values
  ('518981071690705953', 'Forever Never Anywhere', 2007, 'Comedy', 'Antonin Svoboda, Martin Gschlacht', 'Christoph Grissemann, Jörg Kalt, Dirk Stermann', 'Christoph Grissemann, Dirk Stermann, Heinz Strunk, Philip Bialowski, Eva Maria Neubauer, Gabriele Heckel, Silke Jandl, Bernhard Majcen', null, 'History professor Baisch, his depressive and tablet-addicted brother-in-law Anzengruber and a manic cabaret artist have a car accident on a remote country road after a party. Wedged between two trees they get stuck, doors and windows can no longer be opened, the windows made of bulletproof glass cannot be smashed. Injured and with no chance of escape, they wait for days for rescue. Their only provisions are a bowl of herring salad and a few bottles of Prosecco. Fits of rage and fear alternate with overwrought hilarity and desperate fits of crying. But it gets worse...', 'History professor Baisch, his depressive and tablet-addicted brother-in-law Anzengruber and a manic cabaret artist have a car accident on a remote country road after a party. Wedged between two trees they get stuck, doors and windows can no longer be opened, the windows made of bulletproof glass cannot be smashed. Injured and with no chance of escape, they wait for days for rescue. Their only provisions are a bowl of herring salad and a few bottles of Prosecco. Fits of rage and fear alternate with overwrought hilarity and desperate fits of crying. But it gets worse...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/or2pvuXpyXXlJWATexhjabCiYhI.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:2859'),
  ('1109146666890770493', 'Forever Out of My League', 2022, 'Romance, Comedy', 'Claudio Norza, Emanuele Pasquet', 'Michela Straniero, Roberto Proia', 'Ludovica Francesconi, Giancarlo Commare, Gaja Masciale, Jenny De Nucci, Jozef Gjura, Drusilla Foer, Riccardo Niceforo, Diego Giangrasso', null, 'Marta may be an orphan, and she may be affected by a lethal illness, yet she is the most positive person one can meet. She wants a boy to fall for her. Not any boy - the most handsome of them all. One day, she may have found her match.', 'Marta may be an orphan, and she may be affected by a lethal illness, yet she is the most positive person one can meet. She wants a boy to fall for her. Not any boy - the most handsome of them all. One day, she may have found her match.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1zhsT17wTXAw5IxK9rSLtftu7Aw.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:790525'),
  ('1061731828802393247', 'Forever Rich', 2021, 'Crime, Comedy, Drama', 'Shady El-Hamus, Menno Mans, Tony van der Veer', 'Shady El-Hamus, Jeroen Scholten van Aschat', 'Jonas Smulders, Daniël Kolf, Sinem Kavus, Hadewych Minis, Yootha Wong-Loi-Sing, Mustafa Duygulu, Yassin Dardour, Sergio Fontana', 'R', 'This is the story of Richie and his journey to become the greatest rap-artist in the Netherlands. One evening he is violently mugged by a group of teenagers and loses his most prized possession: an expensive watch. When images of the humiliating robbery go viral, Richie''s hard-earned reputation is damaged.', 'This is the story of Richie and his journey to become the greatest rap-artist in the Netherlands. One evening he is violently mugged by a group of teenagers and loses his most prized possession: an expensive watch. When images of the humiliating robbery go viral, Richie''s hard-earned reputation is damaged.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vRbX9sTiZheczEtNfjAi0bhHPAn.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:785527'),
  ('876136073657793833', 'Forever Strong', 2008, 'Drama, Action', 'Ryan Little, T.C. Christensen', 'David Pliler', 'Sean Faris, Gary Cole, Sean Astin, Neal McDonough, Julie Warner, Penn Badgley, Eliot Schwartz, Michael J. Pagan', 'PG-13', 'Hotshot rugby player Rick Penning was the star player of his Arizona high school team until a fateful brush with the law forces him to ponder the consequences of his actions in a Salt Lake City juvenile detention center.', 'Hotshot rugby player Rick Penning was the star player of his Arizona high school team until a fateful brush with the law forces him to ponder the consequences of his actions in a Salt Lake City juvenile detention center.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zEc17IDqnAAkLiyRcCzPT0oXO7j.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:31451'),
  ('242598443813320395', 'Forever the Moment', 2008, 'Drama', 'Yim Soon-rye, Hwang Ki-suk, Park Sang-hyeon', 'Yim Soon-rye, Na Hyun', 'Moon So-ri, Kim Jung-eun, Uhm Tae-woong, Kim Ji-young, Cho Eun-ji, Cha Min-jee, Park Won-sang, Jeong Seok-yong', null, 'A look at the Korean women''s handball team and their journey to the 2004 Summer Olympics. Their path was far from flowery, and they must overcome many obstacles before they can head over to compete.', 'A look at the Korean women''s handball team and their journey to the 2004 Summer Olympics. Their path was far from flowery, and they must overcome many obstacles before they can head over to compete.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1higjJRk4JasUIieliZkKv5Dfjw.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:18431'),
  ('1001078883566459405', 'Forever You', 2019, 'Comedy, Romance, Music', 'Marco Danieli, Ferran Paredes, Alessandro Tonda', 'Isabella Aguilar', 'Michele Riondino, Laura Chiatti, Valeria Bilello, Thomas Trabacchi, Giulio Beranek, Alex Sparrow, Gabriele Granito, Simone Corbisiero', null, 'Apulia, 1970s. Matteo is in love with Francesca, but she wants to leave provincial life behind and see the world. After four years traveling around the world, Francesca returns to her hometown to care for her sick mother, and she and Matteo rekindle their relationship.', 'Apulia, 1970s. Matteo is in love with Francesca, but she wants to leave provincial life behind and see the world. After four years traveling around the world, Francesca returns to her hometown to care for her sick mother, and she and Matteo rekindle their relationship.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4mixZwNnJj1ApDpre8gElrT57H7.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:576762'),
  ('1021278577254655002', 'Forever Young', 1992, 'Adventure, Fantasy, Drama, Science Fiction, Romance', 'Steve Miner, Russell Boyd', 'J.J. Abrams', 'Mel Gibson, Jamie Lee Curtis, Elijah Wood, Isabel Glasser, George Wendt, Joe Morton, Nicolas Surovy, David Marshall Grant', 'PG', 'A 1939 test pilot asks his best friend to use him as a guinea pig for a cryogenics experiment. Daniel McCormick wants to be frozen for a year so that he doesn''t have to watch his love lying in a coma. The next thing Daniel knows is that he''s been awoken in 1992.', 'A 1939 test pilot asks his best friend to use him as a guinea pig for a cryogenics experiment. Daniel McCormick wants to be frozen for a year so that he doesn''t have to watch his love lying in a coma. The next thing Daniel knows is that he''s been awoken in 1992.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eKbD77BEhhBmFD7ZE9VTi9o8r2K.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:10326'),
  ('347298664758599165', 'Forever Young', 2016, 'Comedy', 'Marcello Montarsi, Luca Dal Canto, Yvonne Olivieri', 'Marco Martani, Edoardo Falcone, Fausto Brizzi', 'Fabrizio Bentivoglio, Sabrina Ferilli, Stefano Fresi, Lillo Petrolo, Luisa Ranieri, Teo Teocoli, Claudia Zanella, Emanuel Caserio', null, 'Intertwined stories of 50somethings that won''t give up on their glory days.', 'Intertwined stories of 50somethings that won''t give up on their glory days.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rZRWpmORLy2Ev9rKo12nGB1DIRK.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:385922'),
  ('980847066906890924', 'Forever Young', 2018, 'War, Drama, Romance, History', 'Fangfang Li, Cao Yu', 'Fangfang Li', 'Zhang Ziyi, Huang Xiaoming, Leehom Wang, Chang Chen, Chen Chusheng, Zu Feng, Tie Zheng, Michelle Yim', null, 'From World War, to revolution and ultimately rebirth, Forever Young is the story of four generations spanning a hundred years of modern Chinese history. Each generation faces its own unique set of challenges. Up against corporate corruption, the trials and tribulations of the cultural revolution, and one''s duty to nation in time of war, they are faced with choosing their individual paths through history. But as the challenges and turmoil of each generation may differ as time changes, what was learned in the past cannot help but effect the choices that are made in the future as it is passed down from generation to generation. And that is the universal message that being true to yourself is precious. It is the source of strength that empowers one to become the person they want to be, to march forward as far as their hearts desire, into the future.', 'From World War, to revolution and ultimately rebirth, Forever Young is the story of four generations spanning a hundred years of modern Chinese history. Each generation faces its own unique set of challenges. Up against corporate corruption, the trials and tribulations of the cultural revolution, and one''s duty to nation in time of war, they are faced with choosing their individual paths through history. But as the challenges and turmoil of each generation may differ as time changes, what was learned in the past cannot help but effect the choices that are made in the future as it is passed down from generation to generation. And that is the universal message that being true to yourself is precious. It is the source of strength that empowers one to become the person they want to be, to march forward as far as their hearts desire, into the future.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/szMFnofjf6RZN596GVlDVmf1CSP.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:289930'),
  ('1072817461873038119', 'Forever Young', 2022, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Valeria Bruni Tedeschi, Julien Poupard', 'Valeria Bruni Tedeschi, Noémie Lvovsky, Agnès de Sacy', 'Nadia Tereszkiewicz, Sofiane Bennacer, Louis Garrel, Micha Lescot, Clara Bretheau, Noham Edje, Vassili Schneider, Eva Danino', null, 'At the end of the 1980s, Stella, Victor, Adèle and Etienne are 20 years old. They take the entrance exam to the famous acting school created by Patrice Chéreau and Pierre Romans at the Théâtre des Amandiers in Nanterre. Launched at full speed into life, passion, and love, together they will experience the turning point of their lives, but also their first tragedy.', 'At the end of the 1980s, Stella, Victor, Adèle and Etienne are 20 years old. They take the entrance exam to the famous acting school created by Patrice Chéreau and Pierre Romans at the Théâtre des Amandiers in Nanterre. Launched at full speed into life, passion, and love, together they will experience the turning point of their lives, but also their first tragedy.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/439OxXHS0TdOeFjigO5YUr1LWXF.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:848958'),
  ('186134483752598047', 'Forget About Nick', 2017, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Jo Heim, Margarethe von Trotta', 'Pamela Katz', 'Ingrid Bolsø Berdal, Katja Riemann, Haluk Bilginer, Tinka Fürst, Fredrik Wagner, Lucie Pohl, Robert Seeliger, Paula Riemann', null, 'Against the backdrop of New York''s dazzling fashion scene, a woman in the process of transforming herself from a model into a designer is forced to live with her husband''s ex-wife when he disappears without a trace.', 'Against the backdrop of New York''s dazzling fashion scene, a woman in the process of transforming herself from a model into a designer is forced to live with her husband''s ex-wife when he disappears without a trace.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cjKkc7OV4tF8t3teKr5StCQ6Nhj.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:479834'),
  ('716550110386524767', 'Forget Me', 1995, 'Drama', 'Noémie Lvovsky, Jean-Marc Fabre', 'Marc Cholodenko, Sophie Fillières, Emmanuel Salinger', 'Valeria Bruni Tedeschi, Emmanuelle Devos, Laurent Grévill, Emmanuel Salinger, Philippe Torreton, Olivier Pinalie, Jacques Nolot, Kristina Larsen', null, 'Nathalie is together with Antoine, who really loves her, despite her tendency to get away from him. Eric, the former partner of Nathalie, does not want to be with her anymore, but she can not accept this. In her despair, she tortures herself, Antoine, and Eric.', 'Nathalie is together with Antoine, who really loves her, despite her tendency to get away from him. Eric, the former partner of Nathalie, does not want to be with her anymore, but she can not accept this. In her despair, she tortures herself, Antoine, and Eric.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/10vqEwItRk1MxelEiTqKuq6ZzoB.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:48500'),
  ('672746285156795144', 'Forget Me Not', 2009, 'Drama, Horror, Romance', 'Tyler Oliver, Eric Leach, Keith Dunkerley', 'Jamieson Stern, Tyler Oliver', 'Carly Schroeder, Cody Linley, Micah Alberti, Brie Gabrielle, Jillian Murray, Zachary Abel, Sean Wing, Chloe Bridges', 'R', 'It''s graduation weekend, and Sandy Channing, the popular class president of her small-town high school, should be enjoying the time of her life. But when her friends start disappearing, Sandy discovers they have unwittingly awakened the vengeful spirit of a girl they wronged long ago. Fighting for her sanity, Sandy must unlock a dark secret from her own past before it''s too late.', 'It''s graduation weekend, and Sandy Channing, the popular class president of her small-town high school, should be enjoying the time of her life. But when her friends start disappearing, Sandy discovers they have unwittingly awakened the vengeful spirit of a girl they wronged long ago. Fighting for her sanity, Sandy must unlock a dark secret from her own past before it''s too late.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jDux50AIllCTIeAwg8wJ32oN1EE.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:27588'),
  ('876629520469313653', 'Forget Me Not', 2013, 'Documentary', 'David Sieveking', null, 'Gretel Sieveking, Malte Sieveking', null, 'David Sieveking left home years ago to make films. Now he has returned – and for a reason: To help his mother, Gretel, who has Alzheimer’s, and relieve her long-time carer and his father Malte for a few weeks. The filmmaker takes on the role of carer and documents this encounter with his camera. Gretel no longer knows the people around her, but her puns and charm have not faded. The time spent with his mother becomes a journey into David’s unexpected family history. Once active in Zurich’s left-wing scene, David’s parents enjoyed a lifelong “open relationship”, characterised by a loving distance and mutual respect. VERGISS MEIN NICHT is a film about dementia, but it’s first and foremost a declaration of a love of life and family.', 'David Sieveking left home years ago to make films. Now he has returned – and for a reason: To help his mother, Gretel, who has Alzheimer’s, and relieve her long-time carer and his father Malte for a few weeks. The filmmaker takes on the role of carer and documents this encounter with his camera. Gretel no longer knows the people around her, but her puns and charm have not faded. The time spent with his mother becomes a journey into David’s unexpected family history. Once active in Zurich’s left-wing scene, David’s parents enjoyed a lifelong “open relationship”, characterised by a loving distance and mutual respect. VERGISS MEIN NICHT is a film about dementia, but it’s first and foremost a declaration of a love of life and family.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sp1HrT7pSny8vbufEtQYiSNR54e.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:130798'),
  ('2820770088578414', 'Forget Me Not', 2015, 'Drama, Romance, Fantasy', 'Kei Horie, Yoko Itakura', 'Satoko Okazaki, Kei Horie', 'Nijiro Murakami, Akari Hayami, Yoshikazu Nishikawa, Yutaro Watanabe, Hikaru Osawa, Chiharu, Reina Ikehata, Mickey Curtis', null, 'Takashi Hayama is a third year high school student. He falls in love with Azusa Oribe at first sight and they begin to date. One day, Azusa tells Takashi "people who meet me, forget about me several hours later." Takashi doesn''t believe Azusa, but by chance he realizes that he forgot about Azusa. So he won''t forget Azusa, Takashi begins to leave a note for himself and Azusa.', 'Takashi Hayama is a third year high school student. He falls in love with Azusa Oribe at first sight and they begin to date. One day, Azusa tells Takashi "people who meet me, forget about me several hours later." Takashi doesn''t believe Azusa, but by chance he realizes that he forgot about Azusa. So he won''t forget Azusa, Takashi begins to leave a note for himself and Azusa.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/s80LGHpj1hNlLW9WMjAROhdL6Lu.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:334030'),
  ('428790460946960690', 'Forget Paris', 1995, 'Comedy, Drama, Romance', 'Don Burgess, Billy Crystal, Jim Chory', 'Babaloo Mandel, Lowell Ganz, Billy Crystal', 'Billy Crystal, Debra Winger, Joe Mantegna, Cynthia Stevenson, Richard Masur, Julie Kavner, John Spencer, Mary Ann Hermansen', 'PG-13', 'Mickey Gordon is a basketball referee who travels to France to bury his father. Ellen Andrews is an American living in Paris who works for the airline he flies on. They meet and fall in love, but their relationship goes through many difficult patches.', 'Mickey Gordon is a basketball referee who travels to France to bury his father. Ellen Andrews is an American living in Paris who works for the airline he flies on. They meet and fall in love, but their relationship goes through many difficult patches.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/c2RwGHqWwvh7nmRKpdIyYUWMEvP.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:10525'),
  ('227332078569467868', 'Forgetting Dad', 2008, 'Documentary', 'Matt Sweetwood, Rick Minnich', null, null, null, 'A man suffers a minor car accident, and a week later constructs a new identity, claiming he can''t "remember" being a father. Nearly twenty years later, his amnesia persists, yet no brain damage or physical cause are ever found. Enthralling and thought-provoking, "Forgetting Dad" offers an award-winning case study of dissociation, parental abandonment, and family enmenshment in mental illness.', 'A man suffers a minor car accident, and a week later constructs a new identity, claiming he can''t "remember" being a father. Nearly twenty years later, his amnesia persists, yet no brain damage or physical cause are ever found. Enthralling and thought-provoking, "Forgetting Dad" offers an award-winning case study of dissociation, parental abandonment, and family enmenshment in mental illness.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/heHX31ls2VXgQwpaRC07KwANUkr.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:134647'),
  ('145574413349711141', 'Forgetting Sarah Marshall', 2008, 'Comedy, Romance, Drama', 'Russ T. Alsobrook, Nicholas Stoller, Chamonix Bosch', 'Jason Segel', 'Jason Segel, Kristen Bell, Mila Kunis, Russell Brand, Bill Hader, Jonah Hill, Liz Cackowski, Jack McBrayer', 'R', 'When actress Sarah Marshall dumps aspiring musician Peter Bretter for rock star Aldous Snow, Peter''s world comes crashing down. His best friend Brian suggests that Peter should get away from everything and to fly off to Hawaii to escape all his problems. After arriving in Hawaii and meeting the beautiful receptionist Rachel Jansen, Peter is shocked to see not only Aldous in Hawaii, but also Sarah.', 'When actress Sarah Marshall dumps aspiring musician Peter Bretter for rock star Aldous Snow, Peter''s world comes crashing down. His best friend Brian suggests that Peter should get away from everything and to fly off to Hawaii to escape all his problems. After arriving in Hawaii and meeting the beautiful receptionist Rachel Jansen, Peter is shocked to see not only Aldous in Hawaii, but also Sarah.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oj2oj0AaiY2HIDJJ66aUiXTRS7i.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:9870'),
  ('314438004686626882', 'Forgive Us All', 2025, 'Western, Horror, Thriller, Action', 'Jordana Stott, Peter McCaffrey', 'Jordana Stott, Alex Makauskas, Lance Giles', 'Lily Sullivan, Callan Mulvey, Richard Roxburgh, Lance Giles, Bree Peters, Lawrence Makoare, Dean O''Gorman, Bonnie Filer', null, 'In a post-apocalyptic world, a virus has transformed humans into violently deranged cannibals. A bereaved mother has lost everything and takes refuge in an isolated mountain cabin, until a desperate wounded stranger arrives with a story of hope.', 'In a post-apocalyptic world, a virus has transformed humans into violently deranged cannibals. A bereaved mother has lost everything and takes refuge in an isolated mountain cabin, until a desperate wounded stranger arrives with a story of hope.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bT7sMDsvWNeIGgZ6ZsisNdBcHdq.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1443894'),
  ('674308155789226817', 'Forgive Us Our Debts', 2018, 'Drama', 'Nicola Scorza, Daniela Baldasarre, Antonio Morabito', 'Amedeo Pagani, Antonio Morabito', 'Marco Giallini, Claudio Santamaria, Jerzy Stuhr, Flonja Kodheli, Agnieszka Żulewska, Peppino Mazzotta, Maddalena Crippa, Pietro Naglieri', null, 'Threatened by creditors, a newly unemployed man agrees to work for a debt collector, but soon discovers his deal with the devil has unexpected costs.', 'Threatened by creditors, a newly unemployed man agrees to work for a debt collector, but soon discovers his deal with the devil has unexpected costs.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fydagSdbEc6hGpifkGvXBweQzus.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:519253'),
  ('265324364978108136', 'Forgive Us Our Trespasses', 2022, 'Drama, War', 'Michael Galbraith, Ashley Eakin', 'Ashley Eakin, Shawn Lovering', 'Knox Gibson, Hanneke Talbot, Justin Mader, Nathaniel McParland, Tyler Hutchings, Noah Lamanna, Luke Marty, DL MacDonald', 'PG-13', 'Targeted by Nazis as they hunt down and murder people with disabilities, a boy with a limb difference makes a daring decision while running for his life.', 'Targeted by Nazis as they hunt down and murder people with disabilities, a boy with a limb difference makes a daring decision while running for his life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/onc5fMwe0eBlrw8DgXv3ZYgjEil.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:929436'),
  ('173066092216842309', 'Forgotten', 2012, 'Drama, Thriller, Mystery', 'Alex Schmidt, Wedigo von Schultzendorff', 'Valentin Mereutza, Alex Schmidt', 'Mina Tander, Laura de Boer, Katharina Thalbach, Max Riemelt, Clemens Schick, Anna Thalbach, Alina Sophie Antoniadis, William Boer', null, 'During their childhood, Hanna and Clarissa were best friends. They spent every vacation together in an old summer house on a small island. Shortly after Hanna’s 9th birthday, they suddenly lost touch and only meet again unexpectedly 25 years later. Hanna is now married, has a seven-year-old daughter and is the chief resident physician at the hospital where she reunites with Clarissa. Her old friend has been brought to the hospital ER for overdosing on sleeping pills. The two women pick up their friendship where they left off and spontaneously decide to spend a few days on the island, just like in the old days. When Hanna learns that Maria, a playmate of hers from the island’s village, disappeared as a child and was never seen or heard from again, she begins to search in the past. Something horrible must have happened on the island and they must have been involved.', 'During their childhood, Hanna and Clarissa were best friends. They spent every vacation together in an old summer house on a small island. Shortly after Hanna’s 9th birthday, they suddenly lost touch and only meet again unexpectedly 25 years later. Hanna is now married, has a seven-year-old daughter and is the chief resident physician at the hospital where she reunites with Clarissa. Her old friend has been brought to the hospital ER for overdosing on sleeping pills. The two women pick up their friendship where they left off and spontaneously decide to spend a few days on the island, just like in the old days. When Hanna learns that Maria, a playmate of hers from the island’s village, disappeared as a child and was never seen or heard from again, she begins to search in the past. Something horrible must have happened on the island and they must have been involved.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5KbLpR1BeGBl3VUxQmBYjHrK9Rx.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:133396'),
  ('357081801247061707', 'Forgotten Experiment', 2023, 'Science Fiction', 'Maxim Chirkov, Evgeny Kozlov, Tatyana Samoilova', 'Alexandra Primachenko, Alexey Slushchev, Ilya Ipatov', 'Victor Dobronravov, Sonia Priss, Valeriya Shkirando, Egor Beroev, Egor Koreshkov, Nikita Tarasov, Daniel Barnes, Andrey Zhigalov', null, 'A group of heroes assembled by the eccentric billionaire goes into closed Perimeter full of abnormal activity which is inexplicable in terms of science. This journey will change all members of the group and reverse their notion of reality.', 'A group of heroes assembled by the eccentric billionaire goes into closed Perimeter full of abnormal activity which is inexplicable in terms of science. This journey will change all members of the group and reverse their notion of reality.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9ZH78OjgMqFAFovraJ0uagr9JW6.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:586373'),
  ('484951622356649373', 'Forgotten Island', 2026, 'Comedy, Adventure, Animation, Fantasy, Family', 'Januel Mercado, Joel Crawford', 'Joel Crawford, Januel Mercado', 'H.E.R., Liza Soberano, Dave Franco, Jenny Slate, Manny Jacinto, Dolly de Leon, Jo Koy, Ronny Chieng', null, 'Jo and Raissa find themselves stranded on the fantastic world of the forgotten island of Nakali. They find that their only way home might come at the expense of a lifetime of memories and emotions.', 'Jo and Raissa find themselves stranded on the fantastic world of the forgotten island of Nakali. They find that their only way home might come at the expense of a lifetime of memories and emotions.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/44RMjgvpZmHU3aGmX3IQAaHtEw9.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1465063'),
  ('401429627352343477', 'Forgotten Light', 1996, 'Drama', 'Vladimír Michálek, Kryštof Hanzlík, Hynek Svoboda', 'Milena Jelínková', 'Bolek Polívka, Veronika Žilková, Jiří Lábus, Jaromíra Mílová, Petr Kavan, Jiří Pecha, Simona Peková, Hana Frejková', null, 'Father Holy, a village priest, battles against the state and religious bureaucracies of 1980s Czechoslovakia in his fight to raise money for a new church roof. Permeated by his love for the villagers, his encounters are marked by his good humor. In his losing battle against Church and State, Holy is ordered to be transferred away from his parish and his allies. The Czech-American, Milena Jelinek, adapted this moving story from the the novel The Forgotten Light, by the 1930s Czech writer/poet and Catholic priest Jakub Deml. (1934)', 'Father Holy, a village priest, battles against the state and religious bureaucracies of 1980s Czechoslovakia in his fight to raise money for a new church roof. Permeated by his love for the villagers, his encounters are marked by his good humor. In his losing battle against Church and State, Holy is ordered to be transferred away from his parish and his allies. The Czech-American, Milena Jelinek, adapted this moving story from the the novel The Forgotten Light, by the 1930s Czech writer/poet and Catholic priest Jakub Deml. (1934)', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qmQZ0KQvjiINzQMyeheAZ7DaDO7.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:50274'),
  ('685465755206926055', 'Forgotten Pistolero', 1969, 'Western', 'Ferdinando Baldi, Mario Montuori', 'Pier Giovanni Anchisi, Federico De Urrutia, Mario Di Nardo', 'Leonard Mann, Luciana Paluzzi, Pietro Martellanza, Alberto de Mendoza, Pilar Velázquez, Piero Lulli, Luciano Rossi, Mirella Pamphili', null, 'Mann is a gunman informed by a childhood friend that his father was murdered years earlier by his mother and her lover. To make matters worse, Mann''s sister, who is in love with his friend, is held under the thumb of his murderous mom. The two gunmen ride off to have a reckoning with her.', 'Mann is a gunman informed by a childhood friend that his father was murdered years earlier by his mother and her lover. To make matters worse, Mann''s sister, who is in love with his friend, is held under the thumb of his murderous mom. The two gunmen ride off to have a reckoning with her.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sJhuwZz6Hj1Zj4PxyhUHAdoeA1o.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:61738'),
  ('694137005487996852', 'Forgotten Silver', 1997, 'Comedy, TV Movie', 'Peter Jackson, Costa Botes, Alun Bollinger', 'Peter Jackson, Costa Botes', 'Jeffrey Thomas, Peter Jackson, Costa Botes, Beatrice Ashton, Leonard Maltin, Harvey Weinstein, Sam Neill, Johnny Morris', null, 'The life story of Colin McKenzie, a forgotten pioneer of international cinema who was born in rural New Zealand in 1888.', 'The life story of Colin McKenzie, a forgotten pioneer of international cinema who was born in rural New Zealand in 1888.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gSLluaJR2fxmsGOtmfSKQJ9RCly.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:32458'),
  ('934568974711785394', 'Forgotten Tune for the Flute', 1987, 'Drama, Romance, Comedy', 'Eldar Ryazanov, Semyon Litvinov, Vadim Alisov', 'Emil Braginskiy, Eldar Ryazanov', 'Leonid Filatov, Tatyana Dogileva, Irina Kupchenko, Vsevolod Sanayev, Olga Volkova, Sergei Artsybashev, Aleksandr Shirvindt, Valentin Gaft', null, 'A flutist in the forgotten past, at present the husband of a “big man’s” daughter and head of one of the Chief Directorate’s sections felt unwell one day: the forty-year-old man had a pain in his heart. This unpleasant incident provided an opportunity to meet a nurse named Lida. However, their stormy love affair ended, with Filimonov returning to normal life and an unloved wife.', 'A flutist in the forgotten past, at present the husband of a “big man’s” daughter and head of one of the Chief Directorate’s sections felt unwell one day: the forty-year-old man had a pain in his heart. This unpleasant incident provided an opportunity to meet a nurse named Lida. However, their stormy love affair ended, with Filimonov returning to normal life and an unloved wife.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cdHhbTrUWrl1b3ZmubLpVBcQqrM.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:148622'),
  ('516138153026397998', 'Fork in the Road', 2017, 'Drama', 'Yavuz Turgul, Uğur İçbak', 'Yavuz Turgul', 'Şener Şen, Çiğdem Selişik Onat, Rutkay Aziz, Nihal Yalçın, Mert Fırat, Tilbe Saran, Ruhsar Öcal, Defne Kayalar', null, 'He is a boss who dedicates his life to grow up the textile empire he inherited from his father and does not hesitate to follow ruthless methods for it. He decides to choose a different life after a heavy traffic accident.', 'He is a boss who dedicates his life to grow up the textile empire he inherited from his father and does not hesitate to follow ruthless methods for it. He decides to choose a different life after a heavy traffic accident.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6go5UaZafwTnVUafA0CFUxmf3Ru.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:477288'),
  ('272499890597829788', 'Forklift Driver Klaus: The First Day on the Job', 2001, 'Horror, Comedy', 'Stefan Prehn, Jörg Wagner, Matthias Lehmann', 'Jörg Wagner, Stefan Prehn', 'Konstantin Graudus, Gustav-Adolph Artz, Jürgen Kittel, Sönke Korres, Erik Rossbander, Till Huster, Dieter Dost, Michael Sombetzki', null, 'Short film depicting a fictional educational film about fork lift truck operational safety. The dangers of unsafe operation are presented in gory details.', 'Short film depicting a fictional educational film about fork lift truck operational safety. The dangers of unsafe operation are presented in gory details.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/m2UqwOggUbQIuPeCOiRlYBUDDw0.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:9677'),
  ('301090089539540039', 'Forks Over Knives', 2011, 'Documentary', 'Lee Fulkerson', 'Lee Fulkerson', 'Lee Fulkerson, Matthew Lederman, Alona Pulde, T. Colin Campbell, Caldwell Esselstyn Jr., Joey Aucoin, Connie Diekman, Pam Popper', 'PG', 'Examines the profound claim that most; if not all; of the degenerative diseases that afflict us can be controlled; or even reversed; by rejecting our present menu of animal-based and processed foods. The idea of food as medicine is put to the test. Cameras follow "reality patients" who have chronic conditions from heart disease to diabetes. Doctors teach these patients how to adopt a whole-foods, plant-based diet as the primary approach to treat their ailments - while the challenges and triumphs of their journeys are revealed.', 'Examines the profound claim that most; if not all; of the degenerative diseases that afflict us can be controlled; or even reversed; by rejecting our present menu of animal-based and processed foods. The idea of food as medicine is put to the test. Cameras follow "reality patients" who have chronic conditions from heart disease to diabetes. Doctors teach these patients how to adopt a whole-foods, plant-based diet as the primary approach to treat their ailments - while the challenges and triumphs of their journeys are revealed.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/v3SC1ztIEpo41AvF5frURCdvLOx.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:64288'),
