  ('794384809492716145', 'Formentera Lady', 2018, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Pau Durà', 'Pau Durà', 'José Sacristán, Nora Navas, Sandro Ballesteros, Jordi Sánchez, Ferran Rañé, Mireia Ros, Pepa Juan, Juli Mira', null, 'Samuel is an old hippie musician who settled in Formentera in the 1970s, when King Crimson and other British rock bands frequented the island. There he lives austerely, in a ramshackle house without electric light or unnecessary luxuries, and plays the banjo in a friends'' club. Until one day, after many years, he receives the unexpected visit of his daughter Anna and his grandson Marc. Anna, unemployed for some time, says she has had to accept a job in France and is forced to leave her little son on the island with grandfather Samuel.', 'Samuel is an old hippie musician who settled in Formentera in the 1970s, when King Crimson and other British rock bands frequented the island. There he lives austerely, in a ramshackle house without electric light or unnecessary luxuries, and plays the banjo in a friends'' club. Until one day, after many years, he receives the unexpected visit of his daughter Anna and his grandson Marc. Anna, unemployed for some time, says she has had to accept a job in France and is forced to leave her little son on the island with grandfather Samuel.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sHI3mAsZQm01WKpeHkFDkjZy5RE.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:449017'),
  ('344121710225536248', 'Formula 17', 2004, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Yin-jung Chen', 'Rady Fu', 'Tony Yang, Duncan Chow, King Chin, Dada Ji, Jimmy Yang, Jason Chang, Ladder Yu, Huang Guan-jie', null, 'Naive country-boy Tien-Tsai travels to Taipei, where his quest to lose his virginity is impeded by his insistence on finding true love first.', 'Naive country-boy Tien-Tsai travels to Taipei, where his quest to lose his virginity is impeded by his insistence on finding true love first.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zfjEY6nXRjZw4i9At2dviNsF8oV.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:27101'),
  ('1029830189268671765', 'Formula for a Murder', 1985, 'Thriller, Horror', 'Alberto De Martino', 'Alberto De Martino, Vincenzo Mannino', 'Christina Nagy, David Warbeck, Carroll Blumenberg, Rossano Brazzi, Andrea Bosic, Loris Loddi, Adriana Giuffrè, Daniela De Carolis', null, 'A fitness instructor marries a traumatized, crippled woman who suffers from PTSD and is tormented by a traumatic event that happened in her past. What is even more unfortunate is that her marriage is part of her maniac husband''s evil scheme to kill her for her money. It isn''t long before the formula is put into action and the gory body count starts to mount.', 'A fitness instructor marries a traumatized, crippled woman who suffers from PTSD and is tormented by a traumatic event that happened in her past. What is even more unfortunate is that her marriage is part of her maniac husband''s evil scheme to kill her for her money. It isn''t long before the formula is put into action and the gory body count starts to mount.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/saLVQFTz39IgskvgIos20iF3nBt.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:85005'),
  ('1106773308136670194', 'Formula of Love', 1984, 'Romance, Comedy', 'Mark Zakharov, Vladimir Nakhabtsev, Yusup Daniyalov', 'Grigori Gorin', 'Nodar Mgaloblishvili, Aleksandr Abdulov, Semyon Farada, Leonid Bronevoy, Tatyana Pelttser, Elena Valyushkina, Aleksandr Mikhaylov, Aleksandra Zakharova', null, 'A young aristocrat, Aleksei Fedyashev, is languishing in his family''s country estate, spending his days reading poetry and confessing his love... to a statue. Upon hearing that famous Count Cagliostro is touring Russia and has created quite a buzz in high society with his "magic", he decides to ask the Count to bring the statue to life...', 'A young aristocrat, Aleksei Fedyashev, is languishing in his family''s country estate, spending his days reading poetry and confessing his love... to a statue. Upon hearing that famous Count Cagliostro is touring Russia and has created quite a buzz in high society with his "magic", he decides to ask the Count to bring the statue to life...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yAgBjMZMKG9rn0aKZBZ6Prx83T5.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:27940'),
  ('456487867246656418', 'Forrest Gump', 1994, 'Comedy, Drama, Romance', 'Don Burgess, Robert Zemeckis, Linda Berger', 'Eric Roth', 'Tom Hanks, Robin Wright, Gary Sinise, Sally Field, Mykelti Williamson, Michael Conner Humphreys, Hanna Hall, Haley Joel Osment', 'PG-13', 'A man with a low IQ has accomplished great things in his life and been present during significant historic events—in each case, far exceeding what anyone imagined he could do. But despite all he has achieved, his one true love eludes him.', 'A man with a low IQ has accomplished great things in his life and been present during significant historic events—in each case, far exceeding what anyone imagined he could do. But despite all he has achieved, his one true love eludes him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/saHP97rTPS5eLmrLQEcANmKrsFl.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:13'),
  ('577050301922835929', 'Forsaken', 2015, 'Western, Action, Drama', 'Jon Cassar, Jackie Bagley, Lee Cleary', 'Brad Mirman', 'Kiefer Sutherland, Donald Sutherland, Demi Moore, Brian Cox, Siobhan Williams, Michael Wincott, Landon Liboiron, Greg Ellis', 'R', 'John Henry returns to his hometown in hopes of repairing his relationship with his estranged father, but a local gang is terrorizing the town. John Henry is the only one who can stop them, however he has abandoned both his gun and reputation as a fearless quick-draw killer.', 'John Henry returns to his hometown in hopes of repairing his relationship with his estranged father, but a local gang is terrorizing the town. John Henry is the only one who can stop them, however he has abandoned both his gun and reputation as a fearless quick-draw killer.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fbTpSiqGn6ImqSAyawHlLf7goat.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:354110'),
  ('93525133716066084', 'Forsaken', 2018, 'Adventure, Science Fiction, Drama', 'Sergey Pavlov, Alexander Kulikov, Mikhail Raskhodnikov', 'Alexey A. Petrukhin, Alexander Kulikov, Mikhail Raskhodnikov', 'Alexander Kulikov, Andrey Smolyakov, Yuriy Tsurilo, Grigorij Sijatvinda, Maksim Vitorgan, Anna Banshchikova, Evgeniya Shipova, Boris Moiseev', null, 'As a result of a chain of tragic accidents on a distant planet, the cosmonaut Chapayev is left alone. His life is in constant danger. Something inexplicable, which he came into contact with, will forever change his life. From now on, he will be lost not only for himself but for the people of earth as well. And he have to die many times in order to prove that he is alive.', 'As a result of a chain of tragic accidents on a distant planet, the cosmonaut Chapayev is left alone. His life is in constant danger. Something inexplicable, which he came into contact with, will forever change his life. From now on, he will be lost not only for himself but for the people of earth as well. And he have to die many times in order to prove that he is alive.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jIr5HrGdMpSsBA9RttSZhKtQp7K.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:555630'),
  ('113943638092359410', 'Forsaking All Others', 1934, 'Comedy, Romance', 'W.S. Van Dyke, George J. Folsey, Douglas Shearer', 'Joseph L. Mankiewicz, Frank Cavett', 'Robert Montgomery, Joan Crawford, Clark Gable, Charles Butterworth, Billie Burke, Frances Drake, Rosalind Russell, Pat Flaherty', 'NR', 'A socialite only realises that her friend is in love with her when she falls for the wrong man.', 'A socialite only realises that her friend is in love with her when she falls for the wrong man.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jPt57JYNjSqKHQPMMRtVal8B2AU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:150249'),
  ('939970193771556566', 'Fort Algiers', 1953, 'Adventure, War', 'Lesley Selander, John F. Seitz', 'Theodore St. John', 'Yvonne De Carlo, Raymond Burr, Carlos Thompson, Leif Erickson, Anthony Caruso, John Dehner, Henry Corden, Joe Kirk', 'NR', 'In northwest Africa, a tribal leader tries to stir up a rebellion against the ruling powers.', 'In northwest Africa, a tribal leader tries to stir up a rebellion against the ruling powers.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5VLBx31TExtXIRUc1IHk0dTGTpz.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:356888'),
  ('1139897509681383020', 'Fort Apache', 1948, 'Western', 'John Ford, Archie Stout, Lowell J. Farrell', 'Frank S. Nugent', 'John Wayne, Henry Fonda, Shirley Temple, Pedro Armendáriz, Ward Bond, George O''Brien, Victor McLaglen, Anna Lee', null, 'Owen Thursday sees his new posting to the desolate Fort Apache as a chance to claim the military honour which he believes is rightfully his. Arrogant, obsessed with military form and ultimately self-destructive, he attempts to destroy the Apache chief Cochise after luring him across the border from Mexico, against the advice of his subordinates.', 'Owen Thursday sees his new posting to the desolate Fort Apache as a chance to claim the military honour which he believes is rightfully his. Arrogant, obsessed with military form and ultimately self-destructive, he attempts to destroy the Apache chief Cochise after luring him across the border from Mexico, against the advice of his subordinates.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5PqKsWVlyIFuMeV1UkK6Q9Q8y9k.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:37347'),
  ('247659067072396167', 'Fort Apache Napoli', 2009, 'History, Drama', 'Marco Risi, Dino Giarrusso, Marco Onorato', 'Maurizio Cerino', 'Libero De Rienzo, Valentina Lodovini, Michele Riondino, Fortunato Cerlino, Massimiliano Gallo, Ernesto Mahieux, Salvatore Cantalupo, Ennio Fantastichini', null, 'The story of Giancarlo Siani, a journalist killed by the Neapolitan Mafia in 1985.', 'The story of Giancarlo Siani, a journalist killed by the Neapolitan Mafia in 1985.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8hB2cp65RF3Odu1h35JNh7wcQko.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:50987'),
  ('1020263368739542755', 'Fort Apache, the Bronx', 1981, 'Crime, Drama, Action', 'Daniel Petrie, John Alcott', 'Heywood Gould', 'Paul Newman, Ed Asner, Ken Wahl, Danny Aiello, Pam Grier, Rachel Ticotin, Kathleen Beller, Tito Goya', 'R', 'From the sight of a police officer this movie depicts the life in New York''s infamous South Bronx. In the center is "Fort Apache", as the officers call their police station, which really seems like an outpost in enemy''s country. The story follows officer Murphy, who seems to be a tuff cynic, but in truth he''s a moralist with a sense for justice.', 'From the sight of a police officer this movie depicts the life in New York''s infamous South Bronx. In the center is "Fort Apache", as the officers call their police station, which really seems like an outpost in enemy''s country. The story follows officer Murphy, who seems to be a tuff cynic, but in truth he''s a moralist with a sense for justice.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8p57OvRAG5qswa5UW9O5Y6xZjAV.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:23668'),
  ('470304827154925462', 'Fort Bliss', 2014, 'War, Drama', 'Claudia Myers, Adam Silver', 'Claudia Myers', 'Michelle Monaghan, Emmanuelle Chriqui, Pablo Schreiber, Ron Livingston, Freddy Rodríguez, Dash Mihok, John Savage, Oakes Fegley', 'R', 'After returning home from an extended tour in Afghanistan, a decorated U.S. Army medic and single mother struggles to rebuild her relationship with her young son.', 'After returning home from an extended tour in Afghanistan, a decorated U.S. Army medic and single mother struggles to rebuild her relationship with her young son.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bDCWv9myyBpkvrKfcQusosFRAg1.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:263855'),
  ('409669516653282801', 'Fort Buchanan', 2014, 'Romance, Comedy, Drama', 'Michaël Capron, Benjamin Crotty', 'Benjamin Crotty', 'Andy Gillet, Iliana Zabeth, David Baïot, Mati Diop, Luc Chessel, Pauline Jacquard, Nancy Lane Kaplan, Judith Lou Lévy', 'NR', 'Four seasons to tell the fluctuating moods and mores of a small community that shares its daily chores and life experiences in the military base of Fort Buchanan. In this imagined (perhaps dreamed?) location, peculiar habits respond to the needs of a peculiar environment. Roger, a fragile gay man, and his female companions, trying to cope with the absence of their husbands, go through their own brand of challenges for survival, with their own form of outdoor camaraderie, thought-occupying chat and DIY activities. Roger has a tough daughter who runs him ragged, but he has buddies willing to help: Justine, Denise, Pamela and Claudia-Joy.', 'Four seasons to tell the fluctuating moods and mores of a small community that shares its daily chores and life experiences in the military base of Fort Buchanan. In this imagined (perhaps dreamed?) location, peculiar habits respond to the needs of a peculiar environment. Roger, a fragile gay man, and his female companions, trying to cope with the absence of their husbands, go through their own brand of challenges for survival, with their own form of outdoor camaraderie, thought-occupying chat and DIY activities. Roger has a tough daughter who runs him ragged, but he has buddies willing to help: Justine, Denise, Pamela and Claudia-Joy.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rBk1os7Iq16lxmQpibuED3DKMCA.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:299264'),
  ('614500123087957246', 'Fort Defiance', 1951, 'Action, Western', 'John Rawlins, Stanley Cortez', 'Louis Lantz', 'Dane Clark, Ben Johnson, Peter Graves, Tracey Roberts, George Cleveland, Ralph Sanford, Iron Eyes Cody, Dennis Moore', 'NR', 'It''s just after the Civil War and Ben Shelby arrives looking for Johnny Tallon whom he plans to kill. Shelby was the only survivor of a battle due to the cowardice of Tallon. Thinking Tallon dead, another man who lost a brother at the same battle arrives to kill Tallon''s blind brother. Tallon arrives to find Shelby and his brother fleeing. Then they are attacked by Indians and Shelby and Tallon must now fight together postponing the inevitable showdown.', 'It''s just after the Civil War and Ben Shelby arrives looking for Johnny Tallon whom he plans to kill. Shelby was the only survivor of a battle due to the cowardice of Tallon. Thinking Tallon dead, another man who lost a brother at the same battle arrives to kill Tallon''s blind brother. Tallon arrives to find Shelby and his brother fleeing. Then they are attacked by Indians and Shelby and Tallon must now fight together postponing the inevitable showdown.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cH7g9dHPXQ0j1rrxlXmqAtOUTBr.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:205556'),
  ('9239094417117249', 'Fort Dobbs', 1958, 'Western', 'William H. Clothier, Gordon Douglas, C.M. Florance', 'Burt Kennedy', 'Clint Walker, Virginia Mayo, Brian Keith, Richard Eyer, Russ Conway, Michael Dante, John Cliff, John McKee', 'NR', 'Eluding a sheriff''s posse, an escaped man saves a farming family from a Comanche attack and escorts it to the nearby Fort Dobbs.', 'Eluding a sheriff''s posse, an escaped man saves a farming family from a Comanche attack and escorts it to the nearby Fort Dobbs.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rUEn5MqCRjcNO6xXvdpRMsxhzok.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:126766'),
  ('371982883426948367', 'Fort Massacre', 1958, 'Western', 'Joseph M. Newman, Carl E. Guthrie, Jesse Corallo', 'Martin Goldsmith', 'Joel McCrea, Forrest Tucker, Susan Cabot, John Russell, George N. Neise, Anthony Caruso, Robert Osterloh, Denver Pyle', 'NR', 'New Mexico Territory, August 1879. The few surviving members of a cavalry column, which has been relentlessly decimated by the Apaches, attempt to reach Fort Crain. On their way through a hostile land, the obsessive and ruthless Sergeant Vinson takes to the limit the battered will of the troopers under his command.', 'New Mexico Territory, August 1879. The few surviving members of a cavalry column, which has been relentlessly decimated by the Apaches, attempt to reach Fort Crain. On their way through a hostile land, the obsessive and ruthless Sergeant Vinson takes to the limit the battered will of the troopers under his command.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vjlbMX9QO3ge7YNsfRL0D5lVYcF.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:95060'),
  ('821192764488791711', 'Fort Saganne', 1984, 'War, Drama, History', 'Alain Corneau, Bruno Nuytten', 'Louis Gardel, Henri de Turenne, Alain Corneau', 'Gérard Depardieu, Philippe Noiret, Catherine Deneuve, Sophie Marceau, Michel Duchaussoy, Jean-Laurent Cochet, Roger Dumas, Jean-Louis Richard', null, 'In 1911, a willful and determined man from peasant stock named Charles Saganne enlists in the military and is assigned to the Sahara Desert under the aristocratic Colonel Dubreuilh.', 'In 1911, a willful and determined man from peasant stock named Charles Saganne enlists in the military and is assigned to the Sahara Desert under the aristocratic Colonel Dubreuilh.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8srIfF14GCPwaLUrOtVT4Y6tMcw.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:4274'),
  ('276756254984471589', 'Fort Yuma', 1955, 'Western', 'Lesley Selander', 'Danny Arnold', 'Peter Graves, Joan Vohs, John Hudson, Joan Taylor, Abel Fernandez, William Phillips, James O''Hara, Addison Richards', null, 'Apaches plan to attack a fort by wearing uniforms plundered from a cavalry officer''s (Peter Graves) supply column.', 'Apaches plan to attack a fort by wearing uniforms plundered from a cavalry officer''s (Peter Graves) supply column.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/A2RYaCkUl0oShLCIhGKYbQBwxMo.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:173626'),
  ('799420298831306048', 'Fort Yuma Gold', 1966, 'Western, War', 'Giorgio Ferroni, Rafael Pacheco', 'Massimiliano Capriccioli, Sandro Continenza, Gilles Morris-Dumoulin', 'Giuliano Gemma, Dan Vadis, Sophie Daumier, Jacques Sernas, Jacques Herlin, José Calvo, Ángel del Pozo, Andrea Bosic', null, 'Near the end of the Civil War, an imprisoned Confederate raider is sent under guard to warn both his men and the Army at Fort Yuma that an impending rebel raid is really nothing but a ruse by scoundrels from both sides, in cahoots to take the fort''s gold for themselves during the chaos. Soon he slips his treacherous escort and attempts to complete the mission himself.', 'Near the end of the Civil War, an imprisoned Confederate raider is sent under guard to warn both his men and the Army at Fort Yuma that an impending rebel raid is really nothing but a ruse by scoundrels from both sides, in cahoots to take the fort''s gold for themselves during the chaos. Soon he slips his treacherous escort and attempts to complete the mission himself.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8WWv4QNZbtSooHe9LywbD5ujMND.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:73477'),
  ('207026399356924347', 'Fortini/Cani', 1977, 'Documentary', 'Danièle Huillet, Jean-Marie Straub, Emilio Bestetti', 'Franco Fortini', 'Franco Fortini, Luciana Nissim, Adriano Aprà', null, 'The film is a sort of presentation of Franco Fortini''s book ''I Cani del Sinai''. Fortini, an Italian Jew, reads excerpts from the book about his alienation from Judaism and from the social relations around him, the rise of Fascism in Italy, the anti-Arab attitude of European culture. The images, mostly a series of Italian landscape shots, provide a backdrop that highlights the meaning of the text. - Fabrizio Sabidussi', 'The film is a sort of presentation of Franco Fortini''s book ''I Cani del Sinai''. Fortini, an Italian Jew, reads excerpts from the book about his alienation from Judaism and from the social relations around him, the rise of Fascism in Italy, the anti-Arab attitude of European culture. The images, mostly a series of Italian landscape shots, provide a backdrop that highlights the meaning of the text. - Fabrizio Sabidussi', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lT73LwT9fCN1NIG3tPiIngPzds6.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:205667'),
  ('207802351447099877', 'Fortitude', 2020, 'Drama', 'Rodrigo Michelangeli, Jorge Thielen Armand', 'Jorge Thielen Armand, Rodrigo Michelangeli', 'Jorge Thielen Hedderich, Carlos Medina, Leudys Naranjo, Yoni Naranjo', null, 'To escape the crisis in Venezuela, and his alcoholism, Roque retreats into the Amazon jungle to renovate a cabin he built during happier times. He struggles with feverish visions caused by alcohol abstinence, and his desire for redemption becomes distorted when he joins old friends to work in an illegal gold mine controlled by Colombian guerrillas. The violence required to work in the mine plunges Roque into a cycle of self-destruction that devours his interior. He will need the fortitude to get out and start anew.', 'To escape the crisis in Venezuela, and his alcoholism, Roque retreats into the Amazon jungle to renovate a cabin he built during happier times. He struggles with feverish visions caused by alcohol abstinence, and his desire for redemption becomes distorted when he joins old friends to work in an illegal gold mine controlled by Colombian guerrillas. The violence required to work in the mine plunges Roque into a cycle of self-destruction that devours his interior. He will need the fortitude to get out and start anew.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bFZGP2ZmvtH4YG7uyExdejxPFk8.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:662880'),
  ('427013494820026477', 'Fortress', 1985, 'Drama, Horror, Thriller', 'Arch Nicholson, David Connell', 'Everett De Roche', 'Rachel Ward, Sean Garlick, Elaine Cusick, Laurie Moran, Marc Aden Gray, Ray Chubb, Bradley Meehan, Rebecca Rigg', null, 'After being kidnapped by four masked men, a teacher and her students rebel by plotting against the criminals.', 'After being kidnapped by four masked men, a teacher and her students rebel by plotting against the criminals.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/a1jHnKnRUEdKi9vkd9LIdmFaj5D.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:37929'),
  ('672870185786584031', 'Fortress', 1992, 'Action, Thriller, Science Fiction', 'Stuart Gordon, David Eggby', 'Troy Neighbors, David Venable, Steven Feinberg', 'Christopher Lambert, Kurtwood Smith, Loryn Locklin, Clifton Collins Jr., Jeffrey Combs, Lincoln Kilpatrick, Tom Towles, Vernon Wells', 'R', 'In the future, the inmates of a private underground prison are computer-controlled with cameras, dream readers, and devices that can cause pain or death. John and his illegally pregnant wife Karen are locked inside "The Fortress" but are determined to escape before the birth of their baby.', 'In the future, the inmates of a private underground prison are computer-controlled with cameras, dream readers, and devices that can cause pain or death. John and his illegally pregnant wife Karen are locked inside "The Fortress" but are determined to escape before the birth of their baby.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/evjpqWPUY4VpOdyLpeRfkGU8DiR.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:12088'),
  ('992592230451299475', 'Fortress', 2021, 'Action, Thriller, Crime', 'James Cullen Bressack, Bryan Koss, Cadiz Rodriguez', 'Alan Horsnail', 'Jesse Metcalfe, Bruce Willis, Chad Michael Murray, Kelly Greyson, Ser''Darius Blain, Katalina Viteri, Shannen Doherty, Natalie Burn', 'R', 'The story revolves around a top-secret resort for retired U.S. intelligence officers. A group of criminals led by Balzary breach the compound, hellbent on revenge on Robert, forcing the retired officer and his son to save the day.', 'The story revolves around a top-secret resort for retired U.S. intelligence officers. A group of criminals led by Balzary breach the compound, hellbent on revenge on Robert, forcing the retired officer and his son to save the day.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sR6OQUvOnQ0OrRLo7hhonaQhuaE.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:826749'),
  ('1131909755487612563', 'Fortress 2', 2000, 'Science Fiction, Action', 'David Eggby, Geoff Murphy', 'Troy Neighbors, Steven Feinberg, David Venable', 'Christopher Lambert, Aidan Rea, David Roberson, Liz May Brice, Beth Toussaint, Pam Grier, Yuji Okumoto, Willie Garson', 'R', '7 years on from the original Fortress movie, Brennick and his family are still on the run. Finally, they give in, and surrender, only to find themselves imprisoned in a new, more sophisticated fortress prison in outer space. But Brennick''s not a man to give in easily, and with a 10 year old son waiting for him back on earth, he''s going to pack some serious assault on the evil corporation.', '7 years on from the original Fortress movie, Brennick and his family are still on the run. Finally, they give in, and surrender, only to find themselves imprisoned in a new, more sophisticated fortress prison in outer space. But Brennick''s not a man to give in easily, and with a 10 year old son waiting for him back on earth, he''s going to pack some serious assault on the evil corporation.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dVNFoj8NqfnNJN4Syq8aXbAS10B.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:11119'),
  ('384034651832900273', 'Fortress of Amerikkka', 1989, 'Action, Comedy', 'Eric Louzil, Ron Chapman', 'Eric Louzil', 'Gene LeBrock, Kellee Bradley, David Crane, Kascha, Xavier Barquet, William J. Kulzer, Karen Michaels, Troy Fromin', 'R', 'John Whitecloud, a criminal rebel, is out for revenge against a corrupt Sheriff and a militia run by a crazed General.', 'John Whitecloud, a criminal rebel, is out for revenge against a corrupt Sheriff and a militia run by a crazed General.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/y06JPGHTiHnW3D1xjcwjPmcHFJr.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:73137'),
  ('682891383859165684', 'Fortress of War', 2010, 'War, Drama, History, Action', 'Alexander Kott, Vladimir Bashta, Artur Ilyinyh', 'Vladimir Eryomin, Konstantin Vorobyov, Aleksei Dudaryov', 'Andrey Merzlikin, Pavel Derevyanko, Veronika Nikonova, Evgeny Tsyganov, Anna Tsukanova-Kott, Aleksei Kopashov, Alexander Korshunov, Yana Esipovich', null, 'The film covers the heroic defence of the Brest Fortress, which was attacked during the first strike of German invaders on June 22 1941. The story describes the events of the first days of the defence, including the three main resistance zones, headed by the regiment commander, Pyotr Mikhailovich Gavrilov, the commissar Efim Moiseevich Fomin and the head of the 9th frontier outpost, Andrey Mitrofanovich Kizhevatov. Many years later veteran Alexander Akimov again recalls the memories of the time, when he, then a 15 year old Sasha Akimov was deeply in love with the beautiful Anya and suddenly found himself in the middle of the bloody events of war.', 'The film covers the heroic defence of the Brest Fortress, which was attacked during the first strike of German invaders on June 22 1941. The story describes the events of the first days of the defence, including the three main resistance zones, headed by the regiment commander, Pyotr Mikhailovich Gavrilov, the commissar Efim Moiseevich Fomin and the head of the 9th frontier outpost, Andrey Mitrofanovich Kizhevatov. Many years later veteran Alexander Akimov again recalls the memories of the time, when he, then a 15 year old Sasha Akimov was deeply in love with the beautiful Anya and suddenly found himself in the middle of the bloody events of war.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6pocaDiLUONtU3bNY57XGPfBqVr.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:50618'),
  ('959890722349357240', 'Fortress: Sniper''s Eye', 2022, 'Action, Thriller, Crime', 'Bryan Koss, Josh Sternfeld, Cadiz Rodriguez', 'Alan Horsnail', 'Chad Michael Murray, Bruce Willis, Jesse Metcalfe, Kelly Greyson, Ser''Darius Blain, Michael Sirow, Welker White, Natali Yura', 'R', 'Weeks after the deadly assault on Fortress Camp, Robert makes a daring rescue to save Sasha, the widow of his old nemesis Balzary. But back in the camp''s command bunker, it appears Sasha may have devious plans of her own. As a new attack breaks out, Robert is confronted with a familiar face he thought he''d never see again…', 'Weeks after the deadly assault on Fortress Camp, Robert makes a daring rescue to save Sasha, the widow of his old nemesis Balzary. But back in the camp''s command bunker, it appears Sasha may have devious plans of her own. As a new attack breaks out, Robert is confronted with a familiar face he thought he''d never see again…', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/61J34xHVVdQHbJ4MSCWQo4e727v.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:883502'),
  ('772381921489903144', 'Fortuna', 2018, 'Drama', 'Germinal Roaux', 'Germinal Roaux', 'Kidist Siyum, Bruno Ganz, Patrick d''Assumçao, Yoann Blanc, Antonin Schopfer', null, 'Fortuna, a 14-year-old Ethiopian girl, has had no news of her parents since they crossed the Mediterranean Sea. Together with other refugees, she is given shelter for the winter in a Swiss catholic monastery. While she waits for her fate to be decided by the Swiss authorities, Fortuna finds out she is pregnant. The choice she will have to make and the arrival of the refugees will give rise to concern within the religious community and will challenge their concept of Christian charity.', 'Fortuna, a 14-year-old Ethiopian girl, has had no news of her parents since they crossed the Mediterranean Sea. Together with other refugees, she is given shelter for the winter in a Swiss catholic monastery. While she waits for her fate to be decided by the Swiss authorities, Fortuna finds out she is pregnant. The choice she will have to make and the arrival of the refugees will give rise to concern within the religious community and will challenge their concept of Christian charity.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fgtGlehldB7f6lL4e3oJWjpmtiD.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:499386'),
  ('132225909915504930', 'Fortuna', 2021, 'Drama, Thriller', 'Agostino Vertucci, Nicolangelo Gelormini, Giuseppe Eusepi', 'Nicolangelo Gelormini, Massimiliano Virgilio', 'Valeria Golino, Pina Turco, Libero De Rienzo, Cristina Magnotti, Giovanni Ludeno, Marcello Romolo, Anna Patierno, Luciano Saltarelli', null, 'Fortuna (6 years old) lives with her mother in an anonymous suburb. She spends her time with two playmates, Nicola and Anna, dreaming of being Nancy, an alien princess chased by giants who want to kidnap her and her friends. After a tragic accident happened to Nicola, an obscure secret surfaces in a struggle between reality and imagination, unveiling a horrible truth. A dark fairy tale, based on a true story.', 'Fortuna (6 years old) lives with her mother in an anonymous suburb. She spends her time with two playmates, Nicola and Anna, dreaming of being Nancy, an alien princess chased by giants who want to kidnap her and her friends. After a tragic accident happened to Nicola, an obscure secret surfaces in a struggle between reality and imagination, unveiling a horrible truth. A dark fairy tale, based on a true story.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mtstDdxg6VwhEOHxVOnjBrVVFeI.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:757660'),
  ('674756580827632834', 'Fortuna''s Eye', 2019, 'Drama', 'Takahiro Miki, Kosuke Yamada', 'Riko Sakaguchi', 'Ryunosuke Kamiki, Kasumi Arimura, Jun Shison, DAIGO, Airi Matsui, Yukiya Kitamura, Yuki Saito, Saburo Tokito', null, 'Shinichiro Kiyama is completely alone in the world. One day, he realizes he possesses "Fortuna''s Eye", an ability through which people whose death is drawing near appear transparent to him. It is a gift that torments him. Then he meets a cheerful, optimistic girl Aoi Kiryu who makes him feel at ease. Shinichiro develops feelings for her, but after a brief period of happiness, Aoi''s body suddenly starts turning transparent.', 'Shinichiro Kiyama is completely alone in the world. One day, he realizes he possesses "Fortuna''s Eye", an ability through which people whose death is drawing near appear transparent to him. It is a gift that torments him. Then he meets a cheerful, optimistic girl Aoi Kiryu who makes him feel at ease. Shinichiro develops feelings for her, but after a brief period of happiness, Aoi''s body suddenly starts turning transparent.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ipDsgNCdLOECXYa2qnC57gIF4KG.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:522837'),
  ('558943242833387549', 'Fortunate', 1960, 'Drama, Comedy, Romance', 'Alex Joffé', 'Michel Breitman', 'Bourvil, Michèle Morgan, Gaby Morlay, Teddy Bilis, Rosy Varte, Patrick Millow, Albertine Sarov, Frédéric Mitterrand', null, 'During WW2, a posh bourgeois woman (Morgan)is compelled to live under the same room as a crude simple-minded yet big-hearted man.(Bourvil) Her husband was arrested by the Gestapo and she is a hunted woman.', 'During WW2, a posh bourgeois woman (Morgan)is compelled to live under the same room as a crude simple-minded yet big-hearted man.(Bourvil) Her husband was arrested by the Gestapo and she is a hunted woman.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/o4sH67pV7i2LA0kXlRGjIrcSqqS.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:66837'),
  ('693781669614664077', 'Fortune and Men''s Eyes', 1971, 'Drama', 'Harvey Hart', 'John Herbert', 'Wendell Burton, Zooey Hall, Michael Greer, Danny Freedman, Lázaro Pérez, John Granik, Tom Harvey, Modesto', null, 'Smitty, a young man sentenced to six months in prison for marijuana possession eventually becomes the sexual subordinate of another inmate, Rocky.', 'Smitty, a young man sentenced to six months in prison for marijuana possession eventually becomes the sexual subordinate of another inmate, Rocky.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sz3wiXUazAQNxBXzvlhUTKxQ1Nh.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:173805'),
  ('1114693607175515142', 'Fortune Cookie', 1991, 'Comedy', 'Darren Aronofsky', 'Hubert Selby Jr.', 'Stanley B. Herman, Dean Cleverdon, Robin Monroe, Peter Chen, Nina Bauer, Richard Morrison, Cliff Cozens, Jean Adams', null, 'A struggling door-to-door salesman becomes addicted to collecting the paper messages of good fortune found inside fortune cookies served as dessert at Chinese restaurants in the United States.', 'A struggling door-to-door salesman becomes addicted to collecting the paper messages of good fortune found inside fortune cookies served as dessert at Chinese restaurants in the United States.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ld2twhYzKGPbTTqtlyI9jsX31PA.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:92655'),
  ('587053306390789458', 'Fortune Favors Lady Nikuko', 2021, 'Animation, Drama, Family, Comedy', 'Kenichi Konishi, Koji Kasamatsu, Takanori Nakajima', 'Satomi Oshima', 'Shinobu Otake, Cocomi, Natsuki Hanae, Ikuji Nakamura, Izumi Ishii, Atsushi Yamanishi, Yuichi Yasoda, Matsuko Deluxe', 'NR', 'Brash single mother Nikuko is well-known for her bold spirit, much to the embarrassment of Kikuko, her pensive yet imaginative daughter. In contrast to her mother, Kikuko wants nothing more than to fit in as she navigates the everyday social dramas of middle school. Life in the harbor is peaceful until a shocking revelation from the past threatens to uproot the pair''s tender relationship.', 'Brash single mother Nikuko is well-known for her bold spirit, much to the embarrassment of Kikuko, her pensive yet imaginative daughter. In contrast to her mother, Kikuko wants nothing more than to fit in as she navigates the everyday social dramas of middle school. Life in the harbor is peaceful until a shocking revelation from the past threatens to uproot the pair''s tender relationship.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ceine994qh3wc5KpQoEp3LAGHOS.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:781816'),
  ('90151234394672399', 'Fortune Feimster: Sweet & Salty', 2020, 'Comedy', 'Krysia Plonka', 'Fortune Feimster', 'Fortune Feimster', null, 'Actor, comedian and writer Fortune Feimster takes the stage and riffs on her southern roots, sexual awakenings, showbiz career and more.', 'Actor, comedian and writer Fortune Feimster takes the stage and riffs on her southern roots, sexual awakenings, showbiz career and more.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/w48A4zpi0VwUUf3erMalw0OO4iQ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:665459'),
  ('128219162175268077', 'Fortune Is a Woman', 1957, 'Thriller, Crime', 'Sidney Gilliat, Gerald Gibbs', 'Sidney Gilliat, Frank Launder, Val Valentine', 'Jack Hawkins, Arlene Dahl, Dennis Price, Violet Farebrother, Ian Hunter, Malcolm Keen, Geoffrey Keen, Patrick Holt', null, 'An insurance man discovers his ex-girlfriend and her husband''s art-forgery/arson scam.', 'An insurance man discovers his ex-girlfriend and her husband''s art-forgery/arson scam.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ilV1Twp8Yos9zMHSgaeXy8cc5Gb.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:116580'),
  ('332616815180042699', 'Fortune Salon', 2009, 'Comedy', 'Han Ki-eop, Kim Jin-young', 'Kim Soo-mi, Kim Jin-young, Choi Won', 'Park Ye-jin, Im Chang-jung, Seo Young-hee, Park Hyo-ju, Lee Jun-hyuk, Kim Min-su, Lee Yong-i, Son Hee-soon', null, 'Tae-rang is gifted clairvoyant who runs a posh fortune telling salon in Cheongdam, Seoul. She helps guide her elite clients on matters of love and life altering choices. Yet fate has it that Tae-rang''s personal life is always cursed. All the men that Tae-rang has shown interest have become harmed in one way or another. As a child, Tae-rang''s mother, also a clairvoyant, told Tae-rang that she is destined to meet a man born May 16, 1978 at 11 pm before she turns 28. One day, Seung-won, a former horse jockey now a maintenance worker for horses, spots a 10,000 Won bill on the street and attempts to pick it up. This is when he is hit by a car driven by Tae-rang. It turns out Ki-su was born on May 16, 1978 at 11 pm ...', 'Tae-rang is gifted clairvoyant who runs a posh fortune telling salon in Cheongdam, Seoul. She helps guide her elite clients on matters of love and life altering choices. Yet fate has it that Tae-rang''s personal life is always cursed. All the men that Tae-rang has shown interest have become harmed in one way or another. As a child, Tae-rang''s mother, also a clairvoyant, told Tae-rang that she is destined to meet a man born May 16, 1978 at 11 pm before she turns 28. One day, Seung-won, a former horse jockey now a maintenance worker for horses, spots a 10,000 Won bill on the street and attempts to pick it up. This is when he is hit by a car driven by Tae-rang. It turns out Ki-su was born on May 16, 1978 at 11 pm ...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5FnyKxYPloa0wzmLCXpyu3sdubz.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:167760'),
  ('1133995772939531659', 'Fortune Teller', 2010, 'Documentary', 'Xu Tong', null, '厉百程, 石珍珠, 唐小雁', null, 'Li Baicheng is a charismatic fortune teller who services a clientele of prostitutes and marginalized figures whose jobs, like his, are commonplace but technically illegal in China. He practices his ancient craft in a village near Beijing while taking care of his deaf and dumb wife Pearl, who he rescued from her family''s mistreatment. Winter brings a police crackdown on both fortune tellers and prostitutes, forcing Li and Pearl into temporary exile in his hometown, where he revisits old family demons. His humble story is told with chapter headings similar to Qing Dynasty popular fiction.', 'Li Baicheng is a charismatic fortune teller who services a clientele of prostitutes and marginalized figures whose jobs, like his, are commonplace but technically illegal in China. He practices his ancient craft in a village near Beijing while taking care of his deaf and dumb wife Pearl, who he rescued from her family''s mistreatment. Winter brings a police crackdown on both fortune tellers and prostitutes, forcing Li and Pearl into temporary exile in his hometown, where he revisits old family demons. His humble story is told with chapter headings similar to Qing Dynasty popular fiction.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/39cg6sAuWgXUllyz1ySX0Gfg0yE.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:152508'),
  ('1060135120351332999', 'Forty Boys and a Song', 1941, 'Documentary', 'Irving Allen', null, null, null, 'Forty Boys and a Song is a 1941 short documentary film directed by Irving Allen. The film is about the Robert Mitchell Boy Choir, consisting entirely of boys aged 8 to 14. The choir, run by organist Robert Mitchell, appeared in Hollywood productions for over thirty years. Accordingly, the boys were recruited to go to a special school where they would go through regular classroom instruction until 1 PM, after which they''d do choir practice. The kids are also shown performing in a church on Sunday as well as camping, as they are all part of the same Boy Scouts troop. The film was nominated for an Oscar for Best Short Subject, One-Reel.', 'Forty Boys and a Song is a 1941 short documentary film directed by Irving Allen. The film is about the Robert Mitchell Boy Choir, consisting entirely of boys aged 8 to 14. The choir, run by organist Robert Mitchell, appeared in Hollywood productions for over thirty years. Accordingly, the boys were recruited to go to a special school where they would go through regular classroom instruction until 1 PM, after which they''d do choir practice. The kids are also shown performing in a church on Sunday as well as camping, as they are all part of the same Boy Scouts troop. The film was nominated for an Oscar for Best Short Subject, One-Reel.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/829uX31T8XrSARaMnGBr0VtrAa5.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:236813'),
  ('735829510917104144', 'Forty Guns', 1957, 'Western, Drama', 'Samuel Fuller, Joseph F. Biroc, Harold E. Knox', 'Samuel Fuller', 'Barbara Stanwyck, Barry Sullivan, Dean Jagger, John Ericson, Gene Barry, Robert Dix, Jidge Carroll, Paul Dubov', null, 'An authoritarian rancher rules an Arizona county with her private posse of hired guns. When a new Marshall arrives to set things straight, the cattle queen finds herself falling for the avowedly non-violent lawman. Both have itchy-fingered brothers, a female gunman enters the picture, and things go desperately wrong.', 'An authoritarian rancher rules an Arizona county with her private posse of hired guns. When a new Marshall arrives to set things straight, the cattle queen finds herself falling for the avowedly non-violent lawman. Both have itchy-fingered brothers, a female gunman enters the picture, and things go desperately wrong.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7tJ83se0djTzIQ4pSs1LuebtPV.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:14837'),
  ('683617374678753939', 'Forty Shades of Blue', 2005, 'Drama, Romance', 'Ira Sachs, Julian Whatley', 'Ira Sachs, Michael Rohatyn', 'Rip Torn, Dina Korzun, Darren E. Burrows, Paprika Steen, Red West, Jenny O''Hara, Andrew Henderson, Elizabeth Morton', 'R', 'A Russian woman living in Memphis with a much older rock-n-roll legend experiences a personal awakening when her husband''s estranged son comes to visit.', 'A Russian woman living in Memphis with a much older rock-n-roll legend experiences a personal awakening when her husband''s estranged son comes to visit.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tWhkFzXkqS9afk2KKTTwd6IBmZ6.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:30082'),
  ('131163790271493633', 'Forward March Hare', 1953, 'Animation, Comedy, War', 'Chuck Jones, Carl W. Stalling', null, 'Mel Blanc, John T. Smith', null, 'Bugs Bunny gets a draft notice by mistake and joins the army, with disastrous results, especially for the sergeant of his platoon.', 'Bugs Bunny gets a draft notice by mistake and joins the army, with disastrous results, especially for the sergeant of his platoon.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rbGjDGTTIdZLF1fQREXFph4dBnb.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:101510'),
  ('229206213440156402', 'Forwards Ever!', 2017, 'Comedy', 'Franziska Meletzky, Bella Halben', 'Markus Thebe', 'Jörg Schüttauf, Josefine Preuß, Jacob Matschenz, Hedi Kriegeskotte, Marc Benjamin, Devid Striesow, Steffen Scheumann, André Jung', null, 'A stage actor''s turn as GDR leader Erich Honecker inspires an outlandish scheme to keep his daughter safe during the Leipzig protests of 1989.', 'A stage actor''s turn as GDR leader Erich Honecker inspires an outlandish scheme to keep his daughter safe during the Leipzig protests of 1989.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kvvbw3OHBOlT3WKAovKR7w87rwL.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:403899'),
  ('889376507782843069', 'Forza Bastia', 1978, 'Documentary', 'Jacques Tati, Alain Pillet, Henri Clairon', 'Jacques Tati', null, null, '"Forza Bastia" is a 26-minute film documenting a UEFA Cup match between PSV Eindhoven and French club SC Bastia at the Furiani Stadium in 1978. Jacques Tati directed the piece at the request of friend Gilberto Trigano – the President of the Bastia club at that time. It was subsequently shelved and kept in storage until Tati''s daughter Sophie Tatischeff eventually assembled the footage for release in 2002.', '"Forza Bastia" is a 26-minute film documenting a UEFA Cup match between PSV Eindhoven and French club SC Bastia at the Furiani Stadium in 1978. Jacques Tati directed the piece at the request of friend Gilberto Trigano – the President of the Bastia club at that time. It was subsequently shelved and kept in storage until Tati''s daughter Sophie Tatischeff eventually assembled the footage for release in 2002.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zHSrMtJ5L9OBiAL7J4QPn7XoJrc.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:283077'),
  ('187125771628559651', 'Foster', 2011, 'Comedy, Drama, Family', 'Jonathan Newman, Dirk Nel, Francesca Payne', 'Jonathan Newman', 'Toni Collette, Ioan Gruffudd, Maurice Cole, Richard E. Grant, Anne Reid, Hayley Mills, Barry Jackson, Daisy Beaumont', null, 'Looking to adopt a child and unable to conceive a child of their own, the Morrisons'' lives are turned upside down when a seven-year-old boy unexpectedly shows up on their doorstep.', 'Looking to adopt a child and unable to conceive a child of their own, the Morrisons'' lives are turned upside down when a seven-year-old boy unexpectedly shows up on their doorstep.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tO5FI5th4mxvokU8qsPbu9l4ucE.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:81232'),
  ('955506436840147761', 'Foul Hunting', 1947, 'Animation, Comedy', 'Jack Hannah', 'Dick Kinney, Bob North', 'Pinto Colvig', 'NR', 'Goofy goes duck-hunting.', 'Goofy goes duck-hunting.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vBNVOxrGX6YsQkNTVYauuWJUqIv.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:67625'),
  ('35615231039044007', 'Foul Play', 1977, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Juan Antonio Bardem, Juan Ignacio Galván', 'Daniel Sueiro, Juan Antonio Bardem, Javier Palmero', 'Alfredo Landa, Josele Román, Simón Andreu, Victoria Abril, Francisco Algora, Mabel Escaño, Germán Cobos, Manuel Alexandre', null, 'A workshop employee decides to take advantage of a long weekend to go to Torremolinos to have fun and chat up foreign tourists.', 'A workshop employee decides to take advantage of a long weekend to go to Torremolinos to have fun and chat up foreign tourists.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oci1Jr6MVMRrBsJNtOy5jNqJO9O.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:272845'),
  ('381860434640521164', 'Foul Play', 1978, 'Comedy, Mystery, Thriller', 'Colin Higgins, David M. Walsh', 'Colin Higgins', 'Goldie Hawn, Chevy Chase, Burgess Meredith, Eugene Roche, Dudley Moore, Marilyn Sokol, Brian Dennehy, Marc Lawrence', 'PG', 'A shy San Francisco librarian and a bumbling cop fall in love as they solve a crime involving albinos, dwarves, and the Catholic Church.', 'A shy San Francisco librarian and a bumbling cop fall in love as they solve a crime involving albinos, dwarves, and the Catholic Church.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mk3enoeLNRXRnYGxKcvPXYY1xci.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:15659'),
  ('511610119845361145', 'Found', 2012, 'Horror, Thriller, Drama', 'Scott Schirmer, Leya Taylor', 'Todd Rigney, Scott Schirmer', 'Gavin Brown, Ethan Philbeck, Phyllis Munro, Louie Lawless, Alex Kogin, Andy Alphonse, Kitsie Duncan, Kate Braun', 'NR', 'Marty is the ideal fifth grader—he gets good grades, listens to his teachers and doesn''t start trouble in class. But a darkness is beginning to fall over Marty''s life, the kids at school won''t stop picking on him, his parents just don''t seem to understand him, and now Marty must grapple with a terrible secret that threatens to destroy life as he knows it—his big brother is a serial killer.', 'Marty is the ideal fifth grader—he gets good grades, listens to his teachers and doesn''t start trouble in class. But a darkness is beginning to fall over Marty''s life, the kids at school won''t stop picking on him, his parents just don''t seem to understand him, and now Marty must grapple with a terrible secret that threatens to destroy life as he knows it—his big brother is a serial killer.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/a6KyeVoJ3gyttg8hu32ytSNOYO5.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:138941'),
  ('597045991275462539', 'Found', 2021, 'Documentary', 'Amanda Lipitz, Casey Regan', null, null, 'PG', 'Follows the story of three American teenage girls—each adopted from China—who discover they are blood-related cousins on 23andMe. Their online meeting inspires the young women to confront the burning questions they have about their lost history.', 'Follows the story of three American teenage girls—each adopted from China—who discover they are blood-related cousins on 23andMe. Their online meeting inspires the young women to confront the burning questions they have about their lost history.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9yUFnLw5KkcinnWUzGx8Fll28BN.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:819500'),
  ('421225120788989411', 'Found Footage 3D', 2016, 'Horror', 'Drew Daniels, Steven DeGennaro', 'Steven DeGennaro', 'Carter Roy, Alena von Stroheim, Chris O''Brien, Tom Saporito, Scott Allen Perry, Jessica Perrin, Scott Weinberg, John Daws', null, 'A group of filmmakers sets out to make the first 3D found footage horror movie, but find themselves IN the first 3D found footage horror movie when the evil entity from their film escapes into their behind-the-scenes footage.', 'A group of filmmakers sets out to make the first 3D found footage horror movie, but find themselves IN the first 3D found footage horror movie when the evil entity from their film escapes into their behind-the-scenes footage.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sOQmVVPXkUWWDWf0n2OyYjFmFee.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:353419'),
  ('1144585674859749612', 'Found Memories', 2012, 'Drama', 'Julia Murat, Lucio Bonelli', 'Maria Clara Escobar, Felipe Sholl, Julia Murat', 'Sônia Guedes, Lisa Fávero, Luiz Serra, Ricardo Merkin, Nelson Justiniano', null, 'Each citizen of Jotuomba plays an integral role in village life. Madalena is responsible for baking bread; each morning she stacks her rolls as Antonio prepares the coffee. The two share a morning ritual of arguments and insults, followed by an amicable cup of coffee on the bench outside Antonio''s shop. At midday the church bells ring, summoning the villagers to mass. In the early evening, they all share a meal together. And so life proceeds in Jotuomba, the days languidly drifting into one another; the only variations seem to be in the weather. But, one day Rita arrives looking for a place to stay.', 'Each citizen of Jotuomba plays an integral role in village life. Madalena is responsible for baking bread; each morning she stacks her rolls as Antonio prepares the coffee. The two share a morning ritual of arguments and insults, followed by an amicable cup of coffee on the bench outside Antonio''s shop. At midday the church bells ring, summoning the villagers to mass. In the early evening, they all share a meal together. And so life proceeds in Jotuomba, the days languidly drifting into one another; the only variations seem to be in the weather. But, one day Rita arrives looking for a place to stay.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fERzBTJAft18aTi7Qm6Ui7MZTw7.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:102860'),
  ('431107914559746582', 'Founders Day', 2024, 'Horror, Thriller, Comedy', 'Tyler LaValley, Cody Boccia, Erik Bloomquist', 'Erik Bloomquist, Carson Bloomquist', 'Naomi Grace, Devin Druid, William Russ, Amy Hargreaves, Catherine Curtin, Emilia McCarthy, Olivia Nikkanen, Jayce Bartok', 'R', 'A small town is shaken by a series of ominous killings in the days leading up to a heated mayoral election.', 'A small town is shaken by a series of ominous killings in the days leading up to a heated mayoral election.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ohzLPC9lHUWseBgB7HRcz0GBkFb.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1055451'),
  ('408752707181747280', 'Fountain of Youth', 2025, 'Adventure, Fantasy, Mystery', 'Guy Ritchie, Ed Wild, Max Keene', 'James Vanderbilt', 'John Krasinski, Natalie Portman, Eiza González, Domhnall Gleeson, Arian Moayed, Laz Alonso, Carmen Ejogo, Stanley Tucci', 'PG-13', 'A treasure-hunting mastermind assembles a team for a life-changing adventure. But to outwit and outrun threats at every turn, he''ll need someone even smarter than he is: his estranged sister.', 'A treasure-hunting mastermind assembles a team for a life-changing adventure. But to outwit and outrun threats at every turn, he''ll need someone even smarter than he is: his estranged sister.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4iWjGghUj2uyHo2Hyw8NFBvsNGm.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1098006'),
  ('671449679266606106', 'Four Adventures of Reinette and Mirabelle', 1987, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Éric Rohmer', 'Éric Rohmer', 'Joëlle Miquel, Jessica Forde, Philippe Laudenbach, François-Marie Banier, Jean-Claude Brisseau, Yasmine Haury, Gérard Courant, Béatrice Romand', null, 'Two young girls meet, Reinette from the countryside and Mirabelle from Paris, and decide to take a flat together in Paris where they attend University. Four successive stories about their daily lives illustrate the very different views, characters and relation to the world of these two friends.', 'Two young girls meet, Reinette from the countryside and Mirabelle from Paris, and decide to take a flat together in Paris where they attend University. Four successive stories about their daily lives illustrate the very different views, characters and relation to the world of these two friends.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iXydrbtUGX7CUutomhtMtlUd3Cb.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:37189'),
  ('660067788798099449', 'Four Against the Bank', 2016, 'Comedy, Crime', 'Wolfgang Petersen, Daniel Gottschalk', 'Tripper Clancy', 'Jan Josef Liefers, Til Schweiger, Matthias Schweighöfer, Michael Herbig, Antje Traue, Alexandra Maria Lara, Claudia Michelsen, Thomas Heinze', null, 'After losing their respective nest eggs thanks to a bumbling bank employee, three men use him to plot a bold and batty heist to get their money back.', 'After losing their respective nest eggs thanks to a bumbling bank employee, three men use him to plot a bold and batty heist to get their money back.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/HPpM5xlHJhhpR8eyeUfEazD4bm.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:366568'),
  ('982462745121412715', 'Four Around the Woman', 1921, 'Drama', 'Fritz Lang, Otto Kanturek', 'Fritz Lang, Thea von Harbou', 'Hermann Böttcher, Carola Toelle, Lilli Lohrer, Ludwig Hartau, Anton Edthofer, Robert Forster-Larrinaga, Lisa von Marton, Gottfried Huppertz', null, 'Harry Yquem buys his beloved wife some jewelry in a place where underworld middlemen trade in fake and stolen goods. By chance, he spots a man with whom his wife had an affair in the past.', 'Harry Yquem buys his beloved wife some jewelry in a place where underworld middlemen trade in fake and stolen goods. By chance, he spots a man with whom his wife had an affair in the past.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lYK9xJBmJAaklp4ZVSoTRtK2xAx.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:175472'),
  ('675408266180984046', 'Four Brothers', 2005, 'Action, Crime', 'John Singleton, Peter Menzies Jr., Doug Coleman', 'David Elliot, Paul Lovett', 'Mark Wahlberg, Tyrese Gibson, André 3000, Garrett Hedlund, Terrence Howard, Josh Charles, Sofía Vergara, Fionnula Flanagan', 'R', 'Four adopted brothers return to their Detroit hometown when their mother is murdered and vow to exact revenge on the killers.', 'Four adopted brothers return to their Detroit hometown when their mother is murdered and vow to exact revenge on the killers.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8cO39cnWSZQi2ncPG5TxL3YRzKc.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:8292'),
  ('35925523050064827', 'Four Carrions in Malopasso', 1989, 'Western, TV Movie', 'Vito Colomba', 'Vito Colomba', 'Salvatore Cipponeri, Tony Genco, Caterina Pace, Daniele D''Angelo, Nicola Vultaggio, Nino Scaduto, Vito Gagliano, Salvatore Peraino', null, 'Billy Nelson returns to his hometown of Malopasso after ten years as a rancher on a large ranch in San Vito. Once in town, Billy discovers a terrible truth: His parents, Santo Nelson and Rosa Lopez, were killed by the terrible bandit Parker. Shocked, Billy vows revenge against the perpetrators of his family''s massacre.', 'Billy Nelson returns to his hometown of Malopasso after ten years as a rancher on a large ranch in San Vito. Once in town, Billy discovers a terrible truth: His parents, Santo Nelson and Rosa Lopez, were killed by the terrible bandit Parker. Shocked, Billy vows revenge against the perpetrators of his family''s massacre.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/npwYK4PjzIMWmnyjJzsuMp6Urbu.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:168376'),
  ('552161501713296785', 'Four Christmases', 2008, 'Comedy, Romance, Drama', 'Jeffrey L. Kimball, Seth Gordon, Rip Murray', 'Caleb Wilson, Matt Allen, Jon Lucas', 'Vince Vaughn, Reese Witherspoon, Robert Duvall, Sissy Spacek, Mary Steenburgen, Jon Voight, Kristin Chenoweth, Jon Favreau', 'PG-13', 'Brad and Kate have made something of an art form out of avoiding their families during the holidays, but this year their foolproof plan is about go bust -- big time. Stuck at the city airport after all departing flights are canceled, the couple is embarrassed to see their ruse exposed to the world by an overzealous television reporter. Now, Brad and Kate are left with precious little choice other than to swallow their pride and suffer the rounds.', 'Brad and Kate have made something of an art form out of avoiding their families during the holidays, but this year their foolproof plan is about go bust -- big time. Stuck at the city airport after all departing flights are canceled, the couple is embarrassed to see their ruse exposed to the world by an overzealous television reporter. Now, Brad and Kate are left with precious little choice other than to swallow their pride and suffer the rounds.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zixj44TC7rwzpxtJAG5OzFJnEqe.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:12193'),
  ('848240324531059997', 'Four Christmases and a Wedding', 2017, 'TV Movie, Romance, Comedy', 'Marita Grabiak, Mike Kam', 'Barbara Kymlicka', 'Arielle Kebbel, Corey Sevier, Madison Smith, Markie Post, Donna Benedicto, Cassidy Nugent, Judge Reinhold, Courtney Richter', null, 'When event planner Chloe is hired to plan the local Christmas Festival, she is beyond thrilled to embrace the challenge. Professionally, everything is going great, but much to the dismay of her mother, Chloe confesses she has given up on ever finding Mr. Right. That all changes the night of the opening of the festival when she meets Evan. The two begin a whirlwind romance, but as Christmas Day nears, Chloe learns that Evan is being transferred overseas for work. What follows is three more Christmases where Chloe and Evan cross paths at the annual festival, but each year something - or someone - stands in the way of true love. Will a touch of Santa''s magic on their fourth Christmas Eve finally bring them together?', 'When event planner Chloe is hired to plan the local Christmas Festival, she is beyond thrilled to embrace the challenge. Professionally, everything is going great, but much to the dismay of her mother, Chloe confesses she has given up on ever finding Mr. Right. That all changes the night of the opening of the festival when she meets Evan. The two begin a whirlwind romance, but as Christmas Day nears, Chloe learns that Evan is being transferred overseas for work. What follows is three more Christmases where Chloe and Evan cross paths at the annual festival, but each year something - or someone - stands in the way of true love. Will a touch of Santa''s magic on their fourth Christmas Eve finally bring them together?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dRv1JbwTsAymNnV5grIDN2NCNlH.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:489204'),
  ('894289001318162124', 'Four Daughters', 1938, 'Drama, Music, Romance', 'Michael Curtiz, Ernest Haller, Leo F. Forbstein', 'Lawrence Kimble, Thyra Samter Winslow', 'Claude Rains, Priscilla Lane, John Garfield, May Robson, Lola Lane, Rosemary Lane, Gale Page, Frank McHugh', 'NR', 'Musician Adam Lemp and his four equally musical daughters, Emma, Ann, Kay, and Thea, live happily together. Each daughter has an upstanding young man for whom she cares. However, the arrival of a cynical, slovenly young composer named Mickey Borden turns the household upside-down, and romantic and tragic complications ensue.', 'Musician Adam Lemp and his four equally musical daughters, Emma, Ann, Kay, and Thea, live happily together. Each daughter has an upstanding young man for whom she cares. However, the arrival of a cynical, slovenly young composer named Mickey Borden turns the household upside-down, and romantic and tragic complications ensue.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/b537l9ogYQY3y66G4zLXvP970Lj.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:67880'),
  ('786518967099692533', 'Four Daughters', 2023, 'Documentary, Drama', 'Kaouther Ben Hania, Farouk Laaridh, Wided Zoghlami', 'Kaouther Ben Hania', 'Olfa Hamrouni, Eya Chikhaoui, Tayssir Chikhaoui, Nour Karoui, Ichraq Matar, Majd Mastoura, Hend Sabry, Zine El-Abidine Ben Ali', 'NR', 'Between light and darkness stands Olfa, a Tunisian woman and the mother of four daughters. One day, her two older daughters disappear. To fill in their absence, the filmmaker Kaouther Ben Hania invites professional actresses and invents a unique cinema experience that will lift the veil on Olfa and her daughters'' life stories. An intimate journey of hope, rebellion, violence, transmission and sisterhood that will question the very foundations of our societies.', 'Between light and darkness stands Olfa, a Tunisian woman and the mother of four daughters. One day, her two older daughters disappear. To fill in their absence, the filmmaker Kaouther Ben Hania invites professional actresses and invents a unique cinema experience that will lift the veil on Olfa and her daughters'' life stories. An intimate journey of hope, rebellion, violence, transmission and sisterhood that will question the very foundations of our societies.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iSpJ6fg1OOSO30IUkZskZDufVzN.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1069193'),
  ('933407787847254208', 'Four Days in July', 1984, 'Drama, TV Movie', 'Mike Leigh, Remi Adefarasin', 'Mike Leigh', 'Brid Brennan, Des McAleer, Paula Hamilton, Charles Lawson, B.J. Hogg, Adrian Gordon, Shane Connaughton, Eileen Pollock', null, 'Two couples, one Catholic, one Protestant, exist on two sides of the chasm that is everyday life in Northern Ireland.', 'Two couples, one Catholic, one Protestant, exist on two sides of the chasm that is everyday life in Northern Ireland.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bB05tIC4NhxYASRwECbHayYls7Z.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:187569'),
  ('916046968854269168', 'Four Days in September', 1997, 'Thriller, Drama, History', 'Bruno Barreto, Ricardo Favilla, Félix "Chango" Monti', 'Fernando Gabeira, Leopoldo Serran', 'Alan Arkin, Pedro Cardoso, Fernanda Torres, Luiz Fernando Guimarães, Cláudia Abreu, Nelson Dantas, Matheus Nachtergaele, Marco Ricca', 'R', 'Fernando, a journalist, and his friend César join terrorist group MR8 in order to fight Brazilian dictatorial regime during the late sixties. César, however, is wounded and captured during a bank hold up. Fernando then decides to kidnap the American ambassador in Brazil and ask for the release of fifteen political prisoners in exchange for his life.', 'Fernando, a journalist, and his friend César join terrorist group MR8 in order to fight Brazilian dictatorial regime during the late sixties. César, however, is wounded and captured during a bank hold up. Fernando then decides to kidnap the American ambassador in Brazil and ask for the release of fifteen political prisoners in exchange for his life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zkA5riIdjtanpSoTNh3icKNjACZ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:21253'),
  ('703602423283116737', 'Four Enchanted Sisters', 2020, 'Adventure, Comedy, Family, Fantasy', 'Sven Unterwaldt Jr.', 'Gerrit Hermans', 'Katja Riemann, Doris Schretzmayer, Justus von Dohnányi, Anna Thalbach, Gregor Bloéb, Leonore von Berg, Lilith Julie Johna, Juls Serger', null, 'Based on Sheridan Winn''s book series "Sprite Sisters" about the magical adventures of sisters Flame, Sky, Flora and Marina.', 'Based on Sheridan Winn''s book series "Sprite Sisters" about the magical adventures of sisters Flame, Sky, Flora and Marina.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/64JXvxlNSjr3leHaoVqTu0wtz76.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:639854'),
  ('350225999397962310', 'Four Eyed Monsters', 2005, 'Comedy, Drama, Fantasy, Romance', 'Susan Buice, Arin Crumley, Arin Crumley', 'Susan Buice, Arin Crumley', 'Susan Buice, Arin Crumley, Brad Calcaterra, Lindsey Andersen, Julia Ann Ames, Yuan-Kwan Chan, Lucie Cuadrado, Aubrey Plaza', 'PG-13', 'Apathy, technology, paranoia, disease and medication. Meet Arin. Arin is a shy videographer who finds it too much to handle to go out and meet girls, so he sets up an account on meester.net. The flood of responses never comes, save for one email from Susan, a struggling artist who finds her job as a waitress stifling her creativity. Susan is also on the shy side and is seeking an alternative to the classic dating situation. When Arin and Susan finally meet, that alternative dating situation comes to life as the two refuse to communicate verbally with each other, wanting to avoid bs small talk.', 'Apathy, technology, paranoia, disease and medication. Meet Arin. Arin is a shy videographer who finds it too much to handle to go out and meet girls, so he sets up an account on meester.net. The flood of responses never comes, save for one email from Susan, a struggling artist who finds her job as a waitress stifling her creativity. Susan is also on the shy side and is seeking an alternative to the classic dating situation. When Arin and Susan finally meet, that alternative dating situation comes to life as the two refuse to communicate verbally with each other, wanting to avoid bs small talk.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dK6qTEus2V2xCKGgXJ8osTPIf1g.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:46336'),
  ('585157979404077360', 'Four Faces West', 1948, 'Western', 'Alfred E. Green, Russell Harlan, Nathan Barragar', 'C. Graham Baker, Teddi Sherman', 'Joel McCrea, Frances Dee, Charles Bickford, Joseph Calleia, William Conrad, Martín Garralaga, Raymond Largay, John Parrish', 'NR', 'Cowboy Ross McEwen arrives in town. He asks the banker for a loan of $2000. When the banker asks about securing a loan that large, McEwen shows him his six-gun collateral. The banker hands over the money in exchange for an I.O.U., signed "Jefferson Davis". McEwen rides out of town and catches a train, but not before being bitten by a rattler. On the train, a nurse, Miss Hollister, tends to his wound. A posse searches the train, but McEwen manages to escape notice. However a mysterious Mexican has taken note of the cowboy, and that loudmouthed brat is still nosing around. Who will be the first to claim the reward for the robber''s capture?', 'Cowboy Ross McEwen arrives in town. He asks the banker for a loan of $2000. When the banker asks about securing a loan that large, McEwen shows him his six-gun collateral. The banker hands over the money in exchange for an I.O.U., signed "Jefferson Davis". McEwen rides out of town and catches a train, but not before being bitten by a rattler. On the train, a nurse, Miss Hollister, tends to his wound. A posse searches the train, but McEwen manages to escape notice. However a mysterious Mexican has taken note of the cowboy, and that loudmouthed brat is still nosing around. Who will be the first to claim the reward for the robber''s capture?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pCVRQPLAQYxnubSsyxIjlm4ldTs.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:64139'),
  ('1006775285105407837', 'Four Flies on Grey Velvet', 1971, 'Horror, Thriller, Mystery', 'Dario Argento, Franco Di Giacomo, Giovanni Viti', 'Dario Argento', 'Michael Brandon, Mimsy Farmer, Jean-Pierre Marielle, Aldo Bufi Landi, Calisto Calisti, Marisa Fabbri, Oreste Lionello, Fabrizio Moroni', 'PG', 'Roberto, a drummer in a rock band, keeps receiving weird phone calls and being followed by a mysterious man. One night he manages to catch up with his persecutor and tries to get him to talk but in the ensuing struggle he accidentally stabs him. He runs away, but he understands his troubles have just begun when the following day he receives an envelope with photos of him killing the man. Someone is killing all his friends and trying to frame him for the murders.', 'Roberto, a drummer in a rock band, keeps receiving weird phone calls and being followed by a mysterious man. One night he manages to catch up with his persecutor and tries to get him to talk but in the ensuing struggle he accidentally stabs him. He runs away, but he understands his troubles have just begun when the following day he receives an envelope with photos of him killing the man. Someone is killing all his friends and trying to frame him for the murders.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hEFlF2M4nJ9OszjZaJ2oaRt9lr0.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:30689'),
  ('430280871050272205', 'Four Flights to Love', 1939, 'War, Drama, Romance', 'Abel Gance, Christian Matras', 'Abel Gance, Joseph Than', 'Fernand Gravey, Micheline Presle, Robert Le Vigan, Elvira Popescu, André Alerme, Monique Rolland, Robert Pizani, Jane Marken', null, 'In pre-World Ward I in Paris, a budding artist, Pierre LeBlanc, falls in love and marries Janine, a dressmaker''s assistant. Pierre has a flair for designing clothes, and he and his bride live in a blissful paradise, until the war breaks out and he becomes a soldier. Janine dies in childbirth and, no longer desiring to live, Pierre volunteers for a dangerous patrol behind German lines. While recuperating in the hospital from a wound he received on the mission, Pierre spends his time drawing sketches of dresses. He becomes rich and famous after the war. Years later, after devoting himself to his daughter, Pierre seeks a marriage with a girl no older than his daughter. A conflict develops and to ensure his daughter''s happiness, Pierre sacrifices his own plans.', 'In pre-World Ward I in Paris, a budding artist, Pierre LeBlanc, falls in love and marries Janine, a dressmaker''s assistant. Pierre has a flair for designing clothes, and he and his bride live in a blissful paradise, until the war breaks out and he becomes a soldier. Janine dies in childbirth and, no longer desiring to live, Pierre volunteers for a dangerous patrol behind German lines. While recuperating in the hospital from a wound he received on the mission, Pierre spends his time drawing sketches of dresses. He becomes rich and famous after the war. Years later, after devoting himself to his daughter, Pierre seeks a marriage with a girl no older than his daughter. A conflict develops and to ensure his daughter''s happiness, Pierre sacrifices his own plans.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/muZzUinKStUfKy10dKso4esxREh.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:65645'),
  ('1150114145847055966', 'Four Friends', 1981, 'Drama, Romance, Comedy', 'Gene Lasko, Arthur Penn, Ghislain Cloquet', 'Steve Tesich', 'Craig Wasson, Jodi Thelen, Michael Huddleston, Jim Metzler, Scott Hardt, Elizabeth Lawrence, Miklos Simon, Michael Kovacs', 'R', 'A young immigrant comes to America in the 60s and is caught up in the counterculture movement which tests his bonds of friendship and love.', 'A young immigrant comes to America in the 60s and is caught up in the counterculture movement which tests his bonds of friendship and love.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4qWB2CtUOOvmlBNc0KTZQno0Edj.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:70971'),
  ('499283249967153190', 'Four Frightened People', 1934, 'Adventure, Drama, Thriller', 'Cecil B. DeMille, Karl Struss, James Dugan', 'Bartlett Cormack, Lenore J. Coffee', 'Claudette Colbert, Herbert Marshall, Mary Boland, William Gargan, Leo Carrillo, Nella Walker, Ethel Griffies, Tetsu Komai', null, 'Malaya tropical island romantic love triangle adventure thriller, about a cruise ship where Bubonic plague breaks out. Four people are able to leave the ship in a tiny boat and make it to a desert island, where many adventures ensue and, of course, the two men fight over the beautiful young schoolteacher who is with them.', 'Malaya tropical island romantic love triangle adventure thriller, about a cruise ship where Bubonic plague breaks out. Four people are able to leave the ship in a tiny boat and make it to a desert island, where many adventures ensue and, of course, the two men fight over the beautiful young schoolteacher who is with them.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/u2btRH8X6vuBNASarrA0bMGjJ8I.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:61392'),
  ('333722348927926151', 'Four Good Days', 2021, 'Drama', 'Rodrigo García', 'Rodrigo García, Eli Saslow', 'Glenn Close, Mila Kunis, Stephen Root, Joshua Leonard, Rebecca Field, Michael Hyatt, Sam Hennings, Mandy June Turpin', 'R', 'A mother helps her daughter work through four crucial days of recovery from substance abuse.', 'A mother helps her daughter work through four crucial days of recovery from substance abuse.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uaJmqZxwAsdFLLjPGH5DzIEnbpj.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:641960'),
  ('534325968464917915', 'Four Guns to the Border', 1954, 'Western', 'Tom Shaw, Richard Carlson, Russell Metty', 'George Van Marter, Franklin Coen', 'Rory Calhoun, Colleen Miller, George Nader, Walter Brennan, Nina Foch, John McIntire, Charles Drake, Jay Silverheels', 'NR', 'A group of outlaws plan and execute a robbery in a small town. However, things go awry as the team attempt a getaway, when a couple of the locals attempting to follow them, are ambushed by marauding natives.', 'A group of outlaws plan and execute a robbery in a small town. However, things go awry as the team attempt a getaway, when a couple of the locals attempting to follow them, are ambushed by marauding natives.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eLGNjQOdVDSJEZ0QDf5WDimbtv7.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:245305'),
  ('714737903935323393', 'Four Hands', 2017, 'Thriller, Drama', 'Oliver Kienle, Yoshi Heimrath', 'Oliver Kienle', 'Frida Lovisa Hamann, Friederike Becht, Christoph Letkowski, Agnieszka Guzikowska, Detlef Bothe, Verena Konietschke, Daniel Reimling, Frank W. Rima', null, 'After Sophie and Jessica had witnessed a brutal crime when they were kids, Jessica promised her younger sister Sophie: "I will always protect you!" Growing older, this promise became an obsession. Now, Jessica (28) is suffering from paranoia and sees threats to her and her sister everywhere. But Sophie (26) wants to live a normal life without fear, without her sister. She wants to become a pianist and wants to fall in love. When the perpetrators are released of prison after 20 years, Jessica is shocked and wants to confront them. But an accident changes everything. Jessica''s promise to always protect her little sister turns into an existential nightmare.', 'After Sophie and Jessica had witnessed a brutal crime when they were kids, Jessica promised her younger sister Sophie: "I will always protect you!" Growing older, this promise became an obsession. Now, Jessica (28) is suffering from paranoia and sees threats to her and her sister everywhere. But Sophie (26) wants to live a normal life without fear, without her sister. She wants to become a pianist and wants to fall in love. When the perpetrators are released of prison after 20 years, Jessica is shocked and wants to confront them. But an accident changes everything. Jessica''s promise to always protect her little sister turns into an existential nightmare.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/royswZqbLgTP45ReP8B5jFROd0f.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:459937'),
  ('427661355309310021', 'Four Hearts', 1944, 'Romance, Comedy, Music', 'Konstantin Yudin, Nikolay Vlasov, Boris Aretskiy', 'Anatoli Granberg, Aleksei Fajko', 'Valentina Serova, Evgeniy Samoylov, Lyudmila Tselikovskaya, Pavel Shpringfeld, Lyubov Dmitriyevskaya, Irina Murzayeva, Andrei Tutyshkin, Aleksandr Antonov', null, 'The plot is built around two charming sisters — a strict, wayward Galina, an assistant professor of mathematics, and a windy, frivolous student Shurochka. Despite the fact that the girls are so different, they are looking, of course, for one thing — love. The events take place in the summer pre-war Moscow and in the country where both sisters go: one in order to prepare for the re-examination, the other — to conduct math classes with the military from the Yuryev Camps located near the dacha village. Funny and difficult situations, intrigues, tears, joy — all this will be experienced by young girls on the way to their happiness.', 'The plot is built around two charming sisters — a strict, wayward Galina, an assistant professor of mathematics, and a windy, frivolous student Shurochka. Despite the fact that the girls are so different, they are looking, of course, for one thing — love. The events take place in the summer pre-war Moscow and in the country where both sisters go: one in order to prepare for the re-examination, the other — to conduct math classes with the military from the Yuryev Camps located near the dacha village. Funny and difficult situations, intrigues, tears, joy — all this will be experienced by young girls on the way to their happiness.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8ZZpfE3g2haJUl1UZxKEfYdMnDG.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:101846'),
  ('1020802421213502692', 'Four Hours at the Capitol', 2021, 'Documentary', 'Jamie Roberts', null, 'Eric Swalwell, Jim McGovern, Ruben Gallego, Chuck Schumer, Dick Durbin, Rosa DeLauro, Buddy Carter, Michael Fanone', null, 'The documentary is an immersive chronicle of the insurrection at the U.S. Capitol on January 6, 2021, when thousands of American citizens from across the country gathered in Washington D.C. to protest the results of the 2020 presidential election, many with the intent of disrupting the certification of Joe Biden''s presidency.', 'The documentary is an immersive chronicle of the insurrection at the U.S. Capitol on January 6, 2021, when thousands of American citizens from across the country gathered in Washington D.C. to protest the results of the 2020 presidential election, many with the intent of disrupting the certification of Joe Biden''s presidency.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2PZIEIAUdpsAorGyrbESnxoL0yA.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:879535'),
  ('3473301357538840', 'Four in the Afternoon', 1951, 'Drama, Comedy', 'James Broughton', null, 'Anna Halprin, Welland Lathrop', null, 'Poems narrate four afternoon vignettes; each protagonist is older than the one in the previous sketch.', 'Poems narrate four afternoon vignettes; each protagonist is older than the one in the previous sketch.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/n2Ow9snl2SIm5MMirDx0ZxOXrsq.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:235963'),
  ('321284157738797783', 'Four in the Morning', 1965, 'Drama', 'John Wakefield, Anthony Simmons, Larry Pizer', 'Anthony Simmons', 'Ann Lynn, Judi Dench, Norman Rodway, Brian Phelan, Joe Melia', null, 'The parallel stories of two couples in crises and their connections to a drowned woman found in a river.', 'The parallel stories of two couples in crises and their connections to a drowned woman found in a river.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/11RpYE4D7vpbPQFk98We5iMLQ9q.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:129134'),
  ('602583590366031823', 'Four Kids and It', 2020, 'Family, Fantasy', 'Andy de Emmony', 'Simon Lewis', 'Matthew Goode, Pippa Haywood, Paula Patton, Michael Caine, Russell Brand, William Franklyn-Miller, Billy Jenkins, Ashley Aufderheide', 'PG', 'A group of kids on holiday in Cornwall meet a magical creature on the beach with the power to grant wishes.', 'A group of kids on holiday in Cornwall meet a magical creature on the beach with the power to grant wishes.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vIFyMT7HIUdfYPqgjsFsXlbaVZx.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:555457'),
  ('949373495218491582', 'Four Lions', 2010, 'Comedy, Crime, Drama', 'Chris Morris, Lol Crawley, Joe Geary', 'Chris Morris, Jesse Armstrong, Sam Bain', 'Riz Ahmed, Nigel Lindsay, Kayvan Novak, Adeel Akhtar, Arsher Ali, Preeya Kalidas, Benedict Cumberbatch, Julia Davis', 'R', 'Four Lions tells the story of a group of British jihadists who push their abstract dreams of glory to the breaking point. As the wheels fly off, and their competing ideologies clash, what emerges is an emotionally engaging (and entirely plausible) farce.', 'Four Lions tells the story of a group of British jihadists who push their abstract dreams of glory to the breaking point. As the wheels fly off, and their competing ideologies clash, what emerges is an emotionally engaging (and entirely plausible) farce.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/x4JzaRPXBs9wiHCe3e3ymXWuwfd.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:37495'),
  ('874192252605116854', 'Four Lovers', 2010, 'Romance', 'Antony Cordier, Nicolas Gaurin', 'Julie Peyr, Antony Cordier', 'Marina Foïs, Élodie Bouchez, Roschdy Zem, Nicolas Duvauchelle, Alexia Stresi, Blanche Gardin, Jean-François Stévenin', null, 'Mutual attraction leads two married couples to swap bedtime partners.', 'Mutual attraction leads two married couples to swap bedtime partners.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/n8ZDAs5lJ8hN3MSPBThLbxMnE5z.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:59507'),
  ('793212377237692641', 'Four Men and a Prayer', 1938, 'Adventure, Mystery', 'John Ford', 'Sonya Levien, Walter Ferris, Richard Sherman', 'Loretta Young, Richard Greene, George Sanders, David Niven, C. Aubrey Smith, William Henry, Berton Churchill, Alan Hale', 'NR', 'The sons of a disgraced British officer try to clear his name.', 'The sons of a disgraced British officer try to clear his name.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nruByrsU5KHz3pzSzkJsg6gqiYR.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:116973'),
  ('1121588267251941131', 'Four Minutes', 2006, 'Drama, Music', 'Chris Kraus, Judith Kaufmann', 'Chris Kraus', 'Monica Bleibtreu, Hannah Herzsprung, Sven Pippig, Richy Müller, Jasmin Tabatabai, Stefan Kurt, Vadim Glowna, Nadja Uhl', null, 'Jenny is young. Her life is over. She killed someone. And she would do it again. When an 80-year-old piano teacher discovers the girl’s secret, her brutality and her dreams, she decides to transform her pupil into the musical wunderkind she once was.', 'Jenny is young. Her life is over. She killed someone. And she would do it again. When an 80-year-old piano teacher discovers the girl’s secret, her brutality and her dreams, she decides to transform her pupil into the musical wunderkind she once was.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qZusVWgu0Df9hD4JbT0R2yYL2ya.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1294'),
  ('319476636135903228', 'Four Moods', 1970, 'Drama, Fantasy, Romance', 'Chen Jung-Shu, Chen-Kan Hsieh, Lee Hsing', 'Li Han-Hsiang, Zhishan Li, Chang Yung-Hsiang', 'Zhen Zhen, Yueh Yang, Chang Mei-Yao, Li Li-Hua, Peter Yang Kwan, Chang Tseng, Han Su, Lung Fei', null, 'Directed by some of most well known Chinese-language directors of the time, the portmanteau film Four Moods was an attempt to alleviate Li Han-hsiang’s financial troubles during the late 1960s. Arguably one of his best works, King Hu’s short Anger is an adaptation of the famous Peking opera San Cha Kou; set to opera instrumentation and stylishly shot, the film deftly captures the tense showdown between political schemers, avengers and vagabonds inside an inn. Li Han-hsiang’s Happiness, inspired by the Strange Tales of Liaozhai, tells a tale of reprieve for a kind-hearted ghost, while Pai Ching-Jui’s Joy and Lee Hsing’s Sadness both explore the fateful encounters between mortal men and ghostly women.', 'Directed by some of most well known Chinese-language directors of the time, the portmanteau film Four Moods was an attempt to alleviate Li Han-hsiang’s financial troubles during the late 1960s. Arguably one of his best works, King Hu’s short Anger is an adaptation of the famous Peking opera San Cha Kou; set to opera instrumentation and stylishly shot, the film deftly captures the tense showdown between political schemers, avengers and vagabonds inside an inn. Li Han-hsiang’s Happiness, inspired by the Strange Tales of Liaozhai, tells a tale of reprieve for a kind-hearted ghost, while Pai Ching-Jui’s Joy and Lee Hsing’s Sadness both explore the fateful encounters between mortal men and ghostly women.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zcjDRgdJYsR4CB761yUZK84DQOQ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:287584'),
  ('27328248935502352', 'Four Mothers', 2025, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Darren Thornton, Louise Kiely, Tom Comerford', 'Colin Thornton, Darren Thornton', 'James McArdle, Fionnula Flanagan, Dearbhla Molloy, Paddy Glynn, Stella McCusker, Niamh Cusack, Gaëtan Garcia, Rory O''Neill', null, 'Edward, a gay novelist saddled with caring for his elderly mother, finally finds himself on the brink of literary success. With pressure to go on a US book tour mounting, the last thing Edward needs is his friends jetting off to Spain for an impromptu Pride holiday, leaving their mothers on his doorstep! Over a chaotic weekend, he has to juggle his burgeoning career with the care of four eccentric, combative, and wildly different ladies.', 'Edward, a gay novelist saddled with caring for his elderly mother, finally finds himself on the brink of literary success. With pressure to go on a US book tour mounting, the last thing Edward needs is his friends jetting off to Spain for an impromptu Pride holiday, leaving their mothers on his doorstep! Over a chaotic weekend, he has to juggle his burgeoning career with the care of four eccentric, combative, and wildly different ladies.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bvpXFlOuSYN0AOo9KAd0XOEs8mX.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1081196'),
  ('406006847960653358', 'Four Murders Are Enough, Darling', 1971, 'Crime, Comedy', 'Oldřich Lipský, Ivana Tokošová, Jiří Tarantík', 'Miloš Macourek, Oldřich Lipský', 'Lubomír Lipský, Jiřina Bohdalová, Iva Janžurová, Marie Rosůlková, František Filipovský, Jan Libíček, Josef Hlinomaz, Karel Effa', null, 'Two criminal gangs are ruthlessly fighting for a 1-million dollar check that, purely by chance, got into the flat of shy high school teacher George Camel. As the number of victims sharply increases, Camel is mistakenly regarded as a mass murderer and cunningly uses his horrifying reputation to get the respect and heart of his beloved Sabrina, a journalist from a local newspaper. But this game turns out to be risky and in the end, both gangs don''t hesitate to seize the check at all costs, including an improvised operation', 'Two criminal gangs are ruthlessly fighting for a 1-million dollar check that, purely by chance, got into the flat of shy high school teacher George Camel. As the number of victims sharply increases, Camel is mistakenly regarded as a mass murderer and cunningly uses his horrifying reputation to get the respect and heart of his beloved Sabrina, a journalist from a local newspaper. But this game turns out to be risky and in the end, both gangs don''t hesitate to seize the check at all costs, including an improvised operation', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ssMMH8sqRmp2Bjj6uBTgmE7Szkc.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:51545'),
  ('201557527032653446', 'Four Nights of a Dreamer', 1972, 'Drama, Romance', 'Robert Bresson, Pierre Lhomme, Nasreen Munni Kabir', 'Robert Bresson', 'Isabelle Weingarten, Guillaume des Forêts, Jean-Maurice Monnoyer, Lidia Biondi, Giorgio Maulini, Patrick Jouané, Jacques Renard, Marku Ribas', 'NR', 'Jacques, a young man with artistic aspirations, spends four nights wandering Paris with a young woman, whom he rescued from suicide.', 'Jacques, a young man with artistic aspirations, spends four nights wandering Paris with a young woman, whom he rescued from suicide.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cVzvJsn2TUEXxRszs2IVFF36hSA.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:55847'),
  ('183092668858373254', 'Four Nights with Anna', 2008, 'Crime, Drama, Thriller', 'Jerzy Skolimowski, Adam Sikora', 'Ewa Piaskowska, Jerzy Skolimowski', 'Artur Steranko, Kinga Preis, Jerzy Fedorowicz, Jakub Snochowski, Barbara Kolodziejska, Małgorzata Buczkowska, Anna Lenartowicz, Urszula Bartos-Gesikowska', null, 'Leon falls in love with a nurse and obsessively tries to get close to her.', 'Leon falls in love with a nurse and obsessively tries to get close to her.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/l7GeLmLIeAL9R2L6jfMqhSu8zov.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:44442'),
  ('568266647119679513', 'Four of the Apocalypse', 1975, 'Western', 'Lucio Fulci', 'Ennio De Concini', 'Fabio Testi, Lynne Frederick, Michael J. Pollard, Harry Baird, Tomas Milian, Adolfo Lastretti, Bruno Corazzari, Giorgio Trestini', null, 'Four petty criminals, three men and a woman, wander through the trackless terrain of the Wild West Utah and are hounded by a sadistic bandit.', 'Four petty criminals, three men and a woman, wander through the trackless terrain of the Wild West Utah and are hounded by a sadistic bandit.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fXuIo8Qn3he4QRDQPWI3HDxx6Sf.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:48855'),
