  ('557703730178009638', 'Four Riders', 1972, 'Action, Drama, Crime', 'Chang Cheh, Kung Mu-To, John Woo', 'Chang Cheh, Ni Kuang', 'David Chiang Da-Wei, Ti Lung, Chen Kuan-Tai, Wong Chung, Lily Li, Yasuaki Kurata, Ching Li, Andre Marquis', null, 'Four highly skilled fighters unite to take on a ruthless criminal gang, battling corruption, murder, and injustice in the wake of the Korean War.', 'Four highly skilled fighters unite to take on a ruthless criminal gang, battling corruption, murder, and injustice in the wake of the Korean War.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vLayeFVsZzjcvsXB5btqMlQUysy.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:75701'),
  ('35501066370034801', 'Four Roads', 2021, 'Documentary', 'Alice Rohrwacher, Alice Rohrwacher', 'Alice Rohrwacher', 'Alice Rohrwacher, Anita Crucitti', null, 'In the absence of any physical connection, this short explores alternative forms of contact among neighbors by making use of an old 16mm camera, a zoom lens, and a few meters of expired film.', 'In the absence of any physical connection, this short explores alternative forms of contact among neighbors by making use of an old 16mm camera, a zoom lens, and a few meters of expired film.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/16osXhJnaYxdcozRWCDW926YPWC.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:767452'),
  ('423657935972347467', 'Four Rooms', 1995, 'Comedy', 'Allison Anders, Alexandre Rockwell, Robert Rodriguez', 'Allison Anders, Alexandre Rockwell, Robert Rodriguez', 'Tim Roth, Jennifer Beals, David Proval, Ione Skye, Madonna, Antonio Banderas, Quentin Tarantino, Paul Calderon', 'R', 'It''s Ted the Bellhop''s first night on the job...and the hotel''s very unusual guests are about to place him in some outrageous predicaments. It seems that this evening''s room service is serving up one unbelievable happening after another.', 'It''s Ted the Bellhop''s first night on the job...and the hotel''s very unusual guests are about to place him in some outrageous predicaments. It seems that this evening''s room service is serving up one unbelievable happening after another.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/75aHn1NOYXh4M7L5shoeQ6NGykP.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:5'),
  ('210793845349786612', 'Four Shades of Brown', 2004, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Tomas Alfredson', 'Tomas Alfredson, Robert Gustafsson, Jonas Inde', 'Robert Gustafsson, Maria Kulle, Johan Rheborg, Henrik Schyffert, Jonas Inde, Ulf Brunnberg, Anna Björk, Sofia Helin', null, 'An eccentric millionaire dies at a manor in Dalarna in Sweden, leaving behind three sons and a mistress. One of four parallel stories about parents and children. Four sides of Sweden. Four shades of brown.', 'An eccentric millionaire dies at a manor in Dalarna in Sweden, leaving behind three sons and a mistress. One of four parallel stories about parents and children. Four sides of Sweden. Four shades of brown.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7J7MM2AtEaZkuxdl1Jehdy2GyR2.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:25283'),
  ('1141192553823452843', 'Four Sided Triangle', 1953, 'Science Fiction, Romance', 'Terence Fisher, Reginald H. Wyer', 'Terence Fisher', 'Barbara Payton, James Hayter, Stephen Murray, John Van Eyssen, Percy Marmont, Kynaston Reeves, Edith Saville, John Stuart', null, 'A young man, in love with a woman who can never be his, discovers a way to fulfil his dreams. In their childhood the three were the best of friends, the perfect triangle. But years later when Lena returns to her sleepy home the tone of the relationship changes and it is Robin she loves. Bill has discovered a method of duplication and decides to make an exact replica of the woman he cannot have... .with disastrous consequences for them all.', 'A young man, in love with a woman who can never be his, discovers a way to fulfil his dreams. In their childhood the three were the best of friends, the perfect triangle. But years later when Lena returns to her sleepy home the tone of the relationship changes and it is Robin she loves. Bill has discovered a method of duplication and decides to make an exact replica of the woman he cannot have... .with disastrous consequences for them all.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4u0xp0rekIy0Fcd0alGnJ3KCJvB.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:100656'),
  ('1055600128381786949', 'Four Sons', 1928, 'War, Drama', 'John Ford, R.L. Hough, Edward O''Fearna', 'Herman Bing', 'Margaret Mann, James Hall, Charles Morton, Francis X. Bushman Jr., George Meeker, June Collyer, Earle Foxe, Albert Gran', 'NR', 'A family saga in which three of a Bavarian widow''s sons go to war for Germany and the fourth goes to America, Germany''s eventual opponent. Preserved by the Academy Film Archive in partnership with L''Imaginne Ritrovato and Twentieth Century Fox Film Corporation in 1999.', 'A family saga in which three of a Bavarian widow''s sons go to war for Germany and the fourth goes to America, Germany''s eventual opponent. Preserved by the Academy Film Archive in partnership with L''Imaginne Ritrovato and Twentieth Century Fox Film Corporation in 1999.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vNhHMc7xa2X96fX4akmxo6LmYHt.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:95169'),
  ('728786573183191523', 'Four Springs', 2019, 'Documentary, TV Movie', 'Lu Qingyi', null, null, 'NR', 'Four Springs is a documentary film that presented a family''s daily life in the remote town of Dushan in the Guizhou province in southwest China. From a subjective angle, the camera induced the flow of life out of the screen: the quotidian toils, singing, excursions in nature, visits among friends and extended families, funerals, reunions and departures. It presented the state of being of the two main characters, the director''s own parents, and their attitude when facing irretrievable loss in life.', 'Four Springs is a documentary film that presented a family''s daily life in the remote town of Dushan in the Guizhou province in southwest China. From a subjective angle, the camera induced the flow of life out of the screen: the quotidian toils, singing, excursions in nature, visits among friends and extended families, funerals, reunions and departures. It presented the state of being of the two main characters, the director''s own parents, and their attitude when facing irretrievable loss in life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/smBbon8zwp6p9NqWDYDvM4rQ8gN.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:537223'),
  ('405426468826594383', 'Four Steps in the Clouds', 1942, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Alessandro Blasetti, Václav Vích, Lionello De Felice', 'Aldo De Benedetti, Alessandro Blasetti, Cesare Zavattini', 'Gino Cervi, Adriana Benetti, Carlo Romano, Guido Celano, Aldo Silvani, Arturo Bragaglia, Mario Siletti, Margherita Seglin', null, 'Travelling family man Paolo agrees to pose as husband to an unwed pregnant girl he meets on a train. However, once faced with her father, things do not go as planned.', 'Travelling family man Paolo agrees to pose as husband to an unwed pregnant girl he meets on a train. However, once faced with her father, things do not go as planned.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/v3Lzmyf2buhvzPM0hs4sidRWn2Q.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:65477'),
  ('397769655643069940', 'Four Times That Night', 1971, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Mario Bava, Antonio Rinaldi, Mario Bava', 'Mario Moroni, Carl Ross', 'Daniela Giordano, Brett Halsey, Dick Randall, Valeria Sabel, Michael Hinz, Rainer Basedow, Brigitte Skay, Calisto Calisti', 'R', 'A night of attempted seduction is recalled from the perspectives of the woman, the man, a lecherous doorman and a psychoanalyst.', 'A night of attempted seduction is recalled from the perspectives of the woman, the man, a lecherous doorman and a psychoanalyst.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pBqPlJe0AqYiPF9bx6Zy1hplwNg.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:5484'),
