  ('347529532908603953', 'Four Unloved Women, Adrift on a Purposeless Sea, Experience the Ecstasy of Dissection', 2023, 'Horror', 'David Cronenberg', 'David Cronenberg', null, null, 'Long live the new flesh. Surgery is the new sex. These Cronenbergian epigrams come together in a tableau that reimagines the ecstasy and eroticism of Renaissance sculpture for the future. Or is it already the present?', 'Long live the new flesh. Surgery is the new sex. These Cronenbergian epigrams come together in a tableau that reimagines the ecstasy and eroticism of Renaissance sculpture for the future. Or is it already the present?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aeVYh2YPjNSKcGT67JdP8Cd4NGS.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1094746'),
  ('844034783976229192', 'Four Weddings and a Funeral', 1994, 'Comedy, Drama, Romance', 'Michael Coulter, Mike Newell, Kieron Phipps', 'Richard Curtis', 'Hugh Grant, Andie MacDowell, Kristin Scott Thomas, Simon Callow, James Fleet, John Hannah, Charlotte Coleman, David Bower', 'R', 'Over the course of five social occasions, a committed bachelor must consider the notion that he may have discovered love.', 'Over the course of five social occasions, a committed bachelor must consider the notion that he may have discovered love.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qa72G2VS0bpxms6yo0tI9vsHm2e.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:712'),
  ('403324689122684012', 'Four Winds of Heaven', 1962, 'Drama, War, Romance', 'Stanislav Rostotsky, Vyacheslav Shumskiy, Nikolai Ozornov', 'Aleksandr Galich, Stanislav Rostotsky', 'Larisa Luzhina, Vyacheslav Tikhonov, Klara Luchko, Svetlana Druzhinina, Sofiya Pilyavskaya, Leonid Bykov, Vladimir Zamanskiy, Vyacheslav Nevinnyy', null, 'A young girl Svetlana just arrived to the small town when a war begun. Her fiancé Igor did not meet Svetlana so she stayed alone to wait for him.', 'A young girl Svetlana just arrived to the small town when a war begun. Her fiancé Igor did not meet Svetlana so she stayed alone to wait for him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6s7vQzrhYDI4kuWeoWZklNL1G4B.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:94696'),
  ('987197722574577985', 'Four Wives', 1939, 'Drama, Romance', 'Michael Curtiz, Sol Polito, Leo F. Forbstein', 'Julius J. Epstein, Philip G. Epstein, Maurice Hanline', 'Priscilla Lane, Rosemary Lane, Lola Lane, Gale Page, Claude Rains, Jeffrey Lynn, Eddie Albert, May Robson', 'NR', 'In this sequel to Four Daughters, Ann struggles to move on after the death of her husband as she falls in love with Felix, but on the day of her engagement discovers that she carries Mickey''s child.', 'In this sequel to Four Daughters, Ann struggles to move on after the death of her husband as she falls in love with Felix, but on the day of her engagement discovers that she carries Mickey''s child.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kJLEfC9VWCe24jjGQiMG0Kl7ZkZ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:124115'),
  ('255030915024879711', 'Four Women and a Mess', 1985, 'Comedy', 'Mariano Ozores Puchol', 'Mariano Ozores Puchol', 'Fernando Esteso, Antonio Ozores, Arévalo, Adriana Vega, Loreta Tovar, Marta Valverde, Juanito Navarro, Fedra Lorente', null, 'Federico received a letter containing a few photos very involved with a girl. The problem is that his wife Alicia have seen those pictures, and decides to leave. To make matters worse, the next day comes to visit his uncle Federico millionaire and asks her maid to pose as his wife Alice for 24 hours so that it does not find out, but this will only the beginning of a big mess ...', 'Federico received a letter containing a few photos very involved with a girl. The problem is that his wife Alicia have seen those pictures, and decides to leave. To make matters worse, the next day comes to visit his uncle Federico millionaire and asks her maid to pose as his wife Alice for 24 hours so that it does not find out, but this will only the beginning of a big mess ...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7IGEti9GnwECjcnRIhXwZtSwPAi.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:198249'),
  ('878115173148719546', 'Four Women in the Harem', 1965, 'Drama, History', 'Halit Refiğ, Mike Rafaelyan, Memduh Yükman', 'Halit Refiğ, Kemal Tahir', 'Tanju Gürsu, Nilüfer Aydan, Pervin Par, Cüneyt Arkın, Sami Ayanoğlu, Ayfer Feray, Birsen Menekşeli, Gülbin Eray', null, 'Sadık Pasha is a pleasure-loving and pious pasha who lives in a luxurious Ottoman mansion with his three wives. The balance of the mansion, already full of intrigue with three women, is completely disrupted when he wants to take a fourth wife, thinking that he needs to continue his lineage because he has no children.', 'Sadık Pasha is a pleasure-loving and pious pasha who lives in a luxurious Ottoman mansion with his three wives. The balance of the mansion, already full of intrigue with three women, is completely disrupted when he wants to take a fourth wife, thinking that he needs to continue his lineage because he has no children.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ediiT6oWow9nZlZNgWMjDGciqu7.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:271896'),
  ('1016494435775249479', 'Four-Year-Old Heroine', 1907, 'Comedy', 'Étienne Arnaud', null, null, null, 'A little girl runs away from the maid in charge of her care and, during her escapade, she will arrest two thugs, prevent a blind man from drowning, and save some drunks from being run over by a train. According to Etienne Arnaud''s own notes, he filmed this short on the 18th and 19th of July, 1907. Alice Guy, who is mistakenly attributed to have directed it, had been living in the United States long before those dates.', 'A little girl runs away from the maid in charge of her care and, during her escapade, she will arrest two thugs, prevent a blind man from drowning, and save some drunks from being run over by a train. According to Etienne Arnaud''s own notes, he filmed this short on the 18th and 19th of July, 1907. Alice Guy, who is mistakenly attributed to have directed it, had been living in the United States long before those dates.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/w6CvLSbu9ONxkyq7y572cYFyIiC.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:120037'),
  ('18259978550471479', 'Four''s a Crowd', 1938, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Michael Curtiz, Ernest Haller, Sherry Shourds', 'Casey Robinson, Sig Herzig', 'Errol Flynn, Olivia de Havilland, Rosalind Russell, Patric Knowles, Walter Connolly, Hugh Herbert, Melville Cooper, Franklin Pangborn', 'NR', 'A public relations man falls for his most difficult client''s granddaughter.', 'A public relations man falls for his most difficult client''s granddaughter.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5MXJZSYv2qowp2YUByNeXXHrHb6.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:65580'),
