  ('967579966260624464', 'Fourbi', 1996, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Alain Tanner, Denis Jutzeler', 'Alain Tanner, Bernard Comment', 'Karin Viard, Jean-Quentin Châtelain, Cécile Tanner, Antoine Basler, Robert Bouvier, Nathalie Jeannet, Jean-Luc Bideau, Jacques Denis', null, 'Writer Paul attempts to interview Rosemonde, a young woman who killed an alleged rapist in self-defense six years prior, for a true crime television program. When Rosemonde refuses to divulge details of the events, Paul encourages his actress girlfriend to befriend her, but the three are repeatedly sidetracked from their initial commission.', 'Writer Paul attempts to interview Rosemonde, a young woman who killed an alleged rapist in self-defense six years prior, for a true crime television program. When Rosemonde refuses to divulge details of the events, Paul encourages his actress girlfriend to befriend her, but the three are repeatedly sidetracked from their initial commission.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kcSUli5cj5WFRIphJVf0f4Qopiu.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:172948'),
  ('816232732349571450', 'Fourteen Days in May', 1987, 'Documentary', 'Paul Hamann', 'Paul Hamann', 'Clive Stafford Smith', null, 'A camera crew follows Edward Earl Johnson, a man falsely convicted of rape and murder, during his last 14 days on death row. Everyone involved is interviewed, Johnson himself, his family, the warden, prison guards and other inmates. We also witness the futile attempts by his attorney to save his life.', 'A camera crew follows Edward Earl Johnson, a man falsely convicted of rape and murder, during his last 14 days on death row. Everyone involved is interviewed, Johnson himself, his family, the warden, prison guards and other inmates. We also witness the futile attempts by his attorney to save his life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5uHJk7ltHxQ07pVS9r5VEjx37Q2.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:97954'),
  ('561431245241137661', 'Fourteen Hours', 1951, 'Drama, Thriller', 'Henry Hathaway, Joseph MacDonald', 'John Paxton', 'Paul Douglas, Richard Basehart, Barbara Bel Geddes, Debra Paget, Agnes Moorehead, Robert Keith, Howard Da Silva, Jeffrey Hunter', 'NR', 'A young man, morally destroyed by his parents not loving him and by the fear of being not capable to make his girlfriend happy, rises on the ledge of a building with the intention of committing suicide. A policeman makes every effort to argue him out of it.', 'A young man, morally destroyed by his parents not loving him and by the fear of being not capable to make his girlfriend happy, rises on the ledge of a building with the intention of committing suicide. A policeman makes every effort to argue him out of it.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kS1Rhn5YfNDS2gT0UNRCPPYVV8J.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:54139'),
  ('550689285824860523', 'Fourth Floor', 2026, 'Horror, Mystery, Thriller', 'L.R. Sundarapandi, J.laxman MFI, L R Sundarapandi', 'L.R. Sundarapandi, L R Sundarapandi', 'Aari Arjuna, Deepshikha Chandran, Subramaniam Siva, Pavithra Aravind', null, 'Summoned to Chennai by his ex-lover, Dheeren stays at an isolated guest house where disturbing events and vivid dreams plague him. As reality blurs, he discovers the visions reveal secrets about his past and her fate.', 'Summoned to Chennai by his ex-lover, Dheeren stays at an isolated guest house where disturbing events and vivid dreams plague him. As reality blurs, he discovers the visions reveal secrets about his past and her fate.', 'https://images.plex.tv/photo?size=large-1280&url=https%3A%2F%2Fimage.tmdb.org%2Ft%2Fp%2Foriginal%2FzWvALKGFD4X8LXVvLIvwIeUfXvC.jpg', 'plex:movie:fourth-floor-2026'),
  ('944850318607780924', 'Fourth of July', 2022, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Louis C.K., Christopher Raymond', 'Joe List, Louis C.K.', 'Joe List, Sarah Tollemache, Paula Plum, Robert E. Walsh, Tara Pacheco, Robert Kelly, Richard O''Rourke, Dorothy Dwyer', null, 'A recovering alcoholic and jazz pianist in NYC confronts his acerbic family during their annual Fourth of July vacation.', 'A recovering alcoholic and jazz pianist in NYC confronts his acerbic family during their annual Fourth of July vacation.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2taYmICrAP9YJTo6VmGtZCpQQXM.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:983406'),
  ('840718939678385434', 'Fourth of July Parade', 1929, 'Documentary', 'Antonio Rodríguez Fuentes, Josefina Barrera Fuentes', null, null, null, 'This home movie, shot by longtime Corpus Christi resident Antonio Rodríguez Fuentes, captures the Fourth of July parade through downtown Corpus Christi in 1929. The footage provides insight into the early construction of parade floats, with many adopting a boxy appearance and featuring limited decoration. Fuentes and his wife Josefina were active members of the city''s Mexican-American society, participating in several community organizations.', 'This home movie, shot by longtime Corpus Christi resident Antonio Rodríguez Fuentes, captures the Fourth of July parade through downtown Corpus Christi in 1929. The footage provides insight into the early construction of parade floats, with many adopting a boxy appearance and featuring limited decoration. Fuentes and his wife Josefina were active members of the city''s Mexican-American society, participating in several community organizations.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mMPA7DAQd8EHJ1JF8H6dEEPGhVp.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:496539'),
  ('474892353517645078', 'Fourth Place', 2016, 'Drama', 'Jung Ji-woo, Cho Hyoung-rae', 'Kim Min-ah, Jung Ji-woo', 'Yoo Jae-sang, Park Hae-joon, Lee Hang-na, Choi Moo-seong, Jung Ga-ram, You Chea-myung, Kwak Min-seok, Kim Do-young', null, 'A former Asian Games record breaker and Olympic tryout, Kim Gwang-su, endures beatings, abuse, and constant ridicule from his swimming coach. To justify this abusive behavior, his coach constantly reminded Gwang-su - this is for your own good.', 'A former Asian Games record breaker and Olympic tryout, Kim Gwang-su, endures beatings, abuse, and constant ridicule from his swimming coach. To justify this abusive behavior, his coach constantly reminded Gwang-su - this is for your own good.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9IlF0C0RQauDHthLwUXlxFH5Qzd.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:378537'),
  ('546480567731451780', 'Fox and His Friends', 1975, 'Drama', 'Rainer Werner Fassbinder, Michael Ballhaus, Irm Hermann', 'Rainer Werner Fassbinder, Christian Hohoff', 'Rainer Werner Fassbinder, Peter Chatel, Karlheinz Böhm, Adrian Hoven, Christiane Maybach, Harry Baer, Hans Zander, Kurt Raab', 'NR', 'Fox, a former circus performer, wins the lottery of DM 500,000 and can now have the life and things that he has always wanted. He enters an abusive relationship with wealthy industrialist Eugen in an attempt to climb the social ladder. His desperation for love and affection soon spirals into tragedy.', 'Fox, a former circus performer, wins the lottery of DM 500,000 and can now have the life and things that he has always wanted. He enters an abusive relationship with wealthy industrialist Eugen in an attempt to climb the social ladder. His desperation for love and affection soon spirals into tragedy.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uYHNK7VycMOcD9Jv5qgjIdvDwgG.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:42254'),
