  ('567501160108267263', 'Fox Pop', 1942, 'Animation', 'Chuck Jones', null, 'Mel Blanc, Frank Graham, Robert C. Bruce, Tedd Pierce', null, 'Hearing that silver foxes are all the rage in high society, a fox paints himself silver and gets himself trapped, finding out too late that it''s only his fur anyone is interested in.', 'Hearing that silver foxes are all the rage in high society, a fox paints himself silver and gets himself trapped, finding out too late that it''s only his fur anyone is interested in.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fgH3WDZo8S4YgzuFz9LMBR9DzAL.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:236648'),
  ('1083001960850061477', 'Fox-Terror', 1957, 'Animation', 'Robert McKimson', 'Michael Maltese', 'Mel Blanc', null, 'Foghorn''s going fishing, but a fox has other plans for him. Posing as a racetrack tout, he suggests Foggy get a hunting dog and go hunting. Once the dog is gone, the fox comes after the chickens. One of them pulls the fox alarm, and the dog comes running back (too late). The fox next poses as a quiz show host, tricking Foghorn and the dog into blowing each other up. They go through another cycle or two of abuse before identifying their common enemy. They team up and go after him.', 'Foghorn''s going fishing, but a fox has other plans for him. Posing as a racetrack tout, he suggests Foggy get a hunting dog and go hunting. Once the dog is gone, the fox comes after the chickens. One of them pulls the fox alarm, and the dog comes running back (too late). The fox next poses as a quiz show host, tricking Foghorn and the dog into blowing each other up. They go through another cycle or two of abuse before identifying their common enemy. They team up and go after him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/77rWlJrVKaOgEV9p3nVQJSPEG6x.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:235011'),
  ('1129728649650251627', 'Foxcatcher', 2014, 'Drama, Thriller', 'Greig Fraser, Bennett Miller, Scott Robertson', 'E. Max Frye, Dan Futterman', 'Steve Carell, Channing Tatum, Mark Ruffalo, Sienna Miller, Vanessa Redgrave, Anthony Michael Hall, Guy Boyd, Brett Rice', 'R', 'The greatest Olympic Wrestling Champion brother team joins Team Foxcatcher led by multimillionaire sponsor John E. du Pont as they train for the 1988 games in Seoul - a union that leads to unlikely circumstances.', 'The greatest Olympic Wrestling Champion brother team joins Team Foxcatcher led by multimillionaire sponsor John E. du Pont as they train for the 1988 games in Seoul - a union that leads to unlikely circumstances.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/w6Sl079QtUcQ9dVQ2RP6aN9NBXx.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:87492'),
