  ('544982562322419308', 'Foxy Brown', 1974, 'Action, Crime, Thriller', 'Jack Hill, Brick Marquard, Frank Beetson', 'Jack Hill', 'Pam Grier, Antonio Fargas, Peter Brown, Terry Carter, Kathryn Loder, Harry Holcombe, Conrad Bachmann, Jack Bernardi', 'R', 'A voluptuous black woman takes a job as a high-class prostitute in order to get revenge on the mobsters who murdered her boyfriend.', 'A voluptuous black woman takes a job as a high-class prostitute in order to get revenge on the mobsters who murdered her boyfriend.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lAeEDcBgEqnxl9l7n7i4936ERi8.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:22048'),
  ('685763969735368824', 'Foxy by Proxy', 1952, 'Comedy, Animation', 'Friz Freleng', 'Warren Foster', 'Mel Blanc, Stan Freberg', null, 'Bugs is provoked by a pack of foxhounds and their hunters stampeding over his hole, so he gets out his Halloween costume from last year (a fox suit) and sets out to lead the dogs on a merry chase. The stupidest of the dogs, whose objective is to cut a fox''s tail off, becomes his main victim; Bugs tricks him into chasing a train instead. He eventually tricks the dog pack into running off a cliff, but the stupid dog ends up with Bugs'' tail.', 'Bugs is provoked by a pack of foxhounds and their hunters stampeding over his hole, so he gets out his Halloween costume from last year (a fox suit) and sets out to lead the dogs on a merry chase. The stupidest of the dogs, whose objective is to cut a fox''s tail off, becomes his main victim; Bugs tricks him into chasing a train instead. He eventually tricks the dog pack into running off a cliff, but the stupid dog ends up with Bugs'' tail.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2wzTfTdJy5G8Ef0OOXSyfmNtlqW.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:235946'),
  ('273858038647937487', 'Fracchia The Human Beast', 1981, 'Comedy', 'Neri Parenti, Marina Mattoli, Alberto Spagnoli', 'Piero De Bernardi, Giovanni Manganelli, Paolo Villaggio', 'Paolo Villaggio, Lino Banfi, Anna Mazzamauro, Gigi Reder, Massimo Boldi, Francesco Salvi, Sandro Ghiani, Antonio Allocca', null, 'The world''s greatest criminal and the world greatest loser share the same face... now they''ll share the same life!', 'The world''s greatest criminal and the world greatest loser share the same face... now they''ll share the same life!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rLFWMIvydFQsxShVWQeTxyp0Coq.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:41610'),
  ('855581871941260064', 'Fractals: The Colors of Infinity', 1995, 'Documentary', 'Nigel Lesmoir-Gordon', null, 'Arthur C. Clarke, Stephen Hawking, Benoît B. Mandelbrot', null, 'Explores the revolutionary world of Fractal Geometry - its far-reaching and often unexpected implications - its powerful and revolutionary applications.', 'Explores the revolutionary world of Fractal Geometry - its far-reaching and often unexpected implications - its powerful and revolutionary applications.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gJW3Teih3HQaN2Le9xMEHuC8OxR.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:44200'),
  ('1050074866646297574', 'Fracture', 2007, 'Thriller', 'Gregory Hoblit, Kramer Morgenthau', 'Glenn Gers, Daniel Pyne', 'Anthony Hopkins, Ryan Gosling, David Strathairn, Rosamund Pike, Embeth Davidtz, Billy Burke, Cliff Curtis, Fiona Shaw', 'R', 'A husband is on trial for the attempted murder of his wife, in what is seemingly an open/shut case for the ambitious district attorney trying to put him away. However, there are surprises for both around every corner, and, as a suspenseful game of cat-and-mouse is played out, each must manipulate and outwit the other.', 'A husband is on trial for the attempted murder of his wife, in what is seemingly an open/shut case for the ambitious district attorney trying to put him away. However, there are surprises for both around every corner, and, as a suspenseful game of cat-and-mouse is played out, each must manipulate and outwit the other.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qNen8x5gaikjIg9CFihgxYcJwQe.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:6145'),
  ('133191272934557828', 'Fracture', 2010, 'Drama, TV Movie', 'Alain Tasma, Pierre Milon', 'Emmanuel Carrère', 'Anaïs Demoustier, Samy Seghir, Paul Bartel, Leïla Bekhti, Laurent Stocker, Ariane Ascaride, Robin Renucci, Patrick Catalifo', null, 'Anna is a young teacher assigned as a substitute at a challenging middle school in the suburbs of Paris. In her class, Lakhdar, a well-behaved and promising student, has suffered a medical mishap and lost the use of his right hand.', 'Anna is a young teacher assigned as a substitute at a challenging middle school in the suburbs of Paris. In her class, Lakhdar, a well-behaved and promising student, has suffered a medical mishap and lost the use of his right hand.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1IIUnQvrWvpAshmUkpAYdk66d1F.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:246422'),
  ('849023981535082446', 'Fractured', 2019, 'Thriller, Drama', 'Adam Druxman, Björn Charpentier, Brad Anderson', 'Alan B. McElroy', 'Sam Worthington, Lily Rabe, Lucy Capri, Stephen Tobolowsky, Lauren Cochrane, Shane Dean, Adjoa Andoh, Stephanie Sy', 'R', 'Driving cross-country, Ray and his wife and daughter stop at a highway rest area where his daughter falls and breaks her arm. After a frantic rush to the hospital and a clash with the check-in nurse, Ray is finally able to get her to a doctor. While the wife and daughter go downstairs for an MRI, Ray, exhausted, passes out in a chair in the lobby. Upon waking up, they have no record or knowledge of Ray''s family ever being checked in.', 'Driving cross-country, Ray and his wife and daughter stop at a highway rest area where his daughter falls and breaks her arm. After a frantic rush to the hospital and a clash with the check-in nurse, Ray is finally able to get her to a doctor. While the wife and daughter go downstairs for an MRI, Ray, exhausted, passes out in a chair in the lobby. Upon waking up, they have no record or knowledge of Ray''s family ever being checked in.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/paZNRffT3kUckuRFKbeDBuX1YcZ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:568091'),
  ('585262639637099166', 'Fractured', 2020, 'Drama', 'Fikret Reyhan', 'Fikret Reyhan', 'Hakan Salınmış, Süreyya Kilimci, Hakan Emre Ünal, Tuğçe Yolcu, Elif Ürse, Giray Altınok, Mehmet Bilge Aslan, Gülçin Kültür Şahin', null, 'Migrant workers working in the UK as Fatih Ayhan still running mate in the UK, has received large amounts of debt to send to his family in Turkey. The payment of this debt even after the Conqueror''s return to Turkey will be requested during a visit to the family by Ayhan from Turkey. Claiming this debt ignites a wick within the family that lives in the same building and with intertwined economic interests. All clashes between family members come to the fore.', 'Migrant workers working in the UK as Fatih Ayhan still running mate in the UK, has received large amounts of debt to send to his family in Turkey. The payment of this debt even after the Conqueror''s return to Turkey will be requested during a visit to the family by Ayhan from Turkey. Claiming this debt ignites a wick within the family that lives in the same building and with intertwined economic interests. All clashes between family members come to the fore.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jQjkRO7iy4AAUXrDiCZfYNamkyF.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:745518'),
  ('923205428431982419', 'Fractured Follies', 1988, 'Drama, Comedy, Romance', 'James Chan Hau-Ming, Wong Chung', 'Wong Chung, Rico Chung Kai-Cheong, Lung Tin-Sang', 'Chow Yun-Fat, Nina Li Chi, Joey Wong, James Wong Jim, Wong Ching, Bonnie Law Ming-Chu, Cheng Mang-Ha, Wong Yat-Fei', null, 'Joe, a reckless cab driver, accidentally hits someone with his taxi. The person he hit is May, a sweet girl who walks with a limp due to one of her legs being longer than the other. Joe mistakenly thinks that he''s paralyzed May for life; so in order to make it up to her, he works for her family, helping them run their grocery store. Soon, Joe falls in love with May, but she''s slow to return his affection.', 'Joe, a reckless cab driver, accidentally hits someone with his taxi. The person he hit is May, a sweet girl who walks with a limp due to one of her legs being longer than the other. Joe mistakenly thinks that he''s paralyzed May for life; so in order to make it up to her, he works for her family, helping them run their grocery store. Soon, Joe falls in love with May, but she''s slow to return his affection.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lC6oCmcvtaIRtrTe89fNVGk06Mv.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:69957'),
  ('167026921932194183', 'Fragile', 2005, 'Horror, Thriller, Mystery', 'Xavi Giménez, Jaume Balagueró, Anna Rua', 'Jaume Balagueró, Jordi Galcerán', 'Calista Flockhart, Richard Roxburgh, Elena Anaya, Gemma Jones, Yasmin Murphy, Colin McFarlane, Michael Pennington, Daniel Ortiz', null, 'Haunted by memories of a patient''s death, a nurse takes a job at an antiquated hospital for children. Soon she learns that the kids fear a ghost that prowls the floors and will not allow anyone to leave. Amy tries to protect them and convince the other staffers of the evil that lurks there.', 'Haunted by memories of a patient''s death, a nurse takes a job at an antiquated hospital for children. Soon she learns that the kids fear a ghost that prowls the floors and will not allow anyone to leave. Amy tries to protect them and convince the other staffers of the evil that lurks there.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/s7gCOegufXiQR48IhuTsPNy0Fav.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:11348'),
  ('10499547766921197', 'Fragile as the World', 2001, 'Drama, Romance', 'Rita Azevedo Gomes, Acácio de Almeida, Cesário Monteiro', 'Rita Azevedo Gomes', 'Maria Gonçalves, Bruno Terra, Sophie Balabanian, Manuela de Freitas, João Bénard da Costa, Carolina Villaverde, Carlos Ferreira, Mário Barroso', null, 'An impossible love. Two young people who love each other. Vera and João can’t find in this life the space, time, or identity to resolve their love story.', 'An impossible love. Two young people who love each other. Vera and João can’t find in this life the space, time, or identity to resolve their love story.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ljuUGPHfOpyS2P3YENnbXwk0XLp.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:382594'),
  ('75744547394487199', 'Fragment of an Empire', 1929, 'Drama', 'Fridrikh Ermler, Yevgeni Shneider', 'Fridrikh Ermler, Ekaterina Vinogradskaya', 'Fyodor Nikitin, Lyudmila Semyonova, Valeri Solovtsov, Emil Gal, Yakov Gudkin, Sergei Gerasimov, Vyacheslav Viskovsky, Ursula Krug', null, 'Director Frederick Ermler’s last silent feature and the last of four collaborations with actor Fiodor Nikitin. Nikitin plays an officer who spends a decade after the Great War as a shell-shocked amnesiac, until a glimpse of a woman through a train window sparks the return of his memory. He makes his way back to St. Petersburg, now Leningrad, a man out of time who struggles to make sense of the new society brought about by the revolution.', 'Director Frederick Ermler’s last silent feature and the last of four collaborations with actor Fiodor Nikitin. Nikitin plays an officer who spends a decade after the Great War as a shell-shocked amnesiac, until a glimpse of a woman through a train window sparks the return of his memory. He makes his way back to St. Petersburg, now Leningrad, a man out of time who struggles to make sense of the new society brought about by the revolution.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/h5lnD1zd0Cy4CtQ7EW8oQq52x2E.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:167354'),
  ('742176421158158790', 'Fragment of Fear', 1970, 'Thriller, Crime, Mystery', 'Richard C. Sarafian, Robert Cartwright, Oswald Morris', 'Paul Dehn', 'David Hemmings, Gayle Hunnicutt, Wilfrid Hyde-White, Flora Robson, Adolfo Celi, Roland Culver, Daniel Massey, Mona Washbourne', 'PG', 'Reformed drug addict Tim Brett (David Hemmings) is vacationing in Italy with his aunt. When she is murdered, he tries to investigate. Soon his whole life spins out of control.', 'Reformed drug addict Tim Brett (David Hemmings) is vacationing in Italy with his aunt. When she is murdered, he tries to investigate. Soon his whole life spins out of control.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/g0FVuvvekTgfJzgVEoObJ6v2Kdj.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:75905'),
  ('119865213825317605', 'Fragment of Seeking', 1947, 'Horror', 'Curtis Harrington', 'Curtis Harrington', 'Curtis Harrington', null, 'A young man desperately seeks out the fleeting image of a female companion, and though he never quite catches her, he discovers much more through the surreal explorations of his own sexuality. Preserved by the Academy Film Archive in 2012.', 'A young man desperately seeks out the fleeting image of a female companion, and though he never quite catches her, he discovers much more through the surreal explorations of his own sexuality. Preserved by the Academy Film Archive in 2012.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dAjoquhPXxYYLSBjlfmT2sbeoyc.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:221637'),
  ('923149702738559548', 'Fragments of a Life Loved', 2023, 'Documentary', 'Chloé Barreau', null, 'Jeanne Rosa, Rebecca Zlotowski, Anne Berest, Jean-Philippe Raiche Ludger Beaulieu, Anna Mouglalis, Marco Giuliani, Sébastien Ryckelynck, Laurent Charles-Nicolas', null, 'For over thirty years, between Paris and Rome, Chloé Barreau has been filming her love life. While in a relationship, she would already build its memory by filming, taking pictures, writing about it… but what do her exes remember? What is their side of the story? This film traces a woman''s life, based exclusively on the interviews of people who loved her. Intimate testimonies and private items reveal the universal paths of the feeling of love.', 'For over thirty years, between Paris and Rome, Chloé Barreau has been filming her love life. While in a relationship, she would already build its memory by filming, taking pictures, writing about it… but what do her exes remember? What is their side of the story? This film traces a woman''s life, based exclusively on the interviews of people who loved her. Intimate testimonies and private items reveal the universal paths of the feeling of love.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qqCjyKA6TB0lPdUeEEHDwY9tkZL.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1157128'),
  ('276365539796150557', 'Fragments of Antonin', 2006, 'Drama, War', 'Gabriel Le Bomin, Pierre Cottereau', 'Gabriel Le Bomin', 'Grégori Derangère, Aurélien Recoing, Niels Arestrup, Yann Collette, Laure Duthilleul, David Assaraf, Pascal Demolon, Anouk Grinberg', null, 'A psychiatrist who probes the mind of traumatized soldiers attempts to unlock the secret that drove a gentle but deeply-disturbed World War I veteran to the edge of insanity.', 'A psychiatrist who probes the mind of traumatized soldiers attempts to unlock the secret that drove a gentle but deeply-disturbed World War I veteran to the edge of insanity.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jAjP4ho9Okyi3vUfpCNr0eEVRA7.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:58928'),
  ('402114329987844322', 'Fragments of Love', 2016, 'Romance, Drama', 'Jaime Costas, Fernando Vallejo', 'Fernando Vallejo, Laura Duque', 'Laura Aleman, Luis Gonzaga, Angélica Aragón, Alfredo de Quesada, Angélica Blandón, José Ángel Bichir, Teresita Gómez', null, 'Rodrigo, a piano-tuner and former composer fallen on hard times, begins a love affair with the soon-to-be-married Susana. When a bomb in the city of Medellín nearly kills them, Rodrigo and Susana surrender to their attraction and fall into each other’s arms. Cocooned in her apartment above the vibrant city, Susana opens up to him every night and tells him a story of each of the different men from her past. Her stories inspire him to compose again, but his obsession makes him jealous and paranoid. When Susana finally leaves her fiancée to be with Rodrigo, he becomes obsessed with her fidelity.', 'Rodrigo, a piano-tuner and former composer fallen on hard times, begins a love affair with the soon-to-be-married Susana. When a bomb in the city of Medellín nearly kills them, Rodrigo and Susana surrender to their attraction and fall into each other’s arms. Cocooned in her apartment above the vibrant city, Susana opens up to him every night and tells him a story of each of the different men from her past. Her stories inspire him to compose again, but his obsession makes him jealous and paranoid. When Susana finally leaves her fiancée to be with Rodrigo, he becomes obsessed with her fidelity.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/l5DUyJE3UaDC9COJ8OxycyTkRBW.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:400013'),
  ('248845039767671590', 'Fragtime', 2019, 'Animation, Romance, Science Fiction, Comedy', 'Takeshi Kusaka, Naoyoshi Kusaka, Seiji Nishimoto', 'Takuya Sato', 'Miku Ito, Yume Miyamoto, Chika Anzai, Miyuri Shimabukuro, Miho Hayashi, Yuuichirou Umehara, Azusa Tadokoro, Minami Takahashi', null, 'Misuzu Moritani is an introvert who has always had difficulty interacting with her classmates, quickly becoming flustered whenever someone tries to talk to her. Sometimes, she will use her ability to stop time for three minutes to escape troublesome social situations. One day, as Misuzu watches the suspended environment around her, she observes that her classmate, Haruka Murakami, is somehow able to move despite her temporal influence. From that moment on, Misuzu experiences new wonders as she explores more of the world she has long avoided; no matter where time may take her, Misuzu can count on Haruka to always be at her side.', 'Misuzu Moritani is an introvert who has always had difficulty interacting with her classmates, quickly becoming flustered whenever someone tries to talk to her. Sometimes, she will use her ability to stop time for three minutes to escape troublesome social situations. One day, as Misuzu watches the suspended environment around her, she observes that her classmate, Haruka Murakami, is somehow able to move despite her temporal influence. From that moment on, Misuzu experiences new wonders as she explores more of the world she has long avoided; no matter where time may take her, Misuzu can count on Haruka to always be at her side.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jWTA9hccaFIXNoqADg7V5hCnSOq.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:630027'),
  ('727676825909578691', 'Fraidy Cat', 1942, 'Animation, Comedy', 'Joseph Barbera, William Hanna', null, 'William Hanna, Lillian Randolph, Martha Wentworth, Harry Lang, Kent Rogers, Sara Berner', 'NR', 'Tom hears a ghost story on the radio and is spooked by it; Jerry notices this and takes advantage of it, using a variety of tricks to scare Tom.', 'Tom hears a ghost story on the radio and is spooked by it; Jerry notices this and takes advantage of it, using a variety of tricks to scare Tom.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eBj90pocOdfR4IQge0XvaGBPnUF.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:40472'),
  ('569226113072023037', 'Frailty', 2002, 'Drama, Thriller, Crime', 'Bill Paxton, Bill Butler', 'Brent Hanley', 'Bill Paxton, Matthew McConaughey, Powers Boothe, Matt O''Leary, Jeremy Sumpter, Luke Askew, Levi Kreis, Derk Cheetwood', 'R', 'A mysterious man arrives at the offices of an FBI agent and recounts his childhood: how his religious fanatic father received visions telling him to kill people who were in fact "demons."', 'A mysterious man arrives at the offices of an FBI agent and recounts his childhood: how his religious fanatic father received visions telling him to kill people who were in fact "demons."', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jid7dyfHa6ApZSTweC3T3nllWjh.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:12149'),
  ('352211259883571209', 'Fraktus', 2012, 'Music, Comedy', 'Lars Jessen, Sebastian Schultz, Rocko Schamoni', 'Sebastian Schultz, Lars Jessen, Ingo Haeb', 'Devid Striesow, Heinz Strunk, Rocko Schamoni, Jacques Palminger, Piet Fuchs, Alex Christensen, H.P. Baxxter, Dieter Meier', null, 'German mockumentary about the history of the techno band of the same name. Fraktus were once considered the pioneers of techno. Now, after 25 years, they are planning their big comeback. The band is supported by their manager Roger Dettner, who used a trick to get the band back together.', 'German mockumentary about the history of the techno band of the same name. Fraktus were once considered the pioneers of techno. Now, after 25 years, they are planning their big comeback. The band is supported by their manager Roger Dettner, who used a trick to get the band back together.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2pThyBOA43DS9YUxHDDUcWiF7EU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:140554'),
  ('952788728696860694', 'Framed', 1930, 'Adventure, Crime', 'George Archainbaud, Leo Tover', 'Paul Schofield', 'Evelyn Brent, Regis Toomey, Ralf Harolde, William Holden, Maurice Black, Robert Emmett O''Connor, Eddie Kane, Joel McCrea', 'NR', 'Rose Manning swears revenge for the unjust slaying of her father by Inspector McArthur. Five years later, as a nightclub hostess, she is sought by Chuck Gaines, secretly a bootlegger, but she centers her attentions on young Jimmy Carter, who, she learns, is the son of McArthur.', 'Rose Manning swears revenge for the unjust slaying of her father by Inspector McArthur. Five years later, as a nightclub hostess, she is sought by Chuck Gaines, secretly a bootlegger, but she centers her attentions on young Jimmy Carter, who, she learns, is the son of McArthur.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/a3tv4X2HBXNYZ5KVmxaVmIxLmy1.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:28755'),
  ('120520043397896801', 'Framed', 1947, 'Crime, Drama', 'Burnett Guffey, Richard Wallace, Herman E. Webber', 'Ben Maddow', 'Glenn Ford, Janis Carter, Barry Sullivan, Edgar Buchanan, Karen Morley, Jim Bannon, Art Smith, Lillian Wells', 'NR', 'Truck driver Mike Lambert is a down-and-out mining engineer searching for a job. When his rig breaks down in a small town, he happens upon a venomous seductress. When her boyfriend robs a bank, they intend to frame Lambert.', 'Truck driver Mike Lambert is a down-and-out mining engineer searching for a job. When his rig breaks down in a small town, he happens upon a venomous seductress. When her boyfriend robs a bank, they intend to frame Lambert.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gCpZ13hCj4xp9m8FwERFKIzxVii.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:29365'),
  ('566127115753750923', 'Framed', 1975, 'Action, Crime, Thriller', 'Jack A. Marta, Phil Karlson, Barry Stern', 'Mort Briskin', 'Joe Don Baker, Conny Van Dyke, Gabriel Dell, John Marley, Brock Peters, John Larch, Warren J. Kemmerling, Paul Mantee', 'R', 'Joe Don Baker plays a gambler who is framed for a crime he did not commit. A corrupt legal system leads him into a plea bargain and four years behind bars. By the time he gets out of prison, he''s determined to put together the pieces of his frame-up and dole out the justice he was denied to those responsible.', 'Joe Don Baker plays a gambler who is framed for a crime he did not commit. A corrupt legal system leads him into a plea bargain and four years behind bars. By the time he gets out of prison, he''s determined to put together the pieces of his frame-up and dole out the justice he was denied to those responsible.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/b78HelKTjM7sQ6TvtK83ihEVwmB.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:38201'),
  ('75959860930136902', 'Framed', 1988, 'Action, Comedy', 'Jonas Frick, Stefan Kullänger', 'Bengt Palmers, Björn Skifs', 'Björn Skifs, Gino Samil, Johan Ulveson, Magnus Nilsson, Stefan Sauk, Gunnel Fred, Michael Druker, Kåre Sigurdson', null, 'Conny is a chemistry teacher who is framed for drug possession. Unable to prove his innocence he ends up in prison. When he finds a secret exit some inmates "persuade" him to participate in a heist. Things become extremely hectic as he tries to prove his innocence as well as "helping" his inmates. When Conny thinks that it couldn''t possibly get any worse he meets Susanne, a policewoman...', 'Conny is a chemistry teacher who is framed for drug possession. Unable to prove his innocence he ends up in prison. When he finds a secret exit some inmates "persuade" him to participate in a heist. Things become extremely hectic as he tries to prove his innocence as well as "helping" his inmates. When Conny thinks that it couldn''t possibly get any worse he meets Susanne, a policewoman...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7c31Z66SqGrxc6GnO3JakQkVONj.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:35327'),
