  ('121104700846971890', 'France Boutique', 2003, 'Comedy', 'Tonie Marshall, Jean-François Robin', 'Pierre Erwan Guillaume, Tonie Marshall', 'Karin Viard, François Cluzet, Judith Godrèche, Bernard Ménez, Micheline Presle, Nathalie Baye, Hélène Fillières, Valérie Bonneton', null, 'Francois Cluzet and Karin Viard are the couple behind a French shopping channel whose business and marriage are both drifting towards the rocks, with Nathalie Baye as a smiling Rottweiller out to steal their business by conning them into offering a duff product, the ''Fear Eliminator,'' and picking up the network for pennies in the ensuing financial fallout.', 'Francois Cluzet and Karin Viard are the couple behind a French shopping channel whose business and marriage are both drifting towards the rocks, with Nathalie Baye as a smiling Rottweiller out to steal their business by conning them into offering a duff product, the ''Fear Eliminator,'' and picking up the network for pennies in the ensuing financial fallout.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kSMwpIPGmFVrY1m1Q1jWxJbpT1f.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:64207'),
