  ('1148622164133647720', 'France, Incorporated', 1974, 'Science Fiction, Comedy', 'Alain Corneau, Pierre-William Glenn, Laurent Ferrier', 'Jean-Claude Carrière', 'Michel Bouquet, Allyn Ann McLerie, Roland Dubillard, Joel Barcellos, Michel Vitold, Yves Afonso, Marcel Imhoff, Georges Staquet', null, 'In the year 2222, a former drug dealer is kept in a state of hibernation. Reanimated, he tells his story. Leader in the narcotics market, his situation was prosperous until, during a political change, the government legalized its use.', 'In the year 2222, a former drug dealer is kept in a state of hibernation. Reanimated, he tells his story. Leader in the narcotics market, his situation was prosperous until, during a political change, the government legalized its use.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rEGqECXj1lrMj8puYi2pnlQQ6xF.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:246049'),
  ('1120722244853911922', 'Frances', 1982, 'Drama', 'Graeme Clifford, László Kovács, Ed Milkovich', 'Eric Bergren, Christopher De Vore, Nicholas Kazan', 'Jessica Lange, Sam Shepard, Kim Stanley, Bart Burns, Christopher Pennock, James Karen, Gerald S. O''Loughlin, Sarah Cunningham', 'R', 'The true story of Frances Farmer''s meteoric rise to fame in Hollywood and the tragic turn her life took when she was blacklisted.', 'The true story of Frances Farmer''s meteoric rise to fame in Hollywood and the tragic turn her life took when she was blacklisted.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eyUq8VBgoHncr0cXFTKgg3VPyfi.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:3526'),
  ('184568797190019915', 'Frances Ha', 2013, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Noah Baumbach, David Brant, Sam Levy', 'Noah Baumbach, Greta Gerwig', 'Greta Gerwig, Mickey Sumner, Michael Zegen, Adam Driver, Charlotte d''Amboise, Patrick Heusinger, Michael Esper, Grace Gummer', 'R', 'An aspiring dancer moves to New York City and becomes caught up in a whirlwind of flighty fair-weather friends, diminishing fortunes and career setbacks.', 'An aspiring dancer moves to New York City and becomes caught up in a whirlwind of flighty fair-weather friends, diminishing fortunes and career setbacks.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jrq1NoKvsxWCcffVOjegiYwloFN.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:121986'),
  ('518652143112426895', 'Francesca', 2017, 'Drama, Thriller', 'Luciano Onetti, Luciano Onetti, Nicolás Onetti', 'Luciano Onetti, Nicolás Onetti', 'Raúl Gederlini, Silvina Grippaldi, Martina Nigrelli, Luis Emilio Rodríguez, Gustavo D''Alessandro, Juan Bautista Massolo, Antonieta Bonarea, Idiel Idiáquez', null, 'Italy, 1970. The sinister shadow of a mysterious serial killer, obsessed with Dante''s Divine Comedy, relentlessly hunts down all those whose souls are evil and impure. Inspectors Moretti and Succo, in charge of solving the case, suspect that the wave of murders is related to a horrible crime committed 15 years earlier.', 'Italy, 1970. The sinister shadow of a mysterious serial killer, obsessed with Dante''s Divine Comedy, relentlessly hunts down all those whose souls are evil and impure. Inspectors Moretti and Succo, in charge of solving the case, suspect that the wave of murders is related to a horrible crime committed 15 years earlier.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5UGnbC3sbcOg1xqsKSxMoKLcGmj.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:366122'),
  ('1066622292439214367', 'Francesca and Nunziata', 2003, 'Drama, Comedy, TV Movie', 'Lina Wertmüller', 'Elvio Porta', 'Sophia Loren, Giancarlo Giannini, Claudia Gerini, Raoul Bova, Luciano De Crescenzo, Armando Pugliese, Massimo Wertmüller, Paolo De Giorgio', null, 'At the beginning of the century, in Italy, a wealthy woman Francesca (Loren), adopts a poor little girl named Nunziata. The years pass, Nunziata falls in love Federico (Bova), her adoptive brother, son of Francesca.', 'At the beginning of the century, in Italy, a wealthy woman Francesca (Loren), adopts a poor little girl named Nunziata. The years pass, Nunziata falls in love Federico (Bova), her adoptive brother, son of Francesca.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yBwhdSfRmS23esUimDPVnSgPLqG.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:229425'),
  ('896967161468272723', 'Francesco', 1989, 'Drama, History', 'Giuseppe Lanci, Liliana Cavani, Ennio Guarnieri', 'Liliana Cavani, Roberta Mazzoni', 'Mickey Rourke, Helena Bonham Carter, Andréa Ferréol, Nikolaus Dutsch, Peter Berling, Hanns Zischler, Mario Adorf, Paolo Bonacelli', 'PG-13', 'The life of St. Francis of Assisi (1181-1226) as related by followers who gather after his death to tell stories so that Leone can record them: a privileged and virile youth, a prisoner of war, an heir who turns away from his father and gives all to the poor, a beggar for others, and an inspiration to friends who accept the Gospels'' life of poverty.', 'The life of St. Francis of Assisi (1181-1226) as related by followers who gather after his death to tell stories so that Leone can record them: a privileged and virile youth, a prisoner of war, an heir who turns away from his father and gives all to the poor, a beggar for others, and an inspiration to friends who accept the Gospels'' life of poverty.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8hfyrgk66U2KkT49dvJUy5oWQ0d.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:84981'),
