  ('537992586052073832', 'Francis Goes to the Races', 1951, 'Comedy, Family, Fantasy', 'Arthur Lubin, Irving Glassberg', 'Oscar Brodney, David Stern', 'Donald O''Connor, Piper Laurie, Cecil Kellaway, Jesse White, Barry Kelley, Hayden Rorke, Vaughn Taylor, Larry Keating', 'NR', 'In this funny sequel to the popular Francis the Talking Mule, the talkative Mule and his pal Peter get a job working on a horse-breeder''s ranch. They end up saving it from financial ruin when Francis, who has the inside track with the racehorses, provides Peter with names of the winners before the races are run. Sure enough Peter finds himself with a fistful of cash and uses it to buy a racehorse for the farm. Unfortunately, the horse he chooses is suffering from a debilitating lack of confidence. When not dealing with the mare, Peter finds time to court the horse breeder''s niece and trying to avoid the gangsters who want in on the winnings.', 'In this funny sequel to the popular Francis the Talking Mule, the talkative Mule and his pal Peter get a job working on a horse-breeder''s ranch. They end up saving it from financial ruin when Francis, who has the inside track with the racehorses, provides Peter with names of the winners before the races are run. Sure enough Peter finds himself with a fistful of cash and uses it to buy a racehorse for the farm. Unfortunately, the horse he chooses is suffering from a debilitating lack of confidence. When not dealing with the mare, Peter finds time to court the horse breeder''s niece and trying to avoid the gangsters who want in on the winnings.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8qD9qB53N1grWbhCVBvUxrWfwVn.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:81987'),
  ('526397780540396846', 'Francis Goes to West Point', 1952, 'Comedy, Family, Fantasy', 'Arthur Lubin, Jesse Hibbs, Joseph Gershenson', 'Oscar Brodney', 'Donald O''Connor, Lori Nelson, Alice Kelley, Gregg Palmer, William Reynolds, Les Tremayne, Otto Hulett, David Janssen', 'NR', 'Francis the talking mule gets his owner in and out of trouble while he is taking basic training at West Point.', 'Francis the talking mule gets his owner in and out of trouble while he is taking basic training at West Point.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oykRGGVGOSWfcWJYm0EhXRrPxQs.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:88677'),
  ('748149772505318032', 'Francis in the Navy', 1955, 'Comedy, Family, Fantasy, Romance', 'Arthur Lubin, Phil Bowles, Carl E. Guthrie', 'Devery Freeman', 'Donald O''Connor, Martha Hyer, Richard Erdman, Jim Backus, Clint Eastwood, David Janssen, Leigh Snowden, Martin Milner', 'NR', 'In the U. S. Army intelligence office, bumbling lieutenant Peter Stirling receives a coded message from his friend, Francis, a talking mule. The note urges Pete to hurry to the Coronado, California naval base, where Francis is about to be sold as surplus. Pete rushes to the train station, but before he can board, nurse Betsy Donevan mistakes him for her shell-shocked brother, Navy boatswain Slicker Donevan. She tries to forcibly remove his uniform so he will not get into trouble for impersonating an Army officer. Finally she realizes that Pete is not Slicker but merely his mirror image.', 'In the U. S. Army intelligence office, bumbling lieutenant Peter Stirling receives a coded message from his friend, Francis, a talking mule. The note urges Pete to hurry to the Coronado, California naval base, where Francis is about to be sold as surplus. Pete rushes to the train station, but before he can board, nurse Betsy Donevan mistakes him for her shell-shocked brother, Navy boatswain Slicker Donevan. She tries to forcibly remove his uniform so he will not get into trouble for impersonating an Army officer. Finally she realizes that Pete is not Slicker but merely his mirror image.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sF8eGgtbeW4syxXvKDDTtG0ii3O.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:62742'),
  ('973024185952229577', 'Francis Joins the WACS', 1954, 'Comedy, Fantasy', 'Irving Glassberg, Arthur Lubin, John Sherwood', 'Devery Freeman, James B. Allardice', 'Donald O''Connor, Julie Adams, Mamie Van Doren, Lynn Bari, Zasu Pitts, Joan Shawlee, Allison Hayes, Mara Corday', 'NR', 'Peter Stirling (with his old friend the talking mule) is recalled to active duty...in the WACs!', 'Peter Stirling (with his old friend the talking mule) is recalled to active duty...in the WACs!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ksfuyYvjL5g2P1WeQBfyR3mhqYN.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:88679'),
  ('265363556721484360', 'Francis of Assisi', 1961, 'History, Drama', 'Michael Curtiz, Piero Portalupi, Ottavio Oppo', 'Eugene Vale, James Forsyth, Jack W. Thomas', 'Bradford Dillman, Dolores Hart, Stuart Whitman, Cecil Kellaway, Eduard Franz, Athene Seyler, Finlay Currie, Mervyn Johns', 'NR', 'In 13th century Italy, Francis Bernardone, the son of an Assisi merchant, renounces a promising army career in favor of a monastic life and starts his own religious order, sanctioned by the Pope.', 'In 13th century Italy, Francis Bernardone, the son of an Assisi merchant, renounces a promising army career in favor of a monastic life and starts his own religious order, sanctioned by the Pope.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gYkyJuB8T8ygZGP2Jy6rPewDcRF.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:98010'),
  ('698803123279127178', 'Francis the First', 1937, 'Comedy, Fantasy', 'Christian-Jaque', 'Paul Fékété', 'Fernandel, Mona Goya, Alice Tissot, Aimé Simon-Girard, Alexandre Rignault, Henri Bosc, Alexandre Mihalesco, René Génin', null, 'Honorin is the simple and naive stage manager of a traveling theatre troupe, whose one ambition is to once play the role of the cavalier in the opera "Francis I, or the Loves of the Beautiful Ferroniere". A hypnotist puts him to sleep and in his dreams he is transplanted to the days of the Renaissance. There, among other items, he is made a Duke by Henri VIII, fights a duel and survives a series of medieval tortures, while also bestowing some 20th century blessings on the court of Francis I.', 'Honorin is the simple and naive stage manager of a traveling theatre troupe, whose one ambition is to once play the role of the cavalier in the opera "Francis I, or the Loves of the Beautiful Ferroniere". A hypnotist puts him to sleep and in his dreams he is transplanted to the days of the Renaissance. There, among other items, he is made a Duke by Henri VIII, fights a duel and survives a series of medieval tortures, while also bestowing some 20th century blessings on the court of Francis I.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8Epjk4A3Yl4VTG3t3PaVXIzWRN7.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:142486'),
  ('866172287165437280', 'Francis: Pray for Me', 2015, 'Drama', 'Beda Docampo Feijóo, Kiko de la Rica', 'Beda Docampo Feijóo, César Gómez Copello', 'Darío Grandinetti, Carlos Hipólito, Leticia Brédice, Silvia Abascal, Alejandro Awada, Emilio Gavira, Jorge Marrale, Blanca Jara', null, 'A look at the life of Jorge Mario Bergoglio, form his early childhood days in Argentina to his becoming Pope Francis.', 'A look at the life of Jorge Mario Bergoglio, form his early childhood days in Argentina to his becoming Pope Francis.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yp332Pn3lzhCjlpgyJO5elDckvK.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:349105'),
  ('984328630980322827', 'Francisca', 1981, 'Drama', 'Manoel de Oliveira, Elso Roque, Carlos Santana', 'Manoel de Oliveira', 'Teresa Menezes, Diogo Dória, Mário Barroso, Nuno Carinhas, Manuela de Freitas, Glória de Matos, Alexandre Brandão de Melo, Lia Gama', null, 'The life of a young man, son of an English officer who lets himself become a prisoner of love resulting in fatalism and disgrace.', 'The life of a young man, son of an English officer who lets himself become a prisoner of love resulting in fatalism and disgrace.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yAaypfPeJPLHihpNBecmhnLrBm.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:110789'),
  ('358769868846113474', 'Franciscan of Bourges', 1968, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Claude Autant-Lara, Michel Kelber', 'Pierre Bost, Jean Aurenche', 'Hardy Krüger, Jean Desailly, Christian Barbier, Reinhard Kolldehoff, Béatrix Dussane, Jean-Pierre Dorat, Gérard Berner, Jacques Ferrière', null, 'Albert is a Franciscan monk and a medical orderly at a monastery in France. Although he is German, the kindly monk helps hide French resistance members. Albert tries to maintain the delicate balance between the warring factions by helping out the afflicted and not getting involved in political ideology.', 'Albert is a Franciscan monk and a medical orderly at a monastery in France. Although he is German, the kindly monk helps hide French resistance members. Albert tries to maintain the delicate balance between the warring factions by helping out the afflicted and not getting involved in political ideology.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oZSv9WunxBGznvGeeVlgreIINlD.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:65902'),
  ('783914366180886735', 'Franck Dubosc - Fifty / Fifty', 2020, 'Comedy', 'Xavier Maingnon', 'Franck Dubosc', 'Franck Dubosc', null, 'Both an eternal seducer with ocean-colored eyes and a young father doting on his two little superheroes, Franck Dubosc delivers a new show of total sincerity and unstoppable humor! "I''m 50 and I love it!" You too will love Franck Dubosc''s "Fifty Broomsticks and Dust."', 'Both an eternal seducer with ocean-colored eyes and a young father doting on his two little superheroes, Franck Dubosc delivers a new show of total sincerity and unstoppable humor! "I''m 50 and I love it!" You too will love Franck Dubosc''s "Fifty Broomsticks and Dust."', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lNpm1GaXrgBy1rAQcc32KeEPBFK.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:664411'),
  ('103896497479058415', 'Franck Dubosc - Il était une fois...', 2009, 'Comedy', 'Gérard Pullicino, Rudy Bouchoucha', 'Franck Dubosc', 'Franck Dubosc', null, 'From his birth to his meeting with Véronique, through his first loves, the disco years, and his first steps on stage, Franck Dubosc looks back on his life and loves...', 'From his birth to his meeting with Véronique, through his first loves, the disco years, and his first steps on stage, Franck Dubosc looks back on his life and loves...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/n4akKD5R3PzGOdLvmrLX41rfxCs.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:81609'),
  ('222889807359944456', 'Franck Dubosc : Romantique', 2005, 'Comedy', 'Serge Khalfon, Laurence Jouin', 'Franck Dubosc', 'Franck Dubosc', null, 'Show recorded on November 27 and 28, 2004 at the Olympia. Franck Dubosc is single! He was dumped by his fiancée Véro and so, it made him romantic. However, he didn''t cheat on her just once... It was not cheating, but comparing!', 'Show recorded on November 27 and 28, 2004 at the Olympia. Franck Dubosc is single! He was dumped by his fiancée Véro and so, it made him romantic. However, he didn''t cheat on her just once... It was not cheating, but comparing!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rSyzLmKEMdQD1P8VzLlwhBPIOe9.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:80072'),
