  ('712603001088653542', 'Franco Escamilla: Ladies'' man', 2024, 'Comedy', 'Franco Escamilla', 'Franco Escamilla', 'Franco Escamilla', 'R', 'Franco Escamilla takes the stage with tales of teenage romance gone wrong, featuring painfully long kisses and rockstar cameos with surprising outcomes.', 'Franco Escamilla takes the stage with tales of teenage romance gone wrong, featuring painfully long kisses and rockstar cameos with surprising outcomes.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7sZiozbWOSLlXvgT866MtTK32Yv.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1289045'),
  ('737244178708492586', 'Franco Escamilla: por la anécdota', 2018, 'Comedy', 'Ulises Valencia', 'Franco Escamilla', 'Franco Escamilla', null, 'Mexican stand-up comedian Franco Escamilla draws his jokes from real-life experiences -- and he''s willing to do anything for new material. He''s not afraid to make generalizations about how men bathe. But he is scared to talk to strangers. Especially at funerals.', 'Mexican stand-up comedian Franco Escamilla draws his jokes from real-life experiences -- and he''s willing to do anything for new material. He''s not afraid to make generalizations about how men bathe. But he is scared to talk to strangers. Especially at funerals.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iT5LzAICUgviiSY0d5461MKNSOc.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:529414'),
  ('833116740984522119', 'Franco Escamilla: RPM', 2020, 'Comedy', null, 'Franco Escamilla', 'Franco Escamilla', null, 'No description available yet.', 'No description available yet.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hFVOwiCosQTqGjtdK8ViDmj99v2.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:707533'),
  ('224358936978611594', 'Franco, Ciccio and the Cheerful Widows', 1968, 'Comedy', 'Marino Girolami, Renzo Girolami, Alberto Fusi', 'Amedeo Sollazzo, Roberto Gianviti', 'Franco Franchi, Ciccio Ingrassia, Dominique Boschero, Nino Taranto, Rossella Como, Giampiero Littera, Raimondo Vianello, Margaret Lee', null, 'A 3-episode film starring popular comedians Franchi and Ingrassia. In the first episode, Carlo and Oreste are married to the same woman; when she delivers twins, they fight for paternity. In the second episode, Celestina needs a heir to receive her dead husband''s fortune. In the third episode, young widow Daisy arrives in Italy to meet her deceased much-older husband''s family and ends up marrying his great-grandson.', 'A 3-episode film starring popular comedians Franchi and Ingrassia. In the first episode, Carlo and Oreste are married to the same woman; when she delivers twins, they fight for paternity. In the second episode, Celestina needs a heir to receive her dead husband''s fortune. In the third episode, young widow Daisy arrives in Italy to meet her deceased much-older husband''s family and ends up marrying his great-grandson.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8GybKyijVff6uRS7FFKkwgCGwpp.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:121580'),
  ('11866143509573194', 'Franco, Ciccio and the Pirate Blackbeard', 1969, 'Comedy', 'Mario Amendola, Paolo Taccari, Tino Santoni', 'Bruno Corbucci, Mario Amendola, Amedeo Sollazzo', 'Franco Franchi, Ciccio Ingrassia, Fernando Sancho, Mimmo Palmara, Adriana Facchetti, Pietro Tordi, Rosita Torosh, Enzo Andronico', null, 'Franco and Ciccio embark on a journey to find Pirate Flint''s lost treasure, hunted by the fearsome Pirate Blackbeard.', 'Franco and Ciccio embark on a journey to find Pirate Flint''s lost treasure, hunted by the fearsome Pirate Blackbeard.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iSZrYCswcGDgTVntvYZBjxMJqst.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:238330'),
  ('934787532128422887', 'Francofonia', 2015, 'Drama, History', 'Aleksandr Sokurov, Bruno Delbonnel', 'Alexei Jankovski, Aleksandr Sokurov', 'Louis-Do de Lencquesaing, Vincent Nemeth, Benjamin Utzerath, Jean-Claude Caër, Johanna Korthals Altes, Aleksandr Sokurov, François Smesny, Peter Lontzek', null, 'Master filmmaker Alexander Sokurov (Russian Ark) transforms a portrait of the world-renowned museum into a magisterial, centuries-spanning reflection on the relation between art, culture and power.', 'Master filmmaker Alexander Sokurov (Russian Ark) transforms a portrait of the world-renowned museum into a magisterial, centuries-spanning reflection on the relation between art, culture and power.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/saCFbjXLlypGlX5UngU3iLbthGs.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:296449'),
  ('125358747321560240', 'Frank', 2014, 'Comedy, Drama, Mystery', 'Lenny Abrahamson, James Mather, David Rubin', 'Jon Ronson, Peter Straughan', 'Michael Fassbender, Domhnall Gleeson, Maggie Gyllenhaal, Scoot McNairy, François Civil, Carla Azar, Tess Harper, Bruce McIntosh', 'R', 'A young wannabe musician discovers he has bitten off more than he can chew when he joins an eccentric pop band led by the mysterious and enigmatic Frank.', 'A young wannabe musician discovers he has bitten off more than he can chew when he joins an eccentric pop band led by the mysterious and enigmatic Frank.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mGzqs4CHW8LomreoPATnyrTXk7j.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:171372'),
  ('281218160064618941', 'Frank & Jesse', 1994, 'Action, Adventure, Drama, Western', 'Robert Boris, Walt Lloyd', 'Robert Boris', 'Rob Lowe, Bill Paxton, Randy Travis, William Atherton, Todd Field, Robert Moniot, Cole S. McKay, Dana Wheeler-Nicholson', null, 'At the end of the Civil War, Frank and Jesse James and other former guerillas who rode with Quantrill and Bill Anderson take the oath of allegiance to the Union. Feeling oppressed by Chicago railroad investors, the James and Younger brothers, Bob and Charlie Ford, Clell Miller and Arch Clements take to robbing banks, trains and coaches, with Pinkerton sworn to bringing them to justice.', 'At the end of the Civil War, Frank and Jesse James and other former guerillas who rode with Quantrill and Bill Anderson take the oath of allegiance to the Union. Feeling oppressed by Chicago railroad investors, the James and Younger brothers, Bob and Charlie Ford, Clell Miller and Arch Clements take to robbing banks, trains and coaches, with Pinkerton sworn to bringing them to justice.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/h54QflwgAKx0sy2bE4qm7SGg1Tw.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:42706'),
  ('448850035252058515', 'Frank & Lola', 2016, 'Drama, Mystery, Romance', 'Matthew Ross, Eric Koretz, Julie Plumelle', 'Matthew Ross', 'Michael Shannon, Imogen Poots, Rosanna Arquette, Michael Nyqvist, Justin Long, Emmanuelle Devos, Alex Lombard, Amy Argyle', 'NR', 'A talented Las Vegas chef falls in love with an aspiring fashion designer but turns violently jealous when he realizes that she''s hiding dark secrets.', 'A talented Las Vegas chef falls in love with an aspiring fashion designer but turns violently jealous when he realizes that she''s hiding dark secrets.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fItgZrUw7iUAgQb4CGdSkfT3vlT.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:316021'),
  ('769967014206374115', 'Frank and Eva', 1973, 'Romance, Drama', 'Pim de la Parra', 'Charles Gormley, Pim de la Parra', 'Willeke van Ammelrooy, Hugo Metsers, Lex Goudsmit, Helmert Woudenberg, Sylvia Kristel, Elsje de Wijn, Christina Cünne, Ronny Bierman', null, 'The story of a man who goes out looking for hamburgers, while he has a beautiful steak at home. Frank and Eva can''t live together, but can''t live without each other either. Frank has sex with every woman he can get, while Eva wants to start a family.', 'The story of a man who goes out looking for hamburgers, while he has a beautiful steak at home. Frank and Eva can''t live together, but can''t live without each other either. Frank has sex with every woman he can get, while Eva wants to start a family.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ujIWMfEvfgWQjXQJ7W8sqpbYwzg.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:249238'),
  ('98128882668216404', 'Frank and Ollie', 1995, 'Documentary', 'Theodore Thomas', null, 'Frank Thomas, Ollie Johnston, Glen Keane, Andrew Gaskill, John Canemaker, John Culhane', 'PG', 'Before computer graphics, special effects wizardry, and out-of-this world technology, the magic of animation flowed from the pencils of two of the greatest animators The Walt Disney Company ever produced -- Frank Thomas and Ollie Johnston. Frank and Ollie, the talent behind BAMBI, PINOCCHIO, LADY AND THE TRAMP, THE JUNGLE BOOK, and others, set the standard for such modern-day hits as THE LION KING. It was their creative genius that helped make Disney synonymous with brilliant animation, magnificent music, and emotional storytelling. Take a journey with these extraordinary artists as they share secrets, insights, and the inspiration behind some of the greatest animated movies the world has ever known!', 'Before computer graphics, special effects wizardry, and out-of-this world technology, the magic of animation flowed from the pencils of two of the greatest animators The Walt Disney Company ever produced -- Frank Thomas and Ollie Johnston. Frank and Ollie, the talent behind BAMBI, PINOCCHIO, LADY AND THE TRAMP, THE JUNGLE BOOK, and others, set the standard for such modern-day hits as THE LION KING. It was their creative genius that helped make Disney synonymous with brilliant animation, magnificent music, and emotional storytelling. Take a journey with these extraordinary artists as they share secrets, insights, and the inspiration behind some of the greatest animated movies the world has ever known!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eUIELE2IkuWkAc3JzjYz6J2Lpx5.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:42981'),
  ('42822836465346186', 'Frank and Penelope', 2022, 'Thriller, Horror, Crime', 'Sean Patrick Flanery, Peter J. Calvin, A.J. Raitano', 'Sean Patrick Flanery', 'Billy Budinich, Caylee Cowan, Johnathon Schaech, Brian Maillard, Sydney Scotia, Kevin Dillon, Donna D''Errico, Sean Patrick Flanery', 'R', 'A tale of love and violence when a man on his emotional last legs finds a savior seductively dancing in a run-down strip club. And a life most certainly headed off a cliff suddenly becomes redirected - as everything is now worth dying for.', 'A tale of love and violence when a man on his emotional last legs finds a savior seductively dancing in a run-down strip club. And a life most certainly headed off a cliff suddenly becomes redirected - as everything is now worth dying for.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5NpXoAi3nEQkEgLO09nmotPfyNa.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:899294'),
  ('766681773849687318', 'Frank Duck Brings ''em Back Alive', 1946, 'Animation', 'Jack Hannah', null, 'Clarence Nash, Pinto Colvig', 'NR', 'Wild man of the jungle Goofy is swinging through the treetops when he notices great white hunter Donald Duck pulling into port on his safari boat. He is looking for a wild man of the jungle and Goofy offers himself to Donald...if Donald can catch him which leads the duo on a wild chase through the jungle. Eventually they are pursued in their chase by a lion having switched clothes so that Donald is the wild man and Goofy is the hunter. Goofy escapes in Donald''s boat leaving Donald swinging through the trees to escape the lion.', 'Wild man of the jungle Goofy is swinging through the treetops when he notices great white hunter Donald Duck pulling into port on his safari boat. He is looking for a wild man of the jungle and Goofy offers himself to Donald...if Donald can catch him which leads the duo on a wild chase through the jungle. Eventually they are pursued in their chase by a lion having switched clothes so that Donald is the wild man and Goofy is the hunter. Goofy escapes in Donald''s boat leaving Donald swinging through the trees to escape the lion.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6rVceC570SysRjrJdYbaGyKG3As.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:57235'),
  ('672486305000391291', 'Frank Film', 1973, 'Animation', 'Caroline Mouris, Frank Mouris', 'Tony Schwartz, Frank Mouris', 'Frank Mouris', null, 'A compilation of images co-creator Frank Mouris had collected from magazines interwoven with two narrations, one giving a mostly linear autobiography and the other stating words having to do with the images, the story the first voice is relating, or neither. Preserved by the Academy Film Archive.', 'A compilation of images co-creator Frank Mouris had collected from magazines interwoven with two narrations, one giving a mostly linear autobiography and the other stating words having to do with the images, the story the first voice is relating, or neither. Preserved by the Academy Film Archive.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9HwTuIINMo619CKzRFe53l6VG4W.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:147199'),
  ('753744333912510613', 'Frank Nitti: The Enforcer', 1988, 'TV Movie, Drama, Action, Crime', 'Tana M. Manners, Robert Altshuler, Bob Lewis', 'Lee David Zlotoff', 'Anthony LaPaglia, Vincent Guastaferro, Trini Alvarado, Michael Moriarty, Michael Russo, Louis Guss, Clayton Landey, Bruce Kirby', 'PG-13', 'Al Capone may be the most famous Chicago mobster, but his successor, Frank "The Enforcer" Nitti (Anthony LaPaglia), was just as ruthless. This biopic goes to great lengths to accurately trace Nitti''s rise to the top of the Windy City''s underworld, amid corruption, betrayal and violence. The result is an engrossing glimpse into mob life in the early 20th century.', 'Al Capone may be the most famous Chicago mobster, but his successor, Frank "The Enforcer" Nitti (Anthony LaPaglia), was just as ruthless. This biopic goes to great lengths to accurately trace Nitti''s rise to the top of the Windy City''s underworld, amid corruption, betrayal and violence. The result is an engrossing glimpse into mob life in the early 20th century.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yqWKkE8mbwiTT7yv9PmwNfYY1Fd.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:94866'),
  ('249690376156671335', 'Frank Zappa: Baby Snakes', 1979, 'Music, Documentary', 'Frank Zappa, Richard Pearce, Robert Leacock', 'Frank Zappa', 'Frank Zappa, Terry Bozzio, Tommy Mars, Adrian Belew, Kerry McNabb, Ron Delsener, Bruce Bickford, Robert Leacock', 'R', 'Rock artist Frank Zappa hosts a concert in New York City. This movie contains tons of on-stage footage, off-stage footage, and animation.', 'Rock artist Frank Zappa hosts a concert in New York City. This movie contains tons of on-stage footage, off-stage footage, and animation.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/z1LSd3rZaP9EywCU628Sli5VMbS.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:100205'),
  ('82245176893294059', 'Frankenhooker', 1990, 'Comedy, Horror, Science Fiction', 'Frank Henenlotter, Robert M. Baldwin, Ted Hope', 'Frank Henenlotter, Robert Martin', 'James Lorinz, Patty Mullen, Joseph Gonzalez, Charlotte J. Helmkamp, Joanne Ritchie, J.J. Clark, C.K. Steefel, Shirl Bernheim', 'R', 'A medical school dropout loses his fiancée in a tragic lawnmower incident and decides to bring her back to life. Unfortunately, he was only able to save her head, so he goes to the red light district in the city and lures prostitutes into a hotel room so he can collect body parts to reassemble her.', 'A medical school dropout loses his fiancée in a tragic lawnmower incident and decides to bring her back to life. Unfortunately, he was only able to save her head, so he goes to the red light district in the city and lures prostitutes into a hotel room so he can collect body parts to reassemble her.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/s8Oubzkc2pPdOdj4D23ljZSKRbg.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:27274'),
  ('287223050691919567', 'Frankenstein', 1910, 'Horror, Science Fiction, Fantasy', 'J. Searle Dawley, James H. White', 'J. Searle Dawley', 'Augustus Phillips, Mary Fuller, Charles Ogle', null, 'Frankenstein, a young medical student, trying to create the perfect human being, instead creates a misshapen monster. Made ill by what he has done, Frankenstein is comforted by his fiancée; but on his wedding night he is visited by the monster.', 'Frankenstein, a young medical student, trying to create the perfect human being, instead creates a misshapen monster. Made ill by what he has done, Frankenstein is comforted by his fiancée; but on his wedding night he is visited by the monster.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xPzF7qW6FFZEzfsnsKqNOncxJNU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:2929'),
  ('983191455118957097', 'Frankenstein', 1931, 'Drama, Horror, Science Fiction', 'James Whale, Arthur Edeson', 'Francis Edward Faragoh, Garrett Fort', 'Colin Clive, Mae Clarke, John Boles, Boris Karloff, Edward Van Sloan, Frederick Kerr, Dwight Frye, Lionel Belmore', null, 'Henry Frankenstein pieces together body parts in the hope of bringing a human-like creature to life. The mad scientist’s dreams are shattered by his monstrous creation awakening with rage to a world that hates and fears him.', 'Henry Frankenstein pieces together body parts in the hope of bringing a human-like creature to life. The mad scientist’s dreams are shattered by his monstrous creation awakening with rage to a world that hates and fears him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mu6wHwH0IwCCaEYtpqujuPJYat1.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:3035'),
  ('649801112619475800', 'Frankenstein', 1973, 'Horror, TV Movie, Science Fiction', 'Glenn Jordan, Ben Colman, Trevor Williams', 'Dan Curtis, Richard H. Landau, Sam Hall', 'Robert Foxworth, Susan Strasberg, Bo Svenson, Heidi Vaughn, Philip Bourneuf, Robert Gentry, Jon Lormer, William Hansen', null, 'A scientist obsessed with creating life steals body parts to put together his "creation." Released as a feature on video, this was originally shown in two installments on TV as part of the Wide World of Entertainment series.', 'A scientist obsessed with creating life steals body parts to put together his "creation." Released as a feature on video, this was originally shown in two installments on TV as part of the Wide World of Entertainment series.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6aGzET8iM6PLaq5T1NPjmPvGWf7.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:3068'),
  ('98120072674784650', 'Frankenstein', 1984, 'Horror, Thriller, TV Movie, Science Fiction', 'James Ormerod, Stuart Hinchliffe', null, 'Robert Powell, David Warner, Carrie Fisher, John Gielgud, Terence Alexander, Susan Wooldridge, Michael Cochrane, Graham McGrath', null, 'A scientist who is obsessed with creating life finally does it, with tragic results.', 'A scientist who is obsessed with creating life finally does it, with tragic results.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bgXZtnbXkDFkwRlunrYZy3kSomX.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:3067'),
  ('447347371572572729', 'Frankenstein', 1993, 'Horror, Science Fiction, TV Movie', 'Jack Conroy, David Wickes, Cliff Lanning', 'David Wickes', 'Patrick Bergin, Randy Quaid, John Mills, Lambert Wilson, Fiona Gillies, Jacinta Mulcahy, Ronald Leigh-Hunt, Timothy Stark', null, 'In the early 19th century, Dr. Frankenstein discovers the secret of life – how to create a perfect man – powerful, intelligent and immune to disease. But something goes wrong in the laboratory and the doctor’s hideous creation disappears into the night. At first, Frankenstein hoped that the horrible monster would perish in the wilderness, but now he senses that it’s alive and sets out for him. Dr. Frankenstein tracks the creature to the Arctic, where the two must battle to decide who will become the master of the other’s life…or death.', 'In the early 19th century, Dr. Frankenstein discovers the secret of life – how to create a perfect man – powerful, intelligent and immune to disease. But something goes wrong in the laboratory and the doctor’s hideous creation disappears into the night. At first, Frankenstein hoped that the horrible monster would perish in the wilderness, but now he senses that it’s alive and sets out for him. Dr. Frankenstein tracks the creature to the Arctic, where the two must battle to decide who will become the master of the other’s life…or death.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/osjlYkk2dIJvbOHTwghboKWfl8k.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:3042'),
  ('332979443659807392', 'Frankenstein', 2004, 'TV Movie, Drama, Horror, Science Fiction, Mystery', 'Leslie Keel, Daniel Pearl, Marcus Nispel', 'Dean R. Koontz, John Shiban', 'Parker Posey, Vincent Perez, Thomas Kretschmann, Adam Goldberg, Ivana Miličević, Michael Madsen, Deborah Duke, Ann Mahoney', 'R', 'An investigation into a serial killer leads two detectives to discover that Dr. Frankenstein and his creature are still alive after two centuries of genetic experiments.', 'An investigation into a serial killer leads two detectives to discover that Dr. Frankenstein and his creature are still alive after two centuries of genetic experiments.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gmeccZOjv2l12NM7dTjHXTYHaC4.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:3056'),
  ('327515626884144294', 'Frankenstein', 2015, 'Horror, Science Fiction, Thriller', 'Candace Higgins, Bernard Rose', 'Bernard Rose', 'Xavier Samuel, Carrie-Anne Moss, Danny Huston, Tony Todd, Mckenna Grace, Maya Erskine, Matthew Jacobs, David Pressler', 'R', 'After he is artificially created, then left for dead by a husband-and-wife team of eccentric scientists, Adam is confronted with nothing but aggression and violence from the world around him. This perfect creation-turned disfigured monster must come to grips with the horrific nature of humanity.', 'After he is artificially created, then left for dead by a husband-and-wife team of eccentric scientists, Adam is confronted with nothing but aggression and violence from the world around him. This perfect creation-turned disfigured monster must come to grips with the horrific nature of humanity.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kzTvgsGFd7zpGbwDsA4p8Nkdzj9.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:337029'),
  ('576901579408664507', 'Frankenstein', 2025, 'Drama, Fantasy, Horror', 'Dan Laustsen, Guillermo del Toro, Marilou Vaillancourt', 'Guillermo del Toro', 'Oscar Isaac, Jacob Elordi, Christoph Waltz, Mia Goth, Felix Kammerer, Charles Dance, David Bradley, Lars Mikkelsen', 'R', 'Dr. Victor Frankenstein, a brilliant but egotistical scientist, brings a creature to life in a monstrous experiment that ultimately leads to the undoing of both the creator and his tragic creation.', 'Dr. Victor Frankenstein, a brilliant but egotistical scientist, brings a creature to life in a monstrous experiment that ultimately leads to the undoing of both the creator and his tragic creation.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/g4JtvGlQO7DByTI6frUobqvSL3R.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1062722'),
  ('1069372170025333563', 'Frankenstein ''80', 1972, 'Horror, Science Fiction', 'Emilio Varriano, Mario Mancini', 'Ferdinando De Leone, Mario Mancini', 'John Richardson, Gordon Mitchell, Renato Romano, Xiro Papas, Dada Gallotti, Roberto Fizz, Dalila Di Lazzaro, Marisa Traversi', null, 'A mad scientist creates a monster called "Mosaico," who breaks out of the laboratory to hunt down and kill beautiful women.', 'A mad scientist creates a monster called "Mosaico," who breaks out of the laboratory to hunt down and kill beautiful women.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aGI83YFbmko97GBjqFXu9dK4tiL.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:3306'),
  ('1001809796994120342', 'Frankenstein 1970', 1958, 'Horror, Science Fiction', 'Howard W. Koch, Carl E. Guthrie', 'Richard H. Landau, Charles A. Moses, Aubrey Schenck', 'Boris Karloff, Jana Lund, Don ''Red'' Barry, Charlotte Austin, Rudolph Anders, Tom Duggan, Irwin Berke, John Dennis', 'NR', 'The baron''s grandson rents the family castle to a TV crew to fund his atomic revival of the family monster.', 'The baron''s grandson rents the family castle to a TV crew to fund his atomic revival of the family monster.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pblxHVBjN7JJ5lz3Rdl3cjCvChp.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:3164'),
  ('419388170881115439', 'Frankenstein 90', 1984, 'Comedy, Horror, TV Movie, Science Fiction', 'William Lubtchansky, Alain Jessua', 'Paul Gégauff, Alain Jessua', 'Jean Rochefort, Eddy Mitchell, Fiona Gélin, Herma Vos, Ged Marlon, Serge Marquand, Christian Charmetant, Anna Gaylor', null, 'French cybernetics genius Victor Frankenstein carries on the work of his notorious ancestor and creates a monster, albeit one with a penchant for philosophy, etiquette and occasional bouts of murderous rage. But when the creature develops a hunger for l''amour, Frankenstein and his understanding fiancé use a cache of freshly murdered strippers to build the creature a beautiful yet dutiful bride. Can the undead find true love in a cold world, or will the French ways of passion unleash some monstrous surprises upon them all?', 'French cybernetics genius Victor Frankenstein carries on the work of his notorious ancestor and creates a monster, albeit one with a penchant for philosophy, etiquette and occasional bouts of murderous rage. But when the creature develops a hunger for l''amour, Frankenstein and his understanding fiancé use a cache of freshly murdered strippers to build the creature a beautiful yet dutiful bride. Can the undead find true love in a cold world, or will the French ways of passion unleash some monstrous surprises upon them all?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cNZxL0yeDZ37YVCf05us8nbhhjF.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:3118'),
  ('138396462102896847', 'Frankenstein and Me', 1996, 'Fantasy, Horror', 'Robert Tinnell, Roxanne di Santo', 'David Sherman, Robert Tinnell, Richard Goudreau', 'Jamieson Boulanger, Ryan Gosling, Burt Reynolds, Louise Fletcher, Ricky Mabe, Polly Shannon, Myriam Cyr, Beki Lantos', null, 'Earl Williams is a dreamer teenager obsessed with monsters, who fantasizes his life as if he were living in the world of the monsters of Universal Studios. Although being an excellent student, his intolerant and nasty school teacher Mrs. Perdue does not like him and punishes him for any minor fault. His supportive father Les Williams is also a dreamer, who has never been successful in life. When his father dies, his mother becomes lost with two boys, and tries to change the behavior of Earl. One day, the boy finds the "true Frankenstein" lost by a Carnival, and decides to bring the monster back to life.', 'Earl Williams is a dreamer teenager obsessed with monsters, who fantasizes his life as if he were living in the world of the monsters of Universal Studios. Although being an excellent student, his intolerant and nasty school teacher Mrs. Perdue does not like him and punishes him for any minor fault. His supportive father Les Williams is also a dreamer, who has never been successful in life. When his father dies, his mother becomes lost with two boys, and tries to change the behavior of Earl. One day, the boy finds the "true Frankenstein" lost by a Carnival, and decides to bring the monster back to life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4QWlmX69UAXlcySa9CJ5Q4Oqj7o.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:3119'),
  ('800621478833199082', 'Frankenstein and the Monster from Hell', 1974, 'Horror, Science Fiction', 'Brian Probyn, Terence Fisher', 'Anthony Hinds', 'Peter Cushing, Shane Briant, Madeline Smith, David Prowse, John Stratton, Michael Ward, Norman Mitchell, Elsie Wagstaff', 'R', 'Dr Simon Helder, sentenced to an insane asylum for crimes against humanity, recognises its director as the brilliant Baron Frankenstein, the man whose work he had been trying to emulate before his imprisonment. Frankenstein utilises Helder''s medical knowledge for a project he has been working on for some time. He is assembling a man from vital organs extracted from various inmates in the asylum. And the Baron will resort to murder to acquire the perfect specimens for his most ambitious project ever.', 'Dr Simon Helder, sentenced to an insane asylum for crimes against humanity, recognises its director as the brilliant Baron Frankenstein, the man whose work he had been trying to emulate before his imprisonment. Frankenstein utilises Helder''s medical knowledge for a project he has been working on for some time. He is assembling a man from vital organs extracted from various inmates in the asylum. And the Baron will resort to murder to acquire the perfect specimens for his most ambitious project ever.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lKcAIHSOHquRgit3F59Z81vdMdl.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:3117'),
  ('141515730793812394', 'Frankenstein Conquers the World', 1965, 'Horror, Science Fiction', 'Ishirō Honda, Hajime Koizumi, Eiji Tsuburaya', 'Takeshi Kimura', 'Tadao Takashima, Nick Adams, Kumi Mizuno, Yoshio Tsuchiya, Koji Furuhata, Jun Tazaki, Susumu Fujita, Takashi Shimura', null, 'During WWII, Germans obtain the immortal heart of Frankenstein''s monster and transport it to Japan to prevent it being seized by the Allies. Kept in a Hiroshima laboratory, it is seeming lost when the United States destroys the city with the atomic bomb. Years later a wild boy is discovered wandering the streets of the city alone, born of the immortal heart.', 'During WWII, Germans obtain the immortal heart of Frankenstein''s monster and transport it to Japan to prevent it being seized by the Allies. Kept in a Hiroshima laboratory, it is seeming lost when the United States destroys the city with the atomic bomb. Years later a wild boy is discovered wandering the streets of the city alone, born of the immortal heart.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wXzG32nsY6i8mMslXGrsHMOZla9.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:3160'),
  ('418232710451915854', 'Frankenstein Created Woman', 1967, 'Horror, Science Fiction', 'Terence Fisher, Arthur Grant, Douglas Hermes', 'Anthony Hinds', 'Peter Cushing, Susan Denberg, Thorley Walters, Robert Morris, Duncan Lamont, Peter Blythe, Barry Warren, Derek Fowlds', null, 'A deformed tormented girl drowns herself after her lover is framed for murder and guillotined. Baron Frankenstein, experimenting with the transfer of souls, places the boy''s soul into her body, bringing Christina back to life. Driven by revenge, she carries out a violent retribution on those responsible for both deaths.', 'A deformed tormented girl drowns herself after her lover is framed for murder and guillotined. Baron Frankenstein, experimenting with the transfer of souls, places the boy''s soul into her body, bringing Christina back to life. Driven by revenge, she carries out a violent retribution on those responsible for both deaths.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1gT7sSKIITCchwCQopAuvxUctDU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:3104'),
  ('666438584668049152', 'Frankenstein General Hospital', 1988, 'Comedy, Horror, Science Fiction', 'Tom Fraser, Deborah Sahagun', 'Robert Deel, Michael Kelly', 'Mark Blankfield, Leslie Jordan, Jonathan Farwell, Kathy Shower, Irwin Keyes, Hamilton Mitchell, Lou Cutell, Katie Caple', null, 'A mad doctor puts together a new body by using body parts he steals from a mortuary at the hospital where he works.', 'A mad doctor puts together a new body by using body parts he steals from a mortuary at the hospital where he works.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fJLMpeI0j9SI6OA8j1ak6gUhzrH.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:3151'),
  ('679134677489056317', 'Frankenstein Island', 1981, 'Horror, Science Fiction', 'Jerry Warren, Murray De Atley', 'Jerry Warren', 'Robert Clarke, Steve Brodie, Cameron Mitchell, Robert Christopher, Tain Bodkin, Patrick O''Neil, Andrew Duggan, John Carradine', 'PG', 'A hot air balloon crew and a dog find themselves on an island with scantily-clad part-alien women, zombies, and other monsters.', 'A hot air balloon crew and a dog find themselves on an island with scantily-clad part-alien women, zombies, and other monsters.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cyQ9LrACK0ynI73ZyvW1XVEAIut.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:3165'),
  ('984841565530831540', 'Frankenstein Meets the Space Monster', 1965, 'Horror, Science Fiction', 'Robert Gaffney, Saul Midwall, Maurice Rosenblum', null, 'Marilyn Hanold, James Karen, Lou Cutell, Nancy Marshall, David Kerman, Robert Reilly, Robert Alan Browne, Robert Fields', null, 'When an atomic war on Mars destroys the planet''s women, it''s up to Martian Princess Marcuzan and her right-hand man Dr. Nadir to travel to earth and kidnap women for new breeding stock. Landing in Puerto Rico, they shoot down a NASA space capsule manned by an android. With his electronic brain damaged, the android terrorizes the island while the Martians raid beaches and pool parties', 'When an atomic war on Mars destroys the planet''s women, it''s up to Martian Princess Marcuzan and her right-hand man Dr. Nadir to travel to earth and kidnap women for new breeding stock. Landing in Puerto Rico, they shoot down a NASA space capsule manned by an android. With his electronic brain damaged, the android terrorizes the island while the Martians raid beaches and pool parties', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mOCOgP4aDnb7qTIy09jqx4T0azd.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:3166'),
  ('357219035049019057', 'Frankenstein Meets the Wolf Man', 1943, 'Horror, Science Fiction', 'George Robinson, Roy William Neill, Bernard B. Brown', 'Curt Siodmak', 'Lon Chaney Jr., Bela Lugosi, Patric Knowles, Ilona Massey, Maria Ouspenskaya, Dennis Hoey, Lionel Atwill, Rex Evans', 'NR', 'Grave robbers open the grave of the wolf man and awaken him. He doesn''t like the idea of being immortal and killing people when the moon is full so tries to find Dr. Frankenstein, in the hopes that the doctor can cure him. Dr. Frankenstein has died; however, his monster is found.', 'Grave robbers open the grave of the wolf man and awaken him. He doesn''t like the idea of being immortal and killing people when the moon is full so tries to find Dr. Frankenstein, in the hopes that the doctor can cure him. Dr. Frankenstein has died; however, his monster is found.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eitxewmvmZXY7qoKpiVhdaFmwMz.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:3076'),
  ('332889879649366466', 'Frankenstein Must Be Destroyed', 1969, 'Horror, Science Fiction', 'Terence Fisher, Arthur Grant, Philip Martell', 'Bert Batt', 'Peter Cushing, Veronica Carlson, Freddie Jones, Simon Ward, Thorley Walters, Maxine Audley, George Pravda, Geoffrey Bayldon', 'PG-13', 'Blackmailing a young couple to assist with his horrific experiments the Baron, desperate for vital medical data, abducts a man from an insane asylum. On route the abductee dies and the Baron and his assistant transplant his brain into a corpse. The creature is tormented by a trapped soul in an alien shell and, after a visit to his wife who violently rejects his monstrous form, the creature wreaks his revenge on the perpetrator of his misery: Baron Frankenstein.', 'Blackmailing a young couple to assist with his horrific experiments the Baron, desperate for vital medical data, abducts a man from an insane asylum. On route the abductee dies and the Baron and his assistant transplant his brain into a corpse. The creature is tormented by a trapped soul in an alien shell and, after a visit to his wife who violently rejects his monstrous form, the creature wreaks his revenge on the perpetrator of his misery: Baron Frankenstein.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rLCCdYBhCm4ATkupOTf4yRbFgm6.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:3075'),
  ('153998756213023179', 'Frankenstein Reborn', 2005, 'Horror, Science Fiction, Thriller', 'Leigh Scott, Steven Parker', 'Leigh Scott', 'Rhett Giles, Thomas Downey, Joel Ezra Hebner, Eliza Swenson, Jeff Denton, Dan Kaplan, Christina Rosenberg, Sarah Lieving', 'NR', 'The latest psychiatrist assigned to assess whether inmate Victor Frank is mentally fit to stand trial for murder gives up in frustration and so the asylum head Dr Robert Walton steps in to do the job. Frank tells Walton his story. He was a scientist experimenting in the field of nanotechnology. Using nanobots that were capable of rebuilding the human body, Frank and his team had great success in helping the crippled, wheelchair-ridden Bryce Daniels regain use of his faculties. But then Bryce started to become unstable...', 'The latest psychiatrist assigned to assess whether inmate Victor Frank is mentally fit to stand trial for murder gives up in frustration and so the asylum head Dr Robert Walton steps in to do the job. Frank tells Walton his story. He was a scientist experimenting in the field of nanotechnology. Using nanobots that were capable of rebuilding the human body, Frank and his team had great success in helping the crippled, wheelchair-ridden Bryce Daniels regain use of his faculties. But then Bryce started to become unstable...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7CLGMQv9mA2TP97ObeAkMMo2i5U.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:3069'),
  ('586489622917058264', 'Frankenstein Reborn!', 1998, 'Horror, Action', 'Viorel Sergovici, David DeCoteau', 'Neal Marshall Stevens', 'Jaason Simmons, Ben Gould, Haven Burton Paschall, Ethan Wilde, George Calin, Oana Ștefănescu, Claudiu Trandafir, Roxana Popa', 'PG', 'Thirteen-year-old Anna is intrigued by the secret experiments of her eccentric uncle Victor, but her curiosity soon turns to total terror when she''s confronted by Uncle Victor''s latest creation - a hideous-looking monster with the soul of a man, stitched together and reanimated from the bodies of the dead.', 'Thirteen-year-old Anna is intrigued by the secret experiments of her eccentric uncle Victor, but her curiosity soon turns to total terror when she''s confronted by Uncle Victor''s latest creation - a hideous-looking monster with the soul of a man, stitched together and reanimated from the bodies of the dead.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hVryDwkgsUyJaXrV3fMOtrLmcex.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:3350'),
  ('706168762893592269', 'Frankenstein Unbound', 1990, 'Horror, Science Fiction', 'Armando Nannuzzi, Roger Corman, Michael Scott', 'F. X. Feeney, Roger Corman', 'John Hurt, Raúl Juliá, Nick Brimble, Bridget Fonda, Jason Patric, Michael Hutchence, Catherine Rabett, Catherine Corman', 'R', 'The ultimate weapon, claimed to be safe for mankind, produces global side-effects including time slides and disappearances. The scientist behind the project and his car are zapped from the year 2031 to 1817 in Switzerland where he meets Dr. Victor Frankenstein, Mary Shelley and others.', 'The ultimate weapon, claimed to be safe for mankind, produces global side-effects including time slides and disappearances. The scientist behind the project and his car are zapped from the year 2031 to 1817 in Switzerland where he meets Dr. Victor Frankenstein, Mary Shelley and others.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/r5l1RDSOShMrUmRtiADxrq3ig00.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:3072'),
  ('70625986267658214', 'Frankenstein vs. The Mummy', 2015, 'Horror', 'George Steuber, Damien Leone', 'Damien Leone', 'Max Rhyser, Ashton Leigh, Boomer Tibbs, Brandon deSpain, Constantin Tripes, Robert MacNaughton, Michael Chmiel, John Pickett', null, 'The mummy of a cursed pharaoh and a reanimated corpse terrorize a medical university. Only an Egyptologist and a college professor, the deranged Dr. Frankenstein, may be able to stop the creatures before it''s too late.', 'The mummy of a cursed pharaoh and a reanimated corpse terrorize a medical university. Only an Egyptologist and a college professor, the deranged Dr. Frankenstein, may be able to stop the creatures before it''s too late.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bZMW2zU5JwmLAQ81hy0TolXiHBC.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:319188'),
  ('527876503594062224', 'Frankenstein, the Vampire and Company', 1962, 'Horror, Comedy, Science Fiction', 'Benito Alazraki, Enrique Wallace', 'Alfredo Salazar', 'Manuel Valdés, Martha Elena Cervantes, Nora Veryán, Roberto G. Rivera, José Jasso, Joaquín García Vargas, Quintín Bulnes, Antonio Bravo', null, 'Two screwballs get mixed up with monsters, mad scientists and vampires.', 'Two screwballs get mixed up with monsters, mad scientists and vampires.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/co3hXlHXkCl3vBSKgAKepHtRsK0.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:3346'),
  ('420181422551007339', 'Frankenstein: The Anatomy Lesson', 2025, 'Documentary', null, null, 'Guillermo del Toro, Oscar Isaac, J. Miles Dale, Scott Stuber, Jacob Elordi, Felix Kammerer, Mia Goth, Christoph Waltz', 'R', 'Go deep behind the scenes with visionary filmmaker Guillermo del Toro and the "Frankenstein" cast and crew as they give new life to the classic tale.', 'Go deep behind the scenes with visionary filmmaker Guillermo del Toro and the "Frankenstein" cast and crew as they give new life to the classic tale.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/l1F9EIwShcQX7kmnqucIBsXUG5S.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1576287'),
  ('808267963931634373', 'Frankenstein: The College Years', 1991, 'Comedy, Science Fiction, TV Movie', 'Tom Shadyac, Stephen C. Confer', 'Bryant Christ, John Trevor Wolff', 'William Ragsdale, Christopher Daniel Barnes, Larry Miller, Andrea Elson, De''voreaux White, Patrick Richwood, Greg Grunberg, Vincent Hammond', null, 'When professor Lippzigger dies, his favorite student Mark inherits the key to his secret laboratory. There he and his friend Jay find the hundreds of years old body of Frankenstein - and revive it. But where to go with him? They take him with them to their dorms. He''s dumb as a brick, but makes it into their football team and becomes popular. If there only wasn''t Prof. Loman, who wants to become famous with Lipp''s inventions...', 'When professor Lippzigger dies, his favorite student Mark inherits the key to his secret laboratory. There he and his friend Jay find the hundreds of years old body of Frankenstein - and revive it. But where to go with him? They take him with them to their dorms. He''s dumb as a brick, but makes it into their football team and becomes popular. If there only wasn''t Prof. Loman, who wants to become famous with Lipp''s inventions...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/f4oeKHJqUbS1cZ2OKs1Wt5QK4GK.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:3288'),
  ('473979623866750156', 'Frankenstein: The True Story', 1974, 'Drama, Horror, Science Fiction', 'Arthur Ibbetson, Jack Smight', null, 'James Mason, Leonard Whiting, David McCallum, Jane Seymour, Nicola Pagett, Michael Sarrazin, Michael Wilding, Tom Baker', null, 'Victor Frankenstein witnesses his creation turn uncontrollable after he''s duped by his associate, Dr. Polidori.', 'Victor Frankenstein witnesses his creation turn uncontrollable after he''s duped by his associate, Dr. Polidori.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/d9ZrCrFiIcZzc2AtLItAhWFsFnY.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:3105'),
  ('622417110062685865', 'Frankenstein’s Army', 2013, 'Action, Horror', 'Richard Raaphorst, Bart Beekman', 'Chris W. Mitchell, Miguel Tejada-Flores', 'Karel Roden, Joshua Sasse, Robert Gwilym, Alexander Terentyev, Luke Newberry, Hon Ping Tang, Andrei Zayats, Mark Stevenson', 'R', 'Toward the end of World War II, Russian soldiers pushing into eastern Germany stumble across a secret Nazi lab, one that has unearthed and begun experimenting with the journal of one Dr. Victor Frankenstein. The scientists have used the legendary Frankenstein''s work to assemble an army of super-soldiers stitched together from the body parts of their fallen comrades -- a desperate Hitler''s last ghastly ploy to escape defeat', 'Toward the end of World War II, Russian soldiers pushing into eastern Germany stumble across a secret Nazi lab, one that has unearthed and begun experimenting with the journal of one Dr. Victor Frankenstein. The scientists have used the legendary Frankenstein''s work to assemble an army of super-soldiers stitched together from the body parts of their fallen comrades -- a desperate Hitler''s last ghastly ploy to escape defeat', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tBDuUfnAyN2OTHhyy4xyUrU8C2A.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:153738'),
  ('443336295815351101', 'Frankenstein''s Bloody Terror', 1968, 'Horror', 'Enrique López Eguiluz, Emilio Foriscot', 'Paul Naschy', 'Paul Naschy, Dyanik Zurakowska, Manuel Manzaneque, Aurora de Alba, Julián Ugarte, José Nieto, Rosanna Yanni, Gualberto Galbán', null, 'A man suffers from the curse of lycanthrope and seeks help from doctor and wife team. They both turn out to be vampires and end up dueling it out with the werewolf star.', 'A man suffers from the curse of lycanthrope and seeks help from doctor and wife team. They both turn out to be vampires and end up dueling it out with the werewolf star.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tlGLSByJLfgp8iho5eqG2KhiIG0.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:27398'),
  ('743417929498630296', 'Frankenstein''s Bride', 2026, 'Horror', 'Erica Duke', 'Ryan Ebert, M.L. Miller', 'Sev Philippou, Nick Launchbury, Emma De Maria, Vincent Donato', 'Not Rated', 'On the day of Frankenstein''s Monster''s wedding, villagers riot and kill him. His bride escapes, vows revenge on the townsfolk responsible, and eventually resurrects the Monster - leaving a trail of blood in her wake.', 'On the day of Frankenstein''s Monster''s wedding, villagers riot and kill him. His bride escapes, vows revenge on the townsfolk responsible, and eventually resurrects the Monster - leaving a trail of blood in her wake.', 'https://images.plex.tv/photo?size=large-1280&url=https%3A%2F%2Fimage.tmdb.org%2Ft%2Fp%2Foriginal%2FuCzPZIVVqy6kWo4pu3JqYdsq5Ox.jpg', 'plex:movie:frankensteins-bride-2026'),
  ('323033233216322721', 'Frankenstein''s Castle of Freaks', 1974, 'Horror', 'Mario Mancini, Dick Randall', 'William Rose, Roberto Spano, Mark Smith', 'Rossano Brazzi, Michael Dunn, Edmund Purdom, Gordon Mitchell, Loren Ewing, Luciano Pigozzi, Xiro Papas, Salvatore Baccaro', 'PG', 'Mad Dr Frankenstein recruits an evil dwarf, a Neanderthal man, and others to help him put a brain in the body of a brute.', 'Mad Dr Frankenstein recruits an evil dwarf, a Neanderthal man, and others to help him put a brain in the body of a brute.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/r0CX7tL90LNjSG6ewsoQgaf9XMW.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:3159'),
  ('919911651772728958', 'Frankenstein''s Daughter', 1958, 'Horror, Science Fiction', 'Richard E. Cunha, Meredith M. Nicholson', 'H.E. Barrie', 'Donald Murphy, Sandra Knight, John Ashley, Felix Locher, Wolfe Barzell, Harry Wilson, Sally Todd, Harold Lloyd Jr.', 'NR', 'Dr. Frankenstein''s insane grandson attempts to create horrible monsters in modern day L.A.', 'Dr. Frankenstein''s insane grandson attempts to create horrible monsters in modern day L.A.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/n8n3VS6qiLbiQvh435wceDB53NJ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:45674'),
  ('823644959266996292', 'Frankenstein''s Great Aunt Tillie', 1984, 'Comedy, Horror, Science Fiction', 'Myron J. Gold, Roberto Schlosser, Miguel Garzón', 'Myron J. Gold', 'Donald Pleasence, Yvonne Furneaux, June Wilkinson, Zsa Zsa Gabor, Aldo Ray, Miguel Ángel Fuentes, Rod Colbin, Chandler Garrison', 'NR', 'The descendants of Baron Frankenstein return to the family castle to search for the family fortune that is supposed to be hidden there.', 'The descendants of Baron Frankenstein return to the family castle to search for the family fortune that is supposed to be hidden there.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/e0dvMIfc47G6QsIWnw3jcNbquLj.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:322502'),
  ('1018091197880896684', 'Frankenstein''s Monster''s Monster, Frankenstein', 2019, 'Comedy', 'Carl Herse, Jeffrey Pallotta, Vanessa Portillo', 'John Levenstein', 'David Harbour, Kate Berlant, Alex Ozerov-Meyer, Alfred Molina, Michael Lerner, Mary Woronov, Marion Van Cuyck, Lidia Porto', null, 'When actor David Harbour finds lost footage of his father''s disastrous televised stage play of a literary classic, he uncovers shocking family secrets.', 'When actor David Harbour finds lost footage of his father''s disastrous televised stage play of a literary classic, he uncovers shocking family secrets.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aVrXQAk0lIRw123EghPfNlludjU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:612701'),
  ('667548418609635102', 'Frankenweenie', 1984, 'Horror, Family, Science Fiction, Comedy', 'Tim Burton, Scott Cameron, Thomas E. Ackerman', 'Tim Burton, Leonard Ripps', 'Barret Oliver, Shelley Duvall, Daniel Stern, Joseph Maher, Roz Braverman, Paul Bartel, Sofia Coppola, Jason Hervey', 'PG', 'When young Victor''s pet dog Sparky (who stars in Victor''s home-made monster movies) is hit by a car, Victor decides to bring him back to life the only way he knows how. But when the bolt-necked "monster" wreaks havoc and terror in the hearts of Victor''s neighbors, he has to convince them (and his parents) that despite his appearance, Sparky''s still the good loyal friend he''s always been.', 'When young Victor''s pet dog Sparky (who stars in Victor''s home-made monster movies) is hit by a car, Victor decides to bring him back to life the only way he knows how. But when the bolt-necked "monster" wreaks havoc and terror in the hearts of Victor''s neighbors, he has to convince them (and his parents) that despite his appearance, Sparky''s still the good loyal friend he''s always been.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/10MHgLe0ZEX0xSLHghgy6mvUyIF.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:33914'),
  ('12716451279903977', 'Frankenweenie', 2012, 'Animation, Comedy, Family', 'Tim Burton, Peter Sorg, Trey Thomas', 'John August', 'Catherine O''Hara, Martin Short, Martin Landau, Charlie Tahan, Atticus Shaffer, Winona Ryder, Robert Capron, James Hiroyuki Liao', 'PG', 'When a car hits young Victor''s pet dog Sparky, Victor decides to bring him back to life the only way he knows how. But when the bolt-necked "monster" wreaks havoc and terror in the hearts of Victor''s neighbors, he has to convince them that Sparky''s still the good, loyal friend he was.', 'When a car hits young Victor''s pet dog Sparky, Victor decides to bring him back to life the only way he knows how. But when the bolt-necked "monster" wreaks havoc and terror in the hearts of Victor''s neighbors, he has to convince them that Sparky''s still the good, loyal friend he was.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yGjVbLVdZRBlZTTQVBsj2KUjL1s.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:62214'),
  ('925859952121604401', 'Frankfurt: The Face of a City', 1981, 'Thriller, Action', 'Roger Fritz, Ernst W. Kalinke, Fritz Baader', 'Georg Ensor', 'Michaela Karger, Dave Balko, Hanno Pöschl, Ute Zielinski, Gene Reed, Kurt Raab, Isolde Barth, Nicole Dörfler', null, 'Bored with her stuffy village life, teenager Susanne decides to run away to the bright lights Frankfurt, while her boyfriend does his military. Caught in the swamp of drugs, prostitution, violence and human trafficking, Susanne experiences the dark side of the big city.', 'Bored with her stuffy village life, teenager Susanne decides to run away to the bright lights Frankfurt, while her boyfriend does his military. Caught in the swamp of drugs, prostitution, violence and human trafficking, Susanne experiences the dark side of the big city.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eWgIDGThWbBFu4Hn3QKzxrDwuYg.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:297793'),
  ('426482437777553228', 'Frankie', 2019, 'Drama', 'Ira Sachs, Rui Poças', 'Ira Sachs, Mauricio Zacharias', 'Isabelle Huppert, Brendan Gleeson, Greg Kinnear, Marisa Tomei, Jérémie Renier, Pascal Greggory, Ariyon Bakare, Vinette Robinson', null, 'When a terminally ill French actress decides to spend her last vacation with her large family in Sintra, her relatives grapple with their own insecurities.', 'When a terminally ill French actress decides to spend her last vacation with her large family in Sintra, her relatives grapple with their own insecurities.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7w08bcG8IIM5vk3lwAnvwTDUncv.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:505941'),
  ('177165033554673802', 'Frankie & Alice', 2010, 'Drama, Thriller', 'Geoffrey Sax, Newton Thomas Sigel', 'Cheryl Edwards, Joe Shrapnel, Anna Waterhouse', 'Halle Berry, Stellan Skarsgård, Phylicia Rashād, Chandra Wilson, Adrian Holmes, Melanie Papalia, Rosalyn Coleman, Brian Markinson', 'R', 'A drama centered on a go-go dancer with multiple personality disorder who struggles to remain her true self and begins working with a psychotherapist to uncover the mystery of the inner ghosts that haunt her.', 'A drama centered on a go-go dancer with multiple personality disorder who struggles to remain her true self and begins working with a psychotherapist to uncover the mystery of the inner ghosts that haunt her.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4zXkZirn2QezrEFHWeAOkOxdjxj.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:55061'),
  ('63084885543083150', 'Frankie and Johnny', 1966, 'Comedy, Music, Romance', 'Frederick de Cordova, Jacques R. Marquette, Earl Barton', 'Alex Gottlieb', 'Elvis Presley, Donna Douglas, Harry Morgan, Sue Ane Langdon, Nancy Kovack, Audrey Christie, Robert Strauss, Anthony Eisley', 'NR', 'Johnny is a riverboat entertainer with a big gambling problem. After a fortune-teller tells Johnny how he can change his luck, the appearance of a new ''lady luck'' soon causes a cat fight with Johnny''s girlfriend, Frankie.', 'Johnny is a riverboat entertainer with a big gambling problem. After a fortune-teller tells Johnny how he can change his luck, the appearance of a new ''lady luck'' soon causes a cat fight with Johnny''s girlfriend, Frankie.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/p0FXqTJ8fNASnJRxW8PYE5lfM6L.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:18691'),
  ('664148125949462433', 'Frankie and Johnny', 1991, 'Drama, Romance, Comedy', 'Dante Spinotti, Garry Marshall', 'Terrence McNally', 'Al Pacino, Michelle Pfeiffer, Héctor Elizondo, Nathan Lane, Jane Morris, Kate Nelligan, Greg Lewis, Al Fann', 'R', 'When Johnny is released from prison following a forgery charge, he quickly lands a job as a short-order cook at a New York diner. Following a brief fling with waitress Cora, he develops an attraction for Cora''s friend and fellow waitress Frankie. While Frankie resists Johnny''s charms initially, she eventually relents when her best friend, Tim, persuades her to give Johnny a chance.', 'When Johnny is released from prison following a forgery charge, he quickly lands a job as a short-order cook at a New York diner. Following a brief fling with waitress Cora, he develops an attraction for Cora''s friend and fellow waitress Frankie. While Frankie resists Johnny''s charms initially, she eventually relents when her best friend, Tim, persuades her to give Johnny a chance.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zSOh7hriX4mQNVxhCz1yVY4aykn.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:3784'),
  ('248900263286642332', 'Frankie Boyle: Live', 2008, 'Comedy', 'Brian Klein', 'Frankie Boyle', 'Frankie Boyle', null, 'Critically acclaimed comedian Frankie Boyle presents his hotly-anticipated first live stand-up DVD. Recorded live during his sell-out shows at London''s Hackney Empire, Frankie''s unique brand of observational comedy and brutal but perfectly constructed one-liners prove he is one of the best gag writers in the business.', 'Critically acclaimed comedian Frankie Boyle presents his hotly-anticipated first live stand-up DVD. Recorded live during his sell-out shows at London''s Hackney Empire, Frankie''s unique brand of observational comedy and brutal but perfectly constructed one-liners prove he is one of the best gag writers in the business.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aYWXrdv10ODyGeVs1P1YIMnWoQn.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:18199'),
  ('538728283106931892', 'Frankie Freako', 2024, 'Fantasy, Comedy, Horror', 'Steven Kostanski, Pierce Derks, Scott Weatherall', 'Steven Kostanski', 'Conor Sweeney, Kristy Wordsworth, Adam Brooks, Matthew Kennedy, Meredith Sweeney, Rich Evans, Rob Schrab, Patrick Baxter', null, 'After calling a late-night party hotline that promises out-of-this-world fun, uptight yuppie Conor Sweeney must battle the pint-sized forces of evil unleashed through his phone line, led by the maniacal rock n’ roll goblin FRANKIE FREAKO.', 'After calling a late-night party hotline that promises out-of-this-world fun, uptight yuppie Conor Sweeney must battle the pint-sized forces of evil unleashed through his phone line, led by the maniacal rock n’ roll goblin FRANKIE FREAKO.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8xjOFXj0CHy5Mp6Wfsr2iIXTtZ5.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1127407'),
  ('52432484524073826', 'Frankie Starlight', 1995, 'Drama, Romance, War', 'Michael Lindsay-Hogg, Paul Laufer', 'Chet Raymo, Ronan O''Leary', 'Matt Dillon, Corban Walker, Gabriel Byrne, Anne Parillaud, Niall Tóibín, Owen Roe, Colin Farrell, Barbara Alyn Woods', null, 'The quirky story of a young boy''s adventures growing up with his stunningly beautiful mother and the two very different men who love her.', 'The quirky story of a young boy''s adventures growing up with his stunningly beautiful mother and the two very different men who love her.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6v3VxWhFsr2Qx8qIQkG4WL3f76X.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:73067'),
  ('241770648604035891', 'Franklin and the Turtle Lake Treasure', 2006, 'Animation, Family, Fantasy, Comedy', 'Dominique Monfery', 'John van Bruggen, Jean-Jacques Pron, Charles Tellac', 'Louise Cheka, Kevin Sommier, Ariane Aggiage, Isabelle Volpe, Ivana Coppola, Eric Peter, Isabelle Gance, Benoît Allemane', null, 'When his Granny comes down with a mysterious ailment, Franklin and his friends must search for the treasure of Turtle Lake. This is said to be a talisman that can cure the illness.', 'When his Granny comes down with a mysterious ailment, Franklin and his friends must search for the treasure of Turtle Lake. This is said to be a talisman that can cure the illness.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/28DpvauJIlVLq6WHOXXjg9A0yWe.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:34466'),
  ('1075508878671618342', 'Franklyn', 2008, 'Fantasy, Thriller, Drama', 'Gerald McMorrow, Ben Davis, Simon Downes', 'Gerald McMorrow', 'Eva Green, Ryan Phillippe, Bernard Hill, Sam Riley, Art Malik, Richard Coyle, Susannah York, Kika Markham', 'R', 'Set between the parallel worlds of contemporary London and the futuristic faith dominated metropolis of Meanwhile City, Franklyn weaves a tale of four souls, whose lives are intertwined by fate, romance and tragedy. As these worlds collide, a single bullet determines the destiny of these four characters.', 'Set between the parallel worlds of contemporary London and the futuristic faith dominated metropolis of Meanwhile City, Franklyn weaves a tale of four souls, whose lives are intertwined by fate, romance and tragedy. As these worlds collide, a single bullet determines the destiny of these four characters.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5yns10om8I19j4OHy1zoVRilAnw.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:8884'),
  ('1107875178857893185', 'Frantic', 1988, 'Mystery, Crime, Drama', 'Roman Polanski, Witold Sobociński, Albert Rajau', 'Roman Polanski, Gérard Brach', 'Harrison Ford, Emmanuelle Seigner, Betty Buckley, Dominique Pinon, Jacques Ciron, John Mahoney, Jimmie Ray Weeks, David Huddleston', 'R', 'The wife of an American doctor suddenly vanishes in Paris. To find her, he navigates a puzzling web of language, locale, laissez-faire cops, triplicate-form filling bureaucrats and a defiant, mysterious waif who knows more than she tells.', 'The wife of an American doctor suddenly vanishes in Paris. To find her, he navigates a puzzling web of language, locale, laissez-faire cops, triplicate-form filling bureaucrats and a defiant, mysterious waif who knows more than she tells.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vM7F5cwwxuw43roKjSSksH1sDeX.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:10675'),
  ('62206237893701592', 'Frantz', 2016, 'History, Drama, Romance', 'François Ozon, Pascal Marti, Clément Colin', 'Philippe Piazzo', 'Pierre Niney, Paula Beer, Ernst Stötzner, Marie Gruber, Johann von Bülow, Anton von Lucke, Cyrielle Clair, Alice de Lencquesaing', 'PG-13', 'In the aftermath of WWI, a young German who grieves the death of her fiancé in France meets a mysterious French man who visits the fiance’s grave to lay flowers.', 'In the aftermath of WWI, a young German who grieves the death of her fiancé in France meets a mysterious French man who visits the fiance’s grave to lay flowers.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cL77uNb2BB8eXjYl9JIrWXCM8so.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:377263'),
  ('1150768052828616364', 'Franz', 1972, 'Drama, Romance', 'Jacques Brel, Alain Levent', 'Paul Andréota, Jacques Brel', 'Jacques Brel, Barbara, Danièle Evenou, Fernand Fabre, Louis Navarre, Ceel, Serge Sauvion, François Cadet', null, 'In a French seaside town, at a boarding house for civil servants recovering from surgery and maladies, the six male residents'' lives change dramatically when two women arrive: Catherine, lively, sexually liberated, willing to kiss, dance, and sleep with the men, and Leonie, reserved, formal, conservative. Leonie finds herself attracted to Leon, a Belgian who was a mercenary in Katanga in 1964, wounded and carrying psychological scars as well. The other men continually play practical jokes on Leon, some of them cruel. As Leon courts Leonie, his horrid mother brings him emotional distress as do his memories of war. Can the two of them get past these obstacles?', 'In a French seaside town, at a boarding house for civil servants recovering from surgery and maladies, the six male residents'' lives change dramatically when two women arrive: Catherine, lively, sexually liberated, willing to kiss, dance, and sleep with the men, and Leonie, reserved, formal, conservative. Leonie finds herself attracted to Leon, a Belgian who was a mercenary in Katanga in 1964, wounded and carrying psychological scars as well. The other men continually play practical jokes on Leon, some of them cruel. As Leon courts Leonie, his horrid mother brings him emotional distress as do his memories of war. Can the two of them get past these obstacles?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gwbRWqby10F83CkkDiWHSKLUAya.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:31307'),
  ('534962075013154665', 'Franz Kafka', 1992, 'Animation, Fantasy, Drama', 'Piotr Dumała', 'Piotr Dumała', null, null, 'A fantasy biography of Franz Kafka, bringing to life the writer''s diaries and photographs.', 'A fantasy biography of Franz Kafka, bringing to life the writer''s diaries and photographs.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lYYxfpKS52ZCkNyLreRQu1yQVoB.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:120275'),
  ('31818289352650364', 'Franz Kafka''s a Country Doctor', 2007, 'Animation, Drama', 'Koji Yamamura', null, 'Sensaku Shigeyama', null, 'A hapless country doctor describes with breathless urgency a night-time summons to attend a young patient. Events soon take on a surreal aspect as "unearthly horses" transport him instantaneously to the bedside. The doctor, preoccupied with personal distractions and grievances against those he is employed to care for, fails to find what is revealed to be a vile, fatal wound. He is humiliated by the villagers, who are "always expecting the impossible from the doctor," and doomed to an endless return trip, losing everything.', 'A hapless country doctor describes with breathless urgency a night-time summons to attend a young patient. Events soon take on a surreal aspect as "unearthly horses" transport him instantaneously to the bedside. The doctor, preoccupied with personal distractions and grievances against those he is employed to care for, fails to find what is revealed to be a vile, fatal wound. He is humiliated by the villagers, who are "always expecting the impossible from the doctor," and doomed to an endless return trip, losing everything.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/axVkLAB0aR51oq6BPZ92GZdMJMf.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:73714'),
  ('1142985869859580903', 'Franz Kafka''s It''s a Wonderful Life', 1993, 'Comedy, Fantasy', 'Peter Capaldi, Alison Begg, Sophie Francis', 'Peter Capaldi', 'Richard E. Grant, Elaine Collins, Crispin Letts, Phyllis Logan, Ken Stott, Julie Cox, Jessie Doyle, Sammy Sheldon', null, 'Franz Kafka is working on his Metamorphosis, but he''s suffering from writer''s block; he can''t get off on the right track. While trying to decide what Gregor Samsa is going to wake up as, he is constantly interrupted by door-to-door salesmen, young women, and his own inexplicable hallucinations.', 'Franz Kafka is working on his Metamorphosis, but he''s suffering from writer''s block; he can''t get off on the right track. While trying to decide what Gregor Samsa is going to wake up as, he is constantly interrupted by door-to-door salesmen, young women, and his own inexplicable hallucinations.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5lHyjxGiqiROJKc3BwgNCSFjgWF.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:47981'),
  ('658264406762096018', 'Frat House', 1998, 'Documentary', 'Todd Phillips, Andrew Gurland', null, null, null, 'Frat House is a documentary film exploring the darker side of fraternity life, largely filmed at Allentown, Pennsylvania''s Muhlenberg College; the majority of the film was shot in the house of the Alpha Tau Omega fraternity.', 'Frat House is a documentary film exploring the darker side of fraternity life, largely filmed at Allentown, Pennsylvania''s Muhlenberg College; the majority of the film was shot in the house of the Alpha Tau Omega fraternity.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ymlvb6RI8Lra4KtbDTjaEbzU9Vy.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:54641'),
  ('831006212034908318', 'Frat Party', 2009, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Robert Bennett, James Currier, William Garcia', 'Robert Bennett', 'Randy Wayne, Caroline D''Amore, Jareb Dauplaise, Lauren C. Mayhew, Dan Levy, Katerina Mikailenko, Robert Parks-Valletta, Alicia Ziegler', 'R', 'Duffy, the big man on campus, is marrying Adriana, a debutante heiress to a global wine fortune, right after they both graduate from the same prestigious university. Unfortunately, the final frat party of his college career is the night before his wedding, and there are many obstacles in his way, including a soon to be father-in-law who is less than happy with his daughter''s choice.', 'Duffy, the big man on campus, is marrying Adriana, a debutante heiress to a global wine fortune, right after they both graduate from the same prestigious university. Unfortunately, the final frat party of his college career is the night before his wedding, and there are many obstacles in his way, including a soon to be father-in-law who is less than happy with his daughter''s choice.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tBevHrPcJOlDVLsIpWU5N7Rskox.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:26673'),
  ('1061014066643500779', 'Fratè', 2022, 'Comedy', 'Karole Rocher, Barbara Biancardini, Julie Allione', 'Thomas Ngijol, Patrick Rocher', 'Thomas Ngijol, Samir Guesmi, Marie-Ange Geronimi, Jean-Pierre Lanfranchi, Aurélien Gabrielli, Karole Rocher, Gina Jimenez, Cédric Appietto', null, 'Following the burial of his father, in his village right in the middle of the Corsican countryside , Dumè discovered the existence of a brother, Lucien, with whom he will have to share the inheritance left by the patriarch... On the condition of being able to live together for a month in the family home. Under the backdrop of cultural legitimacy and of real estate inheritance a balance of power will be established between Lucien, the blood son, and Dumè, the adopted son.', 'Following the burial of his father, in his village right in the middle of the Corsican countryside , Dumè discovered the existence of a brother, Lucien, with whom he will have to share the inheritance left by the patriarch... On the condition of being able to live together for a month in the family home. Under the backdrop of cultural legitimacy and of real estate inheritance a balance of power will be established between Lucien, the blood son, and Dumè, the adopted son.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vAKsz9BaZrjNf8vAr1CBDX3nsTn.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:960815'),
  ('1077300817975087565', 'Fratelli coltelli', 1997, 'Comedy', 'Maurizio Calvesi, Maurizio Ponzi', 'Enrico Vanzina, Franco Ferrini, Emilio Solfrizzi', 'Fabio Canino, Emilio Solfrizzi, Antonio Stornaiolo, Simona Ventura, Dante Marmone, Flavio Bucci, Katia Beni, Graziella Scaliarini', null, 'Guelfo is a Florentine noble who has never worked and has no money. On the death of his mother, he believes he can inherit a large fortune, but from the notary he learns that he has an illegitimate brother with whom he will have to share half of his inheritance. His brother is called Felice, he works as a waiter in Bari and goes to Florence with a student friend who is indebted to the usurers. A rivalry without quarter begins between the two brothers.', 'Guelfo is a Florentine noble who has never worked and has no money. On the death of his mother, he believes he can inherit a large fortune, but from the notary he learns that he has an illegitimate brother with whom he will have to share half of his inheritance. His brother is called Felice, he works as a waiter in Bari and goes to Florence with a student friend who is indebted to the usurers. A rivalry without quarter begins between the two brothers.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/b27nT4tzYlaAod3kBFDFrQZl9n7.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:284994'),
  ('510034615527178415', 'Fratelli d''Italia', 1989, 'Comedy', 'Neri Parenti, Roberto Gerardi, Maria Pia Rocco', 'Enrico Vanzina, Carlo Vanzina', 'Christian De Sica, Jerry Calà, Massimo Boldi, Sabrina Salerno, Nathalie Caldonazzo, Fabrizio Bracconeri, Gian, Angelo Bernabucci', null, 'Three episodes held together by a common element: a car rented by three different characters.', 'Three episodes held together by a common element: a car rented by three different characters.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wRI6pxyvy9vfvW3WvrEnxF8Y8y9.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:38525'),
