  ('402369162189220381', 'Fraternity Demon', 1992, 'Comedy', 'C.B. Rubin', 'Steve Tymon', 'Trixxie Bowie, Charles Laulette, Deborah Thompson Duda, Michael McKay, Josh Holland, Adam Lieberman, Victor Newmark, Al Darrouch', 'R', 'Some college kids accidently unleash a sex demon and she ends up turning a frat party inside out.', 'Some college kids accidently unleash a sex demon and she ends up turning a frat party inside out.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/n4EK1PY5ryBD7iV6eT0jdrQQdHg.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:112582'),
  ('871564511853887368', 'Fraternity Vacation', 1985, 'Comedy, Romance', 'James Frawley, Paul Ryan, Bill Carroll', 'Lindsay Harrison', 'Stephen Geoffreys, Sheree J. Wilson, Cameron Dye, Leigh McCloskey, Tim Robbins, Matt McCoy, Amanda Bearse, John Vernon', 'R', 'A nerd gains the friendship of two of his frat brothers when his dad offers them his condo for the week in Palm Springs, and also offers the fraternity a hot tub and jacuzzi if they can help his son find a girl. They meet two guys from a rival fraternity, and make a bet on who can nail the Designated Babe first.', 'A nerd gains the friendship of two of his frat brothers when his dad offers them his condo for the week in Palm Springs, and also offers the fraternity a hot tub and jacuzzi if they can help his son find a girl. They meet two guys from a rival fraternity, and make a bet on who can nail the Designated Babe first.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sHglZYlTpIFqORB5TzTA3ACNdhn.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:24585'),
