  ('1007143229016815176', 'Fraud Saiyaan', 2019, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Sourabh Shrivastava', 'Amal Donwaar, Sharad Tripathi', 'Arshad Warsi, Saurabh Shukla, Flora Saini, Varun Badola, Sara Loren, Deepali Pansare, Nivedita Tiwari, Peeyush Suhaney', null, 'The story of a con artist in North India who convinces women to marry him just so he can live off their money.', 'The story of a con artist in North India who convinces women to marry him just so he can live off their money.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jobB4ZKJSxvXwXgvtXz8HNMYhab.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:569494'),
  ('301259684345273901', 'Frauds', 1993, 'Comedy, Crime, Thriller', 'Stephan Elliott, Geoff Burton, John Martin', 'Stephan Elliott', 'Phil Collins, Hugo Weaving, Josephine Byrnes, Peter Mochrie, Helen O''Connor, Colleen Clifford, Vincent Ball, Gandhi MacIntyre', null, 'The film is a story of the ways in which insurance investigator Roland Copping interferes in and manipulates the lives of others with outrageous games and gimmicks. Eventually he becomes involved in an escalating vendetta with a couple who make an unusual insurance claim.', 'The film is a story of the ways in which insurance investigator Roland Copping interferes in and manipulates the lives of others with outrageous games and gimmicks. Eventually he becomes involved in an escalating vendetta with a couple who make an unusual insurance claim.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oSBsYeNWt1h5WbTnx2JCPZy6nHg.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:114556'),
  ('122778536032142044', 'Fraulein', 2006, 'Drama', 'Andrea Štaka, Igor Martinović', 'Marie Kreutzer, Barbara Albert, Andrea Štaka', 'Mirjana Karanović, Andrea Zogg, Marija Škaričić, Pablo Aguilar, David Imhoof, Sebastian Krähenbühl, Ljubica Jović, Oliver Zgorelec', null, 'Ruža left Serbia, her country, over 30 years ago and lives in Zurich. Her daily life is a string of repetitive moments until, one day, Ana arrives on the scene and upsets Ruža''s painstakingly organized world. A subtle friendship develops between the two strong willed women.', 'Ruža left Serbia, her country, over 30 years ago and lives in Zurich. Her daily life is a string of repetitive moments until, one day, Ana arrives on the scene and upsets Ruža''s painstakingly organized world. A subtle friendship develops between the two strong willed women.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/a7OdfSEs6yHLJsEdQRBxFZHrClS.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:10420'),
  ('518410334035027737', 'Fräulein - A Winter’s Tale', 2016, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Caterina Carone, Melanie Brugger', 'Caterina Carone, Caterina Carone', 'Christian De Sica, Lucia Mascino, Irina Wrona, Max Mazzotta, Therese Hämer, Andrea Germani, Jasmin Barbara Mairhofer, Luigi Delladio', null, 'As a solar storm unfolds, causing power surges and blackouts, a storm of emotions rages within Regina, a spinster referred to as Fräulein, when a childlike sexagenarian checks into her hotel. What should be one night becomes a stormy coexistence all its own.', 'As a solar storm unfolds, causing power surges and blackouts, a storm of emotions rages within Regina, a spinster referred to as Fräulein, when a childlike sexagenarian checks into her hotel. What should be one night becomes a stormy coexistence all its own.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/33nzVqOfEuzTHhIbfBGd3YlXi8W.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:399343'),
  ('1614232057155643', 'Frayed', 2007, 'Horror, Thriller', 'Rob Portmann, Norbert Caoili', 'Rob Portmann, Norbert Caoili, Dino Moore', 'Tony Doupe, Don Brady, Aaron Blakely, Alena Dashiell, Tasha Smith-Floe, Kellee Bradley, Rachel Pate, Tim Evans', 'R', 'Pat Baker is a small town sheriff. His son, Kurt, is a deranged young man with a dark secret. Sheriff Baker''s worst nightmare comes true when Kurt escapes from a psychiatric hospital where he was locked away for the brutal murder of his mother thirteen years earlier. Gary, a hospital security guard, sets out into the woods to stop him, but soon finds himself relentlessly hunted by the deranged psychopath intent on killing him and anyone who crosses his path. Sheriff Baker launches an intense search to find his son, only to discover that his daughter, Sara, and her friends are camping in the same woods where Kurt has escaped. Kurt''s psychosis escalates, as does his vengeful killing spree, culminating in a terrifying, climactic confrontation with Kurt, the sheriff and his family.', 'Pat Baker is a small town sheriff. His son, Kurt, is a deranged young man with a dark secret. Sheriff Baker''s worst nightmare comes true when Kurt escapes from a psychiatric hospital where he was locked away for the brutal murder of his mother thirteen years earlier. Gary, a hospital security guard, sets out into the woods to stop him, but soon finds himself relentlessly hunted by the deranged psychopath intent on killing him and anyone who crosses his path. Sheriff Baker launches an intense search to find his son, only to discover that his daughter, Sara, and her friends are camping in the same woods where Kurt has escaped. Kurt''s psychosis escalates, as does his vengeful killing spree, culminating in a terrifying, climactic confrontation with Kurt, the sheriff and his family.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/d79orWLtNE9I9vJQb3q8Ze9OxIm.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:50376'),
  ('649148041185639536', 'Freak Orlando', 1981, 'Comedy, Fantasy', 'Ulrike Ottinger, Bettina Woernle, Eva Ebner', 'Ulrike Ottinger', 'Magdalena Montezuma, Delphine Seyrig, Albert Heins, Claudio Pantoja, Hiro Uchiyama, Galli, Eddie Constantine, Else Nabu', null, 'Five more-or-less distinct sections, all featuring "Freak" Orlando, a woman played by the late Magdalena Montezuma, who appears in various guises and deformities throughout.', 'Five more-or-less distinct sections, all featuring "Freak" Orlando, a woman played by the late Magdalena Montezuma, who appears in various guises and deformities throughout.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fbnSKY3HAM5VkyAbC2A22N2ipbM.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:107531'),
  ('904663281191755578', 'Freak Show', 2018, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Dante Spinotti, Trudie Styler', 'Patrick J. Clifton, Beth Rigazio', 'Alex Lawther, Ian Nelson, AnnaSophia Robb, Celia Weston, Abigail Breslin, Bette Midler, Larry Pine, Christopher Dylan White', null, 'The story of teenager Billy Bloom who, despite attending an ultra conservative high school, makes the decision to run for homecoming queen.', 'The story of teenager Billy Bloom who, despite attending an ultra conservative high school, makes the decision to run for homecoming queen.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dGkKEnSe2uJit6IINShE9JHyGSt.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:440424'),
  ('474278969229674428', 'Freaked', 1993, 'Comedy, Science Fiction', 'Alex Winter, Jene Omens, Jamie Thompson', 'Alex Winter, Tom Stern, Tim Burns', 'Alex Winter, Randy Quaid, Michael Stoyanov, Megan Ward, Keanu Reeves, Mr. T, Bobcat Goldthwait, John Hawkes', 'PG-13', 'A vain actor, his best friend, and an activist end up at a mutant freak farm run by a weirdo scientist.', 'A vain actor, his best friend, and an activist end up at a mutant freak farm run by a weirdo scientist.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/enQ9FBLo4bd7AHX78geP6qRSl9U.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:17796'),
  ('1015531459950860808', 'Freakier Friday', 2025, 'Comedy, Fantasy, Family', 'Nisha Ganatra, Matthew Clark', 'Jordan Weiss', 'Lindsay Lohan, Jamie Lee Curtis, Julia Butters, Sophia Hammons, Manny Jacinto, Mark Harmon, Chad Michael Murray, Vanessa Bayer', 'PG', 'Years after Tess and Anna endured an identity crisis, Anna now has a daughter of her own and a soon-to-be stepdaughter. As they navigate the myriad challenges that come when two families merge, Tess and Anna discover lightning might indeed strike twice.', 'Years after Tess and Anna endured an identity crisis, Anna now has a daughter of her own and a soon-to-be stepdaughter. As they navigate the myriad challenges that come when two families merge, Tess and Anna discover lightning might indeed strike twice.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9wV65OmsjLAqBfDnYTkMPutXH8j.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1125257'),
  ('379025856524442948', 'Freakin'' Beautiful World', 1997, 'Drama', 'Jarmo Lampela, Kalle Nurminen, Mika Lehtinen', 'Jarmo Lampela', 'Joonas Bragge, Arttu Kapulainen, Pihla Penttinen, Ilkka Koivula, Kati Outinen, Sakari Korhonen, Pekka Valkeejärvi, Jyri Ojansivu', null, 'The Helsinki-based teenagers Ippe, Papu and Mia have become entangled in drug circles. Their problems get even worse when violent dealer Kalle starts blackmailing the indebted Ippe.', 'The Helsinki-based teenagers Ippe, Papu and Mia have become entangled in drug circles. Their problems get even worse when violent dealer Kalle starts blackmailing the indebted Ippe.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zUluLGBt2A8vPp7VK9mig0LTZbp.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:148478'),
