  ('217053949727528321', 'Freaks', 2019, 'Science Fiction, Thriller', 'Zach Lipovsky, Adam B. Stein, Stirling Bancroft', 'Adam B. Stein, Zach Lipovsky', 'Emile Hirsch, Bruce Dern, Grace Park, Amanda Crew, Lexy Kolker, Ava Telek, Michelle Harrison, Matty Finochio', 'R', 'Kept locked inside the house by her father, 7-year-old Chloe lives in fear and fascination of the outside world, where Abnormals create a constant threat—or so she believes. When a mysterious stranger offers her a glimpse of what''s really happening outside, Chloe soon finds that while the truth isn''t so simple, the danger is very real.', 'Kept locked inside the house by her father, 7-year-old Chloe lives in fear and fascination of the outside world, where Abnormals create a constant threat—or so she believes. When a mysterious stranger offers her a glimpse of what''s really happening outside, Chloe soon finds that while the truth isn''t so simple, the danger is very real.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kc2cvuqESIiRX5QoZOoMTBq18kQ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:539892'),
  ('864621760269196332', 'Freaks of Nature', 2015, 'Science Fiction, Comedy, Horror', 'Robbie Pickering, Uta Briesewitz, Jeff Dashnaw', 'Oren Uziel', 'Nicholas Braun, Mackenzie Davis, Josh Fadem, Vanessa Hudgens, Ed Westwick, Keegan-Michael Key, Joan Cusack, Bob Odenkirk', 'R', 'In the town of Dillford, humans, vampires and zombies were all living in peace - until the alien apocalypse arrived. Now three teenagers-one human, one vampire, and one zombie-have to team up to figure out how to get rid of the visitors.', 'In the town of Dillford, humans, vampires and zombies were all living in peace - until the alien apocalypse arrived. Now three teenagers-one human, one vampire, and one zombie-have to team up to figure out how to get rid of the visitors.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uOfXM61tr3sDoyyAaNTDyfxxyaE.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:218784'),
  ('523334553677914359', 'Freaks Out', 2021, 'Adventure, Fantasy, Drama', 'Giuseppe Costantino, Alessio De Leonardis, Matteo Carlesimo', 'Gabriele Mainetti, Nicola Guaglianone', 'Claudio Santamaria, Aurora Giovinazzo, Pietro Castellitto, Giancarlo Martini, Giorgio Tirabassi, Max Mazzotta, Franz Rogowski, Éric Godon', null, 'Four super-powered circus freaks find themselves trapped in war-torn Rome after their foster father is captured by the Nazis.', 'Four super-powered circus freaks find themselves trapped in war-torn Rome after their foster father is captured by the Nazis.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6y0qa5rkSMuTmOPyQZ8u0g1VeEF.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:571468'),
  ('177106204408091920', 'Freakshow', 1989, 'Horror', 'Constantino Magnatta, Gilles Corbeil', 'Bob Farmer, Steve Surgik', 'Audrey Landers, Peter Read, Dean Richards Wiancko, William Korbut, Patrick Galligan, Dan Gallagher, Michelle Scattolon, Santino Buda', null, 'After being ditched by her cameraman because of her manipulative behavior at a murder scene, a reporter wanders through town looking for a phone she can use. She finds a small museum, where the proprietor invites her in to have a look around before leaving. In one room, she encounters a strange jar which causes her to have strange visions, visions that are supposedly drawn from her own mind. These ''visions'' make up the rest of this four- part anthology, which includes horror and suspense stories about a junkie chasing a dog for his runaway fix, a pizza delivery boy who gets a Halloween surprise, a living but paralyzed OD victim forced to undergo her own autopsy because everyone thinks she''s dead, and a deal between a golf course owner and a gravedigger that has some unexpected consequences.', 'After being ditched by her cameraman because of her manipulative behavior at a murder scene, a reporter wanders through town looking for a phone she can use. She finds a small museum, where the proprietor invites her in to have a look around before leaving. In one room, she encounters a strange jar which causes her to have strange visions, visions that are supposedly drawn from her own mind. These ''visions'' make up the rest of this four- part anthology, which includes horror and suspense stories about a junkie chasing a dog for his runaway fix, a pizza delivery boy who gets a Halloween surprise, a living but paralyzed OD victim forced to undergo her own autopsy because everyone thinks she''s dead, and a deal between a golf course owner and a gravedigger that has some unexpected consequences.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rMx3EHvlwjETsSsmV6U1fBtAPCd.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:91172'),
  ('308754420009204666', 'Freakshow', 2007, 'Horror', 'Drew Bell, Mark Atkins, Brad Schield', 'Keith Leopard', 'Christopher Adamson, Rebekah Kochan, Dane Rosselli, Sharon Edrei, McKenna Geu, Robert Pike Daniel, Mark Preston Miller, Matthew Blashaw', null, 'In a modern retelling of Tod Browning''s "Freaks" (1932), "Freakshow" tells the story of a group of criminals who chose to hide out by working security at a traveling circus. At first, they plot with an insider to steal the ticket sales, but the wily Lucy has bigger plans. She convinces the gang to let her seduce and marry the aging circus owner, Lon, in order to secure the entire circus fortune after he "suffers an accident". "People die all the time," Lucy says. The freaks are on to their scheme, however, and when the youngest of them is caught by the ruthless gang, they show no mercy to ensure her silence. When the circus folk find the child''s remains, they swear vengeance, and no one is safe from their fury--least of all, the wily Lucy.', 'In a modern retelling of Tod Browning''s "Freaks" (1932), "Freakshow" tells the story of a group of criminals who chose to hide out by working security at a traveling circus. At first, they plot with an insider to steal the ticket sales, but the wily Lucy has bigger plans. She convinces the gang to let her seduce and marry the aging circus owner, Lon, in order to secure the entire circus fortune after he "suffers an accident". "People die all the time," Lucy says. The freaks are on to their scheme, however, and when the youngest of them is caught by the ruthless gang, they show no mercy to ensure her silence. When the circus folk find the child''s remains, they swear vengeance, and no one is safe from their fury--least of all, the wily Lucy.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/w8BuJ6bLQ3QdqjZP6R6xAAcCoEl.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:67289'),
  ('902701029089713113', 'Freaky', 2020, 'Horror, Comedy', 'Christopher Landon, Laurie Rose, Amir R. Khan', 'Christopher Landon, Michael Kennedy', 'Vince Vaughn, Kathryn Newton, Celeste O''Connor, Misha Osherovich, Uriah Shelton, Mitchell Hoog, Dana Drori, Carter Glade', 'R', 'A mystical, ancient dagger causes a notorious serial killer to magically switch bodies with a 17-year-old girl.', 'A mystical, ancient dagger causes a notorious serial killer to magically switch bodies with a 17-year-old girl.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8xC6QSyxrpm0D5A6iyHNemEWBVe.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:551804'),
  ('392469627325751574', 'Freaky Ali', 2016, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Sohail Khan, Mahesh Limaye, Mukesh Chhabra', 'Sohail Khan, Raaj Shaandilyaa', 'Nawazuddin Siddiqui, Arbaaz Khan, Amy Jackson, Seema Biswas, Nikitin Dheer, Paresh Ganatra, Asif Basra, Karishma Kotak', null, 'A debt collector becomes a major sensation when he takes on the rich man''s sport of golfing.', 'A debt collector becomes a major sensation when he takes on the rich man''s sport of golfing.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5MfW0eNdoPCihc6ce25uo62H6GH.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:414276'),
  ('979130593309163525', 'Freaky Deaky', 2012, 'Comedy', 'Charles Matthau, John J. Connor', null, 'Christian Slater, Michael Jai White, Crispin Glover, Billy Burke, Breanne Racano, Sabina Gadecki, Roger Bart, Andy Dick', 'R', 'Set in 1974, a pair of ''60s radicals rely on their bomb-making skills on their way to becoming capitalists.', 'Set in 1974, a pair of ''60s radicals rely on their bomb-making skills on their way to becoming capitalists.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1rMr42ppp05ikGgoJf1efx0ouJZ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:168027'),
  ('1139646955902152180', 'Freaky Friday', 1976, 'Fantasy, Comedy, Family', 'Gary Nelson, Cheryl Downey, Ronald R. Grow', 'Mary Rodgers', 'Jodie Foster, Barbara Harris, John Astin, Patsy Kelly, Dick Van Patten, Vicki Schreck, Sorrell Booke, Alan Oppenheimer', 'G', 'School girl Annabel is hassled by her mother, and Mrs. Andrews is annoyed with her daughter, Annabel. They both think that the other has an easy life. On a normal Friday morning, both complain about each other and wish they could have the easy life of their daughter/mother for just one day and their wishes come true as a bit of magic puts Annabel in Mrs. Andrews'' body and vice versa. They both have a Freaky Friday.', 'School girl Annabel is hassled by her mother, and Mrs. Andrews is annoyed with her daughter, Annabel. They both think that the other has an easy life. On a normal Friday morning, both complain about each other and wish they could have the easy life of their daughter/mother for just one day and their wishes come true as a bit of magic puts Annabel in Mrs. Andrews'' body and vice versa. They both have a Freaky Friday.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ensFUbvS08uvG0xJze1MqhhjQJ1.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:16084'),
  ('593917533300156908', 'Freaky Friday', 1995, 'Comedy, Family, Fantasy, TV Movie', 'Melanie Mayron, Russ T. Alsobrook', null, 'Shelley Long, Gaby Hoffmann, Catlin Adams, Sandra Bernhard, Andrew Bilgore, Eileen Brennan, Drew Carey, Carol Kane', 'NR', 'Fun-loving Annabelle Andrews and her uptight mother, Ellen, have a hard time getting along with each other. One Friday the 13th, they both wear magical necklaces that make them switch bodies for the day.', 'Fun-loving Annabelle Andrews and her uptight mother, Ellen, have a hard time getting along with each other. One Friday the 13th, they both wear magical necklaces that make them switch bodies for the day.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vQljMYQKVApQFXfTXKt9J8diVLG.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:196257'),
  ('925761897563524668', 'Freaky Friday', 2003, 'Family, Fantasy, Comedy, Romance', 'Oliver Wood, Mark Waters, Benjamin Rosenberg', 'Leslie Dixon, Heather Hach', 'Lindsay Lohan, Jamie Lee Curtis, Harold Gould, Chad Michael Murray, Mark Harmon, Stephen Tobolowsky, Christina Vidal Mitchell, Ryan Malgarini', 'PG', 'Mother and daughter bicker over everything -- what Anna wears, whom she likes and what she wants to do when she''s older. In turn, Anna detests Tess''s fiancé. When a magical fortune cookie switches their personalities, they each get a peek at how the other person feels, thinks and lives.', 'Mother and daughter bicker over everything -- what Anna wears, whom she likes and what she wants to do when she''s older. In turn, Anna detests Tess''s fiancé. When a magical fortune cookie switches their personalities, they each get a peek at how the other person feels, thinks and lives.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ipKcZ4Up7dp18XpsfYUc9NKZy3g.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:10330'),
  ('50438750147936478', 'Freaky Friday', 2018, 'Family, Fantasy, TV Movie, Comedy', 'Steve Carr, Adam Santelli', 'Bridget Carpenter', 'Heidi Blickenstaff, Cozi Zuehlsdorff, Jason Maybaum, Ricky He, Alex Désert, Kahyun Kim, Dara Reneé, June Laporte', 'G', 'When an overworked mother and her teenage daughter magically swap bodies, they have just one day to put things right again before mom’s big wedding.', 'When an overworked mother and her teenage daughter magically swap bodies, they have just one day to put things right again before mom’s big wedding.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aD1GTKtSAyQIumPoUjslk6IzHxA.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:505904'),
  ('75052324328200248', 'Freaky Tales', 2025, 'Action, Crime, Comedy', 'Ron Yuan, Ron Yuan, Ryan Fleck', 'Ryan Fleck, Anna Boden', 'Jay Ellis, Pedro Pascal, Ben Mendelsohn, Normani, Dominique Thorne, Jack Champion, Ji-young Yoo, Angus Cloud', 'R', 'In 1987 Oakland, a mysterious force guides The Town''s underdogs in four interconnected tales: teen punks defend their turf against Nazi skinheads, a rap duo battles for hip-hop immortality, a weary henchman gets a shot at redemption, and an NBA All-Star settles the score.', 'In 1987 Oakland, a mysterious force guides The Town''s underdogs in four interconnected tales: teen punks defend their turf against Nazi skinheads, a rap duo battles for hip-hop immortality, a weary henchman gets a shot at redemption, and an NBA All-Star settles the score.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lo5mfglsGeMYmAkSRXs9DATNJxk.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:979660'),
  ('816612333304797926', 'Freche Mädchen', 2008, 'Comedy, Drama, Romance', 'Ute Wieland, Peter Przybylski', 'Maggie Peren', 'Emilia Schüle, Selina Shirin Müller, Henriette Nagel, Jonathan Beck, David Berton, Armin Rohde, Anke Engelke, David Rott', null, 'Teenage best friends Mila, Hanna and Kati play matchmaker to their teachers while helping each other through their own budding romances.', 'Teenage best friends Mila, Hanna and Kati play matchmaker to their teachers while helping each other through their own budding romances.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jqLAlwFOUE5VD2cXDmCmOHeGjFo.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:11752'),
  ('988340844615085454', 'Freche Mädchen 2', 2010, 'Drama, Comedy, Romance', 'Ute Wieland, Peter Przybylski, Daniel Rosness', 'Maggie Peren', 'Emilia Schüle, Henriette Nagel, Selina Shirin Müller, Jonathan Beck, Christina Peifer, Ben Unterkofler, Jannis Niewöhner, Dennis Herrmann', null, 'After Kati, Hanna and Mila first experiences with guys, it is now necessary to cultivate those relations. The jealous Mila thinks that her friend Markus, would cheat on her with Vanessa. Kati, who is actually together with Tobi, finds that Robert, whom she met during a shooting, more than just cool. Only with Hanna everything seems to work perfectly. Branko is a real gentleman and does everything for her musical career - but not entirely unselfishly, as soon turns out. Problems therefore pre-programmed with the girlfriends and their new conquests!', 'After Kati, Hanna and Mila first experiences with guys, it is now necessary to cultivate those relations. The jealous Mila thinks that her friend Markus, would cheat on her with Vanessa. Kati, who is actually together with Tobi, finds that Robert, whom she met during a shooting, more than just cool. Only with Hanna everything seems to work perfectly. Branko is a real gentleman and does everything for her musical career - but not entirely unselfishly, as soon turns out. Problems therefore pre-programmed with the girlfriends and their new conquests!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9MeypEd7XTrlDXvscMwqrEXReCU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:53352'),
  ('71180786913555147', 'Fred', 1997, 'Crime', 'Pierre Jolivet, Patrick Blossier, Catherine Charlot', 'Pierre Jolivet, Simon Michaël', 'Vincent Lindon, Clotilde Courau, François Berléand, Stéphane Jobert, Roschdy Zem, Albert Dray, Francis Frappat, Laura Favali', null, 'Fred (Vincent Lindon) is a former crane driver who was a victim of the closure of his factory. He takes care of the little boy of his girlfriend (Clotilde Courau), does the housework and sometimes goes to the job center but boredom is inescapable. One day, because he accepted to drive a truck for a friend to a warehouse, he''s caught up in a vicious spiral that goes beyond him. It''s all the more serious as shady men want to eliminate him an the police is on his back.', 'Fred (Vincent Lindon) is a former crane driver who was a victim of the closure of his factory. He takes care of the little boy of his girlfriend (Clotilde Courau), does the housework and sometimes goes to the job center but boredom is inescapable. One day, because he accepted to drive a truck for a friend to a warehouse, he''s caught up in a vicious spiral that goes beyond him. It''s all the more serious as shady men want to eliminate him an the police is on his back.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/p1ZNYeE1Ytf9xtD7YroMM93Srfd.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:90430'),
  ('252197870895719676', 'Fred 2: Night of the Living Fred', 2011, 'Adventure, Comedy, Family, TV Movie', 'David Barber, Mathew Rudenberg, John Fortenberry', 'David A. Goodman', 'Lucas Cruikshank, Seth Morris, Daniella Monet, Siobhan Fallon Hogan, Jake Weary, Ariel Winter, Stephanie Courtney, Jay Jay Warren', null, 'When Fred suspects that his new music teacher is a vampire, he and his friend Bertha set out to save the town from this garlic-hating fiend.', 'When Fred suspects that his new music teacher is a vampire, he and his friend Bertha set out to save the town from this garlic-hating fiend.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rBl9FBizmfIVhFokwn3gJIACMpj.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:84564'),
  ('158943804465524833', 'FRED 3: Camp Fred', 2012, 'Family, TV Movie, Comedy, Music', 'Jonathan Judge, Brandon Mastrippolito', 'Drew Hancock', 'Lucas Cruikshank, Jake Weary, Siobhan Fallon Hogan, Carlos Knight, Daniella Monet, Joey Bragg, Leah Lewis, Matthew Scott Miller', 'PG', 'Schools out, and Fred Figglehorn''s dream of water slides, horseback riding and monkey butlers during the summer turns into a nightmare of gruel and poisonous berries when his mom signs him up to an unsanitary camp.', 'Schools out, and Fred Figglehorn''s dream of water slides, horseback riding and monkey butlers during the summer turns into a nightmare of gruel and poisonous berries when his mom signs him up to an unsanitary camp.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wyVZtMe1phhwCmEGDTEVATv8X2g.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:128542'),
  ('697508451822743978', 'Fred Claus', 2007, 'Action, Comedy, Drama', 'David Dobkin, Remi Adefarasin, Giles Masters', 'Dan Fogelman', 'Vince Vaughn, Paul Giamatti, John Michael Higgins, Miranda Richardson, Rachel Weisz, Kathy Bates, Trevor Peacock, Ludacris', 'PG', 'Fred Claus and Santa Claus have been estranged brothers for many years. Now Fred must reconcile his differences with his brother whom he believes overshadows him. When an efficiency expert assesses the workings at the North Pole and threatens to shut Santa down, Fred must help his brother to save Christmas.', 'Fred Claus and Santa Claus have been estranged brothers for many years. Now Fred must reconcile his differences with his brother whom he believes overshadows him. When an efficiency expert assesses the workings at the North Pole and threatens to shut Santa down, Fred must help his brother to save Christmas.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9gATbvoRMxVeoHInwS8nR0KZMVc.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:5375'),
  ('280264474418535504', 'FRED: The Movie', 2010, 'Comedy, Family, Adventure, TV Movie', 'Scott Henriksen, Clay Weiner', 'David A. Goodman', 'Lucas Cruikshank, Pixie Lott, Jake Weary, Jennette McCurdy, John Cena, Siobhan Fallon Hogan, Jack Coughlan, Mak Kriksciun', 'PG', 'Fred Figglehorn is in love with Judy, who lives next door. But Kevin, the local bully, prevents Fred from seeing Judy until she moves out of town. So, Fred embarks on a quest to find her in the hope that his feelings will be reciprocated.', 'Fred Figglehorn is in love with Judy, who lives next door. But Kevin, the local bully, prevents Fred from seeing Judy until she moves out of town. So, Fred embarks on a quest to find her in the hope that his feelings will be reciprocated.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/u9V734PuiqbcvOFZwBoYZDqiMTA.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:45839'),
  ('273252541311966675', 'Freda', 2021, 'Drama', 'Karine Aulnette, Gessica Généus', 'Gessica Généus', 'Néhémie Bastien, Fabiola Remy, Djanaïna François, Jean Jean, Gaëlle Bien-Aimé, Cantave Kervern, Rolaphton Mercure, Paula Clermont Péan', null, 'Freda lives with her mother, sister and little brother in a popular neighbourhood of Haiti. They survive with their little street food shop. The precariousness and violence of their daily life pushes them to do everything they can to escape their situation in the hope of finding a better life.', 'Freda lives with her mother, sister and little brother in a popular neighbourhood of Haiti. They survive with their little street food shop. The precariousness and violence of their daily life pushes them to do everything they can to escape their situation in the hope of finding a better life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yqmkq3q98ipmsAQCO9rciJLPDfK.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:836489'),
  ('707917961950204883', 'Freddie As F.R.O.7.', 1992, 'Animation, Adventure, Family, Fantasy', 'Jon Acevski, Roberto Casale, Rex Neville', 'Jon Acevski, David Ashton', 'Ben Kingsley, Brian Blessed, Nigel Hawthorne, Jonathan Pryce, Prunella Scales, Michael Hordern, Jenny Agutter, David Ashton', 'PG', 'Frederick is a young medieval French prince with magical powers, turned into a frog by his evil sorceress aunt, who kills his father in a bid to seize the throne. After being pursued by his aunt, the prince is saved by the Loch Ness Monster, who indebts herself to him, and hides out with a colony of anthropomorphic frogs for a time. After ultimately deciding to accept his fate and fight evil using his powers, Freddie grows to the size of an adult human, travels to the future, and becomes a French secret agent with a sentient car.', 'Frederick is a young medieval French prince with magical powers, turned into a frog by his evil sorceress aunt, who kills his father in a bid to seize the throne. After being pursued by his aunt, the prince is saved by the Loch Ness Monster, who indebts herself to him, and hides out with a colony of anthropomorphic frogs for a time. After ultimately deciding to accept his fate and fight evil using his powers, Freddie grows to the size of an adult human, travels to the future, and becomes a French secret agent with a sentient car.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xP68rOqXaCmPToabihND4UufQKA.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:110395'),
  ('451651306758447276', 'Freddie Mercury: The Final Act', 2022, 'Documentary, Music', 'James Rogan', null, 'Freddie Mercury, Brian May, Roger Taylor, Elton John, Lisa Stansfield, David Wigg, Anita Dobson, Peter Freestone', null, 'The story of the extraordinary final chapter of Freddie Mercury’s life and how, after his death from AIDS, Queen staged one of the biggest concerts in history, the Freddie Mercury Tribute Concert at Wembley Stadium, to celebrate his life and challenge the prejudices around HIV/AIDS. For the first time, Freddie''s story is told alongside the experiences of those who tested positive for HIV and lost loved ones during the same period. Medical practitioners, survivors, and human rights campaigners recount the intensity of living through the AIDS pandemic and the moral panic it brought about.', 'The story of the extraordinary final chapter of Freddie Mercury’s life and how, after his death from AIDS, Queen staged one of the biggest concerts in history, the Freddie Mercury Tribute Concert at Wembley Stadium, to celebrate his life and challenge the prejudices around HIV/AIDS. For the first time, Freddie''s story is told alongside the experiences of those who tested positive for HIV and lost loved ones during the same period. Medical practitioners, survivors, and human rights campaigners recount the intensity of living through the AIDS pandemic and the moral panic it brought about.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tctFh2aNKCG7C1l5oPQGxK8qvHn.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:897561'),
  ('34672186516448053', 'Freddie Mercury: The Great Pretender', 2012, 'Music, Documentary', 'Rhys Thomas', null, 'Freddie Mercury, Roger Taylor, Brian May, Luciano Pavarotti, Montserrat Caballé, Peter Freestone, David Arnold, John Reid', 'NR', 'Archive footage of interviews, concerts and personal material bring to light the solo performance work of Mercury, the lead singer of Queen.', 'Archive footage of interviews, concerts and personal material bring to light the solo performance work of Mercury, the lead singer of Queen.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2zTtw8VNZtLrcUtHiiEzADkUKkm.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:135403'),
  ('305105056317770020', 'Freddie Mercury: The Untold Story', 2000, 'Documentary, Music', 'Rudi Dolezal, Hannes Rossacher, Hermann Dunzendorfer', 'Simon Witter', 'Freddie Mercury, Brian May, Roger Taylor, John Deacon, Montserrat Caballé, Tim Rice, Jer Bulsara, Kashmira Cooke', null, 'Freddie Mercury (1946-91) was not just a man with one of the most pure and amazing voices the world has heard, but he was also the lead singer for Queen, the most enthusiastic rock band in history.', 'Freddie Mercury (1946-91) was not just a man with one of the most pure and amazing voices the world has heard, but he was also the lead singer for Queen, the most enthusiastic rock band in history.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/q7yPeIa8QVzZhoEUqEvk8qeKvPr.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:53968'),
  ('597131744882723628', 'Freddy', 2022, 'Romance, Thriller', 'Shashanka Ghosh, Ayananka Bose', 'Parveez Shaikh', 'Kartik Aaryan, Alaya F, Karan A. Pandit, Sajjad Delafrooz, Jeniffer Piccinato, Harshika Kewalramani, Myrna S. Dalal, Kamalrukh W. Khan', null, 'Introverted and awkward Dr. Freddy Ginwala desperately searches for a soulmate. When he finally finds her, the relationship becomes as painful as a root canal.', 'Introverted and awkward Dr. Freddy Ginwala desperately searches for a soulmate. When he finally finds her, the relationship becomes as painful as a root canal.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/av8OONk9vmm0OmGWNYzZpAbOJP3.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1041054'),
  ('174177664862737507', 'Freddy Eddy', 2018, 'Thriller', 'Tini Tüllmann', 'Tini Tüllmann', 'Felix Schäfer, Jessica Schwarz, Greta Bohacek, Alexander Finkenwirth, Katharina Schüttler, Burghart Klaußner, Robert Stadlober, Anna Unterberger', null, 'Painter Freddy lives with his wife and child on Lake Tegernsee and is working on his comeback until one day his life suddenly turns upside down: He is accused of beating up his wife and as a result of which he is said to have custody of his eight-year-old son withdrawn . But Freddy can not remember having committed the alleged acts and protests his innocence. In this grave crisis, Eddy appears, Freddy''s childhood friend. Both look confusingly alike and Eddy immediately begins to interfere in Freddy''s life, in which worse things happen. Only Freddy knows that he has a doppelganger, an imaginary one at that - how is he supposed to convince those around him that it is Eddy who is to blame for all the disasters? Freddy is slowly losing control of his life...', 'Painter Freddy lives with his wife and child on Lake Tegernsee and is working on his comeback until one day his life suddenly turns upside down: He is accused of beating up his wife and as a result of which he is said to have custody of his eight-year-old son withdrawn . But Freddy can not remember having committed the alleged acts and protests his innocence. In this grave crisis, Eddy appears, Freddy''s childhood friend. Both look confusingly alike and Eddy immediately begins to interfere in Freddy''s life, in which worse things happen. Only Freddy knows that he has a doppelganger, an imaginary one at that - how is he supposed to convince those around him that it is Eddy who is to blame for all the disasters? Freddy is slowly losing control of his life...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1hmtGuP68ZVyoBOsAou1LUznI0P.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:432688'),
  ('275515822566079388', 'Freddy Frogface', 2011, 'Comedy, Animation, Family', 'Pete Dodd', 'Michael W. Horsten, Søren Danielsen', 'Nikolaj Lie Kaas, Thure Lindhardt, Nicolaj Kopernikus, Katrine Falkenberg', 'G', 'Based on a classic Danish children''s book by Ole Lund Kirkegaard. Being small doesn''t make life easy for little ten-year-old Victor and his friends, who not only have to face a world full of stern grown-ups but also the town bully Freddy Frogface. When a circus comes to the sleepy little town, Victor is thrilled at having the chance to perform in a talent show with his dog Sausage. Yet Freddy soon comes up with a sinister plot of his own to spoil Victor''s plans...', 'Based on a classic Danish children''s book by Ole Lund Kirkegaard. Being small doesn''t make life easy for little ten-year-old Victor and his friends, who not only have to face a world full of stern grown-ups but also the town bully Freddy Frogface. When a circus comes to the sleepy little town, Victor is thrilled at having the chance to perform in a talent show with his dog Sausage. Yet Freddy soon comes up with a sinister plot of his own to spoil Victor''s plans...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lfQi0UkiiH4y8o3eTNPruAUKJuf.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:79557'),
  ('1007120436126373667', 'Freddy Got Fingered', 2001, 'Comedy', 'Tom Green, Mark Irwin, John Holbrook', 'Derek Harvie, Tom Green', 'Tom Green, Rip Torn, Marisa Coughlan, Eddie Kaye Thomas, Harland Williams, Anthony Michael Hall, Julie Hagerty, Jackson Davies', 'R', 'Unemployed cartoonist Gord Brody moves back in with his parents Jim and Julie and younger brother Freddy. When his parents demand he leave, he retaliates by spreading rumors that Jim is sexually abusing Freddy.', 'Unemployed cartoonist Gord Brody moves back in with his parents Jim and Julie and younger brother Freddy. When his parents demand he leave, he retaliates by spreading rumors that Jim is sexually abusing Freddy.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gVmSZgxiT7ynyRLsEgg8Xs8ZVWX.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:13166'),
  ('742397208271752200', 'Freddy vs. Jason', 2003, 'Horror', 'Fred Murphy, Ronny Yu, Milena Zdravkovic', 'Damian Shannon, Mark Swift', 'Jesse Hutch, Robert Englund, Ken Kirzinger, Monica Keena, Jason Ritter, Lochlyn Munro, Kelly Rowland, David Kopp', 'R', 'Freddy Krueger and Jason Voorhees return to terrorize the teenagers of Elm Street. Only this time, they''re out to get each other, too.', 'Freddy Krueger and Jason Voorhees return to terrorize the teenagers of Elm Street. Only this time, they''re out to get each other, too.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/f9ZASRUfl8Jlco7rgRx3ujPR0P7.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:6466'),
  ('457332530071084385', 'Freddy''s Dead: The Final Nightmare', 1991, 'Horror, Thriller', 'Rachel Talalay, Declan Quinn, Gregory Jacobs', 'Michael De Luca', 'Robert Englund, Lisa Zane, Shon Greenblatt, Lezlie Deane, Yaphet Kotto, Breckin Meyer, Ricky Dean Logan, Cassandra Rachel Friel', 'R', 'Just when you thought it was safe to sleep, Freddy Krueger returns in this sixth installment of the Nightmare on Elm Street films, as psychologist Maggie Burroughs, tormented by recurring nightmares, meets a patient with the same horrific dreams. Their quest for answers leads to a certain house on Elm Street -- where the nightmares become reality.', 'Just when you thought it was safe to sleep, Freddy Krueger returns in this sixth installment of the Nightmare on Elm Street films, as psychologist Maggie Burroughs, tormented by recurring nightmares, meets a patient with the same horrific dreams. Their quest for answers leads to a certain house on Elm Street -- where the nightmares become reality.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/e4qh58n2WaG4Gyh9VhjOUeN9Mhv.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:11284'),
  ('1105401741375091993', 'Freddy''s Fridays', 2023, 'Horror', 'Darcy Baker, Ben J. Williams', 'Tom Carter, Charlie Carter', 'Danielle Scott, Lauren Budd, Matthew Baunsgard, Jase Rivers, Matthew Metcalfe, Tom Beechcroft, Cici Clarke, Alina Desmond', null, 'A detective begins to investigate a series of mysterious murders that are connected to a demonic book that brings dolls to life. As the body count begins to rise, the detective soon learns the curse of the demonic Friday and must find a way to stop it before any others disappear.', 'A detective begins to investigate a series of mysterious murders that are connected to a demonic book that brings dolls to life. As the body count begins to rise, the detective soon learns the curse of the demonic Friday and must find a way to stop it before any others disappear.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/syNeotlmV6uIXBKg7dYwVpXoI7P.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1140168'),
  ('301061640252680742', 'Free and Easy', 1930, 'Comedy, Music', 'Edward Sedgwick, Leonard Smith', 'Richard Schayer', 'Buster Keaton, Anita Page, Trixie Friganza, Robert Montgomery, Fred Niblo, Edgar Dearing, Gwen Lee, John Miljan', 'NR', 'Gopher City Kansas hosts a beauty contest. The winner, Elvira Plunkett, and her mother go to Hollywood. The Chamber of Commerce also provides Elvira with an agent, Gopher City''s own Elmer J. Butz. Elmer likes Elvira and the shy Elvira likes him, but Mrs. Plunkett, a formidable woman, has little use for hapless Elmer. On the train west, they meet movie star Larry Mitchell, who takes a shine to Elvira and helps her meet MGM directors once they get to Tinsel Town. Elmer, meanwhile, wants to help Elvira with her career and he also wants to be her man. Movie stardom does come to the Gopher City entourage, but to whom is a surprise. And who will win the lovely Elvira''s hand?', 'Gopher City Kansas hosts a beauty contest. The winner, Elvira Plunkett, and her mother go to Hollywood. The Chamber of Commerce also provides Elvira with an agent, Gopher City''s own Elmer J. Butz. Elmer likes Elvira and the shy Elvira likes him, but Mrs. Plunkett, a formidable woman, has little use for hapless Elmer. On the train west, they meet movie star Larry Mitchell, who takes a shine to Elvira and helps her meet MGM directors once they get to Tinsel Town. Elmer, meanwhile, wants to help Elvira with her career and he also wants to be her man. Movie stardom does come to the Gopher City entourage, but to whom is a surprise. And who will win the lovely Elvira''s hand?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/31UrsNkQOBNgaGkE7FF8oD6ONU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:42811'),
  ('424692309151008123', 'Free and Easy', 2017, 'Comedy', 'Jun Geng, Wang Weihua', 'Jun Geng', 'Xu Gang, Zhang Zhiyong, Zhang Xun, Xue Baohe', null, 'Under a tin-gray sky, in a hollowed out corner of northern China, a stranger arrives in town bearing magical soap—but smelling it will cost you. Nearby, a pair of unenthused cops try cracking a seemingly simple case. Or not. And you can forget religious solace; the only monk around is not what he seems.', 'Under a tin-gray sky, in a hollowed out corner of northern China, a stranger arrives in town bearing magical soap—but smelling it will cost you. Nearby, a pair of unenthused cops try cracking a seemingly simple case. Or not. And you can forget religious solace; the only monk around is not what he seems.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iqC89HJ5zFeNY8USNFtumxnVsdN.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:428481'),
  ('198704007344202862', 'Free Birds', 2013, 'Animation, Comedy, Family', 'Jimmy Hayward, Chris DiGiovanni', 'Scott Mosier, Jimmy Hayward', 'Owen Wilson, Woody Harrelson, Amy Poehler, George Takei, Colm Meaney, Keith David, Dan Fogler, Jimmy Hayward', 'PG', 'Two turkeys from opposite sides of the tracks must put aside their differences and team up to travel back in time to change the course of history—and get turkey off the holiday menu for good.', 'Two turkeys from opposite sides of the tracks must put aside their differences and team up to travel back in time to change the course of history—and get turkey off the holiday menu for good.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gnSU2wUBq2gTkBEkxY8C1d1fXAQ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:175574'),
  ('1005693471208796626', 'Free Country', 2020, 'Drama, Thriller', 'Christian Alvart, Christian Alvart, Andrey Kudin', 'Rafael Cobos, Alberto Rodríguez', 'Trystan Pütter, Felix Kramer, Nora Waldstätten, Ben Hartmann, Alva Schäfer, Ludwig Simon, Uwe Dag Berlin, Leonard Kunz', null, 'Former East Germany, 1992. Patrick Stein and Markus Bach, two very different police officers, are commissioned to investigate the disappearance of two female teenagers in a remote area of the country. Did they run away from home or did something more terrible happen to them?', 'Former East Germany, 1992. Patrick Stein and Markus Bach, two very different police officers, are commissioned to investigate the disappearance of two female teenagers in a remote area of the country. Did they run away from home or did something more terrible happen to them?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/snkeg0NgURfXRbrnndoC6N0nBF3.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:633182'),
  ('139432244464011487', 'Free Enterprise', 1998, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Charles L. Barbee, Robert Meyer Burnett', 'Robert Meyer Burnett, Mark A. Altman', 'Eric McCormack, Rafer Weigel, Audie England, William Shatner, Phil LaMarr, Thomas Hobson, Jennifer Sommerfeld, Jonathan Slavin', null, 'Young filmmakers trying to hawk a movie titled "Bradykillers" about a serial killer who goes after victims Marcia, Jan, and Cindy meet their screen idol, William Shatner. The two young men, who idolize him and in their fantasies have seen him as a shadowy fairy godfather figure, are alarmed at the reality of the middle-aged non-Captain Kirk man that they meet.', 'Young filmmakers trying to hawk a movie titled "Bradykillers" about a serial killer who goes after victims Marcia, Jan, and Cindy meet their screen idol, William Shatner. The two young men, who idolize him and in their fantasies have seen him as a shadowy fairy godfather figure, are alarmed at the reality of the middle-aged non-Captain Kirk man that they meet.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tBkKj6pUgxIW8DvNJEjsbnWgifP.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:13533'),
  ('417116326437624373', 'Free Fall', 1964, null, 'Arthur Lipsett, Arthur Lipsett', null, null, null, 'An experimental film from Arthur Lipsett, Free Fall is an assortment of film trimmings assembled to make a wry comment on humankind in today’s world. It evokes a surrealist dream of our fall from grace into banality. (NFB.ca)', 'An experimental film from Arthur Lipsett, Free Fall is an assortment of film trimmings assembled to make a wry comment on humankind in today’s world. It evokes a surrealist dream of our fall from grace into banality. (NFB.ca)', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bFU09fG58abbPqIpDi9lP5N1VZn.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:128014'),
  ('1016243472623467908', 'Free Fall', 1999, 'Thriller, Action, TV Movie', 'Mario Azzopardi', 'Ken Wheat, Jim Wheat', 'Hannes Jaenicke, Jaclyn Smith, Bruce Boxleitner, Scott Wentworth, Hayden Christensen, Nigel Brennet, Chad Everett, Kate Trotter', null, 'An NTSB investigator and her boyfriend, who works for the FAA, investigate a series of similar and suspicious plane crashes that seem to be affecting only one airline.', 'An NTSB investigator and her boyfriend, who works for the FAA, investigate a series of similar and suspicious plane crashes that seem to be affecting only one airline.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fUr8UFc6aP5m66qCaZuhgzIzeSi.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:100562'),
  ('235907035375230610', 'Free Fall', 2009, 'Drama', 'Mariloup Wolfe, Jérôme Sabourin', 'Vincent Bolduc', 'Guillaume Lemay-Thivierge, Éric Bruneau, Laurence Leboeuf, Vincent Bolduc, Adam Kosh, Monique Spaziani, Andrew Shaver, Martin Dubreuil', null, 'Three friends meet one summer at a skydiving center. Adventurous, they spend most of their time jumping - for thrills and to escape what haunts them. When his dream of becoming a pilot is shattered, Rafaël, a young daredevil of 20 years, puts his life in danger by pushing his limits as a parashooter. Her friend Charles, the older owner of the skydiving center, tries to make her understand reason while developing a love passion for Manu, a young woman who, at 20, has to deal with her mother''s cancer. But Manu and Rafaël also develop a strong passion, which comes to compromise the strong bond between the three friends. Things don''t work out when Rafaël, who has been forbidden to jump, comes to miss a particularly dangerous jump prepared by Charles.', 'Three friends meet one summer at a skydiving center. Adventurous, they spend most of their time jumping - for thrills and to escape what haunts them. When his dream of becoming a pilot is shattered, Rafaël, a young daredevil of 20 years, puts his life in danger by pushing his limits as a parashooter. Her friend Charles, the older owner of the skydiving center, tries to make her understand reason while developing a love passion for Manu, a young woman who, at 20, has to deal with her mother''s cancer. But Manu and Rafaël also develop a strong passion, which comes to compromise the strong bond between the three friends. Things don''t work out when Rafaël, who has been forbidden to jump, comes to miss a particularly dangerous jump prepared by Charles.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9nZ0magTSDz7AsRYZzirL5Br7sc.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:26681'),
  ('710449164225622616', 'Free Fall', 2014, 'Thriller', 'Malek Akkad, Jonathan Hall', 'Dwayne Alexander Smith', 'Sarah Butler, D. B. Sweeney, Malcolm McDowell, Ian Gomez, Adam Tomei, Mustafa Speaks, Thea Rubley, Jayson Blair', 'R', 'Upwardly-mobile executive Jane uncovers evidence that that her high powered boss may have been murdered, prompting the corporation to dispatch a "crisis manager" to ensure that the truth never gets out. Now, trapped in an elevator during a holiday weekend, Jane realizes that she must climb for her life to avoid taking a fatal plunge.', 'Upwardly-mobile executive Jane uncovers evidence that that her high powered boss may have been murdered, prompting the corporation to dispatch a "crisis manager" to ensure that the truth never gets out. Now, trapped in an elevator during a holiday weekend, Jane realizes that she must climb for her life to avoid taking a fatal plunge.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8C0TgIkII4zh1xLES8UddqOD4Su.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:287415'),
  ('559557003339182235', 'Free Fall', 2025, 'Science Fiction, Thriller', 'Oleg Urazaykin, Fedor Lyass, Asya Aristova', 'Alexey Medvedev, Oleg Urazaykin', 'Aleksandr Kuznetsov, Anna Chipovskaya, Andrey Merzlikin, Andrey Pynzaru', null, 'In the near future, humanity has successfully colonized space and build a giant orbital station "Delta". Max is a repairman working on the station. After a disaster caused by a proton storm, he is left alone without his crew members, drifting into space. His space suit is broken, he is exhausted, and he lacks communication with people. But suddenly a dispatcher named Anna comes to help. She is the only one who can guide Max through difficulties and get him to the station. Max has to risk everything to save his life, but he has no idea what Anna is up to.', 'In the near future, humanity has successfully colonized space and build a giant orbital station "Delta". Max is a repairman working on the station. After a disaster caused by a proton storm, he is left alone without his crew members, drifting into space. His space suit is broken, he is exhausted, and he lacks communication with people. But suddenly a dispatcher named Anna comes to help. She is the only one who can guide Max through difficulties and get him to the station. Max has to risk everything to save his life, but he has no idea what Anna is up to.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oY1b65zg8IwsbNdr7SEiQ7ohZ7u.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:650033'),
  ('1003330782954737372', 'Free Falling', 2024, 'Thriller, Drama', 'Laura Jou, Marc Gómez del Moral', 'Bernat Vilaplana', 'Belén Rueda, Irene Escolar, Ilay Kurelovic, Manuela Vellés, Mariia Netavrovana, Brays Efe, Roser Batalla, Raquel Pérez', null, 'Marisol is the national rhythmic gymnastics coach, methodical, demanding and authoritative. The World Championship is approaching and she places all her gold medal hopes on Angelica, the team''s most promising newcomer. Two weeks before the final, Marisol discovers that her husband is having an affair with a much younger woman with whom she is expecting a child. Marisol does not contemplate failure, so she embarks on a desperate race to win him back, without taking into account her motives and feelings. Her pain is transferred to her tatami, where she becomes even more implacable towards Angelica, in whom she places her hopes of success. At this point, winning gold is all that''s left for him.', 'Marisol is the national rhythmic gymnastics coach, methodical, demanding and authoritative. The World Championship is approaching and she places all her gold medal hopes on Angelica, the team''s most promising newcomer. Two weeks before the final, Marisol discovers that her husband is having an affair with a much younger woman with whom she is expecting a child. Marisol does not contemplate failure, so she embarks on a desperate race to win him back, without taking into account her motives and feelings. Her pain is transferred to her tatami, where she becomes even more implacable towards Angelica, in whom she places her hopes of success. At this point, winning gold is all that''s left for him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2GoWWyizDzceBjgUK9F725FcCdC.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1243650'),
  ('145597640731641347', 'Free Fire', 2017, 'Action, Crime, Mystery', 'Ben Wheatley, Laurie Rose, Nigel Pollock', 'Amy Jump, Ben Wheatley', 'Cillian Murphy, Brie Larson, Armie Hammer, Sharlto Copley, Jack Reynor, Sam Riley, Michael Smiley, Noah Taylor', 'R', 'Set in Boston in 1978, a meeting in a deserted warehouse between two gangs turns into a shoot-out and a game of survival.', 'Set in Boston in 1978, a meeting in a deserted warehouse between two gangs turns into a shoot-out and a game of survival.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/olpgs0OPE8sdBGcuuWhKYzxAwN4.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:334521'),
  ('350842915721689289', 'Free Guy', 2021, 'Comedy, Adventure, Science Fiction', 'Chris O''Hara, Shawn Levy, Beat Frutiger', 'Matt Lieberman, Zak Penn', 'Ryan Reynolds, Jodie Comer, Lil Rel Howery, Joe Keery, Utkarsh Ambudkar, Taika Waititi, Channing Tatum, Aaron W Reed', 'PG-13', 'A bank teller discovers he is actually a background player in an open-world video game, and decides to become the hero of his own story. Now, in a world where there are no limits, he is determined to be the guy who saves his world his way before it''s too late.', 'A bank teller discovers he is actually a background player in an open-world video game, and decides to become the hero of his own story. Now, in a world where there are no limits, he is determined to be the guy who saves his world his way before it''s too late.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dxraF0qPr1OEgJk17ltQTO84kQF.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:550988'),
