  ('979672177373333259', 'Free Love', 1974, 'Drama, Romance, Horror', 'Pier Ludovico Pavoni, Tomaso Sherman, Fausto Rossi', 'Tomaso Sherman, Guido Leoni, Pier Ludovico Pavoni', 'Laura Gemser, Enzo Bottesini, Venantino Venantini, Ugo Cardea, Olga Bisera, Ogilvy Chiffon, Lorenzo Piani, Rocky Laurence', null, 'An engineer named Francesco arrives on Emerald Island in the Seychelles and is instantly smitten with the local girl Jeanine, whose sister ran off with the previous engineer -- neither of them to be seen again.', 'An engineer named Francesco arrives on Emerald Island in the Seychelles and is instantly smitten with the local girl Jeanine, whose sister ran off with the previous engineer -- neither of them to be seen again.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/loDZpyTmmAyCOuWvaryfr5Qcf78.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:59873'),
  ('758672723102593866', 'Free Love', 1978, 'Comedy, Romance, Drama', 'Jaime Humberto Hermosillo', 'Francisco Sánchez', 'Julissa, Alma Muriel, Manuel Ojeda, Jorge Balzaretti, José Alonso, Roberto Cobo, Emma Roldán, Ana Ofelia Murguía', null, 'Two single women share an apartment, work together, and sometimes swap boyfriends. None of their romantic attachments seem quite as stable or enduring as their friendship.', 'Two single women share an apartment, work together, and sometimes swap boyfriends. None of their romantic attachments seem quite as stable or enduring as their friendship.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aUnzwuKjxxJNzmTIiLwuzcFlsn8.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:372443'),
  ('85867205606636190', 'Free Man', 2011, 'Drama, History', 'Mehmet Tanrısever, Ali Özel', 'Mehmet Tanrısever', 'Mürşit Ağa Bağ, Tarik Tanrisever, Engin Yüksel, Mesut Çakarlı, Halil İbrahim Kalaycıoğlu, Ahmet Yenilmez, Mahmut Hekimoğlu, Bülent Polat', null, '“Hür Adam” or “Free Man” in English is the real-life story of a very influential Kurdish scholar in Turkey that had lived between 1877-1960, ''Said Nursi''. A writer, philosopher, and philanthropist, he compiled many books on Islam covering various themes of faith, brotherhood, and philanthropy and exploring the reasons behind societal weakness, poverty, ignorance, and divisions.', '“Hür Adam” or “Free Man” in English is the real-life story of a very influential Kurdish scholar in Turkey that had lived between 1877-1960, ''Said Nursi''. A writer, philosopher, and philanthropist, he compiled many books on Islam covering various themes of faith, brotherhood, and philanthropy and exploring the reasons behind societal weakness, poverty, ignorance, and divisions.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/84i0tdNwrGgpGCvuKIVaeND3D3L.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:65725'),
  ('459714862462041644', 'Free Men', 2011, 'Drama, History, War', 'Ismaël Ferroukhi, Jérôme Alméras', 'Ismaël Ferroukhi, Alain-Michel Blanc', 'Tahar Rahim, Michael Lonsdale, Lubna Azabal, Mahmoud Shalaby, Christopher Buchholz, Farid Larbi, Stéphane Rideau, Bruno Fleury', null, 'In Paris during WWII, an Algerian immigrant is inspired to join the resistance by his unexpected friendship with a Jewish man. Based on not very known facts about the Muslim community in Paris during WWII, when the Paris Mosque and its dynamic leader played a pivotal role in supporting the resistance and rescuing Jews.', 'In Paris during WWII, an Algerian immigrant is inspired to join the resistance by his unexpected friendship with a Jewish man. Based on not very known facts about the Muslim community in Paris during WWII, when the Paris Mosque and its dynamic leader played a pivotal role in supporting the resistance and rescuing Jews.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wIxYcEJUrv75MmQ5RTColWcH7TW.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:85741'),
  ('425627191635933709', 'Free Money', 1998, 'Comedy, Crime, Thriller', 'Yves Simoneau, David Franco', 'Joseph Brutsman, Tony Peck', 'Marlon Brando, Donald Sutherland, Charlie Sheen, Thomas Haden Church, Mira Sorvino, Martin Sheen, David Arquette, Jean-Pierre Bergeron', 'R', 'A deranged prison warden with a nasty habit of killing escapees forces the boyfriends of his teenage twin daughters into a shotgun wedding, after they claim to be pregnant. All hope seems lost, until the husbands hatch a madcap plan to rob a money train to freedom.', 'A deranged prison warden with a nasty habit of killing escapees forces the boyfriends of his teenage twin daughters into a shotgun wedding, after they claim to be pregnant. All hope seems lost, until the husbands hatch a madcap plan to rob a money train to freedom.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rthoTWBsSiaSdtQGwgvr1HcAweT.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:30712'),
  ('233115135359094632', 'Free Radicals', 1958, 'Animation, Music', 'Len Lye', null, null, null, 'In this powerful abstract film with a soundtrack of African drum music, Lye scratched "white ziggle-zag-splutter scratches" on to black leader, using a variety of tools from saw teeth to arrow heads. The first version of the film won a major award at the International Experimental Film Festival Held in Brussels in 1958 in association with the World''s Fair. Stan Brakhage described the film as "an almost unbelievably immense masterpiece".', 'In this powerful abstract film with a soundtrack of African drum music, Lye scratched "white ziggle-zag-splutter scratches" on to black leader, using a variety of tools from saw teeth to arrow heads. The first version of the film won a major award at the International Experimental Film Festival Held in Brussels in 1958 in association with the World''s Fair. Stan Brakhage described the film as "an almost unbelievably immense masterpiece".', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9VApH2rC5ZA6jVyX38HlS5HvF4R.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:129614'),
  ('533238529262145888', 'Free Rein: The Twelve Neighs of Christmas', 2018, 'Comedy, Drama, Family', 'Marek Losey', 'Vicki Lutas', 'Jaylen Barron, Manpreet Bambra, Kerry Ingram, Céline Buckens, Freddy Carter, Bruce Herbelin-Earle, Billy Angell, Charlotte Jordan', 'G', 'As Bright Fields preps for its Mistletoe Ball, a broken ornament leads Zoe to a family secret, while Gaby finds herself at the mercy of new boss Mia.', 'As Bright Fields preps for its Mistletoe Ball, a broken ornament leads Zoe to a family secret, while Gaby finds herself at the mercy of new boss Mia.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/brQBJQkWTZMuq89qTeFds7X7cqW.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:567145'),
  ('591472906523918469', 'Free Rein: Valentine''s Day', 2019, 'Romance, Family', 'Marek Losey', 'Anna McCleery, Kevin Rundle, Vicki Lutas', 'Jaylen Barron, Manpreet Bambra, Kerry Ingram, Céline Buckens, Freddy Carter, Bruce Herbelin-Earle, Charlotte Jordan, Martin Bobb-Semple', null, 'Love is in the air as Zoe and friends go on a quest to find a fabled Maid''s Stone. But when rivalry blinds them to danger, it''s Raven to the rescue!', 'Love is in the air as Zoe and friends go on a quest to find a fabled Maid''s Stone. But when rivalry blinds them to danger, it''s Raven to the rescue!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uRAWwdGqnhoi8eFCiHuipymELJR.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:579450'),
  ('577583793856092542', 'Free Ride', 2013, 'Action, Drama, Thriller', 'Shana Betz, Jessica Hurles-Laws, Quyen Tran', 'Shana Betz', 'Anna Paquin, Cam Gigandet, Drea De Matteo, Liana Liberato, Eddie Pepitone, Brit Morgan, Daniella Garcia, Sabrina Gennarino', 'R', 'A single mom in the 1970s raises her two daughters and becomes involved in illegal drug trade to make a better life.', 'A single mom in the 1970s raises her two daughters and becomes involved in illegal drug trade to make a better life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9vuDdLXgyjhiuqi0MiE66XvnbEg.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:240881'),
  ('1147339824338033364', 'Free Solo', 2018, 'Documentary, Adventure', 'Jimmy Chin, Elizabeth Chai Vasarhelyi, Jimmy Chin', null, 'Alex Honnold, Tommy Caldwell, Jimmy Chin, Sanni McCandless, Mikey Schaefer, Cheyne Lempe, Mark Synnott', 'PG-13', 'Follow Alex Honnold as he attempts to become the first person to ever free solo climb Yosemite''s 3,000 foot high El Capitan wall. With no ropes or safety gear, this would arguably be the greatest feat in rock climbing history.', 'Follow Alex Honnold as he attempts to become the first person to ever free solo climb Yosemite''s 3,000 foot high El Capitan wall. With no ropes or safety gear, this would arguably be the greatest feat in rock climbing history.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/v4QfYZMACODlWul9doN9RxE99ag.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:515042'),
  ('235908474113736411', 'Free State of Jones', 2016, 'Action, Drama, History, War', 'Garrett Warren, Jerry M. Jacob, Christopher T. Sadler', 'Gary Ross', 'Matthew McConaughey, Gugu Mbatha-Raw, Mahershala Ali, Keri Russell, Jacob Lofland, Sean Bridgers, Brad Carter, Jane McNeill', 'R', 'In 1863, Mississippi farmer Newt Knight serves as a medic for the Confederate Army. Opposed to slavery, Knight would rather help the wounded than fight the Union. After his nephew dies in battle, Newt returns home to Jones County to safeguard his family but is soon branded an outlaw deserter. Forced to flee, he finds refuge with a group of runaway slaves hiding out in the swamps. Forging an alliance with the slaves and other farmers, Knight leads a rebellion that would forever change history.', 'In 1863, Mississippi farmer Newt Knight serves as a medic for the Confederate Army. Opposed to slavery, Knight would rather help the wounded than fight the Union. After his nephew dies in battle, Newt returns home to Jones County to safeguard his family but is soon branded an outlaw deserter. Forced to flee, he finds refuge with a group of runaway slaves hiding out in the swamps. Forging an alliance with the slaves and other farmers, Knight leads a rebellion that would forever change history.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fTB6p9QwPRKIuK5LtB5CZXlkx5b.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:316152'),
  ('884694611023362054', 'Free to Play', 2014, 'Documentary', null, null, 'Benedict Lim, Danil Ishutin, Clinton Loomis', null, 'Follow three professional video game players as they overcome personal adversity, family pressures, and the realities of life to compete in a $1,000,000 tournament that could change their lives forever.', 'Follow three professional video game players as they overcome personal adversity, family pressures, and the realities of life to compete in a $1,000,000 tournament that could change their lives forever.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ohLJT2UiFLsiw3SeXrbw6dxT7Fg.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:256561'),
  ('313367743337917960', 'Free Willy', 1993, 'Family, Adventure, Drama', 'Robbie Greenberg, Simon Wincer, Jim Van Wyck', 'Corey Blechman, Keith Walker', 'Jason James Richter, Keiko, Lori Petty, August Schellenberg, Michael Madsen, Jayne Atkinson, Michael Ironside, Richard Riehle', 'PG', 'When maladjusted orphan Jesse vandalizes a theme park, he is placed with foster parents and must work at the park to make amends. There he meets Willy, a young Orca whale who has been separated from his family. Sensing kinship, they form a bond and, with the help of kindly whale trainer Rae Lindley, develop a routine of tricks. However, greedy park owner Dial soon catches wind of the duo and makes plans to profit from them.', 'When maladjusted orphan Jesse vandalizes a theme park, he is placed with foster parents and must work at the park to make amends. There he meets Willy, a young Orca whale who has been separated from his family. Sensing kinship, they form a bond and, with the help of kindly whale trainer Rae Lindley, develop a routine of tricks. However, greedy park owner Dial soon catches wind of the duo and makes plans to profit from them.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9iBgd9gi9ztWiVcYSG6zl8wDFBN.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1634'),
  ('914082135203078481', 'Free Willy 2: The Adventure Home', 1995, 'Family, Adventure, Drama, Comedy', 'László Kovács, Dwight H. Little, Conrad E. Palmisano', 'John Mattson', 'Jason James Richter, Michael Madsen, Jayne Atkinson, August Schellenberg, Mary Kate Schellhardt, Francis Capra, Mykelti Williamson, Elizabeth Peña', 'PG', 'Jesse becomes reunited with Willy three years after the whale''s jump to freedom as the teenager tries to rescue the killer whale and other orcas from an oil spill.', 'Jesse becomes reunited with Willy three years after the whale''s jump to freedom as the teenager tries to rescue the killer whale and other orcas from an oil spill.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3wpug3W5rYBdqeAnhc1UeXLE5ZF.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:9073'),
  ('466202435014693836', 'Free Willy 3: The Rescue', 1997, 'Family, Adventure', 'Sam Pillsbury, Helen Jarvis, Tobias A. Schliessler', 'John Mattson', 'Jason James Richter, August Schellenberg, Annie Corley, Vincent Berry, Patrick Kilpatrick, Tasha Simms, Peter LaCroix, Stephen E. Miller', 'PG', 'Willy the whale is back, this time threatened by illegal whalers making money off sushi. Jesse, now 16, has taken a job on an orca-researching ship, along with old friend Randolph and a sarcastic scientist, Drew. On the whaler''s ship is captain John Wesley and his son, Max, who isn''t really pleased about his father''s job, but doesn''t have the gut to say so. Along the way, Willy reunites with Jesse.', 'Willy the whale is back, this time threatened by illegal whalers making money off sushi. Jesse, now 16, has taken a job on an orca-researching ship, along with old friend Randolph and a sarcastic scientist, Drew. On the whaler''s ship is captain John Wesley and his son, Max, who isn''t really pleased about his father''s job, but doesn''t have the gut to say so. Along the way, Willy reunites with Jesse.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xzca4bxgP2aEMlPTyq5vqhsunFB.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:18519'),
  ('720121151779885255', 'Free Willy: Escape from Pirate''s Cove', 2010, 'Family, Adventure, Drama', 'Will Geiger, Robert Malpage', 'Will Geiger', 'Beau Bridges, Bindi Irwin, Matthew Dylan Roberts, Kevin Otto, Darron Meyer, Bongo Mbutuma, Siyabulela Ramba, Stephen Jennings', 'PG', 'After young Kirra leaves her Australian home to summer with her grandfather in South Africa, she soon discovers a baby orca stranded in the lagoon near her grandfather’s rundown seaside amusement park. She names the lonely whale Willy--and embarks on a great quest to lead the little guy back to his anxious pod.', 'After young Kirra leaves her Australian home to summer with her grandfather in South Africa, she soon discovers a baby orca stranded in the lagoon near her grandfather’s rundown seaside amusement park. She names the lonely whale Willy--and embarks on a great quest to lead the little guy back to his anxious pod.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/48i53xuzGLmBOvigCLW2QO1ZLPE.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:34751'),
  ('24143805824750791', 'Free Zone', 2005, 'Drama', 'Amos Gitai, Laurent Brunet, Haim Rinsky', 'Amos Gitai, Marie-Jose Sanselme', 'Natalie Portman, Hana Laslo, Hiam Abbass, Carmen Maura, Makram J. Khoury, Aki Avni, Uri Klauzner, Liron Levo', null, 'Rebecca, an American who has been living in Jerusalem for a few months now, has just broken off her engagement. She gets into a cab driven by Hanna, an Israeli. But Hanna is on her way to Jordan, to the Free Zone, to pick up a large sum of money.', 'Rebecca, an American who has been living in Jerusalem for a few months now, has just broken off her engagement. She gets into a cab driven by Hanna, an Israeli. But Hanna is on her way to Jordan, to the Free Zone, to pick up a large sum of money.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ud4A2xRAa6j92dTuOy2B2Glv5xY.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:7483'),
  ('842516001879249670', 'Free!: Take Your Marks', 2017, 'Animation, Comedy', 'Futoshi Nishiya, Futoshi Nishiya, Miku Kadowaki', 'Masahiro Yokotani', 'Tsubasa Yonaga, Mamoru Miyano, Kenichi Suzumura, Nobunaga Shimazaki, Kouki Miyata, Daisuke Hirakawa, Tatsuhisa Suzuki, Yoshimasa Hosoya', null, 'This film consists of all-new stories that are direct continuations of the previous two films and are told in four episodic parts. The four short stories take place in March as Haruka Nanase is about to graduate from Iwatobi High School.', 'This film consists of all-new stories that are direct continuations of the previous two films and are told in four episodic parts. The four short stories take place in March as Haruka Nanase is about to graduate from Iwatobi High School.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/f63hpTnddxejmBYAV5Xe22hpKRQ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:460398'),
  ('376817527913614300', 'Free!: Timeless Medley - The Bond', 2017, 'Animation, Comedy, Drama', 'Eisaku Kawanami, Yuji Shibata, Yota Tsuruoka', 'Masahiro Yokotani', 'Nobunaga Shimazaki, Daisuke Hirakawa, Kenichi Suzumura, Kouki Miyata, Koki Uchiyama, Mamoru Miyano, Tatsuhisa Suzuki, Tsubasa Yonaga', null, 'A recap movie of mostly Eternal Summer with some of season one. Focuses on Haru and Iwatobi. Also includes never before seen scenes and includes cameos from High Speed characters.', 'A recap movie of mostly Eternal Summer with some of season one. Focuses on Haru and Iwatobi. Also includes never before seen scenes and includes cameos from High Speed characters.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3qgJgdEa0pN9twylgjdTazTl23h.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:450149'),
  ('812109369710219998', 'Freebie and the Bean', 1974, 'Action, Comedy, Crime, Drama', 'Richard Rush, László Kovács, Lorin Bennett Salob', 'Robert Kaufman', 'Alan Arkin, James Caan, Loretta Swit, Jack Kruschen, Mike Kellin, Paul Koslo, Linda Marsh, John Garwood', 'R', 'Two San Francisco detectives want to bring down a local hijacking boss. But they''ll have to get to him before a hitman does.', 'Two San Francisco detectives want to bring down a local hijacking boss. But they''ll have to get to him before a hitman does.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sM9YZqppgCfVtFRX1eAgaaeaJQx.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:20802'),
  ('313750753894713580', 'Freedom', 2000, 'Drama', 'Šarūnas Bartas, Šarūnas Bartas, Rimvydas Leipus', 'Šarūnas Bartas', 'Valentinas Masalskis, Fatima Ennaflaoui, Axel Neumann, Corey Large', null, 'A few fugitives... And a very, very long way to freedom.', 'A few fugitives... And a very, very long way to freedom.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7AGvLmYvNb57Mz4OETZusdN3mM3.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:32708'),
  ('338072397344256383', 'Freedom', 2009, 'Drama', 'Tony Gatlif, Julien Hirsch', 'Tony Gatlif', 'Marc Lavoine, James Thierrée, Mathias Laliberté, Marie-Josée Croze, Carlo Brandt, Rufus, Arben Bajraktaraj, Giorgi Babluani', null, 'A Gypsy family travels the French roads during the Second World War, followed by Little Claude, a young boy seeking a new family after his parents "left and never returned". Upon reaching a town where they traditionally stop for a few months and work in vineyards, they learn that a new law forbids them from being nomadic. Theodore, the town''s mayor, and Miss Lundi, the schoolteacher, protect and help the Gypsies. Despite this, They are arrested and placed in an internment camp. Theodore manages to rescue them and gives them a piece of property where they must settle. But the Gypsies'' deeply ingrained thirst for freedom makes this sedentary lifestyle difficult to bear. After Theodore and Miss Lundi are arrested for resistance, the Gypsies decide they must get back on the move in order to remain free.', 'A Gypsy family travels the French roads during the Second World War, followed by Little Claude, a young boy seeking a new family after his parents "left and never returned". Upon reaching a town where they traditionally stop for a few months and work in vineyards, they learn that a new law forbids them from being nomadic. Theodore, the town''s mayor, and Miss Lundi, the schoolteacher, protect and help the Gypsies. Despite this, They are arrested and placed in an internment camp. Theodore manages to rescue them and gives them a piece of property where they must settle. But the Gypsies'' deeply ingrained thirst for freedom makes this sedentary lifestyle difficult to bear. After Theodore and Miss Lundi are arrested for resistance, the Gypsies decide they must get back on the move in order to remain free.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5WyxD7SmO1e65fXbFujfUCi5OkQ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:57106'),
  ('12462745129298649', 'Freedom', 2017, 'Drama', 'Tilo Hauke, Jan Speckenbach', 'Jan Speckenbach, Andreas Deinert', 'Johanna Wokalek, Hans-Jochen Wagner, Inga Birkenfeld, Ondrej Kovaľ, Barbara Philipp, Andrea Sabová, Ricky Watson, Emil von Schönfels', null, 'Nora walks out on her husband Philip and their two children without a word of explanation. She’s driven by an irresistible force. She wants to be free.', 'Nora walks out on her husband Philip and their two children without a word of explanation. She’s driven by an irresistible force. She wants to be free.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9sbdpMMmYj0aT4c1jx8TK2PX2xp.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:467245'),
  ('627383273943398441', 'Freedom', 2024, 'Action, Romance, Drama', 'Edouard Azoulay, Jean-Baptiste Pouilloux, Ornella Alagna', 'Mélanie Laurent, Christophe Deslandes', 'Lucas Bravo, Yvan Attal, Léa Luce Busato, Steve Tientcheu, David Ayala, Léo Chalié, Slimane Dazi, David Murgia', null, 'Inspired by the true events of one of France''s most notorious non-violent robbers, Bruno Sulak, in the 1980s. He led multiple heists, then captured public attention for his many daring escapes from police custody...always to reunite with his beloved lover and accomplice Annie, becoming both France''s Public Enemy #1 and an icon of Freedom.', 'Inspired by the true events of one of France''s most notorious non-violent robbers, Bruno Sulak, in the 1980s. He led multiple heists, then captured public attention for his many daring escapes from police custody...always to reunite with his beloved lover and accomplice Annie, becoming both France''s Public Enemy #1 and an icon of Freedom.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/b2YL2kncIqlcDcqly78AsOPJi6r.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1142518'),
  ('731175068010773560', 'Freedom Fighters: The Ray', 2018, 'Animation, Action, Fantasy', 'Ethan Spaulding', 'Lauren Certo, Marc Guggenheim, Sarah Hernandez', 'Russell Tovey, Megalyn Echikunwoke, Echo Kellum, Iddo Goldberg, Sunil Malhotra, Matthew Mercer, Jason Mitchell, Colleen O''Shaughnessey', null, 'Earth-X is one of many realities in the multiverse, with one glaring difference from our Earth: The Nazis won World War II. Led by The Ray, a group of heroes known as the Freedom Fighters battle selflessly against tyranny. But when The Ray is transported to our Earth to save his life, he passes his powers to his unsuspecting counterpart, Ray Terrill. Charged with superhuman abilities, Terrill is newly christened The Ray and must adapt and overcome the challenges of crime-fighting with a little help from The Flash and Green Arrow. Seasoned and ready to fight, The Ray now faces his biggest battle: a return to Earth-X to lead the Freedom Fighters against Overgirl and her evil Nazi henchmen!', 'Earth-X is one of many realities in the multiverse, with one glaring difference from our Earth: The Nazis won World War II. Led by The Ray, a group of heroes known as the Freedom Fighters battle selflessly against tyranny. But when The Ray is transported to our Earth to save his life, he passes his powers to his unsuspecting counterpart, Ray Terrill. Charged with superhuman abilities, Terrill is newly christened The Ray and must adapt and overcome the challenges of crime-fighting with a little help from The Flash and Green Arrow. Seasoned and ready to fight, The Ray now faces his biggest battle: a return to Earth-X to lead the Freedom Fighters against Overgirl and her evil Nazi henchmen!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jo6ItNdatsIJuIN6WNXI94q74Yq.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:539626'),
  ('1024261604153800424', 'Freedom Force', 2012, 'Animation, Adventure, Family', 'Eduardo Schuldt', 'Abraham Vurnbrand', 'Bruno Ascenzo, Julio Morín, Emilio Treviño, Mildred Barrera, Moisés Iván Mora, Giovanni Ciccia, Connie Chaparro, Moisés Suárez', 'PG', 'There is a plot under way to change the course of history. Four kids are chosen to be the Freedom Force—a gang of unlikely heroes who travel through time to change the outcome of sacred stories.', 'There is a plot under way to change the course of history. Four kids are chosen to be the Freedom Force—a gang of unlikely heroes who travel through time to change the outcome of sacred stories.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vix3uo8gmocpuPdiNzM2E8Waptp.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:126565'),
  ('95762639285206682', 'Freedom Is Paradise', 1989, 'Drama', 'Sergei Bodrov, Yuri Skhirtladze, Viktor Trakhtenberg', 'Sergei Bodrov', 'Aleksandr Bureyev, Sergei Bodrov Jr., Svetlana Gaytan, Volodya Kozyrev, Kseniya Nazarova, Vytautas Tomkus, Luiza Mosendz, Valeriya Prikhodchenko', null, 'Young Sasha is brought into a state-run children''s home because his mother died early and his father spends most of his life in prison. The conditions are like in a penal institution. Sasha tries several times to escape and to search for his father.', 'Young Sasha is brought into a state-run children''s home because his mother died early and his father spends most of his life in prison. The conditions are like in a penal institution. Sasha tries several times to escape and to search for his father.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iahW9GSfncZxmXk19achCCl01XG.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:196895'),
  ('30978990628108753', 'Freedom Strike', 1998, 'Action', 'Jerry P. Jacobs', 'Tony Giglio', 'Michael Dudikoff, Tone Loc, Felicity Waterman, Jay Anthony, Nicolas Coster, James Karen, Michael Fairman, Frank Roman', null, 'When a peace treaty between America and Syria is thwarted, the renegade head of the Syrian army retaliates in a major way. He steals a nuclear weapon that only the Freedom Strike team can stop! Cue an action-packed race against time to save the world.', 'When a peace treaty between America and Syria is thwarted, the renegade head of the Syrian army retaliates in a major way. He steals a nuclear weapon that only the Freedom Strike team can stop! Cue an action-packed race against time to save the world.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gGrF9MFWzSZHojBqYO5eNLmdNOq.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:274478'),
  ('208715111768601437', 'Freedom Strikes a Blow', 1973, 'Action', 'Tsai Yang-Ming', 'Tao Liang', 'Michael Chan Wai-Man, Fan Chiang, Bolo Yeung, Fong Yau, Huang Tsung-Hsun, Leung Tin, Lee Tin-Ying, Lam Saan', 'PG', 'A martial arts fighter, haunted by his past, takes a job as a dock worker in a small village. His vow never to fight again is tested by the cruel owner of the pier.', 'A martial arts fighter, haunted by his past, takes a job as a dock worker in a small village. His vow never to fight again is tested by the cruel owner of the pier.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cspCpdH5KNnkRx5iLijCrFfC01m.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:54861'),
  ('1080315710804906141', 'Freedom to Love', 1969, 'Documentary, Drama', 'Phyllis Kronhausen, Eberhardt Kronhausen, Paul Grupp', 'Phyllis Kronhausen, Eberhardt Kronhausen', 'Daniel D. Halleck, Hugh Hefner, Franulka Heyermans, Kees van der Wusten, Monique Kraamwinkel, Sacha Kraamwinkel, Marie Antoinette, John Bowen', null, 'A sex education film dedicated to all forms of human sexuality.', 'A sex education film dedicated to all forms of human sexuality.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9fIEWPghYIGuORjto07idgcmwb9.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:80236'),
  ('686586301328962860', 'Freedom-Oleron', 2001, 'Comedy', 'Bruno Podalydès, Giorgos Arvanitis, Pierre Minot', 'Denis Podalydès, Bruno Podalydès', 'Denis Podalydès, Guilaine Londez, Arnaud Jalbert, Ange Ruzé, Lou-Nil Font, Jean Podalydès, Patrick Pineau, Éric Elmosnino', null, '39 years old Jacques Monot is tired from the same vacation he and his family have every year so he decides to buy a boat.', '39 years old Jacques Monot is tired from the same vacation he and his family have every year so he decides to buy a boat.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7CJBN9xykvECkDUcXKg5j6FwKNZ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:70487'),
  ('180544459383708922', 'Freedomfighters', 1996, 'War, Drama, History', 'Vicente Aranda, José Luis Alcaine, Juan Amorós', 'Antonio Rabinad, Vicente Aranda', 'Ana Belén, Victoria Abril, Ariadna Gil, Blanca Apilánez, Laura Mañá, Loles León, Jorge Sanz, José Sancho', null, 'At the outbreak of the Spanish Civil War, the nun Maria is forced to flee her convent. She takes refuge in a brothel, until it is liberated by a woman''s anarchist group. Maria joins the group and eventually goes to the front. The women''s group faces the problems of fighting not only the nationalists, but also factions on the left seeking to impose a more traditional military structure.', 'At the outbreak of the Spanish Civil War, the nun Maria is forced to flee her convent. She takes refuge in a brothel, until it is liberated by a woman''s anarchist group. Maria joins the group and eventually goes to the front. The women''s group faces the problems of fighting not only the nationalists, but also factions on the left seeking to impose a more traditional military structure.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/k9HiiZRNS6N0PnUM7Wyeo5cspEn.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:58097'),
  ('225687082648437903', 'Freedomland', 2006, 'Thriller, Crime, Mystery', 'Joe Roth, Anastas N. Michos, Toni Barton', null, 'Samuel L. Jackson, Julianne Moore, Edie Falco, Aunjanue Ellis-Taylor, William Forsythe, Anthony Mackie, Peter Friedman, Domenick Lombardozzi', 'R', 'A black police detective must solve a strange case of a kidnapped boy and deal with a big racial protest.', 'A black police detective must solve a strange case of a kidnapped boy and deal with a big racial protest.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fM9MYcI7BHJ2YqEtcr8JKPE8nDB.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:9959'),
  ('105741414153331859', 'Freefall', 1994, 'Action', 'John Irvin, Yossi Wein', 'Les Weldon, David Zito', 'Eric Roberts, Jeff Fahey, Pamela Gidley, Ron Smerczak, Anthony Fridjhon, Warrick Grier, Lesley Fong, Ted Le Plat', null, 'New York publisher Dex Dellum sends his fiancée and star photographer Katy Mazur to Swaziland to shoot the taita falcon. There she meets ''highman'' (altitude stuntman) Grant Orion, who practices skydiving. After an initial clash, they become hot lovers, her first infidelity. She''s drugged before he leaves unannounced. In London Grant saves her from armed killers and discloses to be an Interpol agent. Dex has an incompatible story but is killed. It''s the start of a cascade of violence and charades.', 'New York publisher Dex Dellum sends his fiancée and star photographer Katy Mazur to Swaziland to shoot the taita falcon. There she meets ''highman'' (altitude stuntman) Grant Orion, who practices skydiving. After an initial clash, they become hot lovers, her first infidelity. She''s drugged before he leaves unannounced. In London Grant saves her from armed killers and discloses to be an Interpol agent. Dex has an incompatible story but is killed. It''s the start of a cascade of violence and charades.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6yfZiP3JkUbI38YEXL2AW6X4zPf.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:215136'),
