  ('891366737675633457', 'Freelance', 2023, 'Action, Comedy', 'Elaine Grainger, Pierre Morel, Thierry Arbogast', 'Jacob Lentz', 'John Cena, Alison Brie, Juan Pablo Raba, Christian Slater, Alice Eve, Marton Csokas, Sebastián Eslava, Molly McCann', 'R', 'An ex-special forces operative takes a job to provide security for a journalist as she interviews a dictator, but a military coup breaks out in the middle of the interview, they are forced to escape into the jungle where they must survive.', 'An ex-special forces operative takes a job to provide security for a journalist as she interviews a dictator, but a military coup breaks out in the middle of the interview, they are forced to escape into the jungle where they must survive.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7Bd4EUOqQDKZXA6Od5gkfzRNb0.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:897087'),
  ('813355276000345729', 'Freelancers', 2012, 'Mystery, Drama, Action, Crime', 'Dan Laz Lazarovits, Tommy Martin, Andy Ross', 'L. Philippe Casseus', '50 Cent, Forest Whitaker, Robert De Niro, Ryan O''Nan, Matt Gerald, Beau Garrett, Malcolm Goodwin, Robert Wisdom', 'R', 'The son of a slain NYPD officer joins the force, where he falls in with his father''s former partner and a team of rogue cops. His new boss, Sarcone, will see if he has what it takes to be rogue through many trials and tribulations of loyalty, trust and respect. When the truth about his father''s death is revealed revenge takes him over and he won''t stop until justice has been truly served.', 'The son of a slain NYPD officer joins the force, where he falls in with his father''s former partner and a team of rogue cops. His new boss, Sarcone, will see if he has what it takes to be rogue through many trials and tribulations of loyalty, trust and respect. When the truth about his father''s death is revealed revenge takes him over and he won''t stop until justice has been truly served.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qCvA4Cw7lsYGR5fatVcoPEIYolU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:122800'),
  ('1077669047646853626', 'Freerunner', 2011, 'Action', 'Lawrence Silverstein, Claudio Chea', 'Matthew Chadwick, Raimund Huber, Jeremy Sklar', 'Sean Faris, Danny Dyer, Tamer Hassan, Amanda Fuller, Seymour Cassel, Mariah Bonner, Casey Durkin, Jia Mae', 'R', 'With a ticking bomb locked to his neck, a young freerunner races against the clock and all types of baddies to get from one end of the city to the other to save himself and his girlfriend.', 'With a ticking bomb locked to his neck, a young freerunner races against the clock and all types of baddies to get from one end of the city to the other to save himself and his girlfriend.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uy1FNiDvSqUkAKkQ7Nvb42ntdfr.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:76101'),
