  ('79719283988723955', 'Freeway', 1988, 'Horror, Crime, Thriller', 'Francis Delia, Frank Byers', 'Darrell Fetty, Francis Delia', 'Darlanne Fluegel, James Russo, Billy Drago, Richard Belzer, Michael Callan, Joe Palese, Steve Franken, Brian Kaiser', 'R', 'A deeply disturbed man goes on a murderous nighttime rampage across Los Angeles.', 'A deeply disturbed man goes on a murderous nighttime rampage across Los Angeles.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cxv8MRnpAhd4izS0yHHeQPgn6FR.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:211729'),
  ('725452905533460794', 'Freeway', 1996, 'Comedy, Crime, Thriller, Drama', 'Matthew Bright, John Thomas, Timothy Bird', 'Matthew Bright', 'Kiefer Sutherland, Reese Witherspoon, Wolfgang Bodison, Dan Hedaya, Amanda Plummer, Brooke Shields, Michael T. Weiss, Bokeem Woodbine', 'R', 'Following the arrest of her mother, Ramona, young Vanessa Lutz decides to go in search of her estranged grandmother. On the way, she is given a ride by school counselor Bob Wolverton. During the journey, Lutz begins to realize that Bob is the notorious I-5 Killer and manages to escape by shooting him several times. Wounded but still very much alive, Bob pursues Lutz across the state in this modern retelling of Little Red Riding Hood.', 'Following the arrest of her mother, Ramona, young Vanessa Lutz decides to go in search of her estranged grandmother. On the way, she is given a ride by school counselor Bob Wolverton. During the journey, Lutz begins to realize that Bob is the notorious I-5 Killer and manages to escape by shooting him several times. Wounded but still very much alive, Bob pursues Lutz across the state in this modern retelling of Little Red Riding Hood.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/m0pAARUq3foDWFsrUmlYDHtNPE9.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:11229'),
  ('472027886035665474', 'Freeway II: Confessions of a Trickbaby', 2000, 'Comedy, Crime', 'Jason Furukawa, Kevin Leslie, Debra Herst', 'Matthew Bright', 'Natasha Lyonne, María Celedonio, Vincent Gallo, David Alan Grier, Michael T. Weiss, John Landis, Max Perlich, Bob Dawson', 'R', 'A twisted teenage prostitute and an equally deranged vicious killer manage to escape from the pen and embark on a non-stop orgy of violence and debauchery, all while hoping to make it across the border into Mexico in order to seek refuge with the mysterious Sister Gomez.', 'A twisted teenage prostitute and an equally deranged vicious killer manage to escape from the pen and embark on a non-stop orgy of violence and debauchery, all while hoping to make it across the border into Mexico in order to seek refuge with the mysterious Sister Gomez.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5GDjVq3WhQRc7OlKb6QDQzxKdk7.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:39927'),
  ('1041161706143734779', 'Freeway Killer', 2009, 'Horror, Thriller, Drama, Crime', 'John Murlowski, John Murlowski', 'David Birke', 'Scott Anthony Leet, Cole Williams, Dusty Sorg, Michael Rooker, Eileen Dietz, Helen Wilson, Debbon Ayer, Mercy Malick', 'R', 'For years he terrorized California motorists as he rode the endless highways searching for his next victim. The discarded bodies turned up beaten, sexually assaulted and horribly mutilated. Deceptively charming and intelligent, the scheming murderer easily avoided police at first. But as police closed in and the killer’s pattern grew more erratic, the only question was how many more will die?', 'For years he terrorized California motorists as he rode the endless highways searching for his next victim. The discarded bodies turned up beaten, sexually assaulted and horribly mutilated. Deceptively charming and intelligent, the scheming murderer easily avoided police at first. But as police closed in and the killer’s pattern grew more erratic, the only question was how many more will die?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/enrh35Wz7xd6LExXSryOqOrTTGt.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:31992'),
  ('409700463336990137', 'Freeze Frame', 1979, 'Animation, Comedy', 'Chuck Jones', null, null, null, 'Wile E. Coyote chases the Road Runner across a frozen desert.', 'Wile E. Coyote chases the Road Runner across a frozen desert.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8y4bsoXtjmEMjjyKcwX72in9mo2.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:197768'),
  ('979062757691935025', 'Freeze Frame', 2004, 'Thriller, Drama, Crime', 'Mark Garrett, John Simpson', 'John Simpson', 'Lee Evans, Sean McGinley, Ian McNeice, Colin Salmon, Rachael Stirling, Rachel O’Riordan, Andrew Wilson, Andrea Grimason', 'R', 'Sean Veil is an ultra paranoid murder suspect who takes to filming himself round the clock to provide an alibi, just in case he''s ever accused of another crime. Problems arise however when the police do come calling and the one tape that can prove his innocence has mysteriously disappeared.', 'Sean Veil is an ultra paranoid murder suspect who takes to filming himself round the clock to provide an alibi, just in case he''s ever accused of another crime. Problems arise however when the police do come calling and the one tape that can prove his innocence has mysteriously disappeared.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/A7SNMoBXWt0GAdktkVY1SB3y3vQ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:12612'),
  ('384428048974269309', 'Freeze Me', 2000, 'Drama, Horror, Thriller', 'Takashi Ishii, Yasushi Sasakibara', 'Takashi Ishii', 'Harumi Inoue, Shingo Tsurumi, Kazuki Kitamura, Shunsuke Matsuoka, Daisuke Iijima, Ito Yozaburo, Naoto Takenaka', null, 'When a woman is harassed and threatened by one of the men who gang-raped her five years previously, she is pushed to take icy revenge against her attackers.', 'When a woman is harassed and threatened by one of the men who gang-raped her five years previously, she is pushed to take icy revenge against her attackers.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pFvL4nBFIAACLwrnts3FISNESDz.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:37998'),
  ('1115149576827413575', 'Freeze, Die, Come to Life', 1990, 'Drama', 'Vitali Kanevsky, Vladimir Brylyakov', 'Vitali Kanevsky', 'Dinara Drukarova, Pavel Nazarov, Elena Popova, Valeri Ivchenko, Nikolay Mikheev, Vyacheslav Bambushek, Vadim Yermolayev, Valentina Kosobutskaya', null, 'Stuck in a mining town near Vladivostok in 1947 amongst Soviet exiles and Japanese POWs (Japanese prisoners remained in Siberia for years after the war had ended), the kids have to come up with something to keep them busy. Two friends, Valerka and Galia, play some peculiar, very dangerous games of their own amid the man-made wasteland of Suchan.', 'Stuck in a mining town near Vladivostok in 1947 amongst Soviet exiles and Japanese POWs (Japanese prisoners remained in Siberia for years after the war had ended), the kids have to come up with something to keep them busy. Two friends, Valerka and Galia, play some peculiar, very dangerous games of their own amid the man-made wasteland of Suchan.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pi6CZR4O6btbY91H5qL3BBfmySc.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:41948'),
  ('444440824579595838', 'Freezer', 2014, 'Action, Thriller', 'Simon Board, Martin Pedersen, John Dyer', 'Shane Weisfeld, Tom Doganoglu', 'Dylan McDermott, Peter Facinelli, Yuliya Snigir, Mickey Milan, Andrey Ivchenko, Rafael Petardi, David McNally, Markus Parilo', 'R', 'New York city mechanic Robert Saunders is knocked unconscious at his birthday dinner by Russian thugs and wakes up to find himself locked inside the restaurant''s industrial freezer. This ruthless gang demand he return the $8 million he has stolen from them. The only problem Robert has no idea what they are talking about. But as the temperature drops and the terror grows, the shocking truth begins to emerge as Robert struggles to survive.', 'New York city mechanic Robert Saunders is knocked unconscious at his birthday dinner by Russian thugs and wakes up to find himself locked inside the restaurant''s industrial freezer. This ruthless gang demand he return the $8 million he has stolen from them. The only problem Robert has no idea what they are talking about. But as the temperature drops and the terror grows, the shocking truth begins to emerge as Robert struggles to survive.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kxtp9hqHK22x9DUVsQE58rrpJvz.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:243531'),
  ('566897391697856567', 'Freibad', 2022, 'Comedy', 'Doris Dörrie', 'Doris Dörrie', 'Andrea Sawatzki, Maria Happel, Nilam Farooq, Lisa Wagner, Melodie Simina, Julia Jendroßek, Sabrina Amali, Nico Stank', null, 'It''s summer and very hot in Germany''s only open-air swimming pool for women. There, women bathe topless, in a bikini, bathing suit or burkini. Each follows different rules. This always leads to friction, which the overwhelmed lifeguard is not quite able to control. When a group of completely veiled women enthusiastically discovers the women''s bath for themselves, rags literally fly: Who owns the bath and who makes the rules? Who owns the female body? And when is a woman a woman at all? The lifeguard resigns, exasperated. But when a man of all people is hired as the successor as lifeguard, the situation escalates in unpredictable directions.', 'It''s summer and very hot in Germany''s only open-air swimming pool for women. There, women bathe topless, in a bikini, bathing suit or burkini. Each follows different rules. This always leads to friction, which the overwhelmed lifeguard is not quite able to control. When a group of completely veiled women enthusiastically discovers the women''s bath for themselves, rags literally fly: Who owns the bath and who makes the rules? Who owns the female body? And when is a woman a woman at all? The lifeguard resigns, exasperated. But when a man of all people is hired as the successor as lifeguard, the situation escalates in unpredictable directions.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dSP5JIDKtuQDQ84CecRnleTFMiu.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:978399'),
  ('831905442296923816', 'Freiheit', 1966, 'Drama', 'George Lucas', null, 'Randal Kleiser, Christopher Lewis', null, 'This film shows a German student escaping across the Berlin Border and being shot to death, while on the soundtrack, various platitudes about dying for freedom can be heard.', 'This film shows a German student escaping across the Berlin Border and being shot to death, while on the soundtrack, various platitudes about dying for freedom can be heard.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uTJi76TqpMzmAR5YocMNv6kti6a.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:53167'),
  ('833418138448052456', 'Fremont', 2023, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Babak Jalali, Laura Valladao, Elaine Marie Gibson', 'Carolina Cavalli, Babak Jalali', 'Anaita Wali Zada, Jeremy Allen White, Gregg Turkington, Hilda Schmelling, Siddique Ahmed, Taban Ibraz, Avis See-tho, Timur Nusratty', 'NR', 'Donya, a lonely Afghan refugee and former translator, spends her twenties drifting through a meager existence in Fremont, California. Shuttling between her job writing fortunes for a fortune cookie factory and sessions with her eccentric therapist, Donya suffers from insomnia and survivor''s guilt over those still left behind in Kabul as she desperately searches for love.', 'Donya, a lonely Afghan refugee and former translator, spends her twenties drifting through a meager existence in Fremont, California. Shuttling between her job writing fortunes for a fortune cookie factory and sessions with her eccentric therapist, Donya suffers from insomnia and survivor''s guilt over those still left behind in Kabul as she desperately searches for love.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wJZovPXB3SWL1BL1GyLrCRrk4z9.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1048522'),
  ('88674475356507325', 'French Blood', 2015, 'Drama', 'Diastème', null, 'Alban Lenoir, Samuel Jouy, Paul Hamy, Olivier Chenille, Jeanne Rosa, Alex Martin, Jean-Marie Le Pen, Alain Naron', null, 'Marco Lopez, a former Neo-Nazi and skinhead, tries to leave his violent, racist and hateful past behind him.', 'Marco Lopez, a former Neo-Nazi and skinhead, tries to leave his violent, racist and hateful past behind him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eflY76R1AkWwWwv5n7Y3JLzHxvM.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:337730'),
  ('125124437847446811', 'French Blood 1 - Mr. Pig', 2020, 'Horror', 'Rodolphe Bonnet, Matthieu Budin, Thomas Walser', null, 'Leslie Carles, Delphine Biard, Pierre Lucat, Margot Migno-Michel, Emmanuel Bonami, Sophie Chamoux, Gérard Dessalles, Yannick Laurent', null, 'FRENCH BLOOD tells the story of a woman who was raped and left for dead by a gang of five men hiding behind masks: Mr. Pig, Mr. Rabbit, Mr. Frog, Mr. Sheep and Mr. Wolf. It’s now up to her to take up the mask and her revenge… This is the thread that leads from one movie to the other: HER revenue. In the first five chapters, she finds each one of her five abusers, and so wearing her mask she lets her anger and hurt loose. Every chapter of FRENCH BLOOD includes three to four short films, all of them dealing with the single storyline of the main character. In this butcher''s shop, a young geek addicted to horror films is stripped naked by a pervert zombie, a group of friends is murdered with a machete by a couple of degenerates, and an old successful author is found dead in his mansion, while a pedophile psychopath prowls around.', 'FRENCH BLOOD tells the story of a woman who was raped and left for dead by a gang of five men hiding behind masks: Mr. Pig, Mr. Rabbit, Mr. Frog, Mr. Sheep and Mr. Wolf. It’s now up to her to take up the mask and her revenge… This is the thread that leads from one movie to the other: HER revenue. In the first five chapters, she finds each one of her five abusers, and so wearing her mask she lets her anger and hurt loose. Every chapter of FRENCH BLOOD includes three to four short films, all of them dealing with the single storyline of the main character. In this butcher''s shop, a young geek addicted to horror films is stripped naked by a pervert zombie, a group of friends is murdered with a machete by a couple of degenerates, and an old successful author is found dead in his mansion, while a pedophile psychopath prowls around.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xkTVKb8Ws7yHbk3MwIiya9qiHj2.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:688146'),
  ('278119991054321117', 'French Cancan', 1955, 'Comedy, Drama, Romance, Music', 'Jean Renoir, Pierre Kast, Serge Vallin', 'Jean Renoir', 'Jean Gabin, Françoise Arnoul, María Félix, Anna Amendola, Jean-Roger Caussimon, Dora Doll, Giani Esposito, Gaston Gabaroche', null, 'Nineteenth-century Paris comes vibrantly alive in Jean Renoir’s exhilarating tale of the opening of the world-renowned Moulin Rouge. Jean Gabin plays the wily impresario Danglard, who makes the cancan all the rage while juggling the love of two beautiful women—an Egyptian belly-dancer and a naive working girl turned cancan star.', 'Nineteenth-century Paris comes vibrantly alive in Jean Renoir’s exhilarating tale of the opening of the world-renowned Moulin Rouge. Jean Gabin plays the wily impresario Danglard, who makes the cancan all the rage while juggling the love of two beautiful women—an Egyptian belly-dancer and a naive working girl turned cancan star.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/slIF5i3Mz03I90sqoxj7Xteutyb.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:45213'),
