  ('96572043318586471', 'French Cuisine', 2015, 'Comedy', 'Florent-Emilio Siri, Giovanni Fiore Coltellacci', 'Gilles Grangier', 'Gérard Lanvin, Pascale Arbillot, Franck Dubosc, Audrey Dana, Catherine Lachens, Stefan Godin, Nader Boussandel, Marc Barbé', null, 'François and Charlotte directed together a gourmet hotel and restaurant on the edge of the sea, but their marital relationship is not fixed beauty: obsessive hard, Francis wants his first star in the Michelin Guide while Charlotte, at the dawn of the quarantine, dreams of a first child. This already complicated situation will literally explode the day where Charlotte''s first husband, Alex, disembarked in their lives while everyone believed him dead in the terrible tsunami of 2004...', 'François and Charlotte directed together a gourmet hotel and restaurant on the edge of the sea, but their marital relationship is not fixed beauty: obsessive hard, Francis wants his first star in the Michelin Guide while Charlotte, at the dawn of the quarantine, dreams of a first child. This already complicated situation will literally explode the day where Charlotte''s first husband, Alex, disembarked in their lives while everyone believed him dead in the terrible tsunami of 2004...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/k2q2z5bxlU2NP5aFj5oHZA1GM5o.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:373960'),
  ('999010799452618617', 'French Dolls', 2014, 'Comedy', 'Katia Lewkowicz, Nicolas Gaurin', 'Maud Ameline', 'Marina Foïs, Noémie Lvovsky, Laura Smet, Lola Dueñas, Jonathan Zaccaï, Michaël Abiteboul, Dominique Labourier, Richard Sammel', null, 'Louise, Sam, Lili. Three women who don''t know each other but whom will be forced to meet, get together, and compare themselves to each other by the wild will of evolution.', 'Louise, Sam, Lili. Three women who don''t know each other but whom will be forced to meet, get together, and compare themselves to each other by the wild will of evolution.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jnCuA24wTjW7XkYbZsNf5Pw5pgT.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:302627'),
  ('220825353088080489', 'French Dressing', 1964, 'Comedy', 'Ken Russell, Kenneth Higgins, Michael Stevenson', 'Peter Brett', 'James Booth, Roy Kinnear, Marisa Mell, Alita Naughton, Bryan Pringle, Germaine Delbat, Norman Pitt, Henry McCarty', null, 'A deck-chair attendant at a British resort promotes a film festival featuring a French sexpot.', 'A deck-chair attendant at a British resort promotes a film festival featuring a French sexpot.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/m5oqXnICYUaGa4kJGXBzaXqToSG.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:3522'),
  ('1104432444116773536', 'French Exit', 2021, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Azazel Jacobs, Tobias Datum, Michel Marrec', 'Patrick DeWitt', 'Michelle Pfeiffer, Lucas Hedges, Tracy Letts, Valerie Mahaffey, Susan Coyne, Imogen Poots, Danielle Macdonald, Isaach de Bankolé', 'R', '“My plan was to die before the money ran out,” says 60-year-old penniless Manhattan socialite Frances Price, but things didn’t go as planned. Her husband Franklin has been dead for 12 years and with his vast inheritance gone, she cashes in the last of her possessions and resolves to live out her twilight days anonymously in a borrowed apartment in Paris, accompanied by her directionless son Malcolm and a cat named Small Frank—who may or may not embody the spirit of Frances’s dead husband.', '“My plan was to die before the money ran out,” says 60-year-old penniless Manhattan socialite Frances Price, but things didn’t go as planned. Her husband Franklin has been dead for 12 years and with his vast inheritance gone, she cashes in the last of her possessions and resolves to live out her twilight days anonymously in a borrowed apartment in Paris, accompanied by her directionless son Malcolm and a cat named Small Frank—who may or may not embody the spirit of Frances’s dead husband.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/l5iZuQr62YCs72AZ9P3HwApowaC.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:599960'),
  ('444194969972319869', 'French for Beginners', 2006, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Christian Ditter, Christian Rein', null, 'François Goeske, Paula Schramm, Lennard Bertzbach, Christian Tramitz, Dietrich Adam, Andreas Borcherding, Élodie Bollée, Charlotte Baglan', null, 'The story of Henrik, who takes part in a student exchange program with France. The only reason for this journey is to conquer the heart of his dream girl. Wild Partys, exciting trips, a crazy host family and of course his trouble with the French language turn the - at first unmeant - holidays into a memorable summer.', 'The story of Henrik, who takes part in a student exchange program with France. The only reason for this journey is to conquer the heart of his dream girl. Wild Partys, exciting trips, a crazy host family and of course his trouble with the French language turn the - at first unmeant - holidays into a memorable summer.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5E2bKqUsUL2S7RucQgfTrAaIbNX.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:10123'),
  ('169101939009618758', 'French Fried Vacation', 1978, 'Comedy', 'Patrice Leconte, Jean-François Robin', 'Dominique Lavanant, Josiane Balasko, Marie-Anne Chazel', 'Thierry Lhermitte, Christian Clavier, Gérard Jugnot, Josiane Balasko, Michel Blanc, Dominique Lavanant, Bruno Moynot, Marie-Anne Chazel', null, 'Holidaymakers arriving in a Club Med camp on the Ivory Coast are determined to forget their everyday problems and emotional disappointments. Games, competitions, outings, bathing and sunburn accompany a continual succession of casual affairs.', 'Holidaymakers arriving in a Club Med camp on the Ivory Coast are determined to forget their everyday problems and emotional disappointments. Games, competitions, outings, bathing and sunburn accompany a continual succession of casual affairs.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cj82wH8irxpCijTQWIASfYkQylw.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:11183'),
  ('22594620789618273', 'French Fried Vacation 2', 1979, 'Comedy', 'Patrice Leconte, Jean-François Robin', 'Christian Clavier, Gérard Jugnot, Michel Blanc', 'Thierry Lhermitte, Michel Blanc, Christian Clavier, Gérard Jugnot, Josiane Balasko, Dominique Lavanant, Maurice Chevit, Marie-Anne Chazel', null, 'In this sequel to Les Bronzes (1978) summer has passed, but that doesn''t mean the fun has to end for Bernard, Nathalie, Gigi, Jerome, Popeye, Jean-Claude, and Christiane.', 'In this sequel to Les Bronzes (1978) summer has passed, but that doesn''t mean the fun has to end for Bernard, Nathalie, Gigi, Jerome, Popeye, Jean-Claude, and Christiane.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tEiNHF6SqfguCKBdxwukrK10KbH.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:33701'),
  ('368061196847345529', 'French Fried Vacations 3: Friends Forever', 2006, 'Comedy', 'Patrice Leconte, Jean-Marie Dreujou', 'Marie-Anne Chazel, Christian Clavier, Gérard Jugnot', 'Josiane Balasko, Michel Blanc, Marie-Anne Chazel, Christian Clavier, Gérard Jugnot, Thierry Lhermitte, Dominique Lavanant, Martin Lamotte', null, 'After the Club Med and skiing, what happened to the Bronzés 27 years later? Early response: the same, and worse.', 'After the Club Med and skiing, what happened to the Bronzés 27 years later? Early response: the same, and worse.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ot2ZJ0mhQIDuExQjqBJfKcwxSy1.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:21435'),
  ('898243887945072086', 'French Girl', 2024, 'Romance, Comedy', 'James A. Woods, Karel Quinn, Nicolas Wright', 'James A. Woods, Nicolas Wright', 'Zach Braff, Evelyne Brochu, Vanessa Hudgens, Antoine Olivier Pilon, Luc Picard, Isabelle Vincent, Charlotte Aubin, Muriel Dutil', 'R', 'Sweet Gordon, an affable English teacher in Brooklyn, has beaten the odds; a French Girl has fallen in love with him and he’s fallen even harder back. But their future is thrown into limbo when she interviews for an executive chef position in her hometown of Quebec City. To Gordon’s dismay her future boss also happens to be her former lover, a celebrity Chef with oceanic eyes and a hit TV show. Good luck Gordon.', 'Sweet Gordon, an affable English teacher in Brooklyn, has beaten the odds; a French Girl has fallen in love with him and he’s fallen even harder back. But their future is thrown into limbo when she interviews for an executive chef position in her hometown of Quebec City. To Gordon’s dismay her future boss also happens to be her former lover, a celebrity Chef with oceanic eyes and a hit TV show. Good luck Gordon.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/Bu1cgfaLOqELu11qRdmzYX6o6K.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1024452'),
  ('578491347706542925', 'French Kiss', 1995, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Lawrence Kasdan, Owen Roizman, Charles Okun', 'Adam Brooks', 'Meg Ryan, Kevin Kline, Timothy Hutton, Jean Reno, Adam Brooks, François Cluzet, Suzan Anbeh, Renée Humphrey', 'PG-13', 'After her fiancee admits to infidelity while on a business trip in France, a woman attempts to get her lover back and marry him by traveling to Paris despite her crippling fear of flying. On the way she unwittingly smuggles something of value that has a charming crook chasing her across France as she chases after her future husband.', 'After her fiancee admits to infidelity while on a business trip in France, a woman attempts to get her lover back and marry him by traveling to Paris despite her crippling fear of flying. On the way she unwittingly smuggles something of value that has a charming crook chasing her across France as she chases after her future husband.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/q5hXdMfxSwhuOmWmkTJmm5qVijc.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:397'),
  ('123918522246185280', 'French Lolita', 1998, 'Drama, Romance', 'Pierre B. Reinhard', null, 'Cécile Fleury, Richard Sun Kwok-Ho', null, 'Paris, the city of love. Not for our young heroine, who, frustrated by her father''s ignorance, runs away from home and seeks her fortune in the glittering city.', 'Paris, the city of love. Not for our young heroine, who, frustrated by her father''s ignorance, runs away from home and seeks her fortune in the glittering city.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ydnX6nKNiJ7ESGi4nDT2YR4sTCK.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:739936'),
  ('119040393954203991', 'French Lover', 2025, 'Romance, Comedy', 'Renaud Chassaing, Lisa-Nina Rives, Manon Manucci', 'Hugo Gélin, Lisa-Nina Rives', 'Omar Sy, Sara Giraudeau, Pascale Arbillot, Alban Ivanov, Cindy Bruna, Benoît Crou, Agnès Hurstel, Xavier Lacaille', 'R', 'When a jaded actor meets a down-on-her-luck waitress in Paris, their unexpected love story begins — but will it survive the glare of the spotlight?', 'When a jaded actor meets a down-on-her-luck waitress in Paris, their unexpected love story begins — but will it survive the glare of the spotlight?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bLqPpqNoKbNbXysIeft1tLIl6KB.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1289888'),
  ('973023256426482038', 'French Provincial', 1975, 'Comedy, Drama', 'André Téchiné, Bruno Nuytten', 'André Téchiné, Marilyn Goldin', 'Jeanne Moreau, Michel Auclair, Marie-France Pisier, Claude Mann, Orane Demazis, Aram Stephan, Hélène Surgère, Julien Guiomar', null, 'In the 1930s, we follow the story of the laundress Berthe who marries the eldest son of a bourgeois family.', 'In the 1930s, we follow the story of the laundress Berthe who marries the eldest son of a bourgeois family.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qhABi1wsyGEN0OEDqMCG7lgY6md.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:63228'),
  ('939627424507943766', 'French Rarebit', 1951, 'Animation, Comedy', 'Robert McKimson', null, 'Mel Blanc, Tedd Pierce', null, 'While visiting Paris, Bugs Bunny wanders past the restaurants of Louie and Francois, rival chefs who fight to cook him until he promises to teach them the recipe for ''Louisiana Back-bay Bayou Bunny Bordelaise à la Antoine''.', 'While visiting Paris, Bugs Bunny wanders past the restaurants of Louie and Francois, rival chefs who fight to cook him until he promises to teach them the recipe for ''Louisiana Back-bay Bayou Bunny Bordelaise à la Antoine''.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aSeVLNNop7XoE73pngxklbPAMEy.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:117423'),
  ('721155569679707310', 'French Roast', 2008, 'Animation', 'Fabrice Joubert', 'Fabrice Joubert', null, null, 'In a fancy Parisian Café, an uptight businessman discovers he forgot to bring his wallet and bides his time by ordering more coffee.', 'In a fancy Parisian Café, an uptight businessman discovers he forgot to bring his wallet and bides his time by ordering more coffee.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/v5n5VrajQwgE5nqsqjo09SBU7JF.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:37845'),
  ('697849045392914750', 'French Tech', 2021, 'Comedy', 'Patrick Blossier, Bruno Podalydès', 'Bruno Podalydès, Denis Podalydès', 'Denis Podalydès, Sandrine Kiberlain, Bruno Podalydès, Yann Frisch, Leslie Menu, Luàna Bajrami, Michel Vuillermoz, Jean-Noël Brouté', null, 'Down-on-his-luck, unemployed Alexandre has two months to prove to his wife he can take care of his two young kids and be financially independent. Now, the thing is, although The Box, a user-friendly startup, wants to hire him on pro- bation, the company’s slogan is “No kids!” and Séverine, his future boss, is a short-tempered “killer”. So if Alexandre wants to land the job, he’s bound to lie... Will his meeting with Arcimboldo, an “entrepreneur of himself” and the king of online odd jobs, help the brave, disoriented Alexandre overcome all those challenges?', 'Down-on-his-luck, unemployed Alexandre has two months to prove to his wife he can take care of his two young kids and be financially independent. Now, the thing is, although The Box, a user-friendly startup, wants to hire him on pro- bation, the company’s slogan is “No kids!” and Séverine, his future boss, is a short-tempered “killer”. So if Alexandre wants to land the job, he’s bound to lie... Will his meeting with Arcimboldo, an “entrepreneur of himself” and the king of online odd jobs, help the brave, disoriented Alexandre overcome all those challenges?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3Otv7PEeyHllIeUO2AV7Yf22KRs.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:665387'),
  ('575309610458256576', 'French Tour', 2016, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Rachid Djaïdani, Luc Pagès', 'Rachid Djaïdani', 'Gérard Depardieu, Sadek, Louise Grinberg, Nicolas Marétheu, Mabô Kouyaté, Yasiin Bey, Raounaki Chaudron, Alain Pronnier', null, 'Far’Hook is a 20-year-old rapper. Following a violent dispute with a rival, he’s forced to leave Paris for a while. His producer, Bilal, suggests that Far’Hook acts as driver for Bilal’s father, Serge, on a tour of French ports, following in the footsteps of the classic painter Joseph Vernet. Despite the age gap and culture clash, an unlikely friendship forms between this talented rapper and a bricklayer from the north of France during a road trip that concludes in Marseille for a final concert, one of reconciliation.', 'Far’Hook is a 20-year-old rapper. Following a violent dispute with a rival, he’s forced to leave Paris for a while. His producer, Bilal, suggests that Far’Hook acts as driver for Bilal’s father, Serge, on a tour of French ports, following in the footsteps of the classic painter Joseph Vernet. Despite the age gap and culture clash, an unlikely friendship forms between this talented rapper and a bricklayer from the north of France during a road trip that concludes in Marseille for a final concert, one of reconciliation.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3aAuMCaeqRDrVBTUgOIPGVgHgSS.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:394262'),
  ('207997951294691068', 'French Twist', 1995, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Josiane Balasko, Gérard de Battista, Leopoldo Pescatore', 'Josiane Balasko, Patrick Aubrée', 'Victoria Abril, Josiane Balasko, Alain Chabat, Ticky Holgado, Catherine Hiegel, Catherine Samie, Catherine Lachens, Katrine Boorman', 'R', 'After learning of her husband''s infidelities, a housewife invites an itinerant lesbian to move in with them. None of their lives will ever be the same again.', 'After learning of her husband''s infidelities, a housewife invites an itinerant lesbian to move in with them. None of their lives will ever be the same again.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xlLnHizshGBwMiNrnop2kg2nYzE.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:4482'),
  ('610780055191000519', 'French Women', 2014, 'Comedy', 'Audrey Dana', 'Murielle Magellan, Raphaëlle Desplechin, Audrey Dana', 'Isabelle Adjani, Alice Belaïdi, Laetitia Casta, Audrey Dana, Julie Ferrier, Audrey Fleurot, Géraldine Nakache, Vanessa Paradis', null, 'A story about 11 girls living in Paris. Each of them has its own problems: career, love life, children. Every girl has their complexes and virtues. They always look elegant, hiding their inner feelings. Will they reach all the goals and overcome all their difficulties?', 'A story about 11 girls living in Paris. Each of them has its own problems: career, love life, children. Every girl has their complexes and virtues. They always look elegant, hiding their inner feelings. Will they reach all the goals and overcome all their difficulties?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1rPxRkVfqEbQSJNj7nSPchMfcxM.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:273169'),
  ('1019963574546253385', 'Frenchie', 1950, 'Western', 'Louis King, Maury Gertsman', 'Oscar Brodney', 'Joel McCrea, Shelley Winters, Paul Kelly, Elsa Lanchester, Marie Windsor, John Russell, John Emery, George Cleveland', 'NR', 'Frenchie Fontaine sells her successful business in New Orleans to come West. Her reason? Find the men who killed her father, Frank Dawson. But she only knows one of the two who did and she''s determined to find out the other.', 'Frenchie Fontaine sells her successful business in New Orleans to come West. Her reason? Find the men who killed her father, Frank Dawson. But she only knows one of the two who did and she''s determined to find out the other.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3hVqHDpc9TAJbbE6m1lQJ2FAtYq.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:212787'),
  ('535005584328440201', 'Frenchman''s Creek', 1944, 'Romance, Adventure', 'Mitchell Leisen, George Barnes, Richard McWhorter', 'Talbot Jennings', 'Joan Fontaine, Arturo de Córdova, Basil Rathbone, Nigel Bruce, Cecil Kellaway, Ralph Forbes, Harald Maresch, Billy Daniel', 'NR', 'An English lady falls in love with a French pirate after he kidnaps her from her ancestral home on the coast of Cornwall and sweeps her off her feet into a world of adventure.', 'An English lady falls in love with a French pirate after he kidnaps her from her ancestral home on the coast of Cornwall and sweeps her off her feet into a world of adventure.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pBAUlDfWGXEvjmPS5t24wbZKOwC.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:131764'),
  ('285790429078691851', 'Frenchmen', 2003, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Marc Esposito, Jean-Luc Roze, Pascal Caubère', 'Marc Esposito', 'Bernard Campan, Gérard Darmon, Jean-Pierre Darroussin, Marc Lavoine, Ludmila Mikaël, Fabienne Babe, Zoé Félix, Florence Thomassin', null, 'The life of four best friends in Paris: Antoine (a gym school teacher), Jeff (director of a monthly journal), Alex (Jeff''s associate in the monthly journal and a Don Juan) and Manu (owner of fine food store). Their time is shared between their respective jobs, their relationship with women (their own and others...) and the times they meet together to discuss about life and play sport lottery.', 'The life of four best friends in Paris: Antoine (a gym school teacher), Jeff (director of a monthly journal), Alex (Jeff''s associate in the monthly journal and a Don Juan) and Manu (owner of fine food store). Their time is shared between their respective jobs, their relationship with women (their own and others...) and the times they meet together to discuss about life and play sport lottery.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2QCoj8iZWysxVsG78DmFqv606P2.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:19099'),
  ('1009222542825577903', 'Frenchmen 2', 2007, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Marc Esposito', 'Marc Esposito', 'Bernard Campan, Gérard Darmon, Jean-Pierre Darroussin, Marc Lavoine, Fabienne Babe, Zoé Félix, Valérie Kaprisky, Ludmila Mikaël', null, 'Alex, Antoine, Jeff and Manu. Four friends, four years later. Their relationships, friendship, shared secrets, feelings of guilt and their desire to change and improve.', 'Alex, Antoine, Jeff and Manu. Four friends, four years later. Their relationships, friendship, shared secrets, feelings of guilt and their desire to change and improve.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xjQxIBkQNKUewJqVSwkv6kCb4Je.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:13734'),
  ('503965684790402185', 'Frenchmen 3', 2013, 'Comedy', 'Marc Esposito, Pascal Caubère', 'Marc Esposito', 'Bernard Campan, Jean-Pierre Darroussin, Éric Elmosnino, Marc Lavoine, Florence Thomassin, Catherine Wilkening, Zoé Félix, Lucie Phan', null, 'Alex, Antoine and Manu meet Jean, a loner who ignores the pleasures of friendship. Little by little, they learn to know each other, to appreciate each other. Jean is moved by the complicity and affection that fuels the relationship with his new friends.', 'Alex, Antoine and Manu meet Jean, a loner who ignores the pleasures of friendship. Little by little, they learn to know each other, to appreciate each other. Jean is moved by the complicity and affection that fuels the relationship with his new friends.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xMzDR5qFRzeVzoUsEySTwDhELvw.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:215303'),
  ('722351063815086006', 'Frenemies', 2012, 'Drama, Family, TV Movie, Comedy', 'Daisy von Scherler Mayer, Michael Storey', 'Jim Krieg, Dava Savel, Wendy Weiner', 'Bella Thorne, Zendaya, Mary Mouser, Nick Robinson, Stefanie Scott, Connor Price, Jascha Washington, Dylan Everett', 'G', 'Three pairs of friends relationships go from good to bad and back again. Several couple fall out over girls, boys and work. Can all these couples settle their differences and be friends again?', 'Three pairs of friends relationships go from good to bad and back again. Several couple fall out over girls, boys and work. Can all these couples settle their differences and be friends again?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cfEUQG5Jv5SHVgq6pPfybS57ORO.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:84105'),
