  ('259932376095076546', 'Frenzy', 2015, 'Drama, Crime', 'Emin Alper', 'Emin Alper', 'Mehmet Özgür, Berkay Ateş, Tülin Özen, Müfit Kayacan, Ozan Akbaba, Fatih Sevdi, Meli Bendeli, Ararat Mor', null, 'With Istanbul mired in political violence, Kadir is offered release after 15 years in prison if he’ll work as an informant. In a shantytown he stumbles upon his brother Ahmet, working for the city rounding up stray dogs and shutting himself in his home.', 'With Istanbul mired in political violence, Kadir is offered release after 15 years in prison if he’ll work as an informant. In a shantytown he stumbles upon his brother Ahmet, working for the city rounding up stray dogs and shutting himself in his home.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bza9EaNrx20BrMFmbEsay5McPcf.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:352196'),
  ('837822914806391502', 'Frenzy', 2018, 'Horror, Thriller, TV Movie', 'Jose Montesinos, Josh Maas', 'Graham Winter', 'Aubrey Reynolds, Gina Vitori, Lanett Tachel, Taylor Jorgensen, Michael S. New, Pope Bustos, Russell Geoffrey Banks', 'PG-13', 'A group of friends run a popular travel vlog that helps fund their adventures. The leader of the group brings along her younger sister for the next scuba diving trip to an isolated cove. But when their plane crashes, the two sisters must use their strength, resourcefulness and immense courage to survive a pack of great white sharks.', 'A group of friends run a popular travel vlog that helps fund their adventures. The leader of the group brings along her younger sister for the next scuba diving trip to an isolated cove. But when their plane crashes, the two sisters must use their strength, resourcefulness and immense courage to survive a pack of great white sharks.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kkTLgg5BkDFIuiRVESg8rRpsRbh.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:542787'),
  ('596659853991116959', 'Frequencies', 2013, 'Romance, Science Fiction, Mystery', 'Darren Paul Fisher, James Watson', 'Darren Paul Fisher', 'Daniel Fraser, Eleanor Wyld, Owen Pugh, David Broughton-Davies, Emma Powell, David Barnaby, Dylan Llewellyn, Georgina Minter-Brown', null, 'The story of the forbidden relationship between a ''low born'' boy and a ''high born'' girl in an alternate reality where every person''s relationships and life worth are determined by their innate ''frequencies''.', 'The story of the forbidden relationship between a ''low born'' boy and a ''high born'' girl in an alternate reality where every person''s relationships and life worth are determined by their innate ''frequencies''.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dDF11WTsDVY1i25VNPbwBjPk6t1.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:218425'),
  ('16646606213036456', 'Frequency', 2000, 'Science Fiction, Crime, Thriller', 'Gregory Hoblit, Alar Kivilo, Rick Kush', 'Toby Emmerich', 'Dennis Quaid, Jim Caviezel, Shawn Doyle, Elizabeth Mitchell, Andre Braugher, Noah Emmerich, Melissa Errico, Jordan Bridges', 'PG-13', 'When a rare phenomenon gives police officer John Sullivan the chance to speak to his father, 30 years in the past, he takes the opportunity to prevent his dad''s tragic death. After his actions inadvertently give rise to a series of brutal murders he and his father must find a way to fix the consequences of altering time.', 'When a rare phenomenon gives police officer John Sullivan the chance to speak to his father, 30 years in the past, he takes the opportunity to prevent his dad''s tragic death. After his actions inadvertently give rise to a series of brutal murders he and his father must find a way to fix the consequences of altering time.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eu3Hrjj271dnBdNAF0HqfmwWASt.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:10559'),
  ('114277069671790788', 'Frequently Asked Questions', 2004, 'Drama, Science Fiction', 'Carlos Atanes, Albert Ramirez', 'Carlos Atanes', 'Xavier Tort, Manel Solás, Anne Céline Auche, Raúl Mena, Marta Timón, Antonio Vladimir', 'R', 'In France, a near and probable future. The Sisterhood of Metacontrol governs Europe. Angeline, an exemplary and irreproachable citizen has just joined the order... But her relationship with a special man, Nono, will make her question profoundly the principles of the Doctrine.', 'In France, a near and probable future. The Sisterhood of Metacontrol governs Europe. Angeline, an exemplary and irreproachable citizen has just joined the order... But her relationship with a special man, Nono, will make her question profoundly the principles of the Doctrine.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ruMP9bxle3PHxXPrQ2Sh2Sjf9NT.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:62854'),
  ('100710631953391089', 'Frequently Asked Questions About Time Travel', 2009, 'Comedy, Drama, Romance, Science Fiction', 'Gareth Carrivick, Martin Harrison, Chris Stoaling', 'Jamie Mathieson', 'Chris O''Dowd, Dean Lennox Kelly, Marc Wootton, Anna Faris, Meredith MacNeill, Ray Gardner, Nick Ewans, Arthur Nightingale', null, 'Follows three social outcasts -- two geeks and a cynic -- as they attempt to navigate a time-travel conundrum in the middle of a British pub.', 'Follows three social outcasts -- two geeks and a cynic -- as they attempt to navigate a time-travel conundrum in the middle of a British pub.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/r67KzlHkdiwe3fBWzImEkNOg1Y.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:22494'),
  ('188175673210506686', 'Fresh', 1994, 'Crime, Drama, Thriller', 'Boaz Yakin, Adam Holender, J. Miller Tobin', 'Boaz Yakin', 'Sean Nelson, Giancarlo Esposito, Samuel L. Jackson, N''Bushe Wright, Ron Brice, Jean-Claude La Marre, José Zúñiga, Luis Lantigua', 'R', 'Death and violence anger twelve year old drug courier Fresh, who sets his rival employers against each other.', 'Death and violence anger twelve year old drug courier Fresh, who sets his rival employers against each other.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uXRIIUzjDZZdWR2cUzPJ9eAqaHv.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:13815'),
  ('1049051011796463619', 'Fresh', 2022, 'Horror, Thriller', 'Pawel Pogorzelski, Amanda De Castro, Mimi Cave', 'Lauryn Kahn', 'Daisy Edgar-Jones, Sebastian Stan, Jojo T. Gibbs, Charlotte Le Bon, Dayo Okeniyi, Andrea Bang, Brett Dier, Alina Maris', 'R', 'Frustrated by scrolling dating apps only to end up on lame, tedious dates, Noa takes a chance by giving her number to the awkwardly charming Steve after a produce-section meet-cute at the grocery store.', 'Frustrated by scrolling dating apps only to end up on lame, tedious dates, Noa takes a chance by giving her number to the awkwardly charming Steve after a produce-section meet-cute at the grocery store.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tlu71AgaL3EQBBCNGsAwZLPbV5D.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:787752'),
  ('1029274502138513185', 'Fresh Bait', 1995, 'Drama, Crime', 'Bertrand Tavernier, Alain Choquart', 'Bertrand Tavernier, Colo Tavernier O''Hagan', 'Marie Gillain, Olivier Sitruk, Bruno Putzulu, Richard Berry, Philippe Duclos, Marie Ravel, Clotilde Courau, Alain Sarde', null, 'With the ambition to start a boutique overseas but without the means to do so, Nathalie finds herself in a desperate situation, where she would do anything to acquire what she needs. Along with her boyfriend, Eric, and his friend Bruno, she concocts a plan where she seduces clueless men and accompanies them to their places, then allows Eric and Bruno to break in. But the three soon encounter trouble after one of their schemes ends in murder.', 'With the ambition to start a boutique overseas but without the means to do so, Nathalie finds herself in a desperate situation, where she would do anything to acquire what she needs. Along with her boyfriend, Eric, and his friend Bruno, she concocts a plan where she seduces clueless men and accompanies them to their places, then allows Eric and Bruno to break in. But the three soon encounter trouble after one of their schemes ends in murder.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/86hFBxrciPyuhCcZis5gBndKWJB.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:38414'),
  ('165832011979097603', 'Fresh Guacamole', 2012, 'Animation', 'PES', 'PES', 'PES', null, 'In this follow-up to his stop-motion hit Western Spaghetti, director PES transforms familiar objects into Fresh Guacamole.', 'In this follow-up to his stop-motion hit Western Spaghetti, director PES transforms familiar objects into Fresh Guacamole.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3uBH7edC9cbJqh180iWmAndVsz0.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:142563'),
  ('383981348010474976', 'Fresh Hare', 1942, 'Comedy, Animation', 'Friz Freleng', null, 'Mel Blanc, Arthur Q. Bryan', null, 'Bugs Bunny is wanted "dead or alive" by the Mounted Police, led by Elmer Fudd. The "Fresh Hare" episode was banned from television for almost 30 years because it was considered too racey for the time.', 'Bugs Bunny is wanted "dead or alive" by the Mounted Police, led by Elmer Fudd. The "Fresh Hare" episode was banned from television for almost 30 years because it was considered too racey for the time.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qUg8PQhIUarbVK04oeH7HS6Jrzo.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:236655'),
  ('53613954031786301', 'Fresh Horses', 1988, 'Drama, Romance', 'David Anspaugh, Fred Murphy', 'Larry Ketron', 'Molly Ringwald, Andrew McCarthy, Patti D''Arbanville, Ben Stiller, Leon Russom, Molly Hagan, Viggo Mortensen, Doug Hutchison', 'PG-13', 'A Cincinnati college student breaks off his engagement to his wealthy fiancée after he falls in love with a backwoods Kentucky girl he meets at a party. She says she''s 20, but he finds out she''s 16 and married to an abusive husband.', 'A Cincinnati college student breaks off his engagement to his wealthy fiancée after he falls in love with a backwoods Kentucky girl he meets at a party. She says she''s 20, but he finds out she''s 16 and married to an abusive husband.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sEPTYt17NsmRGXxza5WjSQpIORk.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:38982'),
  ('432958146786724383', 'Fresh Kill', 1996, 'Science Fiction, Drama', 'Annie Tan, Shu Lea Cheang, Jane Castle', 'Jessica Hagedorn', 'Sarita Choudhury, Erin McMurtry, Laurie Carlos, Abraham Lim, José Zúñiga, Will Kempe, Nelini Stamp, Rino Thunder', null, 'Shareen and Claire, a lesbian couple living on Staten Island, find themselves ensnared in a vast conspiracy involving a ghost ship of nuclear refuse, ominous television commercials, and deadly cat food.', 'Shareen and Claire, a lesbian couple living on Staten Island, find themselves ensnared in a vast conspiracy involving a ghost ship of nuclear refuse, ominous television commercials, and deadly cat food.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8O2UYcYGU61DgyzdHNM8kIJ5eK3.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:375914'),
  ('300013337090590047', 'Fresh Kills', 2024, 'Drama, Crime', 'Jennifer Esposito, Ben Hardwicke', 'Jennifer Esposito', 'Emily Bader, Odessa A''zion, Jennifer Esposito, Domenick Lombardozzi, Annabella Sciorra, Nicholas Cirillo, Ava DeMary, Stelio Savante', 'NR', 'Rose Larusso, an inquisitive young girl in 1980s Staten Island, discovers her father is an emerging mafia kingpin. Rose''s growing desire to break free from the path set before her soon threatens her existence and alienates her from her closest allies: her mother Francine, her sister Connie, and her aunt Christine.', 'Rose Larusso, an inquisitive young girl in 1980s Staten Island, discovers her father is an emerging mafia kingpin. Rose''s growing desire to break free from the path set before her soon threatens her existence and alienates her from her closest allies: her mother Francine, her sister Connie, and her aunt Christine.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iDdDnFvxAVTHQLgzWos03lcFDvd.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1062198'),
  ('143146881177032377', 'Fresh Meat', 2012, 'Comedy, Horror', 'Danny Mulheron, Simon Baumfield', 'Briar Grace Smith', 'Temuera Morrison, Nicola Kawana, Hannah Tevita, Kahn West, Kate Elliott, Will Robertson, James Ashcroft, Jack Sergent-Shadbolt', null, 'A dysfunctional gang of criminals takes a middle class Maori family hostage and discovers too late that they are cannibals.', 'A dysfunctional gang of criminals takes a middle class Maori family hostage and discovers too late that they are cannibals.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iQ4KWUXZaINWNvj7FPLnBZu1XEc.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:140403'),
  ('594049223392922287', 'Fresh Precure! Movie: The Kingdom of Toys has Lots of Secrets!?', 2009, 'Animation, Comedy, Fantasy, Action, Adventure, Family', 'Junji Shimizu, Kunihito Noritomo', 'Atsushi Maekawa', 'Kanae Oki, Eri Kitamura, Akiko Nakagawa, Yuka Komatsu, Satomi Korogi, Taiki Matsuno, Banjo Ginga, Chika Sakamoto', null, 'After resolving the problems in the Labyrinth Kingdom, Love Momozono and her friends live a happy life and continue their dance training. Suddenly, the town children''s toys start to go missing and the girls agree to help find them. Love Momozono''s stuffed rabbit then comes to life and tells the Cures that the Toymajin is responsible. The Fresh Pretty Cure cast then travel to the Kingdom of Toys to save the day!', 'After resolving the problems in the Labyrinth Kingdom, Love Momozono and her friends live a happy life and continue their dance training. Suddenly, the town children''s toys start to go missing and the girls agree to help find them. Love Momozono''s stuffed rabbit then comes to life and tells the Cures that the Toymajin is responsible. The Fresh Pretty Cure cast then travel to the Kingdom of Toys to save the day!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/spq0IsfktD0PuumSMqKo3O3i7xY.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:120434'),
  ('242714366752120178', 'Freshman Orientation', 2004, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Ryan Shiraki, Amy Vincent', 'Ryan Shiraki', 'Sam Huntington, Marla Sokoloff, Mike Erwin, Heather Matarazzo, Kaitlin Doubleday, Bryce Johnson, Jud Tylor, John Goodman', 'R', 'A bored college student sees a prime opportunity to score with a hot coed who has made the assumption that he is gay, and he decides to play along when she follows her sorority leader''s assignment to seduce then cut loose a series of misfits and losers.', 'A bored college student sees a prime opportunity to score with a hot coed who has made the assumption that he is gay, and he decides to play along when she follows her sorority leader''s assignment to seduce then cut loose a series of misfits and losers.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/85Jj34KuJieIBobf010KXGNOvt3.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:41862'),
  ('807020854794586447', 'Freshwater Assassins', 1947, 'Documentary', 'Jean Painlevé, Geneviève Hamon', null, null, null, 'In a freshwater pond, it''s "eat or be eaten." A dragonfly larva eats a midge; a water beetle larva eats a damselfly larva. Snail larvae grow. A beetle larva eats one. Up close, we see the eating apparatus of a damselfly larva—with a retractable hook beneath mandibles. Some creatures bite and chew, others suck. A water beetle larva holds on to its prey, injects a poison that turns the victim''s insides to soup, and then sucks it dry. We watch one eat a damselfly larvae and then another water beetle larva. Some have ingenious ways to camouflage themselves, like the water scorpion, and to breathe air while hunting under water. Caddisfly larvae hide in debris, then eat.', 'In a freshwater pond, it''s "eat or be eaten." A dragonfly larva eats a midge; a water beetle larva eats a damselfly larva. Snail larvae grow. A beetle larva eats one. Up close, we see the eating apparatus of a damselfly larva—with a retractable hook beneath mandibles. Some creatures bite and chew, others suck. A water beetle larva holds on to its prey, injects a poison that turns the victim''s insides to soup, and then sucks it dry. We watch one eat a damselfly larvae and then another water beetle larva. Some have ingenious ways to camouflage themselves, like the water scorpion, and to breathe air while hunting under water. Caddisfly larvae hide in debris, then eat.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/r6heeexkH2jZolpWNeifotnLaKc.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:163806'),
  ('671424031927831397', 'Freud Leaving Home', 1991, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Susanne Bier, Erik Zappon, Daniel Alfredson', 'Marianne Goldman', 'Gunilla Röör, Ghita Nørby, Palle Granditsky, Philip Zandén, Jessica Zandén, Peter Andersson, Stina Ekblad, Nils Eklund', null, 'In this story, the 60th birthday of Cohen-family matriarch Rosha is the occasion for a gathering of her children from the diverse places around the world. The central character in this drama, however, is Angelique, whose interest in psychoanalysis has earned her the nickname of "Freud." Her older brother is gay and lives in Florida with his lover. Her older sister has married into an Orthodox family, and lives in Jerusalem. They have all gathered in Sweden for their grandmother''s birthday. Meanwhile, Rosha''s daughter, the mother of these diverse children, has taken ill and is in the hospital. She has been diagnosed with a very advanced, inoperable brain tumor. Freud, who never left home, is perhaps as upset by this news as anyone, and she startles everyone by going out and beginning an affair with a biker. However, she is deeply involved in the new situation: she insists that their mother be brought home from the hospital rather than being allowed to suffer and die there.', 'In this story, the 60th birthday of Cohen-family matriarch Rosha is the occasion for a gathering of her children from the diverse places around the world. The central character in this drama, however, is Angelique, whose interest in psychoanalysis has earned her the nickname of "Freud." Her older brother is gay and lives in Florida with his lover. Her older sister has married into an Orthodox family, and lives in Jerusalem. They have all gathered in Sweden for their grandmother''s birthday. Meanwhile, Rosha''s daughter, the mother of these diverse children, has taken ill and is in the hospital. She has been diagnosed with a very advanced, inoperable brain tumor. Freud, who never left home, is perhaps as upset by this news as anyone, and she startles everyone by going out and beginning an affair with a biker. However, she is deeply involved in the new situation: she insists that their mother be brought home from the hospital rather than being allowed to suffer and die there.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zD9MPWnJtzyKEX0FTkkTcZ1FDDw.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:141523'),
  ('420699532694489357', 'Freud: The Secret Passion', 1962, 'Drama', 'John Huston, Douglas Slocombe, Laci von Ronay', 'Jean-Paul Sartre', 'Montgomery Clift, Susannah York, Larry Parks, Susan Kohner, Eileen Herlie, Fernand Ledoux, David McCallum, Rosalie Crutchley', null, 'An examination of Austrian psychologist Sigmund Freud''s career when he began to treat patients diagnosed with hysteria, using the radical technique of hypnosis.', 'An examination of Austrian psychologist Sigmund Freud''s career when he began to treat patients diagnosed with hysteria, using the radical technique of hypnosis.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2cguhv8jwEaiwF8pB5xo3RzfXlO.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:35806'),
  ('1126602600477955133', 'Freud''s Last Session', 2023, 'Drama', 'Matt Brown, Ben Smithard', 'Mark St. Germain', 'Anthony Hopkins, Matthew Goode, Liv Lisa Fries, Jodi Balfour, Jeremy Northam, Stephen Campbell Moore, Orla Brady, David Shields', 'PG-13', 'On the eve of the Second World War, two of the greatest minds of the twentieth century, C.S. Lewis and Sigmund Freud converge for their own personal battle over the existence of God. The film interweaves the lives of Freud and Lewis, past, present, and through fantasy, bursting from the confines of Freud’s study on a dynamic journey.', 'On the eve of the Second World War, two of the greatest minds of the twentieth century, C.S. Lewis and Sigmund Freud converge for their own personal battle over the existence of God. The film interweaves the lives of Freud and Lewis, past, present, and through fantasy, bursting from the confines of Freud’s study on a dynamic journey.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mp7IBxFuvNZSVOOGESybvaPxd7y.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1025491'),
  ('281462967958071371', 'Fréwaka', 2025, 'Drama, Fantasy, Horror', 'Aislinn Clarke, Narayan Van Maele', 'Aislinn Clarke', 'Clare Monnelly, Bríd Ní Neachtain, Alexandra Bustryzhickaya, Olga Wehrly, Grace Collender, Mícheál Óg Lane, Tara Breathnach, Jim Cunningham', null, 'Care worker Shoo, who is haunted by a personal tragedy, is sent to a remote village to care for an agoraphobic woman, who fears both her neighbours and the Na Sídhe – sinister folkloric entities she believes abducted her decades before.', 'Care worker Shoo, who is haunted by a personal tragedy, is sent to a remote village to care for an agoraphobic woman, who fears both her neighbours and the Na Sídhe – sinister folkloric entities she believes abducted her decades before.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pfLylbmY0uxQm6Sh63j6bpb7XB3.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1189735'),
  ('422101390871727561', 'Fric-Frac', 1939, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Claude Autant-Lara, Maurice Lehmann, Armand Thirard', 'Édouard Bourdet', 'Fernandel, Arletty, Michel Simon, Helene Robert, Andrex, René Génin, Génia Vaury, Jacques Varennes', null, 'An employee at a jewelry store falls in love with a woman who secretly plans to rob the store.', 'An employee at a jewelry store falls in love with a woman who secretly plans to rob the store.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7jCTD2N3VoyKfFs02pJtGlAb8Ds.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:64423'),
  ('14088578622938654', 'Frida', 2002, 'Drama, Romance', 'Rodrigo Prieto, Julie Taymor, Adrian Grünberg', 'Gregory Nava, Diane Lake, Clancy Sigal', 'Salma Hayek Pinault, Alfred Molina, Mía Maestro, Patricia Reyes Spíndola, Edward Norton, Antonio Banderas, Diego Luna, Roger Rees', 'R', 'A biography of artist Frida Kahlo, who channeled the pain of a crippling injury and her tempestuous marriage into her work.', 'A biography of artist Frida Kahlo, who channeled the pain of a crippling injury and her tempestuous marriage into her work.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/a4hgR6aKoohB6MHni171jbi9BkU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1360'),
  ('796234070294780849', 'Frida', 2024, 'Documentary', 'Carla Gutierrez', null, 'Frida Kahlo, Fernanda Echevarría del Rivero, Pablo Alarson, Jeanne Albanese, Tizoc Arroyo, Yeraldín Balcázar, Roberto Cavazos, Patricia Collazo', 'R', 'An intimately raw and magical journey through the life, mind, and heart of iconic artist Frida Kahlo. Told through her own words for the very first time — drawn from her diary, revealing letters, essays, and print interviews — and brought vividly to life by lyrical animation inspired by her unforgettable artwork.', 'An intimately raw and magical journey through the life, mind, and heart of iconic artist Frida Kahlo. Told through her own words for the very first time — drawn from her diary, revealing letters, essays, and print interviews — and brought vividly to life by lyrical animation inspired by her unforgettable artwork.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qfPjPZF2AqB2XnXPFcHlYtlQRS3.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1214523'),
  ('1030980044382359433', 'Frida - Straight from the Heart', 1991, 'Comedy, Romance, Family', 'Berit Nesheim', 'Torun Lian', 'Maria Kvalheim, Elsa Lystad, Helge Jordal, Jan Hårstad, Ellen Horn, Andreas Bratlie, Cathrine Bang, Kristian Mejdell Nissen', null, 'Frida, aged 13, has discovered a book by psychoanalyst Erich Fromm called "The art of loving". Using it as a reference she sets out to better the love lives of her family and friends. But love works in mysterious ways...', 'Frida, aged 13, has discovered a book by psychoanalyst Erich Fromm called "The art of loving". Using it as a reference she sets out to better the love lives of her family and friends. But love works in mysterious ways...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/h6N4Al6RQvu3WQcZHKp4xGXgaPp.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:121814'),
  ('373785313944721160', 'Frida Still Life', 1986, 'Drama, History', 'Paul Leduc', 'José Joaquín Blanco, Paul Leduc', 'Ofelia Medina, Juan José Gurrola, Max Kerlow, Claudio Brook, Salvador Sánchez, Cecilia Toussaint, Ziwta Kerlow, Valentina Leduc Navarro', null, 'This film is a chronicle of painter Frida Kahlo, and her encounter with the personalities of her time. Despite being confied to a wheelchair as a result of polio, operations and amputations, she faces and traces some of the most colorful and controversial aspects of Mexican history, during the dominant time of Mexican muralism.', 'This film is a chronicle of painter Frida Kahlo, and her encounter with the personalities of her time. Despite being confied to a wheelchair as a result of polio, operations and amputations, she faces and traces some of the most colorful and controversial aspects of Mexican history, during the dominant time of Mexican muralism.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2lrSzduS7JgdzXPOt28qAnbfP0p.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:123057'),
  ('664322468967555052', 'Frida. Viva la Vida', 2019, 'Documentary', 'Giovanni Troilo', 'Jacopo Magri', 'Asia Argento, Florencia Maria Hart, Graciela Iturbide', null, 'The two sides of Frida Kahlo''s spirit: on one side the revolutionary, pioneering artist of contemporary feminism and on the other, the human being, victim of her tortured body and a tormented relationship.', 'The two sides of Frida Kahlo''s spirit: on one side the revolutionary, pioneering artist of contemporary feminism and on the other, the human being, victim of her tortured body and a tormented relationship.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/r4uVPdU7FlrDbX7SIAyiz4yQxVI.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:649244'),
  ('269684712792720610', 'Friday', 1995, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Dwight Williams, Algric Leo Chaplin, Kimberly Sizemore', 'Ice Cube, DJ Pooh', 'Ice Cube, Chris Tucker, Nia Long, Tommy Lister Jr., John Witherspoon, Anna Maria Horsford, Regina King, Paula Jai Parker', 'R', 'Craig and Smokey are two guys in Los Angeles hanging out on their porch on a Friday afternoon, smoking and drinking, looking for something to do.', 'Craig and Smokey are two guys in Los Angeles hanging out on their porch on a Friday afternoon, smoking and drinking, looking for something to do.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2lReF53F8trkC68piGSfk0JVwWU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:10634'),
  ('340062938717257685', 'Friday After Next', 2002, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Glen MacPherson, Wayne Witherspoon, Wendi Lampassi', 'Ice Cube', 'Ice Cube, Mike Epps, John Witherspoon, Don Curry, Anna Maria Horsford, Clifton Powell, Bebe Drake, K.D. Aubert', 'R', 'Craig and his cousin Day-Day have finally moved out of their parents'' houses and into their own crib, working nights at a local mall as security guards. When their house is robbed on Christmas Eve they set out to track down the culprit.', 'Craig and his cousin Day-Day have finally moved out of their parents'' houses and into their own crib, working nights at a local mall as security guards. When their house is robbed on Christmas Eve they set out to track down the culprit.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sxHFGPKLWj9e3aaA6wGVxghoiPE.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:10426'),
  ('367853290646573727', 'Friday Foster', 1975, 'Action, Thriller', 'Arthur Marks, Gene De Ruelle, Harry J. May', 'Orville H. Hampton', 'Pam Grier, Yaphet Kotto, Godfrey Cambridge, Thalmus Rasulala, Eartha Kitt, Jim Backus, Scatman Crothers, Ted Lange', 'R', 'Friday Foster, a magazine photographer, goes to Los Angeles International airport to photograph the arrival of Blake Tarr, the richest black man in America. Three men attempt to assassinate Tarr. Foster photographs the melee and is plunged into a web of conspiracy involving the murder of her childhood friend, a US senator, and a shadowy plan called "Black Widow".', 'Friday Foster, a magazine photographer, goes to Los Angeles International airport to photograph the arrival of Blake Tarr, the richest black man in America. Three men attempt to assassinate Tarr. Foster photographs the melee and is plunged into a web of conspiracy involving the murder of her childhood friend, a US senator, and a shadowy plan called "Black Widow".', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dGADshou0bUIGGt0vompPORdKtn.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:56539'),
  ('543658564591640624', 'Friday Night', 2002, 'Drama, Romance', 'Claire Denis, Agnès Godard, Jean-Paul Allegre', 'Emmanuèle Bernheim, Claire Denis', 'Valérie Lemercier, Vincent Lindon, Hélène Fillières, Hélène de Saint-Père, Grégoire Colin, Florence Loiret Caille, Gilles D''Ambra, Micha Lescot', 'NR', 'The night before she is to move in with her boyfriend, a young Parisian woman picks up a male hitchhiker, leading to a highly charged and impossibly erotic detour.', 'The night before she is to move in with her boyfriend, a young Parisian woman picks up a male hitchhiker, leading to a highly charged and impossibly erotic detour.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oBLkiNfPaXGKQHwSd8I9Ta36UTZ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:45044'),
  ('406824638610825479', 'Friday Night Lights', 2004, 'Drama', 'Peter Berg, Tobias A. Schliessler, Allan Graf', 'David Aaron Cohen, Peter Berg', 'Billy Bob Thornton, Lucas Black, Garrett Hedlund, Derek Luke, Jay Hernandez, Lee Jackson, Lee Thompson Young, Tim McGraw', 'PG-13', 'A small, turbulent town in Texas obsesses over their high school football team to an unhealthy degree. When the star tailback, Boobie Miles, is seriously injured during the first game of the season, all hope is lost, and the town''s dormant social problems begin to flare up. It is left to the inspiring abilities of new coach Gary Gaines to instill in the other team members -- and, by proxy, the town itself -- a sense of self-respect and honor.', 'A small, turbulent town in Texas obsesses over their high school football team to an unhealthy degree. When the star tailback, Boobie Miles, is seriously injured during the first game of the season, all hope is lost, and the town''s dormant social problems begin to flare up. It is left to the inspiring abilities of new coach Gary Gaines to instill in the other team members -- and, by proxy, the town itself -- a sense of self-respect and honor.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8HIqpOgqShRc3TAleabnYispDl1.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:13416'),
  ('761222024824742548', 'Friday Night Plan', 2023, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Krish Makhija, Vatsal Neelakantan', 'Vatsal Neelakantan', 'Babil Khan, Amrith Jayan, Juhi Chawla Mehta, Medha Rana, Aadhya Anand, Ninad Kamat, Aditya Jain, Rishabh Joshi', 'R', 'When their mother takes off on a business trip, two bickering brothers unite to secretly attend the hottest party of the year before she returns.', 'When their mother takes off on a business trip, two bickering brothers unite to secretly attend the hottest party of the year before she returns.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8QIAFlELWwP8xfo2Xwf7oleDcUE.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1160562'),
  ('900385150013746844', 'Friday the 13th', 1980, 'Horror', 'Sean S. Cunningham, Barry Abrams, Stephen Ross', 'Victor Miller', 'Adrienne King, Betsy Palmer, Kevin Bacon, Jeannine Taylor, Harry Crosby, Laurie Bartram, Mark Nelson, Peter Brouwer', 'R', 'Camp counselors are stalked and murdered by an unknown assailant while trying to reopen a summer camp that was the site of a child''s drowning.', 'Camp counselors are stalked and murdered by an unknown assailant while trying to reopen a summer camp that was the site of a child''s drowning.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uGGpnWHOmWTARVN9wbC1nPxNgps.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:4488'),
  ('164111141340297993', 'Friday the 13th', 2009, 'Horror, Thriller', 'Marcus Nispel, Daniel Pearl, Cleta Elaine Ellington', 'Damian Shannon, Mark Swift', 'Jared Padalecki, Travis Van Winkle, Danielle Panabaker, Amanda Righetti, Aaron Yoo, Derek Mears, Julianna Guill, Arlen Escarpeta', 'R', 'A group of young adults visit a boarded up campsite named Crystal Lake where they soon encounter the mysterious Jason Voorhees and his deadly intentions.', 'A group of young adults visit a boarded up campsite named Crystal Lake where they soon encounter the mysterious Jason Voorhees and his deadly intentions.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/88wlJ4teYlck4hJ2bnlxBrAVh0m.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:13207'),
  ('126050777781664824', 'Friday the 13th Part 2', 1981, 'Horror, Thriller', 'Steve Miner, Peter Stein, Richard Feury', 'Ron Kurz', 'Russell Todd, Amy Steel, John Furey, Adrienne King, Kirsten Baker, Stuart Charno, Warrington Gillette, Walt Gorney', 'R', 'Five years after the horrible bloodbath at Camp Crystal Lake, new counselors roam the area, not sensing the ominous lurking presence that proves that the grisly legend is real.', 'Five years after the horrible bloodbath at Camp Crystal Lake, new counselors roam the area, not sensing the ominous lurking presence that proves that the grisly legend is real.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/92rGctBMTv4uaSlIBVnhz01kRWL.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:9725'),
  ('425230238066716402', 'Friday the 13th Part III', 1982, 'Horror, Thriller', 'Steve Miner, Steve Miner, Gerald Feil', 'Carol Watson, Martin Kitrosser', 'Richard Brooker, Dana Kimmell, Catherine Parks, Tracie Savage, David Wiley, Rachel Howard, Anne Gaybis, Larry Zerner', 'R', 'An idyllic summer turns into a nightmare of unspeakable terror for yet another group of naïve friends. Ignoring Camp Crystal Lake''s bloody legacy, one by one they fall victim to the maniacal Jason, who stalks them at every turn...', 'An idyllic summer turns into a nightmare of unspeakable terror for yet another group of naïve friends. Ignoring Camp Crystal Lake''s bloody legacy, one by one they fall victim to the maniacal Jason, who stalks them at every turn...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9kukTSlgFgXnQGdpcHvHcpTDiUc.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:9728'),
  ('686885923099464794', 'Friday the 13th Part VII - The New Blood', 1988, 'Horror, Thriller', 'John Carl Buechler, Paul Elliott, Francis R. Mahony III', 'Manuel Fidello, Daryl Haney', 'Lar Park Lincoln, Kane Hodder, Terry Kiser, Kevin Spirtas, Susan Jennifer Sullivan, Debora Kessler, Elizabeth Kaitan, Staci Greason', 'R', 'Tina Shepard, a telekinetic teenage girl, accidentally unchains Jason from his watery grave, allowing him to go on another killing spree in the area.', 'Tina Shepard, a telekinetic teenage girl, accidentally unchains Jason from his watery grave, allowing him to go on another killing spree in the area.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rUzk9Qnyz2FZGxHMBrq6DYIQZkO.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:10281'),
  ('183890660032215568', 'Friday the 13th Part VIII: Jason Takes Manhattan', 1989, 'Horror, Thriller', 'Bryan England, Rob Hedden, Tom Quinn', 'Rob Hedden', 'Jensen Daggett, Sharlene Martin, Scott Reeves, Tiffany Paulsen, Alex Diakun, Amber Pawlick, Kane Hodder, Kelly Hu', 'R', 'Jason ships out aboard a teen-filled "love boat" bound for New York, which he soon transforms into the ultimate voyage of the damned.', 'Jason ships out aboard a teen-filled "love boat" bound for New York, which he soon transforms into the ultimate voyage of the damned.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6ezOsZ9UzqGnbDokaatxdOWP6e9.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:10283'),
  ('132004656679602648', 'Friday the 13th: A New Beginning', 1985, 'Horror, Thriller', 'Stephen L. Posey, Danny Steinmann, Gary Dahl', 'John Shepherd', 'John Shepherd, Tiffany Helm, John Robert Dixon, Juliette Cummins, Melanie Kinnaman, Richard Young, Deborah Voorhees, Mark Venturini', 'R', 'Homicidal maniac Jason returns from the grave to cause more bloody mayhem. Young Tommy may have escaped from Crystal Lake, but he’s still haunted by the gruesome events that happened there. When gory murders start happening at the secluded halfway house for troubled teens where he now lives, it seems like his nightmarish nemesis, Jason, is back for more sadistic slaughters.', 'Homicidal maniac Jason returns from the grave to cause more bloody mayhem. Young Tommy may have escaped from Crystal Lake, but he’s still haunted by the gruesome events that happened there. When gory murders start happening at the secluded halfway house for troubled teens where he now lives, it seems like his nightmarish nemesis, Jason, is back for more sadistic slaughters.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ewnIs4aCuWnKQ13Eaj8f3ybrQc8.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:9731'),
  ('414713370252387993', 'Friday the 13th: The Final Chapter', 1984, 'Horror', 'João Fernandes, Joseph Zito, Paul Moen', 'Barney Cohen', 'Judie Aronson, Kimberly Beck, Joan Freeman, Barbara Howard, Corey Feldman, Erich Anderson, Peter Barton, Crispin Glover', 'R', 'After his revival in a hospital morgue, Jason fixes his vengeful attention on the Jarvis family and a group of hitherto carefree teenagers.', 'After his revival in a hospital morgue, Jason fixes his vengeful attention on the Jarvis family and a group of hitherto carefree teenagers.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1J7zudfR3VLPwAf9lK5YPfSu0n6.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:9730'),
  ('197914588823285479', 'Fridge', 1995, 'Drama, Thriller', 'Peter Mullan, Grant Cameron', 'Peter Mullan', 'Gary Lewis, Vicki Masson, Laurie Ventry, Steven Singleton, Joe Douglas, Max McIlmunn, Campbell Soutar, Alasdair Begbie', null, 'Two Neds are harassing a drunken ''jaikie'' and an inebriated resident confronts them. A stand off takes place until one of the Neds shuts a young boy in an abandoned fridge. They leave but threaten to return and burn down the tenement. The residents try to open the fridge but are unsuccessful. Panic initially sets in as they fear the young boy will die.', 'Two Neds are harassing a drunken ''jaikie'' and an inebriated resident confronts them. A stand off takes place until one of the Neds shuts a young boy in an abandoned fridge. They leave but threaten to return and burn down the tenement. The residents try to open the fridge but are unsuccessful. Panic initially sets in as they fear the young boy will die.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/86BsdhN99erh7znPeaFQfmxLc0i.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:111163'),
  ('136098537042326854', 'Fried Barry', 2020, 'Horror, Comedy, Science Fiction', 'Gareth Place, Ryan Kruger', 'Ryan Kruger', 'Gary Green, Chanelle de Jager, Brett Williams, Joey Cramer, Bianka Hartenstein, Sean Cameron Michael, Steve Wall, Hakeem Kae-Kazim', null, 'Barry is a drug-addled, abusive bastard who - after yet another bender - is abducted by aliens. Barry takes a backseat as an alien visitor assumes control of his body and takes it for a joyride through Cape Town. What follows is an onslaught of drugs, sex, and violence as our alien tourist enters the weird and wonderful world of humankind.', 'Barry is a drug-addled, abusive bastard who - after yet another bender - is abducted by aliens. Barry takes a backseat as an alien visitor assumes control of his body and takes it for a joyride through Cape Town. What follows is an onslaught of drugs, sex, and violence as our alien tourist enters the weird and wonderful world of humankind.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iQ2TCB6nszgFHnF1QeHJujvBIzn.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:718558'),
  ('766346873319375931', 'Fried Green Tomatoes', 1991, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Jon Avnet, David Rubin, Geoffrey Simpson', 'Fannie Flagg, Carol Sobieski', 'Kathy Bates, Jessica Tandy, Mary-Louise Parker, Mary Stuart Masterson, Cicely Tyson, Stan Shaw, Chris O''Donnell, Gailard Sartain', 'PG-13', 'Amidst her own personality crisis, a southern housewife meets an outgoing old woman who tells her the story of Idgie Threadgoode and Ruth Jamison, two young women who experienced hardships and love in 1920s Whistle Stop, Alabama.', 'Amidst her own personality crisis, a southern housewife meets an outgoing old woman who tells her the story of Idgie Threadgoode and Ruth Jamison, two young women who experienced hardships and love in 1920s Whistle Stop, Alabama.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/g71l1vbJwyAAYk8zKCkIQQ58qcb.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1633'),
  ('973772507780967296', 'Frieda', 1947, 'Drama, War', 'Basil Dearden, Gordon Dines', 'Ronald Millar, Angus MacPhail', 'David Farrar, Glynis Johns, Mai Zetterling, Flora Robson, Albert Lieven, Barbara Everest, Gladys Henson, Ray Jackson', 'NR', 'An RAF pilot who was shot down during WWII returns home to his English village with his new bride. The trouble is that she is the German lady who helped him escape.', 'An RAF pilot who was shot down during WWII returns home to his English village with his new bride. The trouble is that she is the German lady who helped him escape.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/slkOMq4oeSsyT105nJX7TZw9MNk.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:92492'),
  ('1040688627954242908', 'Friend', 1974, 'Drama', 'Yılmaz Güney', 'Yılmaz Güney', 'Yılmaz Güney, Semra Özdamar, Ahu Tuğbay, Kerim Afşar, Civan Canova, Azra Balkan, Melike Demirağ, Nizam Ergüden', null, 'After betraying his social class, denying his peasant roots and fleeing his native village, Ahmed has become a successful businessman and has found a place in the sun among the bourgeoisie. Azem, his childhood friend, has followed a quite different way. refusing the rat race, he has remained close to people of humble origin. Politically committed, he aspires to be useful to his country and more particularly to the forsaken rural world. The two former friends meet again. Due to the influence of Azem, Ahmed gradually becomes aware that his life is a failure.', 'After betraying his social class, denying his peasant roots and fleeing his native village, Ahmed has become a successful businessman and has found a place in the sun among the bourgeoisie. Azem, his childhood friend, has followed a quite different way. refusing the rat race, he has remained close to people of humble origin. Politically committed, he aspires to be useful to his country and more particularly to the forsaken rural world. The two former friends meet again. Due to the influence of Azem, Ahmed gradually becomes aware that his life is a failure.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6WxSatDacXgOWsVtkYCc8y4fVB9.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:163857'),
  ('821132182994000063', 'Friend', 1988, 'Drama', 'Leonid Kvinikhidze, Evgeniy Guslinskiy, Igor Mayorov', 'Eduard Akopov', 'Sergey Shakurov, Vasiliy Livanov, Anatoliy Romashin, Yelena Solovey, Igor Yasulovich, Viktor Uralsky, Galina Polskikh, Tatyana Kochemasova', null, 'Looking for the money for a drink, an alcoholic gets a Newfoundland dog as a present from a stranger at a bird fair. He''ll soon find out that the animal is not only able to speak, but to get him to give up drinking as well. Now he''s determined to get rid of the dog, but that won''t be an easy task.', 'Looking for the money for a drink, an alcoholic gets a Newfoundland dog as a present from a stranger at a bird fair. He''ll soon find out that the animal is not only able to speak, but to get him to give up drinking as well. Now he''s determined to get rid of the dog, but that won''t be an easy task.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uJRzgeBt04eD5ewDV4o4A7tQI4n.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:128414'),
  ('275134837352666488', 'Friend', 2001, 'Action, Drama, Crime', 'Kwak Kyung-taek, Hwang Ki-suk, Shin Kyung-man', 'Kwak Kyung-taek', 'Yu Oh-seong, Jang Dong-gun, Seo Tae-hwa, Jung Woon-taek, Kim Bo-kyung, Ki Joo-bong, Joo Hyun, Jeon Young-woon', null, 'Despite their different family backgrounds, four friends grew up together in the wearisome years of the 70s. But as time goes by, each of them takes a different life path.', 'Despite their different family backgrounds, four friends grew up together in the wearisome years of the 70s. But as time goes by, each of them takes a different life path.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/AwhWTvbB1Pdp7nz1DWElonH4e2a.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:19635'),
