  ('1075465006087676340', 'Friend Zone', 2009, 'Comedy', 'Alfonso Postigo, Borja Cobeaga, Susana González', 'Diego San José, Borja Cobeaga', 'Gorka Otxoa, Sabrina Garciarena, Julián López, Óscar Ladoire, Kiti Mánver, María Asquerino, Bárbara Santa-Cruz, Michel Brown', null, 'Bilbao, Spain. After breaking up with Elisa, his girlfriend for several years, Txema meets Claudia, a gorgeous Argentinian girl, in a very awkward situation. They become friends so soon and so easily that Txema misinterprets Claudia''s feelings for him.', 'Bilbao, Spain. After breaking up with Elisa, his girlfriend for several years, Txema meets Claudia, a gorgeous Argentinian girl, in a very awkward situation. They become friends so soon and so easily that Txema misinterprets Claudia''s feelings for him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6ZmQLbzOkrNfcnqUhmqKWeyDps0.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:20071'),
  ('715643006647053035', 'Friend Zone', 2019, 'Romance, Comedy', 'Kittiwat Saemarat, Chayanop Bunprakob, Sasiphon Chinakat', 'Thodsapon Thiptinnakorn, Chayanop Bunprakob, Pattaranad Bhiboonsawade', 'Naphat Siangsomboon, Pimchanok Luevisadpaibul, Jason Young, Benjamin Joseph Varney, Nathasit Kotimanuswanich, Sukhapat Lohwacharin, Chertsak Pratumsrisakhon, Panasya Sawettaporn', null, 'Two best friends who wind up in the friend zone navigate a series of failed relationships through the years — until sparks finally fly.', 'Two best friends who wind up in the friend zone navigate a series of failed relationships through the years — until sparks finally fly.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ifJLg5uc0KQVrp8heSHwOFpBRK1.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:582681'),
  ('480610890796786686', 'Friend: The Great Legacy', 2013, 'Drama, Action, Crime', 'Kwak Kyung-taek, Yun Ju-hwan, Shin Sang-yeul', 'Seungun Han, Kwak Kyung-taek', 'Yu Oh-seong, Ju Jin-mo, Kim Woo-bin, Jang Young-nam, Jung Ho-bin, Ki Joo-bong, Lee Cheol-min, Lee Jun-hyeok', null, 'Joon-seok is sent to prison for his involvement in Dong-soo''s death. He meets Dong-soo''s son in prison, keeps his identity a secret, and agrees to join forces when he is released. All of their plans fall apart when Sung-hoon finds out the truth.', 'Joon-seok is sent to prison for his involvement in Dong-soo''s death. He meets Dong-soo''s son in prison, keeps his identity a secret, and agrees to join forces when he is released. All of their plans fall apart when Sung-hoon finds out the truth.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/70UQdCtO53xstSuWrTiQQg7wVyB.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:238010'),
  ('497356250969378999', 'Friend''s Mothers', 2018, 'Romance', 'Jo Tae-ho', null, 'Baek Yoon-jae, Jo Wan-jin, Yoon Joo-I, Lee Hyo-won, Seo Won', null, 'A lonely young man is in dire straits, but his friend''s mothers don''t see him as a boy, but as a man, and take extra interest in him.', 'A lonely young man is in dire straits, but his friend''s mothers don''t see him as a boy, but as a man, and take extra interest in him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cG1hXEWGepEqKSRe2HLL33vvPn8.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:700979'),
  ('1095760336827411978', 'Friend''s Mothers 2', 2020, 'Romance', 'Kim Hwan', null, 'Seo Won, Si Woo, Lee Eun-mi, Shin Yeon-woo', null, 'Junho and Jungkook are friends. They each live with their mother. One day, Jun-ho goes to his friend''s home to meet Jung-kook''s mother Mi-jeong. However, she falls in love at first sight with her younger and more beautiful figure. Mi-ho, who has lived alone without her husband, falls in love with Junho. Meanwhile, Jungkook is going to have a wild conversation with Junho''s stepmom Yujeong whom he met with a chat application and feel her actually...', 'Junho and Jungkook are friends. They each live with their mother. One day, Jun-ho goes to his friend''s home to meet Jung-kook''s mother Mi-jeong. However, she falls in love at first sight with her younger and more beautiful figure. Mi-ho, who has lived alone without her husband, falls in love with Junho. Meanwhile, Jungkook is going to have a wild conversation with Junho''s stepmom Yujeong whom he met with a chat application and feel her actually...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/t44O6f1qBHxdyq2QGkikzniWWFT.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:671502'),
  ('210334042499904004', 'Friendly Beast', 2018, 'Thriller, Horror, Crime', 'Gabriela Amaral Almeida', 'Gabriela Amaral Almeida', 'Murilo Benício, Luciana Paes, Irandhir Santos, Camila Morgado, Jiddú Pinheiro, Ernani Moraes, Humberto Carrão, Ariclenes Barroso', null, 'A restaurant owner going over the edge when an armed robbery is attempted at his establishment. He holds everyone captive at gunpoint – criminals and customers alike – and situations corrode into a nightmare state, guided by manipulation and raw compulsion.', 'A restaurant owner going over the edge when an armed robbery is attempted at his establishment. He holds everyone captive at gunpoint – criminals and customers alike – and situations corrode into a nightmare state, guided by manipulation and raw compulsion.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/o7TZODLR9pMhKypYclFDdo1Z68o.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:461774'),
  ('238169352394240343', 'Friendly Fire', 1998, 'Drama, History, Crime', 'Beto Brant, Marcelo Durst', 'Beto Brant, Renato Ciasca', 'Leonardo Villar, Zécarlos Machado, Cacá Amaral, Genézio de Barros, Carlos Meceni, Rodrigo Brassoloto, Sergio Cavalcante, Douglas Simon', null, 'Brazil in the early 70s. Miguel, Eloi, Osvaldo and Paolo take part in armed attacks against the military dictatorship. They pay a heavy price with torture and arrest. Today the four friends still see each other. Only Miguel is politically active. On a photograph from a political meeting in Sao Paolo he recognises the policeman who tortured them 25 years ago and who was responsible for the death of Miguel''s girlfriend. The policeman has been officially dead for a few years. On one of their fishing trips together, Miguel tells his friends of his discovery. When they hunt down and confront their nemesis they come into conflict with both themselves and each other.', 'Brazil in the early 70s. Miguel, Eloi, Osvaldo and Paolo take part in armed attacks against the military dictatorship. They pay a heavy price with torture and arrest. Today the four friends still see each other. Only Miguel is politically active. On a photograph from a political meeting in Sao Paolo he recognises the policeman who tortured them 25 years ago and who was responsible for the death of Miguel''s girlfriend. The policeman has been officially dead for a few years. On one of their fishing trips together, Miguel tells his friends of his discovery. When they hunt down and confront their nemesis they come into conflict with both themselves and each other.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fFJejyyA5x2SvNFlamm4nXTWvsT.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:96055'),
  ('996544138407135012', 'Friendly Persuasion', 1956, 'Drama, War', 'William Wyler, Ellsworth Fredericks, Austen Jewell', 'Michael Wilson', 'Gary Cooper, Dorothy McGuire, Anthony Perkins, Richard Eyer, Robert Middleton, Phyllis Love, Peter Mark Richman, Walter Catlett', 'NR', 'The story of a family of Quakers in Indiana in 1862. Their religious sect is strongly opposed to violence and war. It''s not easy for them to meet the rules of their religion in everyday life but when Southern troops pass the area they are in real trouble. Should they fight, despite their peaceful attitude?', 'The story of a family of Quakers in Indiana in 1862. Their religious sect is strongly opposed to violence and war. It''s not easy for them to meet the rules of their religion in everyday life but when Southern troops pass the area they are in real trouble. Should they fight, despite their peaceful attitude?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mhsdObvFHoOfgaKAVJUOeK3LiOP.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:43258'),
  ('406383549030227324', 'Friends', 1971, 'Drama, Romance', 'Lewis Gilbert, Andréas Winding', 'Vernon Harris, Jack Golden Russell, Lewis Gilbert', 'Anicée Alvina, Sean Bury, Ronald Lewis, Toby Robins, Pascale Roberts, Sady Rebbot, Joan Hickson', 'R', 'Paul, a rich English boy, and Michelle, an orphaned French girl, run away from home to a remote beach. Living on their own, their friendship grows into love.', 'Paul, a rich English boy, and Michelle, an orphaned French girl, run away from home to a remote beach. Living on their own, their friendship grows into love.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oaNJNddADomFR97gr3SsY6xVUuU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:4156'),
