  ('236484973454234750', 'Friends', 1999, 'Romance, Comedy, Drama', 'Siddique', 'Siddique', 'Jayaram, Mukesh, Sreenivasan, Meena, Divyaa Unni, Jagathy Sreekumar, Janardhanan, Cochin Haneefa', null, 'Aravindan, Chandu and Joy are best friends. Their friendship faces a testing time when Aravindan''s sister falls in love with Chandu.', 'Aravindan, Chandu and Joy are best friends. Their friendship faces a testing time when Aravindan''s sister falls in love with Chandu.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/MpFC6ZEcnyXHi4E0pTQcLMzRxj.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:359559'),
  ('968131246129916670', 'Friends', 2001, 'Family, Drama, Comedy', 'Siddique, Anandakuttan', 'Siddique', 'Vijay, Suriya, Vadivelu, Devayani, Vijayalakshmi, Ramesh Khanna, Abhinaya Sri, Radha Ravi', null, 'A man values his best friend more than anything else in the world. One day he confesses a dark secret from their childhood to his wife, which is overheard by another. Once the secret gets out, the friendship is destroyed.', 'A man values his best friend more than anything else in the world. One day he confesses a dark secret from their childhood to his wife, which is overheard by another. Once the secret gets out, the friendship is destroyed.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iOCOY9SAD8u9N5JWCaLILrlgpzP.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:108248'),
  ('246004937054732861', 'Friends & Family Christmas', 2023, 'Family, Romance', 'Anne Wheeler, Mel Ward', 'Gary Goldstein, Tracy Andreen', 'Humberly González, Ali Liebert, Gabriela Reynoso, Christopher Shyer, Samantha Cole, Barclay Hope, Jeremy Hoffman, Kyle Toy', 'G', 'Daniella has recently moved to New York to pursue an art career and decides to stay in town to share the holidays with her circle of artist friends, instead of going home to see her sweet, if overbearing, parents. Amelia is a talented entertainment lawyer trying to stay focused on her work after a broken engagement. When Daniella and Amelia are set up by their parents, they agree to pretend that they are dating, to appease them for the holidays. However, as they spend time in each other’s worlds, they soon build a connection that is deeper than either of them could have hoped for.', 'Daniella has recently moved to New York to pursue an art career and decides to stay in town to share the holidays with her circle of artist friends, instead of going home to see her sweet, if overbearing, parents. Amelia is a talented entertainment lawyer trying to stay focused on her work after a broken engagement. When Daniella and Amelia are set up by their parents, they agree to pretend that they are dating, to appease them for the holidays. However, as they spend time in each other’s worlds, they soon build a connection that is deeper than either of them could have hoped for.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/naLwVZJKN1G4OQatuoMNcHwQDRw.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1180706'),
  ('208708473194197237', 'Friends & Lovers', 1999, 'Comedy, Romance, Drama', 'George Haas', 'George Haas', 'George Newbern, Alison Eastwood, Neill Barry, Suzanne Cryer, Danny Nucci, Stephen Baldwin, Robert Downey Jr., Claudia Schiffer', 'R', 'Friends for ten years, a group of twenty-somethings head for the ski slopes as guests of Ian''s father. (Ian and dad are estranged because dad worked too many hours when Ian was a lad.) Dad has something to say, but Ian won''t listen. Meanwhile, David is gay and virginal; Ian''s business partner, Keaton, is unhappy that his sister Jane is pregnant with no plans to tell the father; Lisa is everybody''s pal and no one''s lover; John, stuck in adolescence, is always on the make. He brings German-born stunner, Carla, and promptly loses her affection to Hans, a fast-talking ski instructor. David meets Manny: they have chess in common. Soon, surprises abound as relationships take new turns.', 'Friends for ten years, a group of twenty-somethings head for the ski slopes as guests of Ian''s father. (Ian and dad are estranged because dad worked too many hours when Ian was a lad.) Dad has something to say, but Ian won''t listen. Meanwhile, David is gay and virginal; Ian''s business partner, Keaton, is unhappy that his sister Jane is pregnant with no plans to tell the father; Lisa is everybody''s pal and no one''s lover; John, stuck in adolescence, is always on the make. He brings German-born stunner, Carla, and promptly loses her affection to Hans, a fast-talking ski instructor. David meets Manny: they have chess in common. Soon, surprises abound as relationships take new turns.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5zh1PQPN7dl8BX2zdaEYyiNRNXp.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:114719'),
  ('56147671448453454', 'Friends and Family', 2001, 'Action, Comedy, Crime', 'Kristen Coury, John Leuba', 'Joseph Triebwasser', 'Greg Lauren, Chris Gartin, Rebecca Creskoff, Edward Hibbert, Allison Mackie, Beth Fowler, Meshach Taylor, Frank Pellegrino', null, 'Gay New York couple Stephen Torcelli and Danny Russo have something to hide from Stephen''s parents -- their jobs as Mafia enforcers. When the Torcelli family plans to visit, Stephen and Danny panic because Stephen''s father works for the FBI. Despite efforts to keep family and Mafia separate, a birthday party gets mixed up with a mobster''s daughter''s engagement party. Trouble arises when the mobsters concoct a political scheme at the party.', 'Gay New York couple Stephen Torcelli and Danny Russo have something to hide from Stephen''s parents -- their jobs as Mafia enforcers. When the Torcelli family plans to visit, Stephen and Danny panic because Stephen''s father works for the FBI. Despite efforts to keep family and Mafia separate, a birthday party gets mixed up with a mobster''s daughter''s engagement party. Trouble arises when the mobsters concoct a political scheme at the party.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kYzGsZZjIwni13eve3AvAXBXFb.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:23423'),
  ('554168631026687773', 'Friends Forever', 1987, 'Drama', 'Stefan Henszelman', 'Alexander Korschen, Stefan Henszelman', 'Claus Bender Mortensen, Thomas Elholm, Thomas Sigsgaard, Lars Kylmann Jacobsen, Rasmus Bay Barlby, Trine Torp Hansen, Rita Angela, Carsten Morch', null, 'Teenager Kristian moves to a new neighborhood. He makes friends with two very different boys in the new school: Henrik, an independent boy, and Patrick, the leader of a gang. Later on, Kristian is startled when he finds Patrick is gay and having an affair with the captain of a soccer team.', 'Teenager Kristian moves to a new neighborhood. He makes friends with two very different boys in the new school: Henrik, an independent boy, and Patrick, the leader of a gang. Later on, Kristian is startled when he finds Patrick is gay and having an affair with the captain of a soccer team.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/x1UNPgxzBeBtHL4Y8Fzh5R2lKW0.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:185061'),
  ('438850054527434716', 'Friends Jokes', 2006, 'Comedy, TV Movie', 'Noureddine Douguena', null, 'Benaissa El Jirari, Hanan Ibrahimi, Aziz Hattab, Khalid Benchegra, جميلة لسكير, Youssef Britel, Malika El-Omari, Abdenbi Benioui', null, 'The film tells a story speaks of "Yusuf ", a plumbing Man, who is exposed to many pranks by his friends.', 'The film tells a story speaks of "Yusuf ", a plumbing Man, who is exposed to many pranks by his friends.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/prVnmglF6tQnx75AZEj4DXyBmvu.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:575392'),
  ('995585754112663275', 'Friends of Friends', 2002, 'Drama, Romance', 'Dominik Graf, Hanno Lentz', 'Markus Busch, Dominik Graf', 'Matthias Schweighöfer, Sabine Timoteo, Florian Stetter, Jessica Schwarz, Tanja Schleiff, Tabea Heynig, Peter Benedict, Alexander Held', null, 'Dominik Graf relocates the story of the same name by Henry James from the 19th century to the year 2001.', 'Dominik Graf relocates the story of the same name by Henry James from the 19th century to the year 2001.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aUzk1e4GAhKaNvgrJemrvGAc5EU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:76898'),
  ('251495258868090227', 'Friends of the Groom', 2017, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Doğa Can Anafarta, Mehmet Başbaran', 'Doğa Can Anafarta', 'Furkan Andıç, Özgürcan Çevik, Pelin Akil, Açelya Topaloğlu, Sarp Can Köroğlu, Ozan Osmanpaşaoğlu, Özgün Aydın, Eylül Su Sapan', null, 'When one of them is about to get hitched, five school buddies tackle a list of adventures before adulthood kicks in.', 'When one of them is about to get hitched, five school buddies tackle a list of adventures before adulthood kicks in.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nybzhRKbQMvvPwvoB81SUSLf87J.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:474718'),
  ('567520719500256473', 'Friends with Benefits', 2011, 'Romance, Comedy', 'Will Gluck, Tony Nahar, Todd Amateau', 'Keith Merryman, David A. Newman, Will Gluck', 'Justin Timberlake, Mila Kunis, Jenna Elfman, Patricia Clarkson, Woody Harrelson, Richard Jenkins, Bryan Greenberg, Andy Samberg', 'R', 'Dylan is done with relationships. Jamie decides to stop buying into the Hollywood clichés of true love. When the two become friends they decide to try something new and take advantage of their mutual attraction - but without any emotional attachment.', 'Dylan is done with relationships. Jamie decides to stop buying into the Hollywood clichés of true love. When the two become friends they decide to try something new and take advantage of their mutual attraction - but without any emotional attachment.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nKhhDFCdzxeJ3GUunQ570LDpUkz.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:50544'),
  ('1044912889112329468', 'Friends with Kids', 2012, 'Comedy, Drama, Romance', 'Jennifer Westfeldt, William Rexer', 'Jennifer Westfeldt', 'Adam Scott, Jennifer Westfeldt, Jon Hamm, Maya Rudolph, Chris O''Dowd, Kristen Wiig, Megan Fox, Lee Bryant', 'R', 'In the wake of their friends'' marriages and eventual offspring, longtime pals Julie and Jason decide to have a child together without becoming a couple. By becoming "time-share" parents, they reason, they can experience the joys of parenthood without significantly curbing their personal freedom. However, when Julie and Jason both become involved with others, they discover that they secretly harbor romantic feelings for each other.', 'In the wake of their friends'' marriages and eventual offspring, longtime pals Julie and Jason decide to have a child together without becoming a couple. By becoming "time-share" parents, they reason, they can experience the joys of parenthood without significantly curbing their personal freedom. However, when Julie and Jason both become involved with others, they discover that they secretly harbor romantic feelings for each other.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cA6putv2ND8snBBa0t9WhlW1TfG.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:80038'),
  ('789966970263138512', 'Friends with Money', 2006, 'Comedy, Drama, Romance', 'Terry Stacey, Nicole Holofcener, Maria Mantia', 'Nicole Holofcener', 'Jennifer Aniston, Joan Cusack, Catherine Keener, Frances McDormand, Jason Isaacs, Scott Caan, Simon McBurney, Greg Germann', 'R', 'As she reaches her mid-thirties and quits her lucrative job, singleton Olivia finds herself unsure about her future and her relationships with her successful and wealthy friends. She begins to envy the security of her richer friends and, although their lives may seem easier, Olivia''s friends have their problems too: screenwriters Christine and Patrick are unable to collaborate on their latest project, Jane and Aaron have lost the romance in their relationship, and Franny and Matt have difficulties handling the demands of parenthood.', 'As she reaches her mid-thirties and quits her lucrative job, singleton Olivia finds herself unsure about her future and her relationships with her successful and wealthy friends. She begins to envy the security of her richer friends and, although their lives may seem easier, Olivia''s friends have their problems too: screenwriters Christine and Patrick are unable to collaborate on their latest project, Jane and Aaron have lost the romance in their relationship, and Franny and Matt have difficulties handling the demands of parenthood.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hJmfZ1b6ZzT4bORo4f2FyWbkgAx.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:8998'),
  ('314133355860644842', 'Friends: Naki on Monster Island', 2011, 'Animation, Comedy, Family', 'Takashi Yamazaki, Ryuichi Yagi', 'Takashi Yamazaki', 'Shingo Katori, Koichi Yamadera, Yûna Shindô, YOU, Seishirou Katou, Sadao Abe, FROGMAN', 'G', 'Offshore, shrouded in fog, there is a mysterious island that is said to be the home of a family of monsters. It is strictly forbidden to approach it. But one day a human child, Mushroom, it loses and coming face to face with the mysterious creatures that live there. The arrival of Mushroom, makes panic on the island because the monsters are actually terrified of living humans.', 'Offshore, shrouded in fog, there is a mysterious island that is said to be the home of a family of monsters. It is strictly forbidden to approach it. But one day a human child, Mushroom, it loses and coming face to face with the mysterious creatures that live there. The arrival of Mushroom, makes panic on the island because the monsters are actually terrified of living humans.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/Oiyu5tdrJHYUwXm6Z1TQlm3RZd.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:180272'),
  ('128487852256819827', 'Friends: The Reunion', 2021, 'Documentary', 'Chloe Weaver, Tore Livia, Matt Garrett', null, 'Jennifer Aniston, Courteney Cox, Lisa Kudrow, Matt LeBlanc, Matthew Perry, David Schwimmer, James Corden, Justin Bieber', 'PG-13', 'The cast of Friends reunites for a once-in-a-lifetime celebration of the hit series, an unforgettable evening filled with iconic memories, uncontrollable laughter, happy tears, and special guests.', 'The cast of Friends reunites for a once-in-a-lifetime celebration of the hit series, an unforgettable evening filled with iconic memories, uncontrollable laughter, happy tears, and special guests.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bT3c4TSOP8vBmMoXZRDPTII6eDa.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:691179'),
  ('645622260915106861', 'Friendsgiving', 2020, 'Comedy', 'Nicol Paone, Neil Shapiro', 'Nicol Paone', 'Malin Åkerman, Kat Dennings, Jack Donnelly, Aisha Tyler, Jane Seymour, Deon Cole, Ryan Hansen, Chelsea Peretti', 'R', 'Newly-divorced actress Molly, her recently-dumped lesbian best friend Abby and Molly’s mother Helen host a dysfunctional, comical and chaotic Thanksgiving dinner for their motley crew of close friends and strange acquaintances.', 'Newly-divorced actress Molly, her recently-dumped lesbian best friend Abby and Molly’s mother Helen host a dysfunctional, comical and chaotic Thanksgiving dinner for their motley crew of close friends and strange acquaintances.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/s9CGTv4AFmrVkgoydnYFwXPaxGx.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:524840'),
  ('502373383249748166', 'Friendsheep', 2010, 'Comedy, Animation', 'Jaime Maestro', null, null, null, 'A wolf gets a job hunting the sheep who work there, but falls for the perks of his new role. Then he runs out of snacks. An animation nominated for a Goya Award.', 'A wolf gets a job hunting the sheep who work there, but falls for the perks of his new role. Then he runs out of snacks. An animation nominated for a Goya Award.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xXLoTeTrgBdXGKwbZK9F40xuPiZ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:159254'),
  ('825779365112758942', 'Friendship', 2008, 'Drama, Romance', 'Chatchai Naksuriya, Anat Yuangngern, Patchanon Thammajira', 'Pawanrat Naksuriya', 'Jetrin Wattanasin, Mario Maurer, Apinya Sakuljaroensuk, Yutthana Boonaom, Chaleumpol Tikumpornteerawong, Varut Woratham, Kanawat Chantaralawan, Punyawee Sukkulworasate', null, 'Adult Singha receives a call from Jack, a friend from school. Jack sets up a high school reunion where young Singha meets with the rest of his buddies from back in the day.', 'Adult Singha receives a call from Jack, a friend from school. Jack sets up a high school reunion where young Singha meets with the rest of his buddies from back in the day.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iqvrN06eV8ruogGjULN3IAjLKtH.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:72743'),
  ('500357392075966466', 'Friendship', 2025, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Andrew DeYoung, Laura Klein, Kat Hess', 'Andrew DeYoung', 'Tim Robinson, Paul Rudd, Kate Mara, Jack Dylan Grazer, Rick Worthy, Whitmer Thomas, Daniel London, Eric Rahill', 'R', 'Suburban dad Craig falls hard for his charismatic new neighbor Austin, and his attempts to make an adult male friend threatens to ruin both of their lives.', 'Suburban dad Craig falls hard for his charismatic new neighbor Austin, and his attempts to make an adult male friend threatens to ruin both of their lives.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eikAu9gPJTQQmwFwa1zX5Hfz96P.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1239655'),
  ('270327005052578564', 'Friendship!', 2010, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Markus Goller, Ueli Steiger', 'Oliver Ziegenbalg', 'Matthias Schweighöfer, Friedrich Mücke, Alicja Bachleda-Curuś, Kevin Rankin, Chris Browning, Kimberly J. Brown, Todd Stashwick, Dwayne Adway', null, 'A young man from East Germany travels to San Francisco to search for his father, who fled 12 years ago. Together with his best friend, he starts the journey from New York with no money and the only word they ever learned in english-lessons: "friendship".', 'A young man from East Germany travels to San Francisco to search for his father, who fled 12 years ago. Together with his best friend, he starts the journey from New York with no money and the only word they ever learned in english-lessons: "friendship".', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/a9wd9gJyEHrUVT4FuLfCADhmDzw.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:35217'),
  ('582779077374259844', 'Friendship''s Death', 1987, 'Science Fiction, Drama', 'Peter Wollen, Cordelia Hardy, Witold Stok', 'Peter Wollen', 'Bill Paterson, Tilda Swinton, Patrick Bauchau, Ruby Baker, Joumana Gill', null, 'A robot messenger is sent to earth to appeal to humans to live in peace. Originally designed to go to MIT, by mistake she ends up in Amman, Jordan during the Black September riots of 1970. Sullivan, a British journalist, comes to her aid when she is found wandering without papers following a bombing and grants her refuge in his hotel room. But there she tells him she is a robot, sent as a peace envoy from another planet. He is not sure whether to believe her story or not, but finds her unusual view of the world appealing. They examine the human condition in a series of incredibly insightful and entertaining conversations.', 'A robot messenger is sent to earth to appeal to humans to live in peace. Originally designed to go to MIT, by mistake she ends up in Amman, Jordan during the Black September riots of 1970. Sullivan, a British journalist, comes to her aid when she is found wandering without papers following a bombing and grants her refuge in his hotel room. But there she tells him she is a robot, sent as a peace envoy from another planet. He is not sure whether to believe her story or not, but finds her unusual view of the world appealing. They examine the human condition in a series of incredibly insightful and entertaining conversations.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7HxhqLY9MoXJh4TgXEcaW5qKDSp.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:230915'),
  ('350430086864217475', 'Friendzone', 2021, 'Romance, Comedy', 'Charles Van Tieghem', 'Marina Rollman, Stanislas Carré de Malberg, Charles Van Tieghem', 'Mickaël Lumière, Manon Azem, Fadily Camara, Constance Arnoult, Éloïse Valli, Maxime Gasteuil, Bruno Sanches, Eva Danino', null, 'Hopeful romantic Thibault believes his luck could change when sparks fly between him and Rose. But can he go from bestie to boyfriend?', 'Hopeful romantic Thibault believes his luck could change when sparks fly between him and Rose. But can he go from bestie to boyfriend?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xgQ55Koxnq6rwLoPDIfaIjm16bA.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:869617'),
  ('907411802648957839', 'Fright', 1971, 'Horror, Thriller', 'Peter Collinson, Ian Wilson', 'Tudor Gates', 'Susan George, Honor Blackman, Ian Bannen, John Gregson, George Cole, Dennis Waterman, Tara Collinson, Maurice Kaufmann', 'PG', 'Young babysitter Amanda arrives at the Lloyd residence to spend the evening looking after their young son. Soon after the Lloyds leave, a series of frightening occurrences in the gloomy old house have Amanda''s nerves on edge. The real terror begins, however, when the child''s biological father appears after recently escaping from a nearby mental institution.', 'Young babysitter Amanda arrives at the Lloyd residence to spend the evening looking after their young son. Soon after the Lloyds leave, a series of frightening occurrences in the gloomy old house have Amanda''s nerves on edge. The real terror begins, however, when the child''s biological father appears after recently escaping from a nearby mental institution.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3HpslY91rWbmbBRPZS0It1uWarD.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:40350'),
  ('223507061148616926', 'Fright Before Christmas', 1979, 'Animation, Family, Comedy', 'Friz Freleng', 'Friz Freleng, Tony Benedict', 'Mel Blanc', 'NR', 'The Tasmanian Devil escapes from a plane and lands in Santa''s suit. After taking off in Santa''s sleigh he lands on Bugs'' roof where he tries to eat everything in sight including the present Bugs got for him.', 'The Tasmanian Devil escapes from a plane and lands in Santa''s suit. After taking off in Santa''s sleigh he lands on Bugs'' roof where he tries to eat everything in sight including the present Bugs got for him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7UxfPH40UaBuy1XaEwnuqUUWAZI.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:83774'),
  ('488976816238045782', 'Fright Night', 1985, 'Comedy, Horror', 'Tom Holland, Jan Kiesser, John Bruno', 'Tom Holland', 'Chris Sarandon, William Ragsdale, Amanda Bearse, Roddy McDowall, Stephen Geoffreys, Jonathan Stark, Dorothy Fielding, Art Evans', 'R', 'Charley Brewster, a high school student, accidentally discovers the true and creepy nature of Jerry Dandrige, his dashing and enigmatic new neighbor; but no one seems willing to believe him.', 'Charley Brewster, a high school student, accidentally discovers the true and creepy nature of Jerry Dandrige, his dashing and enigmatic new neighbor; but no one seems willing to believe him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/euIh75MwNDrYkTEVSkw7VXWGXoE.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:11797'),
  ('285065070381102697', 'Fright Night', 2011, 'Horror, Comedy', 'Craig Gillespie, Kevin Black, Javier Aguirresarobe', 'Tom Holland', 'Anton Yelchin, Colin Farrell, Toni Collette, David Tennant, Imogen Poots, Christopher Mintz-Plasse, Dave Franco, Reid Ewing', 'R', 'A teenager suspects his new neighbour is a vampire. Unable to convince anyone, he tries to enlist the help of a self-proclaimed vampire hunter and magician.', 'A teenager suspects his new neighbour is a vampire. Unable to convince anyone, he tries to enlist the help of a self-proclaimed vampire hunter and magician.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ySQ3v4Fzpy3fePs86eoLiDzwLYM.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:58151'),
  ('685254374121674974', 'Fright Night 2: New Blood', 2013, 'Horror, Comedy', 'Eduardo Rodríguez, Ingrid Cristea, Christopher Landry', 'Matt Venne', 'Will Payne, Sean Power, Sacha Parkinson, Chris Waller, Jaime Murray, John-Christian Bateman, Liana Margineanu, Alina Minzu', 'R', 'By day Gerri Dandridge is a sexy professor, but by night she transforms into a real-life vampire with an unquenchable thirst for human blood. When a group of high school students travel abroad to study in Romania, they find themselves ensnared in her chilling web of lust and terror. Charlie and ''Evil'' Ed must stop Gerri from drinking and bathing in the blood of a ''new moon virgin'', who just so happens to be Charlie’s ex-girlfriend.', 'By day Gerri Dandridge is a sexy professor, but by night she transforms into a real-life vampire with an unquenchable thirst for human blood. When a group of high school students travel abroad to study in Romania, they find themselves ensnared in her chilling web of lust and terror. Charlie and ''Evil'' Ed must stop Gerri from drinking and bathing in the blood of a ''new moon virgin'', who just so happens to be Charlie’s ex-girlfriend.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3Is5G28YLNKq22n5Ee2yTmYA3m6.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:214597'),
  ('48817591815629579', 'Fright Night Part 2', 1988, 'Horror, Comedy', 'Tommy Lee Wallace, Mark Irwin, Scott Printz', 'Tommy Lee Wallace, Tim Metcalfe, Miguel Tejada-Flores', 'Roddy McDowall, William Ragsdale, Traci Lind, Julie Carmen, Jon Gries, Russell Clark, Brian Thompson, Merritt Butrick', 'R', 'After three years of therapy Charley Brewster, now a college student, is convinced that Jerry Dandridge was a serial killer posing as a vampire. But when Regine, a mysterious actress and her entourage move into Peter Vincent''s apartment block, the nightmare starts again - and this time it''s personal!', 'After three years of therapy Charley Brewster, now a college student, is convinced that Jerry Dandridge was a serial killer posing as a vampire. But when Regine, a mysterious actress and her entourage move into Peter Vincent''s apartment block, the nightmare starts again - and this time it''s personal!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pNJDLond2y2hQLBnEoczkdFrgZJ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:18086'),
  ('255355066427499421', 'Frightmare', 1974, 'Horror, Thriller', 'Pete Walker, Peter Jessop', 'David McGillivray', 'Rupert Davies, Sheila Keith, Deborah Fairfax, Paul Greenwood, Kim Butcher, Leo Genn, Gerald Flood, Fiona Curzon', 'R', 'In 1957, Dorothy and Edmund Yates were committed to an institution for the criminally insane, she for acts of murder and cannibalism and he for covering up her crimes. Fifteen years later, they are pronounced fit for society and released. However, in Dorothy''s case the doctors may have jumped the gun a bit. Edmund and eldest daughter, Jackie, try to discover just how far Mother''s bloodlust has taken her. Meanwhile, youngest daughter Debbie begins to explore the crazy roots of her family tree as fully as possible.', 'In 1957, Dorothy and Edmund Yates were committed to an institution for the criminally insane, she for acts of murder and cannibalism and he for covering up her crimes. Fifteen years later, they are pronounced fit for society and released. However, in Dorothy''s case the doctors may have jumped the gun a bit. Edmund and eldest daughter, Jackie, try to discover just how far Mother''s bloodlust has taken her. Meanwhile, youngest daughter Debbie begins to explore the crazy roots of her family tree as fully as possible.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9lJdYMIMpPIdTBVoSsFIm3e6cVQ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:38446'),
  ('561065956868557548', 'Frightmare', 1981, 'Horror, Comedy', 'Norman Thaddeus Vane, John Dirlam, Joel King', 'Norman Thaddeus Vane', 'Ferdy Mayne, Luca Bercovici, Nita Talbot, Leon Askin, Jennifer Starrett, Jeffrey Combs, Barbara Pilavin, Scott Thomson', null, 'Drama students decide to pay tribute to their favorite horror star by stealing his body from his crypt for a farewell party. They fail to realize their violation of the tomb has triggered powerful black magic, and Conrad hasn''t taken his final bows yet.', 'Drama students decide to pay tribute to their favorite horror star by stealing his body from his crypt for a farewell party. They fail to realize their violation of the tomb has triggered powerful black magic, and Conrad hasn''t taken his final bows yet.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/joQ36TBtUfMlQilc44gcRiY5Nqv.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:85198'),
  ('720333227079367104', 'Frigid Hare', 1949, 'Animation, Comedy', 'Chuck Jones', 'Michael Maltese', 'Mel Blanc', 'PG', 'Bugs rescues a penguin from an Inuit hunter at the South Pole and becomes obligated to it beyond his wildest dreams.', 'Bugs rescues a penguin from an Inuit hunter at the South Pole and becomes obligated to it beyond his wildest dreams.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/84N1kqib1MN4jeQ3cDPQlvQ2g25.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:106930'),
  ('104822219705104891', 'Frisch gepresst', 2012, 'Comedy, Romance, TV Movie', 'Christine Hartmann', null, 'Diana Amft, Alexander Beyer, Tom Wlaschiha, Sunnyi Melles, Jule Ronstedt, Sylvester Groth, Yasmina Filali, Susanne Fröhlich', null, 'Andrea, a childless single, humiliates herself on a date with ex‐crush Gregor, blacks out, and wakes in his bed. Determined to change, she meets ideal lawyer Chris. As she and friends imagine a future, Andrea discovers she’s pregnant - certain Chris is the father despite doubt about that night.', 'Andrea, a childless single, humiliates herself on a date with ex‐crush Gregor, blacks out, and wakes in his bed. Determined to change, she meets ideal lawyer Chris. As she and friends imagine a future, Andrea discovers she’s pregnant - certain Chris is the father despite doubt about that night.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eDB97edlVQUr1bJ10y7eUmfxm6h.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:129582'),
  ('200588796112521783', 'Frisco Jenny', 1933, 'Drama', 'William A. Wellman, Sidney Hickox, Dolph Zimmer', 'Robert Lord, Wilson Mizner', 'Ruth Chatterton, Louis Calhern, Helen Jerome Eddy, Donald Cook, James Murray, Hallam Cooley, Pat O''Malley, Harold Huber', null, 'Jenny is carrying the child of a young man who dies in the San Francisco earthquake (1906). After giving birth, she decides to place her child in the custody of a wealthy married couple. Years later, thanks to the protection of a corrupt politician, she becomes the main "madame" of San Francisco, in addition to participating in various illegal activities.', 'Jenny is carrying the child of a young man who dies in the San Francisco earthquake (1906). After giving birth, she decides to place her child in the custody of a wealthy married couple. Years later, thanks to the protection of a corrupt politician, she becomes the main "madame" of San Francisco, in addition to participating in various illegal activities.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/akye9O1aMeMlh9DS9c2ZUACPeaW.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:72338'),
  ('417906074204498289', 'Frisk', 1996, 'Drama, Thriller, Comedy', 'Todd Verow, Greg Watkins', 'Jim Dwyer, George LaVoo, Todd Verow', 'Michael Gunther, Craig Chester, Michael Stock, Raoul O''Connell, Jaie Laplante, Parker Posey, James Lyons, Alexis Arquette', null, 'A first person narrative of the exploits of a gay serial killer in deeply disturbing, controversial drama about violence, sexuality, and the imagination. Dennis, the main character, whose lead we follow on this path between what is real and what we can only hope is surreal. His friends attempt to determine if he''s truly a psychopath.', 'A first person narrative of the exploits of a gay serial killer in deeply disturbing, controversial drama about violence, sexuality, and the imagination. Dennis, the main character, whose lead we follow on this path between what is real and what we can only hope is surreal. His friends attempt to determine if he''s truly a psychopath.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2BsmfL2wr4sAjrsBFePewmslnXO.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:40926'),
  ('675029288576045837', 'Frisky', 1954, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Luisa Alessandri, Franco Montemurro, Luigi Comencini', 'Luigi Comencini, Ettore Maria Margadonna, Eduardo De Filippo', 'Vittorio De Sica, Gina Lollobrigida, Marisa Merlini, Tina Pica, Roberto Risso, Memmo Carotenuto, Saro Urzì, Virgilio Riento', null, 'The relationships between a veteran marshal, his bride-to-be, a rookie and his fiancée are severely tested when the young carabiniere is temporarily sent to a distant town.', 'The relationships between a veteran marshal, his bride-to-be, a rookie and his fiancée are severely tested when the young carabiniere is temporarily sent to a distant town.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/n8B5J3CjICO3xq7anwuiEoC5t0f.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:57991'),
  ('951852456625449488', 'Fritz Lang', 2016, 'Drama', 'Lutz Reitemeier, Gordian Maugg', 'Gordian Maugg, Alexander Häusser', 'Heino Ferch, Samuel Finzi, Johanna Gastdorf, Michael Mendl, Thomas Thieme, Maximilian von Pufendorf, Lisa Charlotte Friederich, Lena Münchow', null, 'Filmmaker Fritz Lang seeks inspiration for his first sound film by immersing himself in the case of serial killer Peter Kürten.', 'Filmmaker Fritz Lang seeks inspiration for his first sound film by immersing himself in the case of serial killer Peter Kürten.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xDr4fy3FyR9u25WXrbTvfl7fRez.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:386100'),
  ('755755133294001640', 'Fritzi: A Revolutionary Tale', 2019, 'Animation, Drama, Family', 'Ralf Kukula, Matthias Bruhn', 'Beate Völcker, Péter Palátsik', 'Naomi Hadad, Ben Hadad, Jördis Triebel, Jonas Schmidt-Foß, Katharina Lopinski, Winfried Glatzeder, Peter Flechtner, Amelie Sophie von Redecke', null, 'September 1989 in the GDR. With the change of the general mood in the country, the life of 12-year-old FRITZI changes as well. Her best friend Sophie has fled with her mother through Hungary to West Germany and the only thing Fritzi has left is Sophie''s little dog Sputnik. But Fritzi misses Sophie just as much as her little four-legged friend does. Therefore, she decides to bring Sputnik to Sophie. But there is only one way to get there: over the strictly guarded border. A very dangerous adventure for a 12-year-old girl and a small dog...', 'September 1989 in the GDR. With the change of the general mood in the country, the life of 12-year-old FRITZI changes as well. Her best friend Sophie has fled with her mother through Hungary to West Germany and the only thing Fritzi has left is Sophie''s little dog Sputnik. But Fritzi misses Sophie just as much as her little four-legged friend does. Therefore, she decides to bring Sputnik to Sophie. But there is only one way to get there: over the strictly guarded border. A very dangerous adventure for a 12-year-old girl and a small dog...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lYwCqGjDvlohlN1WZzsgyov5KhF.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:586943'),
  ('357538778842112539', 'Frivolous Wife', 2008, 'Drama, Comedy, Science Fiction, Romance', 'Lim Won-gook', null, 'Park Jin-woo, Park Jung-ah, Lee Won-jong, Lee Il-hwa, Jang Min-ho, Yang Geum-seok, Kim Neul-me', null, 'Inspired by Shakespeare''s classic of the same name. Beautiful and rich, Yeon-su (Park Jung-a) lives a life of freedom and indulgence, having any man she wants. That is, until she meets and falls for her polar opposite in Jung-do, an awkward and polite young gentleman. Meeting her future in-laws is a baptism by fire as she learns to become a proper lady. Little does she know that the family is actually the head of a notorious mob, setting up a blood feud.', 'Inspired by Shakespeare''s classic of the same name. Beautiful and rich, Yeon-su (Park Jung-a) lives a life of freedom and indulgence, having any man she wants. That is, until she meets and falls for her polar opposite in Jung-do, an awkward and polite young gentleman. Meeting her future in-laws is a baptism by fire as she learns to become a proper lady. Little does she know that the family is actually the head of a notorious mob, setting up a blood feud.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gW6Cdcf7z8DOwJ09O4UOumQJEpq.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:57140'),
  ('67633501629681993', 'Frog Baseball', 1992, 'Animation, Comedy', 'Mike Judge', 'Mike Judge', 'Mike Judge', null, 'The animated short that introduced the world to Beavis and Butt-Head, the two dimwitted fifteen year-olds with the intelligence of dirt. "Frog Baseball" features the two distinguished numbskulls beating a helpless frog to death with a baseball bat.', 'The animated short that introduced the world to Beavis and Butt-Head, the two dimwitted fifteen year-olds with the intelligence of dirt. "Frog Baseball" features the two distinguished numbskulls beating a helpless frog to death with a baseball bat.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/abxsFf8UiQx8NN7R5JbIl4gva84.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:201300'),
  ('30323726760189095', 'Frog Dreaming', 1986, 'Drama, Adventure, Family', 'Brian Trenchard-Smith, John R. McLean, Russell Hagg', 'Everett De Roche', 'Henry Thomas, Tony Barry, Rachel Friend, Dennis Miller, Katy Manning, Tamsin West, Dempsey Knight, John Ewart', 'PG', 'American boy Cody lives in Australia with his guardian, Gaza. Cody is very imaginative, inventive and inquisitive. He comes accross some strange events happening in Devil''s Knob national park associated with an aboriginal myth about "frog dreamings". Cody tries to investigate...', 'American boy Cody lives in Australia with his guardian, Gaza. Cody is very imaginative, inventive and inquisitive. He comes accross some strange events happening in Devil''s Knob national park associated with an aboriginal myth about "frog dreamings". Cody tries to investigate...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7S0VFsQw0QDQ2QeEPLtSFxQZ76C.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:25666'),
  ('408157329036166714', 'Frog-g-g!', 2004, 'Comedy, Horror, Science Fiction', 'Cody Jarrett, David E. Diano', 'Cody Jarrett', 'Kristi Russell, Ariadne Shaffer, Robert Patrick Brink, Michael McConnohie, James Duval, Todd Malta, Mary Woronov, John Ponzio', null, 'Chemical waste seeps into a small town''s water supply, causing the birth of a mutant FROGGG which is instinctively driven to mate with its genetic match - human women. Sexy EPA super-agent Dr Barbara Michaels tracks the Froggg''s every move, fighting off corrupt good-ol''-boy politicians and drunken rednecks at every turn. No one in town believes her, or the evidence, until the shocking climax when the Froggg is finally brought to justice... or IS it...?', 'Chemical waste seeps into a small town''s water supply, causing the birth of a mutant FROGGG which is instinctively driven to mate with its genetic match - human women. Sexy EPA super-agent Dr Barbara Michaels tracks the Froggg''s every move, fighting off corrupt good-ol''-boy politicians and drunken rednecks at every turn. No one in town believes her, or the evidence, until the shocking climax when the Froggg is finally brought to justice... or IS it...?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9pc2mr7YPp1tW7pui9Tq3TW4Mpd.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:28738'),
  ('518360018789865357', 'Frogman', 2024, 'Horror', 'Anthony Cousins, Rebecca Daugherty, John Karsko', 'Anthony Cousins, John Karsko', 'Nathan Tymoshuk, Chelsey Grant, Benny Barrett, Toussaint Morrison, Ali Daniels, Chris Canfield, Brandon Santiago, Michael Paul Levin', 'NR', 'An amateur filmmaker, struggling to turn his passion into a career, returns with friends to Loveland, Ohio, the location of his first, notorious sighting of the Frogman, determined to obtain irrefutable proof that the cryptid legend exists.', 'An amateur filmmaker, struggling to turn his passion into a career, returns with friends to Loveland, Ohio, the location of his first, notorious sighting of the Frogman, determined to obtain irrefutable proof that the cryptid legend exists.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hgAHquo8Bt0ub0ru3QLiyrhGltW.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1139937'),
  ('374207572907630729', 'Frogs', 1972, 'Horror', 'George McCowan, Mario Tosi, Rusty Meek', 'Robert Blees, Robert Hutchison', 'Ray Milland, Sam Elliott, Joan Van Ark, Adam Roarke, Judy Pace, Lynn Borden, Mae Mercer, David Gilliam', 'PG', 'Jason Crockett is an aging, grumpy, physically disabled millionaire who invites his family to his island estate for his birthday celebration. Pickett Smith is a free-lance photographer who is doing a pollution layout for an ecology magazine. Jason Crockett hates nature, poisoning anything that crawls on his property. On the night of his birthday the frogs and other members of nature begin to pay Crockett back.', 'Jason Crockett is an aging, grumpy, physically disabled millionaire who invites his family to his island estate for his birthday celebration. Pickett Smith is a free-lance photographer who is doing a pollution layout for an ecology magazine. Jason Crockett hates nature, poisoning anything that crawls on his property. On the night of his birthday the frogs and other members of nature begin to pay Crockett back.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dF2OlQBMJiggzkjhfaNfx7HzBOU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:18274'),
  ('399409564886210298', 'Frogtown II', 1992, 'Action, Science Fiction', 'Donald G. Jackson, Donald G. Jackson', 'Donald G. Jackson', 'Robert Z''Dar, Denice Duff, Lou Ferrigno, Don Stroud, Charles Napier, Brion James, Linda Singer, Rhonda Shear', 'PG-13', 'In the sequel to Hell Comes to Frogtown, the Mutant-Frog leader of Frogtown kidnaps a professor and forces him to make a serum that will turn everyone into Frogs, they also kidnap some people to test the serum on. And courageous Sam Hell will have to save them.', 'In the sequel to Hell Comes to Frogtown, the Mutant-Frog leader of Frogtown kidnaps a professor and forces him to make a serum that will turn everyone into Frogs, they also kidnap some people to test the serum on. And courageous Sam Hell will have to save them.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ssqlLTYjLSG2UJAiFqI4kNt0mvM.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:96469'),
  ('146241337341581556', 'Frolicking Fish', 1930, 'Animation', 'Burt Gillett', null, null, 'NR', 'The title pretty much says it: fish and other marine life dance and frolic to various tunes. An octopus keeps spoiling the fun in various ways.', 'The title pretty much says it: fish and other marine life dance and frolic to various tunes. An octopus keeps spoiling the fun in various ways.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rnVzhajO0da4YuRs0LPUQ36iH1v.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:57639'),
  ('808386317758038511', 'From a Far Country', 1981, 'Drama, History', 'Krzysztof Zanussi, Sławomir Idziak', 'Andrzej Kijowski, Krzysztof Zanussi, Jan Józef Szczepański', 'Sam Neill, Christopher Cazenove, Lisa Harrow, John Welsh, Maurice Denham, Cezary Morawski, Daniel Olbrychski, Maja Komorowska', null, 'This heroic story follows the life of Karol Wojtyla, a Polish Roman catholic who ascends the throne of St. Peter as Pope John Paul II. As a young boy, Karol is a bright and talented student. Archbishop Sapieha recognizes the very special, moving qualities Karol possesses and encourages him to consider the priesthood. Although determined to study Polish literature, Karol turns to the church; he is ordained and studies in Italy, France, and Belgium. Torn by fear and repression in post-Stalin Eastern Europe, Karol becomes a poisonous thorn in the communists'' side. His deer reverence and commitment return him to Poland as Pope John Paul II.', 'This heroic story follows the life of Karol Wojtyla, a Polish Roman catholic who ascends the throne of St. Peter as Pope John Paul II. As a young boy, Karol is a bright and talented student. Archbishop Sapieha recognizes the very special, moving qualities Karol possesses and encourages him to consider the priesthood. Although determined to study Polish literature, Karol turns to the church; he is ordained and studies in Italy, France, and Belgium. Torn by fear and repression in post-Stalin Eastern Europe, Karol becomes a poisonous thorn in the communists'' side. His deer reverence and commitment return him to Poland as Pope John Paul II.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8LIjjJ7OjNnZRNrE4FLdA8DnsgX.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:132585'),
  ('996952335183188041', 'From a House on Willow Street', 2017, 'Horror', 'Alastair Orr, Ariye Mahdeb, Brendan Barnes', 'Jonathan Jordaan, Catherine Blackman, Alastair Orr', 'Sharni Vinson, Carlyn Burchell, Steven John Ward, Zino Ventura, Nicole De Klerk, Dimitri Bajlanis, Gustav Gerdener, Zelmia Bezuidenhout', null, 'After a young woman is kidnapped, her captors soon come to realize that in fact they may be the ones in danger and this young woman has a dark secret inside her.', 'After a young woman is kidnapped, her captors soon come to realize that in fact they may be the ones in danger and this young woman has a dark secret inside her.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pCDpEXkeurIUXEDR3cs97I4tFDH.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:404584'),
  ('1052549356024065646', 'From a Night Porter''s Point of View', 1979, 'Documentary', 'Krzysztof Kieślowski, Krzysztof Wierzbicki, Witold Stok', null, 'Marian Osuch', null, 'At the time of the Polish social regime, a security officer is promoted to work at a prison yard. Introducing concurrently with the narrator; he speaks of himself, his thoughts, his point of view.', 'At the time of the Polish social regime, a security officer is promoted to work at a prison yard. Introducing concurrently with the narrator; he speaks of himself, his thoughts, his point of view.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/reFHXC1Qdb8XeXb9DQM53uzakKF.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:179851'),
  ('196655639879835005', 'From a Roman Balcony', 1960, 'Drama, Romance', 'Mauro Bolognini, Luigi Bazzoni, Guy Séligmann', 'Pier Paolo Pasolini, Alberto Moravia, Marco Visconti', 'Lea Massari, Jean Sorel, Jeanne Valérie, Rik Battaglia, Valeria Ciangottini, Marcella Valeri, Irene Aloisi, Elvi Lissiak', null, 'The ironic study of a young man''s poignant adventures and sensual adventures...based on "Roman Tales" by Alberto Moravia.', 'The ironic study of a young man''s poignant adventures and sensual adventures...based on "Roman Tales" by Alberto Moravia.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fof5wh8k8hDdGNfzpfGsMcVpTZC.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:255401'),
  ('1060016539777430086', 'From A to Z-Z-Z-Z', 1954, 'Animation, Comedy', 'Chuck Jones', null, 'Dick Beals, Marian Richman, Norman Nesbitt, Mel Blanc', 'NR', 'Ralph is a daydreamer... and he is quick to adapt his current surroundings into new, adventurous dreams.', 'Ralph is a daydreamer... and he is quick to adapt his current surroundings into new, adventurous dreams.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yu7l8T8VmOsc0vrgVN3QUBy6zI4.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:83775'),
  ('372530301741531567', 'From a Whisper to a Scream', 1987, 'Horror', 'Jeff Burr, W.O. Garrett, Craig Greene', 'C. Courtney Joyner, Jeff Burr, Darin Scott', 'Vincent Price, Clu Gulager, Terry Kiser, Harry Caesar, Rosalind Cash, Cameron Mitchell, Susan Tyrrell, Martine Beswick', 'R', 'The uncle of an executed murderess relates four stories of his hometown, Oldfield, to a reporter. In the first, an elderly man pursues a romance with a younger woman, even to the grave and beyond. In the second, a wounded man on the run from creditors is rescued by a backwoods hermit who holds the secret to eternal life. In the third, a glass-eating carny pays the ultimate price for looking for love on the outside. And in the fourth, a group of Civil War soldiers are held captive by a household of orphans with strange intentions for them.', 'The uncle of an executed murderess relates four stories of his hometown, Oldfield, to a reporter. In the first, an elderly man pursues a romance with a younger woman, even to the grave and beyond. In the second, a wounded man on the run from creditors is rescued by a backwoods hermit who holds the secret to eternal life. In the third, a glass-eating carny pays the ultimate price for looking for love on the outside. And in the fourth, a group of Civil War soldiers are held captive by a household of orphans with strange intentions for them.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/h2UzUndAmuqJsluhCK7vZuVjyhu.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:39895'),
  ('994051921002974393', 'From Afar', 2015, 'Drama', 'Lorenzo Vigas, Sergio Armstrong, Alcione Guerrero', 'Lorenzo Vigas, Guillermo Arriaga', 'Alfredo Castro, Luis Silva, Jericó Montilla, Catherina Cardozo, Marcos Moreno, Jorge Luis Bosque, Felipe Massiani, Auffer Camacho', null, 'Armando, a 50 year man, seeks young men in Caracas and pays them just for company. One day he meets Elder, a 17 years boy that is the leader of a criminal gang, and that meeting changes their lives forever.', 'Armando, a 50 year man, seeks young men in Caracas and pays them just for company. One day he meets Elder, a 17 years boy that is the leader of a criminal gang, and that meeting changes their lives forever.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iAJDa3lBKCB5YBE9QiXEFSnXNZl.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:352162'),
  ('437167111817894830', 'From All of Us, To All of You', 1958, 'Animation, Comedy, Family, TV Movie', 'Jack Hannah', 'David Detiege, Al Bertino', 'Cliff Edwards, Walt Disney', null, 'Hosted by Jiminy Cricket along with Mickey Mouse and Tinker Bell, this special combines newly produced animation with clips from vintage animated Disney shorts and feature films, presented to the viewer as Christmas cards from the various characters starring in each one.', 'Hosted by Jiminy Cricket along with Mickey Mouse and Tinker Bell, this special combines newly produced animation with clips from vintage animated Disney shorts and feature films, presented to the viewer as Christmas cards from the various characters starring in each one.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/664zGUmaPp8vskmfh3XZvDIG4IO.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:150067'),
  ('233897037377777149', 'From Beginning to End', 2009, 'Romance, Drama', 'Aluizio Abranches, Ueli Steiger, Bianca Cury', 'Aluizio Abranches', 'Rafael Cardoso, João Gabriel Vasconcellos, Júlia Lemmertz, Fábio Assunção, Jean Pierre Noher, Louise Cardoso, Lucas Cotrim, Gabriel Kaufmann', null, 'Two brothers develop a very close relationship as they are growing up in an idyllic and happy family. When they are young adults their relationship becomes very intimate, romantic, and sexual.', 'Two brothers develop a very close relationship as they are growing up in an idyllic and happy family. When they are young adults their relationship becomes very intimate, romantic, and sexual.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/onweiIAA6n7FqL4ryVnDsTIdSPn.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:44125'),
  ('389587113047761879', 'From Behind', 1999, 'Comedy', 'Valérie Lemercier', null, 'Valérie Lemercier, Claude Rich, Dieudonné, Marthe Keller, Patrick Catalifo, Amira Casar, Didier Bénureau, Alain Doutey', null, 'Frédérique''s mother has died recently leaving her the family stud farm. She''s never met her father, doesn''t even know his name. But she finds it on the back of an old photo. She sets off for Paris. She stays with her gay dancer pal Marc. Marc and friends decide to go to their favourite gay bar... but it''s men only. So Frédérique becomes Frédéric, an effeminate gay boy... Frédérique follows her father. Pierre Arroux is an art curator - and gay. She introduces herself to him, but as Frédéric. So while Frédéric is quite an awkward young man and an embarrassment to his father, Frédérique is secretly meeting with her old boyfriend now living in Paris..', 'Frédérique''s mother has died recently leaving her the family stud farm. She''s never met her father, doesn''t even know his name. But she finds it on the back of an old photo. She sets off for Paris. She stays with her gay dancer pal Marc. Marc and friends decide to go to their favourite gay bar... but it''s men only. So Frédérique becomes Frédéric, an effeminate gay boy... Frédérique follows her father. Pierre Arroux is an art curator - and gay. She introduces herself to him, but as Frédéric. So while Frédéric is quite an awkward young man and an embarrassment to his father, Frédérique is secretly meeting with her old boyfriend now living in Paris..', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/o2ylXCSZTRhYtZsavWp9z8oc9hV.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:69728'),
  ('833198815559084660', 'From Beijing with Love', 1994, 'Action, Comedy', 'Stephen Chow, Lee Lik-Chi, Garry Chan Chi-Shing', 'Stephen Chow, Vincent Kok Tak-Chiu, Lee Lik-Chi', 'Stephen Chow, Anita Yuen Wing-Yee, Law Kar-Ying, Pauline Chan Bo-Lin, Joe Cheng Cho, Wong Kam-Kong, Wong Yat-Fei, Lee Lik-Chi', null, 'A Chinese secret agent travels to Hong Kong to reclaim a dinosaur fossil but experiences hilarious incidents because of his incompetence.', 'A Chinese secret agent travels to Hong Kong to reclaim a dinosaur fossil but experiences hilarious incidents because of his incompetence.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dzSiN45k9bEiDu2KrxZIt3oNIrp.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:41387'),
  ('795891948724735487', 'From Beyond', 1986, 'Horror, Science Fiction', 'Stuart Gordon, Mac Ahlberg, Luca Lachin', 'Dennis Paoli', 'Jeffrey Combs, Barbara Crampton, Ken Foree, Ted Sorel, Carolyn Purdy-Gordon, Bunny Summers, Bruce McGuire, Del Russel', 'R', 'The Resonator, a powerful machine that can control the sixth sense, has killed its creator and sent his associate into an insane asylum. When a psychiatrist becomes determined to continue the experiment, she unwittingly opens the door to a hostile parallel universe.', 'The Resonator, a powerful machine that can control the sixth sense, has killed its creator and sent his associate into an insane asylum. When a psychiatrist becomes determined to continue the experiment, she unwittingly opens the door to a hostile parallel universe.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zwmyxaKzIRLD4iUqZAQW940omdm.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:14510'),
  ('437642020751581847', 'From Beyond the Grave', 1974, 'Fantasy, Horror, Drama', 'Kevin Connor, Alan Hume, Graham Easton', 'Raymond Christodoulou, Robin Clarke', 'Peter Cushing, David Warner, Donald Pleasence, Ian Ogilvy, Ian Carmichael, Lesley-Anne Down, Ian Bannen, Diana Dors', 'PG', 'Four customers purchase, or take, items from Temptations Limited, an antiques shop whose motto is “Offers You Cannot Resist.” A nasty fate awaits all of them; particularly those who cheat the shop''s Proprietor.', 'Four customers purchase, or take, items from Temptations Limited, an antiques shop whose motto is “Offers You Cannot Resist.” A nasty fate awaits all of them; particularly those who cheat the shop''s Proprietor.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8oePNgUwrVGXwykTGxC9vk7dvPX.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:48014'),
  ('393965103935563491', 'From Black', 2023, 'Horror', 'Thomas Marchese, Duncan Cole', 'Thomas Marchese, Jessup Flower', 'Anna Camp, John Ales, Jennifer Lafleur, Travis Hammer, Eduardo Campirano III, Ritchie Montgomery, Kenneth Ford, Alicia S Mason', null, 'A young mother who''s crushed by guilt and shame after the disappearance of her young son five years previously, is offered a bizarre opportunity to learn the truth and set things right. Is she willing to pay the terrifying price for a chance to hold her boy again?', 'A young mother who''s crushed by guilt and shame after the disappearance of her young son five years previously, is offered a bizarre opportunity to learn the truth and set things right. Is she willing to pay the terrifying price for a chance to hold her boy again?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9DG2g1Gl1ENAxFONIxxb5FMH99f.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:943788'),
  ('1052565306722940272', 'From Caligari to Hitler', 2015, 'Documentary, History', 'Harald Schmuck, Frank Reimann, Rüdiger Suchsland', 'Rüdiger Suchsland', 'Rüdiger Suchsland, Hans Henrik Wöhler, Volker Schlöndorff, Fatih Akin, Thomas Elsaesser, Eric D. Weitz, Elisabeth Bronfen, Fritz Lang', null, 'Film journalist and critic Rüdiger Suchsland examines German cinema from 1919, when the Republic of Weimar is born, to 1933, when the Nazis come into power. (Followed by Hitler''s Hollywood, 2017.)', 'Film journalist and critic Rüdiger Suchsland examines German cinema from 1919, when the Republic of Weimar is born, to 1933, when the Nazis come into power. (Followed by Hitler''s Hollywood, 2017.)', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xLPnb6pLpfHHpuAkXiHAGtk65Kx.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:304878'),
  ('686585207951318435', 'From Corleone to Brooklyn', 1979, 'Crime', 'Umberto Lenzi, Stefano Rolla, Guglielmo Mancori', 'Vincenzo Mannino, Umberto Lenzi', 'Maurizio Merli, Mario Merola, Van Johnson, Biagio Pelligra, Nando Marineo, Salvatore Billa, Sonia Viviani, Laura Belli', null, 'Maurizio Merli takes up a familiar role as Commissioner Berni; a cop who puts his life on the line to transport a witness from Corleone to New York City in order to testify against a mob boss on trial for murder. Along the way, Berni and his prisoner face a series of traps set up by the Mafia.', 'Maurizio Merli takes up a familiar role as Commissioner Berni; a cop who puts his life on the line to transport a witness from Corleone to New York City in order to testify against a mob boss on trial for murder. Along the way, Berni and his prisoner face a series of traps set up by the Mafia.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hWSJHtenGkSfalBpuH332TNTZ3N.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:105837'),
  ('235284002233692619', 'From Cradle to Grave', 2019, 'Thriller, Drama, Crime, TV Movie', 'Adeline Darraux', 'Elsa Marpeau', 'Julie de Bona, Caroline Anglade, Arnaud Binard, Sophie Broustal, André Marcon, Régis Maynard, Pierick Tournier, Marion Christmann', null, 'Juliette is attending the baptism of Lucas, the son of her best friend Claire. But the young mother, weakened by her childbirth, shows disturbing signs of depression.', 'Juliette is attending the baptism of Lucas, the son of her best friend Claire. But the young mother, weakened by her childbirth, shows disturbing signs of depression.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tybXgBp5neCFSYEPUCmFTzyRVPl.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:584921'),
  ('677077578154879569', 'From Darkness', 2024, 'Horror, Mystery, Thriller', 'Philip W. da Silva', 'Jimmy Nivrén Olsson', 'Rakel Benér, Oscar Skagerberg, Peter Mörlin, Thomas Hedengran, Amanda Kilpeläinen Arvidsson, Lennart B. Sandelin, Lars Adsten', null, 'Park ranger Angelica seeks the help of her dog handler ex-boyfriend, Viktor, to search for a missing woman in a dangerous nature reserve in Sweden. The search is complicated by a disturbing myth about the Cave Banshee, a vengeful spirit from the Nordic folklore that once lured miners to their deaths in the reserve''s treacherous caves. As they delve deeper into the forest, Viktor starts to question his own sanity and whether the rumored Banshee is more than just a myth. To make matters worse, Angelica and Viktor share a painful history with the haunted place. Viktor must now confront his troubled past and work together with Angelica to survive the night and unravel the mystery behind the woman''s disappearance.', 'Park ranger Angelica seeks the help of her dog handler ex-boyfriend, Viktor, to search for a missing woman in a dangerous nature reserve in Sweden. The search is complicated by a disturbing myth about the Cave Banshee, a vengeful spirit from the Nordic folklore that once lured miners to their deaths in the reserve''s treacherous caves. As they delve deeper into the forest, Viktor starts to question his own sanity and whether the rumored Banshee is more than just a myth. To make matters worse, Angelica and Viktor share a painful history with the haunted place. Viktor must now confront his troubled past and work together with Angelica to survive the night and unravel the mystery behind the woman''s disappearance.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/d49XZvGv6PucJNnbUjJegKkX1TM.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1202863'),
  ('986467619379717658', 'From Dusk Till Dawn', 1996, 'Horror, Action, Thriller, Crime', 'Guillermo Navarro, Robert Rodriguez, Adam Lustig', 'Quentin Tarantino', 'George Clooney, Quentin Tarantino, Harvey Keitel, Juliette Lewis, Ernest Liu, Salma Hayek Pinault, Cheech Marin, Danny Trejo', 'R', 'After kidnapping a father and his two kids, the Gecko brothers head south to a seedy Mexican bar to hide out in safety, unaware of its notorious vampire clientele.', 'After kidnapping a father and his two kids, the Gecko brothers head south to a seedy Mexican bar to hide out in safety, unaware of its notorious vampire clientele.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sV3kIAmvJ9tPz4Lq5fuf9LLMxte.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:755'),
  ('543809893160749560', 'From Dusk Till Dawn 2: Texas Blood Money', 1999, 'Crime, Action, Horror, Thriller', 'Scott Spiegel, Philip Lee, Marcia Shulman', 'Scott Spiegel, Duane Whitaker', 'Robert Patrick, Bo Hopkins, Duane Whitaker, Muse Watson, Brett Harrelson, Raymond Cruz, Tiffani-Amber Thiessen, Danny Trejo', 'R', 'A bank-robbing gang of misfits heads to Mexico with the blueprints for the perfect million-dollar heist, but when one of the crooks wanders into the wrong bar, the thieving cohorts develop a thirst for blood.', 'A bank-robbing gang of misfits heads to Mexico with the blueprints for the perfect million-dollar heist, but when one of the crooks wanders into the wrong bar, the thieving cohorts develop a thirst for blood.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wX129q3nFVTQVaJSHqFnTVfoIG9.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:12095'),
  ('598208609562366823', 'From Dusk Till Dawn 3: The Hangman''s Daughter', 2000, 'Western, Horror, Thriller', 'Michael Bonvillain, P.J. Pesce, Marcia Shulman', 'Álvaro Rodríguez', 'Marco Leonardi, Michael Parks, Rebecca Gayheart, Ara Celi, Lennie Loftin, Orlando Jones, Danny Trejo, Jordana Spiro', 'R', 'Narrowly escaping death, outlaw Johnny Madrid goes on the run with the hangman''s sensuous daughter Esmeralda by his side.', 'Narrowly escaping death, outlaw Johnny Madrid goes on the run with the hangman''s sensuous daughter Esmeralda by his side.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/io5lQ7VRJGBCg2kTJ6BRWRclqJE.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:10213'),
  ('130029040106832041', 'From Good to the Hood', 2024, 'Comedy', 'Mar Olid, Sergi Gallardo, Maruca Carmona', 'Khaled Amara, Mohamed Hamidi, Michaël Souhaité', 'Quim Gutiérrez, Sara Sálamo, María de Nati, Javier Herrera, Hamza Zaidi, Jorge Suquet, Yaël Belicha, Elena Ballesteros', null, 'Cheating the tax man was just too tempting for Andrés. Besides, what are the chances of him getting caught? Well, as it turns out, pretty high! And that’s exactly what happens when a couple of tax inspectors turn up at his company to inform him that he owes the IRS a lot of money.', 'Cheating the tax man was just too tempting for Andrés. Besides, what are the chances of him getting caught? Well, as it turns out, pretty high! And that’s exactly what happens when a couple of tax inspectors turn up at his company to inform him that he owes the IRS a lot of money.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/n9UejLgJi5HzRyEXEH7l5CUNKm4.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1151506'),
  ('994901417086027594', 'From Hare to Eternity', 1997, 'Animation, Comedy, Family, Music', 'Chuck Jones', null, 'Greg Burson, Frank Gorshin', 'NR', 'Yosemite Sam the pirate finds a treasure chest which belongs to Bugs Bunny. Bugs is determined to get it back, and boards Sam''s ship to battle wits with Pirate Sam.', 'Yosemite Sam the pirate finds a treasure chest which belongs to Bugs Bunny. Bugs is determined to get it back, and boards Sam''s ship to battle wits with Pirate Sam.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zzkOh8IThqXSGyaEbuliymqF8Hi.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:83787'),
  ('1108734533377475495', 'From Hare to Heir', 1960, 'Animation, Comedy', 'Friz Freleng', null, 'Mel Blanc', 'NR', 'Sam, the Duke of Yosemite, will inherit one million pounds if he can keep his temper in check. Thing is, he has to endure Bugs Bunny as his house guest.', 'Sam, the Duke of Yosemite, will inherit one million pounds if he can keep his temper in check. Thing is, he has to endure Bugs Bunny as his house guest.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2khc96eHzMkwb9NU3zxyiZcIsVC.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:234748'),
  ('223199354887353403', 'From Hell', 2001, 'Horror, Mystery, Thriller', 'Albert Hughes, Peter Deming, Allen Hughes', 'Terry Hayes, Rafael Yglesias', 'Johnny Depp, Heather Graham, Ian Holm, Robbie Coltrane, Ian Richardson, Jason Flemyng, Katrin Cartlidge, Terence Harvey', 'R', 'Frederick Abberline is an opium-huffing inspector from Scotland Yard who falls for one of Jack the Ripper''s prostitute targets in this Hughes brothers adaption of a graphic novel that posits the Ripper''s true identity.', 'Frederick Abberline is an opium-huffing inspector from Scotland Yard who falls for one of Jack the Ripper''s prostitute targets in this Hughes brothers adaption of a graphic novel that posits the Ripper''s true identity.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/t2WpWM8nBO4sULXr2bDfNEt4qgr.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:768'),
  ('664491834445124374', 'From Hell It Came', 1957, 'Horror', 'Brydon Baker, Dan Milner', 'Richard Bernstein', 'Tod Andrews, Tina Carver, Linda Watkins, John McNamara, Gregg Palmer, Baynes Barron, Robert Swan, Suzanne Ridgway', null, 'A wrongfully accused South Seas prince is executed and returns as a walking tree stump.', 'A wrongfully accused South Seas prince is executed and returns as a walking tree stump.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/isyq2W5onzIUmeGuC5tjVVeArcB.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:84058'),
  ('804198017580836718', 'From Hell to Texas', 1958, 'Western', 'Henry Hathaway, Stanley Hough, Wilfrid M. Cline', 'Robert Buckner, Wendell Mayes', 'Don Murray, Diane Varsi, Chill Wills, Dennis Hopper, R.G. Armstrong, Jay C. Flippen, Margo, John Larch', 'NR', 'The naive cowboy Tod Lohman accidentally kills the son of the powerful land baron Hunter Boyd. Tod runs for his life, pursued by the dead man''s vengeful brothers. Tod shelters on the ranch of Amos Bradley and he falls in love with his daughter Juanita. However, Tod is concerned that he''ll eventually have to leave when his pursuers catch up with him.', 'The naive cowboy Tod Lohman accidentally kills the son of the powerful land baron Hunter Boyd. Tod runs for his life, pursued by the dead man''s vengeful brothers. Tod shelters on the ranch of Amos Bradley and he falls in love with his daughter Juanita. However, Tod is concerned that he''ll eventually have to leave when his pursuers catch up with him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/a45c3PNBguRqtU8PMXoqfZrx5ED.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:57664'),
  ('210814791941306228', 'From Here to Eternity', 1953, 'War, Romance, Drama', 'Fred Zinnemann, Burnett Guffey, Jim Hogan', 'Daniel Taradash', 'Burt Lancaster, Montgomery Clift, Deborah Kerr, Donna Reed, Frank Sinatra, Philip Ober, Mickey Shaughnessy, Harry Bellaver', 'NR', 'In 1941 Hawaii, a private is cruelly punished for not boxing on his unit''s team, while his captain''s wife and second in command are falling in love.', 'In 1941 Hawaii, a private is cruelly punished for not boxing on his unit''s team, while his captain''s wife and second in command are falling in love.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xO1LHnh9aQlQFFq1DxyQrOTia1S.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:11426'),
  ('274082251248385023', 'From Hilde, with Love', 2024, 'War, Drama, History', 'Karen Wendland, Claudia Beewen, Emil Klattenhoff', 'Laila Stieler', 'Liv Lisa Fries, Johannes Hegemann, Sina Martens, Lisa Wagner, Alexander Scheer, Emma Bading, Lisa Hrdina, Lena Urzendowsky', null, 'In Berlin 1942, Hilde is a member of an anti-Nazi group. She falls in love with another member, Hans. The two spend a summer together until they get caught by the Gestapo and Hilde is imprisoned, eight months pregnant.', 'In Berlin 1942, Hilde is a member of an anti-Nazi group. She falls in love with another member, Hans. The two spend a summer together until they get caught by the Gestapo and Hilde is imprisoned, eight months pregnant.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hJ8y5VsbjbzDCoXJ6LDwn8JcFkP.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1070319'),
  ('761303764307025276', 'From Hong Kong with Love', 1975, 'Comedy, Family', 'Yvan Chiffre, Walter Wottitz', 'Christian Fechner, Yvan Chiffre', 'Jean Sarrus, Jean-Guy Fechner, Gérard Rinaldi, Gérard Filipelli, Mickey Rooney, Clifton James, David Tomlinson, Polly Shang-Kuan Ling-Feng', null, 'Bons baisers de Hong Kong (From Hong Kong with Love) is a 1975 French film directed by Yvan Chiffre. It is a parody of James Bond movies featuring Les Charlots with scenes shot in Hong Kong. Mickey Rooney featured in the film as well as Bernard Lee and Lois Maxwell, stars of the James Bond films who appeared as M and Moneypenny respectively.', 'Bons baisers de Hong Kong (From Hong Kong with Love) is a 1975 French film directed by Yvan Chiffre. It is a parody of James Bond movies featuring Les Charlots with scenes shot in Hong Kong. Mickey Rooney featured in the film as well as Bernard Lee and Lois Maxwell, stars of the James Bond films who appeared as M and Moneypenny respectively.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jBFrn1RZCte7GS3QMdjUQPwz0Vm.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:56501'),
  ('320544119493352890', 'From Italy with Amore', 2022, 'TV Movie, Comedy, Romance', 'Eric B. Spoeth, Hijab Choudhary, J.D. Schroder', 'Katy Breier, Erica Deutschman', 'Rebecca Dalton, Marcus Rosner, Michael Lazarovitch, Kara Duncan, Dawn Ford, Stafford Perry, Brendan Morgan, Jenny Steele', null, 'When health and wellness journalist, Ariel Moss catches a glimpse of what she thinks is her dream man at a local eatery, she will stop at nothing to get to know him better. In her quest to see him again, she meets handsome restaurateur, Daniel, who helps her realize that maybe the way to her heart is through her stomach.', 'When health and wellness journalist, Ariel Moss catches a glimpse of what she thinks is her dream man at a local eatery, she will stop at nothing to get to know him better. In her quest to see him again, she meets handsome restaurateur, Daniel, who helps her realize that maybe the way to her heart is through her stomach.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pjpapEg0xOHDYEwhC6h4LsBrFdm.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:971190'),
  ('647213545186397493', 'From Justin to Kelly', 2003, 'Comedy, Romance, Music', 'Robert Iscove, Francis Kenny', 'Kim Fuller', 'Kelly Clarkson, Justin Guarini, Brandon Henschel, Gregory Siff, Brian Dietzen, Jason Yribar, Justin Gorence, Christopher Bryan', 'PG', 'A waitress from Texas and a college student from Pennsylvania meet during spring break in Fort Lauderdale, Florida and come together through their shared love of singing.', 'A waitress from Texas and a college student from Pennsylvania meet during spring break in Fort Lauderdale, Florida and come together through their shared love of singing.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bLLlgQ6nZPGxvAjp0qjTX1wD2hl.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:31246'),
  ('465783160756383918', 'From Karkhe to Rhein', 1993, 'Drama, War', 'Ebrahim Hatamikia', 'Ebrahim Hatamikia', 'Ali Dehkordi, Homa Rousta, Hans Noiman, Sadegh Safaei, Asghar Naghizade', null, 'Young veteran Saeed, who is suffering from visual problems due to injuries sustained during the Iran-Iraq War, is sent to Germany for treatment and recuperation. Once there, he is reunited with his sister Leyla, who is now married to a German citizen. The siblings struggle to reconnect in a foreign land, while Saeed prepares himself for surgery that could change his life. A tragic exploration of the horrific repercussions of war.', 'Young veteran Saeed, who is suffering from visual problems due to injuries sustained during the Iran-Iraq War, is sent to Germany for treatment and recuperation. Once there, he is reunited with his sister Leyla, who is now married to a German citizen. The siblings struggle to reconnect in a foreign land, while Saeed prepares himself for surgery that could change his life. A tragic exploration of the horrific repercussions of war.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6slhaA6gJaIXC9BXqnSVakT5RGM.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:328063'),
  ('109697496846480853', 'From Mayerling to Sarajevo', 1940, 'Romance, History, Drama', 'Max Ophüls, Jean-Paul Le Chanois, Jean Faurez', 'Carl Zuckmayer, Marcelle Maurette', 'Edwige Feuillère, John Lodge, Aimé Clariond, Jean Worms, Jean Debucourt, Raymond Aimos, Gabrielle Dorziat, Henri Bosc', null, 'Franz Ferdinand, heir to the throne of Austria-Hungary, is kept absent from the royal court due to his dangerous political ideas. Sent on a tour of inspections and inaugurations, he falls in love with Countess Sophie Chotek.', 'Franz Ferdinand, heir to the throne of Austria-Hungary, is kept absent from the royal court due to his dangerous political ideas. Sent on a tour of inspections and inaugurations, he falls in love with Countess Sophie Chotek.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1XHKxbnH5A04i6TXNFtOiwGVqvj.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:251305'),
  ('75353859906897155', 'From Me to You', 2010, 'Romance, Drama', 'Naoto Kumazawa, Masayuki Fujii', 'Rika Nezu, Naoto Kumazawa', 'Mikako Tabe, Haruma Miura, Misako Renbutsu, Mirei Kiritani, Natsuna Watanabe, Haru Aoyama, Yuta Kanai, Narumi Konno', null, 'Sawako Kuronuma looks miserable on the outside, but is actually a positive-minded girl, who looks up to Shota Kazehaya, a sociable and friendly boy. Perceiving Sawako''s good intentions, he secretly has feelings for her. Sawako meets Kazehaya and makes her first friends, Chizuru and Ayane but in comes Kurumi proclaiming her love for him... Will Sawako and Kazehaya ever find out about each other''s feelings?', 'Sawako Kuronuma looks miserable on the outside, but is actually a positive-minded girl, who looks up to Shota Kazehaya, a sociable and friendly boy. Perceiving Sawako''s good intentions, he secretly has feelings for her. Sawako meets Kazehaya and makes her first friends, Chizuru and Ayane but in comes Kurumi proclaiming her love for him... Will Sawako and Kazehaya ever find out about each other''s feelings?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ttyBsRKi5yJdSoepIPciDmqwYXn.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:59944'),
  ('635093501877271176', 'From Miyamoto to You', 2019, 'Romance, Drama', 'Tetsuya Mariko, Hidetoshi Shinomiya, Takahide Sano', 'Tetsuya Mariko, Takehiko Minato', 'Sosuke Ikematsu, Yu Aoi, Arata Iura, Wataru Ichinose, Jiro Sato, Kenichi Matsuyama, Tokio Emoto, Hidetoshi Hoshida', null, 'Following the comic series and the subsequent television serial of the same name, and featuring the same cast, a young and relatively inexperienced man comes across a woman during his working day and sparks fly.', 'Following the comic series and the subsequent television serial of the same name, and featuring the same cast, a young and relatively inexperienced man comes across a woman during his working day and sparks fly.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jvsLajVFJWr4Hp5LZnP8UM2cOOc.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:632565'),
  ('254829303553096123', 'From Morning to Midnight', 1920, 'Crime, Comedy', 'Karlheinz Martin, Carl Hoffmann', 'Karlheinz Martin, Georg Kaiser, Herbert Juttke', 'Ernst Deutsch, Erna Morena, Hans Heinrich von Twardowski, Roma Bahn, Adolf E. Licho, Frida Richard, Eberhard Wrede, Hugo Döblin', null, 'A cashier in a bank in a small German town is alerted to the power of money by the visit of a rich Italian lady. He embezzles 60,000 Marks and leaves for the capital city, where he attempts to find satisfaction in politics, sport, love and religion.', 'A cashier in a bank in a small German town is alerted to the power of money by the visit of a rich Italian lady. He embezzles 60,000 Marks and leaves for the capital city, where he attempts to find satisfaction in politics, sport, love and religion.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/phrxYtv83YAgN2G2QKUKHOAZ37w.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:175503'),
  ('1092041859165993668', 'From Mr. Gunnar Papphammar', 1981, 'Comedy', 'Gösta Ekman, Rune Ericson', 'Gösta Ekman', 'Gösta Ekman, Mats Arehn, Pia Ekman, Edith Aspegren', null, 'The clumsy Gunnar Papphammar, with his gray coat and funny hat, stumbles from one disaster to the next.', 'The clumsy Gunnar Papphammar, with his gray coat and funny hat, stumbles from one disaster to the next.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bNvD0Q4pJMFSOWdrGEl98syMc9F.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:167876'),
  ('654962039266769690', 'From Noon Till Three', 1976, 'Comedy, Western', 'Frank D. Gilroy, Lucien Ballard, Russell Saunders', 'Frank D. Gilroy', 'Charles Bronson, Jill Ireland, Douglas Fowley, Stan Haze, Damon Douglas, Hector Morales, Bert Williams, Davis Roberts', 'PG', 'Bank robber Graham Dorsey spends a few hours with beautiful widow Amanda Starbuck, in which time his gang takes part in a disastrous holdup. Learning of his comrades'' demise, Dorsey goes on the lam. Believing her short-term lover was killed by the law, Amanda decides to make the most of having had a liaison with the supposedly deceased desperado by writing a book about him. Much to his confusion, the still-living Dorsey watches as his name becomes legendary.', 'Bank robber Graham Dorsey spends a few hours with beautiful widow Amanda Starbuck, in which time his gang takes part in a disastrous holdup. Learning of his comrades'' demise, Dorsey goes on the lam. Believing her short-term lover was killed by the law, Amanda decides to make the most of having had a liaison with the supposedly deceased desperado by writing a book about him. Much to his confusion, the still-living Dorsey watches as his name becomes legendary.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9n0F4swweH369HTI0etLc6fAuyi.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:6476'),
  ('674461390764612633', 'From Nurse to Worse', 1940, 'Comedy', 'Jules White', 'Clyde Bruckman', 'Moe Howard, Larry Fine, Curly Howard, Dorothy Appleby, Poppy Wilde, Vernon Dent, Charles Dorety, Ned Glass', 'NR', 'The stooge''s friend Jerry convinces them to take out on insurance on Curly and then have him act insane to collect. Moe and Larry put Curly on a leash and take him to the insurance doctor and have him act like a dog. Unfortunately, the insurance doctor wants to perform a brain operation (Cerebrum decapitation). The boys try to escape by hiding in the dog catchers wagon, but are caught and taken to the hospital. They escape again, this time by rigging a sheet to a gurney and sailing down the street, where they run into Jerry and knock him into wet cement.', 'The stooge''s friend Jerry convinces them to take out on insurance on Curly and then have him act insane to collect. Moe and Larry put Curly on a leash and take him to the insurance doctor and have him act like a dog. Unfortunately, the insurance doctor wants to perform a brain operation (Cerebrum decapitation). The boys try to escape by hiding in the dog catchers wagon, but are caught and taken to the hospital. They escape again, this time by rigging a sheet to a gurney and sailing down the street, where they run into Jerry and knock him into wet cement.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1gahp4ouB6m4IGBxp8e5d1WNaYH.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:115795'),
  ('265295369151325182', 'From Paris with Love', 2010, 'Action, Crime, Thriller', 'Pierre Morel, Michel Abramowicz', 'Adi Hasak', 'John Travolta, Jonathan Rhys Meyers, Kasia Smutniak, Richard Durden, Bing Yin, Amber Rose Revah, Éric Godon, François Bredon', 'R', 'James Reese has a good job as an ambassador''s aid in France, but his real passion is a side gig—working in a minor role in the CIA. He would love to be a full-fledged agent and can''t believe his luck when he lands an assignment with Charlie Wax. Trigger-happy Charlie soon has James crying for his desk job, but when he learns that the same guys they''re trying to catch are after him, James realises that Charlie may be his only hope of survival.', 'James Reese has a good job as an ambassador''s aid in France, but his real passion is a side gig—working in a minor role in the CIA. He would love to be a full-fledged agent and can''t believe his luck when he lands an assignment with Charlie Wax. Trigger-happy Charlie soon has James crying for his desk job, but when he learns that the same guys they''re trying to catch are after him, James realises that Charlie may be his only hope of survival.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2nD0RAWVOccomLp1iToVJn6KC2a.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:26389'),
  ('52513748607564613', 'From Prada to Nada', 2011, 'Comedy, Drama, Romance', 'Angel Gracia, Héctor Ortega', 'Fina Torres, Craig Fernandez, Luis Alfaro', 'Camilla Belle, Alexa PenaVega, April Bowlby, Wilmer Valderrama, Nicholas D''Agosto, Adriana Barraza, Norma Reyna, Karla Souza', 'PG-13', 'Two spoiled Beverly Hills sisters who have been left penniless after their father''s sudden death are forced to move in with their estranged aunt in East Los Angeles.', 'Two spoiled Beverly Hills sisters who have been left penniless after their father''s sudden death are forced to move in with their estranged aunt in East Los Angeles.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nWV6RncsN8Q86JplEl8AFlV5h6A.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:50217'),
  ('448842877588467892', 'From Russia with Love', 1963, 'Action, Thriller, Adventure', 'Ted Moore, Terence Young, Michael White', 'Richard Maibaum', 'Sean Connery, Daniela Bianchi, Pedro Armendáriz, Robert Shaw, Lotte Lenya, Bernard Lee, Lois Maxwell, Eunice Gayson', 'PG', 'Agent 007 is back in the second installment of the James Bond series, this time battling a secret crime organization known as SPECTRE. Russians Rosa Klebb and Kronsteen are out to snatch a decoding device known as the Lektor, using the ravishing Tatiana to lure Bond into helping them. Bond willingly travels to meet Tatiana in Istanbul, where he must rely on his wits to escape with his life in a series of deadly encounters with the enemy.', 'Agent 007 is back in the second installment of the James Bond series, this time battling a secret crime organization known as SPECTRE. Russians Rosa Klebb and Kronsteen are out to snatch a decoding device known as the Lektor, using the ravishing Tatiana to lure Bond into helping them. Bond willingly travels to meet Tatiana in Istanbul, where he must rely on his wits to escape with his life in a series of deadly encounters with the enemy.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zx4V17FP8oclNvOpTgs2iCCtiYk.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:657'),
  ('281387857293963199', 'From Saturday to Sunday', 1931, 'Drama, Romance', 'Gustav Machatý, Václav Vích', 'Vítězslav Nezval, Gustav Machatý', 'L. H. Struna, Magda Maděrová, Jiřina Šejbalová, Karel Jičínský, R. A. Dvorský, F. X. Mlejnek, Mimi Erbenová, Jan Richter', null, 'Two secretaries go out on a double date, but the inexperienced Mary flees when offered money for sexual favors. She takes refuge in a cafe and encounters a plebeian Prince Charming. The film recounts the simple progress of their romance after they go home together.', 'Two secretaries go out on a double date, but the inexperienced Mary flees when offered money for sexual favors. She takes refuge in a cafe and encounters a plebeian Prince Charming. The film recounts the simple progress of their romance after they go home together.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pfCYSSfHwW55RtMHZh9NkiqirNm.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:255059'),
  ('565860064616256076', 'From Soup to Nuts', 1928, 'Comedy', 'Edgar Kennedy', 'Leo McCarey, H.M. Walker', 'Stan Laurel, Oliver Hardy, Anita Garvin, Tiny Sandford, Dorothy Coburn, Ellinor Vanderveer', null, 'Inexperienced waiters (Laurel & Hardy) are hired for a swank dinner party.', 'Inexperienced waiters (Laurel & Hardy) are hired for a swank dinner party.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vwp2EshBQbVN4auWnzvCMoMxBND.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:53254'),
  ('316336639208786620', 'From Star Wars to Jedi: The Making of a Saga', 1983, 'Documentary, TV Movie', 'Robert Charlton', 'Richard Schickel', 'George Lucas, Mark Hamill, Carrie Fisher, Harrison Ford, Ben Burtt, Phil Tippett, Stuart Freeborn, Joe Johnston', null, 'From Star Wars to Jedi: The Making of a Saga is a 1983 television documentary special that originally aired on PBS. It is a behind-the-scenes look at the making of the original Star Wars trilogy, with particular emphasis on the final film, Return of the Jedi. Narrated by actor Mark Hamill, the documentary was written by Richard Schickel who had written the previous television documentaries The Making of Star Wars (1977) and SP FX: The Empire Strikes Back (1980).', 'From Star Wars to Jedi: The Making of a Saga is a 1983 television documentary special that originally aired on PBS. It is a behind-the-scenes look at the making of the original Star Wars trilogy, with particular emphasis on the final film, Return of the Jedi. Narrated by actor Mark Hamill, the documentary was written by Richard Schickel who had written the previous television documentaries The Making of Star Wars (1977) and SP FX: The Empire Strikes Back (1980).', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5TuxIPkudDni4BQDAIx8KCWgqZi.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:35795'),
  ('317977360068375024', 'From Star Wars to Star Wars: The Story of Industrial Light & Magic', 1999, 'Documentary, Science Fiction, TV Movie', 'Jon Kroll', null, 'Samuel L. Jackson, George Lucas, Ron Howard, Dennis Muren, Ken Ralston, Lorne Peterson, Steve Gawley, Harrison Ford', null, 'The incredible evolution of George Lucas'' special effects dream factory, including an inside look at "Star Wars: Episode One - The Phantom Menace."', 'The incredible evolution of George Lucas'' special effects dream factory, including an inside look at "Star Wars: Episode One - The Phantom Menace."', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eOK9FczS2GrH8ByZr9RkLYnQiW6.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:277499'),
  ('1061718924478501146', 'From Straight A''s to XXX', 2017, 'Drama, TV Movie', 'Vanessa Parise, Derek Filiatrault, Andrew Suttar', 'Anne-Marie Hess', 'Haley Pullos, Sasha Clements, Judd Nelson, Alyson Bath, Jacky Lai, Jessica Lu, Rachelle Gillis, Sarah Porchetta', 'PG-13', 'When a change of circumstances leaves Miriam unable to pay her college tuition, she makes a surprising decision: to start performing in adult films, using the pseudonym Belle Knox. Miriam lies to her family and her friends at school, keeping her double life a secret. But soon rumours spread and Miriam becomes the subject of vicious online attacks and unwanted attention. Miriam fights back: she talks to the media, saying her new line of work empowers her as a feminist. But her confident stand has unintended consequences. Miriam is shunned by her conservative family and her colleagues in the adult film world. One impulsive decision has quickly spiralled out of control - and Miriam''s problems are just beginning.', 'When a change of circumstances leaves Miriam unable to pay her college tuition, she makes a surprising decision: to start performing in adult films, using the pseudonym Belle Knox. Miriam lies to her family and her friends at school, keeping her double life a secret. But soon rumours spread and Miriam becomes the subject of vicious online attacks and unwanted attention. Miriam fights back: she talks to the media, saying her new line of work empowers her as a feminist. But her confident stand has unintended consequences. Miriam is shunned by her conservative family and her colleagues in the adult film world. One impulsive decision has quickly spiralled out of control - and Miriam''s problems are just beginning.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kvcdaGcres9pGDwZfPN9jOKfZh.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:441168'),
  ('63892359218369027', 'From Stump to Ship', 1930, 'Documentary', 'Alfred Ames, Howard Kahn', null, null, null, 'The long log drive: a spring journey down icy streams and rivers moving logs from the forest to the mill for sawing into boards, laths, and clapboards. For more than 150 years, logging techniques remained the same. Men cut trees by hand and loaded them on horse-drawn sleds to be hauled over snow to the river. Skilled river drivers maneuvered the logs downstream, risking their limbs and lives every day. This film survives as a record of the long log business.', 'The long log drive: a spring journey down icy streams and rivers moving logs from the forest to the mill for sawing into boards, laths, and clapboards. For more than 150 years, logging techniques remained the same. Men cut trees by hand and loaded them on horse-drawn sleds to be hauled over snow to the river. Skilled river drivers maneuvered the logs downstream, risking their limbs and lives every day. This film survives as a record of the long log business.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cUSaQdIFvBHGW3azdYu7WO7TFw6.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:151163'),
  ('243076745407110138', 'From the Ashes', 2024, 'Thriller, Drama', 'Khalid Fahad', 'Abdulhakeem Hakeem', 'Alshaima''a Tayeb, Khairia Abu Laban, Adwaa Fahad, Darin Al Bayed, Aisha Al Rifaie, Wafa Wafi', 'PG-13', 'At a strict girls school, a mysterious fire blazes out of control. Now everyone''s questioning whether it was an accident — or arson.', 'At a strict girls school, a mysterious fire blazes out of control. Now everyone''s questioning whether it was an accident — or arson.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8GwRZHBW4YCGhFsDkY7L8OIGW1x.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1221388'),
  ('469219424115344436', 'From the Ashes', 2027, 'Drama', 'Jeremy Wiles', 'Tiana Wiles', 'Jeanne Neilson, Paul du Toit, Syreeta Banks, Jeremy John Wells, Lucy Capri, Debbie Sutcliffe, Dolores Dermody', null, 'Jailed for her husband''s crime, a woman discovers that her only way out is to solve riddles from her mysterious past.', 'Jailed for her husband''s crime, a woman discovers that her only way out is to solve riddles from her mysterious past.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aEUH2ECoZHvSmoMzJpca0STF2CZ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1191876'),
  ('152915690474813770', 'From the Ashes: The Pit', 2026, 'Thriller, Drama', 'Abdullah Bamajbour', null, 'Adwaa Fahad, Aseel Morya, Aisha Al Rifaie, Aseel Seraj, Wafa Wafi, Modi Abdullah, Asil Moria, Darin Al Bayed', 'PG-13', 'Trapped in an underground pit during a storm, three students from an all-girls school must confront their personal conflicts as they fight to survive.', 'Trapped in an underground pit during a storm, three students from an all-girls school must confront their personal conflicts as they fight to survive.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iwZIR8wp1lqj69zsbWmZKhXTTIU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1608982'),
  ('258621317790240919', 'From the City of Lodz', 1969, 'Documentary', 'Krzysztof Kieślowski, Janusz Kreczmanski, Stanislaw Niedbalski', 'Krzysztof Kieślowski', null, null, 'This documentary explores the changing faces of the old Polish city of Lodz, and how its modernization, both physically and culturally, affects the older, more conservative residents, many of whom lived through World War II and are confused and somewhat resentful at the changes they''re seeing.', 'This documentary explores the changing faces of the old Polish city of Lodz, and how its modernization, both physically and culturally, affects the older, more conservative residents, many of whom lived through World War II and are confused and somewhat resentful at the changes they''re seeing.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ztnsu2sqNxz537ELoftkyWdQpKi.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:166669'),
  ('307444477181865401', 'From the Clouds to the Resistance', 1979, 'Drama', 'Danièle Huillet, Jean-Marie Straub, Saverio Diamante', 'Jean-Marie Straub, Danièle Huillet', 'Olimpia Carlisi, Guido Lombardi, Gino Felici, Lori Pelosini, Walter Pardini, Ennio Lauricella, Andrea Bacci, Loris Cavallini', null, 'Two segments. The first one arranges six stories from Cesare Pavese’s «Dialoghi con Leucò», taken from classical mythology. The second segment is taken from Pavese’s novel «La luna e i falò»: after World War II the emigrant «The Bastard» comes back to his village in the Langhe (northern Italy) to find out that everyone he knew has died, and that the war has deeply changed relationships between people.', 'Two segments. The first one arranges six stories from Cesare Pavese’s «Dialoghi con Leucò», taken from classical mythology. The second segment is taken from Pavese’s novel «La luna e i falò»: after World War II the emigrant «The Bastard» comes back to his village in the Langhe (northern Italy) to find out that everyone he knew has died, and that the war has deeply changed relationships between people.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/h1A5chyYVo4bej5g9qVsU3vjOYU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:87415'),
  ('633186678236457501', 'From the Dark', 2014, 'Horror', 'Conor McMahon, Michael Lavelle', 'Conor McMahon', 'Niamh Algar, Stephen Cromwell, Gerry O''Brien, Ged Murray', null, 'A couple on a trip through the Irish countryside find themselves hunted by a creature who only attacks at night.', 'A couple on a trip through the Irish countryside find themselves hunted by a creature who only attacks at night.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gNFVq2Zb4lFQZNdSBRAE8CBCBcA.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:291865'),
  ('569983213541077407', 'From the Depths', 2020, 'Drama, Horror', 'Jose Montesinos, Brendan J. Boyle', 'Jose Montesinos', 'Angelica Briones, Liz Fenning, Terra Strong, Marissa Godinez, Taylor Jorgensen, Flea Cullom', 'NR', 'After surviving a shark attack, a young woman is plagued by nightmares of being stalked in the dark sea by a ravenous predator, and by hallucinations of visits from her sister and boyfriend, both whom were killed in the attack.', 'After surviving a shark attack, a young woman is plagued by nightmares of being stalked in the dark sea by a ravenous predator, and by hallucinations of visits from her sister and boyfriend, both whom were killed in the attack.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uSa6p5e1wbuyXujXTZf2xPD9GkD.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:766076'),
  ('572770606791072207', 'From the Drain', 1967, 'Horror, Comedy', 'David Cronenberg, David Cronenberg', 'David Cronenberg', 'Mort Ritts, Stefan Nosko', null, 'The film is centered on two men in a bathtub; it is implied that they are veterans of some past conflict. The first man is paranoid about the drain of the tub, the second indifferent to it. As the conversation between the two men progresses, a vine-like tendril emerges from the drain…', 'The film is centered on two men in a bathtub; it is implied that they are veterans of some past conflict. The first man is paranoid about the drain of the tub, the second indifferent to it. As the conversation between the two men progresses, a vine-like tendril emerges from the drain…', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8FxwoYoKroUmiZVJB8TlSu9xn6r.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:104404'),
  ('363591029835684150', 'From the Earth to the Moon', 1958, 'Science Fiction, Adventure', 'Byron Haskin, Edwin B. DuPar', 'Robert Blees, James Leicester', 'Joseph Cotten, George Sanders, Debra Paget, Don Dubbins, Patric Knowles, Carl Esmond, Henry Daniell, Melville Cooper', 'NR', 'Set just after the American civil war, businessman and inventor Victor Barbicane invents a new source of power called Power X. He plans to use it to power rockets, and to show its potential he plans to send a projectile to the moon. Joining him for the trip are his assistant Ben Sharpe, Barbicane''s arch-rival Stuyvesant Nicholl, and Nicholl''s daughter Virginia. Nicholl believes that Power X goes against the will of God and sabotages the projectile so that they cannot return to earth, setting up a suspenseful finale as they battle to repair the projectile.', 'Set just after the American civil war, businessman and inventor Victor Barbicane invents a new source of power called Power X. He plans to use it to power rockets, and to show its potential he plans to send a projectile to the moon. Joining him for the trip are his assistant Ben Sharpe, Barbicane''s arch-rival Stuyvesant Nicholl, and Nicholl''s daughter Virginia. Nicholl believes that Power X goes against the will of God and sabotages the projectile so that they cannot return to earth, setting up a suspenseful finale as they battle to repair the projectile.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cALvMcrweHHswVNfSr1KkQdF2eC.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:44969'),
  ('266960488956460948', 'From the East', 1993, 'Documentary', 'Chantal Akerman, Bernard Delville, Rémon Fromont', 'Chantal Akerman', 'Natalia Chakhovskaia', null, 'In this incisive dispatch from the newly collapsed Soviet empire, bullet holes from WWII still pockmark the old stone buildings. Akerman journeys from East Germany to Moscow between the late summer and winter of 1993 (''while there’s still time''), chronicling in deliberate tracking shots, circular pans, and domestic tableaux yet another moment of radical upheaval in the 20th-century, the faces and bodies of Poles, Ukrainians, Germans, and Russians weighed down with obedient resignation and uncertainty.', 'In this incisive dispatch from the newly collapsed Soviet empire, bullet holes from WWII still pockmark the old stone buildings. Akerman journeys from East Germany to Moscow between the late summer and winter of 1993 (''while there’s still time''), chronicling in deliberate tracking shots, circular pans, and domestic tableaux yet another moment of radical upheaval in the 20th-century, the faces and bodies of Poles, Ukrainians, Germans, and Russians weighed down with obedient resignation and uncertainty.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/o5Qi0fiB2xteF3T1E4VK6q3l5VX.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:104739'),
  ('797375150699833634', 'From the Edge of the City', 1998, 'Drama', 'Giorgos Argyroiliopoulos, Constantine Giannaris', 'Constantine Giannaris', 'Stathis Papadopoulos, Costas Kotsianidis, Aimilios Heilakis, Theodora Tzimou, Giorgos Mavridis, Evri Sophroniadou, Tasos Nousias, Panagiotis Hartomatzidis', null, 'Minority-group Greeks from an outer suburb of Athens struggle with their life on society''s fringe and exploitation of one another.', 'Minority-group Greeks from an outer suburb of Athens struggle with their life on society''s fringe and exploitation of one another.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/n6Mpg0OttUe3yIKl6px5Z0d4I1S.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:40940'),
  ('676846599792526898', 'From the End of the World', 2023, 'Drama, Science Fiction', 'Kazuaki Kiriya', 'Kazuaki Kiriya', 'Aoi Ito, Katsuya Maiguma, Aya Asahina, Mio Masuda, Jiei Wakabayashi, Mari Natsuki, Katsunori Takahashi, Ai Tominaga', null, 'Hana is a normal high school student, unsatisfied in her daily life. One day she had a dream and met a 10-year-old girl living in Sengoku Era. The girl lives hard with poverty and misfortune in that world and the two are going to have a sisterhood friendship. When Hana wakes up, she is taken away by the government special agency and subject to severe scrutiny about her dream. There is something called Akashic Record and the destinies of all humans follow that record. And the future record of all mankind is gone in a month. The key to solving the problem is the girl who appeared in Hana''s dream.', 'Hana is a normal high school student, unsatisfied in her daily life. One day she had a dream and met a 10-year-old girl living in Sengoku Era. The girl lives hard with poverty and misfortune in that world and the two are going to have a sisterhood friendship. When Hana wakes up, she is taken away by the government special agency and subject to severe scrutiny about her dream. There is something called Akashic Record and the destinies of all humans follow that record. And the future record of all mankind is gone in a month. The key to solving the problem is the girl who appeared in Hana''s dream.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/95FT7h88IRwxhLZeHHJGz3SciXk.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1078930'),
  ('937107985587145816', 'From the Hip', 1987, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Dante Spinotti, Bob Clark', 'Bob Clark, David E. Kelley', 'Judd Nelson, Elizabeth Perkins, John Hurt, Darren McGavin, Dan Monahan, David Alan Grier, Nancy Marchand, Allan Arbus', 'PG', 'Apprentice lawyer Robin Weathers turns a civil suit into a headline grabbing charade. He must reexamine his scruples after his shenanigans win him a promotion in his firm, and he must now defend a college professor who is appearantly guilty of murder.', 'Apprentice lawyer Robin Weathers turns a civil suit into a headline grabbing charade. He must reexamine his scruples after his shenanigans win him a promotion in his firm, and he must now defend a college professor who is appearantly guilty of murder.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jkwzakMmaasylJc2Uj9LvL8bSOk.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:24081'),
  ('961751775690665964', 'From the Land of the Moon', 2016, 'Drama, Romance', 'Nicole Garcia, Christophe Beaucarne, Sébastien Matuchet', 'Natalie Carter', 'Marion Cotillard, Louis Garrel, Àlex Brendemühl, Brigitte Roüan, Victoire du Bois, Aloïse Sauvage, Daniel Para, Jihwan Kim', 'R', 'In 1950s France, a free-spirited woman trapped in an arranged marriage falls in love with an injured veteran of the Indochinese War.', 'In 1950s France, a free-spirited woman trapped in an arranged marriage falls in love with an injured veteran of the Indochinese War.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/l6CQmiMBi1z6BIEC2XpUaOpfsc4.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:376166'),
  ('188085289391095586', 'From the Life of the Marionettes', 1980, 'Drama', 'Ingmar Bergman, Sven Nykvist, Johannes Kaetzler', 'Ingmar Bergman', 'Robert Atzorn, Christine Buchegger, Martin Benrath, Rita Russek, Lola Müthel, Walter Schmidinger, Heinz Bennent, Karl Heinz Pelser', null, 'An account of the events before and after a murder committed by a disturbed businessman in a strained marriage, and what led him to perform such a shocking act.', 'An account of the events before and after a murder committed by a disturbed businessman in a strained marriage, and what led him to perform such a shocking act.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/w4wPV7AqX3IebvW1cElyP098El2.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:42152'),
  ('391694306280946068', 'From the Mixed-Up Files of Mrs. Basil E. Frankweiler', 1973, 'Adventure, Mystery, Family', 'Fielder Cook, Victor J. Kemper', 'Blanche Hanalis', 'Sally Prager, Johnny Doran, Ingrid Bergman, Madeline Kahn, Richard Mulligan, Georgann Johnson, George Rose, Bruce Conover', 'G', 'A precocious young girl and her younger brother run away from home and hide in the Metropolitan Museum in New York.', 'A precocious young girl and her younger brother run away from home and hide in the Metropolitan Museum in New York.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4ovC2QLtj8uIB0INWsQ1dOfxL3R.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:115621'),
  ('320368878991652112', 'From the Notebook of...', 1972, 'Documentary', 'Robert Beavers', null, 'Robert Beavers, Gregory J. Markopoulos', null, 'Shot in Florence, the film draws on Leonardo da Vinci’s notebooks and Paul Valéry’s essay on da Vinci’s creative process to explore parallels between Renaissance space and the moving image. Beavers employs rapid pans and tilts along the city’s facades, interspersed with glimpses of his own face, linking camera movement to the filmmaker’s investigative gaze. The work marks a turning point in his practice, foregrounding presence and perception as central to his method. (Note: The film was re-edited and re-released in 1999.)', 'Shot in Florence, the film draws on Leonardo da Vinci’s notebooks and Paul Valéry’s essay on da Vinci’s creative process to explore parallels between Renaissance space and the moving image. Beavers employs rapid pans and tilts along the city’s facades, interspersed with glimpses of his own face, linking camera movement to the filmmaker’s investigative gaze. The work marks a turning point in his practice, foregrounding presence and perception as central to his method. (Note: The film was re-edited and re-released in 1999.)', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/liLwMNX9KSoY20Ooe8GVfvGKYMA.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:104901'),
  ('1125854711182875589', 'From the Orient with Fury', 1965, 'Adventure, Action, Comedy', 'Sergio Grieco', 'Sandro Continenza, Leonardo Martín, Giovanni Scolaro', 'Ken Clark, Margaret Lee, Fabienne Dali, Evi Marandi, Philippe Hersent, Mikaela Wood, Fernando Sancho, Loris Bazzocchi', null, 'A scientist who has invented a weapon capable of disintegrating solid matter is kidnapped by a criminal gang, which intends to sell the scientist and his weapon to the highest bidder. A secret agent and the scientist''s daughter set out to track down the kidnappers and rescue the scientist.', 'A scientist who has invented a weapon capable of disintegrating solid matter is kidnapped by a criminal gang, which intends to sell the scientist and his weapon to the highest bidder. A secret agent and the scientist''s daughter set out to track down the kidnappers and rescue the scientist.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xLZiYDiNo8LklCBQJW3uGfc4JiO.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:98223'),
  ('839558155934778352', 'From the Other Side', 2003, 'Documentary', 'Chantal Akerman, Rémon Fromont, Robert Fenz', 'Chantal Akerman', 'Chantal Akerman, Francisco Santillan García, Delfina Maruri Miranda, Ranulfo Barreda Arcos, Rafael Gonzalez, David Arochi, Mario Rosas, Reymundo Rojas Prado', null, 'A documentary look at the fate of Mexicans who cross the border into the United States.', 'A documentary look at the fate of Mexicans who cross the border into the United States.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gRCr31SMpnElH5W6EZZG6cLdv0q.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:103699'),
  ('544634580655951123', 'From the Reports of Security Guards & Patrol Services No.1', 1985, 'Drama', 'Martin Gressmann, Helke Sander, Claudia Ketels', 'Helke Sander', 'Silvia Klaas, Nina Franoszek', null, 'A woman threatens to jump off a crane with her two young children in order to secure affordable housing.', 'A woman threatens to jump off a crane with her two young children in order to secure affordable housing.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/JHNfo1dYJYAGoGuGTkaO23PJSO.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:325005'),
  ('635605770758669085', 'From the Sea', 2007, 'Animation, Music', 'Miguelanxo Prado', 'Miguelanxo Prado', null, null, 'A male sketch artist goes down with his ship to a dazzling underwater world, guided by a silent, beautiful mermaid. Also in the Sargasso Sea area, is a Casablanca on a tiny rock inhabited only by a sensual auburn-haired violist, who serenades passing creatures, including a pod of friendly killer whales. The artist exploring the deep sea wonders: is he dead, dreaming, reincarnated or ?', 'A male sketch artist goes down with his ship to a dazzling underwater world, guided by a silent, beautiful mermaid. Also in the Sargasso Sea area, is a Casablanca on a tiny rock inhabited only by a sensual auburn-haired violist, who serenades passing creatures, including a pod of friendly killer whales. The artist exploring the deep sea wonders: is he dead, dreaming, reincarnated or ?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oVhNggoY6AIiMeqwN8zhLEiLzAn.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:69796'),
  ('29661711769886876', 'From the Terrace', 1960, 'Drama, Romance', 'Mark Robson, Hal Herman, Leo Tover', 'Ernest Lehman', 'Paul Newman, Joanne Woodward, Ted de Corsia, Ina Balin, Elizabeth Allen, Barbara Eden, George Grizzard, Patrick O''Neal', null, 'Alfred Eaton, an ambitious young executive, climbs to the top of New York''s financial world as his marriage crumbles. At the brink of attaining his career goals, he is forced to choose between business success, married to the beautiful, but unfaithful Mary and starting over with his true love, the much younger Natalie.', 'Alfred Eaton, an ambitious young executive, climbs to the top of New York''s financial world as his marriage crumbles. At the brink of attaining his career goals, he is forced to choose between business success, married to the beautiful, but unfaithful Mary and starting over with his true love, the much younger Natalie.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nG0CavLX9OXhtUVX0a3Nj9pLsA6.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:42541'),
  ('289581667550526582', 'From the Village to the City', 1974, 'Comedy', 'Ertem Eğilmez', 'Zeki Alasya', 'Kemal Sunal, Zeki Alasya, Metin Akpınar, Halit Akçatepe, Tekin Akmansoy, Perran Kutman, Meral Zeren, Oya Alasya', null, 'After they find buried treasure, four hapless brothers from the countryside discover that changing their fortunes will take more than gold.', 'After they find buried treasure, four hapless brothers from the countryside discover that changing their fortunes will take more than gold.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kU5LmUNIvybpP0IJRhwgOb3FAB5.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:74302'),
  ('263926027332258618', 'From This Day Forward', 1946, 'Romance, Drama, War', 'John Berry, George Barnes, Sam Ruman', 'Edith R. Sommer, Charles Schnee', 'Joan Fontaine, Mark Stevens, Rosemary DeCamp, Harry Morgan, Wally Brown, Arline Judge, Renny McEvoy, Bobby Driscoll', 'NR', 'A young American soldier, with an honorable discharge, returns home from World War II to his bride, whom he married after a short courtship and has not seen for several years. The two come together with many trials and tribulations in trying to preserve their marriage in the post-war years.', 'A young American soldier, with an honorable discharge, returns home from World War II to his bride, whom he married after a short courtship and has not seen for several years. The two come together with many trials and tribulations in trying to preserve their marriage in the post-war years.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/guGCW9HNztvne7acXZMICFG7TZ1.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:159469'),
  ('66785326099897069', 'From Time to Time', 2009, 'Adventure, Fantasy, Drama', 'Julian Fellowes, Alan Almond, Melanie Dicks', null, 'Maggie Smith, Dominic West, Timothy Spall, Alex Etel, Pauline Collins, Eliza Bennett, Rachel Bell, Christopher Villiers', null, 'A haunting ghost story spanning two worlds, two centuries apart. When 13 year old Tolly finds he can mysteriously travel between the two, he begins an adventure that unlocks family secrets laid buried for generations.', 'A haunting ghost story spanning two worlds, two centuries apart. When 13 year old Tolly finds he can mysteriously travel between the two, he begins an adventure that unlocks family secrets laid buried for generations.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4qVw09ZMpyXWsHt1odiFzdAPCFB.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:49391'),
  ('178550555568838026', 'From Today, It''s My Turn!!: The Movie', 2020, 'Comedy, Action', 'Keiya Tabuchi, Tetsuya Kudô, Yuichi Fukuda', 'Yuichi Fukuda', 'Kento Kaku, Kentaro Ito, Nana Seino, Kanna Hashimoto, Taiga Nakano, Yuma Yamoto, Nobuyuki Suzuki, Hayato Isomura', null, 'Taking place after the events of the TV series, Mitsuhashi and Ito face the new enemies.', 'Taking place after the events of the TV series, Mitsuhashi and Ito face the new enemies.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lerONWVN0MjraG0iVjKWNUGDzRl.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:698222'),
  ('294140092092010948', 'From Up on Poppy Hill', 2011, 'Animation, Drama', 'Koji Kasamatsu, Goro Miyazaki, Shunsuke Hirota', 'Keiko Niwa, Hayao Miyazaki', 'Masami Nagasawa, Junichi Okada, Keiko Takeshita, Yuriko Ishida, Rumi Hiiragi, Jun Fubuki, Takashi Naito, Shunsuke Kazama', 'PG', 'Yokohama, 1963. Japan is picking itself up from the devastation of World War II and preparing to host the 1964 Olympics—and the mood is one of both optimism and conflict as the young generation struggles to throw off the shackles of a troubled past. Against this backdrop of hope and change, a friendship begins to blossom between high school students Umi and Shun—but a buried secret from their past emerges to cast a shadow on the future and pull them apart.', 'Yokohama, 1963. Japan is picking itself up from the devastation of World War II and preparing to host the 1964 Olympics—and the mood is one of both optimism and conflict as the young generation struggles to throw off the shackles of a troubled past. Against this backdrop of hope and change, a friendship begins to blossom between high school students Umi and Shun—but a buried secret from their past emerges to cast a shadow on the future and pull them apart.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rRLYX4RZIyloHSJwvZKAhphAjiB.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:83389'),
  ('519463050861952715', 'From Vegas to Macau', 2014, 'Comedy, Action', 'Wong Jing, Ng Man-Ching, Cho Man-Keung', 'Wong Jing', 'Chow Yun-Fat, Nicholas Tse Ting-Fung, Jing Tian, Kimmy Tong Fei, Chapman To Man-Chat, Gao Hu, Max Zhang, Benz Hui Siu-Hung', null, 'Retired gambling legend Ken returns to Macau, only to be drawn back into action when his daughter becomes entangled in a global mafia scheme. Using his unmatched skills, he must stop a dangerous plot and protect his loved ones.', 'Retired gambling legend Ken returns to Macau, only to be drawn back into action when his daughter becomes entangled in a global mafia scheme. Using his unmatched skills, he must stop a dangerous plot and protect his loved ones.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7nXA7DWt4jrBaCBq09ojKaq1djg.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:252168'),
  ('719219080748947715', 'From Vegas to Macau II', 2015, 'Comedy', 'Wong Jing, Aman Chang Man, Andrew Lau Wai-Keung', 'Wong Jing', 'Chow Yun-Fat, Carina Lau, Nick Cheung Ka-Fai, Shawn Yue Man-Lok, David Chiang Da-Wei, Kimmy Tong Fei, Connie Man, Michelle Hu', 'PG-13', 'Following his confrontation with the nefarious DOA organization, Ken (Chow Yun Fat) is looking forward to going back to enjoying his retirement. His rest is cut abruptly short when his protégé Vincent (Shawn Yue), who''s now working for Interpol, asks for Ken''s help in taking down the real mastermind behind DOA, Aoi. The two head to Thailand, where DOA''s former chief accountant Mark (Nick Cheung) has escaped with his daughter.', 'Following his confrontation with the nefarious DOA organization, Ken (Chow Yun Fat) is looking forward to going back to enjoying his retirement. His rest is cut abruptly short when his protégé Vincent (Shawn Yue), who''s now working for Interpol, asks for Ken''s help in taking down the real mastermind behind DOA, Aoi. The two head to Thailand, where DOA''s former chief accountant Mark (Nick Cheung) has escaped with his daughter.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lRttDVgevYbTWvLh6rSaVde1hcy.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:329984'),
  ('720722752479112064', 'From Vegas to Macau III', 2016, 'Action, Comedy', 'Wong Jing, Andrew Lau Wai-Keung, Billy Chung Siu-Hung', 'Wong Jing, Ronald Chan Kin-Hung', 'Chow Yun-Fat, Andy Lau, Jacky Cheung Hok-Yau, Nick Cheung Ka-Fai, Carina Lau, Chris Lee Yuchun, Michelle Hu, Jacky Heung', null, 'A gambler is targeted for murder during the wedding of his daughter to his protege.', 'A gambler is targeted for murder during the wedding of his daughter to his protege.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zQ71tuPqMJARxFXzaWFPEmPTKV8.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:381002'),
  ('111563381266810417', 'From Within', 2008, 'Horror, Mystery, Thriller', 'Phedon Papamichael, Chad Rosen, Rafael E. Sánchez', 'Brad Keene', 'Elizabeth Rice, Thomas Dekker, Kelly Blatz, Laura Allen, Adam Goldberg, Rumer Willis, Margo Harshman, Britt Robertson', 'R', 'When the citizens of a small evangelical town systematically begin committing suicide, a young girl struggling to reconcile her Christian upbringing with her desire to experience the outside world finds her faith put to the ultimate test.', 'When the citizens of a small evangelical town systematically begin committing suicide, a young girl struggling to reconcile her Christian upbringing with her desire to experience the outside world finds her faith put to the ultimate test.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yyAiGq6SycABwV9m9KqqB2i6Ctl.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:16167'),
  ('743347892919344954', 'From: First Hymn to the Night – Novalis', 1994, null, 'Stan Brakhage', null, null, null, '“This is a hand-painted film whose emotionally referential shapes and colors are interwoven with words (in English) from the first Hymn to the Night by the late 18th century mystic poet Friedrich Philipp von Hardenberg, whose pen name was Novalis. The pieces of text which I''ve used are as follows: ‘the universally gladdening light … As inmost soul … it is breathed by stars … by stone … by suckling plant … multiform beast … and by (you). I turn aside to Holy Night … I seek to blend with ashes. Night opens in us … infinite eyes … blessed love.’” -SB', '“This is a hand-painted film whose emotionally referential shapes and colors are interwoven with words (in English) from the first Hymn to the Night by the late 18th century mystic poet Friedrich Philipp von Hardenberg, whose pen name was Novalis. The pieces of text which I''ve used are as follows: ‘the universally gladdening light … As inmost soul … it is breathed by stars … by stone … by suckling plant … multiform beast … and by (you). I turn aside to Holy Night … I seek to blend with ashes. Night opens in us … infinite eyes … blessed love.’” -SB', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/44ZEsFbhiSfTLKGMw8uzOXnMg2m.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:146662'),
  ('973663577566014727', 'Front and Back', 1991, 'Animation, Family', 'John Lasseter', null, 'Craig Good', null, 'An educational short film featuring the character of Luxo Jr. demonstrating the concept of "front" and "back."', 'An educational short film featuring the character of Luxo Jr. demonstrating the concept of "front" and "back."', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9NA6jwRrgK4UnTuFbBHv09eA17W.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:246673'),
  ('729846688931419628', 'Front Page Woman', 1935, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Michael Curtiz, Sherry Shourds, Tony Gaudio', 'Laird Doyle, Lillie Hayward, Roy Chanslor', 'Bette Davis, George Brent, Roscoe Karns, Wini Shaw, Walter Walker, J. Carrol Naish, Gordon Westcott, Dorothy Dare', 'NR', 'Ace reporter Curt Devlin and fellow reporter Ellen Garfield love one another, but Curt believes women are "bum newspapermen". When a murder investigation ensues, the two compete every step of the way, determined to not be scooped by the other.', 'Ace reporter Curt Devlin and fellow reporter Ellen Garfield love one another, but Curt believes women are "bum newspapermen". When a murder investigation ensues, the two compete every step of the way, determined to not be scooped by the other.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/g6NTqQQDneq6IUATIooYjcYRoVl.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:162059'),
  ('120628907573531182', 'Frontera', 2014, 'Western, Drama', 'Michael Berry, Joel Ransom', 'Louis Moulinet', 'Ed Harris, Eva Longoria, Michael Peña, Amy Madigan, Kristen DeVore Rakes, Seth Adkins, Lora Martinez-Cunningham, Mia Stallard', 'PG-13', 'After crossing the border illegally for work, Miguel, a hard-working father and devoted husband, finds himself wrongfully accused of murdering a former sheriff’s wife. After learning of his imprisonment, Miguel’s pregnant wife tries to come to his aid and lands in the hands of corrupt coyotes who hold her for ransom. Dissatisfied with the police department’s investigation, the former sheriff tries to uncover the truth about his wife’s death and discovers disturbing evidence that will destroy one family’s future, or tear another’s apart.', 'After crossing the border illegally for work, Miguel, a hard-working father and devoted husband, finds himself wrongfully accused of murdering a former sheriff’s wife. After learning of his imprisonment, Miguel’s pregnant wife tries to come to his aid and lands in the hands of corrupt coyotes who hold her for ransom. Dissatisfied with the police department’s investigation, the former sheriff tries to uncover the truth about his wife’s death and discovers disturbing evidence that will destroy one family’s future, or tear another’s apart.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rjdJN48tBaLB7HdmyzBnlypXvPj.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:259611'),
  ('611471602021720755', 'Frontier Hellcat', 1964, 'Adventure, Western', 'Karl Löb, Alfred Vohrer, Eva Ebner', 'Eberhard Keindorff, Johanna Sibelius', 'Stewart Granger, Pierre Brice, Elke Sommer, Götz George, Walter Barnes, Renato Baldini, Terence Hill, Sieghardt Rupp', 'NR', 'Outlaws disguised as Indians commit crimes against settlers but Winnetou and Old Surehand are determined to unmask the bandits and keep the peace.', 'Outlaws disguised as Indians commit crimes against settlers but Winnetou and Old Surehand are determined to unmask the bandits and keep the peace.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xVA3LE121ZvwoLdHSxXLyYHfDEn.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:9347'),
  ('809237937518295363', 'Frontier Marshal', 1939, 'Western', 'Allan Dwan, Samuel Kaylin, Charles G. Clarke', 'Sam Hellman', 'Randolph Scott, Nancy Kelly, Cesar Romero, Binnie Barnes, John Carradine, Edward Norris, Eddie Foy Jr., Ward Bond', 'NR', 'Wyatt Earp agrees to become marshal and establish order in Tombstone in this very romanticized version of the gunfight at the O.K. Corral.', 'Wyatt Earp agrees to become marshal and establish order in Tombstone in this very romanticized version of the gunfight at the O.K. Corral.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/SxAhP92u6bg0ok6y6OqAQMUADT.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:154064'),
  ('1008700490930287512', 'Frontier of Dawn', 2009, 'Drama, Romance', 'Philippe Garrel, William Lubtchansky', 'Marc Cholodenko, Arlette Langmann', 'Louis Garrel, Clémentine Poidatz, Laura Smet, Jérôme Robart, Olivier Massart, Grégory Gadebois', null, 'A celebrity is caught by her husband with a young lover.', 'A celebrity is caught by her husband with a young lover.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aP3wEVHW0RJ9BnQKSi4VECrMnKl.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:8897'),
  ('1025026021652537958', 'Frost/Nixon', 2008, 'Drama, History', 'Ron Howard, Salvatore Totino', 'Peter Morgan', 'Frank Langella, Michael Sheen, Kevin Bacon, Rebecca Hall, Toby Jones, Matthew Macfadyen, Oliver Platt, Sam Rockwell', 'R', 'For three years after being forced from office, Nixon remained silent. But in summer 1977, the steely, cunning former commander-in-chief agreed to sit for one all-inclusive interview to confront the questions of his time in office and the Watergate scandal that ended his presidency. Nixon surprised everyone in selecting Frost as his televised confessor, intending to easily outfox the breezy British showman and secure a place in the hearts and minds of Americans. Likewise, Frost''s team harboured doubts about their boss''s ability to hold his own. But as the cameras rolled, a charged battle of wits resulted.', 'For three years after being forced from office, Nixon remained silent. But in summer 1977, the steely, cunning former commander-in-chief agreed to sit for one all-inclusive interview to confront the questions of his time in office and the Watergate scandal that ended his presidency. Nixon surprised everyone in selecting Frost as his televised confessor, intending to easily outfox the breezy British showman and secure a place in the hearts and minds of Americans. Likewise, Frost''s team harboured doubts about their boss''s ability to hold his own. But as the cameras rolled, a charged battle of wits resulted.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nLrRrHZQ40tWqLTY3kxgS4x7GUw.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:11499'),
  ('566001381353655794', 'Frost/Nixon: The Original Watergate Interviews', 1977, 'TV Movie, Documentary', 'Jorn H. Winther', null, 'David Frost, Richard Nixon', null, 'This program, culled from the over 28 hours of interview footage between Sir David Frost and U.S. President Richard M. Nixon, was originally broadcast in May of 1977. Never before, nor since, has a U.S. President been so candid on camera. Even more intriguing is the fact that Nixon agreed to appear on camera with no pre-interview preparation or screening of questions.', 'This program, culled from the over 28 hours of interview footage between Sir David Frost and U.S. President Richard M. Nixon, was originally broadcast in May of 1977. Never before, nor since, has a U.S. President been so candid on camera. Even more intriguing is the fact that Nixon agreed to appear on camera with no pre-interview preparation or screening of questions.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7GntmLObhHg6xfX7H5BI5Hz1554.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:29953'),
  ('729428924555808553', 'Frostbite', 2005, 'Comedy', 'Jonathan Schwartz, Andrew B. Andersen', 'Paul Miller, Steve Rogers', 'Peter Jason, Traci Lords, Adam Grimes, Phil Morris, Suzanne Stokes, Oliver Macready, Ron Zimmerman, Carmen Nicole Tonarelli', 'R', 'A slacker hopes to postpone the responsibilities of the real world by enrolling in a snowboarding academy.', 'A slacker hopes to postpone the responsibilities of the real world by enrolling in a snowboarding academy.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/e2EvQyxXjIhFtSv0swPNcRIo3UV.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:18611'),
  ('950793875273088120', 'Frostbiter: Wrath of the Wendigo', 1995, 'Horror', 'Tom Chaney, Rick Cioffi, Steve Quick', 'Tom Chaney, Rick Cioffi, Steve Quick', 'Ron Asheton, Lori Baker, Patrick Butler, Devlin Burton, Tom Franks, Alan Madlane, John Bussard, David Wogh', 'R', 'A duo of gun happy redneck hunters stupidly break a sacred circle in a hunting spree, which releases the deadly wendigo. The wendigo kills many of the hunters gruesomely, leaving the chosen woman and a gun toting idiot to destroy the deadly beast.', 'A duo of gun happy redneck hunters stupidly break a sacred circle in a hunting spree, which releases the deadly wendigo. The wendigo kills many of the hunters gruesomely, leaving the chosen woman and a gun toting idiot to destroy the deadly beast.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wx07tRKGw54wRtfrZKGJDguplva.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:84901'),
  ('760064293480995670', 'Frostbitten', 2006, 'Horror, Comedy', 'Anders Banke, Chris Maris, Janak Thakker', null, 'Petra Nielsen, Carl-Åke Eriksson, Grete Havnesköld, Emma Åberg, Jonas Lawes, Niklas Grönberg, Gustav Johansson, Linnea Jonsson', null, 'Vampires terrorize a city in Norrbotten, Sweden.', 'Vampires terrorize a city in Norrbotten, Sweden.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uddXdHkiEq6MuzMqcmPHJZ1SokM.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:13319'),
  ('539224065067128914', 'Frosty Returns', 1993, 'Animation, Family, TV Movie', 'Bill Melendez, Evert Brown, Dee Baker', 'Oliver Goldstick, Jim Lewis', 'Jonathan Winters, John Goodman, Elisabeth Moss, Brian Doyle-Murray, Jan Hooks, Andrea Martin, Michael Patrick Carter, Steve Stoliar', 'G', 'Mr. Twitchell, a greedy old businessman, has invented Summer Wheeze: a spray that instantly removes snow and slush! Now Holly has to keep Frosty from melting, and convince everybody that snow''s actually a good thing.', 'Mr. Twitchell, a greedy old businessman, has invented Summer Wheeze: a spray that instantly removes snow and slush! Now Holly has to keep Frosty from melting, and convince everybody that snow''s actually a good thing.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qYgHxkiRvjVnPihSAm9Je91kOZq.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:28042'),
  ('458028391561397327', 'Frosty the Snowman', 1969, 'Family, Animation, TV Movie', 'Jules Bass, Arthur Rankin, Jr., Maury Laws', 'Romeo Muller', 'Jimmy Durante, Billy De Wolfe, Jackie Vernon, Paul Frees, June Foray, Suzanne Davidson, Greg Thomas', 'NR', 'A discarded silk top-hat becomes the focus of a struggle between a washed-up stage magician and a group of schoolchildren, after it magically brings a snowman to life. Realizing that newly-living Frosty will melt in spring unless he takes refuge in a colder climate, the magic snowman and Karen, a young girl whom he befriends, stow away on a freight train headed for the North Pole. Little do they know that the magician is following them, and he wants his hat back!', 'A discarded silk top-hat becomes the focus of a struggle between a washed-up stage magician and a group of schoolchildren, after it magically brings a snowman to life. Realizing that newly-living Frosty will melt in spring unless he takes refuge in a colder climate, the magic snowman and Karen, a young girl whom he befriends, stow away on a freight train headed for the North Pole. Little do they know that the magician is following them, and he wants his hat back!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gw7ie4W3iW8nefnZ4kuw8dgYNM2.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:13675'),
  ('349613030144004286', 'Frosty''s Winter Wonderland', 1976, 'Animation, Family, TV Movie', 'Arthur Rankin, Jr., Jules Bass', 'Romeo Muller', 'Andy Griffith, Jackie Vernon, Paul Frees, Shelley Winters, Dennis Day, Shelly Hines, Eric Stern, Manfreed Olea', 'NR', 'Years have passed since Frosty left for the North Pole, but his promise is kept when he hears news of the first snowfall of the season, and decides to return.', 'Years have passed since Frosty left for the North Pole, but his promise is kept when he hears news of the first snowfall of the season, and decides to return.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/o915rkZ0wwQjrk0UAEQkEkmt1E1.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:26539'),
  ('1065970929157148202', 'Frozen', 1996, 'Drama', 'Wang Xiaoshuai, Yang Shu', 'Ming Pang', 'Jia Hongsheng, Ma Xiaoqing, Yu Bai, Geng Li, Ye Wei, Yongning Zhang, Lixin Qu, Liu Jie', null, 'A young performance artist decides to make his own suicide his last work of art. On the longest day of the year, he plans to melt a huge block of ice with his own body heat and die of hypothermia. He calls this protest against the coldness of society "Funeral on Ice." Based on a true story.', 'A young performance artist decides to make his own suicide his last work of art. On the longest day of the year, he plans to melt a huge block of ice with his own body heat and die of hypothermia. He calls this protest against the coldness of society "Funeral on Ice." Based on a true story.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bilqIQBTl7yaamKvaxwaDeaOsRq.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:68413'),
  ('116216375965709265', 'Frozen', 2010, 'Thriller', 'Adam Green, Will Barratt, Brian Sullivan', 'Adam Green', 'Emma Bell, Shawn Ashmore, Kevin Zegers, Ed Ackerman, Rileah Vanderbilt, Kane Hodder, Adam Johnson, Chris York', 'R', 'When three skiers find themselves stranded on a chair lift at a New England ski resort that has closed for the next week, they are forced to make life or death choices that prove to be more perilous than staying put and freezing to death.', 'When three skiers find themselves stranded on a chair lift at a New England ski resort that has closed for the next week, they are forced to make life or death choices that prove to be more perilous than staying put and freezing to death.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2J3URUnDrIpNvh0uVqINQvr4HhW.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:44363'),
  ('149919731789718090', 'Frozen', 2013, 'Animation, Family, Adventure, Fantasy', 'Chris Buck, Jennifer Lee, Mary Twohig', 'Jennifer Lee', 'Idina Menzel, Kristen Bell, Jonathan Groff, Josh Gad, Livvy Stubenrauch, Santino Fontana, Eva Bella, Alan Tudyk', 'PG', 'Young princess Anna of Arendelle dreams about finding true love at her sister Elsa’s coronation. Fate takes her on a dangerous journey in an attempt to end the eternal winter that has fallen over the kingdom. She''s accompanied by ice delivery man Kristoff, his reindeer Sven, and snowman Olaf. On an adventure where she will find out what friendship, courage, family, and true love really means.', 'Young princess Anna of Arendelle dreams about finding true love at her sister Elsa’s coronation. Fate takes her on a dangerous journey in an attempt to end the eternal winter that has fallen over the kingdom. She''s accompanied by ice delivery man Kristoff, his reindeer Sven, and snowman Olaf. On an adventure where she will find out what friendship, courage, family, and true love really means.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/itAKcobTYGpYT8Phwjd8c9hleTo.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:109445'),
  ('944244328109175297', 'Frozen Alive', 1964, 'Mystery, Science Fiction, Thriller', 'Robert Ziller, Bernard Knowles, Margit Rausch', 'Evelyn Frazer', 'Mark Stevens, Marianne Koch, Wolfgang Lukschy, Joachim Hansen, Delphi Lawrence, Walter Rilla, Helmut Weiss, Albert Bessler', 'NR', 'A scientist experimenting with suspended animation decides to use himself as a test subject. Before he is frozen, his wife is killed, and he is suspected of her murder. a murder suspect.', 'A scientist experimenting with suspended animation decides to use himself as a test subject. Before he is frozen, his wife is killed, and he is suspected of her murder. a murder suspect.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lL7gMcKtVHqZxFyjYv87HTguVk8.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:113566'),
  ('118581198587963145', 'Frozen Assets', 1992, 'Comedy', 'George T. Miller, Geza Sinkovics, Ronald M. Lautore', 'Tom Kartozian, Don Klein', 'Shelley Long, Corbin Bernsen, Teri Copley, Larry Miller, Dody Goodman, Jeanne Cooper, Jenifer Lewis, Paul Sand', null, 'Zach Shepard is excited to find he''s been hired as president of a bank. When he finally arrives in Hobart, Ore., he discovers to his dismay that the bank is actually a sperm bank. There he meets the cold Dr. Grace Murdoch, the scientist in charge, whose disregard for him seems to mask romantic intentions. Meanwhile, in order to save the business, the sperm bank holds a fundraiser to find the man with the highest sperm count.', 'Zach Shepard is excited to find he''s been hired as president of a bank. When he finally arrives in Hobart, Ore., he discovers to his dismay that the bank is actually a sperm bank. There he meets the cold Dr. Grace Murdoch, the scientist in charge, whose disregard for him seems to mask romantic intentions. Meanwhile, in order to save the business, the sperm bank holds a fundraiser to find the man with the highest sperm count.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ya12MkdXY4r5BSxKupgoA1i5HuS.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:117773'),
  ('704001327313555469', 'Frozen Fever', 2015, 'Animation, Family, Adventure, Comedy', 'Chris Buck, Jennifer Lee', 'Chris Buck, Jennifer Lee, Marc Smith', 'Kristen Bell, Idina Menzel, Jonathan Groff, Josh Gad, Santino Fontana, Chris Williams, Paul Briggs, Bailey Ryon', 'G', 'On Anna''s birthday, Elsa and Kristoff are determined to give her the best celebration ever, but Elsa''s icy powers may put more than just the party at risk.', 'On Anna''s birthday, Elsa and Kristoff are determined to give her the best celebration ever, but Elsa''s icy powers may put more than just the party at risk.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mPrDJ7puYzPLG5kPM96iNszF2sM.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:326359'),
  ('983996832781693713', 'Frozen Hot Boys', 2025, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Nareubadee Wetchakam, Tanakit Kittiapithan, Peerawat Sangklang', 'Rangsima Akarawiwat, Alinda Peeraket, Tanakit Kittiapithan', 'Natapohn Tameeruks, Nuttawatt Thanathaveeprasert, Chatchai Chinnasri, Sadanont Durongkhaweroj, Piyaphong Dammunee, Punnanon Treewannakul, Kanjanaporn Plodpai, Suppakorn Kitsuwan', null, 'Driven by her personal agenda, a teacher at a juvenile detention center convinces a crew of teenage misfits to enter an snow sculpting contest in Japan.', 'Driven by her personal agenda, a teacher at a juvenile detention center convinces a crew of teenage misfits to enter an snow sculpting contest in Japan.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/i7cDPuT59TuV6hjxcrPkQONkd5Q.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1429743'),
  ('501604731092267201', 'Frozen II', 2019, 'Family, Animation, Adventure, Comedy, Fantasy', 'Jamie Sparer Roberts, Jennifer Lee, Chris Buck', 'Allison Schroeder, Jennifer Lee', 'Idina Menzel, Kristen Bell, Josh Gad, Jonathan Groff, Evan Rachel Wood, Sterling K. Brown, Alfred Molina, Rachel Matthews', 'PG', 'Elsa, Anna, Kristoff and Olaf head far into the forest to learn the truth about an ancient mystery of their kingdom.', 'Elsa, Anna, Kristoff and Olaf head far into the forest to learn the truth about an ancient mystery of their kingdom.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mINJaa34MtknCYl5AjtNJzWj8cD.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:330457'),
  ('799703344612552405', 'Frozen in Love', 2018, 'Romance, TV Movie', 'Ron Stannett, Cynthia Dryka, Riley Walsh', 'Rick Garman', 'Rachael Leigh Cook, Niall Matter, Sandy Sidhu, Madison Smith, Tammy Gillis, Susan Hogan, Keith MacKechnie, Victor Zinck, Jr.', null, 'When struggling bookstore owner Mary and the bad boy of professional hockey, Adam, are teamed together to help facilitate an image makeover for the other, they soon realize that opposites attract and they find themselves unexpectedly frozen in love.', 'When struggling bookstore owner Mary and the bad boy of professional hockey, Adam, are teamed together to help facilitate an image makeover for the other, they soon realize that opposites attract and they find themselves unexpectedly frozen in love.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iF7hEneMVFET1XebgmMqfTLaM6r.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:491408'),
  ('578131668503129101', 'Frozen Lake', 2015, 'Crime', 'Nikolaus Leytner, Hermann Dunzendorfer', 'Susanne Freund', 'Maria Hofstätter, Josef Hader, Miriam Fussenegger, Erni Mangold, Martina Spitzer, Karola Niederhuber, Wiltrud Schreiner, Philipp Hochmair', null, 'A retired police officer discovers a dead body on a frozen lake. When his own family members become the prime suspects, he decides to start his own investigation.', 'A retired police officer discovers a dead body on a frozen lake. When his own family members become the prime suspects, he decides to start his own investigation.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ns4x2diJkLUnTZTtAcBkyHMO9SD.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:371046'),
  ('783637253823191256', 'Frozen Land', 2005, 'Drama', 'Aku Louhimies, Jouni Mutanen, Pia Rickman', 'Paavo Westerberg, Jari Rantala, Aku Louhimies', 'Jasper Pääkkönen, Mikko Leppilampi, Pamela Tola, Petteri Summanen, Matleena Kuusniemi, Mikko Kouki, Sulevi Peltola, Pertti Sveholm', null, 'When a schoolteacher is sacked, he projects his bad mood at his troubled teenage son. The son, in turn, buys a CD player from a pawnshop with counterfeit money. This starts a chain reaction of misery as every victim projects his problems on to another person.', 'When a schoolteacher is sacked, he projects his bad mood at his troubled teenage son. The son, in turn, buys a CD player from a pawnshop with counterfeit money. This starts a chain reaction of misery as every victim projects his problems on to another person.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dTrzRNF1HKCBnHfq5XK3J500aGA.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:18279'),
  ('981997224431855613', 'Frozen River', 2008, 'Drama, Crime', 'Courtney Hunt, Reed Morano', 'Courtney Hunt', 'Melissa Leo, Misty Upham, Charlie McDermott, John Canoe, Jay Klaitz, Dylan Carusona, James Reilly, Michael O''Keefe', 'R', 'After her husband deserts her, working-class mother Ray Eddy is in great need of money to find a home. Lured by the possibility of easy cash, she joins Lila, a widowed Mohawk who earns a living by smuggling immigrants from Canada to the U.S. across the St. Lawrence.', 'After her husband deserts her, working-class mother Ray Eddy is in great need of money to find a home. Lured by the possibility of easy cash, she joins Lila, a widowed Mohawk who earns a living by smuggling immigrants from Canada to the U.S. across the St. Lawrence.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qZRcN4JLwYQWTxKlycZPLQb37mO.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:10183'),
  ('92650639435654049', 'Frozen Scream', 1981, 'Horror', 'Frank Roach, Roberto A. Quezada, Teri Argula', 'Celeste Hammond, Michael Sonye, Doug Ferrin', 'Renee Harmon, Lynne Kocol, Wolf Muser, Thomas McGowan, Wayne Liebman, Lee James, Sunny Bartholomew, Bill Oliver', null, 'Mad scientists turn people into frozen zombies and the zombies wreak havoc and kill people.', 'Mad scientists turn people into frozen zombies and the zombies wreak havoc and kill people.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1GbGECwYHBG5zo4CFRZCuoKQG8p.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:84375'),
  ('708879751087968594', 'Frozen Silence', 2012, 'War, Mystery, Drama', 'Gerardo Herrero, Alfredo Mayo, Angie Paul Risque', 'Nicolas Saada', 'Juan Diego Botto, Carmelo Gómez, Víctor Clavijo, Jordi Aguilar, Gabrielė Malinauskaitė, Sergi Calleja, Rafa Castejón, Francesc Orella', null, 'Russian front, winter 1943. Soldier Arturo Andrade and Sergeant Fernando Espinosa are commissioned to investigate a mysterious murder while the Spanish Blue Division of the German Army endures the fierce counterattack of the Red Army.', 'Russian front, winter 1943. Soldier Arturo Andrade and Sergeant Fernando Espinosa are commissioned to investigate a mysterious murder while the Spanish Blue Division of the German Army endures the fierce counterattack of the Red Army.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/753mxMXHKLXl9YUVxnpFH6OgaLQ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:85434'),
  ('396864742802182190', 'Frozen Stiff', 2002, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Milorad Milinković', 'Milorad Milinković', 'Nikola Đuričko, Sonja Kolačarić, Tara Manić, Srđan ''Žika'' Todorović, Nenad Jezdić, Slobodan ''Boda'' Ninković, Nikola Pejaković, Milorad Mandić', null, 'The basic plot revolves around drug dealer Limeni and two men, Lemi and Kiza, who are trying to transport their dead grandfather for burial, until their car breaks down and they end up struggling to get him home onboard a train. This is when these two plots intersect and all hell breaks loose.', 'The basic plot revolves around drug dealer Limeni and two men, Lemi and Kiza, who are trying to transport their dead grandfather for burial, until their car breaks down and they end up struggling to get him home onboard a train. This is when these two plots intersect and all hell breaks loose.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hXbGz9XJy9HqxdJyursXIv4669x.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:15303'),
  ('110880707077575145', 'Frozen: The Hit Broadway Musical', 2025, 'Music, Family, Fantasy', 'Michael Grandage, Brett Sullivan', 'Jennifer Lee, Jennifer Lee', 'Laura Dawkes, Samantha Barks, Jammy Kasongo, Craig Gallivan, Oliver Ormson, Richard Frame, Ashley Birchall, Mikayla Jade', 'PG', 'Young princess Anna of Arendelle dreams about finding true love at her sister Elsa’s coronation. Fate takes her on a dangerous journey in an attempt to end the eternal winter that has fallen over the kingdom. She''s accompanied by ice delivery man Kristoff, his reindeer Sven, and snowman Olaf. On an adventure where she will find out what friendship, courage, family, and true love really means.', 'Young princess Anna of Arendelle dreams about finding true love at her sister Elsa’s coronation. Fate takes her on a dangerous journey in an attempt to end the eternal winter that has fallen over the kingdom. She''s accompanied by ice delivery man Kristoff, his reindeer Sven, and snowman Olaf. On an adventure where she will find out what friendship, courage, family, and true love really means.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qrRlxuVP6vOHYXPnL4u4FA1q9lq.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1327872'),
  ('371112504795837662', 'Fruit of Paradise', 1970, 'Drama, Fantasy', 'Věra Chytilová, Věra Ženíšková, Kateřina Reimanová', 'Ester Krumbachová, Věra Chytilová', 'Jitka Novákova, Karel Novák, Jan Schmid, Eva Gabrielová, Julius Albert, Blanka Hušková, Luděk Sobota, Jaromír Vomáčka', null, 'An experimental retelling of the story of Adam and Eve which then progresses into an allegorical depiction of the loss of innocence.', 'An experimental retelling of the story of Adam and Eve which then progresses into an allegorical depiction of the loss of innocence.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/m0S3Jek3a9l4LvtKkSzvZy96jbD.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:80080'),
  ('464777444411159990', 'Fruits Basket -prelude-', 2022, 'Animation, Drama, Romance', 'Tsai Po-lun, Jin Aketagawa, Yoshihide Ibata', 'Taku Kishimoto', 'Miyuki Sawashiro, Yoshimasa Hosoya, Manaka Iwami, Nobunaga Shimazaki, Yuma Uchida, Uoken, Maaya Sakamoto, Makoto Furukawa', null, 'Kyoko, who couldn''t believe anything in the world and lived a desolate life, meets Katsuya Honda, who has been assigned as an educational trainee. She is at the mercy of Katsuya, who is rude and has a strong habit, and she is gradually attracted to her. However, she is disowned by her parents in the wake of an incident with her bad fellow. It''s a punishment that I''ve been doing as much as I like. Katsuya appears in front of Kyoko who thinks so...', 'Kyoko, who couldn''t believe anything in the world and lived a desolate life, meets Katsuya Honda, who has been assigned as an educational trainee. She is at the mercy of Katsuya, who is rude and has a strong habit, and she is gradually attracted to her. However, she is disowned by her parents in the wake of an incident with her bad fellow. It''s a punishment that I''ve been doing as much as I like. Katsuya appears in front of Kyoko who thinks so...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gt7radvJj8UI8C8mvmtWX5uiqQB.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:896499'),
  ('1111634478563167329', 'Fruits of Passion', 1981, 'Drama', 'Shūji Terayama, Tatsuo Suzuki', 'Dominique Aury, Shūji Terayama, Rio Kishida', 'Klaus Kinski, Isabelle Illiers, Arielle Dombasle, Shinnosuke Ikehata, Keiko Niitaka, Sayoko Yamaguchi, Hitomi Takahashi, Miyuki Ono', 'R', 'A girl named O loves a rich, and much older man. She is subjected to a variety of humiliating experiences to prove her unconditional obedience to him in a Chinese brothel. A poor boy sees her and falls in love with her. To get the money needed to sleep with her, he takes part in rebellious acts.', 'A girl named O loves a rich, and much older man. She is subjected to a variety of humiliating experiences to prove her unconditional obedience to him in a Chinese brothel. A poor boy sees her and falls in love with her. To get the money needed to sleep with her, he takes part in rebellious acts.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6vikaRo0SoRz7ieRnT4VoS9rC7b.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:64252'),
  ('1120484688943296963', 'Fruitvale Station', 2013, 'Drama', 'Ryan Coogler, Rachel Morrison, Nina Henninger', 'Ryan Coogler', 'Michael B. Jordan, Melonie Díaz, Octavia Spencer, Kevin Durand, Chad Michael Murray, Ahna O''Reilly, Ariana Neal, Keenan Coogler', 'R', 'Oakland, California. Young Afro-American Oscar Grant crosses paths with family members, friends, enemies and strangers before facing his fate on the platform at Fruitvale Station, in the early morning hours of New Year''s Day 2009.', 'Oakland, California. Young Afro-American Oscar Grant crosses paths with family members, friends, enemies and strangers before facing his fate on the platform at Fruitvale Station, in the early morning hours of New Year''s Day 2009.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oXSy3nEKFtfw5iRxdG8ouEFAnxs.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:157354'),
  ('27413512308932604', 'Frustration', 1971, 'Drama, Horror', 'José Bénazéraf', 'José Bénazéraf, Michel Lemoine', 'Janine Reynaud, Michel Lemoine, Elizabeth Teissier, Janet Dunphy, Pamela Stanford', null, 'A sexually frustrated woman, living with her sister and the latter''s husband, is tormented by bizarre nightmares and violent erotic fantasies.', 'A sexually frustrated woman, living with her sister and the latter''s husband, is tormented by bizarre nightmares and violent erotic fantasies.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wLwjAyr6pHO4j9qZt4FZWZozPrI.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:220897'),
  ('318691638739320086', 'FTA', 1972, 'Comedy, Documentary, Music', 'Francine Parker, Yale Zimmerman, John Weidman', 'Len Chandler, Dalton Trumbo, Donald Sutherland', 'Jane Fonda, Donald Sutherland, Pamela Donegan, Len Chandler, Michael Alaimo, Holly Near, Paul Mooney, Rita Martinson', 'R', 'A documentary about a political troupe headed by actors Jane Fonda and Donald Sutherland which traveled to towns near military bases in the US in the early 1970s. The group put on shows called "F.T.A.", which stood for "F**k the Army", and was aimed at convincing soldiers to voice their opposition to the Vietnam War, which was raging at the time. Various singers, actors and other entertainers performed antiwar songs and skits during the show.', 'A documentary about a political troupe headed by actors Jane Fonda and Donald Sutherland which traveled to towns near military bases in the US in the early 1970s. The group put on shows called "F.T.A.", which stood for "F**k the Army", and was aimed at convincing soldiers to voice their opposition to the Vietnam War, which was raging at the time. Various singers, actors and other entertainers performed antiwar songs and skits during the show.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yndNTKkNsHO3EILi5dma2RxC8Hn.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:102812'),
  ('306124774325002684', 'Fubar', 2002, 'Comedy, Music', 'Michael Dowse, Michael Dowse', 'Paul Spence, Michael Dowse, David Lawrence', 'Paul Spence, David Lawrence, Gordon Skilling, Andrew Sparacino, Tracey Lawrence, S.C. Lim, Sage Lawrence, Rose Martin', null, 'Terry and Dean are lifelong friends who have grown-up together: shotgunning their first beers, forming their first garage band, and growing the great Canadian mullet known as "hockey hair". Now the lives of these Alberta everymen are brought to the big screen by documentarian Ferral Mitchener in an exploration of the depths of friendship, the fragility of life, growing up gracefully and the art and science of drinking beer like a man.', 'Terry and Dean are lifelong friends who have grown-up together: shotgunning their first beers, forming their first garage band, and growing the great Canadian mullet known as "hockey hair". Now the lives of these Alberta everymen are brought to the big screen by documentarian Ferral Mitchener in an exploration of the depths of friendship, the fragility of life, growing up gracefully and the art and science of drinking beer like a man.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ceBaeBIQIXJ1ge51H3cuifOrmlS.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:13984'),
  ('228735132913209858', 'Fuck', 2006, 'Documentary', 'Steve Anderson', null, 'Reinhold Aman, Steven Bochco, Pat Boone, Ben Bradlee, Drew Carey, Chuck D, Billy Connolly, John Crossley', 'R', 'A documentary on the expletive''s origin, why it offends some people so deeply, and what can be gained from its use.', 'A documentary on the expletive''s origin, why it offends some people so deeply, and what can be gained from its use.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/26KoTqt7297hMcyU98hzlENhZJc.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:21710'),
  ('879628568287331907', 'Fuck My Life', 2010, 'Comedy', 'Nicolás López, Gabriela Sobarzo, Antonio Quercia', 'Nicolás López, Guillermo Amoedo', 'Ariel Levy, Lucy Cominetti, Andrea Velasco, Ignacia Allamand, Paz Bascuñan, Claudia Celedón, Nicolás Martínez, Leonor Varela', null, 'Javier wants to forget his ex. But it''s impossible when she''s always on line. Getting drunk and partying it''s the only solution. Or not.', 'Javier wants to forget his ex. But it''s impossible when she''s always on line. Getting drunk and partying it''s the only solution. Or not.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8O2wDQD43vKldhYIuMXjMQcVQYR.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:62910'),
  ('272078507758648452', 'Fuck My Weddin‪g', 2011, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Nicolás López, Mauricio Molina, Antonio Quercia', 'Guillermo Amoedo, Nicolás López', 'Ariel Levy, Andrea Velasco, Lorenza Izzo, Paz Bascuñan, Nicolás Martínez, Claudia Celedón, Liliana Ross, Julio Jung', null, 'When Angela gets pregnant, Javier proposes to her, but Javier''s new intern wants more than his guidance.', 'When Angela gets pregnant, Javier proposes to her, but Javier''s new intern wants more than his guidance.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aVotZIKlxW0ur03QTscg2RhFfTU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:83371'),
  ('236087450105408317', 'Fuck Off! Images from Finland', 1971, 'Documentary', 'Jörn Donner, Erkki Seiro, Jaakko Talaskivi', null, null, null, 'F*** Off! shows no false respect towards the authorities in its impudent and candid reportage of the developing country/welfare state Finland. It is a cinematic parallel to Donner''s New Book of Our Land (1967). The travelogue focuses especially on Finland''s outsiders, low-paid workers and the unemployed. In desolate provinces, the inhabitants of a cold and barren country either humbly abide their fate, choose to move to Sweden or take refuge in excessive drinking. These images are accompanied by protest songs based on Donner''s own prose and the lyrics of poet Jarkko Laine. Perkele is embodied in big business and the political elite.The jagged (anti)aesthetics of the film correspond to the underground movement and the radical politics of the time. The camera agilely penetrates everyday life. Though opposed to censorship, Fuck Off! itself transgresses the boundaries of privacy.', 'F*** Off! shows no false respect towards the authorities in its impudent and candid reportage of the developing country/welfare state Finland. It is a cinematic parallel to Donner''s New Book of Our Land (1967). The travelogue focuses especially on Finland''s outsiders, low-paid workers and the unemployed. In desolate provinces, the inhabitants of a cold and barren country either humbly abide their fate, choose to move to Sweden or take refuge in excessive drinking. These images are accompanied by protest songs based on Donner''s own prose and the lyrics of poet Jarkko Laine. Perkele is embodied in big business and the political elite.The jagged (anti)aesthetics of the film correspond to the underground movement and the radical politics of the time. The camera agilely penetrates everyday life. Though opposed to censorship, Fuck Off! itself transgresses the boundaries of privacy.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7h40CHpUjtFTjXqDOvFJeLOf7OC.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:270002'),
  ('660887609453626378', 'Fucking Berlin', 2016, 'Drama, Romance', 'Florian Gottschick', 'Dominik Stegmann', 'Svenja Jung, Mateusz Dopieralski, Michael Kind, Rudolf Martin, Christoph Letkowski, Charley Ann Schmutzler, Jörg Moukaddam, Ecco Mylla', null, 'Sonia breaks the perhaps most exciting time of her life, because the 20-year-old moves to Berlin for a mathematics study. Once there, she soon began to build up a new circle of friends, and then she fell in love with the kind, but irresponsible Ladja. There is only one big catch: the dear money is a bit scarce and therefore Sonia one day, financially, but also from curiosity, the path to prostitution. From now on, it leads a brisk double flight, which can fly at any time. Her experiences are ambivalent, as part-time she often gets into difficult situations, but also gets to know nice people, while she enjoys life just as a student. But how long can it maintain the double game?', 'Sonia breaks the perhaps most exciting time of her life, because the 20-year-old moves to Berlin for a mathematics study. Once there, she soon began to build up a new circle of friends, and then she fell in love with the kind, but irresponsible Ladja. There is only one big catch: the dear money is a bit scarce and therefore Sonia one day, financially, but also from curiosity, the path to prostitution. From now on, it leads a brisk double flight, which can fly at any time. Her experiences are ambivalent, as part-time she often gets into difficult situations, but also gets to know nice people, while she enjoys life just as a student. But how long can it maintain the double game?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rgCF7K2NBj8Xnnk8v7fQtXltJrJ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:376969'),
  ('1067660976624247135', 'Fucking Bornholm', 2022, 'Drama', 'Anna Kazejak, Jakub Stolecki', 'Anna Kazejak, Filip K. Kasperaszek', 'Agnieszka Grochowska, Maciej Stuhr, Jaśmina Polak, Grzegorz Damięcki, Borys Bartłomiejczyk, Oliwier Grzegorzewski, Marcel Sikora, Magnus Krepper', null, 'A group of friends are taking their kids to a traditional long weekend getaway on the Danish island of Bornholm, just like they did for many years. An incident between the children will spark a new crisis in their relationship. Each couple seems happy, but are they really? Maybe they’re just keeping up appearances?', 'A group of friends are taking their kids to a traditional long weekend getaway on the Danish island of Bornholm, just like they did for many years. An incident between the children will spark a new crisis in their relationship. Each couple seems happy, but are they really? Maybe they’re just keeping up appearances?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/orXwXXfBXX0I6mR9pdl8olbOYBh.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:950379'),
  ('425269569319872930', 'Fucking Fernand', 1987, 'Comedy, War', 'Gérard Mordillat', 'Jean Aurenche, Gérard Mordillat, Véra Belmont', 'Thierry Lhermitte, Jean Yanne, Martin Lamotte, Marie Laforêt, Charlotte Valandrey, Zabou Breitman', null, 'A bombing raid makes travelling companions of a blind man, Fernand, and Antoine, a criminal. Fernand is a virgin and is depending on his new friend to find him a woman. But to Antoine, on the run, his fellow victim is more a burden than a boon.', 'A bombing raid makes travelling companions of a blind man, Fernand, and Antoine, a criminal. Fernand is a virgin and is depending on his new friend to find him a woman. But to Antoine, on the run, his fellow victim is more a burden than a boon.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cBYqsAwFY6iFWJHGpUx7pqyIv3y.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:191479'),
  ('676312568516669063', 'Fucking Kassovitz', 2011, 'Documentary', 'François-Régis Jeanne', null, 'Mathieu Kassovitz, Vin Diesel, Alain Figlarz, Mélanie Thierry, Michelle Yeoh, Antoine Charreyron, David Belle, Gérard Depardieu', null, 'A making-of of the chaotic production of Mathieu Kassovitz''s Babylon A.D. (2008).', 'A making-of of the chaotic production of Mathieu Kassovitz''s Babylon A.D. (2008).', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9khkabejpQV0HAVe1MF274fWKhJ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:411510'),
  ('456546833995514195', 'Fudoh: The New Generation', 1996, 'Action, Thriller, Crime, Comedy', 'Takashi Miike, Hideo Yamamoto', 'Toshiyuki Morioka', 'Shosuke Tanihara, Riki Takeuchi, Kenji Takano, Toru Minegishi, Miho Nomoto, Tamaki Kenmotsu, Marie Jinno, Takeshi Caesar', null, 'In order to settle a business dispute, a mob leader murders one of his own teenage sons. The surviving son vows to avenge his brother''s death, and organizes his own gang of teenage killers to destroy his father''s organization.', 'In order to settle a business dispute, a mob leader murders one of his own teenage sons. The surviving son vows to avenge his brother''s death, and organizes his own gang of teenage killers to destroy his father''s organization.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kRlmTuDdZEGPbbXavNmiafUYYka.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:36282'),
  ('414459847991416717', 'Fuego', 1969, 'Drama', 'Armando Bó, Francisco Sposito, Ricardo Younis', 'Armando Bó', 'Isabel Sarli, Armando Bó, Miguel Ángel Olmos, Oscar Valicelli, Mónica Grey, Marcel Zenklusen, Hugo Mújica, Roberto Airaldi', null, 'Laura is a young woman living in a mansion with her maid Andrea. She meets and falls in love with Carlos, a man of high society who sees in her a vivaciousness he so longs to have in his life. But little does he know what troubles lie in store for him. Laura suffers from a dangerous case of nymphomania, desiring any man she lays her eyes on.', 'Laura is a young woman living in a mansion with her maid Andrea. She meets and falls in love with Carlos, a man of high society who sees in her a vivaciousness he so longs to have in his life. But little does he know what troubles lie in store for him. Laura suffers from a dangerous case of nymphomania, desiring any man she lays her eyes on.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bK0S3sfBcbdJlghrOpoREwRXn7Q.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:50966'),
  ('9393685467779551', 'Fuego en la sangre', 1965, 'Drama', 'Juan Carlos Pelliza, René Cardona Jr.', 'Alfonso Díaz Bullard', 'Libertad Leblanc, Julio Aldama, Guillermo Battaglia, Raúl del Valle, Carmen Jiménez, Eduardo Vener, José Orange, Eduardo Galán', null, 'In a rural setting, the chronicle of a woman with too many love demands.', 'In a rural setting, the chronicle of a woman with too many love demands.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zaGPiPwU4yRZiPnlnlwKO6VBZJI.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:676073'),
