  ('407557399439425505', 'Fuentes Family Ranch', 1938, 'Documentary', 'Antonio Rodríguez Fuentes, Josefina Barrera Fuentes', null, null, null, 'This 1938 home movie, shot by longtime Corpus Christi resident Antonio Rodríguez Fuentes, captures Fuentes'' parents at their ranch near Montemorelos, Nuevo León, Mexico. Fuentes'' father rides in on horseback, while his mother tends feeds the chickens and tends to the crops. A proficient photographer, Fuentes takes note of the weather conditions during filming. He labels the footage of his father as taken on a cloudy, rainy day, and the footage of his mother as shot on a clear, sunny day.', 'This 1938 home movie, shot by longtime Corpus Christi resident Antonio Rodríguez Fuentes, captures Fuentes'' parents at their ranch near Montemorelos, Nuevo León, Mexico. Fuentes'' father rides in on horseback, while his mother tends feeds the chickens and tends to the crops. A proficient photographer, Fuentes takes note of the weather conditions during filming. He labels the footage of his father as taken on a cloudy, rainy day, and the footage of his mother as shot on a clear, sunny day.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6fRXSiF7euyUBzaAyb3id6ZctAR.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:496549'),
  ('1015552685849432095', 'Fuerzas Especiales', 2014, 'Action, Comedy', 'Pablo Atienza, José Miguel Zúñiga, Antonio Quercia', 'Nicolás López, Diego Ayala, Rodrigo Salinas', 'Sergio Freire, Rodrigo Salinas, Ariel Levy, Loreto Aravena, Ramón Llao, Juan Pablo Flores, Ayleen Sánchez, Pato Pimienta', null, 'The adventures and misadventures of officers Salinas and Freire, who will have to settle for their lives to be respected by their superiors.', 'The adventures and misadventures of officers Salinas and Freire, who will have to settle for their lives to be respected by their superiors.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rBngIuVAgP0MOzSLlBvf6OWOrkZ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:309268'),
  ('591052803081907581', 'Fuga', 2006, 'Drama, Thriller, Music', 'Pablo Larraín, M.I. Littin-Menz, Liu Marino', 'Hernan Rodriguez Matte, Mateo Iribarren, Pablo Larraín', 'Benjamín Vicuña, Gastón Pauls, Alfredo Castro, Francisca Imboden, Héctor Noguera, María Izquierdo, Willy Semler, Alejandro Trejo', null, 'Could a brilliant composer''s music actually be killing his loved ones? Eliseo can''t help but believe it when his younger sister dies tragically and then his pianist Georgina suddenly dies on the piano. Completely traumatized, Eliseo is taken to a mental hospital where he can find escape only through music.', 'Could a brilliant composer''s music actually be killing his loved ones? Eliseo can''t help but believe it when his younger sister dies tragically and then his pianist Georgina suddenly dies on the piano. Completely traumatized, Eliseo is taken to a mental hospital where he can find escape only through music.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8oZ0me8AFv3181yiIsVjXkH11Db.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:37004'),
  ('301920898303371507', 'Fuga dall''Albania', 1998, null, 'Mario Salieri', null, 'Monica Roccaforte, Karen Lancaume, Chipy Marlow, Coralie Trinh Thi, Eva Falk, Fovéa, Géraldine, Eva Mercedes', null, 'The story begins in Albania where the heroine, Helen, suffers the abuse of her father, a former member of the Albanian Communist Militia. Troubling and extreme events in her life soon cause Helen to flee her homeland for Florence, Italy where she meets up with her friend Sylvia who works as a maid for a wealthy family. She soon learns that her boyfriend in Albania has been arrested for killing her cruel father. Though at first desperate to return home to help, Helen soon forgets her boyfriend''s plight as she is seduced into a wicked life of vice and perversion by the wealthy family with whom she is staying. Helen finds herself spinning out of control in a frenzied cinematic vortex of sex, beer and manipulation. Helen does eventually return home to Albania, but only to discover there, her own erotic destiny.', 'The story begins in Albania where the heroine, Helen, suffers the abuse of her father, a former member of the Albanian Communist Militia. Troubling and extreme events in her life soon cause Helen to flee her homeland for Florence, Italy where she meets up with her friend Sylvia who works as a maid for a wealthy family. She soon learns that her boyfriend in Albania has been arrested for killing her cruel father. Though at first desperate to return home to help, Helen soon forgets her boyfriend''s plight as she is seduced into a wicked life of vice and perversion by the wealthy family with whom she is staying. Helen finds herself spinning out of control in a frenzied cinematic vortex of sex, beer and manipulation. Helen does eventually return home to Albania, but only to discover there, her own erotic destiny.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8qBDxEjbvFulQZtu8v9c3fSiSjy.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:420187'),
  ('644585227068475590', 'Fuga de la Patagonia', 2016, 'Adventure, Thriller, Western', 'Lucio Bonelli, Francisco Schroeder, Javier Zevallos', 'Javier Zevallos', 'Pablo Ragoni, Gustavo Rodríguez, Héctor Bordoni, Bernardo Morico, Jorge Sesán, Laureano Coyueque, Claudio Mattos, Adrián Del Castillo', null, 'Escape from Patagonia is a gaucho-western film set in the tumultuous Patagonia of late nineteenth century. It''s a story of survival, based on real facts from the personal diary of the Argentinian pioneer Francisco P. Moreno.', 'Escape from Patagonia is a gaucho-western film set in the tumultuous Patagonia of late nineteenth century. It''s a story of survival, based on real facts from the personal diary of the Argentinian pioneer Francisco P. Moreno.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wtAWg1Gj0bxnxRAYcwr11gb9LUR.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:486362'),
  ('1007973015418269171', 'Fugitive Alien', 1987, 'Science Fiction, Action, TV Movie', 'Kiyozumi Fukazawa, Minoru Kanaya', 'Keiichi Abe, Yoshihisa Araki', 'Osamu Murashima, Miyuki Tanigawa, Joe Shishido, Choei Takahashi, Tsutomu Yukawa, Hiro Tateyama, Akihiko Hirata, Katsumi Muramatsu', null, 'An alien is pursued as a traitor by his own race because he refuses to kill humans.', 'An alien is pursued as a traitor by his own race because he refuses to kill humans.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hYq03NmJwcp8qg3U6RGOWLdil8J.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:113119'),
  ('1100420373378940166', 'Fugitive at 17', 2012, 'TV Movie, Crime, Mystery, Thriller', 'Jim Donovan, Anthony Lefresne, Bill St. John', 'Douglas Howell, David DeCrane', 'Marie Avgeropoulos, Christina Cox, Casper Van Dien, Danny Blanco Hall, Daniel Rindress-Kay, Frank Schorpion, Allison Graham, Rosemary Dunsmore', 'PG-13', 'Suspected of murdering her best friend, a teenage computer-hacker goes on the run to find the real killer.', 'Suspected of murdering her best friend, a teenage computer-hacker goes on the run to find the real killer.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/b44kGCtUi0vl0oCD6BGulwMA5lE.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:192465'),
  ('1119527328481552692', 'Fugitive Pieces', 2008, 'Drama', 'Jeremy Podeswa, Gregory Middleton', 'Jeremy Podeswa', 'Rade Šerbedžija, Stephen Dillane, Rosamund Pike, Ayelet Zurer, Robbie Kay, Ed Stoppard, Rachelle Lefevre, Nina Dobrev', 'R', 'A child escapes from Poland during World War II and first heads to Greece before coming of age in Canada.', 'A child escapes from Poland during World War II and first heads to Greece before coming of age in Canada.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aKkSgPBmbJ6mDSfxRzTFpqSQCzE.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:18613'),
  ('248741288812149192', 'Fugitive: The Curious Case of Carlos Ghosn', 2022, 'Documentary', 'Lucy Blakstad, Stuart Luck', 'Sophie Feragus', 'Carlos Ghosn, Louis Schweitzer, Nayla Beydoun, Clément Lacombe', null, 'From his rise as a business mogul to his plummet into international notoriety, this true crime documentary examines the bizarre story of Carlos Ghosn.', 'From his rise as a business mogul to his plummet into international notoriety, this true crime documentary examines the bizarre story of Carlos Ghosn.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sjLWPQFMBzsPk9ZURWJ5X6fptLQ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1028864'),
  ('58741290085965570', 'Fugly', 2014, 'Comedy, Drama, Thriller', 'Kabir Sadanand, Milind Jog', 'Sanjay Kumar', 'Mohit Marwah, Kiara Advani, Vijendar Singh, Arfi Lamba, Jimmy Shergill, Anshuman Jha, Akshay Kumar, Salman Khan', null, 'The fun-filled and carefree life of four college friends comes to an abrupt end when they cross paths with a corrupt police officer.', 'The fun-filled and carefree life of four college friends comes to an abrupt end when they cross paths with a corrupt police officer.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gK1d772yMqHjvBpMRVz1XWN5OTU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:281730'),
  ('498893415059261743', 'Fugue', 1999, 'Animation', 'Georges Schwizgebel', 'Georges Schwizgebel', null, null, 'A work of visual art that borrows from music the principles of the fugue, with the sudden flight of a man to his hotel room as its main theme. Where he dreams.', 'A work of visual art that borrows from music the principles of the fugue, with the sudden flight of a man to his hotel room as its main theme. Where he dreams.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xUmnxj6AGUvl4jT1z3iJmPHHmEW.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:256651'),
  ('956232734190802279', 'Führer Ex', 2002, 'Drama', 'Winfried Bonengel, Frank Barbian, Uljana Havemann', 'Winfried Bonengel, Douglas Graham', 'Christian Blümel, Aaron Hildebrand, Jule Flierl, Harry Baer, Dieter Laser, Henning Peker, Matthias Freihof, Detlef Kapplusch', null, 'Ingo Hasselbach, whose parents were Communist Party members in East Germany during his childhood, has lived at both ends of the political seesaw. The question of how people reach a change of heart is a profound one; Hasselbach describes the external forces that led to his founding Germany''s first neo-Nazi political party and the internal ones that led him away from it five years later.', 'Ingo Hasselbach, whose parents were Communist Party members in East Germany during his childhood, has lived at both ends of the political seesaw. The question of how people reach a change of heart is a profound one; Hasselbach describes the external forces that led to his founding Germany''s first neo-Nazi political party and the internal ones that led him away from it five years later.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9UT3mQokA5SdmVHfPCDmIkfDj9a.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:10630'),
  ('443417548848994839', 'Fuji', 1974, 'Animation', 'Robert Breer', null, null, null, 'A live action footage of a smiling, bespectacled (presumably) Western tourist set against the familiar cadence of an accelerating train revving up as it leaves the station sets the mesmerizing tone for the film''s abstract panoramic survey of an Ozu-esque Japanese landscape of electrical power lines, passing trains, railroad tracks, and the gentle slope of obliquely peaked, uniform rooflines as Breer distills the essential geometry of Mount Fuji into a collage of acute angles and converging (and bifurcating) lines .', 'A live action footage of a smiling, bespectacled (presumably) Western tourist set against the familiar cadence of an accelerating train revving up as it leaves the station sets the mesmerizing tone for the film''s abstract panoramic survey of an Ozu-esque Japanese landscape of electrical power lines, passing trains, railroad tracks, and the gentle slope of obliquely peaked, uniform rooflines as Breer distills the essential geometry of Mount Fuji into a collage of acute angles and converging (and bifurcating) lines .', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uRKM0mWEkvDIaJmpXJ5fzC1tsaY.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:146986'),
  ('287661025798645423', 'Fujimi Orchestra: Cold Front Conductor', 2012, 'Drama, Romance, Music', 'Yōichi Shiga, Satoshi Kaneda', 'Rino Itaya, Shinsuke Hakoda', 'Shōta Takasaki, Yusuke Arai, Sayuri Iwata, Akihiro Hayashi, Ryoma Baba, Houka Kinoshita, Ichirôta Miyakawa, Yuu Tokui', 'NR', 'Tonoin Kei, a musical genius, becomes the new conductor of Fujimi, clashing with the group''s leader, Morimura Yuuki, who is unaware of Kei''s feelings for him.', 'Tonoin Kei, a musical genius, becomes the new conductor of Fujimi, clashing with the group''s leader, Morimura Yuuki, who is unaware of Kei''s feelings for him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jBL5wsSBI4b0tYyHXmlJoh1aFns.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:256812'),
  ('361680811077937048', 'Fukrey', 2013, 'Comedy, Drama, Romance', 'Mrighdeep Singh Lamba, Abhishek Sengupta, K.U. Mohanan', 'Mrighdeep Singh Lamba, Vipul Vig', 'Pulkit Samrat, Varun Sharma, Manjot Singh, Ali Fazal, Richa Chadha, Vishakha Singh, Priya Anand, Pankaj Tripathi', null, 'The paths of four dream-chasing college friends cross with an array of colourful characters, from a tough-talking Punjabi female don to a Jugaad Baaz college watchman. Mayhem ensues.', 'The paths of four dream-chasing college friends cross with an array of colourful characters, from a tough-talking Punjabi female don to a Jugaad Baaz college watchman. Mayhem ensues.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wAXcxLLFKeqFdlhORajj4pZrPTz.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:199139'),
  ('1092067501075488389', 'Fukrey 3', 2023, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Mrighdeep Singh Lamba, Amalendu Chaudhary, Taran Bajaj', 'Vipul Vig', 'Pulkit Samrat, Varun Sharma, Manjot Singh, Richa Chadha, Pankaj Tripathi, Manu Rishi Chadha, Geeta Agrawal Sharma, Amit Dhawan', null, 'In the third installment, the Fukras plan to take over Delhi, and run for city elections. However, they have no money and so they take on an international job to make a quick buck, which changes their lives forever. In the first two films, we saw them using dreams, then premonitions to make money but now they’ve been gifted with a new & unique talent which is going to make them millionaires.', 'In the third installment, the Fukras plan to take over Delhi, and run for city elections. However, they have no money and so they take on an international job to make a quick buck, which changes their lives forever. In the first two films, we saw them using dreams, then premonitions to make money but now they’ve been gifted with a new & unique talent which is going to make them millionaires.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1E5qIvLBNrv4onx5SxnNz5Monac.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:805785'),
  ('596859404976906123', 'Fukrey Returns', 2017, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Andre Menezes, Mrighdeep Singh Lamba, Nihar Palwe', 'Vipul Vig, Reema Kagti, Mrighdeep Singh Lamba', 'Pulkit Samrat, Ali Fazal, Varun Sharma, Manjot Singh, Richa Chadha, Pankaj Tripathi, Vishakha Singh, Priya Anand', null, 'A year after the first movie, the four friends are enjoying their lives to the fullest, get in trouble once again with Bholi, who is released from prison earlier than expected and is broke.', 'A year after the first movie, the four friends are enjoying their lives to the fullest, get in trouble once again with Bholi, who is released from prison earlier than expected and is broke.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/AclYkwVFwS8yxMWj4riYqRaE0w0.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:454776'),
  ('712144689593883561', 'Fukuchan of Fukufuku Flats', 2014, 'Comedy', 'Yosuke Fujita, Yoshihiro Ikeuchi, Atsushi Unno', 'Yosuke Fujita', 'Miyuki Oshima, Asami Mizukawa, Yoshiyoshi Arakawa, Tateto Serizawa, Asato Iida', null, 'Fuku-chan is generous, light-hearted, and a little chubby. When a woman from his past returns, his old fear of women is finally put to the test', 'Fuku-chan is generous, light-hearted, and a little chubby. When a woman from his past returns, his old fear of women is finally put to the test', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zuvXtMuzxtzmlDqDi9Nnb5MNLVV.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:266508'),
  ('201042067543394020', 'Fukuoka', 2020, 'Drama', 'Zhang Lu, Park Jung-hun, Park Sang-ho', 'Zhang Lu', 'Kwon Hae-hyo, Yoon Je-moon, Park So-dam, Yuki Yamamoto, Rui Zhao, Oh Se-hyeon, Igaue Keiko, Miyake Shoichi', null, 'A bookseller from Seoul travels with a young woman to Fukuoka in Japan to meet a former friend from university. While their reunion is haunted by the conflicts of the past, his travel companion floats through the plot as if moving through a dream.', 'A bookseller from Seoul travels with a young woman to Fukuoka in Japan to meet a former friend from university. While their reunion is haunted by the conflicts of the past, his travel companion floats through the plot as if moving through a dream.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1v8jy0zB6LoGN0kIfeRP0ku6I1H.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:576112'),
  ('968039942523225103', 'Fukushima 50', 2020, 'History, Drama, Action', 'Shôji Ehara, Setsuro Wakamatsu, Takashi Sugimoto', 'Yoichi Maekawa', 'Ken Watanabe, Koichi Sato, Hidetaka Yoshioka, Narumi Yasuda, Naoto Ogata, Shōhei Hino, Mitsuru Hirata, Masato Hagiwara', null, 'Workers at the Fukushima Daiichi facility in Japan risk their lives and stay at the nuclear power plant to prevent total destruction after the region is devastated by an earthquake and tsunami in 2011.', 'Workers at the Fukushima Daiichi facility in Japan risk their lives and stay at the nuclear power plant to prevent total destruction after the region is devastated by an earthquake and tsunami in 2011.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/o1656SdGsUcnHYQmuNw7jL0JtsT.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:563067'),
  ('17280669384343443', 'Fukushima: A Nuclear Nightmare', 2026, 'Documentary, Drama, History', 'James Jones, Megumi Inman, Jean-Louis Schuller', 'James Jones, Megumi Inman', 'Ikuo Izawa, Carl Pilliteri, Wakana Yokoyama, Martin Fackler, Naoto Kan, Katsuaki Hirano, Katsutaka Idogawa, Manabu Terata', 'R', 'The definitive account of Japan’s struggle as it faced a nuclear catastrophe while still reeling from the devastation of an earthquake and tsunami.', 'The definitive account of Japan’s struggle as it faced a nuclear catastrophe while still reeling from the devastation of an earthquake and tsunami.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nL2f1g1cMPUsPmFWB71qHqjyVFd.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1439660'),
  ('1044831630002405892', 'Fulboy', 2014, 'Documentary', 'Martín Farina', 'Martín Farina', 'Tomás Farina, Facundo Talín, Gonzalo Peralta, Jorge Luis Medina, Cristian Vergara, Rodrigo Acosta, Sebastián Matos, Rodrigo Pepe', null, 'On the verge of achieving his dream career, Tomás allows his older brother Martin Farina an inside look at his life as a professional football player. Martin, never able to fulfill his own dream of playing football, steps into the world of Tomás and his teammates through the lens of his camera.', 'On the verge of achieving his dream career, Tomás allows his older brother Martin Farina an inside look at his life as a professional football player. Martin, never able to fulfill his own dream of playing football, steps into the world of Tomás and his teammates through the lens of his camera.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bIIs0z4yYC1IHoC7zB8WQib2qPQ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:332600'),
  ('690416017946538561', 'Fulci for Fake', 2019, 'Documentary', 'Simone Scafidi, Patrizio Saccò', 'Simone Scafidi', 'Nicola Nocella, Michele Soavi, Paolo Malco, Fabio Frizzi, Sergio Salvati, Camilla Fulci, Antonella Fulci, Enrico Vanzina', null, '«Fulci for Fake» is the first biopic on Lucio Fulci. Lucio Fulci is an enigma. The mystery that surrounds Fulci is linked in part to his personal life. The director only rarely spoke about himself in interviews. But he did let his experience be reflected in his films. The setting of the film sees Nicola, a successful actor, agree to play the part of Lucio Fulci in a biopic on the director. Nicola will ask himself probing questions about the real nature of a man who, in his own lifetime, had already rewritten his biography.', '«Fulci for Fake» is the first biopic on Lucio Fulci. Lucio Fulci is an enigma. The mystery that surrounds Fulci is linked in part to his personal life. The director only rarely spoke about himself in interviews. But he did let his experience be reflected in his films. The setting of the film sees Nicola, a successful actor, agree to play the part of Lucio Fulci in a biopic on the director. Nicola will ask himself probing questions about the real nature of a man who, in his own lifetime, had already rewritten his biography.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oiWv13jo4tYbIxByhOvvL0oEc7r.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:596354'),
  ('981190341160784270', 'Full Alert', 1997, 'Action, Crime, Thriller', 'Ringo Lam Ling-Tung, Andy Lam Kwok-Wah, Gary Mak Wing-Lun', 'Ringo Lam Ling-Tung, Sammy Lau, Calvin Poon Yuen-Leung', 'Sean Lau Ching-wan, Francis Ng Chun-Yu, Amanda Lee Wai-Man, Monica Chan Fat-Yung, Jack Kao, Raymond Cho Wing-Lim, Chin Ka-Lok, Emily Kwan Bo-Wai', null, 'A police inspector becomes obsessed with apprehending a criminal planning a major heist at the Hong Kong Jockey Club in the weeks leading up to Hong Kong''s return to China.', 'A police inspector becomes obsessed with apprehending a criminal planning a major heist at the Hong Kong Jockey Club in the weeks leading up to Hong Kong''s return to China.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/54EorHKcOokVBFWgJX6clsPoEcN.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:42842'),
  ('200180594413900742', 'Full Body Massage', 1999, 'Drama, TV Movie', 'Nicolas Roeg, Anthony B. Richmond, Sholto J. Roeg', 'Dan Gurskis', 'Mimi Rogers, Bryan Brown, Christopher Burgard, Elizabeth Barondes, Gareth Williams, Patrick Neil Quinn, Heather Gunn, Gabriella Hall', null, 'Nina, an art dealer, has her weekly massage appointment and is surprised to find out her usual masseur, Douglas, has sent a replacement named Fitch. The pair develop an easy rapport during the session, with talk about past relationships. As Nina lies topless on the massage table, Fitch also takes time to explain various massage techniques, including those used by Hopi medicine men.', 'Nina, an art dealer, has her weekly massage appointment and is surprised to find out her usual masseur, Douglas, has sent a replacement named Fitch. The pair develop an easy rapport during the session, with talk about past relationships. As Nina lies topless on the massage table, Fitch also takes time to explain various massage techniques, including those used by Hopi medicine men.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dyWG6GC2aktRXma00sdg7fmw18r.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:35044'),
  ('1132997867372739855', 'Full Circle', 1978, 'Drama, Horror, Mystery', 'Richard Loncraine, Peter Hannan', 'Dave Humphries', 'Mia Farrow, Keir Dullea, Tom Conti, Jill Bennett, Robin Gammell, Cathleen Nesbitt, Anna Wing, Edward Hardwicke', 'R', 'After the death of her daughter, wealthy housewife Julia Lofting abruptly leaves her husband and moves into an old Victorian home in London to re-start her life. All seems well until she is haunted by the sadness of losing her own child and the ghosts of other children.', 'After the death of her daughter, wealthy housewife Julia Lofting abruptly leaves her husband and moves into an old Victorian home in London to re-start her life. All seems well until she is haunted by the sadness of losing her own child and the ghosts of other children.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jqOzORZjPWPZ0xdlBBQ2URm8p1B.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:102283'),
  ('294671597696762983', 'Full Contact', 1992, 'Crime, Action, Thriller', 'Ringo Lam Ling-Tung, Lau Kar-Wing, Peter Ngor Chi-Kwan', 'Nam Yin', 'Chow Yun-Fat, Simon Yam, Ann Bridgewater, Anthony Wong Chau-Sang, Bonnie Fu Yuk-Jing, Frankie Chan Chi-Leung, Nam Yin, Victor Hon Kwan', null, 'In an effort to get his buddy out of a gambling debt, Jeff agrees to join forces with Judge in a weapons heist. The job goes bad and Judge betrays Jeff. Jeff plots the ultimate revenge on Judge and his followers and it is a question of whether he can follow through with his plan.', 'In an effort to get his buddy out of a gambling debt, Jeff agrees to join forces with Judge in a weapons heist. The job goes bad and Judge betrays Jeff. Jeff plots the ultimate revenge on Judge and his followers and it is a question of whether he can follow through with his plan.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/a3SFfTwR7j2WHsBTEoYmkxHrkDB.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:27073'),
  ('376930184384497199', 'Full Contact', 1993, 'Action, Drama', 'Rick Jacobson, Brendan Dawson, Jeannette Scheibe', 'Beverly Gray', 'Jerry Trimble, Howard Jackson, Alvin Prouder, Gerry Blanck, Denise Buick, Marcus Aurelius, Raymond Storti, Joe Charles', null, 'Luke Powers travels to L.A. to find that his brother has been murdered in a back alley martial arts tournament. Luke enters the tournament circuit to try to flush out his brother''s killer. With the help of a trainer and former fighter, Lucke enters what he thinks will be a victorious battle.', 'Luke Powers travels to L.A. to find that his brother has been murdered in a back alley martial arts tournament. Luke enters the tournament circuit to try to flush out his brother''s killer. With the help of a trainer and former fighter, Lucke enters what he thinks will be a victorious battle.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nHhNeUSxgtB3tc6jToUvFWtIb3x.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:269646'),
  ('648466321155595729', 'Full Eclipse', 1993, 'Horror, Action, TV Movie, Crime, Science Fiction', 'Anthony Hickox, Sandi Sissel', 'Michael Reaves, Richard Christian Matheson', 'Mario Van Peebles, Patsy Kensit, Bruce Payne, Tony Denison, Jason Beghe, Paula Marshall, John Verea, Dean Norris', null, 'The LA police department have a special team of officers with a talent for reducing big-time crime. The team leader has an excellent track record for crime reduction in other big cities, but his methods are unconventional, and so is he - he''s a werewolf.', 'The LA police department have a special team of officers with a talent for reducing big-time crime. The team leader has an excellent track record for crime reduction in other big cities, but his methods are unconventional, and so is he - he''s a werewolf.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lCtgDrPfhdeIhqRanyAYVG59Ew7.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:78239'),
  ('581813868206075955', 'Full Frontal', 2002, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Steven Soderbergh, Steven Soderbergh, Gregory Jacobs', 'Coleman Hough', 'David Duchovny, Nicky Katt, Catherine Keener, Mary McCormack, David Hyde Pierce, Julia Roberts, Blair Underwood, Enrico Colantoni', 'R', 'A day in the life of a group of men and women in Hollywood, in the hours leading up to a friend''s birthday party.', 'A day in the life of a group of men and women in Hollywood, in the hours leading up to a friend''s birthday party.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7FeoefSYELryi04Kz74xYTayPZk.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:15186'),
  ('540325057528000667', 'Full House', 1952, 'Crime, Mystery', 'André Germain, Henri Verneuil', 'Jacques Companéez, André Tabet', 'Michel Simon, Raymond Rouleau, John van Dreelen, André Dalibert, René Génin, Arlette Merry, Jacqueline Porel, Maurice Teynac', null, 'Anthology film with three shorts each featuring a famous detective: Monsieur Wens, Lemmy Caution and Maigret.', 'Anthology film with three shorts each featuring a famous detective: Monsieur Wens, Lemmy Caution and Maigret.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7NIePbQ6VH9UMoqa15O6fb4hhbu.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:318208'),
  ('682242583516990340', 'Full Metal Jacket', 1987, 'Drama, War', 'Douglas Milsome, Stanley Kubrick, Nigel Phelps', 'Michael Herr, Gustav Hasford, Stanley Kubrick', 'Matthew Modine, Adam Baldwin, Vincent D''Onofrio, R. Lee Ermey, Dorian Harewood, Kevyn Major Howard, Arliss Howard, Ed O''Ross', 'R', 'A pragmatic U.S. Marine observes the dehumanizing effects the U.S.-Vietnam War has on his fellow recruits from their brutal boot camp training to the bloody street fighting in Hue.', 'A pragmatic U.S. Marine observes the dehumanizing effects the U.S.-Vietnam War has on his fellow recruits from their brutal boot camp training to the bloody street fighting in Hue.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kMKyx1k8hWWscYFnPbnxxN4Eqo4.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:600'),
  ('1023283335314242635', 'Full Metal Jacket: Between Good and Evil', 2007, 'Documentary', 'Gary Leva', null, 'Jan Harlan, John Calley, R. Lee Ermey, John Baxter, Adam Baldwin, Kevyn Major Howard, Vincent D''Onofrio, John Ward', null, 'Follow Stanley Kubrick as he creates his savage and brilliant Vietnam film, hewing closely to the theme that dominated his creative life for four decades - the duality of human nature. Poised between good and evil, mankind was, in Kubrick''s view, a complex creature equally capable of unspeakable savagery and heart-melting tenderness. Full Metal Jacket would make his case in vivid, blood-soaked Technicolor. Through interviews with Kubrick''s collaborators and cast members, including Vincent D''Onofrio, Lee Ermey and Adam Baldwin, this documentary reveals how Kubrick''s brilliant visual sense, astute knowledge of human nature, and unique perspective on the duality of man came together to make Full Metal Jacket an unforgettable cinematic experience, taking its place in his "war trilogy" alongside cinematic landmarks Fear and Desire and Paths of Glory.', 'Follow Stanley Kubrick as he creates his savage and brilliant Vietnam film, hewing closely to the theme that dominated his creative life for four decades - the duality of human nature. Poised between good and evil, mankind was, in Kubrick''s view, a complex creature equally capable of unspeakable savagery and heart-melting tenderness. Full Metal Jacket would make his case in vivid, blood-soaked Technicolor. Through interviews with Kubrick''s collaborators and cast members, including Vincent D''Onofrio, Lee Ermey and Adam Baldwin, this documentary reveals how Kubrick''s brilliant visual sense, astute knowledge of human nature, and unique perspective on the duality of man came together to make Full Metal Jacket an unforgettable cinematic experience, taking its place in his "war trilogy" alongside cinematic landmarks Fear and Desire and Paths of Glory.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hGIIomAeSiXdEnF6bdX39ont2JU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:386610'),
  ('296743782229302149', 'Full Metal Village', 2007, 'Documentary', 'Sung Hyung Cho, Marcus Winterbauer', null, 'Uwe Trede, Lore Trede, Klaus H. Plähn, Irma Schaack, Eva Waldow, Ann-Kathrin Schaack, Malena Schaack, Norbert Venohr', null, 'The film describes the microcosmos of the small village Wacken and shows the clash of the cultures, before and during the biggest heavy metal festival in Europe.', 'The film describes the microcosmos of the small village Wacken and shows the clash of the cultures, before and during the biggest heavy metal festival in Europe.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kA5JsZkYnVJYzPIVuBbisYmvp4Z.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1442'),
  ('964491892101898867', 'Full Metal Yakuza', 1997, 'Action, Comedy, Crime, Horror, Science Fiction', 'Takashi Miike, Shōhei Andō', 'Itaru Era', 'Tsuyoshi Ujiki, Tomorowo Taguchi, Takeshi Caesar, Kazuki Kitamura, Yūichi Minato, Shôko Nakahara, Momoko Nishida, Kôji Tsukamoto', null, 'After being brutally murdered in a gangster-style execution, Kensuke Hagane finds himself brought back to life by a mad scientist and rebuilt as a robot-human hybrid with a serious thirst for vengeance and the tools to carry it out.', 'After being brutally murdered in a gangster-style execution, Kensuke Hagane finds himself brought back to life by a mad scientist and rebuilt as a robot-human hybrid with a serious thirst for vengeance and the tools to carry it out.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wLYwjhB9cwUAD5j5jeBoT5DkNSW.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:42099'),
  ('924949330711014151', 'Full Moon High', 1981, 'Horror, Comedy, Fantasy', 'Larry Cohen, Daniel Pearl', 'Larry Cohen', 'Adam Arkin, Ed McMahon, Joanne Nail, Alan Arkin, Pat Morita, Jim J. Bullock, Elizabeth Hartman, Laurene Landon', 'PG', 'After a trip to Romania, popular high school quarterback Tony Walker becomes a werewolf, and struggles to come to terms with his hirsute situation.', 'After a trip to Romania, popular high school quarterback Tony Walker becomes a werewolf, and struggles to come to terms with his hirsute situation.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/i81COenmVVnkfyOC3JOR7lXO1jm.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:107430'),
  ('53488405297421911', 'Full Moon in Blue Water', 1988, 'Drama, Romance', 'Robert Engelman, Eric Jones, Peter Masterson', 'Bill Bozzone', 'Gene Hackman, Teri Garr, Burgess Meredith, Elias Koteas, Kevin Cooney, David Doty, Gil Glasgow, Becky Ann Baker', 'R', 'Floyd, the owner of a bar on the Texas coast, has been depressed for a year after his wife disappeared in a swimming accident. He lives with his senile father-in-law "The General" and is helped by Jimmy, a former asylum inmate, and the good-natured Louise. The bar is rapidly losing money and Charlie wants to buy it cheaply before it becomes publicly known that a nearby bridge is to be built. Louise offers her savings to go into partnership with Floyd, but Floyd decides to sell when he is forced to pay his back taxes.', 'Floyd, the owner of a bar on the Texas coast, has been depressed for a year after his wife disappeared in a swimming accident. He lives with his senile father-in-law "The General" and is helped by Jimmy, a former asylum inmate, and the good-natured Louise. The bar is rapidly losing money and Charlie wants to buy it cheaply before it becomes publicly known that a nearby bridge is to be built. Louise offers her savings to go into partnership with Floyd, but Floyd decides to sell when he is forced to pay his back taxes.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3QsmmSgBvfK83j6EDtJZjBcsC5h.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:40555'),
  ('342157323450380364', 'Full Moon in Paris', 1984, 'Drama, Romance', 'Éric Rohmer, Renato Berta', 'Éric Rohmer', 'Pascale Ogier, Tchéky Karyo, Fabrice Luchini, Virginie Thévenet, Christian Vadim, László Szabó, Lisa Garneri, Mathieu Schiffman', null, 'Feeling suffocated by a possessive boyfriend, work and suburban life, a young woman starts spending the weekends in her Paris apartment in order to reclaim some of her lost freedom.', 'Feeling suffocated by a possessive boyfriend, work and suburban life, a young woman starts spending the weekends in her Paris apartment in order to reclaim some of her lost freedom.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5HQU7dfVnB8HHRkdZzo1hV724gs.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:27102'),
  ('242371993926560658', 'Full of It', 2007, 'Comedy, Family, Drama', 'Kramer Morgenthau, Christian Charles', 'Jon Lucas, Scott Moore', 'Ryan Pinkston, Kate Mara, Craig Kilborn, Teri Polo, Carmen Electra, John Carroll Lynch, Amanda Walsh, Derek McGrath', 'PG-13', 'A teenager tells outrageous lies at his new high school, only to have them suddenly come true.', 'A teenager tells outrageous lies at his new high school, only to have them suddenly come true.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7N96JPo7psxZVpI8axl1gSeJQ7l.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:29362'),
  ('606808218616395280', 'Full Out', 2015, 'History, Drama, Family', 'Sean Cisterna, Pasha Patriki, Matthew Gorman', 'Willem Wennekers', 'Ana Golja, Jennifer Beals, Asha Bromfield, Trevor Tordjman, Jake Epstein, Ramona Milano, Lamar Johnson, Sarah Fisher', null, 'Based on the true life story of California gymnast Ariana Berlin. As she zoned in on her Olympic goals, 14 year old Ariana Berlin''s life took a sharp turn when she was involved in a debilitating car accident. Gaining her confidence and movement back through learning hip hop dance, she unexpectedly found herself called back to the gymnastics world thanks to world renowned UCLA Coach Valorie Kondos Field. With Val''s help, Ariana was eventually able to secure a spot on the UCLA gymnastics team and win an NCAA championship, a lifelong goal that she had always dreamed of. This is a wonderfully inspiring story of persistence, confidence, and the heart and courage to make a somewhat impossible comeback in life.', 'Based on the true life story of California gymnast Ariana Berlin. As she zoned in on her Olympic goals, 14 year old Ariana Berlin''s life took a sharp turn when she was involved in a debilitating car accident. Gaining her confidence and movement back through learning hip hop dance, she unexpectedly found herself called back to the gymnastics world thanks to world renowned UCLA Coach Valorie Kondos Field. With Val''s help, Ariana was eventually able to secure a spot on the UCLA gymnastics team and win an NCAA championship, a lifelong goal that she had always dreamed of. This is a wonderfully inspiring story of persistence, confidence, and the heart and courage to make a somewhat impossible comeback in life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/e9c2JOwJlWUfIZRaxIWE2BZt5GV.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:298582'),
  ('151149376186449019', 'Full Out 2: You Got This!', 2020, 'Family, TV Movie', 'Jeff Deverett', 'Andy Chan, Jeff Deverett', 'Logan Edra, Sydney Cope, Braedyn Bruner, Liza Wilk, Billie D. Merritt, Jessica Johnson, Julia Self, Matthew Elliott', null, 'When the University of Oklahoma Sooners lose their star gymnast, Brenna Dowell, the rest of the team have to find a way to believe in themselves in order to win their second National Gymnastics Championship. With the help of Riley, a local breakdancing phenomenon, Chayse and her OU teammates learn to incorporate intricate breakdance techniques into their gymnastics routines in order to find a competitive edge. At the end of it all, they realize what matters most is finding the confidence to believe in yourself.', 'When the University of Oklahoma Sooners lose their star gymnast, Brenna Dowell, the rest of the team have to find a way to believe in themselves in order to win their second National Gymnastics Championship. With the help of Riley, a local breakdancing phenomenon, Chayse and her OU teammates learn to incorporate intricate breakdance techniques into their gymnastics routines in order to find a competitive edge. At the end of it all, they realize what matters most is finding the confidence to believe in yourself.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yeW1gOLWauwhFVleLwcW29RHLG2.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:696160'),
  ('1027971824118340898', 'Full River Red', 2023, 'Mystery, Comedy, Thriller, History', 'Zhang Yimou, Zhao Xiaoding, Fu Lulu', 'Chen Yu', 'Teng Shen, Jackson Yee, Zhang Yi, Lei Jiayin, Yue Yunpeng, Pan Binlong, Yu Ailei, Guo Jingfei', 'NR', 'During China''s Song Dynasty, a mysterious murder occurs at Chancellor Quin Hui''s palace after meeting delegates from the neighboring Jin Dynasty. The members become embroiled not just in a murder mystery, but a larger conspiracy concerning the fate of the empire.', 'During China''s Song Dynasty, a mysterious murder occurs at Chancellor Quin Hui''s palace after meeting delegates from the neighboring Jin Dynasty. The members become embroiled not just in a murder mystery, but a larger conspiracy concerning the fate of the empire.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kOoxkXTYTi4OipM5G97gK9jnYIk.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1066298'),
  ('885609654061722268', 'Full Spead Ahead', 1951, 'Comedy, Music', 'Ismael Rodríguez, James L. Fields, Jack Draper', 'Ismael Rodríguez, Pedro de Urdimalas', 'Pedro Infante, Luis Aguilar, Aurora Segura, Alma Delia Fuentes, Delorice Archer, Emma Rodríguez, Carlos Valadez, Amelia Wilhelmy', null, 'A drifter lands a job as an officer in México City''s elite motorcycle police unit and gets home with a mate of this unit. The mate is in love with a girl, but he and she are always making jealous to each other. The drifter and the mate get involved themselves in a fight to become the winner of conquering ladies and performing unit acrobatic tricks, interfering with their friendship and profession.', 'A drifter lands a job as an officer in México City''s elite motorcycle police unit and gets home with a mate of this unit. The mate is in love with a girl, but he and she are always making jealous to each other. The drifter and the mate get involved themselves in a fight to become the winner of conquering ladies and performing unit acrobatic tricks, interfering with their friendship and profession.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3ZIf596gdON4qQ7fexlmKHLegtH.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:71652'),
  ('1134972280892736534', 'Full Speed', 1996, 'Romance, Drama', 'Gaël Morel, Jeanne Lapoirie', 'Catherine Corsini, Gaël Morel', 'Élodie Bouchez, Stéphane Rideau, Pascal Cervo, Mezziane Bardadi, Romain Auger, Salim Kéchiouche, Mohammed Dib', null, 'A brief extract of four kids'' lives somewhere in France. Quentin, who won a writers contest and now pays more attention to his career as an author than to his friends, beautiful Julie, his girl-friend, much more mature than she looks, falling in love with Quentin''s very best friend Jimmy, who is kind of stuck in his unability of self-expression and grown up under bad social circumstances. And there is the shy boy Samir, exiled from Algeria, who lost his "brother" and only friend some time ago. Samir heavily falls in love with Quentin, but he can''t handle it...', 'A brief extract of four kids'' lives somewhere in France. Quentin, who won a writers contest and now pays more attention to his career as an author than to his friends, beautiful Julie, his girl-friend, much more mature than she looks, falling in love with Quentin''s very best friend Jimmy, who is kind of stuck in his unability of self-expression and grown up under bad social circumstances. And there is the shy boy Samir, exiled from Algeria, who lost his "brother" and only friend some time ago. Samir heavily falls in love with Quentin, but he can''t handle it...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7IBinPgeZtAOx5qFxTEbJozc6a1.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:12799'),
  ('119832173084900668', 'Full Speed', 2016, 'Family, Comedy, Action', 'Nicolas Benamou, Antoine Marteau', 'Fabrice Roger-Lacan, Frédéric Jardin, Nicolas Benamou', 'José Garcia, André Dussollier, Caroline Vigneaux, Charlotte Gabris, Vincent Desagnat, Josephine Callies, Stylane Lecaille, Jérôme Commandeur', null, 'A family together with their grandpa go on a vacation, when their new car won''t stop and it nearly escapes crashing into a hundred cars.', 'A family together with their grandpa go on a vacation, when their new car won''t stop and it nearly escapes crashing into a hundred cars.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hrExpoA2E2bCrSZ6VPWHHdzY2y.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:382598'),
  ('634089551507147153', 'Full Throttle', 1995, 'Action, Drama', 'Derek Yee, David Chung, Jingle Ma Choh-Sing', 'Lo Chi-Leung, Derek Yee', 'Andy Lau, Gigi Leung Wing-Kei, David Wu, Paul Chun Pui, Chin Ka-Lok, Elvis Tsui Kam-Kong, Katherine Lau Ying-Hung, Teresa Ha Ping', null, 'Joe is a champion motorcycle racer who is forced to question his entire lifestyle after he and some close friends are seriously injured in motorcycle accidents. He subsequently struggles to maintain his identity as a risk-taker; and fights to maintain and redefine his relationships with his fiancée, his friends, and his estranged father.', 'Joe is a champion motorcycle racer who is forced to question his entire lifestyle after he and some close friends are seriously injured in motorcycle accidents. He subsequently struggles to maintain his identity as a risk-taker; and fights to maintain and redefine his relationships with his fiancée, his friends, and his estranged father.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sBy7SRP79R5HbiPpHhee9VcQlDj.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:53720'),
  ('696109247340989191', 'Full Tilt Boogie', 1998, 'Documentary', 'Sarah Kelly, Christopher Gallo, Dan Ortiz', null, 'Rick Stribling, Kevin Bondy, Amy Minda Cohen, Elizabeth Avellan, Dieter Busch, Cecilia Montiel, Greg Nicotero, Victoria Lucai', 'R', 'A documentary about the production of From Dusk Till Dawn (1996) and the people who made it.', 'A documentary about the production of From Dusk Till Dawn (1996) and the people who made it.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/88AiFDwQHuGjE6ZfunMQNNjIEDw.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:36606'),
  ('157974265321055998', 'Full Time', 2022, 'Drama', 'Eric Gravel, Victor Seguin, Lucile Jacques', 'Eric Gravel', 'Laure Calamy, Anne Suarez, Geneviève Mnich, Nolan Arizmendi, Sasha Lemaître Cremaschi, Cyril Gueï, Lucie Gallo, Agathe Dronne', null, 'Julie finally gets an interview for a job where she can raise her children better only to run into a national transit strike.', 'Julie finally gets an interview for a job where she can raise her children better only to run into a national transit strike.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nH6MyOu4wdHnI3Im7PtpaqVRGQB.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:833417'),
  ('1083723325909892071', 'Full-Court Miracle', 2003, 'TV Movie, Family', 'Stuart Gillard, Thomas Burstyn, Jack Boem', 'Joel Kauffmann, Joel Silverman, Donald C. Yost', 'Alex D. Linz, Richard T. Jones, R.H. Thomson, Sean Marquette, Jase Blankfort, Erik Knudsen, David Sazant, Sheila McCarthy', null, 'Inspired by the true story of University of Virginia basketball star Lamont Carr, the film centers on a group of young Jewish basketball players who search for a coach to help them out of a slump. The main character Alex Schlotsky is inspired by the true story of Alex Barbag and Chad Korpeck.', 'Inspired by the true story of University of Virginia basketball star Lamont Carr, the film centers on a group of young Jewish basketball players who search for a coach to help them out of a slump. The main character Alex Schlotsky is inspired by the true story of Alex Barbag and Chad Korpeck.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/f2ijqurlC6fvqWORioahgVXTvKj.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:158265'),
  ('102138380518981363', 'Fuller Report, Base Stockholm', 1968, 'Action, Thriller', 'Sergio Grieco, Stelvio Massi', null, 'Ken Clark, Beba Lončar, Lincoln Tate, Jess Hahn', null, 'Dick Worth (Ken Clark) is an American racing driver in Stockholm to put on an exhibition that his boss Bennet (Jess Hahn) hopes will result in orders for cars, and instead gets drawn into CIA business when he is mistaken for a spy and takes on the job of recovering the Fuller Report, CIA information about an assassination plot.', 'Dick Worth (Ken Clark) is an American racing driver in Stockholm to put on an exhibition that his boss Bennet (Jess Hahn) hopes will result in orders for cars, and instead gets drawn into CIA business when he is mistaken for a spy and takes on the job of recovering the Fuller Report, CIA information about an assassination plot.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aY3NZS7kE2Q4X1kPTQ6l3udFG4l.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:141229'),
  ('54814988387340549', 'Fullmetal Alchemist', 2017, 'Fantasy, Action, Science Fiction, Adventure', 'Fumihiko Sori, Keiji Hashimoto', 'Takeshi Miyamoto, Fumihiko Sori', 'Ryosuke Yamada, Atomu Mizuishi, Tsubasa Honda, Dean Fujioka, Misako Renbutsu, Yasuko Matsuyuki, Kanata Hongo, Jun Kunimura', 'PG-13', 'Two alchemist brothers go on a quest for the Philosopher''s Stone after an attempt to revive their dead mother goes horribly wrong.', 'Two alchemist brothers go on a quest for the Philosopher''s Stone after an attempt to revive their dead mother goes horribly wrong.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kWJtS0XFHxH2ADkWX8P7WISDnX3.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:426285'),
  ('800077846870146935', 'Fullmetal Alchemist the Movie: Conqueror of Shamballa', 2005, 'Action, Adventure, Animation, Drama', 'Seiji Mizushima, Yoshiyuki Ito, Eiko Saito', 'Sho Aikawa', 'Romi Park, Rie Kugimiya, Toru Okawa, Megumi Toyoguchi, Miyuu Sawai, Michiko Neya, Kazuko Kato, Hidekatsu Shibata', 'PG-13', 'Munich, Germany, 1923. Two years have passed since Edward Elric was dragged from his own world to ours, leaving behind his country, his friends and his younger brother, Alphonse. Stripped of his alchemical powers, he has been all this time researching rocketry together with Alphonse Heiderich, a young man who resembles his own brother, hoping to one day find a way back home. His efforts so far had proven fruitless, but after lending a hand to a troubled gipsy girl, Edward is thrown in a series of events that can wreak havoc in both worlds. Meanwhile, at his own world, Alphonse Elric ventures deeper into the mysteries of alchemy in search for a way to reunite with his older brother.', 'Munich, Germany, 1923. Two years have passed since Edward Elric was dragged from his own world to ours, leaving behind his country, his friends and his younger brother, Alphonse. Stripped of his alchemical powers, he has been all this time researching rocketry together with Alphonse Heiderich, a young man who resembles his own brother, hoping to one day find a way back home. His efforts so far had proven fruitless, but after lending a hand to a troubled gipsy girl, Edward is thrown in a series of events that can wreak havoc in both worlds. Meanwhile, at his own world, Alphonse Elric ventures deeper into the mysteries of alchemy in search for a way to reunite with his older brother.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kdovrjrKighUFEh9ZRQul0Evx6L.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:14003'),
  ('432003085002659904', 'Fullmetal Alchemist: The Final Alchemy', 2022, 'Action, Adventure, Fantasy', 'Fumihiko Sori, Kentaro Harada, Eri Nagao', 'Takeshi Miyamoto, Fumihiko Sori', 'Ryosuke Yamada, Atomu Mizuishi, Tsubasa Honda, Dean Fujioka, Mackenyu, Misako Renbutsu, Kanata Hongo, Yuina Kuroshima', 'PG-13', 'The Elric brothers’ long and winding journey comes to a close in this epic finale, where they must face off against an unworldly, nationwide threat.', 'The Elric brothers’ long and winding journey comes to a close in this epic finale, where they must face off against an unworldly, nationwide threat.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/AeyiuQUUs78bPkz18FY3AzNFF8b.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:960704'),
  ('193324692266073992', 'Fullmetal Alchemist: The Revenge of Scar', 2022, 'Fantasy, Action, Adventure', 'Fumihiko Sori, Kentaro Harada, Eri Nagao', 'Fumihiko Sori, Takeshi Miyamoto', 'Ryosuke Yamada, Atomu Mizuishi, Mackenyu, Tsubasa Honda, Dean Fujioka, Jun Fubuki, Naohito Fujiki, Yuina Kuroshima', 'PG-13', 'The Elric brothers meet their toughest opponent yet — a lone serial killer with a large scar on his forehead.', 'The Elric brothers meet their toughest opponent yet — a lone serial killer with a large scar on his forehead.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/c5OwwBNyJkwyroIOIJL9IiRjydR.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:960700'),
  ('851380627367735715', 'Fullmetal Alchemist: The Sacred Star of Milos', 2011, 'Adventure, Fantasy, Animation, Action, Science Fiction', 'Masaru Ohshiro, Kenichi Konishi, Shingo Natsume', 'Yuichi Shinpo', 'Romi Park, Rie Kugimiya, Maaya Sakamoto, Toshiyuki Morikawa, Sakiko Tamagawa, Shin-ichiro Miki, Hidenobu Kiuchi, Fumiko Orikasa', 'PG-13', 'A fugitive alchemist with mysterious abilities leads the Elric brothers to a distant valley of slums inhabited by the Milos, a proud people struggling against bureaucratic exploitation. Ed and Al quickly find themselves in the middle of a rising rebellion, as the exiled Milos lash out against their oppressors. At the heart of the conflict is Julia, a young alchemist befriended by Alphonse. She''ll stop at nothing to restore the Milos to their former glory – even if that means harnessing the awful power of the mythical Philosopher''s Stone.', 'A fugitive alchemist with mysterious abilities leads the Elric brothers to a distant valley of slums inhabited by the Milos, a proud people struggling against bureaucratic exploitation. Ed and Al quickly find themselves in the middle of a rising rebellion, as the exiled Milos lash out against their oppressors. At the heart of the conflict is Julia, a young alchemist befriended by Alphonse. She''ll stop at nothing to restore the Milos to their former glory – even if that means harnessing the awful power of the mythical Philosopher''s Stone.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7RvBQOTZGhCoPvLiF3Ugp2Q94Ux.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:80518'),
  ('221766667210727190', 'Fulltime Killer', 2001, 'Action, Crime, Drama, Thriller', 'Johnnie To, Cheng Siu-Keung, Wai Ka-Fai', 'Wai Ka-Fai, Joey O''Bryan', 'Andy Lau, Takashi Sorimachi, Simon Yam, Kelly Lin Hsi-Lei, Cherrie Ying Choi-Yi, Lam Suet, Teddy Lin Wai-Kin, Patrick Ling Chi-Hung', null, 'Professional assassin O has resided in an isolated world of killing and loneliness. But his life begins to change once he meets the innocent Chin; hired to clean O''s apartment. However, soon the flamboyent and reckless Tok enters Chin''s life with a mission to unveil O''s identity and usurp his place as the number one sharp-shooting assassin in the game.', 'Professional assassin O has resided in an isolated world of killing and loneliness. But his life begins to change once he meets the innocent Chin; hired to clean O''s apartment. However, soon the flamboyent and reckless Tok enters Chin''s life with a mission to unveil O''s identity and usurp his place as the number one sharp-shooting assassin in the game.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pB2lXLvZDaFqi6d8La3fofabgH7.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:9581'),
  ('531945521945700074', 'Fulta Fisher''s Boarding House', 1922, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Frank Capra, Roy Wiggins', 'Walter Montague, Rudyard Kipling', 'Mildred Owens, Olaf Skavlan, Ethan Allen, Gerald Griffin, Oreste Seragnoli', null, 'Fulta Fisher runs a boarding house catering to seamen passing through the port. A girl known as Anne of Austria has had many lovers amongst the sailors, but presently she''s known to be the "property" of Salem Hardieker, a tough Bostonian. When Anne''s eye drifts to a new potential lover, Hans the Dane, he spurns her, knowing she''s Salem''s girl. But hell hath no fury like a woman scorned....', 'Fulta Fisher runs a boarding house catering to seamen passing through the port. A girl known as Anne of Austria has had many lovers amongst the sailors, but presently she''s known to be the "property" of Salem Hardieker, a tough Bostonian. When Anne''s eye drifts to a new potential lover, Hans the Dane, he spurns her, knowing she''s Salem''s girl. But hell hath no fury like a woman scorned....', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zV7rlRREr8ERsmB5bPGhG0LCHYx.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:175553'),
  ('1122263963515927566', 'Fumando Espero', 2013, 'Drama', 'Pablo R. Escola, Eduardo Casanova, Javier Guerra', 'Eduardo Casanova', 'Cristina Fenollar, Adrián Expósito, Eduardo Velasco', null, 'She only smokes and waits for the man she loves. Sometimes we fall for the wrong person even if we are aware of it. But blind love, insane love can fight against all and 100 hours waiting with 100 cigarettes is the least a woman can do when she is madly in love.', 'She only smokes and waits for the man she loves. Sometimes we fall for the wrong person even if we are aware of it. But blind love, insane love can fight against all and 100 hours waiting with 100 cigarettes is the least a woman can do when she is madly in love.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5luxc0JUcO6vYZNDsOpjpoAgasB.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:342041'),
