  ('175901334157079682', 'Fun', 1994, 'Drama, Thriller, Romance', 'Rafal Zielinski, Rick Baer, Nancy Tracy', 'James Bosley', 'Alicia Witt, Renée Humphrey, William R. Moses, Leslie Hope, Ania Suli, Leah Kourtne Ballantine', null, 'Hillary and Bonnie meet one morning by the side of the road. They become fast friends, share their secrets, and, on a rising wave of frenzy, later that afternoon, murder an old woman. They did it, they say later, for fun.', 'Hillary and Bonnie meet one morning by the side of the road. They become fast friends, share their secrets, and, on a rising wave of frenzy, later that afternoon, murder an old woman. They did it, they say later, for fun.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vXsCYOI6v3baMTzLlMho78FO6Hn.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:33135'),
