  ('936910508039535916', 'Fun Is Beautiful', 1980, 'Comedy', 'Ennio Morricone, Roberto Giandalia, Carlo Verdone', 'Leonardo Benvenuti, Piero De Bernardi, Carlo Verdone', 'Carlo Verdone, Verónica Miriel, Mario Brega, Renato Scarpa, Fausto Di Bella, Isabella De Bernardi, Sandro Ghiani, Maria Mizar', null, 'Three characters'' misadventures in semi-deserted, summertime Rome: a dim-witted mama''s boy falls for a tourist; a would-be womanizer struggles to find company for his sex tourism trip to Kraków; a hippie is drawn into his father''s schemes to bring him back into polite society.', 'Three characters'' misadventures in semi-deserted, summertime Rome: a dim-witted mama''s boy falls for a tourist; a would-be womanizer struggles to find company for his sex tourism trip to Kraków; a hippie is drawn into his father''s schemes to bring him back into polite society.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bm51SNYlcohegsZOy9thxy1JtOg.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:37767'),
  ('225381026149388275', 'Fun Mom Dinner', 2017, 'Comedy', 'Alethea Jones, Sean McElwee', 'Julie Rudd', 'Katie Aselton, Toni Collette, Bridget Everett, Molly Shannon, Adam Scott, Rob Huebel, Adam Levine, Paul Rust', null, 'Four women, whose kids attend the same preschool class, get together for a "fun mom dinner". When the night takes an unexpected turn, these unlikely new friends realize they have more in common than just marriage and motherhood.', 'Four women, whose kids attend the same preschool class, get together for a "fun mom dinner". When the night takes an unexpected turn, these unlikely new friends realize they have more in common than just marriage and motherhood.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/drT9iDmZQLaADv8dPFuSR5ZqQjA.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:432787'),
  ('301071312769543448', 'Fun Size', 2012, 'Comedy', 'Josh Schwartz, Yaron Orbach, Mark Anthony Little', 'Max Werner', 'Victoria Justice, Jane Levy, Thomas Mann, Thomas McDonell, Chelsea Handler, Jackson Nicoll, Osric Chau, Thomas Middleditch', 'PG-13', 'Wren''s Halloween plans go awry when she''s made to babysit her brother, who disappears into a sea of trick-or-treaters. Accompanied by her best friend and two nerdy classmates, Wren needs to find her brother before her mom finds out.', 'Wren''s Halloween plans go awry when she''s made to babysit her brother, who disappears into a sea of trick-or-treaters. Accompanied by her best friend and two nerdy classmates, Wren needs to find her brother before her mom finds out.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/h9DYic4zo3Oweb11009FmqZBxN4.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:82679'),
  ('294295149261353165', 'Fun Sunday', 1935, 'Comedy', 'Jacques Berr', 'Rhum, Jacques Tati', 'Rhum, Jacques Tati', null, 'Jacques Tati and his friend Rhum star as down-and-outs (very much their situation in reality at the time) who try to generate funds by providing an impromptu leisure tour in a rickety bus they wangle use of for free.', 'Jacques Tati and his friend Rhum star as down-and-outs (very much their situation in reality at the time) who try to generate funds by providing an impromptu leisure tour in a rickety bus they wangle use of for free.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zHSrMtJ5L9OBiAL7J4QPn7XoJrc.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:224416'),
  ('876045002419126165', 'Fun with Dick and Jane', 1977, 'Comedy, Crime', 'Ted Kotcheff, Fred J. Koenekamp, Charles Okun', 'Mordecai Richler, David Giler, Jerry Belson', 'George Segal, Jane Fonda, Ed McMahon, Richard Gautier, Allan Miller, Hank Garcia, John Dehner, Walter Brooke', 'PG', 'When an upwardly mobile couple find themselves unemployed and in debt, they turn to armed robbery in desperation.', 'When an upwardly mobile couple find themselves unemployed and in debt, they turn to armed robbery in desperation.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/obBXkCU29eRzbVX5erjrAxugOpN.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:24109'),
  ('553480418654173105', 'Fun with Dick and Jane', 2005, 'Comedy, Crime', 'Dean Parisot, Jerzy Zieliński, Troy Sizemore', 'Judd Apatow, Nicholas Stoller', 'Jim Carrey, Téa Leoni, Alec Baldwin, Richard Jenkins, John Michael Higgins, Angie Harmon, Richard Burgi, Carlos Jacott', 'PG-13', 'After Dick Harper loses his job at Globodyne in an Enron-esque collapse, he and his wife, Jane, turn to crime in order to handle the massive debt they now face. Two intelligent people, Dick and Jane actually get pretty good at robbing people and even enjoy it -- but they have second thoughts when they''re reminded that crime can hurt innocent people. When the couple hears that Globodyne boss Jack McCallister actually swindled the company, they plot revenge.', 'After Dick Harper loses his job at Globodyne in an Enron-esque collapse, he and his wife, Jane, turn to crime in order to handle the massive debt they now face. Two intelligent people, Dick and Jane actually get pretty good at robbing people and even enjoy it -- but they have second thoughts when they''re reminded that crime can hurt innocent people. When the couple hears that Globodyne boss Jack McCallister actually swindled the company, they plot revenge.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xTcIPKpzCqQUQixNPS0Rb7HPEAf.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:7552'),
  ('217644676586949271', 'Fun2shh... Dudes in the 10th Century', 2003, 'Fantasy, Comedy', 'Imtiaz Punjabi', 'Rajesh Khattar', 'Paresh Rawal, Kader Khan, Mohammed Iqbal Khan, Anuj Sawhney, Gulshan Grover, Raima Sen, Kanwarjeet Paintal, Ashish Vidhyarthi', null, 'Vikram (Mohammad Iqbal Khan) and Ajay (Anuj Sawhney), and an accomplice, John D''Souza (Paresh Rawal), become prime suspects, and are on the run. They must apprehend Chindi and recover the crown to absolve themselves of this crime. While being chased by security guards, the trio crash into a wall, and are transported back to the 10th century, straight into the palace of Emperor Babushah himself.They realize that only a miracle can get them back to the 21st century.', 'Vikram (Mohammad Iqbal Khan) and Ajay (Anuj Sawhney), and an accomplice, John D''Souza (Paresh Rawal), become prime suspects, and are on the run. They must apprehend Chindi and recover the crown to absolve themselves of this crime. While being chased by security guards, the trio crash into a wall, and are transported back to the 10th century, straight into the palace of Emperor Babushah himself.They realize that only a miracle can get them back to the 21st century.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pET3uiCiis26wbxKek4cHaQKeP.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:433718'),
  ('708564667154670678', 'Funan', 2019, 'Animation, Drama, History', 'Denis Do, Éléonore Guerra, Nilton Martins', 'Denis Do, Magali Pouzol', 'Bérénice Bejo, Louis Garrel, Colette Kieffer, Aude-Laurence Clermont Biver, Brice Montagne, Franck Sasonoff, Hervé Sogne, Maxime Baudoin', null, 'Cambodia, once the ancient kingdom of Funan, April 17th, 1975. The entire country falls under the tyranny of Angkar, the communist party of the Khmer Rouge. The cities are abandoned, the population is thrown to the roads and forced to walk towards an uncertain future…', 'Cambodia, once the ancient kingdom of Funan, April 17th, 1975. The entire country falls under the tyranny of Angkar, the communist party of the Khmer Rouge. The cities are abandoned, the population is thrown to the roads and forced to walk towards an uncertain future…', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3qYbFI52dvNpfAtfvYP13iGIXez.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:515353'),
  ('785553716751919046', 'Funeral in Berlin', 1966, 'Thriller', 'Guy Hamilton, Otto Heller, Michael Stevenson', 'Evan Jones', 'Michael Caine, Paul Hubschmid, Oskar Homolka, Eva Renzi, Guy Doleman, Hugh Burden, Heinz Schubert, Wolfgang Völz', null, 'Colonel Stok, a Soviet intelligence officer responsible for security at the Berlin Wall, appears to want to defect but the evidence is contradictory. Stok wants the British to handle his defection and asks for one of their agents, Harry Palmer, to smuggle him out of East Germany.', 'Colonel Stok, a Soviet intelligence officer responsible for security at the Berlin Wall, appears to want to defect but the evidence is contradictory. Stok wants the British to handle his defection and asks for one of their agents, Harry Palmer, to smuggle him out of East Germany.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xT15D124pyoq3HWDpuhoJTqLfFM.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:34388'),
  ('341015541924516822', 'Funeral Parade of Roses', 1969, 'Drama', 'Toshio Matsumoto, Hirohisa Yamazaki, Tatsuo Suzuki', 'Toshio Matsumoto', 'Shinnosuke Ikehata, Yoshio Tsuchiya, Emiko Azuma, Toshiya Fujita, Kiyoshi Awazu, Osamu Ogasawara, Yoshimi Jô, Koichi Nakamura', null, 'In 1960s Tokyo, Gonda owns a bar in which the gay, cross-dresser, and trans scenes meet. Gonda is in a relationship with the madam of the bar, Leda. As the younger Eddie starts a passionate affair with Gonda, she ignites the jealousy of Leda, unaware of another kind of history between them.', 'In 1960s Tokyo, Gonda owns a bar in which the gay, cross-dresser, and trans scenes meet. Gonda is in a relationship with the madam of the bar, Leda. As the younger Eddie starts a passionate affair with Gonda, she ignites the jealousy of Leda, unaware of another kind of history between them.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7cRQ6rSGajW2soWDr3voEN2rgYO.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1556'),
  ('697570437736000309', 'Funeralopolis: A Suburban Portrait', 2017, 'Documentary', 'Alessandro Redaelli', 'Alessandro Redaelli, Ruggero Melis, Daniele Fagone', 'Andrea Piva, Lorenzo Passera', null, 'Between Bresso, Sesto San Giovanni and Milan, we immerse ourselves in the lives of Vash and Felce, who together make music, do heroin and share everything. Their reality is sometimes brutal, often comical, tragic and romantic.', 'Between Bresso, Sesto San Giovanni and Milan, we immerse ourselves in the lives of Vash and Felce, who together make music, do heroin and share everything. Their reality is sometimes brutal, often comical, tragic and romantic.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vZthJTI0mO3XM6zcQKp4x98dQsx.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:540878'),
  ('538799393041262637', 'Funhouse', 2019, 'Horror', 'Jason William Lee', 'Jason William Lee', 'Valter Skarsgård, Khamisa Wilsher, Gigi Saul Guerrero, Karolina Benefield, Amanda Howells, Jerome Velinsky, Christopher Gerard, Dayleigh Nelson', 'R', 'When 8 celebrities from around the globe are invited to compete in an online reality show, they soon realize that they are playing for their very lives, as those voted off suffer horrific consequences, broadcast live to the entire world.', 'When 8 celebrities from around the globe are invited to compete in an online reality show, they soon realize that they are playing for their very lives, as those voted off suffer horrific consequences, broadcast live to the entire world.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/i6zNpDVwOvVxOJ4MhP7WjrXbM0W.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:590009'),
