  ('187945423008623474', 'Funky Monkey', 2004, 'Family, Comedy', 'Harry Basil, Eric Bartonio, Harry Basil', 'Gene Quintano', 'Matthew Modine, Roma Downey, Seth Adkins, Tommy Davidson, Taylor Negron, Gilbert Gottfried, Liliana Komorowska, Bodhi Elfman', 'G', 'A teen genius teams up with a super-talented chimpanzee and his caretaker to take down an animal testing lab. In exchange, the scientist gives the teen some pointers on the girl of his dreams.', 'A teen genius teams up with a super-talented chimpanzee and his caretaker to take down an animal testing lab. In exchange, the scientist gives the teen some pointers on the girl of his dreams.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zBVDA9WnoSA0hg4nk04HQLR3dor.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:63459'),
