  ('1132049178205904850', 'Funny Dirty Little War', 1983, 'Comedy', 'Héctor Olivera, Leonardo Rodríguez Solís', 'Roberto Cossa, Héctor Olivera', 'Federico Luppi, Ulises Dumont, Víctor Laplace, Miguel Ángel Solá, Héctor Bidonde, Rodolfo Ranni, Graciela Dufau, Julio De Grazia', null, 'A small revolution breaks out in a small Argentine town, as one group of Peronists calls they newly elected peronist a communist. The newly elected official enlists the aid of allies ranging from the town drunk to young peronists to help hold his post. What follows is a slapstick war with a serious message.', 'A small revolution breaks out in a small Argentine town, as one group of Peronists calls they newly elected peronist a communist. The newly elected official enlists the aid of allies ranging from the town drunk to young peronists to help hold his post. What follows is a slapstick war with a serious message.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/AlsJZuEslZnw15CouwINoJh3nk4.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:246896'),
  ('296388495320501749', 'Funny Face', 1957, 'Music, Comedy, Romance', 'Ray June, Stanley Donen, William McGarry', 'Leonard Gershe', 'Audrey Hepburn, Fred Astaire, Kay Thompson, Michel Auclair, Robert Flemyng, Dovima, Suzy Parker, Sunny Hartnett', 'NR', 'A shy Greenwich Village book clerk is discovered by a fashion photographer and whisked off to Paris where she becomes a reluctant model.', 'A shy Greenwich Village book clerk is discovered by a fashion photographer and whisked off to Paris where she becomes a reluctant model.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tzTjalpIz6NyFrWPPlOBFoBjb7z.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:13320'),
  ('865654515817069245', 'Funny Farm', 1988, 'Comedy', 'George Roy Hill, Jim Van Wyck, Michael Rapley', 'Jeffrey Boam', 'Chevy Chase, Madolyn Smith Osborne, Kevin O''Morrison, Joseph Maher, Jack Gilpin, Caris Corfman, William Severs, Mike Starr', 'PG', 'Sportswriter Andy Farmer moves with his schoolteacher wife Elizabeth to the country in order to write a novel in relative seclusion. Of course, seclusion is the last thing the Farmers find in the small, eccentric town, where disaster awaits them at every turn.', 'Sportswriter Andy Farmer moves with his schoolteacher wife Elizabeth to the country in order to write a novel in relative seclusion. Of course, seclusion is the last thing the Farmers find in the small, eccentric town, where disaster awaits them at every turn.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/i4ExIbPuAe0rAjpYcteiFx4QEfY.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:14170'),
  ('897240334682437161', 'Funny Games', 1997, 'Drama, Horror, Thriller', 'Michael Haneke, Jürgen Jürges', 'Michael Haneke', 'Susanne Lothar, Ulrich Mühe, Arno Frisch, Frank Giering, Stefan Clapczynski, Doris Kunstmann, Christoph Bantzer, Wolfgang Glück', 'R', 'Two psychotic young men take a mother, father, and son hostage in their vacation cabin and force them to play sadistic "games" with one another for their own amusement.', 'Two psychotic young men take a mother, father, and son hostage in their vacation cabin and force them to play sadistic "games" with one another for their own amusement.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vUJxLlRGM6KfXQDeAHqyMyhrI59.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:10234'),
  ('216453186154929094', 'Funny Games', 2008, 'Thriller, Horror', 'Michael Haneke, Darius Khondji, Beth Kuhn', 'Michael Haneke', 'Naomi Watts, Tim Roth, Michael Pitt, Brady Corbet, Devon Gearhart, Boyd Gaines, Siobhan Fallon Hogan, Robert LuPone', 'R', 'When Ann, husband George, and son Georgie arrive at their holiday home they are visited by a pair of polite and seemingly pleasant young men. Armed with deceptively sweet smiles and some golf clubs, they proceed to terrorize and torture the tight-knit clan, giving them until the next day to survive.', 'When Ann, husband George, and son Georgie arrive at their holiday home they are visited by a pair of polite and seemingly pleasant young men. Armed with deceptively sweet smiles and some golf clubs, they proceed to terrorize and torture the tight-knit clan, giving them until the next day to survive.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zs92sAOh3Q0kDIJkgaJFTBzSFka.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:8461'),
  ('658379393281528374', 'Funny Girl', 1968, 'Comedy, Drama, Romance', 'William Wyler, Harry Stradling Sr., Wendell Franklin', 'Isobel Lennart', 'Barbra Streisand, Omar Sharif, Kay Medford, Anne Francis, Walter Pidgeon, Lee Allen, Mae Questel, Gerald Mohr', 'G', 'The life of famed 1930s comedienne Fanny Brice, from her early days in the Jewish slums of New York, to the height of her career with the Ziegfeld Follies, as well as her marriage to the rakish gambler Nick Arnstein.', 'The life of famed 1930s comedienne Fanny Brice, from her early days in the Jewish slums of New York, to the height of her career with the Ziegfeld Follies, as well as her marriage to the rakish gambler Nick Arnstein.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ywjXHWUK0niM26UKy7DTCErWTFz.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:16085'),
  ('193579659616561797', 'Funny Ha Ha', 2003, 'Drama, Comedy, Romance', 'Andrew Bujalski, Matthias Grunsky, Phill Zagajewski', 'Andrew Bujalski', 'Kate Dollenmayer, Mark Herlehy, Christian Rudder, Jennifer L. Schaper, Myles Paige, Marshall Lewy, Andrew Bujalski, Danny Miller', 'NR', 'Unsure of what to do next, 23-year-old Marnie tries her best to navigate life after college. Still partying like there''s no tomorrow, Marnie drags herself out of bed for her miserable temp job and can''t decide whether she''s wasting her time going after best buddy Alex, who doesn''t seem to be interested.', 'Unsure of what to do next, 23-year-old Marnie tries her best to navigate life after college. Still partying like there''s no tomorrow, Marnie drags herself out of bed for her miserable temp job and can''t decide whether she''s wasting her time going after best buddy Alex, who doesn''t seem to be interested.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4UsciNkAvuOZiM7ZfgLbfNR0WNJ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:33693'),
  ('652213888178455016', 'Funny Lady', 1975, 'Comedy, Drama, Romance', 'Herbert Ross, James Wong Howe, Jack Roe', 'Arnold Schulman, Jay Presson Allen', 'Barbra Streisand, James Caan, Omar Sharif, Roddy McDowall, Ben Vereen, Carole Wells, Larry Gates, Eugene Troobnick', 'PG', 'Famous singer Fanny Brice has divorced her first husband Nicky Arnstein. During the Great Depression she has trouble finding work as an artist, but meets Billy Rose, a newcomer who writes lyrics and owns a nightclub.', 'Famous singer Fanny Brice has divorced her first husband Nicky Arnstein. During the Great Depression she has trouble finding work as an artist, but meets Billy Rose, a newcomer who writes lyrics and owns a nightclub.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3F6BcS3hW9YolzHuAMluXSiDES7.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:39282'),
  ('324498797193013756', 'Funny Little Bunnies', 1934, 'Animation', 'Wilfred Jackson', null, 'Florence Gill', 'NR', 'We see bunny rabbits preparing for Easter, by making chocolate eggs and rabbits, decorating eggs, and weaving and filling baskets.', 'We see bunny rabbits preparing for Easter, by making chocolate eggs and rabbits, decorating eggs, and weaving and filling baskets.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9foDYpy6tdRvmwAFVkU7JvEElIM.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:107662'),
  ('1031458180324453229', 'Funny Man', 1994, 'Horror, Comedy', 'Simon Sprackling, Tom Ingle Jr., Toby Duckett', 'Simon Sprackling', 'Christopher Lee, Ingrid Lacey, Tim James, Benny Young, Pauline Black, Matthew Devitt, Chris Walker, Rhona Cameron', null, 'When Max Taylor wins the ancestral home of Callum Chance in a game of Poker, little does he realize that the game is far from over. One by one, Max''s family are murdered by the Funny Man, a demonic jester with a varied and imaginative repertoire of homicidal techniques and an irreverent sense of humor. Meanwhile, Max''s brother is on his way to the mansion with a bunch of hitchhikers who will be lucky to survive the night.', 'When Max Taylor wins the ancestral home of Callum Chance in a game of Poker, little does he realize that the game is far from over. One by one, Max''s family are murdered by the Funny Man, a demonic jester with a varied and imaginative repertoire of homicidal techniques and an irreverent sense of humor. Meanwhile, Max''s brother is on his way to the mansion with a bunch of hitchhikers who will be lucky to survive the night.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/11g73aKXNFMLMtZ9VgyQPPUNt0T.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:104205'),
  ('360510986682942216', 'Funny Money', 2006, 'Comedy, Crime', 'Leslie Greif, Bill Butler', null, 'Chevy Chase, Penelope Ann Miller, Armand Assante, Christopher McDonald, Robert Loggia, Guy Torry, Alex Meneses, Kevin Sussman', 'R', 'Henry Perkins, a mild-mannered accountant, accidentally trades briefcases with another man, to find out that there''s a million dollars inside. Henry tells his unsuspecting wife of their new-found fortune, but she doesn''t embrace it as well as he does. Soon they''re joined by their best friends, a cop on the take, a cop on the hunt, and the dreaded Mr. Big, who has come to claim his money.', 'Henry Perkins, a mild-mannered accountant, accidentally trades briefcases with another man, to find out that there''s a million dollars inside. Henry tells his unsuspecting wife of their new-found fortune, but she doesn''t embrace it as well as he does. Soon they''re joined by their best friends, a cop on the take, a cop on the hunt, and the dreaded Mr. Big, who has come to claim his money.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oG3jWUZiDqqrdk3oKwPEkuwoN89.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:9925'),
  ('1098918503149879161', 'Funny Pages', 2022, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Hunter Zimny, Alice Johnson, Sophie Lilla', 'Owen Kline', 'Daniel Zolghadri, Matthew Maher, Miles Emanuel, Maria Dizzia, Josh Pais, Stephen Adly Guirgis, Marcia DeBonis, Michael Townsend Wright', 'R', 'A teenage cartoonist rejects the comforts of his suburban life in a misguided quest for soul.', 'A teenage cartoonist rejects the comforts of his suburban life in a misguided quest for soul.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gCgdVvExdHM9Qjtc8yoN7MRrC7x.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:583095'),
  ('185851657942494479', 'Funny People', 1976, 'Comedy', 'Jamie Uys, Kobus Kruger', 'Jamie Uys', 'Joe Stewardson, Jamie Uys, Bill Brewer', null, 'What would you do if you were walking along the street and a cute little lady rushed up to you and gave you a smashing kiss, as if you’d known each other for years? And how does one remain cool as a cucumber when you’re busy with an important audition and the chair you are sitting on gets hotter and hotter until you have to jump up in discomfort to save your behind?', 'What would you do if you were walking along the street and a cute little lady rushed up to you and gave you a smashing kiss, as if you’d known each other for years? And how does one remain cool as a cucumber when you’re busy with an important audition and the chair you are sitting on gets hotter and hotter until you have to jump up in discomfort to save your behind?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xt34HigLm3eS2BB8LRYCLmLiPrB.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:225582'),
  ('377558828928224359', 'Funny People', 2009, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Judd Apatow, Janusz Kamiński, Matt Rebenkoff', 'Judd Apatow', 'Adam Sandler, Seth Rogen, Leslie Mann, Eric Bana, Jonah Hill, Jason Schwartzman, Aubrey Plaza, RZA', 'R', 'Famous and wealthy funnyman George Simmons doesn''t give much thought to how he treats people until a doctor delivers stunning health news, forcing George to reevaluate his priorities with a little help from aspiring stand-up comic Ira.', 'Famous and wealthy funnyman George Simmons doesn''t give much thought to how he treats people until a doctor delivers stunning health news, forcing George to reevaluate his priorities with a little help from aspiring stand-up comic Ira.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gEYKD5cWCBGg8Za3hhwDBk3gEsP.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:20829'),
  ('144794469916045631', 'Funuke: Show Some Love, You Losers!', 2007, 'Drama', 'Daihachi Yoshida, Kazuyoshi Yamada, Atsushi Ozawa', 'Daihachi Yoshida', 'Eriko Sato, Aimi Satsukawa, Masatoshi Nagase, Hiromi Nagasaku, Koichi Ueda, Hiroshi Yamamoto, Shoichiro Tanigawa, Nahoko Yoshimoto', null, 'Traumatic incidents, conflicts, and bloody quarrels awaiting the Wago family members who return home to bury their parents.', 'Traumatic incidents, conflicts, and bloody quarrels awaiting the Wago family members who return home to bury their parents.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/djjQuVaPogrLQ8RoqUl486N3Zjs.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:63101'),
  ('909473283469755731', 'Fuori', 2025, 'Drama, History', 'Paolo Carnera, Mario Martone', 'Mario Martone, Ippolita Di Majo', 'Valeria Golino, Matilda De Angelis, Elodie, Corrado Fortuna, Francesco Gheghi, Antonio Gerardi, Carolina Rosi, Daphne Scoccia', null, 'Rome. The 1980s. After the magnum opus The Art of Joy she has been working on for a decade is rejected by the Italian publishing world, writer Goliarda Sapienza commits a desperate theft that costs her her reputation and social position. Incarcerated in Italy’s largest female prison, she finds herself living alongside thieves, junkies, sex workers and revolutionaries. After her release, she continues to meet with these women and over the course of a sweltering summer, a life-changing relationship flowers – a relationship that will reawaken her the desire to live and to write.', 'Rome. The 1980s. After the magnum opus The Art of Joy she has been working on for a decade is rejected by the Italian publishing world, writer Goliarda Sapienza commits a desperate theft that costs her her reputation and social position. Incarcerated in Italy’s largest female prison, she finds herself living alongside thieves, junkies, sex workers and revolutionaries. After her release, she continues to meet with these women and over the course of a sweltering summer, a life-changing relationship flowers – a relationship that will reawaken her the desire to live and to write.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gxSkBOfTEOX2f6KhqMFSXf24nMo.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1310830'),
  ('854571237449013987', 'Fuori era primavera: Viaggio nell''Italia del lockdown', 2020, 'Documentary', 'Gabriele Salvatores', null, 'Luigi Tuccillo, Giulio Cagnazzo, Roberta De Santis', null, 'No description available yet.', 'No description available yet.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bhPy2aTSrkhDk6uHiQYai3P5snv.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:695093'),
