  ('365741206650180453', 'Für immer beinand', 2020, 'Documentary', 'Julia Bauer', null, 'Gottfried Paulus', null, 'No description available yet.', 'No description available yet.', null, 'tmdb:movie:1664716'),
  ('473694350107440707', 'Für immer ein Mörder - Der Fall Ritter', 2014, 'Crime, TV Movie', 'Johannes Grieser', 'Holger Karsten Schmidt', 'Hinnerk Schönemann, Katrin Wolter, Karl-Fred Müller, Oliver Stokowski, Luca Zamperoni, Karl Kranzkowski, Michael Gwisdek, Maren Kroymann', null, 'At the beginning of 2000, the young commissioner Yvonne Weber moved from Frankfurt am Main to Eisenach. Together with the local colleague Frank Wolf, she is to review an unresolved murder case from the GDR era. The investigation team encounters inconsistencies in the file and it becomes clear that there is no interest in truth-clarifying the Eisenach department and the prosecutor''s office in Gotha.', 'At the beginning of 2000, the young commissioner Yvonne Weber moved from Frankfurt am Main to Eisenach. Together with the local colleague Frank Wolf, she is to review an unresolved murder case from the GDR era. The investigation team encounters inconsistencies in the file and it becomes clear that there is no interest in truth-clarifying the Eisenach department and the prosecutor''s office in Gotha.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2MpsY0zYrrvkSqpBSS7G5CJuAcv.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:282671'),
  ('66689660710472171', 'Für immer Eltern', 2021, 'Comedy, TV Movie', 'Florian Schwarz, Philipp Sichler', 'Peter Probst', 'Devid Striesow, Anja Schneider, Max Schimmelpfennig, Pauline Fusban, Petra Hartung, Nils Hohenhövel, Shenja Lacher, Ella-Maria Gollmer', null, 'With their two grown children gone, Anja and Michael Wagner move into their own apartment in the city center. Both are looking forward to their newfound freedom. But when Niklas, their youngest child, is kicked out of his roommate''s apartment, he decides to move in with them and his girlfriend.', 'With their two grown children gone, Anja and Michael Wagner move into their own apartment in the city center. Both are looking forward to their newfound freedom. But when Niklas, their youngest child, is kicked out of his roommate''s apartment, he decides to move in with them and his girlfriend.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sUS9hKrkrka8LfyKYhuQkhuJYi7.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:807630'),
  ('131508505620831563', 'Fur: An Imaginary Portrait of Diane Arbus', 2006, 'Drama, History', 'Bill Pope, Steven Shainberg', 'Erin Cressida Wilson', 'Nicole Kidman, Robert Downey Jr., Ty Burrell, Harris Yulin, Jane Alexander, Emmy Clarke, Genevieve McCarthy, Boris McGiver', 'R', 'In 1958 New York Diane Arbus is a housewife and mother who works as an assistant to her husband, a photographer employed by her wealthy parents. Respectable though her life is, she cannot help but feel uncomfortable in her privileged world. One night, a new neighbor catches Diane''s eye, and the enigmatic man inspires her to set forth on the path to discovering her own artistry.', 'In 1958 New York Diane Arbus is a housewife and mother who works as an assistant to her husband, a photographer employed by her wealthy parents. Respectable though her life is, she cannot help but feel uncomfortable in her privileged world. One night, a new neighbor catches Diane''s eye, and the enigmatic man inspires her to set forth on the path to discovering her own artistry.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/62Owq5NVXvhgEqTklu1oMwTWQUL.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:18615'),
  ('277326142896571024', 'Furcy', 2026, 'History, Drama', 'Abd Al Malik, Guillaume Deffontaines, Stéphane Sartorius', 'Étienne Comar, Mohammed Aïssaoui', 'Makita Samba, Romain Duris, Ana Girardot, Vincent Macaigne, Liya Kebede, Frédéric Pierrot, André Marcon, Micha Lescot', null, 'In 1817, on Bourbon Island (Reunion Island), a compelling narrative unfolds. Following the passing of his mother, the enslaved Furcy stumbles upon a letter of emancipation amidst her belongings – an unexpected key to his indirect liberation. Aided by the support of abolitionist prosecutor Gilbert Boucher, Furcy courageously embarks on a legal crusade against his master, Joseph Lory, in a bid to substantiate his claim to freedom. This legal saga, marked by numerous twists and turns, spans almost three decades. Furcy endures imprisonment and exile in Mauritius for a significant portion of this period. It is only in 1846 that he finally presents his case before the Royal Court of Paris. Furcy’s triumph in the courtroom distinguishes him as one of the rare slaves in French history to achieve legal emancipation several years prior to the definitive abolition of slavery.', 'In 1817, on Bourbon Island (Reunion Island), a compelling narrative unfolds. Following the passing of his mother, the enslaved Furcy stumbles upon a letter of emancipation amidst her belongings – an unexpected key to his indirect liberation. Aided by the support of abolitionist prosecutor Gilbert Boucher, Furcy courageously embarks on a legal crusade against his master, Joseph Lory, in a bid to substantiate his claim to freedom. This legal saga, marked by numerous twists and turns, spans almost three decades. Furcy endures imprisonment and exile in Mauritius for a significant portion of this period. It is only in 1846 that he finally presents his case before the Royal Court of Paris. Furcy’s triumph in the courtroom distinguishes him as one of the rare slaves in French history to achieve legal emancipation several years prior to the definitive abolition of slavery.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/twes6EvoeDDvOObg1zGZ1kXz7Ue.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:960051'),
  ('992410041712294871', 'Fureru', 2024, 'Animation, Drama, Fantasy', 'Tatsuyuki Nagai, Yuya Sakuma, Keita Watanabe', 'Mari Okada', 'Ren Nagase, Ryota Bando, Kentaro Maeda, Haruka Shiraishi, Manaka Iwami, Sarutoki Minagawa, Kenjiro Tsuda, Takuya Eguchi', 'PG-13', 'Childhood friends find a creature with mysterious powers that pushes them to discover the bonds that tie the three students together.', 'Childhood friends find a creature with mysterious powers that pushes them to discover the bonds that tie the three students together.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5UHcz5eEP9CDCR4rlyNW4HxFdzM.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1214138'),
  ('115612921646528086', 'Furia', 1999, 'Drama, Romance, Science Fiction', 'Gerry Fisher, Alexandre Aja', 'Alexandre Aja, Grégory Levasseur', 'Marion Cotillard, Stanislas Merhar, Wadeck Stanczak, Pierre Vaneck, Carlo Brandt, Laura del Sol, Jean-Claude de Goros, Etienne Chicot', null, 'In a desert town, sometime in the future, a repressive government regime restricts all forms of artistic expression. At night, Theo breaks the law, risking torture and death, to paint his work on public spaces. But when his lover Elia is arrested for committing the same crime, Theo allows himself to be captured hoping to somehow be reunited with her.', 'In a desert town, sometime in the future, a repressive government regime restricts all forms of artistic expression. At night, Theo breaks the law, risking torture and death, to paint his work on public spaces. But when his lover Elia is arrested for committing the same crime, Theo allows himself to be captured hoping to somehow be reunited with her.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sjbxvxcg9ndRsWt4IEzcezNcMRq.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:126593'),
  ('1073484696160964744', 'Furia asesina', 1990, 'Action, Adventure, Horror', 'René Cardona Jr.', 'René Cardona Jr.', 'Omar Fierro, Letícia Lozoya, Tony Bravo, Monica Vali, Sergio Martín Herrera, Roberto Montiel, Juan Ramos, Gerardo Zepeda', null, 'Scientists do an investigation on sharks as they believe they can cure deadly diseases.', 'Scientists do an investigation on sharks as they believe they can cure deadly diseases.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hkwNEYZqwazU54jiRvfIc9ad3YC.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:259920'),
  ('1129116287229377974', 'Furies', 2022, 'Action, Drama, Thriller', 'Veronica Ngô, Phunam', 'Aaron Toronto, Lý Thu Uyên, Nguyen Truong Nhan', 'Dong Anh Quynh, Toc Tien, Rima Thanh Vy, Veronica Ngô, Thuan Nguyen, Song Luân, Gi A Nguyen, Phan Thanh Nhien', null, 'Bi, a Vietnamese country girl, survives a brutal childhood and escapes to Saigon. There, she is recruited by the mysterious Mrs. Lin, who trains Bi and her new friends Thanh and Hong in killing and sensuality to take down Hai, a Saigon crime lord.', 'Bi, a Vietnamese country girl, survives a brutal childhood and escapes to Saigon. There, she is recruited by the mysterious Mrs. Lin, who trains Bi and her new friends Thanh and Hong in killing and sensuality to take down Hai, a Saigon crime lord.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/h0yjBGTUToMqsQDY1SgkWRZjrgd.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:988667'),
  ('779510764405112487', 'Furiosa: A Mad Max Saga', 2024, 'Action, Science Fiction, Adventure', 'P.J. Voeten, Guy Norris, Simon Duggan', 'George Miller, Nico Lathouris', 'Anya Taylor-Joy, Chris Hemsworth, Tom Burke, Alyla Browne, George Shevtsov, Lachy Hulme, John Howard, Angus Sampson', 'R', 'As the world falls, young Furiosa is snatched from the Green Place of Many Mothers into the hands of a great biker horde led by the warlord Dementus. Sweeping through the wasteland, they encounter the citadel presided over by Immortan Joe. The two tyrants wage war for dominance, and Furiosa must survive many trials as she puts together the means to find her way home.', 'As the world falls, young Furiosa is snatched from the Green Place of Many Mothers into the hands of a great biker horde led by the warlord Dementus. Sweeping through the wasteland, they encounter the citadel presided over by Immortan Joe. The two tyrants wage war for dominance, and Furiosa must survive many trials as she puts together the means to find her way home.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iADOJ8Zymht2JPMoy3R7xceZprc.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:786892'),
  ('542490022491011135', 'Furious', 2017, 'Fantasy, Action, Adventure', 'Maxim Osadchy-Korytkovsky, Ivan Shurkhovetskiy, Dzhanik Fayziev', 'Dmitriy Raevskiy, Sergey Yudakov, Dmitriy Paltsev', 'Ilya Malakov, Aleksandr Tsoy, Andrey Burkovskiy, Aleksandr Ilyin Jr, Aleksey Serebryakov, Timofey Tribuntsev, Viktor Proskurin, Aleksandr Ilin', null, 'A story of a legendary battle, where seventeen fearless warriors defend their land against an army of thousands well-trained soldiers. In 13th-century Mongol warrior hordes and their leader, Batu Khan, control most of the known world. As the Mongols move towards Europe they invade the last Russian principality standing in their way. Little do they know, their plans are about to be ruined by a small detachment of heroic strong men led by a mysterious brave warrior. This is a story about courage, endurance and self-sacrifice for the sake of one''s country. This is the story of Evpaty the Furious.', 'A story of a legendary battle, where seventeen fearless warriors defend their land against an army of thousands well-trained soldiers. In 13th-century Mongol warrior hordes and their leader, Batu Khan, control most of the known world. As the Mongols move towards Europe they invade the last Russian principality standing in their way. Little do they know, their plans are about to be ruined by a small detachment of heroic strong men led by a mysterious brave warrior. This is a story about courage, endurance and self-sacrifice for the sake of one''s country. This is the story of Evpaty the Furious.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4XCA70oDgYSBLJDvOgYs1Ca4rBm.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:415381'),
  ('827942066291918770', 'Furious 7', 2015, 'Action, Crime, Thriller', 'James Wan, Stephen F. Windon, Jack Gill', 'Chris Morgan', 'Vin Diesel, Paul Walker, Dwayne Johnson, Michelle Rodriguez, Tyrese Gibson, Ludacris, Jordana Brewster, Jason Statham', 'PG-13', 'Deckard Shaw seeks revenge against Dominic Toretto and his family for his comatose brother.', 'Deckard Shaw seeks revenge against Dominic Toretto and his family for his comatose brother.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ktofZ9Htrjiy0P6LEowsDaxd3Ri.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:168259'),
  ('1084669293446896094', 'Furious Attack', 2026, 'Action, Crime, Thriller', 'Yi Huang', 'Yi Huang, 洛奇, 邱骏洋', 'Andy On Chi-Kit, Philip Ng Wan-Lung, Justin Cheung Kin-Sing, Eason Hung Chun-Ga, Charlene Houghton, Julian Gaertner, Wang Dong, Zhu Yun''er', null, 'A former special forces soldier infiltrates northern Myanmar to rescue his missing daughter, fighting against scam gangs and organ traffickers in a final showdown with the crime boss.', 'A former special forces soldier infiltrates northern Myanmar to rescue his missing daughter, fighting against scam gangs and organ traffickers in a final showdown with the crime boss.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4mTK8drt1EWo1AzqBrV4mJA04Wh.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1592032'),
  ('422177658436516676', 'Furioza', 2021, 'Action, Crime, Drama', 'Klaudiusz Dwulit, Cyprian T. Olencki', 'Cyprian T. Olencki, Tomasz Klimala', 'Mateusz Banasiuk, Weronika Książkiewicz-Nathaniel, Mateusz Damięcki, Łukasz Simlat, Wojciech Zieliński, Szymon Bobrowski, Janusz Chabior, Sebastian Stankiewicz', null, 'A policewoman makes her ex-boyfriend an offer he can''t refuse: either he infiltrates and informs on a gang of hooligans, or his brother goes to jail.', 'A policewoman makes her ex-boyfriend an offer he can''t refuse: either he infiltrates and informs on a gang of hooligans, or his brother goes to jail.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sSIo1vG0IILxzHkLKmtFEoTbVE9.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:866678'),
  ('1119871536503923843', 'Furlough', 2018, 'Comedy', 'Laurie Collyer, Bérénice Eveno, Conor Kelly', 'Barry Strugatz', 'Melissa Leo, Tessa Thompson, Edgar Ramírez, Anna Paquin, Whoopi Goldberg, Erik Griffin, Drena De Niro, La La Anthony', 'R', 'In between caring for her mother, a young woman works part time at a prison. The rookie guard gets a chance to prove her mettle when she''s tasked with accompanying a hell-raising inmate on an emergency furlough to visit her dying mother. But things soon spiral out of control, sending the pair on a hilarious, surprising, and ultimately touching road trip.', 'In between caring for her mother, a young woman works part time at a prison. The rookie guard gets a chance to prove her mettle when she''s tasked with accompanying a hell-raising inmate on an emergency furlough to visit her dying mother. But things soon spiral out of control, sending the pair on a hilarious, surprising, and ultimately touching road trip.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cw1RkjmbNfIbujkPGh6a8J9Lrf1.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:502426'),
  ('978256344264319786', 'Furnace', 2007, 'Crime, Horror, Mystery', 'William Butler, Viorel Sergovici', 'William Butler, Aaron Strongoni', 'Michael Paré, Ja Rule, Jenny McShane, Danny Trejo, Tom Sizemore, Kelly Stables, Paul Wall, Cowboy Troy', null, 'A ghost story taking place at a maximum security prison. A detective (Michael Paré ) is called to investigate a string of unexplained deaths as the prisoners fear for their lives.', 'A ghost story taking place at a maximum security prison. A detective (Michael Paré ) is called to investigate a string of unexplained deaths as the prisoners fear for their lives.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bpHNkhmBICJbGvjnzhiDkPq2WTN.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:15488'),
  ('84053138530024452', 'Furry Vengeance', 2010, 'Family, Comedy', 'Roger Kumble, Peter Lyons Collister', 'Michael Carnes, Josh Gilbert', 'Brendan Fraser, Brooke Shields, Ken Jeong, Matt Prokop, Angela Kinsey, Skyler Samuels, Ricky Garcia, Eugene Cordero', 'PG', 'When real estate developer Dan Sanders finalizes plans to level a swath of pristine Oregon forest to make way for a soulless housing subdivision, a band of woodland creatures rises up to throw a monkey wrench into the greedy scheme. Just how much mischief from the furry critters can the businessman take before he calls it quits?', 'When real estate developer Dan Sanders finalizes plans to level a swath of pristine Oregon forest to make way for a soulless housing subdivision, a band of woodland creatures rises up to throw a monkey wrench into the greedy scheme. Just how much mischief from the furry critters can the businessman take before he calls it quits?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/604qqquWBgFy34jLhHLtebFPQy6.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:35169'),
  ('1120290736774625634', 'Further Confessions of a Sixth Form Girl', 1971, 'Drama', 'Klaus Werner, Ernst Hofbauer', 'Günther Hunold', 'Friedrich von Thun, Rena Bergen, Kurt Bülau, Rolf Castell, Günter Clemens, Jürgen Emanuel, Karin Götz, Heidi Hansen', null, 'After the big success of the first part the film-makers apparently felt pressured to launch a new "investigation" and gather new material. Therefore, Friedrich von Thun again ventures out into the streets, this time of Berlin, to ask schoolgirls about their sexual experiences. The invinted guests talk about (allegedly) true events. Schoolgirls that seduce their teachers, runaway girls that have been robbed and who have to prostitute themselves or innocent girls that have been drugged and raped...', 'After the big success of the first part the film-makers apparently felt pressured to launch a new "investigation" and gather new material. Therefore, Friedrich von Thun again ventures out into the streets, this time of Berlin, to ask schoolgirls about their sexual experiences. The invinted guests talk about (allegedly) true events. Schoolgirls that seduce their teachers, runaway girls that have been robbed and who have to prostitute themselves or innocent girls that have been drugged and raped...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tGvB7C5RTtk0kQhV92iJpsmBSu1.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:36887'),
  ('122248011302130466', 'Furtive', 2020, 'Thriller, Drama', 'Francisco D''Eufemia, Diego Poleri, Federico Sosa', 'Francisco D''Eufemia, Fernando Krapp', 'Rodrigo de la Serna, Belén Blanco, Walter Jakob, Facundo Aquinos, Patricia Calisaya, Pablo Ragoni, Héctor Bordoni, Daniel Bernardes', null, 'Park Ranger Pablo Silva remakes his life in his new destination, a forgotten and troubled place that few want to go to, the Pereyra Iraola Park. Soon, under an apparent tranquility, he discovers a network of poachers, traffc and hoaxes. His old hunter instinct will arise. He can hide from everyone, except himself.', 'Park Ranger Pablo Silva remakes his life in his new destination, a forgotten and troubled place that few want to go to, the Pereyra Iraola Park. Soon, under an apparent tranquility, he discovers a network of poachers, traffc and hoaxes. His old hunter instinct will arise. He can hide from everyone, except himself.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/q8wmyxwvDIGjpJMAfuIikuT0B4R.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:662687'),
  ('348588691602126067', 'Fury', 1936, 'Crime, Drama', 'Fritz Lang, Joseph Ruttenberg, Horace Hough', 'Bartlett Cormack, Fritz Lang', 'Sylvia Sidney, Spencer Tracy, Walter Abel, Bruce Cabot, Edward Ellis, Walter Brennan, Frank Albertson, George Walcott', null, 'Joe, who owns a gas station along with his brothers and is about to marry Katherine, travels to the small town where she lives to visit her, but is wrongly mistaken for a wanted kidnapper and arrested.', 'Joe, who owns a gas station along with his brothers and is about to marry Katherine, travels to the small town where she lives to visit her, but is wrongly mistaken for a wanted kidnapper and arrested.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/u1kjLTUqmqjDMlRxcwCqWagjf6r.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:14615'),
  ('367841012807313179', 'Fury', 2014, 'War, Drama, Action', 'David Ayer, Roman Vasyanov, Gary Jopling', 'David Ayer', 'Brad Pitt, Shia LaBeouf, Logan Lerman, Michael Peña, Jon Bernthal, Jim Parrack, Brad William Henke, Kevin Vance', 'R', 'April, 1945. As the Allies make their final push in the European Theatre, a battle-hardened army sergeant named Wardaddy commands a Sherman tank and her five-man crew on a deadly mission behind enemy lines. Outnumbered and outgunned, and with a rookie soldier thrust into their platoon, Wardaddy and his men face overwhelming odds in their heroic attempts to strike at the heart of Nazi Germany.', 'April, 1945. As the Allies make their final push in the European Theatre, a battle-hardened army sergeant named Wardaddy commands a Sherman tank and her five-man crew on a deadly mission behind enemy lines. Outnumbered and outgunned, and with a rookie soldier thrust into their platoon, Wardaddy and his men face overwhelming odds in their heroic attempts to strike at the heart of Nazi Germany.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pfte7wdMobMF4CVHuOxyu6oqeeA.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:228150'),
  ('893692798092140684', 'Fury', 2025, 'Drama', 'Gemma Blasco, Neus Ollé, Bernat Llonch', 'Gemma Blasco, Eva Pauné', 'Ángela Cervantes, Àlex Monner, Eli Iranzo, Carla Linares, Victoria Rivero Falo, Ana Torrent, Salim Daprincee, Pau Escobar', null, 'Alex, a young actress, is sexually assaulted at a New Year’s Eve party at a friend’s house. That night, she never manages to see the face of her aggressor, a fact that will end up eating away at her. Throughout the following year, she will have to face feelings of guilt, disgust and shame. While Alex tries to channel all her pain through theatre, where she takes on the role of the famously vengeful Medea, her brother, Adrian, must face the guilt he feels at not having been able to protect his sister and his impulse to let himself be carried away by his own decisions. What were once the typical conflicts you might expect between any siblings, give way to much more extreme and complex emotions.', 'Alex, a young actress, is sexually assaulted at a New Year’s Eve party at a friend’s house. That night, she never manages to see the face of her aggressor, a fact that will end up eating away at her. Throughout the following year, she will have to face feelings of guilt, disgust and shame. While Alex tries to channel all her pain through theatre, where she takes on the role of the famously vengeful Medea, her brother, Adrian, must face the guilt he feels at not having been able to protect his sister and his impulse to let himself be carried away by his own decisions. What were once the typical conflicts you might expect between any siblings, give way to much more extreme and complex emotions.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ywzUHtubAGbJilTBoypwzOWlKvs.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1224668'),
  ('91554865686952143', 'Fury at Furnace Creek', 1948, 'Western', 'H. Bruce Humberstone, Harry Jackson', 'Charles G. Booth', 'Victor Mature, Coleen Gray, Glenn Langan, Reginald Gardiner, Albert Dekker, Fred Clark, Charles Kemper, Robert Warwick', null, 'The Arizona wilderness, 1880. Gen. Fletcher Blackwell sends a message telling Capt. Walsh, who is escorting a wagon-train through Apache territory, heading for the fort at Furnace Creek, that he should cancel the escort and rush to another town. Apache leader "Little Dog" is leading the attack on the wagon-train and massacring everyone at the poorly manned fort. As a result the treaty is broken with the Indians and the white settlers take over the territory with the help of the cavalry, as the Apaches are wiped out and only "Little Dog" remains at large. Gen. Fletcher Blackwell is court-martial-led for treason.', 'The Arizona wilderness, 1880. Gen. Fletcher Blackwell sends a message telling Capt. Walsh, who is escorting a wagon-train through Apache territory, heading for the fort at Furnace Creek, that he should cancel the escort and rush to another town. Apache leader "Little Dog" is leading the attack on the wagon-train and massacring everyone at the poorly manned fort. As a result the treaty is broken with the Indians and the white settlers take over the territory with the help of the cavalry, as the Apaches are wiped out and only "Little Dog" remains at large. Gen. Fletcher Blackwell is court-martial-led for treason.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3I32SsJHbZEDDiMVRSiH6InkKp7.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:154066'),
  ('515873347918758958', 'Fury of Johnny Kid', 1967, 'Western', 'Gianni Puccini', 'María del Carmen Martínez Román', 'Peter Lee Lawrence, Cristina Galbó, María Cuadra, Andrés Mejuto, Piero Lulli, Pietro Martellanza, Luis Induni, Ana María Noé', null, 'Two family clans have always been enemies; they spend their time hating and killing each other. The daughter of the Campos family and the son of the Mounter family fall in love, thus causing further hatred and deaths.', 'Two family clans have always been enemies; they spend their time hating and killing each other. The daughter of the Campos family and the son of the Mounter family fall in love, thus causing further hatred and deaths.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jRIJxUoHsKh1m5Gtkn4BlOrzZYz.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:100469'),
  ('941200409389321307', 'Fury of the Demon', 2016, 'Horror, Mystery, Fantasy', 'Fabien Delage', 'Fabien Delage', 'Alexandre Aja, Dave Alexander, Christophe Gans, Jean-Jacques Bernard, Pauline Méliès', null, 'An investigation on the rarest and most controversial French movie in the history of early cinema: a fascinating, lost and dangerous short film which causes violent reactions to those who watch it.', 'An investigation on the rarest and most controversial French movie in the history of early cinema: a fascinating, lost and dangerous short film which causes violent reactions to those who watch it.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/f4bXpdK7zLVjtm1yOTk08JzRi3p.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:406454'),
  ('645108661133176085', 'Fusé: Memoirs of a Huntress', 2012, 'Animation, Action, Drama, History', 'Masayuki Miyaji, Tomohisa Shimoyama, Ryousuke Sekiguchi', 'Ichiro Okouchi', 'Minako Kotobuki, Mamoru Miyano, Katsuyuki Konishi, Maaya Sakamoto, Hirofumi Nojima, Nana Mizuki, Utamaru Katsura, Hiroshi Kamiya', null, 'Hamaji, a young huntress from the mountains, stumbles into the middle of a shogun’s vendetta against a group of human-dog hybrids, the Fusé. Rumors of Fusé murdering innocent people in the bustling city of Edo have sparked a bounty for their heads. Along with her brother, Hamaji joins the hunt for this dangerous quarry, but after accidentally befriending one of them, Hamaji is torn between two worlds: her life as a self-reliant huntress, and the young woman her new friend has helped her to uncover.', 'Hamaji, a young huntress from the mountains, stumbles into the middle of a shogun’s vendetta against a group of human-dog hybrids, the Fusé. Rumors of Fusé murdering innocent people in the bustling city of Edo have sparked a bounty for their heads. Along with her brother, Hamaji joins the hunt for this dangerous quarry, but after accidentally befriending one of them, Hamaji is torn between two worlds: her life as a self-reliant huntress, and the young woman her new friend has helped her to uncover.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/juZoY7FRaSqYmuGy1rFnhp55mtW.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:204755'),
  ('239445522620575149', 'Fuses', 1967, null, 'Carolee Schneemann, Stan VanDerBeek', null, 'Carolee Schneemann, James Tenney, Kitch', null, 'A silent film of collaged and painted sequences of lovemaking between Schneemann and her then partner, composer James Tenney; observed by the cat, Kitch.', 'A silent film of collaged and painted sequences of lovemaking between Schneemann and her then partner, composer James Tenney; observed by the cat, Kitch.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bS5NXeriwtthhymQguqbvryOnha.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:150707'),
  ('875591183055742930', 'Fuss of the Fusses', 1979, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Alla Surikova, Vsevolod Simakov, Evgeniy Fyodorov', 'Emil Braginskiy', 'Galina Polskikh, Mher Mkrtchyan, Svetlana Petrosyants, Sergei Ivanov, Anna Varpakhovskaya, Leonid Kuravlyov, Natalya Krachkovskaya, Leonid Kharitonov', null, 'A comedy about a civil registry official whose job is to register newlyweds and who just discovered that her husband has been cheating on her for 3 months, her daughter met a guy she doesn''t approve of, and her life has suddenly become a fuss of the fusses.', 'A comedy about a civil registry official whose job is to register newlyweds and who just discovered that her husband has been cheating on her for 3 months, her daughter met a guy she doesn''t approve of, and her life has suddenly become a fuss of the fusses.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pP8epMslX4wXq0FzHwMXP7EUZ0k.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:65716'),
  ('687468202769543804', 'Futari wa Precure Max Heart Movie 2: Friend of Yukizora', 2005, 'Animation, Comedy, Fantasy, Action, Adventure, Family', 'Junji Shimizu, Takumi Wakao', 'Yoshimi Narita', 'Yoko Honna, Yukana, Rie Tanaka, Tomokazu Seki, Akiko Yajima, Haruna Ikezawa, Asuka Tanii, Mikako Fujita', null, 'On his way to visit the Queen of the Garden of Light, the Sage of the Garden of Clouds accidentally drops the egg of the Houhou. The egg lands in the Garden of Rainbows, where it is found by Hikari, attracting the attention of a powerful pair of servants of the Dark Lord.', 'On his way to visit the Queen of the Garden of Light, the Sage of the Garden of Clouds accidentally drops the egg of the Houhou. The egg lands in the Garden of Rainbows, where it is found by Hikari, attracting the attention of a powerful pair of servants of the Dark Lord.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ciuC92VU3osf8TdgHYU2lRSogEW.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:150425'),
  ('330194406745223911', 'Futari wa Precure Max Heart: The Movie', 2005, 'Animation, Fantasy, Comedy, Action, Adventure, Family', 'Junji Shimizu, Kisachi Tashiro', 'Daisuke Habara', 'Yoko Honna, Yukana, Rie Tanaka, Keiichi Sonobe, Daisuke Kishio, Mikako Fujita, Tamao Akae, Satoshi Katougi', null, 'The Courageous Warriors of the Garden of Hope have summoned Nagisa, Honoka, and Hikari to protect their kingdom from a witch who plans to steal the Diamond Line, which is a set of jewelry the queen of the Garden of Hope wears to a ceremony every year to replenish the water of the kingdom. The witch plans to resurrect the Dark Lord and if she does so, not only will the Garden of Hope be destroyed, but other kingdoms in the galaxies, including the Garden of Rainbows and the Garden of Light. Source: ANN', 'The Courageous Warriors of the Garden of Hope have summoned Nagisa, Honoka, and Hikari to protect their kingdom from a witch who plans to steal the Diamond Line, which is a set of jewelry the queen of the Garden of Hope wears to a ceremony every year to replenish the water of the kingdom. The witch plans to resurrect the Dark Lord and if she does so, not only will the Garden of Hope be destroyed, but other kingdoms in the galaxies, including the Garden of Rainbows and the Garden of Light. Source: ANN', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tXOicosGwKr8MVGIzuAVw5bgspQ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:150421'),
  ('579138094253151815', 'Futari wa Precure Splash☆Star the Movie: Tic-Tac Crisis Hanging by a Thin Thread!', 2006, 'Animation, Fantasy, Comedy, Action, Adventure, Family', 'Junji Shimizu, Nobukage Kimura, Katsumi Tamegai', 'Yoshimi Narita', 'Orie Kimoto, Atsuko Enomoto, Kappei Yamaguchi, Miyu Matsuki, Yuriko Fuchizaki, Akemi Okamura, Junko Takeuchi, Masami Kikuchi', null, 'In the middle of a karaoke contest, Saki and Mai find that time has suddenly stopped. Following some spirits, they wind up in the Land of Clocks where they find Sirloin, a warrior from Dark Fall who is keeping the Infinite Clock hostage. Naturally, Pretty Cure won''t stand for this, and they begin to battle. But can they stop fighting with each other first?', 'In the middle of a karaoke contest, Saki and Mai find that time has suddenly stopped. Following some spirits, they wind up in the Land of Clocks where they find Sirloin, a warrior from Dark Fall who is keeping the Infinite Clock hostage. Naturally, Pretty Cure won''t stand for this, and they begin to battle. But can they stop fighting with each other first?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4LNhz62BIwfDwQ5xoSWwz8EUJEq.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:150434'),
  ('969962588456136026', 'Fútbol Club Maradona', 2019, 'Documentary', 'Roberto Rodríguez', null, null, null, 'No description available yet.', 'No description available yet.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/79p0i7bFYgb2kkD927JcLtvlOqW.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:633553'),
  ('913194661310565137', 'Futura', 2021, 'Documentary', 'Alice Rohrwacher, Francesco Munzi, Pietro Marcello', 'Alice Rohrwacher, Pietro Marcello, Francesco Munzi', 'Pietro Marcello, Francesco Munzi, Carlotta Parodi, Alice Rohrwacher, Luigi Comencini', null, 'A portrait of Italy observed through the eyes of teenagers who talk about the places they live in and imagine themselves, torn between the opportunities that surround them, the dream of what they want to become, the fear of failing, the trials they hope to overcome.', 'A portrait of Italy observed through the eyes of teenagers who talk about the places they live in and imagine themselves, torn between the opportunities that surround them, the dream of what they want to become, the fear of failing, the trials they hope to overcome.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1dk5fzCG0NUWJEoNHY0rQ44T5WB.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:833335'),
  ('212524609601328652', 'Futurama: Bender''s Big Score', 2007, 'Animation, Comedy, Science Fiction', 'Dwayne Carey-Hill', null, 'Billy West, Katey Sagal, John DiMaggio, Phil LaMarr, Tress MacNeille, Lauren Tom, Maurice LaMarche, David Herman', 'PG-13', 'The Planet Express crew return from cancellation, only to be robbed blind by hideous "sprunging" scam artists. Things go from bad to worse when the scammers hack Bender, start traveling through time, and take Earth over entirely! Will the crew be able to save the day, or will Bender''s larcenous tendencies and their general incompetence doom them all?', 'The Planet Express crew return from cancellation, only to be robbed blind by hideous "sprunging" scam artists. Things go from bad to worse when the scammers hack Bender, start traveling through time, and take Earth over entirely! Will the crew be able to save the day, or will Bender''s larcenous tendencies and their general incompetence doom them all?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bmVE90IHvx4uXQgtbRtu4RyMWpt.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:7249'),
  ('656048524438894360', 'Futurama: Bender''s Game', 2008, 'Animation, Comedy, Science Fiction, Action, Fantasy', 'Dwayne Carey-Hill, Scott Muller', 'Eric Horsted, Patric M. Verrone, David X. Cohen', 'Billy West, Katey Sagal, John DiMaggio, Tress MacNeille, Maurice LaMarche, Phil LaMarr, Kath Soucie, Lauren Tom', 'PG-13', 'When Leela is insulted by a group of space-rednecks (like regular rednecks, but in space), she enters the Planet Express ship in a demolition derby. Leela emerges victorious, but when she brings the damaged ship home, and the Professor sees the fuel gauge, he''s enraged by the hit he''s going to take at the Dark Matter pump. Now the crew have to find a way to break Mom''s stranglehold on starship fuel, even if they have to wade through a Lord of the Rings-inspired fantasy-land to do it!', 'When Leela is insulted by a group of space-rednecks (like regular rednecks, but in space), she enters the Planet Express ship in a demolition derby. Leela emerges victorious, but when she brings the damaged ship home, and the Professor sees the fuel gauge, he''s enraged by the hit he''s going to take at the Dark Matter pump. Now the crew have to find a way to break Mom''s stranglehold on starship fuel, even if they have to wade through a Lord of the Rings-inspired fantasy-land to do it!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bx8OVOBn5WP9TJJuOpRzyMCdzzb.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:13253'),
  ('500523274528363586', 'Futurama: Into the Wild Green Yonder', 2009, 'Animation, Comedy, Science Fiction', 'Peter Avanzino', 'Ken Keeler', 'Billy West, Katey Sagal, John DiMaggio, Tress MacNeille, Maurice LaMarche, Phil LaMarr, Dawnn Lewis, Lauren Tom', 'NR', 'Leela becomes an outlaw when she and a group of ecologically-minded feminists attempt to save an asteroid of primitive life forms and the Violet Dwarf star from being destroyed, while Fry joins a secret society and attempts to stop a mysterious species known as the "Dark Ones" from destroying all life in the universe.', 'Leela becomes an outlaw when she and a group of ecologically-minded feminists attempt to save an asteroid of primitive life forms and the Violet Dwarf star from being destroyed, while Fry joins a secret society and attempts to stop a mysterious species known as the "Dark Ones" from destroying all life in the universe.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oL6SymcxQE6TN9KrrbdyhlulnEG.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:15060'),
  ('687800174146251656', 'Futurama: The Beast with a Billion Backs', 2008, 'Animation, Comedy, Science Fiction, Romance', 'Peter Avanzino', null, 'Billy West, Katey Sagal, John DiMaggio, Phil LaMarr, Lauren Tom, Tress MacNeille, Maurice LaMarche, David Herman', 'NR', 'Fresh off ripping space-time a new one at the end of "Bender''s Big Score," the Planet Express crew is back to mend the tear in reality, or (hopefully) at least not make it worse. Beyond the tear, though, lurks a being of inconceivable...tentacularity. What will become of Earth, and indeed, our universe, when faced with the Beast with a Billion Backs?', 'Fresh off ripping space-time a new one at the end of "Bender''s Big Score," the Planet Express crew is back to mend the tear in reality, or (hopefully) at least not make it worse. Beyond the tear, though, lurks a being of inconceivable...tentacularity. What will become of Earth, and indeed, our universe, when faced with the Beast with a Billion Backs?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2BW6JAW4wo7t5wD3WVfoijzosvt.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:12889'),
  ('718445453233379142', 'Future Boy Conan', 1979, 'Action, Adventure, Science Fiction, Animation, TV Movie', 'Hayao Miyazaki, Katsuji Misawa, Shigeharu Shiba', 'Eiichi Imado', 'Noriko Ohara, Mieko Nobusawa, Kazuyo Aoki, Ichiro Nagai, Rihoko Yoshida, Iemasa Kayumi, Takuzō Kamiyama, Hiroshi Masuoka', null, 'In this 1979 condensed-for-film recut of Hayao Miyazaki''s 1978 anime series, a young boy named Conan goes on a grand adventure. Conan lives in a world that is mostly oceans; the major land masses having been destroyed by the weapons of the great disaster of 2008. He meets a young girl named Lana, who is kidnapped by the technological city-state of Industria as they attempt to regain those weapons. Together with his friends, Conan sets out to rescue Lana and stop Industria from threatening the rest of the world.', 'In this 1979 condensed-for-film recut of Hayao Miyazaki''s 1978 anime series, a young boy named Conan goes on a grand adventure. Conan lives in a world that is mostly oceans; the major land masses having been destroyed by the weapons of the great disaster of 2008. He meets a young girl named Lana, who is kidnapped by the technological city-state of Industria as they attempt to regain those weapons. Together with his friends, Conan sets out to rescue Lana and stop Industria from threatening the rest of the world.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xpobR84x9CUHSj8uc3THqRtOJA5.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:497537'),
  ('615234327776276929', 'Future by Design', 2006, 'Documentary', 'William Gazecki', 'William Gazecki', 'Jacque Fresco, Roxanne Meadows, William Gazecki, Larry King', null, 'Future by Design shares the life and far-reaching vision of Jacque Fresco, considered by many to be a modern day Da Vinci. Peer to Einstein and Buckminster Fuller, Jacque is a self-taught futurist who describes himself most often as a "generalist" or multi-disciplinarian -- a student of many inter-related fields.', 'Future by Design shares the life and far-reaching vision of Jacque Fresco, considered by many to be a modern day Da Vinci. Peer to Einstein and Buckminster Fuller, Jacque is a self-taught futurist who describes himself most often as a "generalist" or multi-disciplinarian -- a student of many inter-related fields.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hcKPEIgILWv8uAtZKlfvjAqRWvq.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:19275'),
  ('925178267834715423', 'Future Cops', 1993, 'Action, Comedy, Science Fiction', 'Wong Jing, Andrew Lau Wai-Keung, Aman Chang Man', 'Wong Jing', 'Andy Lau, Jacky Cheung Hok-Yau, Simon Yam, Chingmy Yau Suk-Ching, Dicky Cheung Wai-Kin, Aaron Kwok, Charlie Yeung Choi-Nei, Ekin Cheng Yee-Kin', null, 'In the year 2043, an evil crime lord is trying to take over the world. Only one government official stands in his way, and plans to send him to prison, so The General and his minions Kent, Thai King, and Toyota travel to the year 1993 to kill the official before he has a chance to get into office. During a battle with The General''s minions, the Future Cops Lung, Broom Man, Ti Man, and Ah-Sing hear of their evil plan and devise a plan of their own to travel back in time to protect the official.', 'In the year 2043, an evil crime lord is trying to take over the world. Only one government official stands in his way, and plans to send him to prison, so The General and his minions Kent, Thai King, and Toyota travel to the year 1993 to kill the official before he has a chance to get into office. During a battle with The General''s minions, the Future Cops Lung, Broom Man, Ti Man, and Ah-Sing hear of their evil plan and devise a plan of their own to travel back in time to protect the official.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mmx9lmosHgsdT1bvDHGMWhfjfdq.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:63721'),
  ('1109995976453208496', 'Future Fear', 1997, 'Action, Science Fiction', 'Lewis Baumander, Graeme Mears', 'Lewis Baumander, Glen Cullen, Philip Jackson', 'Jeff Wincott, Maria Ford, Stacy Keach, Shawn Thompson, Kristie Ropiejko, Rob Tinkler, Michael Seater, Danielle Dasilva', 'R', 'An able-bodied scientist has found a cure for the plague from outer space which has eradicated almost all life on the planet. A mad general who wants to repopulate the planet with a new race sends a special female assassin to take him out.', 'An able-bodied scientist has found a cure for the plague from outer space which has eradicated almost all life on the planet. A mad general who wants to repopulate the planet with a new race sends a special female assassin to take him out.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3DjZF7JkmpWC1HNMYHwbTeUCeUx.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:30525'),
  ('18843358013097185', 'Future Force', 1989, 'Action, Crime, Science Fiction', 'David A. Prior, Andrew Parke', 'David A. Prior', 'David Carradine, Robert Tessier, Anna Rapagna, William Zipp, Patrick Culliton, Dawn Wildsmith, D. C. Douglas, Kimberley Casey', 'R', 'In the future, a cop protects a reporter from an organization of crooked, renegade cops who thinks she knows too much about them.', 'In the future, a cop protects a reporter from an organization of crooked, renegade cops who thinks she knows too much about them.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fHXxRYSwIT9v4BYlE9T7V9brrOl.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:67716'),
  ('1130299007589296825', 'Future Hunters', 1986, 'Action, Adventure, Science Fiction', 'Cirio H. Santiago, Ricardo Remias', 'J. Lee Thompson', 'Robert Patrick, Linda Carol, Ed Crick, Bob Schott, David Light, Paul Holmes, Peter Shilton, Ursula Marquez', 'R', 'A man from a post-apocalyptic future travels back in time to prevent the coming nuclear holocaust and enlists the help of a young couple.', 'A man from a post-apocalyptic future travels back in time to prevent the coming nuclear holocaust and enlists the help of a young couple.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/x06bm9W2q3qdfYHoSlynxeZkUdB.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:55068'),
  ('735683350151930191', 'Future Is a Lonely Place', 2021, 'Drama, Crime, Thriller', 'Laura Harwarth, Martin Hawie, Marco Postrak', 'Martin Hawie, Laura Harwarth', 'Lucas Gregorowicz, Denis Moschitto, Katharina Schüttler, Ronald Kukulies, Zejhun Demirov, Vedat Erincin, Daniel Drewes, Slavko Popadic', null, 'Frank, a man without a criminal record, attacks a money transporter and then turns himself in to the police. His behavior is a mystery. In prison he meets the unscrupulous and suspicious Arab Fuad, who is protected by his clan. To get closer to Fuad, Frank intervenes in the drug business within the walls and gets caught between the two rival groups of German and Arab inmates. It is only the prison guard Susanna with whom Frank will be able to build a relationship of trust, not knowing that she is part of Fuad’s business and has a sexual relationship with him. However, they come emotionally close. What only Frank knows is that his wife and his daughter died in a car accident. Fuad was the hit-and-run driver that remained unpunished. Frank seeks revenge.', 'Frank, a man without a criminal record, attacks a money transporter and then turns himself in to the police. His behavior is a mystery. In prison he meets the unscrupulous and suspicious Arab Fuad, who is protected by his clan. To get closer to Fuad, Frank intervenes in the drug business within the walls and gets caught between the two rival groups of German and Arab inmates. It is only the prison guard Susanna with whom Frank will be able to build a relationship of trust, not knowing that she is part of Fuad’s business and has a sexual relationship with him. However, they come emotionally close. What only Frank knows is that his wife and his daughter died in a car accident. Fuad was the hit-and-run driver that remained unpunished. Frank seeks revenge.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zKaJRF49l8oxH6pySahlwyoSh3X.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:840428'),
  ('871496409398709351', 'Future Kick', 1991, 'Action, Science Fiction', 'Damian Klaus', 'Damian Klaus', 'Don Wilson, Meg Foster, Chris Penn, Eb Lottimer, Al Ruscio, Jeff Pomerantz, Linda Dona, Shawn Phillips', 'R', 'In the far-flung future of 2025, where man is a victim of his own technology and corporations deal to a black market that trades in human body parts, a cyborg bounty hunter is hired by a wealthy woman to find out who murdered her husband.', 'In the far-flung future of 2025, where man is a victim of his own technology and corporations deal to a black market that trades in human body parts, a cyborg bounty hunter is hired by a wealthy woman to find out who murdered her husband.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/n12pStK8PT6unFMV2eSrju2eMG5.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:30667'),
  ('295829420873025294', 'Future Lasts Forever', 2011, 'Drama', 'Özcan Alper, Feza Çaldıran', 'Özcan Alper', 'Gaye Gürsel, Durukan Ordu, Sarkis Seropyan, Osman Karakoç, Erdal Kırık, Asiye Dinçsoy, Güllü Özalp Ulusoy', null, 'Sumru, a young ethnomusicologist in search of her lost lover, leaves Istanbul for a three-month research project in Diyarbakır. While crossing paths with locals and tracing the pains of others through a music project based on Anatolian mournings, she comes to confront the remnants of her own agony.', 'Sumru, a young ethnomusicologist in search of her lost lover, leaves Istanbul for a three-month research project in Diyarbakır. While crossing paths with locals and tracing the pains of others through a music project based on Anatolian mournings, she comes to confront the remnants of her own agony.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/n1FT2QzF8aUaZ5ZUuPhDaxLp4I3.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:79682'),
  ('42088074282172230', 'Future Shock', 1994, 'Horror, Science Fiction', 'Matt Reeves, Oley Sassone, Eric Parkinson', 'Oley Sassone, Eric Parkinson, Vivian Schilling', 'Vivian Schilling, Martin Kove, Brion James, Bill Paxton, Sydney Lassick, Max John James, Eric Parkinson, Mark Hertle', 'PG-13', 'A psychiatrist uses virtual reality to probe the minds of three unsuspecting patients, unleashing horrific psychic forces in the process.', 'A psychiatrist uses virtual reality to probe the minds of three unsuspecting patients, unleashing horrific psychic forces in the process.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/68bOLmnL0tTSZ8drtfRBffK9E1o.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:91605'),
