  ('731798694755179657', 'Future-Kill', 1985, 'Action, Science Fiction, Comedy, Horror', 'Ronald W. Moore, Jon H. Lewis', 'Ronald W. Moore', 'Edwin Neal, Marilyn Burns, Gabriel Folse, Wade Reese, Barton Faulks, John Hawkes', 'R', 'A group of fraternity pledges hatch a plot to kidnap Eddie Pain, the leader of a group of anti-nuclear mutant protestors ravaged by toxic poisoning. When Eddie winds up dead at the hands of one of his own guards, the frat boys are framed for his murder and pursued throughout the city.', 'A group of fraternity pledges hatch a plot to kidnap Eddie Pain, the leader of a group of anti-nuclear mutant protestors ravaged by toxic poisoning. When Eddie winds up dead at the hands of one of his own guards, the frat boys are framed for his murder and pursued throughout the city.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sKl0KhiOpGOLWFE0Z2dEAGsnFhg.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:55690'),
  ('258954949214443242', 'Futuresport', 1999, 'Action, Science Fiction, TV Movie', 'Ernest R. Dickerson, Jonathan Freeman', 'Steve De Jarnatt', 'Dean Cain, Vanessa Williams, Wesley Snipes, Valerie Chow, Adrian G. Griffiths, Bill Smitrovich, JR Bourne, Tara Frederick', 'R', 'In the not too distant future, a new deadly sport is the only way to stop a war that will kill millions. Fix is the creator of the sport, but the spotlight has always been on Ramzey. Now this hothead must use the game to stop the Revolution.', 'In the not too distant future, a new deadly sport is the only way to stop a war that will kill millions. Fix is the creator of the sport, but the spotlight has always been on Ramzey. Now this hothead must use the game to stop the Revolution.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/SPJXju2Wq1VmjsVYU2aUSP4eFX.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:16365'),
