  ('136108420139716236', 'Futuro Beach', 2014, 'Drama', 'Karim Aïnouz', 'Felipe Bragança, Karim Aïnouz, Marco Dutra', 'Wagner Moura, Clemens Schick, Jesuíta Barbosa, Sávio Ygor Ramos, Sophie Charlotte Conrad, Fred Lima, Thomás Aquino, Maj. Barreto', 'NR', 'Donato fails in his attempt to save a drowning man, and meets one of the man''s friends. He decides to start his life over, but pieces of his past keep coming after him.', 'Donato fails in his attempt to save a drowning man, and meets one of the man''s friends. He decides to start his life over, but pieces of his past keep coming after him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lologg70UiUMok8ijdSfDzBwR0N.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:227975'),
