  ('163591897043926925', 'FX''s A Christmas Carol', 2019, 'Drama, Fantasy', 'Nick Murphy, Si Bell, Michael Middleton-Downer', 'Steven Knight', 'Guy Pearce, Andy Serkis, Stephen Graham, Joe Alwyn, Vinette Robinson, Jason Flemyng, Charlotte Riley, Johnny Harris', 'R', 'London, 1843. Ebenezer Scrooge, a bitter old man, despises the Christmas holiday. Over the course of Christmas Eve night he is visited by three ghosts to show him his past, present and future.', 'London, 1843. Ebenezer Scrooge, a bitter old man, despises the Christmas holiday. Over the course of Christmas Eve night he is visited by three ghosts to show him his past, present and future.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mcddQAelCt6K0g3pCzPgKJQWpHU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:656968'),
