  ('440653629206330471', 'Fyre Fraud', 2019, 'Documentary', 'Ty Stone, Jenner Furst, Julia Willoughby Nason', 'Julia Willoughby Nason, Jenner Furst, Jed Lipinski', 'Billy McFarland, Jia Tolentino, Vickie Seger, Diallo Osoria, Ben Meiselas, Delroy Jackson, Ava Turnquest, Austin Mills', null, 'A true-crime comedy exploring a failed music festival turned internet meme at the nexus of social media influence, late-stage capitalism, and morality in the post-truth era.', 'A true-crime comedy exploring a failed music festival turned internet meme at the nexus of social media influence, late-stage capitalism, and morality in the post-truth era.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jeeHE4gDErwulQ9UJjHeLAzV1TG.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:575190'),
  ('282794455862965463', 'G', 1983, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Staffan Hildebrand, Lil Trulsson, Lennart Peters', 'Göran Gester, Staffan Hildebrand, Joakim Schröder', 'Joakim Schröder, Sebastian Håkansson, Niclas Wahlgren, Ulrica Örn, Magnus Uggla, Dominik Henzel, Niels Jensen, Lasse Strömstedt', null, 'Three friends, Robban, Alexander and Kim has just left the compulsory school, and now they consider themselves grown-up and mature, being 16 years old. During the summer holiday they also get a bit of experience of the world: Robban becomes a full-time drug addict, Alexander plays in a rock band but leaves it and Kim is desperate to get the girl of his dreams.', 'Three friends, Robban, Alexander and Kim has just left the compulsory school, and now they consider themselves grown-up and mature, being 16 years old. During the summer holiday they also get a bit of experience of the world: Robban becomes a full-time drug addict, Alexander plays in a rock band but leaves it and Kim is desperate to get the girl of his dreams.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kPZlKDjWVzETCkOSvjrLTVzkQSn.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:36961'),
  ('871830444328139946', 'G', 2002, 'Drama, Romance', 'Christopher Scott Cherot', 'Charles E. Drew Jr., Christopher Scott Cherot', 'Richard T. Jones, Blair Underwood, Chenoa Maxwell, Andre Royo, Laz Alonso, Nicoye Banks, Sonja Sohn, Marcia Wright', 'R', 'A young Hip Hop star named Summer G falls for a middle to upper class sister while in college. After she rejects him for a fellow social climber, Summer G spends ten years building a Hip Hop empire, then moves to the Hamptons where he finds the object of his affections.', 'A young Hip Hop star named Summer G falls for a middle to upper class sister while in college. After she rejects him for a fellow social climber, Summer G spends ten years building a Hip Hop empire, then moves to the Hamptons where he finds the object of his affections.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/llkGqfyHf4ZOxpGsl6H8F649duM.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:15155'),
  ('1115167444611966871', 'G', 2011, 'Crime, Comedy', 'Diego Puertas', null, 'José Luis Gil, Beatriz Carvajal, Maiken Beitia', null, 'A short by Diego Puertas.', 'A short by Diego Puertas.', null, 'tmdb:movie:166634'),
  ('568934472081235732', 'G for Gap', 2024, 'Drama, Comedy, Family', 'Long Fei, Xie Zhengyu', 'Huang Jia', 'Hu Ge, Gao Yuanyuan, Yue Hong, Zhou Yemang, Jolin Jin, Liu Jun, Gan Yunchen, Liu Yiwei', null, 'Woody, a man disheartened by setbacks in both his career and love life, chooses to return to his hometown in a bout of depression. This "sudden" return disrupts the tranquil life of his family, as he not only has to navigate close quarters with relatives but also seek out new possibilities for his future. After numerous rejections in reality, a chance encounter with his high school classmate, Feng Liuliu, leads to unexpected changes in his life.', 'Woody, a man disheartened by setbacks in both his career and love life, chooses to return to his hometown in a bout of depression. This "sudden" return disrupts the tranquil life of his family, as he not only has to navigate close quarters with relatives but also seek out new possibilities for his future. After numerous rejections in reality, a chance encounter with his high school classmate, Feng Liuliu, leads to unexpected changes in his life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/658G3OUdjYtVoqUaTmUOFmVPBCF.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1272676'),
  ('141923503464015346', 'G Storm', 2021, 'Action, Thriller', 'Terry Ng Ka-Wai, Joe Chan Kwong-Hung, David Lam Tak-Luk', 'Wong Ho-Wa, Ronald Chan Kin-Hung, Lui Koon-Nam', 'Louis Koo, Julian Cheung Chi-Lam, Kevin Cheng Ka-Wing, Jessica Hsuan, Bosco Wong Chung-Chak, Rosyam Nor, Michael Tse Tin-Wah, Louis Cheung', null, 'Follows an investigator as he prevents a terrorist attack during a symposium held by Hong Kong''s Independent Commission Against Corruption. He later finds it has links to human trafficking in Thailand.', 'Follows an investigator as he prevents a terrorist attack during a symposium held by Hong Kong''s Independent Commission Against Corruption. He later finds it has links to human trafficking in Thailand.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/32NPSZZ2GxMOocgZjjC4ce6n7Ux.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:814785'),
  ('643663620830695792', 'G-2', 1999, 'Action, Adventure, Fantasy', 'Nick Rotundo', 'Nick Rotundo', 'Daniel Bernhardt, Meeka Schiro, Bing Shen, James Hong, Camillo Eugene Natale, James Kim, Simon Kim, Inkyang Kim', 'R', 'Deep in the mind of Steven Colin (Daniel Bernhardt) the secret of an ancient martial arts power lay dormant. In a former life, Colin wielded the forceful sword of Alexander the Great. Now in 2003, his enemies are back and are determined to seek the man who would be king and destroy him for all eternity.', 'Deep in the mind of Steven Colin (Daniel Bernhardt) the secret of an ancient martial arts power lay dormant. In a former life, Colin wielded the forceful sword of Alexander the Great. Now in 2003, his enemies are back and are determined to seek the man who would be king and destroy him for all eternity.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dWa9PPO8Gz7sF5xUUfKS4GR1Chj.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:154600'),
  ('371396621672886424', 'G-Day', 2025, 'Comedy', 'Laurent Dailland, Claude Zidi Jr., Gabriel Levy', 'Claude Zidi Jr., Stanislas Graziani', 'Kev Adams, Brahim Bouhlel, Marie Parisot, Didier Bourdon, Chantal Ladesou, Jonathan Lambert, Cristiana Réali, Jarry', null, 'June 1944. Europe is torn apart by war, and preparations are underway for the Normandy landings. Denis Porte continues his daily work with dedication at a British military base... which is fake. His mission: to move fake soldiers around every day and thus deceive the enemy. In the Porte family, there is a tendency for fathers and sons to die as heroes for France. So there is no question of Porte taking the slightest risk for his mother. Looking after a fake base is the most she will tolerate for her son. But after meeting Sami, an Algerian doctor who dreams of meeting De Gaulle, they decide during a drunken evening to take part. They set off bravely (and with quite a few drinks under their belts). Except that they don''t have the right date or the right place. Add to that a hero who doesn''t want to expose himself to danger. On D-Day, or almost...', 'June 1944. Europe is torn apart by war, and preparations are underway for the Normandy landings. Denis Porte continues his daily work with dedication at a British military base... which is fake. His mission: to move fake soldiers around every day and thus deceive the enemy. In the Porte family, there is a tendency for fathers and sons to die as heroes for France. So there is no question of Porte taking the slightest risk for his mother. Looking after a fake base is the most she will tolerate for her son. But after meeting Sami, an Algerian doctor who dreams of meeting De Gaulle, they decide during a drunken evening to take part. They set off bravely (and with quite a few drinks under their belts). Except that they don''t have the right date or the right place. Add to that a hero who doesn''t want to expose himself to danger. On D-Day, or almost...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4C3MBxlcNLdxiiqN0lSJaEmfEab.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1318037'),
  ('887782096571440869', 'G-Force', 2009, 'Family, Fantasy, Action, Adventure, Comedy', 'Richard Graves, Eric Sherman, Bojan Bazelli', 'Cormac Wibberley, Marianne Wibberley', 'Sam Rockwell, Jon Favreau, Tracy Morgan, Penélope Cruz, Nicolas Cage, Dee Bradley Baker, Bill Nighy, Will Arnett', 'PG', 'A team of trained secret agent animals, guinea pigs Darwin, Hurley, Juarez, Blaster, mole Speckles, and fly Mooch takes on a mission for the US government to stop evil Leonard Saber, who plans to destroy the world with household appliances. But the government shuts them down and they are sentenced to a pet shop. Can they escape to defeat the villain and save the world?', 'A team of trained secret agent animals, guinea pigs Darwin, Hurley, Juarez, Blaster, mole Speckles, and fly Mooch takes on a mission for the US government to stop evil Leonard Saber, who plans to destroy the world with household appliances. But the government shuts them down and they are sentenced to a pet shop. Can they escape to defeat the villain and save the world?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9Tly3ZXTTsQKM26fis8v9LR4GxG.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:19585'),
  ('529602829538072983', 'G-Loc', 2020, 'Science Fiction, Action, Adventure', 'Tom Paton, George Burt, Nick Gorman', 'Tom Paton', 'Stephen Moyer, Tala Gouveia, Casper Van Dien, John Rhys-Davies, Emily Haigh, Toby Osmond, Shayne Ward, Alana Wallace', 'PG-13', 'With Earth virtually destroyed, Bran Marshall flees to Rhea, a nearby planet now hostile towards "Earthers". Escaping onto a Rhean supply ship, he finds the crew slaughtered, with the only survivor a female warrior named Ohsha. As the two try to kill one another, the ship is damaged by meteorites. Bran and Ohsha must join forces to salvage the craft before it impacts the planet below — and the humans that live there.', 'With Earth virtually destroyed, Bran Marshall flees to Rhea, a nearby planet now hostile towards "Earthers". Escaping onto a Rhean supply ship, he finds the crew slaughtered, with the only survivor a female warrior named Ohsha. As the two try to kill one another, the ship is damaged by meteorites. Bran and Ohsha must join forces to salvage the craft before it impacts the planet below — and the humans that live there.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/slAzFdmaGKxKH9qI8OEIocD3z1u.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:720124'),
  ('976976174721188019', 'G-Saviour', 1999, 'Action, Science Fiction, TV Movie', 'Graeme Campbell', 'Mark Amato', 'Brennan Elliott, Enuka Okuma, Catarina Conti, David Lovgren, Kenneth Welsh, Alfonso Quijada, Taayla Markell, Blu Mankuma', null, 'Universal Century 0223 - Humanity struggles to survive as wide spread famine spreads throughout the Earth and its orbiting space settlements known as Sides. Ex-Congressional pilot, Mark Curran stumbles across a conspiracy to suppress a discovery that could potentially end the food crisis. Utilizing an advance Mobile Suit, the G-Savior, Curran is thrust into battle against a powerful Congressional force. But can the colonies prevail against such overwhelming odds?', 'Universal Century 0223 - Humanity struggles to survive as wide spread famine spreads throughout the Earth and its orbiting space settlements known as Sides. Ex-Congressional pilot, Mark Curran stumbles across a conspiracy to suppress a discovery that could potentially end the food crisis. Utilizing an advance Mobile Suit, the G-Savior, Curran is thrust into battle against a powerful Congressional force. But can the colonies prevail against such overwhelming odds?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/n8LS5P9e0SrGzGc3i1S9d5d25PG.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:23613'),
  ('917797426054826036', 'G-Zombie', 2021, 'Horror, Fantasy, Comedy', 'Deepu, B. Rajashekar, Aryan Gowra', 'Aryan Gowra, Deepu', 'Aryan Gowra, Dhivya, Rajsekhar Aningi, Gowtham Avula', null, 'Sara is a research student who wants to make an immunity booster to save humanity. Her experiment however turns people into zombies and in comes Dhruva to save the day.', 'Sara is a research student who wants to make an immunity booster to save humanity. Her experiment however turns people into zombies and in comes Dhruva to save the day.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wkugO5QrnKB3sJsl41Gg913BCsD.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:794362'),
  ('65439858784898123', 'G—Lost in Frankfurt', 2015, 'Drama', 'George Dare', 'George Dare', 'Damiano Gaumann, Kristof Broda, David Sembritzki, George Dare, Andreas Kriener', null, 'Kris cant land a job in Warsaw and is now trying his luck in Frankfurt, where he ends up in a design underwear store for men. After some initial difficulties he explores the foreign city in which he must now find his way around. When he gets to know Damiano at the shop, a young extremely attractive guy who wants to show him Frankfurt, he accepts the offer gladly. After tentative touches and intense eye contact a passionate affair ensues within one day. G is a small study on the excitement a new life can bring. The film talks about the many levels of sensing and experiencing the complexity of the big city with its electronic music, clubs and the licentious sex between men under the influence of the fashionable drug G (GBL). Trying to find the very essence of life and love without ever getting enough of each, and the sneaking onset of disillusionment.', 'Kris cant land a job in Warsaw and is now trying his luck in Frankfurt, where he ends up in a design underwear store for men. After some initial difficulties he explores the foreign city in which he must now find his way around. When he gets to know Damiano at the shop, a young extremely attractive guy who wants to show him Frankfurt, he accepts the offer gladly. After tentative touches and intense eye contact a passionate affair ensues within one day. G is a small study on the excitement a new life can bring. The film talks about the many levels of sensing and experiencing the complexity of the big city with its electronic music, clubs and the licentious sex between men under the influence of the fashionable drug G (GBL). Trying to find the very essence of life and love without ever getting enough of each, and the sneaking onset of disillusionment.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1oi1Kr2pZXS8OVPM3lEPHhcs3pA.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:361629'),
  ('649329813250233489', 'G:MT Greenwich Mean Time', 1999, 'Drama', 'John Strickland', 'Simon Mirren', 'Steve John Shepherd, Ben Waters, Alec Newman, Chiwetel Ejiofor, Anjela Lauren Smith, Melanie Gutteridge, Georgia Mackenzie, Alicya Eyo', null, 'Six London school-leavers attempt to make it in the world, balancing the challenge of trying to make a name for themselves in the music industry against the pressures and tragedies of everyday life.', 'Six London school-leavers attempt to make it in the world, balancing the challenge of trying to make a name for themselves in the music industry against the pressures and tragedies of everyday life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/h7KxHtRgO6IV1OvpwqvfDLI1ZNq.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:16839'),
  ('436301800396966099', 'G.B.F.', 2014, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Darren Stein, Jonathan Hall, Alexandra Branger', 'Darren Stein, George Northy', 'Michael J. Willett, Paul Iacono, Sasha Pieterse, Andrea Bowen, Xosha Roquemore, Molly Tarlov, Evanna Lynch, JoJo', 'R', 'The bitter fight for supremacy between the three most popular girls at North Gateway High takes an unexpected turn when their classmate, Tanner, is outed and becomes the school’s first openly gay student. The trio races to bag the big trend in fashion accessories, the Gay Best Friend, while Tanner must decide whether his skyrocketing popularity is more important than the friendships he is leaving behind.', 'The bitter fight for supremacy between the three most popular girls at North Gateway High takes an unexpected turn when their classmate, Tanner, is outed and becomes the school’s first openly gay student. The trio races to bag the big trend in fashion accessories, the Gay Best Friend, while Tanner must decide whether his skyrocketing popularity is more important than the friendships he is leaving behind.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/f4fR1WMgSv7K93ZPoJlPyvaApdE.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:174323'),
  ('776706051273263444', 'G.D.O. KaraKedi', 2013, 'Action, Comedy', 'Murat Aslan', 'Şafak Sezer', 'Şafak Sezer, Serkan Şengül, Volkan Başaran, Seda Yıldız, Durul Bazan, Şener Kökkaya, Hamdi Kahraman, Erdem Akakçe', null, 'Three brothers living in Balat, one of Istanbul''s old neighborhoods, each struggling to make ends meet in their own way: Gürkan, who earns a living as a taxi driver; Orhan, who runs a rice shop; and Duran, who is hopelessly in love. While continuing their daily struggles like everyone else and trying to resolve their ordinary problems, the lives of these three brothers are turned upside down by a triangle of murder, mafia, and kidnapping triggered by an accident that befalls them one day.', 'Three brothers living in Balat, one of Istanbul''s old neighborhoods, each struggling to make ends meet in their own way: Gürkan, who earns a living as a taxi driver; Orhan, who runs a rice shop; and Duran, who is hopelessly in love. While continuing their daily struggles like everyone else and trying to resolve their ordinary problems, the lives of these three brothers are turned upside down by a triangle of murder, mafia, and kidnapping triggered by an accident that befalls them one day.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ij8LLpqc0yQCn5h3UBHnlgTSdAl.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:211715'),
  ('268748750948571842', 'G.I. Blues', 1960, 'Music, Comedy, Romance', 'Norman Taurog, Loyal Griggs, Michael D. Moore', 'Edmund Beloin, Henry Garson', 'Elvis Presley, Juliet Prowse, Robert Ivers, James Douglas, Letícia Román, Sigrid Maier, Arch Johnson, Mickey Knox', 'PG', 'Stationed in West Germany, soldier Tulsa McLean hopes to open up a nightclub when he gets out of the army. Tulsa may lack the capital for such a venture, but a chance to raise the cash comes his way through a friendly wager. Local dancer Lili (Juliet Prowse) is a notorious ice queen, and Tulsa bets everything he has that a friend of his can earn her affections. But, when that friend is dispatched to Alaska, it''s up to Tulsa to melt Lili''s heart.', 'Stationed in West Germany, soldier Tulsa McLean hopes to open up a nightclub when he gets out of the army. Tulsa may lack the capital for such a venture, but a chance to raise the cash comes his way through a friendly wager. Local dancer Lili (Juliet Prowse) is a notorious ice queen, and Tulsa bets everything he has that a friend of his can earn her affections. But, when that friend is dispatched to Alaska, it''s up to Tulsa to melt Lili''s heart.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8vsi3ezokYXLxccEWJ2sbXj80sF.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:18642'),
  ('812443703304280905', 'G.I. Jane', 1997, 'Action, Drama, War', 'Ridley Scott, Hugh Johnson, William Hiney', 'David Twohy, Danielle Alexandra', 'Demi Moore, Viggo Mortensen, Morris Chestnut, Josh Hopkins, David Vadim, Jim Caviezel, Boyd Kestner, Kevin Gage', 'R', 'In response to political pressure from Senator Lillian DeHaven, the U.S. Navy begins a program that would allow for the eventual integration of women into its combat services. The program begins with a single trial candidate, Lieutenant Jordan O''Neil, who is chosen specifically for her femininity. O''Neil enters the grueling Navy SEAL training program under the command of Master Chief John James Urgayle, who unfairly pushes O''Neil until her determination wins his respect.', 'In response to political pressure from Senator Lillian DeHaven, the U.S. Navy begins a program that would allow for the eventual integration of women into its combat services. The program begins with a single trial candidate, Lieutenant Jordan O''Neil, who is chosen specifically for her femininity. O''Neil enters the grueling Navy SEAL training program under the command of Master Chief John James Urgayle, who unfairly pushes O''Neil until her determination wins his respect.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6yBgZJYqaR4XkxwjsB9tS4GK1ZN.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:4421'),
  ('713930051500835018', 'G.I. Joe: A Real American Hero', 1983, 'Action, Adventure, Animation, Fantasy, Science Fiction, War', 'Dan Thompson', 'Ron Friedman', 'Michael Bell, B.J. Ward, Arthur Burghardt, Morgan Lofting, Jackson Beck, Peter Cullen, Marla Frumkin, John Stephenson', null, 'A Real American Hero is the first G.I. Joe miniseries, in it the G.I. Joe Special Missions Force must contend with COBRA who, after the successful theft of a special broadcast satellite now threaten the world with a teleportation machine called the M.A.S.S. Device. G.I. Joe tracks down the original designer who advises that the only way to counter the weapon is to build a M.A.S.S. Device of their own. However to power the device properly three rare catalytic elements are needed. Now it''s a race around the world and against the clock as G.I. Joe and COBRA go M.A.S.S. to M.A.S.S.', 'A Real American Hero is the first G.I. Joe miniseries, in it the G.I. Joe Special Missions Force must contend with COBRA who, after the successful theft of a special broadcast satellite now threaten the world with a teleportation machine called the M.A.S.S. Device. G.I. Joe tracks down the original designer who advises that the only way to counter the weapon is to build a M.A.S.S. Device of their own. However to power the device properly three rare catalytic elements are needed. Now it''s a race around the world and against the clock as G.I. Joe and COBRA go M.A.S.S. to M.A.S.S.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rHzAkK0ofrYfl9ubNQBiLsHEwRz.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:506215'),
  ('856756977675807113', 'G.I. Joe: Arise, Serpentor, Arise!', 1986, 'Animation', 'Ray Lee', 'Buzz Dixon, Larry Hama', 'Charlie Adler, Jack Angel, Michael Bell, William Callaway, Brian Cummings, Richard Gautier, Kene Holliday, Arthur Burghardt', null, 'After yet another defeat inflicted by G.I. Joe, the immediate subordinates of Cobra''s leader, Cobra Commander, have finally come to the end of their patience with his apparent incompetence and his inability to achieve real victories. The leader of the research and interrogations wing, Dr. Mindbender, receives a dream showing the solution. His plan is to collect the genetic material of great warriors and military leaders to create a composite clone that would be the perfect leader for Cobra. Now they set out to put this scheme into motion, and G.I. Joe has very little time to learn of this plot before Cobra becomes that much more a dire threat to the world.', 'After yet another defeat inflicted by G.I. Joe, the immediate subordinates of Cobra''s leader, Cobra Commander, have finally come to the end of their patience with his apparent incompetence and his inability to achieve real victories. The leader of the research and interrogations wing, Dr. Mindbender, receives a dream showing the solution. His plan is to collect the genetic material of great warriors and military leaders to create a composite clone that would be the perfect leader for Cobra. Now they set out to put this scheme into motion, and G.I. Joe has very little time to learn of this plot before Cobra becomes that much more a dire threat to the world.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/p2G9s4A7ksTX5zpagkKc9DeGvyB.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:458932'),
  ('833625023915008426', 'G.I. Joe: Retaliation', 2013, 'Action, Science Fiction, Adventure, Thriller', 'Stephen F. Windon, Jon M. Chu, James Madigan', 'Rhett Reese, Paul Wernick', 'Dwayne Johnson, Bruce Willis, Jonathan Pryce, Adrianne Palicki, Ray Park, Ray Stevenson, Élodie Yung, Lee Byung-hun', 'PG-13', 'Framed for crimes against the country, the G.I. Joe team is terminated by Presidential order. This forces the G.I. Joes into not only fighting their mortal enemy Cobra; they are forced to contend with threats from within the government that jeopardize their very existence.', 'Framed for crimes against the country, the G.I. Joe team is terminated by Presidential order. This forces the G.I. Joes into not only fighting their mortal enemy Cobra; they are forced to contend with threats from within the government that jeopardize their very existence.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3rWIZMzTKcCtV0eHJ70Z4Ru659f.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:72559'),
  ('997843084606901034', 'G.I. Joe: The Movie', 1987, 'Animation, Action, Science Fiction, Family, Adventure, Fantasy', 'Don Jurwich', 'Ron Friedman, Ron Friedman', 'Charlie Adler, Shuko Akune, Jack Angel, Michael Bell, Gregg Berger, Earl Boen, Arthur Burghardt, Corey Burton', 'PG', 'G.I. Joe faces a new enemy as an ancient society of snake people known as Cobra-La try to forcefully take back the earth from those who drove them underground eons ago.', 'G.I. Joe faces a new enemy as an ancient society of snake people known as Cobra-La try to forcefully take back the earth from those who drove them underground eons ago.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gADRX5uks0nIsgEzwNpkCIHukBN.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:17421'),
  ('578280460684251724', 'G.I. Joe: The Revenge of Cobra', 1984, 'Animation, Action, Adventure', 'Dan Thompson', 'Ron Friedman', 'Frank Welker, Michael Bell, Neil Ross, Mary McDonald-Lewis, Gregg Berger, Arthur Burghardt, Bill Ratner, Jackson Beck', null, 'G.I. Joe: The Revenge of Cobra is the second G.I. Joe miniseries based on the successful Hasbro Toys and Marvel Comics property. Using a laser core stolen from G.I.Joe, Cobra activates the Weather Dominator, an incredible weapon which controls the forces of Nature itself, Cobra Commander targets Washington for destruction, but the Joe team repels the attack and the Weather Dominator explodes into three parts setting off a chain reaction of natural disasters around the world. Can G.I.Joe recover the Weather Dominator in time to beat Cobra and save the world. It aired in 1984 and most of the 1984 and even some 1985 products are given plenty of screen time. Like the first miniseries, A Real American Hero, The Revenge of Cobra was written by Ron Friedman who created the series for television, and wrote all four miniseries.', 'G.I. Joe: The Revenge of Cobra is the second G.I. Joe miniseries based on the successful Hasbro Toys and Marvel Comics property. Using a laser core stolen from G.I.Joe, Cobra activates the Weather Dominator, an incredible weapon which controls the forces of Nature itself, Cobra Commander targets Washington for destruction, but the Joe team repels the attack and the Weather Dominator explodes into three parts setting off a chain reaction of natural disasters around the world. Can G.I.Joe recover the Weather Dominator in time to beat Cobra and save the world. It aired in 1984 and most of the 1984 and even some 1985 products are given plenty of screen time. Like the first miniseries, A Real American Hero, The Revenge of Cobra was written by Ron Friedman who created the series for television, and wrote all four miniseries.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6uSAMF7WtZTfdNwzDV3cVplacDC.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:400101'),
  ('866321160527424787', 'G.I. Joe: The Rise of Cobra', 2009, 'Adventure, Action, Thriller, Science Fiction', 'Stephen Sommers, Greg Michael, Mitchell Amundsen', 'Stuart Beattie, David Elliot, Paul Lovett', 'Adewale Akinnuoye-Agbaje, Christopher Eccleston, Lee Byung-hun, Joseph Gordon-Levitt, Sienna Miller, Rachel Nichols, Ray Park, Jonathan Pryce', 'PG-13', 'From the Egyptian desert to deep below the polar ice caps, the elite G.I. JOE team uses the latest in next-generation spy and military equipment to fight the corrupt arms dealer Destro and the growing threat of the mysterious Cobra organization to prevent them from plunging the world into chaos.', 'From the Egyptian desert to deep below the polar ice caps, the elite G.I. JOE team uses the latest in next-generation spy and military equipment to fight the corrupt arms dealer Destro and the growing threat of the mysterious Cobra organization to prevent them from plunging the world into chaos.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mc9b25IAprHfsaOz0wTshOwGHcY.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:14869'),
  ('430163398312130055', 'G.I. Samurai', 1979, 'Action, Science Fiction, War', 'Kōsei Saitō, Sonny Chiba', 'Toshio Kamata', 'Sonny Chiba, Isao Natsuyagi, Kôji Naka, Jun Etoh, Ryô Hayami, Akira Nishikino, Yoichi Miura, Hiroshi Kamayatsu', null, 'A squadron of Japanese Self-Defense Force soldiers find themselves transported through time to their country''s warring states era, when rival samurai clans were battling to become the supreme Shogun.', 'A squadron of Japanese Self-Defense Force soldiers find themselves transported through time to their country''s warring states era, when rival samurai clans were battling to become the supreme Shogun.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hdrclppnNg9FGK1wGBklRXdQonY.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:73990'),
  ('925652840946210084', 'G.O.A.T. Adjacent', 2026, 'Comedy', 'Michael Mihail', null, 'Chris Spencer', 'PG', 'Chris Spencer jokes about having famous friends, marrying black, his children''s shortcomings and personality stereotypes, confronting a childhood bully, and his love of chocolate chip cookies in this intimate stand-up special, his first in many years.', 'Chris Spencer jokes about having famous friends, marrying black, his children''s shortcomings and personality stereotypes, confronting a childhood bully, and his love of chocolate chip cookies in this intimate stand-up special, his first in many years.', 'https://images.plex.tv/photo?size=large-1280&url=https%3A%2F%2Fimage.tmdb.org%2Ft%2Fp%2Foriginal%2Fy9JOnlKrjYhWLsHdKfqe7kCiQqF.jpg', 'plex:movie:g-o-a-t-adjacent'),
  ('835135125318333016', 'G.O.R.A.', 2004, 'Comedy, Adventure, Science Fiction', 'Ömer Faruk Sorak, Veli Kuzlu, Kıvanç Baruönü', 'Cem Yılmaz', 'Cem Yılmaz, Özge Özberk, Ozan Güven, Şafak Sezer, Rasim Öztekin, Özkan Uğur, İdil Fırat, Erdal Tosun', 'PG-13', 'Carpet dealer and UFO photo forger Arif is abducted by aliens and must outwit the evil commander-in-chief of G.O.R.A., the planet where he is being held.', 'Carpet dealer and UFO photo forger Arif is abducted by aliens and must outwit the evil commander-in-chief of G.O.R.A., the planet where he is being held.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/k58f5o49jv3R9JXDTrGby53BLqf.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:27275'),
  ('157702786883028396', 'g@me.', 2003, 'Thriller', 'Satoshi Isaka, Yasushi Sasakibara, Shinsuke Ohno', 'Masaya Ozaki', 'Naohito Fujiki, Yukie Nakama, Ryudo Uzaki, Ryo Ishibashi, IZAM, Taigi Kobayashi, Yasuhito Shimao, Kippei Shiina', null, 'A young ad executive''s life has been turned upside down when a vicious client ruins his three billion yen project. Through his chance meeting with the disgruntled daughter of his enemy, he plans a vengeance scheme. The young woman agrees to play the victim of his bogus kidnapping. The movie is based on the novel Geimu No Na Wa Yuukai (''The name of the game is kidnapping'') by popular mystery novelist Keigo Higashino.', 'A young ad executive''s life has been turned upside down when a vicious client ruins his three billion yen project. Through his chance meeting with the disgruntled daughter of his enemy, he plans a vengeance scheme. The young woman agrees to play the victim of his bogus kidnapping. The movie is based on the novel Geimu No Na Wa Yuukai (''The name of the game is kidnapping'') by popular mystery novelist Keigo Higashino.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tTwpdQguS9oX3k7LGSSULpqInHQ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:61492'),
  ('784992803482046845', 'G20', 2025, 'Action, Mystery, Drama', 'Patricia Riggen, Checco Varese', 'Noah Miller, Logan Miller, Caitlin Parrish', 'Viola Davis, Anthony Anderson, Marsai Martin, Ramón Rodríguez, Antony Starr, Douglas Hodge, Elizabeth Marvel, Sabrina Impacciatore', 'R', 'After the G20 Summit is overtaken by terrorists, President Danielle Sutton must bring all her statecraft and military experience to defend her family and her fellow leaders.', 'After the G20 Summit is overtaken by terrorists, President Danielle Sutton must bring all her statecraft and military experience to defend her family and her fellow leaders.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wv6oWAleCJZUk5htrGg413t3GCy.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1045938'),
  ('1120001230004868032', 'Ga-ga: Glory to the Heroes', 1986, 'Science Fiction, Comedy, Drama', 'Piotr Szulkin, Marcin Ziębiński, Edward Kłosiński', 'Piotr Szulkin', 'Daniel Olbrychski, Jerzy Stuhr, Katarzyna Figura, Mariusz Benoit, Marek Walczewski, Leon Niemczyk, Krzysztof Majchrzak, Henryk Bista', null, 'Scope is a prisoner on a behemoth space station and is chosen, like all his fellow prisoners, to ''volunteer'' for the exploration of far-away planets. Landing on planet Australia 458, he is given a hero''s welcome with all the sex, booze, and violence that any one man can stomach. But as his new caretakers push him towards even more heinous and deplorable acts, Scope finds that his freedom comes with a high price; his own violent demise, broadcast live for the viewing pleasure of Australia 458''s inhabitants.', 'Scope is a prisoner on a behemoth space station and is chosen, like all his fellow prisoners, to ''volunteer'' for the exploration of far-away planets. Landing on planet Australia 458, he is given a hero''s welcome with all the sex, booze, and violence that any one man can stomach. But as his new caretakers push him towards even more heinous and deplorable acts, Scope finds that his freedom comes with a high price; his own violent demise, broadcast live for the viewing pleasure of Australia 458''s inhabitants.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4ILLzWLBV7uOsE8Asyp3rVdSacn.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:91691'),
  ('706469669373900538', 'Gabbar Is Back', 2015, 'Drama, Action', 'Radha Krishna Jagarlamudi, Narayan K Padharia, Balakrishnan Thevar', 'Rajat Arora, A. R. Murugadoss', 'Akshay Kumar, Shruti Haasan, Suman Talwar, Jaideep Ahlawat, Sunil Grover, Ishita Vyas, Shruti Bapna, Kareena Kapoor Khan', null, 'A vigilante network taking out corrupt officials draws the notice of the authorities.', 'A vigilante network taking out corrupt officials draws the notice of the authorities.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dhIVF43jCqVzxuo11hYcHQxjzS6.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:337876'),
  ('1062573224009545874', 'Gabbeh', 1996, 'Drama, Mystery, Romance', 'Mohsen Makhmalbaf, Mahmoud Kalari, Abolfazl Alagheband', 'Mohsen Makhmalbaf', 'Shaghayeh Djodat, Abbas Sayah, Hossein Moharami, Rogheih Moharami, Parvaneh Ghalandari', 'NR', 'An elderly couple go about their routine of cleaning their gabbeh, while bickering gently with each other. Magically, a young woman appears, helping the two clean the rug. This young woman belongs to the clan whose history is depicted in the design of the gabbeh, and the rug recounts the story of the courtship of the young woman by a stranger from the clan.', 'An elderly couple go about their routine of cleaning their gabbeh, while bickering gently with each other. Magically, a young woman appears, helping the two clean the rug. This young woman belongs to the clan whose history is depicted in the design of the gabbeh, and the rug recounts the story of the courtship of the young woman by a stranger from the clan.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uT2MCo2YKqMqtUXdtmy1rwR4IwD.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:43771'),
  ('751936817366140379', 'Gabby''s Dollhouse: The Movie', 2025, 'Family, Comedy, Adventure, Animation', 'Ryan Crego, Todd Elyzen', 'Mike Lew, Rehana Lew Mirza, Adam Wilson', 'Laila Lockhart Kraner, Gloria Estefan, Kristen Wiig, Logan Bailey, Eduardo Franco, Juliet Donenfeld, Donovan Patton, Sainty Nelsen', 'G', 'Gabby heads out on a road trip with her Grandma Gigi to the urban wonderland of Cat Francisco. But when Gabby''s dollhouse, her most prized possession, ends up in the hands of an eccentric cat lady named Vera, Gabby sets off on an adventure through the real world to get the Gabby Cats back together and save the dollhouse before it''s too late.', 'Gabby heads out on a road trip with her Grandma Gigi to the urban wonderland of Cat Francisco. But when Gabby''s dollhouse, her most prized possession, ends up in the hands of an eccentric cat lady named Vera, Gabby sets off on an adventure through the real world to get the Gabby Cats back together and save the dollhouse before it''s too late.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/t6LLguAmu6iZUN8pWhT7Q0IcaQ5.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1280282'),
  ('169323941612859163', 'Gabo: The Creation of Gabriel García Márquez', 2015, 'Documentary', 'Justin Webster', 'Kate Horne, Justin Webster', 'Juan Gabriel Vásquez, Jon Lee Anderson, Xavi Ayén, Carmen Balcells, Bill Clinton', null, 'How did a boy from a humble town on the Caribbean coast become a famous writer who won the hearts of millions of people, from the poorest to the most powerful ones? The answer to this question is the amazing story of Gabriel “Gabo” García Márquez (1927-2014), winner of the Nobel Prize for Literature in 1982 and probably the best writer in Spanish since Miguel de Cervantes.', 'How did a boy from a humble town on the Caribbean coast become a famous writer who won the hearts of millions of people, from the poorest to the most powerful ones? The answer to this question is the amazing story of Gabriel “Gabo” García Márquez (1927-2014), winner of the Nobel Prize for Literature in 1982 and probably the best writer in Spanish since Miguel de Cervantes.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/e4OQORtwnHJweMALk9OPKAV6gIf.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:340712'),
  ('918657594325292877', 'Gabriel', 2007, 'Fantasy, Horror, Action, Science Fiction', 'Peter A. Holland, Shane Abbess', null, 'Andy Whitfield, Dwaine Stevenson, Erika Heynatz, Samantha Noble, Michael Piccirilli, Harry Pavlidis, Kevin Copeland, Matt Hylton Todd', null, 'Gabriel tells the story of an archangel who fights to bring light back to purgatory - a place where darkness rules - and save the souls of the city''s inhabitants.', 'Gabriel tells the story of an archangel who fights to bring light back to purgatory - a place where darkness rules - and save the souls of the city''s inhabitants.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pH5ieqe5s2ZuZeEhloJZk9WeCTL.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:9997'),
  ('935922459022071055', 'Gabriel and the Mountain', 2017, 'Drama', 'Fellipe Barbosa, Pedro Sá Earp, Pedro Sotero', 'Kirill Mikhanovsky, Lucas Paraizo, Fellipe Barbosa', 'João Pedro Zappa, Caroline Abras, Rashidi Athuman, Luke Mpata, Alex Alembe, Rhosinah Sekeleti, Leonard Siampala, John Goodluck', null, 'Before entering a prestigious American university, Gabriel Buchmann decides to travel the world for one year. After ten months on the road with his backpack full of dreams, immersed at the heart of various countries, he arrives in Kenya determined to discover the African continent. Until he reaches the top of Mount Mulanje, Malawi, his final destination.', 'Before entering a prestigious American university, Gabriel Buchmann decides to travel the world for one year. After ten months on the road with his backpack full of dreams, immersed at the heart of various countries, he arrives in Kenya determined to discover the African continent. Until he reaches the top of Mount Mulanje, Malawi, his final destination.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vQKa8K9466N4yuqureiRmoq9cb8.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:453356'),
  ('481860413107005729', 'Gabriel Iglesias: Hot and Fluffy', 2007, 'Comedy, TV Movie', 'Manny Rodriguez, Amy Walder', 'Gabriel Iglesias', 'Gabriel Iglesias', 'NR', 'Gabriel Iglesias is one of the fastest-rising comics today! With his unique brand of humor, lovable stage presence and wide range of voices and impressions, it''s no wonder that he already has a huge fan following. Now you can see Comedy Central''s "Comic of the Year" in his sold-out performance at the historic Fox Theatre in Bakersfield, California!', 'Gabriel Iglesias is one of the fastest-rising comics today! With his unique brand of humor, lovable stage presence and wide range of voices and impressions, it''s no wonder that he already has a huge fan following. Now you can see Comedy Central''s "Comic of the Year" in his sold-out performance at the historic Fox Theatre in Bakersfield, California!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hYYiubXgtEmWvsaKVp3ssAzUr9l.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:20720'),
  ('435819776214961629', 'Gabriel Iglesias: I''m Not Fat... I''m Fluffy', 2009, 'Comedy, TV Movie', 'Manny Rodriguez', 'Gabriel Iglesias', 'Gabriel Iglesias', 'NR', 'Gabriel Iglesias entertains a packed house at El Paso''s Theatre in this Comedy Central special. For I''m Not Fat, I''m Fluffy, the comedian reaches new heights of hilarity, providing eerily perfect imitations and tales too tall not to be true. He also adds a new step to his five levels of fatness, and the sixth level is sure to leave audiences rolling in the aisles.', 'Gabriel Iglesias entertains a packed house at El Paso''s Theatre in this Comedy Central special. For I''m Not Fat, I''m Fluffy, the comedian reaches new heights of hilarity, providing eerily perfect imitations and tales too tall not to be true. He also adds a new step to his five levels of fatness, and the sixth level is sure to leave audiences rolling in the aisles.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/MUi4MsIJpoR0ruWqGtw1HTBSAo.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:27169'),
  ('304246811676132781', 'Gabriel Iglesias: I''m Sorry for What I Said When I Was Hungry', 2016, 'Comedy', 'Manny Rodriguez', 'Gabriel Iglesias', 'Gabriel Iglesias, Martin Moreno', 'PG-13', 'Hawaiian-shirt enthusiast Gabriel "Fluffy" Iglesias finds the laughs in racist gift baskets, Prius-driving cops and all-female taco trucks.', 'Hawaiian-shirt enthusiast Gabriel "Fluffy" Iglesias finds the laughs in racist gift baskets, Prius-driving cops and all-female taco trucks.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eOgTfgiIbrqVB9Ll0T5PtOD8RGb.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:429801'),
  ('196367847596900959', 'Gabriel Iglesias: Legend of Fluffy', 2025, 'Comedy', 'Manny Rodriguez', 'Gabriel Iglesias', 'Gabriel Iglesias', 'R', 'From breaking stereotypes to home break-ins, Gabriel Iglesias brings comedy to life''s unexpected twists in this stand-up special.', 'From breaking stereotypes to home break-ins, Gabriel Iglesias brings comedy to life''s unexpected twists in this stand-up special.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rrirqMQQfsvOzq3VC6vIW804xBo.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1404382'),
  ('737566674828051057', 'Gabriel Iglesias: Stadium Fluffy', 2022, 'Comedy', 'Manny Rodriguez', 'Gabriel Iglesias', 'Gabriel Iglesias', null, 'Gabriel “Fluffy” Iglesias makes history as the first comedian to perform at Dodger Stadium in his new special Stadium Fluffy: Live From Los Angeles. Filmed at Netflix Is a Joke: The Festival, Gabriel hilariously shares details about being a Los Angeles native, a recent attempt at extortion towards him, and where he holds the record for receiving the highest fine on stage.', 'Gabriel “Fluffy” Iglesias makes history as the first comedian to perform at Dodger Stadium in his new special Stadium Fluffy: Live From Los Angeles. Filmed at Netflix Is a Joke: The Festival, Gabriel hilariously shares details about being a Los Angeles native, a recent attempt at extortion towards him, and where he holds the record for receiving the highest fine on stage.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cf96HbBBy3x5R5Jc8qcS8i7qgzD.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1011579'),
  ('35895505039108883', 'Gabriel Over the White House', 1933, 'Drama, Fantasy, Romance', 'Gregory La Cava, Douglas Shearer, Bert Glennon', 'Carey Wilson', 'Walter Huston, Karen Morley, Franchot Tone, Arthur Byron, Dickie Moore, C. Henry Gordon, David Landau, Samuel S. Hinds', 'NR', 'A political hack becomes President during the height of the Depression and undergoes a metamorphosis into an incorruptible statesman after a near-fatal accident.', 'A political hack becomes President during the height of the Depression and undergoes a metamorphosis into an incorruptible statesman after a near-fatal accident.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fZt8iHZerWqN54JuOWvX7pc8T3G.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:100420'),
  ('219331410676767412', 'Gabriel''s Rapture: Part I', 2021, 'Romance', 'Tosca Musk, Denis Maloney', 'Mary Pocrnic', 'Melanie Zanetti, Giulio Berruti, James Andrew Fraser, Margaux Brooke, Agnes Albright, Purva Bedi, Nicky Buggs, Christian Vit', 'R', 'In the fourth instalment of the Gabriel''s Inferno series, Professor Gabriel Emerson has embarked on a passionate, yet clandestine affair with his former student Julia Mitchell, but when they return from their romantic holiday in Italy, their happiness is threatened. Will Gabriel succumb to Dante''s fate?', 'In the fourth instalment of the Gabriel''s Inferno series, Professor Gabriel Emerson has embarked on a passionate, yet clandestine affair with his former student Julia Mitchell, but when they return from their romantic holiday in Italy, their happiness is threatened. Will Gabriel succumb to Dante''s fate?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8i70DDfrNeVuXCIf8vcWD1HM34j.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:850356'),
  ('459410711338943505', 'Gabriel''s Rapture: Part II', 2022, 'Romance', 'Tosca Musk', 'Mary Pocrnic', 'Melanie Zanetti, Giulio Berruti, James Andrew Fraser, Margaux Brooke', null, 'In the fifth installment of the Gabriel''s Inferno series, Gabriel and Julia’s happiness is threatened by a conspiring student and academic politics. When Gabriel is confronted by the university administration, will he succumb to Dante''s fate? Or will he fight to keep Julia, his Beatrice, forever?', 'In the fifth installment of the Gabriel''s Inferno series, Gabriel and Julia’s happiness is threatened by a conspiring student and academic politics. When Gabriel is confronted by the university administration, will he succumb to Dante''s fate? Or will he fight to keep Julia, his Beatrice, forever?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2DtnVEwBJKL5aUlLAyZASmQpWn8.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:953553'),
  ('76228572620242950', 'Gabriel''s Rapture: Part III', 2022, 'Romance', 'Tosca Musk, Denis Maloney', 'Mary Pocrnic', 'Melanie Zanetti, Giulio Berruti', 'R', 'In the sixth installment of the Gabriel''s Inferno series, Julia deals with the aftermath of Gabriel''s departure, while Gabriel goes on a journey of self-discovery. Will they reunite and be able to repair what is broken?', 'In the sixth installment of the Gabriel''s Inferno series, Julia deals with the aftermath of Gabriel''s departure, while Gabriel goes on a journey of self-discovery. Will they reunite and be able to repair what is broken?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/n6uoqY6y352j0EtSXK8w4qOEwvD.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:971961'),
  ('607808471118565582', 'Gabriel''s Redemption: Part I', 2023, 'Drama, Romance', 'Tosca Musk', 'Mary Pocrnic, Sylvain Reynard', 'Giulio Berruti, Melanie Zanetti, Julia Barrett-Mitchell, Margaux Brooke, Malachy Cleary, Kurt McKinney, Greyson Chadwick, Denise Gossett', null, 'After leaving his prestigious post at the University of Toronto, Gabriel embarks on a new journey with Julia, and he is eager to become a father. However, Gabriel''s idyllic vision is jeopardized when Julia''s intensive program becomes all consuming. When Julia is granted a prestigious opportunity to deliver an academic lecture at Oxford, Gabriel challenges her about the subject of her presentation, which clashes with his own research. In Oxford, their past resurfaces, including an old nemesis determined to humiliate Julia and expose one of Gabriel''s well-guarded secrets. Emotions run high, alliances are tested, and the couple must confront the shadows of their shared history in a battle for love, truth, and redemption.', 'After leaving his prestigious post at the University of Toronto, Gabriel embarks on a new journey with Julia, and he is eager to become a father. However, Gabriel''s idyllic vision is jeopardized when Julia''s intensive program becomes all consuming. When Julia is granted a prestigious opportunity to deliver an academic lecture at Oxford, Gabriel challenges her about the subject of her presentation, which clashes with his own research. In Oxford, their past resurfaces, including an old nemesis determined to humiliate Julia and expose one of Gabriel''s well-guarded secrets. Emotions run high, alliances are tested, and the couple must confront the shadows of their shared history in a battle for love, truth, and redemption.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9juGLYYestTDvzP6TUXGCLEpuJG.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1142615'),
  ('807018721431686850', 'Gabriel''s Redemption: Part II', 2023, 'Romance', 'Tosca Musk', 'Sylvain Reynard', 'Giulio Berruti, Melanie Zanetti, Agnes Albright, Julia Barrett-Mitchell, Margaux Brooke, Greyson Chadwick, Malachy Cleary, Andrea Conte', null, 'Gabriel sets off on a new adventure with Julia after quitting his esteemed position at the University of Toronto, and he is ready to start a family.', 'Gabriel sets off on a new adventure with Julia after quitting his esteemed position at the University of Toronto, and he is ready to start a family.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dxu0JzeYYtMGHTvgThGHmfOmafg.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1146412'),
  ('773849623489644965', 'Gabriel''s Redemption: Part III', 2023, 'Romance', 'Tosca Musk', null, 'Melanie Zanetti, Giulio Berruti, Ashley LeConte Campbell, Rhett Wellington Ramirez, Andrea Conte, James Andrew Fraser, Johnathon Gorman, Jennifer Koon', null, 'A surprise letter from Gabriel’s estranged, half sibling leads to revelations that he never believed could be true. Julia discovers a life changing event that threatens to take away everything she’s worked towards. But with Gabriel support and encouragement, Julia excepts her future, and the two of them open them selves up for the ultimate chance of happiness and redemption.', 'A surprise letter from Gabriel’s estranged, half sibling leads to revelations that he never believed could be true. Julia discovers a life changing event that threatens to take away everything she’s worked towards. But with Gabriel support and encouragement, Julia excepts her future, and the two of them open them selves up for the ultimate chance of happiness and redemption.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cOjiDNoncbhFnOmC5A2zKqii2PE.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1146417'),
  ('494161627850170646', 'Gabriela', 1983, 'Drama, Romance', 'Bruno Barreto, Carlo Di Palma', 'Leopoldo Serran, Flávio R. Tambellini, Bruno Barreto', 'Sonia Braga, Marcello Mastroianni, Antonio Cantafora, Paulo Goulart, Tania Boscoli, Nicole Puzzi, Flávio Galvão, Ricardo Petraglia', 'R', 'In 1925, Gabriela, a poor, uneducated, yet charming woman becomes cook, mistress, and then wife of Nacib, a bar owner in Ilhéus, a small Brazilian coastal town run by the local colonels.', 'In 1925, Gabriela, a poor, uneducated, yet charming woman becomes cook, mistress, and then wife of Nacib, a bar owner in Ilhéus, a small Brazilian coastal town run by the local colonels.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ho99cPnYeKj1RepZxB4XWYzTyfY.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:42109'),
  ('650770456625937068', 'Gabrielle', 2005, 'Drama, Romance', 'Patrice Chéreau, Éric Gautier', 'Patrice Chéreau, Anne-Louise Trividic', 'Isabelle Huppert, Pascal Greggory, Claudia Coli, Thierry Hancisse, Chantal Neuwirth, Thierry Fortineau, Louise Vincent, Clément Hervieu-Léger', null, 'Wealthy but arrogant writer Jean Hervey comes home one day to find that his wife, Gabrielle, has left him for another man. Realizing her mistake, Gabrielle returns, and the pair begin a merciless analysis of their marriage as the relationship comes undone.', 'Wealthy but arrogant writer Jean Hervey comes home one day to find that his wife, Gabrielle, has left him for another man. Realizing her mistake, Gabrielle returns, and the pair begin a merciless analysis of their marriage as the relationship comes undone.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zRifiILj1SNvXetuBN4qCUV4eHE.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:32687'),
  ('74244294520651462', 'Gabrielle', 2013, 'Drama, Romance', 'Louise Archambault, Mathieu Laverdière', 'Valérie Beaugrand-Champagne', 'Gabrielle Marion-Rivard, Alexandre Landry, Mélissa Désormeaux-Poulin, Vincent-Guillaume Otis, Benoît Gouin, Sébastien Ricard, Marie Gignac, Isabelle Vincent', null, 'Gabrielle is a young woman with Williams syndrome who has a contagious joie de vivre and an exceptional musical gift. Since she met her boyfriend Martin, at the recreation centre where they are choir members, they have been inseparable. However, because they are "different," their loved ones are fearful of their relationship. As the choir prepare for an important music festival, Gabrielle does everything she can to gain her independence. As determined as she is, Gabrielle must still confront other people''s prejudices as well as her own limitations in the hope of experiencing a love far from the "ordinary".', 'Gabrielle is a young woman with Williams syndrome who has a contagious joie de vivre and an exceptional musical gift. Since she met her boyfriend Martin, at the recreation centre where they are choir members, they have been inseparable. However, because they are "different," their loved ones are fearful of their relationship. As the choir prepare for an important music festival, Gabrielle does everything she can to gain her independence. As determined as she is, Gabrielle must still confront other people''s prejudices as well as her own limitations in the hope of experiencing a love far from the "ordinary".', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bE2GYdImWm6UZeAv7DNkihALm27.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:215031'),
  ('510263402831204666', 'Gaby Baby Doll', 2014, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Sophie Letourneur, Jeanne Lapoirie', 'Sophie Letourneur, Anne-Louise Trividic', 'Lolita Chammah, Benjamin Biolay, Félix Moati, Pascal Joyeux, Camille Genaud, Emmanuel Rabita, Guillemette Coutellier, Laetitia Goffi', null, 'Gaby mustn’t be left alone at night. Yet that’s exactly what her boyfriend Vincent does, to test her love for him. She struggles against her natural instincts and quickly exhausts the patience of the local guys. But Gaby decides to turn to castle warden Nicolas, an expert in loneliness, for help.', 'Gaby mustn’t be left alone at night. Yet that’s exactly what her boyfriend Vincent does, to test her love for him. She struggles against her natural instincts and quickly exhausts the patience of the local guys. But Gaby decides to turn to castle warden Nicolas, an expert in loneliness, for help.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sRztYJ6JoDVifrdRkAhLnqyBqdn.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:307314'),
  ('832325099654049763', 'Gaby: A True Story', 1987, 'Drama, Romance', 'Luis Mandoki, Lajos Koltai', 'Michael Love, Martín Salinas', 'Liv Ullmann, Norma Aleandro, Robert Loggia, Rachel Chagall, Lawrence Monoson, Robert Beltran, Beatriz Sheridan, Tony Goldwyn', 'R', 'The life of Gaby Brimmer, a girl physically handicapped, who finally gets her goals of study and triumph.', 'The life of Gaby Brimmer, a girl physically handicapped, who finally gets her goals of study and triumph.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hPrTe5ZC4PFiGKrQpt2Un2ocf1J.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:191550'),
