  ('844831481915985870', 'Gacy', 2003, 'Crime, Drama, Horror', 'Clive Saunders', 'David Birke', 'Mark Holton, Adam Baldwin, Charlie Weber, Allison Lange, Edith Jefferson, Joleen Lutz, Scott Allen Henry, Kenneth Swartz', 'R', 'Based on a true story of serial killer a model citizen, loving father and husband and serial killer John Wayne Gacy, a man with over 30 dead men and boys entombed in the crawl space underneath his house which he shared with his family.', 'Based on a true story of serial killer a model citizen, loving father and husband and serial killer John Wayne Gacy, a man with over 30 dead men and boys entombed in the crawl space underneath his house which he shared with his family.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/goHjQHcK88m4hq2FJDyAFH8nz14.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:27387'),
