  ('359678185675638817', 'Gadar 2', 2023, 'Action, Drama', 'Anil Sharma', 'Shaktimaan Talwar', 'Sunny Deol, Utkarsh Sharma, Ameesha Patel, Simrat Kaur, Manish Wadhwa, Gaurav Chopra, Luv Sinha, Mir Sarwar', 'NR', 'When Tara Singh goes missing during a skirmish and is believed to be captured in Pakistan, his son Jeete sets out to rescue him and enters a labyrinth from which they both must escape at all costs.', 'When Tara Singh goes missing during a skirmish and is believed to be captured in Pakistan, his son Jeete sets out to rescue him and enters a labyrinth from which they both must escape at all costs.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/brCBYKGQaxZZcwmFF6OIxZLdKVU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:885331'),
  ('948787781345563400', 'Gadar: Ek Prem Katha', 2001, 'Action, Drama, Romance, History', 'Najeeb Khan, A. Shital, Chitra Shah', 'Shaktimaan Talwar', 'Sunny Deol, Ameesha Patel, Amrish Puri, Lillete Dubey, Vivek Shauq, Utkarsh Sharma, Suresh Oberoi, Madhumalti Kapoor', null, 'During the partition, Tara marries Sakina and they live a happy life. However their happiness is short-lived when Sakina''s father forces her to stay in Pakistan and separates her from her family.', 'During the partition, Tara marries Sakina and they live a happy life. However their happiness is short-lived when Sakina''s father forces her to stay in Pakistan and separates her from her family.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yItg48ViirZHWmuD15reEyMfr4x.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:80156'),
  ('683352556206455716', 'Gaga Chromatica Ball', 2024, 'Music', 'Lady Gaga, Chase Smith, Nick Knight', null, 'Lady Gaga, Tim Stewart, Ricky Tillo, Chris Johnson, Jonny Drummond, Brockett Parsons, Madison Alvarado, Morgan Geraghty', 'PG-13', 'In front of a sold-out crowd of 52,000 people, Lady Gaga delivers a career-defining performance at Los Angeles''s Dodger Stadium during her 2022 Chromatica Ball Tour.', 'In front of a sold-out crowd of 52,000 people, Lady Gaga delivers a career-defining performance at Los Angeles''s Dodger Stadium during her 2022 Chromatica Ball Tour.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kxrJArfrDlxukCXiiMDhsEvMXfS.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1063549'),
  ('847777361125374795', 'Gaga: Five Foot Two', 2017, 'Music, Documentary', 'Chris Moukarbel, Chris Moukarbel', null, 'Lady Gaga, Bobby Campbell, Mark Ronson, Florence Welch, Donatella Versace, Joe Germanotta, Barbara Bush, Tony Bennett', 'R', 'Follow pop provocateur Lady Gaga as she releases a new album, preps for her Super Bowl halftime show, and confronts physical and emotional struggles.', 'Follow pop provocateur Lady Gaga as she releases a new album, preps for her Super Bowl halftime show, and confronts physical and emotional struggles.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/g0NONcnzzvWoASFjFoDqXZUW6SV.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:472424'),
  ('984044330245140424', 'Gagarin', 1994, 'Animation, Comedy', 'Aleksey Kharitidi, Sergey Reshetnikov', 'Aleksey Kharitidi', null, null, 'A young caterpillar yearns to fly like the butterflies and birds, but cannot launch himself high enough to do so ... until a couple start playing badminton nearby.', 'A young caterpillar yearns to fly like the butterflies and birds, but cannot launch himself high enough to do so ... until a couple start playing badminton nearby.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/44fed1DTqH7CP3R0z6jKTHURRjU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:214157'),
  ('831580159946986593', 'Gagarin: First in Space', 2013, 'Drama, History', 'Pavel Parkhomenko, Anton Antonov', 'Sergei Laktuynkin, Andrei Dmitriyev', 'Yaroslav Zhalnin, Mikhail Filippov, Vladimir Steklov, Olga Ivanova, Sergei Laktuynkin, Inga Strelkova-Oboldina, Sergey Kalashnikov, Danila Bukrin', 'PG-13', 'The film is dedicated to the first steps of mankind on the path of space exploration and direct the fate of the first cosmonaut Yuri Gagarin. The main motif - the fight for the right to be first: the competition in the first cosmonaut, competition in missile technology, the confrontation of superpowers - the USSR and the USA. In the first group of astronauts were selected from three thousand fighter pilots across the country. In twenty of the legendary got the best of the best. Which of them will fly first, no one knew. In this way, had to contend not only with the pull of the earth ...', 'The film is dedicated to the first steps of mankind on the path of space exploration and direct the fate of the first cosmonaut Yuri Gagarin. The main motif - the fight for the right to be first: the competition in the first cosmonaut, competition in missile technology, the confrontation of superpowers - the USSR and the USA. In the first group of astronauts were selected from three thousand fighter pilots across the country. In twenty of the legendary got the best of the best. Which of them will fly first, no one knew. In this way, had to contend not only with the pull of the earth ...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nTk9rVyHIq89SgvEs91jzxq51ou.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:199327'),
  ('815120115960987545', 'Gagarine', 2020, 'Drama, Fantasy', 'Lucile Jacques, Marine Benoit, Charles Guegan', 'Fanny Liatard, Jérémy Trouilh, Benjamin Charbit', 'Alséni Bathily, Lyna Khoudri, Jamil McCraven, Finnegan Oldfield, Farida Rahouadj, Denis Lavant, César ''Alex'' Ciurar, Rayane Hajmessaoud', null, 'Yuri, 16, has lived all his life in Gagarin Towers, a vast red-brick housing project on the outskirts of Paris. He dreams of becoming an astronaut. When plans to demolish Gagarin Towers leak out, Yuri joins the resistance. With his friends Diana and Houssam, he embarks on a mission to save their home, which has become his “starship.”', 'Yuri, 16, has lived all his life in Gagarin Towers, a vast red-brick housing project on the outskirts of Paris. He dreams of becoming an astronaut. When plans to demolish Gagarin Towers leak out, Yuri joins the resistance. With his friends Diana and Houssam, he embarks on a mission to save their home, which has become his “starship.”', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5KnhgAYi62EK2RhuzgPtBw5TF7q.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:712178'),
  ('914710166333405257', 'Gagman', 1989, 'Comedy', 'Lee Myung-se, You Yong-kil', 'Lee Myung-se', 'Ahn Sung-ki, Hwang Shin-hye, Bae Chang-ho, Jeon Moo-song, Joo Ho-sung, Choi Jong-won, Kim Se-jun, Son Chang-min', null, 'Lee Jong-se is a third-rate comedian who believes himself to be a creative genius. He desires nothing more than to be a movie director.', 'Lee Jong-se is a third-rate comedian who believes himself to be a creative genius. He desires nothing more than to be a movie director.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gCaH1o0qTWxNa8ZgJceJOYnB34X.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:131964'),
  ('748735139714560498', 'Gags the Clown', 2019, 'Horror, Comedy', 'Adam Krause, Phil Bogdan', 'Adam Krause, John Pata', 'Lauren Ashley Carter, Tracy Perez, Aaron Christensen, Evan Gamble, Wyatt Kuether, Jake Martin, Michael Gideon Sherry, Squall Charlson', 'R', 'It''s been eight days since the clown first showed up in Green Bay, WI. Now, over the course of one night, four different groups of people cross paths with the clown everyone calls "Gags" and his true intentions are finally revealed.', 'It''s been eight days since the clown first showed up in Green Bay, WI. Now, over the course of one night, four different groups of people cross paths with the clown everyone calls "Gags" and his true intentions are finally revealed.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/j1mbWgA1991IAAVQdDYmpv3fGD7.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:483096'),
  ('258753657881269045', 'Gaia', 2021, 'Horror, Fantasy, Drama', 'Luan Kleingeld, Jaco Bouwer, Jorrie van der Walt', 'Tertius Kapp', 'Monique Rockman, Carel Nel, Alex van Dyk, Anthony Oseyemi', 'R', 'In the depths of an ancient forest, something has been growing. Something older than humanity itself, and perhaps greater too. When a park ranger discovers a man and his son living wild, she stumbles onto a secret that is about to change the world.', 'In the depths of an ancient forest, something has been growing. Something older than humanity itself, and perhaps greater too. When a park ranger discovers a man and his son living wild, she stumbles onto a secret that is about to change the world.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/v8cwfPwjHDWf5s5MxvLvcfnxPLL.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:795853'),
  ('563556372763680014', 'Gainsbourg: A Heroic Life', 2010, 'Drama', 'Joann Sfar, Guillaume Schiffman, Jérémie Périn', 'Joann Sfar', 'Éric Elmosnino, Lucy Gordon, Laetitia Casta, Doug Jones, Anna Mouglalis, Mylène Jampanoï, Sara Forestier, Kacey Mottet Klein', null, 'A glimpse at the life of French singer Serge Gainsbourg, from growing up in 1940s Nazi-occupied Paris through his successful song-writing years in the 1960s to his death in 1991 at the age of 62.', 'A glimpse at the life of French singer Serge Gainsbourg, from growing up in 1940s Nazi-occupied Paris through his successful song-writing years in the 1960s to his death in 1991 at the age of 62.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/e1zGOGjIVxzRudOq0SQteQQKfmr.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:31900'),
  ('370678521389772169', 'GAL', 2006, 'Drama, Thriller, History', 'Miguel Courtois, Carlos Suárez', 'Antonio Onetti', 'José Garcia, Natalia Verbeke, Jordi Mollà, Ana Álvarez, Mercè Llorens, Abel Folk, Ricard Borràs, Manuel Galiana', null, 'Two journalists investigate the criminal activities of the GAL (Grupos Antiterroristas de Liberación), a secret terrorist organization founded in the eighties and financed by leading figures in the Spanish government and security forces to hunt down and exterminate both members and collaborators of the terrorist gang ETA.', 'Two journalists investigate the criminal activities of the GAL (Grupos Antiterroristas de Liberación), a secret terrorist organization founded in the eighties and financed by leading figures in the Spanish government and security forces to hunt down and exterminate both members and collaborators of the terrorist gang ETA.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aLlmdeuLiA4v4M9KiKK1gHB6H1x.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:59571'),
  ('173830922744732879', 'Gal Avatar', 2010, 'Science Fiction', 'Hidemi Noto', null, 'Ai Haneda, Horiken, Kuriko, Mami Kobayashi, Namikawa Hajime, Ayaka Tomoda', null, 'An ordinary high school student– with an incontinent grandmother and extremely horny dad, are visited by an extremely pretty avatar to preform a “mind transfer” on Grandma. But before too long, Dad’s sniffing round to get it on with the great-shaped avatar.', 'An ordinary high school student– with an incontinent grandmother and extremely horny dad, are visited by an extremely pretty avatar to preform a “mind transfer” on Grandma. But before too long, Dad’s sniffing round to get it on with the great-shaped avatar.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9ItW3uf0U2OatKb60VAqu6FrbJh.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:981616'),
  ('754964803437859830', 'Galactic Gigolo', 1987, 'Comedy, Science Fiction', 'Gorman Bechard, Kristine Bechard, Gorman Bechard', 'Carmine Capobianco, Gorman Bechard', 'Carmine Capobianco, Debi Thibeault, Frank Stewart, Ruth Collins, Donna Davidge, Michael Citriniti, Tony Kruk, David Coughlin', null, 'Eoj is an alien who won a game show and the grand prize is a trip to earth to have sex with as many earth women as he can. Hildy is a reporter who is writing a biography on Eoj''s adventures.', 'Eoj is an alien who won a game show and the grand prize is a trip to earth to have sex with as many earth women as he can. Hildy is a reporter who is writing a biography on Eoj''s adventures.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4FjUGHby7T3J8GNT9paha0GshA1.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:86677'),
  ('426932580231423108', 'Galantuomini', 2008, 'Crime, Drama', 'Edoardo Winspeare, Paolo Carnera, Miguel Lombardi', 'Alessandro Valenti, Andrea Piva, Edoardo Winspeare', 'Donatella Finocchiaro, Fabrizio Gifuni, Giuseppe Fiorello, Giorgio Colangeli, Gioia Spaziani, Marcello Prayer, Lamberto Probo, Antonio Carluccio', null, 'A well known judge comes back to his native region, Salentino in the South of Italy, to find out that his old friend is dead and the woman he loved is now working for a crime organization.', 'A well known judge comes back to his native region, Salentino in the South of Italy, to find out that his old friend is dead and the woman he loved is now working for a crime organization.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gaX8TBYPmiLnjLdyUQ8bXDWQe7w.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:58171'),
  ('533944748854205910', 'Galaxina', 1980, 'Comedy, Science Fiction', 'Dean Cundey, William Sachs, John S. Curran', 'William Sachs', 'Dorothy Stratten, Stephen Macht, Avery Schreiber, Lionel Mark Smith, J.D. Hinton, Tad Horino, Ronald Knight, Percy Rodriguez', 'R', 'Galaxina is a lifelike, voluptuous android who is assigned to oversee the operations of an intergalactic Space Police cruiser captained by incompetent Cornelius Butt. When a mission requires the ship''s crew to be placed in suspended animation for decades, Galaxina finds herself alone for many years, developing emotions and falling in love with the ship''s pilot, Thor.', 'Galaxina is a lifelike, voluptuous android who is assigned to oversee the operations of an intergalactic Space Police cruiser captained by incompetent Cornelius Butt. When a mission requires the ship''s crew to be placed in suspended animation for decades, Galaxina finds herself alone for many years, developing emotions and falling in love with the ship''s pilot, Thor.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/A66Uw4QFyESPwnDnlvudKKR2Qsv.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:33155'),
  ('281343645554052586', 'Galaxis', 1995, 'Science Fiction, Action', 'William Mesa, Tony Steinberg, Robert C. New', 'Nick Davis', 'Brigitte Nielsen, Kristin Bauer, Richard Moll, Craig Fairbrass, Sam Raimi, John H. Brennan, Roger Aaron Brown, Cindy Morgan', 'R', 'Legend says that the sacred crystal is the source for all life and was created at the beginning of time. Kyla has sought the crystal to use its powers for himself and he takes the crystal after smashing the defenders on the Planet Sintaria. But there is another identical crystal on Earth and Ladera heads there to get it before the evil Kyla. She finds that Jed has taken the crystal from is hiding place, but Victor and his inexhaustible hit men want it for money they gave to Jed. Ladera easily handles the weak earthlings and saves Jed, but Kyla is also after the crystal. Jed and Ladera must find the crystal before Kyla, the clueless cops or the dimwitted villains.', 'Legend says that the sacred crystal is the source for all life and was created at the beginning of time. Kyla has sought the crystal to use its powers for himself and he takes the crystal after smashing the defenders on the Planet Sintaria. But there is another identical crystal on Earth and Ladera heads there to get it before the evil Kyla. She finds that Jed has taken the crystal from is hiding place, but Victor and his inexhaustible hit men want it for money they gave to Jed. Ladera easily handles the weak earthlings and saves Jed, but Kyla is also after the crystal. Jed and Ladera must find the crystal before Kyla, the clueless cops or the dimwitted villains.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lKBnXiYVgWJVXmGHF6tjJMeSnBM.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:45296'),
  ('657602103809216492', 'Galaxy Express 999: Eternal Fantasy', 1998, 'Animation, Science Fiction', 'Konosuke Uda, Takahiro Kagami, Tamio Hosoda', 'Junki Takegami', 'Masako Nozawa, Masako Ikeda, Koichi Yamadera, Yuko Minaguchi, Yoshiko Sakakibara, Noriko Hidaka, Kazuya Tatekabe, Keiko Toda', null, 'Tetsuro believed he was freeing the Earth from the clutches of the Metanoid Empire’s tyranny. Yet one year after his return, Tetsuro is a prisoner of a new tyrant, and this one’s human! However, Maetel and the 999 swoop into the boy’s rescue. With his freedom, gun, and trusty hat returned to him, Tetsuro reaffirms his desire to save his home. But a new darkness is rising to swallow the light, and one of its agents has him in her sights. Before the train can depart for a new destination, Tetsuro will have to face the deadly knight Helmazaria!', 'Tetsuro believed he was freeing the Earth from the clutches of the Metanoid Empire’s tyranny. Yet one year after his return, Tetsuro is a prisoner of a new tyrant, and this one’s human! However, Maetel and the 999 swoop into the boy’s rescue. With his freedom, gun, and trusty hat returned to him, Tetsuro reaffirms his desire to save his home. But a new darkness is rising to swallow the light, and one of its agents has him in her sights. Before the train can depart for a new destination, Tetsuro will have to face the deadly knight Helmazaria!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/imhIqlVfBasr761dVsl1wrPeiZO.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:57123'),
  ('835987481930079951', 'Galaxy Express 999: The Movie', 1979, 'Adventure, Animation, Science Fiction', 'Rintaro, Kazuo Komatsubara, Takao Yoshizawa', 'Leiji Matsumoto, Leiji Matsumoto', 'Masako Nozawa, Masako Ikeda, Yoko Asagami, Miyoko Aso, Toshiko Fujita, Yasuo Hisamatsu, Makio Inoue, Tatsuya Jo', null, 'In the future, one can achieve immortality by obtaining a mechanized body. Orphaned, young Tetsuro hitches a ride on the space train Galaxy Express 999 in the hope of obtaining a cyborg body to avenge his mother''s death. Along the way, he meets Maetel, who is the spitting image of his dead mother.', 'In the future, one can achieve immortality by obtaining a mechanized body. Orphaned, young Tetsuro hitches a ride on the space train Galaxy Express 999 in the hope of obtaining a cyborg body to avenge his mother''s death. Along the way, he meets Maetel, who is the spitting image of his dead mother.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yBNzT42ErObWemedi5ZalZnRTwn.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:15227'),
  ('1128132739730265606', 'Galaxy of Terror', 1981, 'Action, Adventure, Horror, Science Fiction', 'Austin McKinney, Bruce D. Clark, Jacques Haitkin', 'Marc Siegler, Bruce D. Clark', 'Edward Albert, Erin Moran, Ray Walston, Bernard Behrens, Zalman King, Robert Englund, Taaffe O''Connell, Sid Haig', 'R', 'As a lone spaceship proceeds on its long voyage across space, the crew are surprised to encounter a strange pyramid form. Surprise turns to horror as one by one, they discover that their darkest nightmares are all starting to become real. The pyramid has to be behind it all somehow, but how can they save themselves from its influence?', 'As a lone spaceship proceeds on its long voyage across space, the crew are surprised to encounter a strange pyramid form. Surprise turns to horror as one by one, they discover that their darkest nightmares are all starting to become real. The pyramid has to be behind it all somehow, but how can they save themselves from its influence?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/429ot4ktpg6q7JR2ThaX9kthfLb.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:28893'),
  ('39875766159339095', 'Galaxy Quest', 1999, 'Comedy, Science Fiction, Adventure', 'Dean Parisot, Jerzy Zieliński, Kristin Killey', 'David Howard, Robert Gordon', 'Tim Allen, Sigourney Weaver, Alan Rickman, Tony Shalhoub, Sam Rockwell, Daryl Mitchell, Enrico Colantoni, Robin Sachs', 'PG', 'For four years, the courageous crew of the NSEA Protector — Commander Peter Quincy Taggart, Lieutenant Tawny Madison, and Doctor Lazarus — set off on a thrilling and often dangerous mission in space ... until their series was cancelled! Now, twenty years later, aliens under attack have mistaken the Galaxy Quest television transmissions for "historical documents" and beam up the crew of has-been actors to save the universe. With no script, no director, and no clue, the actors must turn in the performances of their lives.', 'For four years, the courageous crew of the NSEA Protector — Commander Peter Quincy Taggart, Lieutenant Tawny Madison, and Doctor Lazarus — set off on a thrilling and often dangerous mission in space ... until their series was cancelled! Now, twenty years later, aliens under attack have mistaken the Galaxy Quest television transmissions for "historical documents" and beam up the crew of has-been actors to save the universe. With no script, no director, and no clue, the actors must turn in the performances of their lives.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fZXSwgZknp81vmciTb86rw0MejV.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:926'),
  ('1151785541842971479', 'Gale: Yellow Brick Road', 2026, 'Fantasy, Horror, Thriller', 'Daniel Alexander', 'Daniel Alexander, L. Frank Baum, Matthew r. Ford', 'Chloë Culligan Crump, Laura Kay bailey, Karen Swan, Dara abasuté, Sarah Feltham', 'PG-13', 'Dorothy Gale, now an elderly woman haunted by her past, tries to warn her granddaughter Emily, but when visions become reality, Emily is drawn into a land once wondrous, now twisted by terror. There she discovers unsettling ties to her family and encounters both strange new figures and distorted echoes of the past.', 'Dorothy Gale, now an elderly woman haunted by her past, tries to warn her granddaughter Emily, but when visions become reality, Emily is drawn into a land once wondrous, now twisted by terror. There she discovers unsettling ties to her family and encounters both strange new figures and distorted echoes of the past.', 'https://images.plex.tv/photo?size=large-1280&url=https%3A%2F%2Fimage.tmdb.org%2Ft%2Fp%2Foriginal%2FVjnGCwc2fWzQwNEz76QN9qUPz8.jpg', 'plex:movie:gale-yellow-brick-road'),
  ('470847715512571825', 'Galería del terror', 1987, 'Horror, Comedy', 'Enrique Carreras, Juan Iribas, Víctor Hugo Caula', 'Juan Carlos Mesa', 'Jorge Porcel, Alberto Olmedo, Beatriz Salomón, Susana Romero, Nito Artaza, Adolfo García Grau, Edgardo Mesa, Mario Sánchez', null, 'No description available yet.', 'No description available yet.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iByxpRT961YbeZdN8HJsMdCOKLZ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:456169'),
  ('1116707058100575257', 'Galgameth', 1997, 'Adventure, Family, Fantasy', 'Sean McNamara', 'Shin Sang-ok, Michael Angeli', 'Devin Oatway, Stephen Macht, Johna Stewart-Bowden, Doug Jones', 'PG', 'The kingdom of Donnegold is being subverted from within, and young prince Davin must defend against the traitors with the help of a legendary, metal-eating dragon called Galgameth.', 'The kingdom of Donnegold is being subverted from within, and young prince Davin must defend against the traitors with the help of a legendary, metal-eating dragon called Galgameth.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jU8HgocPJidSONjTqEteBfIXafR.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:149474'),
  ('951343011453195946', 'Galia', 1966, 'Drama', 'Georges Lautner, Maurice Fellous', 'Vahé Katcha', 'Mireille Darc, Venantino Venantini, Françoise Prévost, Jacques Riberolles, François Chaumette, Edward Meeks, Philippe Castelli, Henri Attal', null, 'Newly arrived in Paris, Galia lives in a small apartment near Notre-Dame cathedral. One evening, whilst walking along the banks of the River Seine, she saves a young woman from drowning. The woman, Nicole, tells Galia that she intended to drown herself, having left a suicide note for her husband, Greg. Having settled Nicole in her apartment, Galia sets out to recover the suicide note, but waits so that she can observe Greg’s reaction. When Greg appears unmoved by the note, Galia decides to wait for him at the art gallery where he works...', 'Newly arrived in Paris, Galia lives in a small apartment near Notre-Dame cathedral. One evening, whilst walking along the banks of the River Seine, she saves a young woman from drowning. The woman, Nicole, tells Galia that she intended to drown herself, having left a suicide note for her husband, Greg. Having settled Nicole in her apartment, Galia sets out to recover the suicide note, but waits so that she can observe Greg’s reaction. When Greg appears unmoved by the note, Galia decides to wait for him at the art gallery where he works...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uKQzCS6ez243f4B4xFIBjxLwsMc.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:121208'),
  ('409898538050782547', 'Galician Caress (of Clay)', 1982, 'Documentary', 'José Val del Omar', 'José Val del Omar', 'Ezequiel Méndez, Arturo Baltar', null, 'This film was reconstructed and completed in 1995 by Javier Codesal for the Filmoteca de Andalucia, from the montage and the sound that Val del Omar had outlined before his death, after having returned to a project abandoned twenty years before with the incorporation of significant additions (above all in the soundtrack). Val del Omar''s notes show that, as he typically did, he had other alternative titles in mind, such as "Acariño de la Terra Meiga" (Caress of the Magic Land), "Acariño a nosa terra" (Caress of Our Land), or "Barro de ánimas" (Clay of Souls), and that in the final phase of the unfinished project he wanted to add a second sound channel – following the diaphonic principle, and using electro-acoustic techniques – consisting of ambient material that he intended to record at the first screenings of the film in the very places and to the very people that were its origin: its "clay".', 'This film was reconstructed and completed in 1995 by Javier Codesal for the Filmoteca de Andalucia, from the montage and the sound that Val del Omar had outlined before his death, after having returned to a project abandoned twenty years before with the incorporation of significant additions (above all in the soundtrack). Val del Omar''s notes show that, as he typically did, he had other alternative titles in mind, such as "Acariño de la Terra Meiga" (Caress of the Magic Land), "Acariño a nosa terra" (Caress of Our Land), or "Barro de ánimas" (Clay of Souls), and that in the final phase of the unfinished project he wanted to add a second sound channel – following the diaphonic principle, and using electro-acoustic techniques – consisting of ambient material that he intended to record at the first screenings of the film in the very places and to the very people that were its origin: its "clay".', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/djRCHv7IAfl5foOquu1exkoEnmL.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:125150'),
  ('735893446876365822', 'Galileo', 1968, 'History', 'Liliana Cavani, Alfio Contini, Dora Kovaceva', 'Tullio Pinelli, Fabrizio Onofri, Liliana Cavani', 'Cyril Cusack, Georgi Kaloyanchev, Gigi Ballista, Giulio Brogi, Piero Vida, Georgi Cherkelov, Nikolay Doychev, Miroslav Mindov', null, 'A humble scientist from Padua proves that the Earth revolves and that it is not the center of the universe.', 'A humble scientist from Padua proves that the Earth revolves and that it is not the center of the universe.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5Eo6wfdBWW8JM3UWfJKVrwGIXg6.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:138275'),
  ('117444775639972946', 'Galileo', 1975, 'Drama, History', 'Michael Reed, Joseph Losey', 'Joseph Losey, Barbara Bray', 'Chaim Topol, Edward Fox, Colin Blakely, Georgia Brown, Clive Revill, Margaret Leighton, John Gielgud, Michael Gough', 'PG', 'Challenged by a new student, tutor and theorist Galileo co-opts emerging telescope technology and discovers irrefutable proof of the heretical notion that the earth is not the center of the universe. But in a rigid society ruled by an uneasy alliance of aristocracy and clergy already undermined by the Plague and the Reformation, science is a threat and enlightenment is a luxury. Faced with either death at the hands of the Inquisition or recantation to a hypocritical but all-powerful Papacy, Galileo must choose between his own life and the restless scientific curiosity that he has spurned family, friends, and wealth to pursue.', 'Challenged by a new student, tutor and theorist Galileo co-opts emerging telescope technology and discovers irrefutable proof of the heretical notion that the earth is not the center of the universe. But in a rigid society ruled by an uneasy alliance of aristocracy and clergy already undermined by the Plague and the Reformation, science is a threat and enlightenment is a luxury. Faced with either death at the hands of the Inquisition or recantation to a hypocritical but all-powerful Papacy, Galileo must choose between his own life and the restless scientific curiosity that he has spurned family, friends, and wealth to pursue.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/z9FnPusModm08PSin30HQn8QejF.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:167408'),
  ('653327284763351282', 'Galileo XX', 2013, 'TV Movie, Mystery', 'Hiroshi Nishitani, Hiro''o Yanagida', 'Junya Ikegami', 'Ko Shibasaki, Masaharu Fukuyama, Yusuke Santamaria, Yuya Yagira, Yuriko Yoshitaka, Kazuki Kitamura, Hiroshi Shinagawa, Hayato Onozuka', null, 'A spin-off from popular Japanese TV series "Galileo". Episode XX tells the story of female detective Utsumi Kaoru''s final case before she went to Oklahoma for further training.', 'A spin-off from popular Japanese TV series "Galileo". Episode XX tells the story of female detective Utsumi Kaoru''s final case before she went to Oklahoma for further training.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kRYfNvXkwtvaIhwJZ0S71YQCpL8.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:235919'),
  ('563326394040434857', 'Gall Force: Eternal Story', 1986, 'Animation, Science Fiction, Action, Adventure', 'Katsuhito Akiyama, Yusaku Saotome, Kenichi Yatagai', 'Sukehiro Tomita', 'Eriko Hara, Naoko Matsui, Yuriko Yamamoto, Hiromi Tsuru, Maria Kawamura, Yusaku Yara, Michie Tomizawa, Naoko Watanabe', null, 'Two races, the Solnoids and the Paranoids, have been waging a war for centuries. Barely surviving a large scale space battle, seven Solnoids set course toward Chaos, a planet set to be the new homeland for their race. A malfunction during the light speed journey makes their ship jump ahead of their fleet forcing them to encounter several problems on their own.', 'Two races, the Solnoids and the Paranoids, have been waging a war for centuries. Barely surviving a large scale space battle, seven Solnoids set course toward Chaos, a planet set to be the new homeland for their race. A malfunction during the light speed journey makes their ship jump ahead of their fleet forcing them to encounter several problems on their own.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/w9tii0NcYsx66Rw8GzQf73cUJuL.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:141521'),
  ('765284694171387295', 'Gallant Indies', 2021, 'Documentary', 'Philippe Béziat', null, 'Clément Cogitore', null, 'Stéphane Lissner, director of the Paris Opera, entrusts the staging of the opera-ballet Les Indes galantes to the visual artist Clément Cogitore. Based on the experience of his short film Les Indes galantes, the artist updates Jean-Philippe Rameau''s baroque masterpiece (1735) by bringing together lyric song and urban dance. The choreography is entrusted to Bintou Dembélé who supervises dancers from krump, popping, voguing or even experimental hip hop. From rehearsals to the Premiere, Philippe Béziat films the meeting of urban dancers with the lyric institution and invites the spectator to share a human and artistic experience.', 'Stéphane Lissner, director of the Paris Opera, entrusts the staging of the opera-ballet Les Indes galantes to the visual artist Clément Cogitore. Based on the experience of his short film Les Indes galantes, the artist updates Jean-Philippe Rameau''s baroque masterpiece (1735) by bringing together lyric song and urban dance. The choreography is entrusted to Bintou Dembélé who supervises dancers from krump, popping, voguing or even experimental hip hop. From rehearsals to the Premiere, Philippe Béziat films the meeting of urban dancers with the lyric institution and invites the spectator to share a human and artistic experience.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mQXBnWEZk2YbzncD4TzAd768wWl.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:722282'),
  ('583458544819311108', 'Gallant Journey', 1946, 'History, Drama, Romance', 'William A. Wellman, Sam Nelson, George Meehan', 'William A. Wellman, Byron Morgan', 'Glenn Ford, Janet Blair, Charles Ruggles, Henry Travers, Jimmy Lloyd, Charles Kemper, Selena Royle, Arthur Shields', 'NR', 'Director William A. Wellman adds another to his long line of salutes-to-aviation films in this bio of an aviation pioneer, John Montgomery (Glenn Ford.) In 1883 he built a practical glider despite the opposition of his friends, who thought he was crazy, and of his family, who were afraid that his dreams of flying would hurt his father''s political ambitions. He pursues his education at Santa Clara University where the Jesuits lend a helping and understanding hand. An earthquake destroys what appears to be a working model for an airplane, but a gold-sorting machine Montgomery invented, and then neglected, promises to provide for his financial needs to keep working on his aircraft until he gets involved in costly lawsuits defending his invention.', 'Director William A. Wellman adds another to his long line of salutes-to-aviation films in this bio of an aviation pioneer, John Montgomery (Glenn Ford.) In 1883 he built a practical glider despite the opposition of his friends, who thought he was crazy, and of his family, who were afraid that his dreams of flying would hurt his father''s political ambitions. He pursues his education at Santa Clara University where the Jesuits lend a helping and understanding hand. An earthquake destroys what appears to be a working model for an airplane, but a gold-sorting machine Montgomery invented, and then neglected, promises to provide for his financial needs to keep working on his aircraft until he gets involved in costly lawsuits defending his invention.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6wmsNS3emblqfDg9sBUNoUPLWl9.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:100223'),
  ('32098421448826342', 'Gallants', 2010, 'Action, Comedy', 'Derek Kwok Chi-Kin, Clement Cheng Si-Kit', 'Clement Cheng Si-Kit, Frankie Tam Gong-Yuen, Derek Kwok Chi-Kin', 'Wong Yau-Nam, Chen Kuan-Tai, Bruce Leung Siu-Lung, Teddy Robin, JJ Jia, Susan Shaw Yam-Yam, Michael Chan Wai-Man, Li Haitao', null, 'Master Law awakes from a 30-year coma without memories, but his martial arts skills are intact. His renowned kung fu academy is now a teahouse, and greedy developers are trying to steamroll it to make way for condos', 'Master Law awakes from a 30-year coma without memories, but his martial arts skills are intact. His renowned kung fu academy is now a teahouse, and greedy developers are trying to steamroll it to make way for condos', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rcJdUuRPD7GqgOmY04bGeTRhexB.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:42380'),
  ('873484357744510993', 'Gallipoli', 1981, 'War, History, Drama', 'Peter Weir, Russell Boyd, Mark Egerton', 'David Williamson', 'Mel Gibson, Mark Lee, Bill Kerr, Harold Hopkins, Charles Lathalu Yunipingu, Heath Harris, Ron Graham, Gerda Nicolson', 'PG', 'Two Australian sprinters face the brutal realities of war when they are sent to fight in the Gallipoli campaign in the Ottoman Empire during World War I.', 'Two Australian sprinters face the brutal realities of war when they are sent to fight in the Gallipoli campaign in the Ottoman Empire during World War I.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/un7VCqTmjrq3u75mQ204a8tofD4.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:11646'),
  ('813347081379187271', 'Gallipoli', 2005, 'Documentary, War', 'Tolga Örnek', 'Tolga Örnek', 'Jeremy Irons, Sam Neill, Zafer Ergin', null, 'The Gallipoli campaign of World War I was so controversial & devastating, it changed the face of battle forever. Using diaries, letters, photographs and memoirs, acclaimed director, Tolga Ornek, traces the personal journeys of Australian, New Zealand, British and Turkish soldiers, from innocence and patriotism to hardship and heartbreak.', 'The Gallipoli campaign of World War I was so controversial & devastating, it changed the face of battle forever. Using diaries, letters, photographs and memoirs, acclaimed director, Tolga Ornek, traces the personal journeys of Australian, New Zealand, British and Turkish soldiers, from innocence and patriotism to hardship and heartbreak.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nx5e5QdHQfmxKwkRIP8W7vAcRC4.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:18063'),
  ('941415055082661715', 'Gallipoli: End of the Road', 2013, 'War, Drama, History', 'Kemal Uzun', 'Alphan Dikmen, Başak Angigün', 'Gürkan Uygun, Umut Kurt, Berrak Tüzünataç, Stephen Chance, Ben Warwick, Yıldırım Fikret Urağ, Mehmetcan Diper, İnanç Koçak', null, 'Corporal Muhsin is a sharp shooter who previously fought in the Balkan War. When mobilization is declared again, he joins the war alongside his brother Hasan. The two brothers support each other in the fight against the enemy.', 'Corporal Muhsin is a sharp shooter who previously fought in the Balkan War. When mobilization is declared again, he joins the war alongside his brother Hasan. The two brothers support each other in the fight against the enemy.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/s1sFBRA5FlvevTqezTRv3ygCAje.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:187962'),
  ('868597608000118413', 'Gallo cedrone', 1998, 'Comedy', 'Danilo Desideri, Carlo Verdone, Roberto Giandalia', 'Piero De Bernardi, Carlo Verdone, Leonardo Benvenuti', 'Carlo Verdone, Regina Orioli, Ines Nobili, Paolo Triestino, Enrica Rosso, Giorgia Brugnoli, Alessia Bruno, Roberto Mincuzzi', null, 'The life and times of Armando Feroci, a fortyish year old, who''s been everything, a divorced husband, a careless father, an unreliable brother. The story is told in flashback by his friends while Armando has been mysteriously kidnapped in an Arab country by an integralist group and condemned to death.', 'The life and times of Armando Feroci, a fortyish year old, who''s been everything, a divorced husband, a careless father, an unreliable brother. The story is told in flashback by his friends while Armando has been mysteriously kidnapped in an Arab country by an integralist group and condemned to death.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/d9KRUi4OxpOER0ANBXNpN7hfwmF.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:42674'),
  ('221049149963901958', 'Gallowwalkers', 2012, 'Action, Horror, Western', 'Andrew Goth, Fraser Fennell-Ball', 'Joanne Reay, Andrew Goth', 'Wesley Snipes, Riley Smith, Tanit Phoenix, Steven Elder, Jenny Gago, Kevin Howarth, Alyssa Pridham, Alex Avant', 'R', 'When a nun broke her covenant with God to save the life of her unborn son, Aman, he was cursed for life. As an adult, Aman has killed those who have crossed him. But his curse brings his victims back to life and they pursue him for revenge, so Aman enlists a young gunman to fight by his side against his undead victims.', 'When a nun broke her covenant with God to save the life of her unborn son, Aman, he was cursed for life. As an adult, Aman has killed those who have crossed him. But his curse brings his victims back to life and they pursue him for revenge, so Aman enlists a young gunman to fight by his side against his undead victims.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cGBmTiNomYCk6Lr4Gkhbssg0m82.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:46429'),
  ('536430545018967289', 'Galveston', 2018, 'Thriller', 'Mélanie Laurent, Arnaud Potier', 'Nic Pizzolatto', 'Ben Foster, Elle Fanning, Beau Bridges, Lili Reinhart, Adepero Oduye, Robert Aramayo, María Valverde, C.K. McFarland', 'NR', 'After a violent encounter, Roy finds Rocky and sees something in her eyes that prompts a fateful decision. He takes her with him as he flees to Galveston, an action as ill-advised as it is inescapable.', 'After a violent encounter, Roy finds Rocky and sees something in her eyes that prompts a fateful decision. He takes her with him as he flees to Galveston, an action as ill-advised as it is inescapable.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/u3hDPc70JEWbrLruk6sni1OcODe.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:283601'),
  ('606218672016868484', 'Gambit', 1966, 'Comedy, Crime', 'Joseph E. Kenney, Ronald Neame, Clifford Stine', 'Jack Davies, Alvin Sargent', 'Shirley MacLaine, Michael Caine, Herbert Lom, Roger C. Carmel, Arnold Moss, John Abbott, Richard Angarola, Maurice Marsac', 'NR', 'Harry Dean is a career burglar set on stealing a piece of priceless art from the world''s wealthiest man, Mr. Shahbandar. With the help of exotic showgirl Nicole Chang, he concocts the perfect scheme for how the robbery should go and lays it out point by point. However, when the team tries to execute the plan, perfection and reality don''t quite match up, and Harry''s vision begins to unravel in this twisty tale of a heist gone wrong.', 'Harry Dean is a career burglar set on stealing a piece of priceless art from the world''s wealthiest man, Mr. Shahbandar. With the help of exotic showgirl Nicole Chang, he concocts the perfect scheme for how the robbery should go and lays it out point by point. However, when the team tries to execute the plan, perfection and reality don''t quite match up, and Harry''s vision begins to unravel in this twisty tale of a heist gone wrong.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1MchaxoMtROoioSAwjLd5FEp6D.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:28270'),
  ('151915786563240700', 'Gambit', 2012, 'Comedy, Crime', 'Michael Hoffman, Florian Ballhaus, Ben Howarth', 'Ethan Coen, Joel Coen', 'Colin Firth, Cameron Diaz, Alan Rickman, Tom Courtenay, Stanley Tucci, Cloris Leachman, Alex Macqueen, Joe Berryman', 'PG-13', 'An art curator decides to seek revenge on his abusive boss by conning him into buying a fake Monet, but his plan requires the help of an eccentric and unpredictable Texas rodeo queen.', 'An art curator decides to seek revenge on his abusive boss by conning him into buying a fake Monet, but his plan requires the help of an eccentric and unpredictable Texas rodeo queen.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/j8euGCM4GkRdPiPcelsLVVn0Bx1.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:97434'),
  ('963708152335643027', 'Gambling House', 1950, 'Crime, Drama', 'Harry J. Wild, Ted Tetzlaff', 'Marvin Borowsky, Allen Rivkin', 'Victor Mature, Terry Moore, William Bendix, Basil Ruysdael, Donald Randolph, Damian O''Flynn, Cleo Moore, Ann Doran', null, 'A gambler faces deportation when he gets mixed up with murder.', 'A gambler faces deportation when he gets mixed up with murder.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vc3HDYEZxMUgni3Nfbr7eEwkZjQ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:65282'),
  ('1076285292831631713', 'Gambling Lady', 1934, 'Drama, Mystery', 'Archie Mayo, George Barnes, Frank Shaw', 'Doris Malloy, Ralph Block', 'Barbara Stanwyck, Joel McCrea, Pat O''Brien, Claire Dodd, C. Aubrey Smith, Robert Barrat, Arthur Vinton, Phillip Reed', 'NR', 'A businesslike syndicate runs all the gambling joints in town; least profitable is honest Mike Lee''s. Under pressure to allow cheating, Mike "walks out," leaving tough-minded daughter Lady Lee to earn a living the only way she knows. She soon becomes a success gambling among the rich, but, falling out with the syndicate, she considers the marriage proposal of blueblood Garry Madison. Can such a match work despite snobbery and old associations?', 'A businesslike syndicate runs all the gambling joints in town; least profitable is honest Mike Lee''s. Under pressure to allow cheating, Mike "walks out," leaving tough-minded daughter Lady Lee to earn a living the only way she knows. She soon becomes a success gambling among the rich, but, falling out with the syndicate, she considers the marriage proposal of blueblood Garry Madison. Can such a match work despite snobbery and old associations?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hNTfxLvnpLAqfU42GJXXBpCMu1d.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:152986'),
  ('943603404464191384', 'Gambling Ship', 1933, 'Drama', 'Max Marcin, Louis J. Gasnier, Charles Lang', 'Seton I. Miller', 'Cary Grant, Benita Hume, Jack La Rue, Glenda Farrell, Roscoe Karns, Arthur Vinton, Charles Williams, Edwin Maxwell', null, 'Tired of the dangerous life as gambling boss, Ace Corbin ''retires'' from the racket and travels cross-country by train to begin a new life with a new name. On the train, he meets Eleanor and they fall in love. Eleanor is afraid to tell Ace she''s a soiled dove and Ace doesn''t tell Eleanor of his shady past. Old enemies won''t let Ace begin his new life, and old commitments''s won''t free Eleanor of her sordid ties. Ace''s old life and Eleanor''s deception collide with the typical results. But love conquers all!', 'Tired of the dangerous life as gambling boss, Ace Corbin ''retires'' from the racket and travels cross-country by train to begin a new life with a new name. On the train, he meets Eleanor and they fall in love. Eleanor is afraid to tell Ace she''s a soiled dove and Ace doesn''t tell Eleanor of his shady past. Old enemies won''t let Ace begin his new life, and old commitments''s won''t free Eleanor of her sordid ties. Ace''s old life and Eleanor''s deception collide with the typical results. But love conquers all!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/woZp6juv8rPVlnYO8ngNwdCkELr.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:81109'),
  ('814957391394565805', 'Gambling with Souls', 1936, 'Drama, Crime', 'Elmer Clifton, James Diamond', null, 'Martha Chapin, Wheeler Oakman, Bryant Washburn, Gay Sheridan, Vera Steadman, Edward Keane, Robert Frazer, Gaston Glass', null, 'Young girls are cheated into rigged gambling games and then forced into prostitution to pay off their debts.', 'Young girls are cheated into rigged gambling games and then forced into prostitution to pay off their debts.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pN1rZdDkISgE27G43vuGNRv8n64.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:90352'),
  ('996388865765338294', 'Game', 2006, 'Animation', 'Georges Schwizgebel', null, null, null, 'A visual and musical game which builds and destroys itself according to the vivacious rhythm of Serge Prokofiev’s Scherzo to Piano Concerto No. 2.', 'A visual and musical game which builds and destroys itself according to the vivacious rhythm of Serge Prokofiev’s Scherzo to Piano Concerto No. 2.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cbCKEe9RE6Bf8IRaPQlrTyothqw.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:256644'),
  ('301283141080028350', 'Game', 2011, 'Mystery, Thriller', 'Abhinay Deo, Jai Sharma, Niraj Kothari', null, 'Abhishek Bachchan, Kangana Ranaut, Gauahar Khan, Sarah-Jane Dias, Jimmy Shergill, Shahana Goswami, Boman Irani, Anupam Kher', null, 'Four strangers are invited by the reclusive Kabir Malhotra, to his private island of Samos, Greece. They don''t know each other and they don''t know him ... and by the next morning they will wish they had never come.', 'Four strangers are invited by the reclusive Kabir Malhotra, to his private island of Samos, Greece. They don''t know each other and they don''t know him ... and by the next morning they will wish they had never come.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nB8jtWGzFuYGRY1Dkbtf23dxbap.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:60740'),
  ('1122660753708143351', 'Game 6', 2006, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Michael Hoffman, Karen M. Kane, Betsy Friedman', 'Don DeLillo', 'Michael Keaton, Robert Downey Jr., Ari Graynor, Griffin Dunne, Bebe Neuwirth, Shalom Harlow, Nadia Dajani, Harris Yulin', 'R', 'Combining real and fictional events, this movie centers around the historic 1986 World Series, and a day in the life of a playwright who skips opening night to watch the momentous game.', 'Combining real and fictional events, this movie centers around the historic 1986 World Series, and a day in the life of a playwright who skips opening night to watch the momentous game.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nwXLO5SWMt7xTIPhPMcM1qBZJxg.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:80919'),
  ('81728020161211058', 'Game Change', 2012, 'TV Movie, Drama, Comedy, History', 'Jay Roach, Richard Hicks, David Rubin', 'Danny Strong', 'Julianne Moore, Woody Harrelson, Ed Harris, Peter MacNicol, Jamey Sheridan, Sarah Paulson, Ron Livingston, David Barry Gray', 'NR', 'During the Republican run of the 2008 Presidential election, candidate John McCain picks a relative unknown, Alaskan governor Sarah Palin, to be his running mate. As the campaign kicks into high gear, her lack of experience, in both political and media savvy, becomes a drain upon McCain and his strategists.', 'During the Republican run of the 2008 Presidential election, candidate John McCain picks a relative unknown, Alaskan governor Sarah Palin, to be his running mate. As the campaign kicks into high gear, her lack of experience, in both political and media savvy, becomes a drain upon McCain and his strategists.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wfRJbhF3zkp3eBpSHkLyzLIKqEM.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:91010'),
  ('167461434608983971', 'Game Changer', 2021, 'Comedy, Crime', 'Tiwa Moeithaisong, Tiwa Moeithaisong', 'Kimhant Kanjanasomjai, Nattapot Potchumnean', 'Pitawat Pruekkit, Isara Kitnitchi, Kyutae Sim, Khunnapat Pichetworawut, Ploypailin Thangprapaporn, Day Thaitanium, Nopachai Jayanama, Jonathan Holman', null, 'When the city''s mafia boss die, his four aides decide to keep his death a secret and continue to run his rackets. However, they soon discover that deception is a dangerous game.', 'When the city''s mafia boss die, his four aides decide to keep his death a secret and continue to run his rackets. However, they soon discover that deception is a dangerous game.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2NWiOOzLPilMC785dSywZCgkkvQ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:890665'),
  ('595133784541830494', 'Game Changer', 2025, 'Action, Drama', 'Shankar, S. Thirunavukkarasu', 'Vivek, Shankar', 'Ram Charan, Anjali, Kiara Advani, S. J. Suryah, Srikanth, Jayaram, Samuthirakani, Sunil Varma', 'NR', 'Ram, a newly appointed district collector, takes charge in a city in Andhra Pradesh and immediately confronts the deeply entrenched corruption and inefficiency plaguing the government. Determined to bring reforms, he initiates sweeping changes, sparking a fierce conflict with a powerful state Minister.', 'Ram, a newly appointed district collector, takes charge in a city in Andhra Pradesh and immediately confronts the deeply entrenched corruption and inefficiency plaguing the government. Determined to bring reforms, he initiates sweeping changes, sparking a fierce conflict with a powerful state Minister.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qtOGsZoLW7QceqKmsOy5nSM6Aik.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:811944'),
  ('29845551263618166', 'Game Changers', 2024, 'Comedy', 'Jérémie Sein, Juliette Denis, Mathieu Gaudet', 'Fanny Burdino, Mathias Gavarry, Jérémie Sein', 'Benjamin Voisin, Emmanuelle Bercot, Rivaldo Pawawi, Grégoire Ludig, Laura Felpin, Lottie Andersen, Suzy Bemba, Aure Atika', null, 'Ten days into the competition, the International Games are a complete fiasco for the French delegation as they’ve consistently failed to win any gold medals. All hopes now rest on Paul, an outstanding shooting champion, though somewhat immature and not particularly clever. As the event draws near, he has to share his room with Jacob, a carefree swimmer from Vanuatu, who seems more focused on the village’s “extra-curricular activities” than on his own races.', 'Ten days into the competition, the International Games are a complete fiasco for the French delegation as they’ve consistently failed to win any gold medals. All hopes now rest on Paul, an outstanding shooting champion, though somewhat immature and not particularly clever. As the event draws near, he has to share his room with Jacob, a carefree swimmer from Vanuatu, who seems more focused on the village’s “extra-curricular activities” than on his own races.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tCmSyQnHqFm77dgjDi37883BpSJ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1114749'),
  ('441175617947829940', 'Game Night', 2018, 'Mystery, Comedy, Crime', 'Paul Schmitz, Danny Brown, Carla Martinez', 'Mark Perez', 'Jason Bateman, Rachel McAdams, Kyle Chandler, Sharon Horgan, Billy Magnussen, Lamorne Morris, Kylie Bunbury, Jesse Plemons', 'R', 'Max and Annie''s weekly game night gets kicked up a notch when Max''s brother Brooks arranges a murder mystery party -- complete with fake thugs and federal agents. So when Brooks gets kidnapped, it''s all supposed to be part of the game. As the competitors set out to solve the case, they start to learn that neither the game nor Brooks are what they seem to be. The friends soon find themselves in over their heads as each twist leads to another unexpected turn over the course of one chaotic night.', 'Max and Annie''s weekly game night gets kicked up a notch when Max''s brother Brooks arranges a murder mystery party -- complete with fake thugs and federal agents. So when Brooks gets kidnapped, it''s all supposed to be part of the game. As the competitors set out to solve the case, they start to learn that neither the game nor Brooks are what they seem to be. The friends soon find themselves in over their heads as each twist leads to another unexpected turn over the course of one chaotic night.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/85R8LMyn9f2Lev2YPBF8Nughrkv.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:445571'),
  ('686421384567058380', 'Game of Death', 1978, 'Drama, Action, Thriller', 'Robert Clouse, Godfrey A. Godar, Mike Gowans', 'Robert Clouse, Bruce Lee', 'Bruce Lee, Gig Young, Dean Jagger, Hugh O''Brian, Colleen Camp, Robert Wall, Mel Novak, Kareem Abdul-Jabbar', 'R', 'A martial arts movie star must fake his death to find the people who are trying to kill him.', 'A martial arts movie star must fake his death to find the people who are trying to kill him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/c6jgLHaQpdIPH1rC94KkjAqgE7O.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:13333'),
  ('702585790055498714', 'Game of Death', 2011, 'Adventure, Action, Thriller', 'Giorgio Serafini, Erik Curtis, Stephen Campbell', 'Jim Agnew, Megan Brown', 'Wesley Snipes, Gary Daniels, Robert Davi, Zoë Bell, Aunjanue Ellis-Taylor, Quinn Duffy, Ernie Hudson, Simon Rhee', 'R', 'CIA agent Marcus is sent undercover to Detroit to take out an arms dealer and the head of the hedge fund that is financing him. His CIA backup has other plans and turns on him, and it''s a fight to survive in a hospital and into the hedge fund vault.', 'CIA agent Marcus is sent undercover to Detroit to take out an arms dealer and the head of the hedge fund that is financing him. His CIA backup has other plans and turns on him, and it''s a fight to survive in a hospital and into the hedge fund vault.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iaF3ln0xzbam2QfeFQTKpTVCPHy.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:46541'),
  ('595037385729453387', 'Game of Death', 2017, 'Thriller, Horror', 'Sébastien Landry, Laurence Morais Lagacé, Simon-Pierre Gingras', 'Laurence Morais Lagacé, Sébastien Landry, Edouard H. Bond', 'Sam Earle, Victoria Diamond, Emelia Hellman, Catherine Saindon, Erniel Baez, Nick Serino, Thomas Vallières, Jane Hackett', 'NR', 'Kill or be killed is the golden rule of the Game of Death. Sucks for seven millennials who ignored that rule. Now each one''s head will explode unless they kill someone. Will they turn on each other to survive, or will this sunny day be the last for the innocent people of their middle-of-nowhere town?', 'Kill or be killed is the golden rule of the Game of Death. Sucks for seven millennials who ignored that rule. Now each one''s head will explode unless they kill someone. Will they turn on each other to survive, or will this sunny day be the last for the innocent people of their middle-of-nowhere town?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mMUF2tW5ACnLUZ5aOMliVzv03Il.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:438982'),
  ('626011142999486182', 'Game of Death II', 1981, 'Drama, Action', 'Sammo Hung Kam-Bo, Ng See-Yuen', 'Ting Chak-luen, Ho Ting-sing', 'Kim Tae-Jeong, Bruce Lee, Hwang Jang-Lee, Roy Horan, Roy Chiao, Hao Li-Jen, To Wai-Wo, Tiger Yang Cheong-Woo', null, 'In this dark tale of revenge, Bruce Lee "returns" as Billy Lo, whose best friend Chin Ku dies of a sudden illness. But suspicion of foul play arises when a gang tries to steal Ku''s coffin at the funeral using a helicopter. When Lo''s younger brother Lo hears about the incident, he leaves his Buddhist master to investigate the truth. His trail soon leads him to the Castle of Death, the last place Chin Ku was seen alive. There, he meets and befriends an unlikely ally--a cruel and merciless martial arts expert who is also the tower''s master. But when the master dies under mysterious circumstances, Lo ends up dueling with someone far more terrifying.', 'In this dark tale of revenge, Bruce Lee "returns" as Billy Lo, whose best friend Chin Ku dies of a sudden illness. But suspicion of foul play arises when a gang tries to steal Ku''s coffin at the funeral using a helicopter. When Lo''s younger brother Lo hears about the incident, he leaves his Buddhist master to investigate the truth. His trail soon leads him to the Castle of Death, the last place Chin Ku was seen alive. There, he meets and befriends an unlikely ally--a cruel and merciless martial arts expert who is also the tower''s master. But when the master dies under mysterious circumstances, Lo ends up dueling with someone far more terrifying.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lVL0oX4ZA2owOtQwTsmbw92lhCp.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:48773'),
  ('394469809370461970', 'Game of Four', 2007, 'Comedy', 'Bruno Dega', 'Jeanne Le Guillou, Bruno Dega', 'François Cluzet, Mathilde Seigner, Roschdy Zem, Alice Taglioni, Talina Boyaci, Titouan Laporte, Florence Foresti', null, 'When a man & woman discover their spouses are having an affair with each other, they secretly plot to break them up and win them back', 'When a man & woman discover their spouses are having an affair with each other, they secretly plot to break them up and win them back', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mrgEjqlV6OxsOJaJsjMCrcxZhkx.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:49387'),
  ('959612585183110884', 'Game of Identity', 2026, 'Mystery, Crime', 'Cheng Liang', 'Cheng Liang', 'Peng Yuchang, Ding Yuxi, Heliao Lüyun, Rebecca Li, Deng Enxi, Hou Wenyuan', null, 'The story tells the story of Liu Quan Long, a lowly born and independent struggling young man who got the opportunity to exchange his life with a boy from another class in a famous university. Unexpectedly, what was waiting for him was a thrilling game. Liu Quan Long is an impoverished young man who can''t afford to go to university but has a great talent. Before meeting Chen Lun, he was an Internet cafe administrator outside the university who would never be noticed. Chen Lun has a distinguished family and studied at an elite university just across the street from an internet cafe, but he had no intention of going to school. In order to cope with his parents abroad, he offered Liu Quan Long an invitation to the game of "identity exchange" and asked Liu Quan Long to replace him.', 'The story tells the story of Liu Quan Long, a lowly born and independent struggling young man who got the opportunity to exchange his life with a boy from another class in a famous university. Unexpectedly, what was waiting for him was a thrilling game. Liu Quan Long is an impoverished young man who can''t afford to go to university but has a great talent. Before meeting Chen Lun, he was an Internet cafe administrator outside the university who would never be noticed. Chen Lun has a distinguished family and studied at an elite university just across the street from an internet cafe, but he had no intention of going to school. In order to cope with his parents abroad, he offered Liu Quan Long an invitation to the game of "identity exchange" and asked Liu Quan Long to replace him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9hXg73Gosne5bLHbo23Bh0oGR1R.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1249589'),
  ('121029991818886743', 'Game of Love', 2009, 'Action, Comedy', 'Murat Şeker', 'Murat Şeker', 'Tolgahan Sayışman, Bergüzar Korel, Zeki Alasya, Altan Erkekli, Altan Gördüm, Ömür Arpacı, Yosi Mizrahi, Hakan Bilgin', null, 'With his dad’s shop threatened by commercial development, Ali decides to change the building contractor’s mind by making his daughter fall for him.', 'With his dad’s shop threatened by commercial development, Ali decides to change the building contractor’s mind by making his daughter fall for him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iJitICtBL7hVXtLPogU0fwSwiK0.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:32345'),
  ('281027860574048830', 'Game of Love', 2022, 'Romance, Drama', 'Elisa Amoruso, Martina Cocco, Davide Blandamura', 'Elisa Amoruso', 'Bella Thorne, Benjamin Mascolo, Alma Noce, Simone Coppo, Francesca Inaudi, Linda Zampaglione, Bruno Di Chiara, Barbara Giummarra', null, 'Follows Vivien and Roy as their love story continues and leads them to Roy’s childhood home in Sicily to prepare for the sale of the family estate. During the visit, a mysterious woman arrives and befriends Vivien, much to Roy’s displeasure. Tensions build and lines are crossed as secrets from Roy’s past force the couple to face aspects of their relationship they did not know existed.', 'Follows Vivien and Roy as their love story continues and leads them to Roy’s childhood home in Sicily to prepare for the sale of the family estate. During the visit, a mysterious woman arrives and befriends Vivien, much to Roy’s displeasure. Tensions build and lines are crossed as secrets from Roy’s past force the couple to face aspects of their relationship they did not know existed.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/slLGOl6rTiMVySAYesYUFnJaaTf.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:888479'),
  ('103758121248959222', 'Game of Thrones: The Last Watch', 2019, 'Documentary', 'Jeanie Finlay, Mark Bushnell, Aaron Black', null, 'Lena Headey, Emilia Clarke, Kit Harington, Nikolaj Coster-Waldau, Peter Dinklage, Sophie Turner, Isaac Hempstead Wright, Maisie Williams', null, 'For a year, acclaimed British filmmaker Jeanie Finlay was embedded on the set of the hit HBO series “Game of Thrones,” chronicling the creation of the show’s most ambitious and complicated season. Debuting one week after the series 8 finale, GAME OF THRONES: THE LAST WATCH delves deep into the mud and blood to reveal the tears and triumphs involved in the challenge of bringing the fantasy world of Westeros to life in the very real studios, fields and car-parks of Northern Ireland. Made with unprecedented access, GAME OF THRONES: THE LAST WATCH is an up-close and personal portrait from the trenches of production, following the crew and the cast as they contend with extreme weather, punishing deadlines and an ever-excited fandom hungry for spoilers. Much more than a “making of” documentary, this is a funny, heartbreaking story, told with wit and intimacy, about the bittersweet pleasures of what it means to create a world – and then have to say goodbye to it.', 'For a year, acclaimed British filmmaker Jeanie Finlay was embedded on the set of the hit HBO series “Game of Thrones,” chronicling the creation of the show’s most ambitious and complicated season. Debuting one week after the series 8 finale, GAME OF THRONES: THE LAST WATCH delves deep into the mud and blood to reveal the tears and triumphs involved in the challenge of bringing the fantasy world of Westeros to life in the very real studios, fields and car-parks of Northern Ireland. Made with unprecedented access, GAME OF THRONES: THE LAST WATCH is an up-close and personal portrait from the trenches of production, following the crew and the cast as they contend with extreme weather, punishing deadlines and an ever-excited fandom hungry for spoilers. Much more than a “making of” documentary, this is a funny, heartbreaking story, told with wit and intimacy, about the bittersweet pleasures of what it means to create a world – and then have to say goodbye to it.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tVyKpOYDtKzs4SOYCbZn4YNFWHI.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:591278'),
  ('726151260377053874', 'Game of Werewolves', 2011, 'Comedy, Horror', 'Juan Martínez Moreno', 'Juan Martínez Moreno', 'Carlos Areces, Luis Zahera, Mabel Rivera, Gorka Otxoa, Secun de la Rosa, Manuel Manquiña, Coté Soler, Marcos Ruiz', null, 'After 15 years, Tomas, a not very succesfull writer, comes back to the village in Galicia where his family comes from, Arga, apparently to get an award. But he doesn''t know the real reason why he is there, to end with an old curse that is been haunting the village for the last hundred years.', 'After 15 years, Tomas, a not very succesfull writer, comes back to the village in Galicia where his family comes from, Arga, apparently to get an award. But he doesn''t know the real reason why he is there, to end with an old curse that is been haunting the village for the last hundred years.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cxafAf42mWyYzTyPDenDNA22yOz.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:100270'),
  ('315365599716888109', 'Game Over', 2019, 'Thriller, Mystery, Drama', 'Ashwin Saravanan, A. Vasanth', 'Ashwin Saravanan', 'Taapsee Pannu, Vinodhini Vaidyanathan, Anish Kuruvilla, Sanchana Natarajan, Ramya Subramanian, Maala Parvathi', null, 'Swapna, a nyctophobic game designer on a turbulent road to recovery from an incident that scarred her deeply, has to fight her inner demons to stay alive in the game called life.', 'Swapna, a nyctophobic game designer on a turbulent road to recovery from an incident that scarred her deeply, has to fight her inner demons to stay alive in the game called life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cuC482gXCEGY9iDkAWp8OZmEU5L.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:553456'),
  ('86097121284943259', 'Game Over, Man!', 2018, 'Action, Comedy', 'Kyle Newacheck, Grant Smith', 'Anders Holm', 'Adam Devine, Anders Holm, Blake Anderson, Utkarsh Ambudkar, Jamie Demetriou, Aya Cash, Daniel Stern, Rhona Mitra', 'R', 'Three friends are on the verge of getting their video game financed when their benefactor is taken hostage by terrorists.', 'Three friends are on the verge of getting their video game financed when their benefactor is taken hostage by terrorists.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/58BnnYeQOTzdMBghZIH1tSH0REx.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:456750'),
  ('24341290775265143', 'Game Over: Kasparov and the Machine', 2003, 'Documentary', 'Vikram Jayanti', null, 'Marc Ghannoum, Michael Greengard, Anatoli Karpov, Garry Kasparov, Joel Benjamin Mowdy', null, 'Garry Kasparov is possibly the greatest chess player who has ever lived. In 1997, he played a match against the greatest chess computer: IBM''s Deep Blue. He lost. This film depicts the drama that happened away from the chess board from Kasparov''s perspective. It explores the psychological aspects of the game and the paranoia surrounding IBM''s ultimate chess machine.', 'Garry Kasparov is possibly the greatest chess player who has ever lived. In 1997, he played a match against the greatest chess computer: IBM''s Deep Blue. He lost. This film depicts the drama that happened away from the chess board from Kasparov''s perspective. It explores the psychological aspects of the game and the paranoia surrounding IBM''s ultimate chess machine.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/92yRagLCvY5XE8GqOslXXmzLuVx.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:57337'),
  ('1081114774835338207', 'Game Therapy', 2015, 'Science Fiction, Adventure, Action, Fantasy, Drama', 'Ryan Travis, Mike Ozier, Abdelghafar Essalfi', 'Marco Cohen, Giacomo Berdini, Adam Lawson', 'Federico Clapis, Lorenzo Ostuni, Leonardo Decarli, Daniele Sodano, Paolo D''Amico, Jennifer Mischiati, Jonny Ortiz, Elisa Piazza', null, 'A man tries to cure his friend of his video-game obsession by using a virtual reality machine. When the device traps his friend in a virtual world, he goes in to help him fight for his life.', 'A man tries to cure his friend of his video-game obsession by using a virtual reality machine. When the device traps his friend in a virtual world, he goes in to help him fight for his life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8AhVp2nd0hCh2ietrUH1nLaVChs.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:364470'),
  ('87458681412944819', 'Gamebox 1.0', 2004, 'Horror, Science Fiction', 'Scott Hillenbrand, David Hillenbrand, Philip D. Schwartz', 'Patrick Casey, Josh Miller', 'Nate Richert, Danielle Fishel, Patrick Kilpatrick, Patrick Cavanaugh, Robert Tena, Megan Blake, Patrick Renna, Jess Malloy', 'PG-13', 'Miserable after the shooting death of his girlfriend, video game tester Charlie immerses himself in his work. When a new 3D game comes in the mail, he becomes caught up in its bizarre fantasy world -- literally. Trapped inside the game, Charlie''s only way out is to win a brutal fight-to-the-death battle.', 'Miserable after the shooting death of his girlfriend, video game tester Charlie immerses himself in his work. When a new 3D game comes in the mail, he becomes caught up in its bizarre fantasy world -- literally. Trapped inside the game, Charlie''s only way out is to win a brutal fight-to-the-death battle.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nVBT9Dz5BFNuKlwFZwOpdBR2Irb.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:34112'),
  ('454778521699589522', 'GameCenter CX: The Movie - 1986 Mighty Bomb Jack', 2014, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Masatoshi Kurakata', 'Kensaku Sakai', 'Shinya Arino, Hajime Yoshi, Yuna Taira, Takamasa Abe, Kaito Matsushima, Kakeru Yoshida, Asami Kokoro', null, 'The story takes place in Japan in both 1986 and 2006. The 1986 storyline follows a gamer named Daisuke who wants to confess his feelings for Kumiko, a girl he likes — all while trying to reclaim his copy of the Famicom (NES) game Mighty Bomb Jack that he lent out. In 2006, the hapless game company manager Arino-kacho struggles to complete Mighty Bomb Jack in front of fans. The storylines of the boy who loves Famicom and the middle-aged man who loves Famicom eventually merge into one.', 'The story takes place in Japan in both 1986 and 2006. The 1986 storyline follows a gamer named Daisuke who wants to confess his feelings for Kumiko, a girl he likes — all while trying to reclaim his copy of the Famicom (NES) game Mighty Bomb Jack that he lent out. In 2006, the hapless game company manager Arino-kacho struggles to complete Mighty Bomb Jack in front of fans. The storylines of the boy who loves Famicom and the middle-aged man who loves Famicom eventually merge into one.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cWMfNu436NEmewyktaT96a4bCUO.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:233839'),
  ('326747098821837016', 'Gamer', 2001, 'Action, Thriller, Science Fiction', 'Patrick Levy, Tariel Meliava', 'Patrick Levy, Daive Cohen, Fabien Suarez', 'Saïd Taghmaoui, Alexis Loret, Camille De Pazzis, Maud Buquet, Bruno Salomone, Arielle Dombasle, Laurent Klug, Julien Courbey', null, 'Tony is crazy about video games. But he is arrested during a hold-up which failed, and he goes to prison for eight months. When he gets out, he contacts Valery, GameStar''s boss, and offers her a new video game concept.', 'Tony is crazy about video games. But he is arrested during a hold-up which failed, and he goes to prison for eight months. When he gets out, he contacts Valery, GameStar''s boss, and offers her a new video game concept.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xtcZ1WrtvexoOcH9sB4cSIDm9Nq.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:82495'),
  ('466347465329461675', 'Gamer', 2009, 'Action, Thriller, Science Fiction', 'Brian Taylor, Mark Neveldine, Jon Mallard', 'Mark Neveldine, Brian Taylor', 'Gerard Butler, Amber Valletta, Michael C. Hall, Kyra Sedgwick, Logan Lerman, Alison Lohman, Terry Crews, Ramsey Moore', 'R', 'Mind-control technology has taken society by a storm, a multiplayer on-line game called "Slayers" allows players to control human prisoners in mass-scale. Simon controls Kable, the online champion of the game. Kable''s ultimate challenge becomes regaining his identity and independence by defeating the game''s mastermind.', 'Mind-control technology has taken society by a storm, a multiplayer on-line game called "Slayers" allows players to control human prisoners in mass-scale. Simon controls Kable, the online champion of the game. Kable''s ultimate challenge becomes regaining his identity and independence by defeating the game''s mastermind.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/d5BTNmr87p7EvguTFW72vlL9l9H.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:18501'),
  ('57388059025193137', 'Gamera', 2015, 'Science Fiction, Horror', 'Katsuhito Ishii', null, 'Rui Takahashi, Kankuro Kudo', null, 'GAMERA is a kaiju short film first released as a celebration of the 50th anniversary of Gamera''s debut film.', 'GAMERA is a kaiju short film first released as a celebration of the 50th anniversary of Gamera''s debut film.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mJAu22p1AOcVVoOIxbYNzTolSB0.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:664048'),
  ('360236329804352632', 'Gamera 2: Attack of Legion', 1996, 'Fantasy, Science Fiction, Horror', 'Shusuke Kaneko, Shinji Higuchi, Atsuki Sato', 'Kazunori Ito', 'Toshiyuki Nagashima, Miki Mizuno, Tamotsu Ishibashi, Mitsuru Fukikoshi, Ayako Fujitani, Yukijiro Hotaru, Zen Kajihara, Tomorowo Taguchi', null, 'A strange meteor lands in Japan and unleashes hundreds of insect-like "Legion" creatures bent on colonizing the Earth. When the military fails to control the situation, Gamera shows up to deal with the ever-evolving space adversary. However the battle may result in Gamera losing his bond with both Asagi and humanity.', 'A strange meteor lands in Japan and unleashes hundreds of insect-like "Legion" creatures bent on colonizing the Earth. When the military fails to control the situation, Gamera shows up to deal with the ever-evolving space adversary. However the battle may result in Gamera losing his bond with both Asagi and humanity.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xPBtoCLUN0raEKywuiSId6SSRAc.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:59480'),
  ('319682986618367038', 'Gamera 3: Revenge of Iris', 1999, 'Fantasy, Science Fiction, Horror', 'Shusuke Kaneko, Shinji Higuchi, Atsuki Sato', 'Shusuke Kaneko, Kazunori Ito', 'Ai Maeda, Shinobu Nakayama, Aki Maeda, Ayako Fujitani, Yû Koyama, Nozomi Ando, Ito Takahiro, Senri Yamazaki', null, 'With the Gyaos re-emerging, Gamera''s ties to humanity have been severed with his bond to Asagi broken. Nagamine and Asagi investigate while an orphaned girl named Ayana discovers a new creature she names Iris. Nagamine and Asagi must reach Ayana before she takes her revenge on Gamera, who she blames for the death of her family.', 'With the Gyaos re-emerging, Gamera''s ties to humanity have been severed with his bond to Asagi broken. Nagamine and Asagi investigate while an orphaned girl named Ayana discovers a new creature she names Iris. Nagamine and Asagi must reach Ayana before she takes her revenge on Gamera, who she blames for the death of her family.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yeUzjv04YdWS3Er5m1gPJJS1D10.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:60159'),
  ('53097025986915034', 'Gamera the Brave', 2006, 'Action, Adventure, Fantasy, Science Fiction, Family', 'Ryuta Tasaki, Kazuhiro Suzuki, Shinsuke Ohno', 'Yukari Tatsui', 'Ryo Tomioka, Kaho, Kanji Tsuda, Susumu Terajima, Kaoru Okunuki, Megumi Kobayashi, Shingo Ishikawa, Shogo Narita', null, 'A young boy in a peaceful seaside town gets more than he bargained for when he takes home a mysterious egg. When it hatches, out comes a baby turtle that grows into a new version of Gamera. But will it become powerful enough in time to defeat the rampaging monster Zedus?', 'A young boy in a peaceful seaside town gets more than he bargained for when he takes home a mysterious egg. When it hatches, out comes a baby turtle that grows into a new version of Gamera. But will it become powerful enough in time to defeat the rampaging monster Zedus?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fXx9C0RhNboR7IKuQ8kiyRqTW0o.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:60160'),
  ('984714531923568774', 'Gamera vs. Barugon', 1966, 'Fantasy, Action, Science Fiction', 'Shigeo Tanaka, Michio Takahashi', 'Nisan Takahashi', 'Kōjirō Hongō, Kyōko Enami, Yūzō Hayakawa, Takuya Fujioka, Kōji Fujiyama, Shō Natsuki, Yoshirō Kitahara, Ichirō Sugai', null, 'Gamera escapes from his rocket enclosure and makes his way back to Earth as a giant opal from New Guinea is brought back to Japan. The opal is discovered to have been an egg that births a new monster called Barugon. The creature attacks the city of Osaka by emitting a destructive rainbow ray from his back, along with a freezing spray capable of incapacitating Gamera.', 'Gamera escapes from his rocket enclosure and makes his way back to Earth as a giant opal from New Guinea is brought back to Japan. The opal is discovered to have been an egg that births a new monster called Barugon. The creature attacks the city of Osaka by emitting a destructive rainbow ray from his back, along with a freezing spray capable of incapacitating Gamera.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tXHVZDyeZPMtd3ggxZEpjmDIdWg.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:22899'),
  ('19701976978196586', 'Gamera vs. Guiron', 1969, 'Adventure, Science Fiction, Action, Family', 'Noriaki Yuasa, Akira Kitazaki', 'Nisan Takahashi', 'Nobuhiro Kajima, Christopher Murphy, Miyuki Akiyama, Eiji Funakoshi, Kon Omura, Yūko Hamada, Reiko Kasahara, Edith Hanson', null, 'Two young boys sneak aboard a spaceship and find themselves whisked away to the mysterious planet Terra. There, they encounter Gamera''s old foe Gyaos and two female aliens with a taste for human brains. Gamera must save the children and battle the new monster Guiron, whose entire body is a deadly living weapon.', 'Two young boys sneak aboard a spaceship and find themselves whisked away to the mysterious planet Terra. There, they encounter Gamera''s old foe Gyaos and two female aliens with a taste for human brains. Gamera must save the children and battle the new monster Guiron, whose entire body is a deadly living weapon.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/13Hn8vS45Ua0ex5dpVED5eQlqZi.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:26947'),
  ('139488142031724370', 'Gamera vs. Gyaos', 1967, 'Action, Adventure, Horror, Science Fiction', 'Akira Uehara, Noriaki Yuasa, Masao Kobayashi', 'Nisan Takahashi', 'Kōjirō Hongō, Kichijirō Ueda, Reiko Kasahara, Naoyuki Abe, Taro Marui, Yukitaro Hotaru, Yoshirō Kitahara, Fujio Murakami', null, 'Unusual volcanic activity in Japan awakens Gyaos, a bloodthirsty flying monster with the power to slice things in half with an ultrasonic ray. While scientists and the military scramble to devise a way to stop this new threat, a young boy forms an alliance with Gamera; a monster no one else seems to trust.', 'Unusual volcanic activity in Japan awakens Gyaos, a bloodthirsty flying monster with the power to slice things in half with an ultrasonic ray. While scientists and the military scramble to devise a way to stop this new threat, a young boy forms an alliance with Gamera; a monster no one else seems to trust.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sQFFSD4ie6BqbXX7GWre7OikqmD.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:52728'),
  ('1131684829422815485', 'Gamera vs. Jiger', 1970, 'Action, Adventure, Science Fiction, Family, Fantasy', 'Noriaki Yuasa, Akira Kitazaki', 'Nisan Takahashi', 'Tsutomu Takakuwa, Kelly Varis, Katherine Murphy, Ryô Hayami, Franz Gruber, Junko Yashiro, Kon Omura, Umenosuke Izumi', null, 'When a giant stone statue on Wester Island is disturbed, the legendary monster Jiger appears and heads for Japan. Gamera tries to stop this new rival, only to be injured when Jiger lays eggs inside of him. As two boys in a submarine go on a dangerous quest inside of Gamera''s body to save him, Jiger threatens the Expo ''70 world''s fair in Osaka.', 'When a giant stone statue on Wester Island is disturbed, the legendary monster Jiger appears and heads for Japan. Gamera tries to stop this new rival, only to be injured when Jiger lays eggs inside of him. As two boys in a submarine go on a dangerous quest inside of Gamera''s body to save him, Jiger threatens the Expo ''70 world''s fair in Osaka.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4nIUsyeNTJXpsTi4Hc6Fkwr6y3l.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:70327'),
  ('210133472763848297', 'Gamera vs. Viras', 1968, 'Adventure, Action, Science Fiction, Family', 'Noriaki Yuasa, Akira Kitazaki', 'Nisan Takahashi', 'Kōjirō Hongō, Tôru Takatsuka, Carl Craig, Michiko Yaegaki, Peter Williams, Kōji Fujiyama, Mari Atsumi, Junko Yashiro', null, 'As alien invaders plot to conquer the Earth, two Boy Scouts steal a mini-submarine and discover Gamera in their midst. Transported to the alien''s spaceship, the Scouts are menaced by the evil inhabitants, including Viras, a squid-like monster that grows to colossal size to battle Gamera.', 'As alien invaders plot to conquer the Earth, two Boy Scouts steal a mini-submarine and discover Gamera in their midst. Transported to the alien''s spaceship, the Scouts are menaced by the evil inhabitants, including Viras, a squid-like monster that grows to colossal size to battle Gamera.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cVrmsX0O071tWBUQBtjSnIBFYk4.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:34131'),
  ('918422612185582039', 'Gamera vs. Zigra', 1971, 'Adventure, Science Fiction, Action, Family', 'Noriaki Yuasa, Akira Uehara, Masami Akise', 'Nisan Takahashi', 'Eiko Yanami, Reiko Kasahara, Mikiko Tsubouchi, Kōji Fujiyama, Isamu Saeki, Shin Minatsu, Arlene Zoellner, Gloria Zoellner', null, 'A moon base is destroyed by a spaceship from Zigra which is looking to take over the planet earth to use its oceans for its ocean-dwelling denizens. Gamera must once again come to the aid of the human race while all of Japan roots him on.', 'A moon base is destroyed by a spaceship from Zigra which is looking to take over the planet earth to use its oceans for its ocean-dwelling denizens. Gamera must once again come to the aid of the human race while all of Japan roots him on.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nL7CjKEQlsegz9FstfkzI05eGXt.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:70322'),
  ('618364730196636564', 'Gamera, the Giant Monster', 1965, 'Action, Horror, Science Fiction', 'Noriaki Yuasa, Nobuo Munekawa, Shima Abe', 'Nisan Takahashi', 'Eiji Funakoshi, Michiko Sugata, Harumi Kiritachi, Yoshirō Kitahara, Bokuzen Hidari, Fumiko Murata, Jun Hamamura, Jutarō Hōjō', null, 'A nuclear explosion in the far north unleashes Gamera, the legendary flying turtle, from his sleep under the ice. In his search for energy, Gamera wreaks havoc over the entire world, and it''s up to the scientists, assisted by a young boy with a strange sympathic link to the monster, to put a stop to Gamera''s rampage.', 'A nuclear explosion in the far north unleashes Gamera, the legendary flying turtle, from his sleep under the ice. In his search for energy, Gamera wreaks havoc over the entire world, and it''s up to the scientists, assisted by a young boy with a strange sympathic link to the monster, to put a stop to Gamera''s rampage.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iwjp6qJaWNGOLDU9zzar0SMcPjl.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:21930'),
  ('390898720307129308', 'Gamera: Guardian of the Universe', 1995, 'Fantasy, Science Fiction, Action, Horror', 'Shusuke Kaneko, Kenji Takama, Junichi Tozawa', 'Kazunori Ito', 'Tsuyoshi Ihara, Shinobu Nakayama, Ayako Fujitani, Yukijiro Hotaru, Hirotaro Honda, Hatsunori Hasegawa, Kōjirō Hongō, Akira Kubo', null, 'A ship runs aground on a mysterious atoll leading to an investigation by insurance representative Kusanagi, who discovers an ancient bead that he gives to his daughter Asagi. Meanwhile, ornithologist Nagamine investigates reports of a new species of large bird named Gyaos. As the Gyaos begin to attack, an ancient guardian with a bond to Asagi emerges.', 'A ship runs aground on a mysterious atoll leading to an investigation by insurance representative Kusanagi, who discovers an ancient bead that he gives to his daughter Asagi. Meanwhile, ornithologist Nagamine investigates reports of a new species of large bird named Gyaos. As the Gyaos begin to attack, an ancient guardian with a bond to Asagi emerges.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dR48KVkILzcXGm7G4SzKlAt6XbD.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:54433'),
  ('778852483674224004', 'Gamera: Super Monster', 1980, 'Science Fiction, Family, Action', 'Akira Uehara, Noriaki Yuasa, Michio Takahashi', 'Nisan Takahashi', 'Mach Fumiake, Yaeko Kojima, Yoko Komatsu, Keiko Kudo, Koichi Maeda, Toshie Takada, Kisao Tobita, Osamu Kobayashi', null, 'As a massive alien craft heads to Earth to do evil, three good and powerful superwomen befriend a young boy who has a special connection to Gamera. The alien Zanon launches a battery of familiar foes against Gamera, who might have to give the ultimate sacrifice to defeat the alien invader.', 'As a massive alien craft heads to Earth to do evil, three good and powerful superwomen befriend a young boy who has a special connection to Gamera. The alien Zanon launches a battery of familiar foes against Gamera, who might have to give the ultimate sacrifice to defeat the alien invader.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/A4NQ0diDbvrGtJHYjCEH8keAhZK.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:70358'),
  ('741005221890184126', 'Gamers', 2006, 'Comedy', 'Christopher Folino, Roberto ''Tito'' Blasini', 'Christopher Folino', 'Kevin Sherwood, Kevin Kirkpatrick, Scott Rinker, Dave Hanson, John Heard, Beverly D''Angelo, Kelly LeBrock, Joe Nieves', 'NR', 'Gamers is a comedy about the lives of four slacker friends (and one obsessive interloper) living at home, -"with my parents... it''s just temporary... ''til they die"- working in the real world but playing in a fantasy world. Obsessed with a role playing game called Demons, Nymphs and Dragons these "gamers" are the subject of this hilarious comedy.', 'Gamers is a comedy about the lives of four slacker friends (and one obsessive interloper) living at home, -"with my parents... it''s just temporary... ''til they die"- working in the real world but playing in a fantasy world. Obsessed with a role playing game called Demons, Nymphs and Dragons these "gamers" are the subject of this hilarious comedy.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/t0e6VlmnHa5Yvyk4O5YebLFnSAx.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:14339'),
  ('1049318527389065014', 'Games', 1967, 'Thriller, Horror', 'Hal W. Polaire, Curtis Harrington, William A. Fraker', 'Gene R. Kearney', 'Simone Signoret, James Caan, Katharine Ross, Don Stroud, Kent Smith, Estelle Winwood, Marjorie Bennett, Ian Wolfe', null, 'A mysterious woman in black moves in with married Manhattan thrill-seekers and helps one trick the other.', 'A mysterious woman in black moves in with married Manhattan thrill-seekers and helps one trick the other.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fF65rqiiPlvNbphuM53GQrtnqyL.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:76875'),
  ('628783950325715216', 'Games Gamblers Play', 1974, 'Comedy', 'Michael Hui Koon-Man, Tadashi Nishimoto', 'Michael Hui Koon-Man, Lau Tin-Chi, Thomas Tang Wai-Hung', 'Michael Hui Koon-Man, Sam Hui, Ricky Hui Koon-Ying, Betty Ting Pei, Lisa Lui Yau-Wai, Roy Chiao, Judy Dirkin, Chin Ti', null, 'Michael Hui stars as Wen, a convict who''s always out to make a quick dollar through gambling. Being behind bars doesn''t stop him from making something off of his gambling skills. Samuel Hui co-stars as Chieh,a novice gambler who gets into trouble one day when he tries to steal casino chips from a crooked card dealer Dean Shek). Whilst in jail, Chieh meets Wen and the latter agrees to become his mentor. Can Wen and Chieh make a fortune from their combined skills or will the duo wind up back in prison?', 'Michael Hui stars as Wen, a convict who''s always out to make a quick dollar through gambling. Being behind bars doesn''t stop him from making something off of his gambling skills. Samuel Hui co-stars as Chieh,a novice gambler who gets into trouble one day when he tries to steal casino chips from a crooked card dealer Dean Shek). Whilst in jail, Chieh meets Wen and the latter agrees to become his mentor. Can Wen and Chieh make a fortune from their combined skills or will the duo wind up back in prison?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5mQb8ND75mgwDv98rSHabGcqTLa.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:107972'),
  ('255067385884295934', 'Games of Clouds and Rain', 2013, 'Drama, Romance, Comedy', 'Benjamin de Lajarte, Frédéric Serve', 'Benjamin de Lajarte', 'Audrey Dana, Alain Chamfort, Hiam Abbass, Simon Yam, John McLean, Li Heling, Hassam Ghancy', null, 'Li Qin leaves her temperamental husband and unknowingly provides a trail for a detective who has been, for months, secretly devoted to her. In the wake of their one-way chase, a Chinese businessman wanders around town; two magicians attempt to overcome a crisis, and a waitress is desperate for stability. Some will find what they are looking for, some will find each other, and some simply will not.', 'Li Qin leaves her temperamental husband and unknowingly provides a trail for a detective who has been, for months, secretly devoted to her. In the wake of their one-way chase, a Chinese businessman wanders around town; two magicians attempt to overcome a crisis, and a waitress is desperate for stability. Some will find what they are looking for, some will find each other, and some simply will not.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dVh89RxEwHae8jERWVsgUXA90LL.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:155888'),
  ('1061367326699316214', 'Games of Desire', 1991, 'Drama', 'Pasquale Fanetti', 'Leandro Lucchetti', 'Malù, Izudin Bajrović, Lidija Zovkić, Slobodan Negić, Branko Đurić', null, 'Florentine is a young, beautiful and passionate woman with a desire for love. Feeling abandoned by her husband''s impotency, she searches for outside affection and seduction within brief, but often passionate encounters. During this web of desire she encounters Dorothy. Unknown to Florentine she is her husband''s accomplice. In this twisted, frenzied fantasy her husband Jake becomes excited and aroused by the seduction of his wife. With his secret darkrooms and two-way mirrors he begins to desire his wife once more. Florentine, with the help of their adopted son, discovers his world of distorted fantasy. Amazed, but realising that Jake still loves her, she must act.', 'Florentine is a young, beautiful and passionate woman with a desire for love. Feeling abandoned by her husband''s impotency, she searches for outside affection and seduction within brief, but often passionate encounters. During this web of desire she encounters Dorothy. Unknown to Florentine she is her husband''s accomplice. In this twisted, frenzied fantasy her husband Jake becomes excited and aroused by the seduction of his wife. With his secret darkrooms and two-way mirrors he begins to desire his wife once more. Florentine, with the help of their adopted son, discovers his world of distorted fantasy. Amazed, but realising that Jake still loves her, she must act.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fksVN9G6DtSvX3WUh1ieZoUw1Bp.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:271749'),
  ('1054014090000155956', 'Games of Love and Chance', 2003, 'Romance, Drama', 'Lubomir Bakchev, Abdellatif Kechiche', 'Ghalya Lacroix, Abdellatif Kechiche', 'Osman Elkharraz, Sara Forestier, Sabrina Ouazani, Nanou Benhamou, Hafet Ben-Ahmed, Aurélie Ganito, Carole Franck, Hajar Hamlili', null, 'A group of teenagers living in a housing project in the outskirts of Paris rehearse a scene from Marivaux''s play of the same name. Krimo is determined not to take part, but after developing feelings for Lydia, he quickly assumes the main role and love interest in the play.', 'A group of teenagers living in a housing project in the outskirts of Paris rehearse a scene from Marivaux''s play of the same name. Krimo is determined not to take part, but after developing feelings for Lydia, he quickly assumes the main role and love interest in the play.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vrGRVDJqa9WcFbfoIV9vYV3Fg7d.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1549'),
  ('1094358401950694961', 'Games of Youth', 1907, null, 'Johann Schwarzer', null, null, null, 'Compilation of two shorts also distributed independently: Cricket und Reifenspiel [Croquet and the Arc and Hook Game], and Springschnur und Amazonen [Jump Roping and the Amazons]. In a sunny day, on a lawn in the woods, three nude, young brunettes with little flower arrangements on their hair are playing a succession of three dexterity games: throwing and catching three arcs with the use of a thin long hook, jumping the rope (soon replaced by a long piece of light cloth), and using the arcs as hoops for a bit of croquet with appropriate mallets and balls.', 'Compilation of two shorts also distributed independently: Cricket und Reifenspiel [Croquet and the Arc and Hook Game], and Springschnur und Amazonen [Jump Roping and the Amazons]. In a sunny day, on a lawn in the woods, three nude, young brunettes with little flower arrangements on their hair are playing a succession of three dexterity games: throwing and catching three arcs with the use of a thin long hook, jumping the rope (soon replaced by a long piece of light cloth), and using the arcs as hoops for a bit of croquet with appropriate mallets and balls.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/o0MCNxUq6dmhcqzHRYO4bzgq2WW.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:196484'),
  ('604681067877928750', 'Games on Reflection and Speed', 1925, 'Documentary', 'Henri Chomette, Henri Chomette', null, null, null, 'A high-speed view of Paris via train-track; Zooming down the Seine by boat. Chomette''s first film, Games of Reflections and Speed, traverses tunnels and elevated railways to produce a disarming rhythm.', 'A high-speed view of Paris via train-track; Zooming down the Seine by boat. Chomette''s first film, Games of Reflections and Speed, traverses tunnels and elevated railways to produce a disarming rhythm.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/olTYGLvqXxzThvNQh2Z9Cexzorq.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:128330'),
  ('959895261087543003', 'Games People Play', 2020, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Hannu Käki, Pia Aho, Jenni Toivoniemi', 'Jenni Toivoniemi', 'Eero Milonoff, Emmi Parviainen, Laura Birn, Christian Hillborg, Iida-Maria Heinonen, Paavo Kinnunen, Paula Vesala, Samuli Niittymäki', null, 'Group of old friends gather in a summer villa to celebrate a surprise birthday party for Mitzi, who is the dramatic focal point of the group. The weekend starts ominously when Mitzi does not respond well to the surprise party. It turns out that Mitzi has just filed for divorce and has been looking forward to a peaceful weekend. The tense situation takes a new turn when Mitzi''s best friend brings her new boyfriend for a visit, who happens to be a Swedish film star. Familiar surroundings and the old rituals get to the core of the group and make them forget their adulthood. Revelations, not meant to harm the balance, make them reassess their past as well as their present.', 'Group of old friends gather in a summer villa to celebrate a surprise birthday party for Mitzi, who is the dramatic focal point of the group. The weekend starts ominously when Mitzi does not respond well to the surprise party. It turns out that Mitzi has just filed for divorce and has been looking forward to a peaceful weekend. The tense situation takes a new turn when Mitzi''s best friend brings her new boyfriend for a visit, who happens to be a Swedish film star. Familiar surroundings and the old rituals get to the core of the group and make them forget their adulthood. Revelations, not meant to harm the balance, make them reassess their past as well as their present.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zNN5VoXuiz0VOjlD2s1A0EVyiD.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:657430'),
  ('1114476563355025543', 'Gammera the Invincible', 1966, 'Horror, Science Fiction, Action', 'Sandy Howard, Julian C. Townsend, Noriaki Yuasa', 'Richard Kraft', 'Albert Dekker, Brian Donlevy, Diane Findlay, John Baragrey, Dick O''Neill, Eiji Funakoshi, Michiko Sugata, Harumi Kiritachi', null, 'An atomic explosion awakens Gammera, a giant fire breathing turtle monster from his millions of years of hibernation.', 'An atomic explosion awakens Gammera, a giant fire breathing turtle monster from his millions of years of hibernation.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qVlnEmM603TA2Xgz17pIpHjjvsV.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:35616'),
  ('1056848896590091067', 'Gamyam', 2008, 'Drama', 'Radha Krishna Jagarlamudi, Hari Anumolu', 'Radha Krishna Jagarlamudi', 'Sharwanand, Allari Naresh, Kamalinee Mukherjee, Rao Ramesh, Hema, Vijayachander, Giri Babu, Brahmanandam', null, 'Two guys, a thief and a rich man, meet in a journey that the latter starts to find love. On their way they find the destinies of their lives.', 'Two guys, a thief and a rich man, meet in a journey that the latter starts to find love. On their way they find the destinies of their lives.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xOnX16iyA6bI8YL9ryeKjYl4YVK.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:80994'),
  ('897625691625067568', 'Gandahar', 1987, 'Animation, Science Fiction, Fantasy, Adventure', 'René Laloux, Philippe Caza, Dominique Boischot', 'Raphael Cluzel, René Laloux', 'Catherine Chevallier, Pierre-Marie Escourrou, Anny Duperey, Christine Pâris, Georges Wilson, Jean-Pierre Ducos, Olivier Cruveiller, Zaïra Benbadis', null, 'On the planet Gandahar where peace reigns and poverty is unknown, this utopian lifestyle is upset by reports of people at the outlying frontiers being turned to stone. Sylvain is sent to investigate this mysterious threat.', 'On the planet Gandahar where peace reigns and poverty is unknown, this utopian lifestyle is upset by reports of people at the outlying frontiers being turned to stone. Sylvain is sent to investigate this mysterious threat.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lDM8fxNsu8oYRmM66kZrLQnPNyw.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:22500'),
  ('29356648310138137', 'Gandhi', 1982, 'Drama, History', 'Richard Attenborough, Ronnie Taylor, Billy Williams', 'John Briley', 'Ben Kingsley, Candice Bergen, Edward Fox, John Gielgud, Trevor Howard, John Mills, Rohini Hattangadi, Martin Sheen', 'PG', 'In the early years of the 20th century, Mohandas K. Gandhi, a British-trained lawyer, forsakes all worldly possessions to take up the cause of Indian independence. Faced with armed resistance from the British government, Gandhi adopts a policy of ''passive resistance'', endeavouring to win freedom for his people without resorting to bloodshed.', 'In the early years of the 20th century, Mohandas K. Gandhi, a British-trained lawyer, forsakes all worldly possessions to take up the cause of Indian independence. Faced with armed resistance from the British government, Gandhi adopts a policy of ''passive resistance'', endeavouring to win freedom for his people without resorting to bloodshed.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rOXftt7SluxskrFrvU7qFJa5zeN.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:783'),
  ('103958893578250951', 'Gandhi Talks', 2026, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Kishor Pandurang ''Belekar'', Karan B Rawat, Raj Kamal', 'Kishor Pandurang ''Belekar''', 'Vijay Sethupathi, Arvind Swamy, Aditi Rao Hydari, Siddharth Jadhav, Rohini Hattangadi', null, 'Unemployed Mahadev tries everything to find a job but fails repeatedly. Meeting wealthy Businessman Boseman, whose business empire nears collapse, Mahadev hatches a plan that might change his life.', 'Unemployed Mahadev tries everything to find a job but fails repeatedly. Meeting wealthy Businessman Boseman, whose business empire nears collapse, Mahadev hatches a plan that might change his life.', 'https://images.plex.tv/photo?size=large-1280&url=https%3A%2F%2Fmetadata-static.plex.tv%2F0%2Fgracenote%2F03967492c51e1330735daa6e918f17a6.jpg', 'plex:movie:gandhi-talks'),
  ('294842899543786851', 'Gandhi, My Father', 2007, 'Drama, History', 'Feroz Abbas Khan', 'Feroz Abbas Khan', 'Akshaye Khanna, Darshan Jariwala, Bhumika Chawla, Shefali Shah, Vinay Jain', null, 'Unable to live in his father''s gigantic shadow, Mahatma Gandhi''s eldest son, Harilal, gets distraught and resorts to alcoholism.', 'Unable to live in his father''s gigantic shadow, Mahatma Gandhi''s eldest son, Harilal, gets distraught and resorts to alcoholism.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sFzo2Ss4PQfNUlrzeTfwoVp5ajE.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:38428'),
  ('376855973878612191', 'Gandhinagar 2nd Street', 1986, 'Comedy, Family, Romance', 'Sathyan Anthikad, Vipin Mohan', 'Sathyan Anthikad', 'Mohanlal, Karthika, Thilakan, Sreenivasan, Seema, Mammootty, Innocent, Sukumari', null, 'Sethu, an unemployed youth, struggles to find a job. When a spate of robberies takes place in his friend''s neighborhood, he poses as a Gurkha to get a job as a security guard.', 'Sethu, an unemployed youth, struggles to find a job. When a spate of robberies takes place in his friend''s neighborhood, he poses as a Gurkha to get a job as a security guard.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/v7FRjWyyAv5Y6cDl0wAoCIQ8mNI.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:192671'),
  ('1146475310134321313', 'Ganes', 2007, 'Drama, Music', 'Jarkko T. Laine, Jouni Mutanen, Essi Suomela', 'Antero Arjatsalo', 'Eero Milonoff, Jussi Nikkilä, Olavi Uusivirta, Minttu Mustakallio, Tommi Korpela, Kari Hietalahti, Reino Nordin, Timo Tikka', null, 'Remu grew up in modest conditions. He dropped out from schoold during his teen age years and is making career as a small time criminal. His family''s destiny is about to come true, and it''s going to be the usual: jail, alcoholism and violent death. After learning about rock music Remu learns to play drums and pushes himself into different bands. His first time in jails interrupts his music career, but after being released he starts his own band; Hurriganes.', 'Remu grew up in modest conditions. He dropped out from schoold during his teen age years and is making career as a small time criminal. His family''s destiny is about to come true, and it''s going to be the usual: jail, alcoholism and violent death. After learning about rock music Remu learns to play drums and pushes himself into different bands. His first time in jails interrupts his music career, but after being released he starts his own band; Hurriganes.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vEHLop4MdZie11G5hAx8pBNwge.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:20158'),
  ('616056612452927238', 'Gang in Blue', 1996, 'Thriller, Action, Crime, Drama, TV Movie', 'Rhett Morita, Patrick Tidy, David McLeod', 'Rick Natkin, David Fuller', 'Mario Van Peebles, Josh Brolin, Cynda Williams, J.T. Walsh, Stephen Lang, Sean McCann, Melvin Van Peebles, Zach Grenier', 'R', 'A black police officer discovers a cell of white supremacist vigilantes within his department.', 'A black police officer discovers a cell of white supremacist vigilantes within his department.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ukY2y4dv0mrjBvu38PFACkDamj7.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:142012'),
  ('1037608451745045979', 'Gang of Four', 1989, 'Drama, Mystery', 'Jacques Rivette, Lorraine Darrow, Isabelle Muraour', 'Jacques Rivette, Pascal Bonitzer, Jacques Rivette', 'Bulle Ogier, Benoît Régent, Fejria Deliba, Laurence Côte, Bernadette Giraud, Inês de Medeiros, Nathalie Richard, Irène Jacob', null, 'Anna, Joyce, Claude, and Cécile are four young actresses sharing a Paris apartment while attending intense acting workshops led by their demanding teacher Constance. As they rehearse scenes and navigate the tensions of living together, their personal lives begin to grow complicated when Joyce becomes involved with a mysterious older man whose presence slowly pulls the others into a web of secrets and suspicions, blurring the boundary between the roles they perform and the lives they''re actually living.', 'Anna, Joyce, Claude, and Cécile are four young actresses sharing a Paris apartment while attending intense acting workshops led by their demanding teacher Constance. As they rehearse scenes and navigate the tensions of living together, their personal lives begin to grow complicated when Joyce becomes involved with a mysterious older man whose presence slowly pulls the others into a web of secrets and suspicions, blurring the boundary between the roles they perform and the lives they''re actually living.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/18syAOybiKSQSurFGqUl5gmXb0a.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:55853'),
  ('1067846791463343807', 'Gang of Roses', 2003, 'Western, Action, Drama', 'Jean-Claude La Marre', 'Jean-Claude La Marre', 'Monica Calhoun, Lil'' Kim, Stacey Dash, Marie Matiko, LisaRaye McCoy, Macy Gray, Louis Mandylor, Bobby Brown', null, 'In 1828 the town of Flat Ridge is over run by a band of outlaws looking for lost treasure said to be buried somewhere in town. In their quest for dominance, the outlaws kill Sally, a prostitute who happens to be the sister of Rachel and a former member of the disbanded Rose Gang. With the weight of grief on her heart, Rachel decides to shed her new found religious faith to bring vengeance upon her sister''s killers. After laying Sally to rest, Rachel goes in search of her former posse to assist her in avenging her sister''s death.', 'In 1828 the town of Flat Ridge is over run by a band of outlaws looking for lost treasure said to be buried somewhere in town. In their quest for dominance, the outlaws kill Sally, a prostitute who happens to be the sister of Rachel and a former member of the disbanded Rose Gang. With the weight of grief on her heart, Rachel decides to shed her new found religious faith to bring vengeance upon her sister''s killers. After laying Sally to rest, Rachel goes in search of her former posse to assist her in avenging her sister''s death.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bbtZf4SwMD9VmtRKsdU0u3R0rRX.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:66667'),
  ('542768570104047417', 'Gang of the Caribbean', 2016, 'Thriller', 'Jean-Claude Barny', null, 'Mathieu Kassovitz, Romane Bohringer, Lucien Jean-Baptiste, Ériq Ebouaney, Djédjé Apali, Adama Niane, Vincent Vermignon', null, 'A gun to be heard, a pen to make yourself understood. The identical course of four young West Indians men who arrived to Paris in the 70''s.', 'A gun to be heard, a pen to make yourself understood. The identical course of four young West Indians men who arrived to Paris in the 70''s.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lmJOvNRItoN2XqWMgzKZAsp2caN.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:418798'),
