  ('913926866324428583', 'Gangaajal', 2003, 'Drama, Crime', 'Prakash Jha', null, 'Ajay Devgn, Gracy Singh, Mohan Joshi, Yashpal Sharma, Mukesh Tiwari, Akhilendra Mishra, Mohan Agashe, Anup Soni', null, 'An honest Superintendent of Police, IPS Amit Kumar, is assigned to a crime infested town to reduce its crime rates. There, he soon learns that cleaning up the town also means confronting the corruption among police and politicians.', 'An honest Superintendent of Police, IPS Amit Kumar, is assigned to a crime infested town to reduce its crime rates. There, he soon learns that cleaning up the town also means confronting the corruption among police and politicians.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hYgMIlRddxXV7WaVLy6QvGy5RPM.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:46428'),
  ('590142978300099034', 'Gangnam Blues', 2015, 'Action, Crime, Thriller', 'Kim Gyeong-seok, Yoo Ha, Hwang Jae-jin', 'Yoo Ha', 'Lee Min-ho, Kim Rae-won, Jung Jin-young, Kim Ji-soo, Kim Seol-hyun, Yoo Seung-mok, Han Jae-yeong, Lee Yeon-doo', null, 'Jong-dae and Yong-ki make a living by picking up paper and empty bottles. Both then join different gangster clan and becomes involved in a struggle of political interests over development in Gangnam, Seoul.', 'Jong-dae and Yong-ki make a living by picking up paper and empty bottles. Both then join different gangster clan and becomes involved in a struggle of political interests over development in Gangnam, Seoul.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fDpiZKiaMk1Gz7y04DlnRmQBtf4.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:297721'),
  ('644122734810516503', 'Gangs', 2009, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Rainer Matsutani, Wolfram de Marco', 'Sebastian Wehlings', 'Jimi Blue Ochsenknecht, Wilson Gonzalez Ochsenknecht, Emilia Schüle, Sina Tkotsch, Jannis Niewöhner, Kai Michael Müller, Christian Blümel, Michael Keseroglu', null, 'This is the story of 17-year-old Flo and his gang, the Rox. A story of great romance and hard choices. When his brother, the leader of the Rox, gets into trouble, Flo has to decide between the love of his life or his flesh and blood. It''s a matter of life and death.', 'This is the story of 17-year-old Flo and his gang, the Rox. A story of great romance and hard choices. When his brother, the leader of the Rox, gets into trouble, Flo has to decide between the love of his life or his flesh and blood. It''s a matter of life and death.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dzATVfYRukd8mO9uVfWXb6DTNX1.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:76097'),
  ('933434590605838797', 'Gangs of Lagos', 2023, 'Crime', 'Jadesola Osiberu', 'Jadesola Osiberu, Kay I. Jegede', 'Demi Banwo, Adesua Etomi-Wellington, Tobi Bakre, Alabi Pasuma, Olarotimi Fakunle, Adebowale Adedayo, Bash Luks', null, 'A group of friends who each have to navigate their own destiny, growing up on the bustling streets and neighborhood of Isale Eko, Lagos.', 'A group of friends who each have to navigate their own destiny, growing up on the bustling streets and neighborhood of Isale Eko, Lagos.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nGwFsB6EXUCr21wzPgtP5juZPSv.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1104040'),
  ('643400358667735587', 'Gangs of New York', 2002, 'Drama, History, Crime', 'Martin Scorsese, Michael Ballhaus, Joseph P. Reidy', 'Jay Cocks, Steven Zaillian, Kenneth Lonergan', 'Leonardo DiCaprio, Daniel Day-Lewis, Cameron Diaz, Jim Broadbent, John C. Reilly, Henry Thomas, Liam Neeson, Brendan Gleeson', 'R', 'In early 1860s New York, Irish immigrant Amsterdam Vallon is released from prison and returns to the Five Points, seeking revenge against his father''s killer, William Cutting, a powerful anti-immigrant gang leader. He knows that revenge can only be attained by infiltrating Cutting''s inner circle. Vallon''s journey becomes a fight for personal survival and to find a place for the Irish people.', 'In early 1860s New York, Irish immigrant Amsterdam Vallon is released from prison and returns to the Five Points, seeking revenge against his father''s killer, William Cutting, a powerful anti-immigrant gang leader. He knows that revenge can only be attained by infiltrating Cutting''s inner circle. Vallon''s journey becomes a fight for personal survival and to find a place for the Irish people.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lemqKtcCuAano5aqrzxYiKC8kkn.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:3131'),
  ('881785377416646060', 'Gangs of the Dead', 2006, 'Horror, Action, Science Fiction', 'Duane Stinnett, David Todd Ocvirk, Yasu Tanida', 'Duane Stinnett, Krissann Shipley', 'Noel Gugliemi, Cazimir Milostan, Howard Alonzo, Ethan Ednee, Dayana Jamine, Ryan Hanna King, Enrique Almeida, Danny Martinez', 'R', 'On the verge of a major arms deal, the two toughest gangs in L.A. will find themselves trapped in an abandoned warehouse by a ravenous mob of bloodthirsty zombies. They will have to work together with the cops to avoid being torn limb-from-limb and eaten alive. A one of a kind urban-zombie film, Gangs of the Dead is a gore-filled and action-packed thriller for both the horror fan and the urban audience.', 'On the verge of a major arms deal, the two toughest gangs in L.A. will find themselves trapped in an abandoned warehouse by a ravenous mob of bloodthirsty zombies. They will have to work together with the cops to avoid being torn limb-from-limb and eaten alive. A one of a kind urban-zombie film, Gangs of the Dead is a gore-filled and action-packed thriller for both the horror fan and the urban audience.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bjVqT8XIVMTCWpSreMpH0W6Rjxi.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:54653'),
  ('348701886160515189', 'Gangs of Wasseypur - Part 1', 2012, 'Action, Thriller, Crime', 'Anurag Kashyap, Rajeev Ravi, Rohit Pandey', 'Zeishan Quadri, Anurag Kashyap', 'Manoj Bajpayee, Richa Chadha, Tigmanshu Dhulia, Nawazuddin Siddiqui, Reema Sen, Huma Qureshi, Piyush Mishra, Jameel Khan', null, 'In 1970s India, Sardar Khan vows to take revenge on the man who killed his father decades earlier.', 'In 1970s India, Sardar Khan vows to take revenge on the man who killed his father decades earlier.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xAy208Znkingmfnb5ZbULwLyIwW.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:117691'),
  ('850278582903649207', 'Gangs of Wasseypur - Part 2', 2012, 'Crime, Thriller, Action', 'Anurag Kashyap, Rajeev Ravi, Vicky Kaushal', null, 'Nawazuddin Siddiqui, Huma Qureshi, Richa Chadha, Rajkummar Rao, Tigmanshu Dhulia, Pankaj Tripathi, Zeishan Quadri, Manoj Bajpayee', null, 'After the death of his father and brother Danish, Faizal Khan vows to take revenge by destroying Ramadhir Singh''s gang.', 'After the death of his father and brother Danish, Faizal Khan vows to take revenge by destroying Ramadhir Singh''s gang.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4CVPyT10Cvw9BCgWNKXiRcXntuc.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:126400'),
  ('677218159108554706', 'Gangsta', 2018, 'Thriller, Action, Crime', 'Adil El Arbi, Bilall Fallah, Robrecht Heyvaert', 'Nabil Ben Yadir, Adil El Arbi, Bilall Fallah', 'Matteo Simoni, Nora Gharib, Saïd Boumazoughe, Junes Lazaar, Nabil Mallat, Paloma Aguilera Valdebenito, Gene Bervoets, Axel Daeseleire', null, 'Antwerp, Belgium. The lives of four small-time drug dealers spin out of control when they steal a shipment of cocaine, triggering a full out war between an Amsterdam drug lord and a ruthless Colombian cartel.', 'Antwerp, Belgium. The lives of four small-time drug dealers spin out of control when they steal a shipment of cocaine, triggering a full out war between an Amsterdam drug lord and a ruthless Colombian cartel.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tIM3LzDJYB2DwEYOuKxgYZVHBZI.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:483552'),
  ('1150733004402866765', 'Gangster', 2006, 'Romance, Crime, Drama, Action, Thriller', 'Anurag Basu, Bobby Singh', 'Anurag Basu', 'Kangana Ranaut, Emraan Hashmi, Shiney Ahuja, Hitanshu Lodhiya, Vicky Ahuja, Gulshan Grover, Zubeen Garg, Pritam Chakraborty', null, 'An alcoholic barmaid is distraught when her former lover, a notorious gangster, re-enters her life. She is forced to relive painful past experiences and choose between the gangster and a pleasant singer she has found comfort in.', 'An alcoholic barmaid is distraught when her former lover, a notorious gangster, re-enters her life. She is forced to relive painful past experiences and choose between the gangster and a pleasant singer she has found comfort in.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uZzJxx7ETfZVV1rVNKmNVCKaiji.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:38440'),
  ('297838241100649632', 'Gangster Boss', 1959, 'Comedy, Crime', 'Henri Verneuil', 'Henri Verneuil, Henri Troyat, Jean Manse', 'Fernandel, Gino Cervi, Jean-Jacques Delbo, Georges Chamarat, Noëlle Norman, Florence Blot, Joël Papouf, Madeleine Barbulée', null, 'In Paris, two scoundrels kidnap a wealthy man''s preteen son, disguised as Indians, only to find he''s a savvy detective, making their ransom plan much more complicated.', 'In Paris, two scoundrels kidnap a wealthy man''s preteen son, disguised as Indians, only to find he''s a savvy detective, making their ransom plan much more complicated.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ebDG7tOnQ2rW0aKEyY4Q1QQ4aOj.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:74765'),
  ('1084403761904318107', 'Gangster High', 2006, 'Action, Crime', 'Park Ki-hyung', 'Park Ki-hyung, Kim Yeong-chan', 'Jang Hee-jin, Jung Kyung-ho, Kim So-yeon, Kim Ye-ryeong, Cho Jin-woong, Kim Hye-seong, Ko Kyu-pil, Yeon Je-wook', null, 'Sang-ho is an ordinary high school student. His dream is to enter the military academy under the influence of his father who is an army colonel. As entering high school, he became friends with Jae-gu, Chang-bae, Kyung-chul, Hong-kyu and Sang-sik. They grouped a soccer team called ''Tiger'', building up friendship by playing soccer. Sang-ho and his friends ran into group of fight with seniors, these incidents made everybody in school to misunderstand them as they were serious group of gangster. When Sang-ho gets becomes close with a girl whose boyfriend is a boss of another school''s gangster group, things are going worse.', 'Sang-ho is an ordinary high school student. His dream is to enter the military academy under the influence of his father who is an army colonel. As entering high school, he became friends with Jae-gu, Chang-bae, Kyung-chul, Hong-kyu and Sang-sik. They grouped a soccer team called ''Tiger'', building up friendship by playing soccer. Sang-ho and his friends ran into group of fight with seniors, these incidents made everybody in school to misunderstand them as they were serious group of gangster. When Sang-ho gets becomes close with a girl whose boyfriend is a boss of another school''s gangster group, things are going worse.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pbQqNBI2DClLtk1fPCNm5bSSXcb.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:40122'),
  ('800356626918377367', 'Gangster Land', 2017, 'Thriller, Crime, Action, Drama, History', 'Timothy Woodward Jr., Pablo Díez, Tim Gagliardo', 'Ian Patrick Williams', 'Jason Patric, Milo Gibson, Peter Facinelli, Jamie-Lynn Sigler, Sean Faris, Mark Rolston, Michael Paré, Al Sapienza', null, 'The story of America''s most famous mobsters and their rise to power. Examine Al Capone''s ascension through the eyes of his second in command, “Machine Gun” Jack McGurn.', 'The story of America''s most famous mobsters and their rise to power. Examine Al Capone''s ascension through the eyes of his second in command, “Machine Gun” Jack McGurn.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fuIVbO6fLrMgmDvZsIutasCSVJC.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:485337'),
  ('1114026958035164604', 'Gangster No. 1', 2000, 'Action, Drama, Thriller, Crime', 'Paul McGuigan, Adrian Biddle', 'Johnny Ferguson', 'Paul Bettany, Malcolm McDowell, David Thewlis, Jamie Foreman, Saffron Burrows, Kenneth Cranham, Eddie Marsan, Andrew Lincoln', null, 'An old gangster is advised that Freddie Mays would leave jail after thirty years in prison. His mood changes and he recalls when he was a young punk and who joined Freddie''s gang—a man he both envied and ultimately betrayed.', 'An old gangster is advised that Freddie Mays would leave jail after thirty years in prison. His mood changes and he recalls when he was a young punk and who joined Freddie''s gang—a man he both envied and ultimately betrayed.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/t8eUSsD2reaIR9qmklU7O2GCVn4.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:10394'),
  ('415001630403642007', 'Gangster Squad', 2013, 'Crime, Drama, Action, Thriller', 'Ruben Fleischer, Dion Beebe, Austin Gorg', 'Will Beall', 'Josh Brolin, Ryan Gosling, Sean Penn, Nick Nolte, Emma Stone, Anthony Mackie, Giovanni Ribisi, Robert Patrick', 'R', 'Los Angeles, 1949. Ruthless, Brooklyn-born mob king Mickey Cohen runs the show in this town, reaping the ill-gotten gains from the drugs, the guns, the prostitutes and — if he has his way — every wire bet placed west of Chicago. And he does it all with the protection of not only his own paid goons, but also the police and the politicians who are under his control. It’s enough to intimidate even the bravest, street-hardened cop… except, perhaps, for the small, secret crew of LAPD outsiders led by Sgt. John O’Mara and Jerry Wooters who come together to try to tear Cohen’s world apart.', 'Los Angeles, 1949. Ruthless, Brooklyn-born mob king Mickey Cohen runs the show in this town, reaping the ill-gotten gains from the drugs, the guns, the prostitutes and — if he has his way — every wire bet placed west of Chicago. And he does it all with the protection of not only his own paid goons, but also the police and the politicians who are under his control. It’s enough to intimidate even the bravest, street-hardened cop… except, perhaps, for the small, secret crew of LAPD outsiders led by Sgt. John O’Mara and Jerry Wooters who come together to try to tear Cohen’s world apart.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wAuQNTBFBu2yXZsX6yLhUPiwTlW.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:82682'),
  ('1002550340545967548', 'Gangster Story', 1959, 'Crime, Drama', 'Walter Matthau, Charles H. Maguire, Max Glenn', 'Paul Purcell', 'Walter Matthau, Carol Grace, Bruce MacFarlane, Garry Walberg, Raikin Ben-Ari, David Leonard, John Albright, Clegg Hoyt', null, 'Gangster and cop killer Jack Martin is on the run from the law, and hides out in a small town. Low on funds, he engineers a clever bank robbery that yields him a big bundle. Now he has not only the cops and the FBI after him, but also the local crime boss, who''s outraged that an outsider can pull off a heist like that in his territory and not cut him in on it.', 'Gangster and cop killer Jack Martin is on the run from the law, and hides out in a small town. Low on funds, he engineers a clever bank robbery that yields him a big bundle. Now he has not only the cops and the FBI after him, but also the local crime boss, who''s outraged that an outsider can pull off a heist like that in his territory and not cut him in on it.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zWsRYEL02qnsc6SvzEGfd7DIHEu.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:81720'),
  ('966826042642016035', 'Gangster''s Paradise: Jerusalema', 2008, 'Action, Crime, Drama', 'Ralph Ziman', 'Ralph Ziman', 'Daniel Buckland, Robert Hobbs, Jeffrey Zekele, Ronnie Nyakale, Shelley Meskin, Malusi Skenjana, Jafta Mamabolo, Motlatsi Mahloko', 'R', 'This South African movie tracks the rise of a once-petty criminal to the heights of the criminal underworld. After cutting his teeth on hijacking, before moving onto bigger game, an ambitious man hits a setback when most of his gang are shot.', 'This South African movie tracks the rise of a once-petty criminal to the heights of the criminal underworld. After cutting his teeth on hijacking, before moving onto bigger game, an ambitious man hits a setback when most of his gang are shot.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fVmlqgIyHjEsONDcaFiP8jBdqvU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:22600'),
  ('814439983751446087', 'Gangsterdam', 2017, 'Action, Comedy', 'Romain Lévy, Léo Hinstin', 'Romain Lévy, Mathieu Oullion, Rémy Four', 'Kev Adams, Manon Azem, Côme Levin, Mona Walravens, Manu Payet, Patrick Timsit, Rutger Hauer, Hubert Koundé', null, 'Ruben, Durex and Nora are three students in their last year of college. Ruben has already failed his exams once due to his lack of self-confidence. He''s been as useless with Nora, to whom he dares not confess his feelings. And his childhood friend Durex, the most embarrassing guy in the world, is no help at all. When Ruben discovers that Nora is a dealer and that she''s going to Amsterdam to bring back a new kind of drug, Ruben bucks up the courage to accompany her. This trip to Amsterdam is an ideal situation in which to at last seduce Nora. But his bad luck: Durex comes along for the ride. While the trio discover Europe''s craziest capital, their lives really get complicated when they realize that the drug they''ve just picked up belongs to one of Amsterdam''s most dangerous gangsters. Very quickly, Ruben, Durex and Nora will understand that to get their old lives back, they must stop being nerds in order to become true heroes.', 'Ruben, Durex and Nora are three students in their last year of college. Ruben has already failed his exams once due to his lack of self-confidence. He''s been as useless with Nora, to whom he dares not confess his feelings. And his childhood friend Durex, the most embarrassing guy in the world, is no help at all. When Ruben discovers that Nora is a dealer and that she''s going to Amsterdam to bring back a new kind of drug, Ruben bucks up the courage to accompany her. This trip to Amsterdam is an ideal situation in which to at last seduce Nora. But his bad luck: Durex comes along for the ride. While the trio discover Europe''s craziest capital, their lives really get complicated when they realize that the drug they''ve just picked up belongs to one of Amsterdam''s most dangerous gangsters. Very quickly, Ruben, Durex and Nora will understand that to get their old lives back, they must stop being nerds in order to become true heroes.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/h6bcLNMkw8nbnC3OhYHTo3OALvm.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:411626'),
  ('145964780337579004', 'Gangsters', 2002, 'Crime, Drama', 'Olivier Marchal, Matthieu Poirot-Delpech', 'Olivier Marchal', 'Richard Anconina, Anne Parillaud, François Levantal, Gérald Laroche, Francis Renaud, Guy Lecluyse, Pierre Laplace, Jean-Louis Tribes', null, 'Franck Chaievski and Nina Delgado are two undercover detectives of a French special force trying to identify two corrupts members of the Paris Police Force. Franck is pretending to be a gangster and Nina a prostitute living with him, and involved in a robbery of a fortune in diamonds, having seven deaths and some injured persons.', 'Franck Chaievski and Nina Delgado are two undercover detectives of a French special force trying to identify two corrupts members of the Paris Police Force. Franck is pretending to be a gangster and Nina a prostitute living with him, and involved in a robbery of a fortune in diamonds, having seven deaths and some injured persons.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/o8KssRBXqIvEKZdOStJ4kJfiMLQ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:40417'),
  ('149739024113373356', 'Gangsters and Philanthropists', 1963, 'Action, Comedy, Crime', 'Jerzy Hoffman, Edward Skórzewski, Antoni Nurzyński', 'Jerzy Hoffman, Edward Skórzewski', 'Gustaw Holoubek, Wiesław Michnikowski, Hanka Bielicka, Magdalena Celówna-Janikowska, Barbara Modelska, Jacek Hahn, Janusz Hahn, Gustaw Lutkiewicz', null, 'The movie consists of two satirical novels based on the same idea: both the "gangsters" and "philanthropists" end up in the courtroom.', 'The movie consists of two satirical novels based on the same idea: both the "gangsters" and "philanthropists" end up in the courtroom.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2VTXrcHhXvQlaJXCAd3AAwdK7i8.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:101190'),
