  ('523987884541673705', 'Ganti-Ganti', 2023, 'Romance, Drama, Thriller', 'Mac Alejandre', null, 'Angeli Khang, Yen Renee Durano, Mark Anthony Fernandez, Sean de Guzman, Richard Solano, Larissa Buendia, Sofia Carandang, Rhealyn Ayson', null, 'Four lives become intertwined because of one goal - to exact revenge. Things turn bloodier and more chaotic when they all realize who the real mastermind is.', 'Four lives become intertwined because of one goal - to exact revenge. Things turn bloodier and more chaotic when they all realize who the real mastermind is.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jDRiStYMUHirEqL7Qp54pfus8Je.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1203097'),
