  ('789557488187680779', 'Garden Party', 2017, 'Animation, Comedy, Horror', 'Vincent Bayoux, Gabriel Grapperon, Théophile Dufresne', null, null, null, 'In a deserted rich house, a couple of amphibians explore their surroundings and follow their primal instincts.', 'In a deserted rich house, a couple of amphibians explore their surroundings and follow their primal instincts.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uexgjEoNVXZPIRYsUMwofnIL9xr.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:476719'),
  ('1108090463419968593', 'Garden State', 2004, 'Comedy, Drama, Romance', 'Lawrence Sher, Zach Braff', 'Zach Braff', 'Zach Braff, Natalie Portman, Ian Holm, Peter Sarsgaard, Jean Smart, Armando Riesco, Jackie Hoffman, Method Man', 'R', 'Andrew returns to his hometown for his mother’s funeral, a journey that reconnects him with old friends. The trip coincides with his decision to stop taking his powerful antidepressants. A chance meeting with Sam—a girl also struggling with various maladies—opens up the possibility of rekindling emotional connections, confronting his psychologist father, and perhaps beginning a new life.', 'Andrew returns to his hometown for his mother’s funeral, a journey that reconnects him with old friends. The trip coincides with his decision to stop taking his powerful antidepressants. A chance meeting with Sam—a girl also struggling with various maladies—opens up the possibility of rekindling emotional connections, confronting his psychologist father, and perhaps beginning a new life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/h3iqYiGS6F3y7GxaS4AT8nFxZ2i.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:401'),
  ('999479404644236218', 'Gardener of Eden', 2007, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Kevin Connolly, Lisa Rinzler', 'Adam ''Tex'' Davis', 'Lukas Haas, Erika Christensen, Giovanni Ribisi, Jim Parsons, Jon Abrahams, Jerry Ferrara, Emily Wickersham, David Patrick Kelly', 'R', 'When a young deli-counter clerk and general slacker in New Jersey accidentally saves a young woman from a serial rapist, he becomes convinced that his new role in life is to become a vigilante.', 'When a young deli-counter clerk and general slacker in New Jersey accidentally saves a young woman from a serial rapist, he becomes convinced that his new role in life is to become a vigilante.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6Vq91cEOicwNKMqlLtYmg1WPdW.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:25354'),
  ('552649024184816114', 'Gardens in Autumn', 2006, 'Comedy', 'Otar Iosseliani, William Lubtchansky', 'Otar Iosseliani', 'Séverin Blanchet, Jacynthe Jacquet, Otar Iosseliani, Lily Lavina, Denis Lambert, Michel Piccoli, Pascal Vincent, Salomé Bedine-Mkheidze', null, 'When he loses his position as a powerful government minister, Vincent is dropped by his pretty mistress and must begin life anew, without the privileges of power. As he gradually becomes acquainted with milieus which he d either forgotten or never known and a host of sometimes eccentric, often remarkable everyday people, Vincent really begins to start living again.', 'When he loses his position as a powerful government minister, Vincent is dropped by his pretty mistress and must begin life anew, without the privileges of power. As he gradually becomes acquainted with milieus which he d either forgotten or never known and a host of sometimes eccentric, often remarkable everyday people, Vincent really begins to start living again.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9vGWandSCQFmoljl1Rp1lHbJ8wx.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:63717'),
  ('979519556913987552', 'Gardens of Stone', 1987, 'War, Drama, History', 'Francis Ford Coppola, Jordan Cronenweth, David Valdes', 'Ronald Bass', 'James Caan, Anjelica Huston, James Earl Jones, D. B. Sweeney, Dean Stockwell, Mary Stuart Masterson, Dick Anthony Williams, Lonette McKee', 'R', 'At Arlington National Cemetery during the Vietnam era, veteran sergeant Clell Hazard trains young soldiers while mourning those lost in combat. Unable to return to war himself, he mentors Jackie Willow—the idealistic son of a fallen comrade—hoping to prepare him for the realities of Vietnam and the cost of duty.', 'At Arlington National Cemetery during the Vietnam era, veteran sergeant Clell Hazard trains young soldiers while mourning those lost in combat. Unable to return to war himself, he mentors Jackie Willow—the idealistic son of a fallen comrade—hoping to prepare him for the realities of Vietnam and the cost of duty.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bptiOG8kCoq1WUpWEwMyAIaMED4.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:28368'),
  ('632560542948207586', 'Gardens of the Night', 2008, 'Crime, Drama', 'Damian Harris, Paula Huidobro', 'Damian Harris', 'Gillian Jacobs, John Malkovich, Ryan Simpkins, Tom Arnold, Kevin Zegers, Jermaine Scooter Smith, Harold Perrineau, Jeremy Sisto', 'R', 'After being abducted as children, and suffering years of abuse, a teenage boy and girl find themselves living on the street.', 'After being abducted as children, and suffering years of abuse, a teenage boy and girl find themselves living on the street.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bhaR49fQIoXZ13MSed8os1R3Z4A.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:16867'),
  ('174819586633587595', 'Gare du Nord', 2013, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Claire Simon, Richard Copans', 'Claire Simon, Olivier Lorelle, Shirel Amitay', 'Nicole Garcia, Reda Kateb, François Damiens, Monia Chokri, Christophe Paou, Ibrahim Koma, Jean-Christophe Bouvet, Clémence Boisnard', null, 'Paris, North Station, anything comes by, even trains. One would like to stay, but they have to hurry up... Like other thousands lives crossing, Ismael, Mathilde, Sacha and Joan are going to meet here...', 'Paris, North Station, anything comes by, even trains. One would like to stay, but they have to hurry up... Like other thousands lives crossing, Ismael, Mathilde, Sacha and Joan are going to meet here...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4F70FWbz5WX4i8pZoaaT7SEmIv9.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:203814'),
  ('872550641025710788', 'Garfield', 2004, 'Comedy, Family', 'Dean Cundey, Peter Hewitt', 'Joel Cohen, Alec Sokolow', 'Bill Murray, Breckin Meyer, Jennifer Love Hewitt, Stephen Tobolowsky, Evan Arnold, Mark Christopher Lawrence, Jimmy Kimmel, Debra Messing', 'PG', 'Garfield, the fat, lazy, lasagna lover, has everything a cat could want. But when Jon, in an effort to impress the Liz - the vet and an old high-school crush - adopts a dog named Odie and brings him home, Garfield gets the one thing he doesn''t want. Competition.', 'Garfield, the fat, lazy, lasagna lover, has everything a cat could want. But when Jon, in an effort to impress the Liz - the vet and an old high-school crush - adopts a dog named Odie and brings him home, Garfield gets the one thing he doesn''t want. Competition.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vqwTSWNLyH55g8kBT61s2DgNYEp.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:8920'),
  ('732469741175566674', 'Garfield Gets a Life', 1991, 'Animation, Comedy, Family, TV Movie', 'John Sparey', 'Jim Davis', 'Lorenzo Music, Thom Huge, Gregg Berger, Frank Welker, June Foray, Kim Campbell, Kevin Campbell, Julie Payne', 'G', 'Garfield and his owner, Jon Arbuckle, are in a rut. Life for them is a complete bore. They both need a life. Jon tries several unsuccessful times to get a date. Then he attends a class for the personality impaired where he meets a young woman and all seems to be great for Jon, but Garfield starts to feel neglected and left out.', 'Garfield and his owner, Jon Arbuckle, are in a rut. Life for them is a complete bore. They both need a life. Jon tries several unsuccessful times to get a date. Then he attends a class for the personality impaired where he meets a young woman and all seems to be great for Jon, but Garfield starts to feel neglected and left out.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tAL4CHOQZluwT8EFiFT1LlvsfW8.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:37297'),
  ('937841851427271294', 'Garfield Gets Real', 2008, 'Family, Comedy, Adventure, Animation', 'Mark A.Z. Dippé, Shannon Makhanian, Kyung Ho Lee', 'Jim Davis', 'Frank Welker, Rajia Baroudi, Gregg Berger, Greg Eagles, Jason Marsden, Audrey Wasilewski, Pat Fraley, Wally Wingert', 'NR', 'Everyone''s favorite lazy, lasagna loving, Monday hating orange tabby leaves his exciting star of a popular comic strip world for the real one. But as the novelty wears thin, Garfield begins looking for a way back before his strip is permanently cancelled.', 'Everyone''s favorite lazy, lasagna loving, Monday hating orange tabby leaves his exciting star of a popular comic strip world for the real one. But as the novelty wears thin, Garfield begins looking for a way back before his strip is permanently cancelled.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cRlJEevXbt183BYBhUw3cvldp7C.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:16460'),
  ('849107566063467492', 'Garfield Goes Hollywood', 1987, 'Animation, Comedy, Family, Music, TV Movie', 'Phil Roman', 'Jim Davis', 'Lorenzo Music, Thom Huge, Gregg Berger, Nino Tempo, Frank Welker', 'G', 'Jon, Garfield and Odie audition for the talent show "Pet Search" in hopes of winning the $1000 prize and a chance at the finals in Hollywood.', 'Jon, Garfield and Odie audition for the talent show "Pet Search" in hopes of winning the $1000 prize and a chance at the finals in Hollywood.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qhwb4gwSsLlVbsCP4eQDyBx4VBa.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:64154'),
  ('563296999516872412', 'Garfield In Paradise', 1986, 'Animation, Comedy, Adventure, Family, Music, Romance, TV Movie', 'Phil Roman', 'Jim Davis', 'Lorenzo Music, Gregg Berger, Desiree Goyette, Thom Huge, Wolfman Jack, Frank Nelson, Nino Tempo, Hal Smith', 'G', 'Garfield, Odie and Jon go vacationing on a tropical island along with the High Rama Lama of rock and roll, a princess and her cat - and a rumbling volcano.', 'Garfield, Odie and Jon go vacationing on a tropical island along with the High Rama Lama of rock and roll, a princess and her cat - and a rumbling volcano.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9BavPkpifVvFeZSjW0sQgqXEzMx.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:64170'),
  ('381489891243129986', 'Garfield in the Rough', 1984, 'Animation, Family, Comedy, TV Movie, Adventure', 'Phil Roman', 'Jim Davis', 'Lorenzo Music, Thom Huge, Gregg Berger, George Wendt, Hal Smith, Orson Bean, Desiree Goyette', 'G', 'Garfield is taken on a camping trip by Jon, much against his will. A series of very funny disasters follow. But not all is well, as a panther has escaped from the local zoo and is stalking them. Will our hero survive to eat another lasagna and kick Odie off the table again?', 'Garfield is taken on a camping trip by Jon, much against his will. A series of very funny disasters follow. But not all is well, as a panther has escaped from the local zoo and is stalking them. Will our hero survive to eat another lasagna and kick Odie off the table again?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/byqKmSu8Okm1Trt9pz4OrnUo7AR.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:64169'),
  ('842140302410710064', 'Garfield on the Town', 1983, 'Animation, Family, Comedy, Drama, Fantasy, Music, TV Movie', 'Phil Roman', 'Jim Davis, Lorenzo Music', 'Lorenzo Music, Thom Huge, Gregg Berger, George Wendt, Sandi Huge, Julie Payne, C. Lindsay Workman, Allyce Beasley', null, 'Garfield escapes from the car on a trip to the vet and finds the place where he grew up.', 'Garfield escapes from the car on a trip to the vet and finds the place where he grew up.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vDbSvpbtEMG6YQKUoqYGpA53i5j.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:14307'),
  ('690158990939067474', 'Garfield: A Tail of Two Kitties', 2006, 'Comedy, Family, Adventure', 'Tim Hill, Peter Lyons Collister, Michele Panelli-Venetis', 'Joel Cohen, Alec Sokolow', 'Breckin Meyer, Jennifer Love Hewitt, Billy Connolly, Bill Murray, Tim Curry, Ian Abercrombie, Roger Rees, Lucy Davis', 'PG', 'Jon and Garfield visit the United Kingdom, where a case of mistaken cat identity finds Garfield ruling over a castle. His reign is soon jeopardized by the nefarious Lord Dargis, who has designs on the estate.', 'Jon and Garfield visit the United Kingdom, where a case of mistaken cat identity finds Garfield ruling over a castle. His reign is soon jeopardized by the nefarious Lord Dargis, who has designs on the estate.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wVcipKqECbIUxkEMKT4kwtL1LQP.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:9513'),
