  ('273730458704168628', 'Garfield''s Feline Fantasies', 1990, 'Animation, Comedy, Adventure, Family, TV Movie', 'John Sparey, Bob Nesler, Phil Roman', 'Jim Davis', 'Lorenzo Music, Gregg Berger, Thom Huge, Frank Welker, Julie Payne', 'G', 'Garfield and Odie fantasize that they are on a Middle-East mission to retrieve the Banana of Bombay, the symbol of humour to nations around the world.', 'Garfield and Odie fantasize that they are on a Middle-East mission to retrieve the Banana of Bombay, the symbol of humour to nations around the world.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kyqwKRNTgDbYgoR7Rxk5JGKqnn2.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:64148'),
  ('400096855361636709', 'Garfield''s Fun Fest', 2008, 'Family, Comedy, Adventure, Animation', 'Mark A.Z. Dippé, Han Eon-deok', 'Jim Davis', 'Frank Welker, Tim Conway, Gregg Berger, Wally Wingert, Audrey Wasilewski, Fred Tatasciore, Stephen Stanton, Greg Eagles', 'NR', 'Garfield''s 29-year winning streak in the annual Fun Fest talent competition is threatened by a dashing new entrant, Ramone, who possesses great charm. Concerned about losing his touch, Garfield goes on a quest to seek Freddy Frog''s mythical pond, where it is said that anyone who drinks from it is certain to be funny.', 'Garfield''s 29-year winning streak in the annual Fun Fest talent competition is threatened by a dashing new entrant, Ramone, who possesses great charm. Concerned about losing his touch, Garfield goes on a quest to seek Freddy Frog''s mythical pond, where it is said that anyone who drinks from it is certain to be funny.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vsCHc3vb5xdS9nJ5YdFSY8p2ujO.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:26728'),
  ('506478155567163553', 'Garfield''s Halloween Adventure', 1985, 'Animation, Family', 'Phil Roman', 'Jim Davis', 'Lorenzo Music, Thom Huge, Gregg Berger, C. Lindsay Workman, Desiree Goyette, Lou Rawls', 'G', 'Garfield and his pup pal Odie go trick-or-treating, only to wind up in a house haunted by ghostly pirates.', 'Garfield and his pup pal Odie go trick-or-treating, only to wind up in a house haunted by ghostly pirates.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/akgmKfcusFVNF0NzCIvTWg1wkaS.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:15718'),
  ('944084888165781362', 'Garfield''s Pet Force', 2009, 'Family, Comedy, Adventure, Animation', 'Mark A.Z. Dippé, Wonjae Lee', 'Jim Davis', 'Frank Welker, Vanessa Marshall, Gregg Berger, Wally Wingert, Audrey Wasilewski, Jason Marsden, Fred Tatasciore, Stephen Stanton', 'G', 'Nothing in the world can make Garfield get involved in anything besides eating, until the muscular super cat Garzooka comes crashing into Cartoon World from the Comic Book universe with terrifying news. Garfield summons up the willpower to join his superhero Garzooka in a fight to save their worlds.', 'Nothing in the world can make Garfield get involved in anything besides eating, until the muscular super cat Garzooka comes crashing into Cartoon World from the Comic Book universe with terrifying news. Garfield summons up the willpower to join his superhero Garzooka in a fight to save their worlds.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ylbBsF1WKI0RrxfX89QFqrBPYKu.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:19508'),
  ('478319123037344588', 'Garfield''s Thanksgiving', 1989, 'Animation, Comedy, Family, TV Movie', 'Phil Roman, John Sparey, Bob Nesler', 'Jim Davis, Kim Campbell', 'Lorenzo Music, Thom Huge, Gregg Berger, Pat Carroll, Julie Payne', 'NR', 'On Thanksgiving, according to Garfield, people celebrate food by eating as much of it as possible. It''s a tradition! But that tradition is history following a checkup from vet Liz, who says Garfield must go on a diet.', 'On Thanksgiving, according to Garfield, people celebrate food by eating as much of it as possible. It''s a tradition! But that tradition is history following a checkup from vet Liz, who says Garfield must go on a diet.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oULFXcDjQDLGVsRkbNoCDZ8MVN0.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:44840'),
  ('1106026695050212934', 'Gargantua', 1998, 'Science Fiction, Action, Adventure, TV Movie', 'John Powditch, John Stokes, Angella McPherson', 'Ronald Parker', 'Adam Baldwin, Julie Carmen, Emile Hirsch, Bobby Hosea, Doug Penty, Peter Adams, Alexander Petersons, Monroe Reimers', 'NR', 'Marine biologist Jack Ellway and his son Brandon are drawn to the Polynesian island of Malau to study the effects of recent seismic activity on the area''s marine life. Along with the local doctor Alyson Hart, they soon become caught up in the investigation of a series of recent drownings with unexpected results. As Jack explores the surrounding ocean for a mysterious marine creature, Brandon discovers and befriends a three-foot-long baby creature that is able to leave the ocean and walk on land. As more dangerous and giant creatures come onto the island, and the military begins to take offensive action, Jack must risk everything to save the creatures, the island and his son.', 'Marine biologist Jack Ellway and his son Brandon are drawn to the Polynesian island of Malau to study the effects of recent seismic activity on the area''s marine life. Along with the local doctor Alyson Hart, they soon become caught up in the investigation of a series of recent drownings with unexpected results. As Jack explores the surrounding ocean for a mysterious marine creature, Brandon discovers and befriends a three-foot-long baby creature that is able to leave the ocean and walk on land. As more dangerous and giant creatures come onto the island, and the military begins to take offensive action, Jack must risk everything to save the creatures, the island and his son.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mzx3KU6QNzquBdTmjhuytQ8kXlM.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:180243'),
  ('853693692440365120', 'Gargi', 2022, 'Drama, Thriller', 'Gautham Ramachandran, Sraiyanti, Premkrishna Akkattu', 'Gautham Ramachandran, Hariharan Raju', 'Sai Pallavi, Aishwarya Lekshmi, Kaali Venkat, R.S. Shivaji, Jayaprakash, Saravanan, Livingston, Kalesh Ramanand', null, 'When a schoolteacher''s father is arrested for the rape of a 10-year-old girl, the media storm surrounding the case has lawyers reluctant about defending the accused. An inexperienced advocate with a speech disability agrees to take up the case despite the stiff opposition and ridicule from his association. It is now up to them to build their defence and prove that the man accused of committing the crime did not do it.', 'When a schoolteacher''s father is arrested for the rape of a 10-year-old girl, the media storm surrounding the case has lawyers reluctant about defending the accused. An inexperienced advocate with a speech disability agrees to take up the case despite the stiff opposition and ridicule from his association. It is now up to them to build their defence and prove that the man accused of committing the crime did not do it.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3gN32gdxdXd96Usl1vEzg7RFMQ7.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:973579'),
  ('700558947643976356', 'Gargoyle: Wings of Darkness', 2004, 'Horror', 'Jim Wynorski, Andrea V. Rossotto', 'Ion Ionescu', 'Michael Paré, Sandra Hess, Fintan McKeown, Kate Orsini, Tim Abell, William Langlois, Petri Roega, Rene Rivera', 'R', 'Two CIA agents are sent to Bucharest, Romania to solve a high profile kidnapping. But what they discover is something inexplicable. An evil gargoyle, once thought dead and banished forever, has returned with a vengeance.', 'Two CIA agents are sent to Bucharest, Romania to solve a high profile kidnapping. But what they discover is something inexplicable. An evil gargoyle, once thought dead and banished forever, has returned with a vengeance.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eMVvXpyXmVaLiEkAyBL879xRfrJ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:28508'),
  ('821090461273323934', 'Gargoyles', 1972, 'Fantasy, Horror, TV Movie', 'Bill L. Norton, Earl Rath', 'Elinor Karpf, Steven Karpf', 'Cornel Wilde, Jennifer Salt, Grayson Hall, Bernie Casey, Scott Glenn, William Stevens, John Gruber, Woody Chambliss', 'NR', 'After receiving word about a mysterious carcass/skeleton unearthed in the Arizona desert, a father and his daughter decide to remove it from the burial grounds for further study. Once they do so, they, as well as the town, are besieged by a colony of gargoyles living in some nearby caverns.', 'After receiving word about a mysterious carcass/skeleton unearthed in the Arizona desert, a father and his daughter decide to remove it from the burial grounds for further study. Once they do so, they, as well as the town, are besieged by a colony of gargoyles living in some nearby caverns.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/74x0yhrNGUsAvggdE8beIEOnQrJ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:41025'),
  ('58972579834994718', 'Gargoyles the Movie: The Heroes Awaken', 1995, 'Animation, Fantasy, Family', 'Saburo Hashimoto, Takamitsu Kawamura, Kazuo Terada', 'Michael Reaves', 'Keith David, Salli Richardson-Whitfield, Ed Asner, Jonathan Frakes, Marina Sirtis, Jeff Bennett, Frank Welker, Thom Adcox-Hernandez', null, 'After a magic spell in 10th century Scotland turns them to stone, a group of gargoyles that turn to flesh and blood when the sun goes down are resurrected by an opportunistic billionaire with sinister intentions.', 'After a magic spell in 10th century Scotland turns them to stone, a group of gargoyles that turn to flesh and blood when the sun goes down are resurrected by an opportunistic billionaire with sinister intentions.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nBmvDbG5xauUHssAr7PWf90nbbW.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:285763'),
  ('955877418077408864', 'Garibaldi''s Lovers', 2012, 'Comedy', 'Silvio Soldini, Ramiro Civita, Cinzia Castania', 'Doriana Leondeff, Marco Pettenello, Silvio Soldini', 'Valerio Mastandrea, Alba Rohrwacher, Giuseppe Battiston, Claudia Gerini, Maria Paiato, Luca Dirodi, Serena Pinto, Shi Yang', 'NR', 'A widowed working-class father falls in love with a struggling, poor artist.', 'A widowed working-class father falls in love with a struggling, poor artist.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/khITzjbOVlRgQ19xhFXEExACTuB.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:139504'),
  ('645323013566908725', 'Garlic Is as Good as Ten Mothers', 1980, 'Documentary', 'Les Blank, Les Blank', null, 'Alice Waters, Werner Herzog, Harrod Blank, Michael Goodwin, Christopher Pray', 'PG', 'A zesty paean of praise to the greater glories of garlic. This lip-smacking foray into the history, consumption, cultivation and culinary/curative powers of the stinking rose features chef Alice Waters of Chez Panisse, and a flavorful musical soundtrack. Preserved by the Academy Film Archive in 1999.', 'A zesty paean of praise to the greater glories of garlic. This lip-smacking foray into the history, consumption, cultivation and culinary/curative powers of the stinking rose features chef Alice Waters of Chez Panisse, and a flavorful musical soundtrack. Preserved by the Academy Film Archive in 1999.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gcgRpoF7WKcGAXpEGtqRdVo9b7u.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:85642'),
  ('17218669225850228', 'Garm Hava', 1973, 'Drama', 'Ishan Arya, M.S. Sathyu, Kulbir Singh', 'Kaifi Azmi, Shama Zaidi', 'A.K. Hangal, Gita Siddharth, Jamal Hashmi, Yunus Parvez, Jalal Agha, Shaukat Azmi, Vikas Anand, Rajendra Raghuvanshi', null, 'In post-Partition India, a Muslim businessman and his family struggle for their rights in a country which was once their own.', 'In post-Partition India, a Muslim businessman and his family struggle for their rights in a country which was once their own.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mrBK3u2CwiewljKRdyorURUEZQC.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:183654'),
  ('945066507424607117', 'Garm Wars: The Last Druid', 2014, 'Action, Science Fiction, Thriller', 'Mamoru Oshii, Benoit Beaulieu, Anthony De Chellis', 'Geoffrey Gunn, Mamoru Oshii', 'Lance Henriksen, Kevin Durand, Mélanie St-Pierre, Summer H. Howell, Andrew Gillies, Dawn Ford, Jordan Van Dyck', null, 'In a world where clone soldiers from three military tribes are locked in a perpetual battle of air, land and technology, one clone is separated from the battle and finds herself on the run with a group of unlikely companions.', 'In a world where clone soldiers from three military tribes are locked in a perpetual battle of air, land and technology, one clone is separated from the battle and finds herself on the run with a group of unlikely companions.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cz3tMdY7XPjzhEWH7hdKOn3doJ1.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:302026'),
  ('1057924352476965183', 'GARO - Kiba: The Dark Knight', 2011, 'Fantasy, Action, Adventure', 'Keita Amemiya, Kousuke Kurogi', 'Keita Amemiya', 'Masaki Kyomoto, Mika Hijii, Leah Dizon, Mikoto Inoue, Raima Hiramatsu, Kazuhiko Inoue, Mizuho Yoshida, Asami', null, 'The spirit of Kiba the Dark Makai Knight influenced everything since the beginning. Though he called himself a Makai Knight, Kiba was no different to a Horror. Kiba''s spirit resides inside what was once a grey colored Makai Armor that''s filled with the dark knowledge of Makai Power. As Barago absorbed Horror after Horror, Kiba eventually deformed into an organically pure black armor with a cape. Kiba assumed full control over his host upon Meisha''s defeat by Kouga.', 'The spirit of Kiba the Dark Makai Knight influenced everything since the beginning. Though he called himself a Makai Knight, Kiba was no different to a Horror. Kiba''s spirit resides inside what was once a grey colored Makai Armor that''s filled with the dark knowledge of Makai Power. As Barago absorbed Horror after Horror, Kiba eventually deformed into an organically pure black armor with a cape. Kiba assumed full control over his host upon Meisha''s defeat by Kouga.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nCZCm6JKjgwrvrjP4YbGBLm7C3x.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:257171'),
  ('277223641766078335', 'GARO and the Wailing Dragon', 2013, 'Action, Adventure, Fantasy', 'Keita Amemiya', 'Keita Amemiya', 'Ryosei Konishi, Yuki Kubota, Anna Aoi, Yukijiro Hotaru, Tetsuya Yanagihara, Hironobu Kageyama, Ryuuzaburou Ootomo, Okuda Yukari', null, 'Garo: Soukoku no Maryu (lit. Blue Cries of the Demon Dragon) is the second film to the Garo series. The film serves as an epilogue after Makai Senki and leads up to The One Who Shines in the Darkness. The story continues after the events of Makai Senki. Having made a contract with Gajari, Kouga Saejima honors his end of the deal by traveling to the Promised Land to retrieve a part of Gajari: the Fang of Sorrow. After Kouga defeated Sigma, Gajari transported him to the Promised Land, however, his quest had unexpected results.', 'Garo: Soukoku no Maryu (lit. Blue Cries of the Demon Dragon) is the second film to the Garo series. The film serves as an epilogue after Makai Senki and leads up to The One Who Shines in the Darkness. The story continues after the events of Makai Senki. Having made a contract with Gajari, Kouga Saejima honors his end of the deal by traveling to the Promised Land to retrieve a part of Gajari: the Fang of Sorrow. After Kouga defeated Sigma, Gajari transported him to the Promised Land, however, his quest had unexpected results.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/v1VXZRpEYRgsoqUDpSS0CSzrMMp.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:227366'),
  ('1092004788168676554', 'GARO Side Story: The Tougen Flute', 2013, 'Action, Adventure, Horror', 'Akira Ohashi', 'Keita Amemiya, Hisako Fujihira', 'Yasue Sato, Mary Matsuyama, Kanji Tsuda, Kumi Takiuchi, Miku Oono, Yuzumi Shibamoto, Masahiro Kuranuki, Hitomi Takahashi', null, 'Long ago, a fallen Makai Priestess named Higari became too powerful and after tampering with powers no one should wield, she had to be stopped and was eventually sealed away by another Makai Priest named Sougen. Using his body and his own life, he created the Tougen Flute and sealed Higari shortly after his death. However, through a special ritual, those who seek Higari''s power can resurrect her by replaying eight notes on the Tougen Flute to undo Sougen''s seal. In the present, while Kouga Saezima has travelled to the promised land (Garo: Soukoku no Maryu), two fallen priests,Jabi and Rekka, will attempt to return Higari.', 'Long ago, a fallen Makai Priestess named Higari became too powerful and after tampering with powers no one should wield, she had to be stopped and was eventually sealed away by another Makai Priest named Sougen. Using his body and his own life, he created the Tougen Flute and sealed Higari shortly after his death. However, through a special ritual, those who seek Higari''s power can resurrect her by replaying eight notes on the Tougen Flute to undo Sougen''s seal. In the present, while Kouga Saezima has travelled to the promised land (Garo: Soukoku no Maryu), two fallen priests,Jabi and Rekka, will attempt to return Higari.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/d7Nc1fYPYWvFZfwbwxSVYeHva4q.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:259390'),
  ('1081039875665657985', 'GARO: Divine Flame', 2016, 'Action, Animation', 'Kim Boo-cheol, Yuichiro Hayashi, Sunghoo Park', 'Yasuko Kobayashi', 'Katsuhito Nomura, Daisuke Namikawa, Kenyu Horiuchi, Romi Park, Yumi Sudo, Miyu Tomita, Masato Hagiwara, Arisa Komiya', null, 'Leon, who has succeeded the name of Golden Knight "GARO," devotes himself to train a young Makai Knight for the next generation, together with Prince Alfonso of the Valiante Kingdom. Then, they receive an order to exterminate the most beautiful Horror in the world which resides in a neighboring country "Vazelia." At the same time, a young Makai Knight for the next generation is kidnapped by an unknown person. Leon desperately follows them, only to find that he is surrounded by his enemies at a dead end. Then, a Makai Knight Dario who was supposed to be missing for some time suddenly appears and rescues him. Under his guidance, Leon is led to the town where he meets up a totally unexpected person.', 'Leon, who has succeeded the name of Golden Knight "GARO," devotes himself to train a young Makai Knight for the next generation, together with Prince Alfonso of the Valiante Kingdom. Then, they receive an order to exterminate the most beautiful Horror in the world which resides in a neighboring country "Vazelia." At the same time, a young Makai Knight for the next generation is kidnapped by an unknown person. Leon desperately follows them, only to find that he is surrounded by his enemies at a dead end. Then, a Makai Knight Dario who was supposed to be missing for some time suddenly appears and rescues him. Under his guidance, Leon is led to the town where he meets up a totally unexpected person.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/74xMMFGE2eGXQZNKyqcc69R4TUM.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:374195'),
  ('340220010244680747', 'GARO: Red Requiem', 2010, 'Action, Adventure, Fantasy, Thriller', 'Keita Amemiya, Mitsuyoshi Abe', 'Itaru Era, Keita Amemiya', 'Ryosei Konishi, Mary Matsuyama, Masahiro Kuranuki, Saori Hara, Shinji Kasahara, Hiromi Eguchi, Yousuke Saito, Akira Nakao', null, 'The current wearer of the gold wolf armor Garo, doesn’t believe women can be chosen to wear mystic armor. When Kouga''s quest thrusts him into conflict alongside Priestess Rekka, he’s forced to acknowledge that the female species can be deadly!', 'The current wearer of the gold wolf armor Garo, doesn’t believe women can be chosen to wear mystic armor. When Kouga''s quest thrusts him into conflict alongside Priestess Rekka, he’s forced to acknowledge that the female species can be deadly!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ssue24YN4ay40UmpRerXS4qAOOE.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:75930'),
  ('678415744738091586', 'Garota da Moto', 2021, 'Action', 'Luis Pinheiro', 'David França Mendes', 'Maria Casadevall, Kevin Vechiatto, Naruna Costa, Murilo Grossi, Roberto Birindelli, Felipe Montanari, Duda Nagle, Fernanda Viacava', null, 'No description available yet.', 'No description available yet.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sYoWjGSW4XQRWwFDHf3kdMqtCLr.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:876262'),
  ('962010748202240238', 'Garrincha: Joy of the People', 1962, 'Documentary', 'Joaquim Pedro de Andrade, Mário Carneiro', 'David Neves, Armando Nogueira, Joaquim Pedro de Andrade', 'Heron Domingues, Garrincha', null, 'Documentary about the most famous dribbler in Brazilian Soccer (some say in Soccer''s history!) at the zenith of his career, showing classic scenes of 1958 and 1962 World Cup. Garrincha was a very original and talented player, having curved legs. Women and alcohol were his passion, and the cause of his later decadence. After a glorious career, he died in financial misery, forgotten.', 'Documentary about the most famous dribbler in Brazilian Soccer (some say in Soccer''s history!) at the zenith of his career, showing classic scenes of 1958 and 1962 World Cup. Garrincha was a very original and talented player, having curved legs. Women and alcohol were his passion, and the cause of his later decadence. After a glorious career, he died in financial misery, forgotten.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/s8LS0Wf40Gs8m64SRiR4V7Onvxk.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:163936'),
  ('13684577924254044', 'Garrincha: Lonely Star', 2003, 'Drama', 'Milton Alencar Jr.', 'João Máximo, Aldir Blanc, Rodrigo Campos', 'André Gonçalves, Ana Couto, Romeu Evaristo, Tatiana Merino, Marília Pêra, Pascoal Villaboim, Taís Araújo, Milhem Cortaz', null, 'The life of Brazilian soccer player, Garrincha, considered to be one of the greatest players of all time, with his uniquely original style. He had arched legs, a passion for women and booze. Also had a much talked extramarital affair with singer Elza Soares and died in relative decadence. The movie focuses on his zenith, from 1953 until the World Championship and the Rio Regional Championship, in 1962.', 'The life of Brazilian soccer player, Garrincha, considered to be one of the greatest players of all time, with his uniquely original style. He had arched legs, a passion for women and booze. Also had a much talked extramarital affair with singer Elza Soares and died in relative decadence. The movie focuses on his zenith, from 1953 until the World Championship and the Rio Regional Championship, in 1962.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zHdcHMDXy4BxavJ8GwrbEjpABZ2.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:60209'),
  ('1115616388632991885', 'Garuda', 2004, 'Action, Science Fiction, Thriller', 'Monthon Arayangkoon, Jiradech Samniangsanor, Atsawin Jitjana', 'Monthon Arayangkoon', 'Sornram Theppitak, Sara Legge, Dan Fraser, Chalad Na Songkhla, Suttipong Samkumpim, Thanapong Kumvit, Piya Vimuktayon, Suthiporn Meta', null, 'In Bangkok, construction workers come across a rock which cannot be drilled, and discover dinosaur-like fossils of a creature resembling the Garuda from Thai-Hindu mythology. Two American archeologists investigate, awakening the creature which then goes on a rampage.', 'In Bangkok, construction workers come across a rock which cannot be drilled, and discover dinosaur-like fossils of a creature resembling the Garuda from Thai-Hindu mythology. Two American archeologists investigate, awakening the creature which then goes on a rampage.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/p86VuBOZn2aqHwWhFT4ldwug1pG.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:123702'),
  ('691630740869008523', 'Garv: Pride and Honour', 2004, 'Action, Crime, Drama', 'Puneet Issar, Stephen Fernandes, Kishore Kapadia', 'Puneet Issar', 'Salman Khan, Shilpa Shetty Kundra, Arbaaz Khan, Amrish Puri, Farida Jalal, Kulbhushan Kharbanda, Akanksha Malhotra, Mukesh Rishi', null, 'About to retire, police inspector Samar Singh changes his mind when he discovers that a recently elected official has ties with the underworld.', 'About to retire, police inspector Samar Singh changes his mind when he discovers that a recently elected official has ties with the underworld.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9lqPTKndjMWfPmBRyH8rWw7bH5I.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:72051'),
  ('655237741441546622', 'Gas Food Lodging', 1992, 'Drama, Romance', 'Allison Anders, Dean Lent, Jim Goldthwait', 'Allison Anders', 'Brooke Adams, Ione Skye, Fairuza Balk, James Brolin, Robert Knepper, David Lansbury, Jacob Vargas, Donovan Leitch', 'R', 'Nora, a single mother raising two teenage daughters, Shade and Trudi, waits tables at a truck-stop diner in a small New Mexico town. The beautiful and rebellious Trudi drops out of school and gets a job alongside Nora, while the younger Shade whittles away her time at Spanish movie matinees. Their lives are turned upside down when Trudi becomes pregnant and the girls'' absent father returns.', 'Nora, a single mother raising two teenage daughters, Shade and Trudi, waits tables at a truck-stop diner in a small New Mexico town. The beautiful and rebellious Trudi drops out of school and gets a job alongside Nora, while the younger Shade whittles away her time at Spanish movie matinees. Their lives are turned upside down when Trudi becomes pregnant and the girls'' absent father returns.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4klEYvGDHmv89NQRfAaDc8qHncs.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:47866'),
  ('601286813616083917', 'Gas Pump Girls', 1979, 'Comedy', 'Joel Bender, Nicholas Josef von Sternberg', 'David A. Davies, Joel Bender, Isaac Blech', 'Kirsten Baker, Linda Lawrence, Sandy Johnson, Rikki Marin, Leslie King, Demetre Phillips, Steve Bond, Ken Lerner', 'R', 'June and her friends take over a service station formerly run by her uncle. They perform every trick in the book to attract the customers.', 'June and her friends take over a service station formerly run by her uncle. They perform every trick in the book to attract the customers.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nJ15qWMW0DmbGvosnvWFbObFT08.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:119552'),
  ('139462603714265564', 'Gas Station Queen', 1963, 'Comedy', 'Aleksey Mishurin, Mykola Litus, Oleksandr Pyshchykov', 'Pyotr Lubenskiy', 'Nadezhda Rumyantseva, Yuri Belov, Aleksey Kozhevnikov, Andrii Sova, Nonna Koperzhynska, Vladimir Belokurov, Sergei Blinnikov, Pavel Vinnik', null, 'Lyudmila doesn''t have any luck in finding the perfect job. She tried to be an air hostess, newscaster, model, ice skater, but fate had something else in store for her - a petrol station, where her incredible positivity and fiery personality charm everyone around her.', 'Lyudmila doesn''t have any luck in finding the perfect job. She tried to be an air hostess, newscaster, model, ice skater, but fate had something else in store for her - a petrol station, where her incredible positivity and fiery personality charm everyone around her.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/78rI3uNkQEn9mumzGNCarGF16HV.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:20977'),
  ('970956725901364728', 'Gas, Inspector Palmu!', 1961, 'Comedy, Crime', 'Matti Kassila, Esko Nevalainen', 'Matti Kassila, Kaarlo Nuorvala', 'Joel Rinne, Matti Ranin, Leo Jokela, Elina Salo, Pentti Siimes, Saulo Haarla, Risto Mäkelä, Henny Valjus', null, 'A rich widow is found dead in her apartment in Helsinki due to gas poisoning. The incident is initially thought to be an accident, but inspector Palmu notices that the murderer made a mistake, and so Palmu, Kokki and Virta begin the investigation: who had come to the apartment through the balcony door and opened the gas tap while Mrs. Skrof was asleep?', 'A rich widow is found dead in her apartment in Helsinki due to gas poisoning. The incident is initially thought to be an accident, but inspector Palmu notices that the murderer made a mistake, and so Palmu, Kokki and Virta begin the investigation: who had come to the apartment through the balcony door and opened the gas tap while Mrs. Skrof was asleep?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/823WXJeRqAVCj89mKnhKz8vgDDd.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:145899'),
  ('814192470653064840', 'Gas! -Or- It Became Necessary to Destroy the World in Order to Save It.', 1970, 'Comedy, Science Fiction', 'Roger Corman, Ron Dexter, Robert Dijoux', 'George Armitage', 'Bud Cort, Talia Shire, Elaine Giftos, Cindy Williams, Ben Vereen, Bob Corff, Alex Wilson, Bruce Karcher', 'R', 'A gas is let loose upon the world that kills anyone over 25 years old.', 'A gas is let loose upon the world that kills anyone over 25 years old.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bR6U9tVmCpZ68XrmvsNgxSzZYtY.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:85224'),
  ('464644994802804906', 'Gascoigne', 2015, 'Documentary', 'Jane Preston', null, 'Paul Gascoigne, Gary Lineker, José Mourinho, Wayne Rooney, Vinnie Jones, Diego Maradona, Bobby Robson, Terry Wogan', 'PG-13', 'A feature length, theatrical documentary on the life of Paul Gascoigne, one of the greatest footballers that ever lived: delving deep into his psyche, vulnerabilities, fears and triumphs.', 'A feature length, theatrical documentary on the life of Paul Gascoigne, one of the greatest footballers that ever lived: delving deep into his psyche, vulnerabilities, fears and triumphs.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nnac1OwNpcdtQzHs7nhk5AtiJfC.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:343981'),
  ('150483196109064403', 'Gasland', 2010, 'Documentary', 'Josh Fox', 'Josh Fox', 'Josh Fox, Dick Cheney, Pete Seeger, Richard Nixon, Aubrey K. McClendon, Pat Fernelli, Ron Carter, Jean Carter', 'NR', 'It is happening all across America-rural landowners wake up one day to find a lucrative offer from an energy company wanting to lease their property. Reason? The company hopes to tap into a reservoir dubbed the "Saudi Arabia of natural gas." Halliburton developed a way to get the gas out of the ground-a hydraulic drilling process called "fracking"-and suddenly America finds itself on the precipice of becoming an energy superpower.', 'It is happening all across America-rural landowners wake up one day to find a lucrative offer from an energy company wanting to lease their property. Reason? The company hopes to tap into a reservoir dubbed the "Saudi Arabia of natural gas." Halliburton developed a way to get the gas out of the ground-a hydraulic drilling process called "fracking"-and suddenly America finds itself on the precipice of becoming an energy superpower.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2vu4Nk1wY0yjXiSzOxYuXlaD8yV.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:40663'),
  ('502612627331281773', 'Gaslight', 1940, 'Thriller, Mystery', 'Thorold Dickinson, George Pollock, Bernard Knowles', 'A.R. Rawlinson, Bridget Boland', 'Anton Walbrook, Diana Wynyard, Frank Pettingell, Cathleen Cordell, Robert Newton, Jimmy Hanley, Minnie Rayner, Marie Wright', null, 'Twenty years removed from Alice Barlow''s murder by a thief looking for her jewels, newlyweds Paul and Bella Mallen move into the very house where the crime was committed. Retired detective B.G. Rough, who worked on the Barlow case, is still in the area and grows suspicious of Paul, who he feels bears a striking resemblance to one of Barlow''s relatives. Rough must find the truth before the killer can strike again and reclaim his bounty.', 'Twenty years removed from Alice Barlow''s murder by a thief looking for her jewels, newlyweds Paul and Bella Mallen move into the very house where the crime was committed. Retired detective B.G. Rough, who worked on the Barlow case, is still in the area and grows suspicious of Paul, who he feels bears a striking resemblance to one of Barlow''s relatives. Rough must find the truth before the killer can strike again and reclaim his bounty.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/h3xaVryGKjvXjomHaqmqjjbasUC.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:55207'),
  ('1016868784081014612', 'Gaslight', 1944, 'Thriller, Drama, Mystery, Crime', 'George Cukor, Joseph Ruttenberg, Jack Greenwood', 'Walter Reisch, John L. Balderston, John Van Druten', 'Charles Boyer, Ingrid Bergman, Joseph Cotten, May Whitty, Angela Lansbury, Barbara Everest, Emil Rameau, Edmund Breon', null, 'A newlywed fears she''s going mad when strange things start happening at the family mansion.', 'A newlywed fears she''s going mad when strange things start happening at the family mansion.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gXKszCl5Q1KrgWRWpPcqn94CP58.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:13528'),
  ('599016832966725572', 'Gaslight', 2023, 'Horror, Thriller', 'Pavan Kirpalani, Ragul Dharuman, Mukesh Chhabra', 'Pavan Kirpalani, Neha Veena Sharma', 'Sara Ali Khan, Vikrant Massey, Chitrangada Singh, Rahul Dev, Akshay Oberoi, Shishir Sharma, Shataf Figar, Mannat Duggal', null, 'Meesha, a young paraplegic woman confined to a wheelchair, returns to her family’s royal estate after 15 years at the behest of her estranged father, only to learn that he’s mysteriously missing and probably dead.', 'Meesha, a young paraplegic woman confined to a wheelchair, returns to her family’s royal estate after 15 years at the behest of her estranged father, only to learn that he’s mysteriously missing and probably dead.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8D3lObq5pv7lH0o5tny908SldKf.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1092654'),
  ('855068079896391284', 'Gasman', 1998, 'Drama', 'Lynne Ramsay, Nigel MacInnes, Morvan MacKenzie', 'Lynne Ramsay', 'Lynne Ramsay Jr., Martin Anderson, James Ramsay, Denise Flannagan, Jackie Quinn, Lisa Taylor, Robert McEwan', null, 'A story of two children who react with naive simple emotion to a situation imposed upon them by their father''s secret.', 'A story of two children who react with naive simple emotion to a situation imposed upon them by their father''s secret.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/s58XvzjJv0ZxNo1gySiKlyRsAyj.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:49486'),
  ('92499634619980394', 'Gasoline', 2002, 'Crime, Romance', 'Luigi Cutore, Fabio Cianchetti, Martino Ferro', 'Elena Stancanelli, Monica Stambrini, Anne Riitta Ciccone', 'Maya Sansa, Regina Orioli, Mariella Valentini, Chiara Conti, Marco Quaglia, Pietro Ragusa, Luigi Maria Burruano, Osvaldo Alzari', 'NR', 'Fiery, dark-haired Stella, an intense auto mechanic, and nervous, blonde Eleonora are young and in love. They operate a gas station peacefully, until Eleonora''s mother appears and voices her disapproval of their romance.', 'Fiery, dark-haired Stella, an intense auto mechanic, and nervous, blonde Eleonora are young and in love. They operate a gas station peacefully, until Eleonora''s mother appears and voices her disapproval of their romance.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1YPxI4SVPWHAybAma6qFpxzWoew.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:12800'),
  ('507838068912161596', 'Gasoline Alley', 2022, 'Action, Thriller, Crime, Mystery', 'Edward Drake, Brandon Cox', 'Edward Drake, Tom Sierchio', 'Devon Sawa, Bruce Willis, Luke Wilson, Kat Foster, Sufe Bradshaw, Johnny Dowers, Kenny Wormald, Angie Pack', 'R', 'A man implicated in the triple homicide of three Hollywood starlets begins his own investigation. Needing assistance, he enlists the two detectives on his tail in order to expose a conspiracy more explosive than any of them imagined.', 'A man implicated in the triple homicide of three Hollywood starlets begins his own investigation. Needing assistance, he enlists the two detectives on his tail in order to expose a conspiracy more explosive than any of them imagined.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ews3l3v7JYLtBS5ansZrXsXLMzl.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:916821'),
  ('1028608797642974983', 'Gasoline Rainbow', 2024, 'Drama, Adventure', 'Turner Ross, Bill Ross, Bill Ross', 'Bill Ross, Turner Ross', 'Makai Garza, Micah Bunch, Nichole Dukes, Nathaly Garcia, Tony Aburto', 'NR', 'With high school in the rearview, five teenagers from inland Oregon embark on one last adventure. Piling into a van with a busted tail light, their mission takes them to a place they’ve never been—the Pacific coast, five hundred miles away. Their plan, in full: “Fuck it.”', 'With high school in the rearview, five teenagers from inland Oregon embark on one last adventure. Piling into a van with a busted tail light, their mission takes them to a place they’ve never been—the Pacific coast, five hundred miles away. Their plan, in full: “Fuck it.”', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3wZPMKCrL4jwpAMWgQQoV75VaU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1156110'),
  ('211088259134012339', 'Gaspard at the Wedding', 2018, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Antony Cordier, Nicolas Gaurin', 'Antony Cordier', 'Félix Moati, Laetitia Dosch, Christa Théret, Johan Heldenbergh, Guillaume Gouix, Marina Foïs, Élodie Bouchez, Vincent Deniard', null, 'After keeping a careful distance for many years, 25-year-old Gaspard must renew contact with his family when his father remarries. Accompanied by Laura, an eccentric young woman who agrees to pretend she''s his girlfriend at the wedding, he finally feels ready to set foot in the zoo owned by his parents, where he is reunited with the monkeys and tigers he grew up with... But with a father who is an out-of-control womanizer, a brother who is far too sensible, and a sister who is far too beautiful, he unknowingly sets himself up to experience the last days of his childhood.', 'After keeping a careful distance for many years, 25-year-old Gaspard must renew contact with his family when his father remarries. Accompanied by Laura, an eccentric young woman who agrees to pretend she''s his girlfriend at the wedding, he finally feels ready to set foot in the zoo owned by his parents, where he is reunited with the monkeys and tigers he grew up with... But with a father who is an out-of-control womanizer, a brother who is far too sensible, and a sister who is far too beautiful, he unknowingly sets himself up to experience the last days of his childhood.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hR3RmVmxWomnJN7OFalIJGWfRKV.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:424344'),
