  ('873187081698677525', 'Gaston Lagaffe', 2018, 'Comedy', 'Pierre-François Martin-Laval, Régis Blondeau', 'Pierre-François Martin-Laval, Mathias Gavarry', 'Théo Fernandez, Pierre-François Martin-Laval, Arnaud Ducret, Jérôme Commandeur, Alison Wheeler, Franc Bruneau, Christophe Canard, Sébastien Chassagne', null, 'Gaston is a new guy at the Peticoin start-up. With his delusional inventions, he will change the lives of his colleagues. Cat, seagull, cow, and gaffophone will be at the center of the mishaps of this genius laidback handyman who wants only to do good, but has the gift of annoying Prunelle, his boss. Can those Gaston''s gaffes galore prevent the buy-out of the Peticoin by Mr. de Mesmaeker?', 'Gaston is a new guy at the Peticoin start-up. With his delusional inventions, he will change the lives of his colleagues. Cat, seagull, cow, and gaffophone will be at the center of the mishaps of this genius laidback handyman who wants only to do good, but has the gift of annoying Prunelle, his boss. Can those Gaston''s gaffes galore prevent the buy-out of the Peticoin by Mr. de Mesmaeker?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3t3E8Lg4msV7ubKcVj2QkI8CPAG.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:469052'),
  ('959003354275549783', 'Gastone', 1960, 'Comedy', 'Mario Bonnard, Francesco Giaculli, Luciano Trasatti', 'Mario Bonnard, Rodolfo Sonego, Oreste Biancoli', 'Alberto Sordi, Vittorio De Sica, Anna Maria Ferrero, Franca Marzi, Linda Sini, Chelo Alonso, Magali Noël, Paolo Stoppa', null, 'During the period between world wars, vaudeville sketches were popular before film showings.Gastone is one of the characters played by the famous Ettore Petrolini who figures in these sketches.', 'During the period between world wars, vaudeville sketches were popular before film showings.Gastone is one of the characters played by the famous Ettore Petrolini who figures in these sketches.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dCtOInMNu5EhYs7XZit622sISG0.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:82354'),
  ('950389717454690819', 'Gatao 2: Rise of the King', 2018, 'Action, Drama, Crime', 'Chiang Jui-chih, Yen Cheng-kuo, Yao Hung-i', 'Yen Cheng-kuo', 'Wang Shih-sian, Jack Kao, Rexen Cheng, Collin Chou, Chang Tsai-hsing, Peggy Tseng, Yin Chao-te, Tang Chen-kang', null, 'Ren has finally succeeded his boss as the head of the North Fort Gang. For so long, his ambitions had been held back; now, he can realize them. But the ruthless Jian returns with his own gang. Though Ren and Jian were once like brothers, Ren''s position is challenged, causing tensions with Qing, his loyal captain. Now that former friends are enemies, what is the price of loyalty? What will be left of friendship when the smoke of battle clears?', 'Ren has finally succeeded his boss as the head of the North Fort Gang. For so long, his ambitions had been held back; now, he can realize them. But the ruthless Jian returns with his own gang. Though Ren and Jian were once like brothers, Ren''s position is challenged, causing tensions with Qing, his loyal captain. Now that former friends are enemies, what is the price of loyalty? What will be left of friendship when the smoke of battle clears?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tyAr9mLsohMW8V2yEkVIRThuH5e.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:506053'),
  ('709488160806960096', 'GATAO: Big Brothers', 2025, 'Crime, Action', 'Chiang Jui-chih, Yao Hung-i, Armo Huang', 'Red Chang, Joyce Liu, Chiang Hsi-wen', 'Jack Kao, Tsai Chen-nan, Tai Bo, King Jieh-wen, Lung Tien-hsiang, Tsui Hao-jan, Wang Shih-sian, Joseph Hsia', null, 'Michael and his right-hand man Scorpion, who find themselves embroiled in their father Ko''s turf war against rival gangs in Taipei, setting off a conflict between old and new generations of gangsters. The film is the latest installment in the Gatao franchise, following the narrative of a young successor trying to expand his power while navigating the volatile underworld.', 'Michael and his right-hand man Scorpion, who find themselves embroiled in their father Ko''s turf war against rival gangs in Taipei, setting off a conflict between old and new generations of gangsters. The film is the latest installment in the Gatao franchise, following the narrative of a young successor trying to expand his power while navigating the volatile underworld.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tc5z5OADIYlOZLn0xNNM32c0Cq5.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1468057'),
  ('321264676924395363', 'GATAO: Like Father Like Son', 2024, 'Crime, Action', 'Chiang Jui-chih, Yao Hung-i, Yao Hung-i', 'Red Chang, Joyce Liu', 'Sunny Wang, Harry Chang, Lung Tien-hsiang, Rexen Cheng, Tsai Chen-nan, King Jieh-wen, Jack Kao, Tai Bo', 'R', 'Michael and his right-hand man Scorpion, who find themselves embroiled in their father Ko''s turf war against rival gangs in Taipei, setting off a conflict between old and new generations of gangsters. The film is the latest installment in the Gatao franchise, following the narrative of a young successor trying to expand his power while navigating the volatile underworld.', 'Michael and his right-hand man Scorpion, who find themselves embroiled in their father Ko''s turf war against rival gangs in Taipei, setting off a conflict between old and new generations of gangsters. The film is the latest installment in the Gatao franchise, following the narrative of a young successor trying to expand his power while navigating the volatile underworld.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gaNsN1ojr3mhFBUexBpA4gJ7ejs.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1303236'),
  ('1059099395715011431', 'Gatao: The Last Stray', 2021, 'Crime, Action', 'Lee Ming, Chiang Jui-chih', 'Chiang Jui-chih', 'Rexen Cheng, Nikki Hsieh, Jack Kao, Lung Siu Wa, Alan Kuo, Tai Bo, Hsin Shao, Peggy Tseng', null, 'A Qing encounters the photographer Xiao Qi at the full moon banquet of the daughter of the big brother Ren Ge at the corner of the Beiguan. They fall in love with each other. But, sadly, they aren''t able to stay together at the end.', 'A Qing encounters the photographer Xiao Qi at the full moon banquet of the daughter of the big brother Ren Ge at the corner of the Beiguan. They fall in love with each other. But, sadly, they aren''t able to stay together at the end.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/h3fMhdMCf28dWEVn9C0HdeAVGLV.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:779221'),
  ('1146701386713789225', 'Gatchaman', 2013, 'Action, Adventure, Science Fiction', 'Tōya Satō, Takahiro Tsutai', 'Yusuke Watanabe', 'Tori Matsuzaka, Ryohei Suzuki, Go Ayano, Ayame Goriki, Tatsuomi Hamada, Eriko Hatsune, Goro Kishitani, Ken Mitsuishi', null, 'By the year 2050 AD, a mysterious organization called Galactor has occupied half of the Earth and threatens to exterminate the human race. Around the same time, the International Science Organization had uncovered mysterious stones that bear unusual powers. It is said that one person out of approximately eight million is able to harness the power of the stones; they are known as a "Receptor". Dr. Kozaburo Nambu gathers a team of these five lucky Receptors together. Known as the "Gatchaman" team, it is their mission to defeat Galactor.', 'By the year 2050 AD, a mysterious organization called Galactor has occupied half of the Earth and threatens to exterminate the human race. Around the same time, the International Science Organization had uncovered mysterious stones that bear unusual powers. It is said that one person out of approximately eight million is able to harness the power of the stones; they are known as a "Receptor". Dr. Kozaburo Nambu gathers a team of these five lucky Receptors together. Known as the "Gatchaman" team, it is their mission to defeat Galactor.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/u0le88N2NFnpgtuMbBuPSoRK2pA.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:225145'),
  ('978980252914524426', 'Gate II', 1990, 'Horror, Fantasy', 'Tibor Takács, Bryan England', 'Michael Nankin', 'Louis Tripp, Simon Reynolds, James Villemaire, Pamela Adlon, Neil Munro, James Kidnie, Irene Pauzer, Larry O''Brey', 'R', 'It''s been five years since Terry''s friend Glen discovered The Gate to hell in his backyard. Glen has now moved away and Terry begins practicing rituals in Glen''s old house and eventually bringing back demons through The Gate and leading to demoniac possession and near world domination.', 'It''s been five years since Terry''s friend Glen discovered The Gate to hell in his backyard. Glen has now moved away and Terry begins practicing rituals in Glen''s old house and eventually bringing back demons through The Gate and leading to demoniac possession and near world domination.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3XyBlFPfr1mAeplN1deQfQ3oHmb.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:40729'),
  ('72000130959015777', 'Gate of Flesh', 1964, 'Drama, Crime', 'Seijun Suzuki, Shigeyoshi Mine, Masami Kuzū', 'Gorō Tanada', 'Joe Shishido, Kōji Wada, Yumiko Nogawa, Tomiko Ishii, Kayo Matsuo, Satoko Kasai, Misako Tominaga, Isao Tamagawa', null, 'In the shady black markets and bombed-out hovels of post–World War II Tokyo, a tough band of prostitutes eke out a dog-eat-dog existence, maintaining tenuous friendships and a semblance of order in a world of chaos. But when a renegade ex-soldier stumbles into their midst, lusts and loyalties clash, with tragic results. With Gate of Flesh, visionary director Seijun Suzuki delivers a whirlwind of social critique and pulp drama, shot through with brilliant colors and raw emotions.', 'In the shady black markets and bombed-out hovels of post–World War II Tokyo, a tough band of prostitutes eke out a dog-eat-dog existence, maintaining tenuous friendships and a semblance of order in a world of chaos. But when a renegade ex-soldier stumbles into their midst, lusts and loyalties clash, with tragic results. With Gate of Flesh, visionary director Seijun Suzuki delivers a whirlwind of social critique and pulp drama, shot through with brilliant colors and raw emotions.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yRi34m5PlktF5NdgHEKOzyOkHGo.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:86666'),
  ('109080209681432635', 'Gate of Flesh', 1988, 'Drama', 'Hideo Gosha, Fujio Morita', 'Kazuo Kasahara', 'Rino Katase, Yūko Natori, Jinpachi Nezu, Miyuki Kanō, Kazuyo Matsui, Senri Yamazaki, Tsunehiko Watase, Shinsuke Ashida', null, 'Prostitutes in burnt out Tokyo ghetto of post-WWII Japan peddle their flesh and save one-third of their money for a proposed dancehall to be named Paradise. The hookers live in a bombed-out building, but they accept the precarious situation with typical resolve.', 'Prostitutes in burnt out Tokyo ghetto of post-WWII Japan peddle their flesh and save one-third of their money for a proposed dancehall to be named Paradise. The hookers live in a bombed-out building, but they accept the precarious situation with typical resolve.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6WdSpiIoALRfU7xjGdSPC1nOxiV.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:383634'),
  ('428108704655939831', 'Gate of Hell', 1953, 'Drama, History, Romance', 'Teinosuke Kinugasa, Kōhei Sugiyama', 'Teinosuke Kinugasa, Masaichi Nagata', 'Kazuo Hasegawa, Machiko Kyō, Isao Yamagata, Yataro Kurokawa, Kōtarō Bandō, Jun Tazaki, Koreya Senda, Masao Shimizu', null, 'Japan, 1159. Moritō, a brave samurai, performs a heroic act by rescuing the lovely Kesa during a violent uprising. Moritō falls in love with her, but becomes distraught when he finds out that she is married.', 'Japan, 1159. Moritō, a brave samurai, performs a heroic act by rescuing the lovely Kesa during a violent uprising. Moritō falls in love with her, but becomes distraught when he finds out that she is married.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/um7KDGoLgS1aRDZENkxlTSLIQNw.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:43349'),
  ('901377796075620455', 'Gates of Flesh', 2025, 'Horror, Thriller, Action', 'Bob Giordano', 'Bob Giordano', 'Rae Olivier, Daniel Annone, Jarrod Beck, Marquita Goings, Morgan Robertson, Percy Bell, Doug Steier', null, 'A group of friends attempt to escape the city after an outbreak of demon-possessions. The friends seek shelter in an abandoned church, but their plans for escape are ruined when one of them becomes possessed.', 'A group of friends attempt to escape the city after an outbreak of demon-possessions. The friends seek shelter in an abandoned church, but their plans for escape are ruined when one of them becomes possessed.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cOiuCeECSRqzpwuY6wYKQzvPcXm.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1205225'),
  ('386050158438675478', 'Gates of Heaven', 1978, 'Documentary', 'Errol Morris, Ned Burgess', null, 'Lucille Billingsley, Zella Graham, Cal Harberts, Dan Harberts, Phil Harberts, Scottie Harberts, Mike Koewler, Floyd McClure', null, 'A documentary about a pet cemetery in California, and the people who have pets buried there.', 'A documentary about a pet cemetery in California, and the people who have pets buried there.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2VGQsyCvd2XJKpKZXHF4AWsADoA.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:24998'),
  ('1029691023283929385', 'Gates of the Night', 1946, 'Drama, Romance', 'Marcel Carné, Roger Blanc, Georges Beaudoin', 'Jacques Prévert', 'Pierre Brasseur, Serge Reggiani, Yves Montand, Nathalie Nattier, Saturnin Fabre, Raymond Bussières, Jean Vilar, Sylvia Bataille', null, 'In post-Liberation Paris, a man reunites with a friend and meets the woman of his dreams, only to discover her brother''s dark past.', 'In post-Liberation Paris, a man reunites with a friend and meets the woman of his dreams, only to discover her brother''s dark past.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/e8BngTN2DHwSvdcABKPLqiNP1z3.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:60799'),
  ('430051184516291956', 'Gates to Paradise', 1968, 'History, Drama', 'Vladek Sheybal, Andrzej Wajda, Mieczysław Jahoda', 'Donald Howarth, Jerzy Andrzejewski', 'Lionel Stander, John Fordyce, Mathieu Carrière, Ferdy Mayne, Pauline Challoner, Jenny Agutter, Denis Gilmore, Kynaston Reeves', null, 'In 1212, a Children''s Crusade is launched after a young shepherd, Jacques de Cloyes, claims to have had a vision in which it is said that the innocence of children would be able to liberate Jerusalem. A monk, returning from Holy Land, joins the crusade and hears the children''s confessions, gradually realizing that most of them are taking part not for religious, but for more worldly reasons, like rejected love and hopes for freedom, the true nature of their enthusiasm is homosexual. In fact, if the children follow Jacques, it is more for romantic than religious reasons. They take literally the famous phrase: “Love one another”.', 'In 1212, a Children''s Crusade is launched after a young shepherd, Jacques de Cloyes, claims to have had a vision in which it is said that the innocence of children would be able to liberate Jerusalem. A monk, returning from Holy Land, joins the crusade and hears the children''s confessions, gradually realizing that most of them are taking part not for religious, but for more worldly reasons, like rejected love and hopes for freedom, the true nature of their enthusiasm is homosexual. In fact, if the children follow Jacques, it is more for romantic than religious reasons. They take literally the famous phrase: “Love one another”.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xZrIPA0BCC9bk8tbZVzYPHPrIEX.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:185050'),
  ('847388288895994977', 'Gatlopp: Hell of a Game', 2022, 'Comedy, Horror', 'Alberto Belli, Ilyssa Peltz, Nicholas Rogers', 'Jim Mahoney', 'Emmy Raver-Lampman, Jim Mahoney, Jon Bass, Sarunas J. Jackson, Shelley Hennig, Nancy Linehan Charles, Patricia Belcher, John Ales', null, 'Four friends get together for a nostalgic evening of fun and games after a decade of absence, which takes a dark turn.', 'Four friends get together for a nostalgic evening of fun and games after a decade of absence, which takes a dark turn.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/k5WreZUBFqeR1Er4AAecffp6ay0.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:893338'),
  ('177435556504907892', 'Gator', 1976, 'Drama, Crime, Action', 'Burt Reynolds, William A. Fraker, Edward Teets', 'William W. Norton', 'Burt Reynolds, Lauren Hutton, Jerry Reed, Dub Taylor, Burton Gilliam, Jack Weston, Alice Ghostley, Mike Douglas', 'PG', 'After his release from prison, notorious ex-con and moonshine distiller Gator McKlusky moves in with his father in a cabin in the Okefenokee Swamp. His bootlegging plans are cut short, however, when a federal agent tells McKlusky that he will lose custody of his 9-year-old daughter unless he helps bring down local crime lord Bama McCall. McKlusky enlists the help of reporter Aggie Maybank and a few local eccentrics to bring down McCall''s empire.', 'After his release from prison, notorious ex-con and moonshine distiller Gator McKlusky moves in with his father in a cabin in the Okefenokee Swamp. His bootlegging plans are cut short, however, when a federal agent tells McKlusky that he will lose custody of his 9-year-old daughter unless he helps bring down local crime lord Bama McCall. McKlusky enlists the help of reporter Aggie Maybank and a few local eccentrics to bring down McCall''s empire.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/n7mBSRhiH3qPHNgXqTc2evCx186.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:21882'),
  ('1102176994457019976', 'Gatta Kusthi', 2022, 'Comedy, Drama, Family', 'Chella Ayyavu, Richard M. Nathan', 'Chella Ayyavu', 'Aishwarya Lekshmi, Vishnu Vishal, Karunas, Munishkanth, Kaali Venkat, Ajay, Hareesh Peradi, Redin Kingsley', null, 'Veera, a misguided man who wants a timid, not-so-learned and subservient wife with long hair, unknowingly ends up getting married to Keerthi, an intrepid wrestler who is also more educated than him and has cropped hair. For how long can Keerthi maintain the charade and what happens when Veera comes to know the truth?', 'Veera, a misguided man who wants a timid, not-so-learned and subservient wife with long hair, unknowingly ends up getting married to Keerthi, an intrepid wrestler who is also more educated than him and has cropped hair. For how long can Keerthi maintain the charade and what happens when Veera comes to know the truth?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gkKA5pR0Nm0xoqnbfGds7sPdQ4X.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:959163'),
  ('29233215842058371', 'Gattaca', 1997, 'Thriller, Science Fiction, Mystery, Romance', 'Andrew Niccol, Sławomir Idziak, John R. Woodward', 'Andrew Niccol', 'Ethan Hawke, Uma Thurman, Jude Law, Alan Arkin, Loren Dean, Gore Vidal, Tony Shalhoub, Ernest Borgnine', 'PG-13', 'Vincent is an all-too-human man who dares to defy a system obsessed with genetic perfection. He is an "In-Valid" who assumes the identity of a member of the genetic elite to pursue his goal of traveling into space with the Gattaca Aerospace Corporation.', 'Vincent is an all-too-human man who dares to defy a system obsessed with genetic perfection. He is an "In-Valid" who assumes the identity of a member of the genetic elite to pursue his goal of traveling into space with the Gattaca Aerospace Corporation.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eSKr5Fl1MEC7zpAXaLWBWSBjgJq.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:782'),
  ('26438701488584957', 'Gaturro: The Movie', 2010, 'Animation, Family, Comedy', 'Gustavo Cova, Sergio Adrián Fernández, Alejandro de Icaza', 'Adriana Lorenzón, Cristian Dzwonik, Esteban Garrido', 'Mariano Chiesa, Agustina Gonzalez Cirulnik, Pablo Gandolfo, Leto Dugatkin, Gustavo Bonfigli, Valeria Gómez, Gustavo Dardés, Andrea Sala Rigler', null, 'Gaturro wants to have Agatha''s love and while he fights with his childhood archenemy Max, he learns to be a better cat for his love, his friends, his family and his 7 lives.', 'Gaturro wants to have Agatha''s love and while he fights with his childhood archenemy Max, he learns to be a better cat for his love, his friends, his family and his 7 lives.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xGrPtJ2RJETFIybqXaFvg9X0X2z.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:62324'),
  ('656092216651380331', 'Gaua (The Night)', 2025, 'Drama, Horror, Fantasy', 'Paul Urkijo Alijo, Gorka Gómez Andreu', 'Paul Urkijo Alijo', 'Yune Nogueiras, Ane Gabarain, Elena Irureta, Iñake Irastorza, Xabi «Jabato» López, Erika Olaizola, Elena Uriz, Manex Fuchs', null, 'Spain, Basque Country, 17th century. At night and through the mountains, Kattalin escapes from her farmhouse and, while wandering through the deep forest, she senses a presence that stalks her.', 'Spain, Basque Country, 17th century. At night and through the mountains, Kattalin escapes from her farmhouse and, while wandering through the deep forest, she senses a presence that stalks her.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hWSY7OdBBJplNMWNPT1NIGYTRH2.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1367125'),
  ('166479726276733449', 'Gauche the Cellist', 1982, 'Animation, Music, Fantasy', 'Isao Takahata, Toshitsugu Saida, Yasuo Uragami', 'Isao Takahata', 'Hideki Sasaki, Fuyumi Shiraishi, Kaneta Kimotsuki, Kazue Takahashi, Keiko Yokozawa, Ryuji Saikachi, Masashi Amenomori, Akiko Takamura', null, 'Gauche is a diligent but mediocre cellist who plays for a small town orchestra and the local cinema in the early 20th century. He struggles during rehearsals and is often berated by his conductor during preparations for an upcoming performance of Beethoven''s Sixth Symphony. Over the course of four nights, Gauche is visited at his mill house home by talking animals as he is practicing.', 'Gauche is a diligent but mediocre cellist who plays for a small town orchestra and the local cinema in the early 20th century. He struggles during rehearsals and is often berated by his conductor during preparations for an upcoming performance of Beethoven''s Sixth Symphony. Over the course of four nights, Gauche is visited at his mill house home by talking animals as he is practicing.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/31I321F0eePRVzsoMcbInmOgb22.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:41017'),
  ('369591289234961946', 'Gaudi Afternoon', 2001, 'Comedy, Drama, Mystery', 'Susan Seidelman, Josep M. Civit', 'James Myhre', 'Judy Davis, Marcia Gay Harden, Lili Taylor, Juliette Lewis, María Barranco, Christopher Bowen, Courtney Jines, Pep Molina', null, 'Barcelona hasn’t turned out to be the romantic dreamland fledgling translator Cassandra thought it would be. But just when she’s about to return to America, the mysterious Frankie offers her a large sum of money to track down her missing lover.', 'Barcelona hasn’t turned out to be the romantic dreamland fledgling translator Cassandra thought it would be. But just when she’s about to return to America, the mysterious Frankie offers her a large sum of money to track down her missing lover.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wg0ip26O6LR51o1kmLoKLTZkvp5.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:170400'),
  ('587743343502994760', 'Gauguin: Voyage to Tahiti', 2017, 'Drama, Romance', 'Édouard Deluc, Julie Navarro, Pierre Cottereau', 'Édouard Deluc, Sarah Kaminsky, Thomas Lilti', 'Vincent Cassel, Tuheï Adams, Malik Zidi, Pua-Taï Hikutini, Marc Barbé, Paul Jeanson, Scali Delpeyrat, Victor Boulenger', null, 'In 1891, the French painter Paul Gauguin leaves Paris and travels to Tahiti to renew his art as a free man, far from the European artistic conventionalism. On his journey of discovery, he faces solitude and disease, but he also knows the beauty of wild nature and the love of Tehura, a young native girl who becomes his wife and model.', 'In 1891, the French painter Paul Gauguin leaves Paris and travels to Tahiti to renew his art as a free man, far from the European artistic conventionalism. On his journey of discovery, he faces solitude and disease, but he also knows the beauty of wild nature and the love of Tehura, a young native girl who becomes his wife and model.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3Kqrt14GxiudaphD0wLdiAVfmsm.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:446132'),
  ('919199810435592034', 'Gay Purr-ee', 1962, 'Animation, Music, Romance, Family', 'Abe Levitow', 'Chuck Jones, Dorothy Jones', 'Judy Garland, Robert Goulet, Red Buttons, Paul Frees, Hermione Gingold, Mel Blanc, Morey Amsterdam, Joan Gardner', 'G', 'Mewsette is a starry-eyed cat who grows weary of life on a French farm and heads for the excitement of 1890s Paris. Her tomcat suitor, Jaune-Tom, and his furry cohort, Robespierre, chase after Mewsette, but she''s already fallen under the spell of a feline modeling-school racket run by Madame Rubens-Chatte and her slimy assistant, Meowrice.', 'Mewsette is a starry-eyed cat who grows weary of life on a French farm and heads for the excitement of 1890s Paris. Her tomcat suitor, Jaune-Tom, and his furry cohort, Robespierre, chase after Mewsette, but she''s already fallen under the spell of a feline modeling-school racket run by Madame Rubens-Chatte and her slimy assistant, Meowrice.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kSu1iF8idPcPobLFX7q7sFgZWUB.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:32328'),
  ('213611921785796818', 'Gay Sex in the 70s', 2005, 'Documentary', 'Joseph F. Lovett', null, 'Larry Kramer, Tom Bianchi', 'NR', 'A chronicle of gay culture in New York during the post-Stonewall, pre-AIDs era. Thirteen men and one woman look back at gay life and sex in Manhattan and Fire Island - from Stonewall (June, 1969) to the first reporting on AIDS (June, 1981). They describe the rapid move from repression to celebration, from the removal of shame to joy, the on-going search for "someone," the freedom before AIDS, the friendships, and brotherhood.', 'A chronicle of gay culture in New York during the post-Stonewall, pre-AIDs era. Thirteen men and one woman look back at gay life and sex in Manhattan and Fire Island - from Stonewall (June, 1969) to the first reporting on AIDS (June, 1981). They describe the rapid move from repression to celebration, from the removal of shame to joy, the on-going search for "someone," the freedom before AIDS, the friendships, and brotherhood.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4LME5iSbLvT2W9JR4efMEd8e6Hw.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:54299'),
  ('1023407740366023381', 'Gay USA', 1977, 'Documentary', 'Arthur J. Bressan, Jr.', null, 'Stuart Loomis, Pat Parker', null, 'Documentary about the gay rights movement during the year of 1977, capturing the intersections of diversity in queer life; from vox pop style interviews with lesbian feminists, street drag queens, and straight allies to taking a look at the fight against Anita Bryant and her notorious "Save Our Children" campaign.', 'Documentary about the gay rights movement during the year of 1977, capturing the intersections of diversity in queer life; from vox pop style interviews with lesbian feminists, street drag queens, and straight allies to taking a look at the fight against Anita Bryant and her notorious "Save Our Children" campaign.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/c87P4sfNgtn6T2TIEfI08D4HeJY.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:125776'),
  ('403734887720528535', 'Gayniggers from Outer Space', 1993, 'Comedy, Science Fiction', 'Morten Lindberg, Henrik Kristensen, Jens Bangsholt', 'Per Kristensen, Morten Lindberg', 'Gbatokai Dakinah, Sammy Salomon, Coco C.P. Dalbert, Konrad Fields, Bob Rockwell, Rob Pederson, Dan Marmorstein, Bob Harris', null, 'Extraterrestrial beings travel the galaxy to free men "oppressed" by females to make way for an entirely-homosexual society.', 'Extraterrestrial beings travel the galaxy to free men "oppressed" by females to make way for an entirely-homosexual society.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1PXAQQ9tnBgb1qLTSHMFgn5wNXl.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:33380'),
  ('530235650770457868', 'Gaz Bar Blues', 2003, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Louis Bélanger, Jean-Pierre Saint-Louis', 'Louis Bélanger', 'Serge Thériault, Gilles Renaud, Fanny Mallette, Sébastien Delorme, Danny Gilmore, Maxime Dumontier, Gaston Caron, Gaston Lepage', null, 'This is the story of Mr. Brochu, whose friends like to call "the Boss". He runs his gas station the best he can and tries to stay happy no matter what happens. This movie relates all the small tragedies surrounding the gaz bar, such as hold-ups, competition from the big companies invading the neighbourhood, and the fact that is sons don''t seem to be interested in the gas station.', 'This is the story of Mr. Brochu, whose friends like to call "the Boss". He runs his gas station the best he can and tries to stay happy no matter what happens. This movie relates all the small tragedies surrounding the gaz bar, such as hold-ups, competition from the big companies invading the neighbourhood, and the fact that is sons don''t seem to be interested in the gas station.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5kbVOF04fG1e7uFKyRu9VNdypqJ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:17213'),
  ('596346283386595821', 'Gaza Mon Amour', 2021, 'Drama, Comedy, Romance', 'Christophe Graillot, Arab Nasser, Tarzan Nasser', 'Tarzan Nasser, Arab Nasser', 'Hiam Abbass, Salim Daw, Maisa Abd Elhadi, George Iskandar, Manal Awad, Hitham Al Omai, Hamada Atallah, Rukkmini Ghosh', null, 'In Gaza, 60-year-old fisherman Issa has been secretly in love with Siham, a widow who works at the market. One day, the discovery of an ancient phallic statue of Apollo in his fishing net changes his life. With newfound confidence, he decides to approach Siham but problems arise when authorities become involved with this mysterious and potent treasure.', 'In Gaza, 60-year-old fisherman Issa has been secretly in love with Siham, a widow who works at the market. One day, the discovery of an ancient phallic statue of Apollo in his fishing net changes his life. With newfound confidence, he decides to approach Siham but problems arise when authorities become involved with this mysterious and potent treasure.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/slznW1Vgp3kS3g6VfaV5OZG4Lpg.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:725561'),
  ('794555976630933266', 'Gebo and the Shadow', 2012, 'Drama', 'Manoel de Oliveira, Renato Berta, Francisco Pinhão Botelho', 'Manoel de Oliveira', 'Michael Lonsdale, Claudia Cardinale, Jeanne Moreau, Leonor Silveira, Luis Miguel Cintra, Ricardo Trêpa, Luis Inacio, Bastien Guio', null, 'Despite his age and general weariness, Gebo keeps on working as an accountant to provide for his family. He lives with his wife, Doroteia, and his daughter-in-law, Sofia, but it is the absence of João, son and husband, that worries them.Gebo seems to be hiding something, especially to Doroteia, who is anxiously waiting to see her son again. Sofia is also waiting for her husband to come home, and yet she fears him. All of a sudden, João arrives and everything changes.', 'Despite his age and general weariness, Gebo keeps on working as an accountant to provide for his family. He lives with his wife, Doroteia, and his daughter-in-law, Sofia, but it is the absence of João, son and husband, that worries them.Gebo seems to be hiding something, especially to Doroteia, who is anxiously waiting to see her son again. Sofia is also waiting for her husband to come home, and yet she fears him. All of a sudden, João arrives and everything changes.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9y5mkZ2n6e8CWKgoYflfygevXJ8.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:110401'),
  ('432546877303335990', 'Gebürtig', 2002, 'Drama', 'Robert Schindel, Lukas Stepanik, Edward Kłosiński', 'Georg Stefan Troller, Robert Schindel, Lukas Stepanik', 'Peter Simonischek, Ruth Rieser, August Zirner, Katja Weitzenböck, Daniel Olbrychski, Samuel Finzi, Corinna Harfouch, Otto Tausig', null, 'A holocaust survivor now living as a respected writer in Manhattan is the only person who can identify a suspected Nazi back in his native Austria. When a beautiful reporter eager for a scoop tries to lure him back, Geburtig must decide whether to confront his past.', 'A holocaust survivor now living as a respected writer in Manhattan is the only person who can identify a suspected Nazi back in his native Austria. When a beautiful reporter eager for a scoop tries to lure him back, Geburtig must decide whether to confront his past.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fGhhoEoMopxbEKWZ6IFlwRM2H9.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:36750'),
  ('285923300800282168', 'Gece', 2014, 'Drama', 'Erden Kıral, Muharrem Özabat, Feza Çaldıran', 'Rıza Kıraç', 'Nurgül Yeşilçay, Mert Fırat, Vildan Atasever, İlyas Salman, Ayça Damgacı, Hakan Yufkacıgil, Hakan Karahan, Teoman Kumbaracıbaşı', null, 'A family forcibly displaced from their village struggles to stay together when Süsen, the daughter of an already broken home, defies her kin to marry her childhood love Yusuf. As her father and brother abandon the family and marriage fails to bring the dreamed-of salvation, Süsen and Yusuf must confront mounting responsibilities and learn to adapt, or risk losing each other entirely.', 'A family forcibly displaced from their village struggles to stay together when Süsen, the daughter of an already broken home, defies her kin to marry her childhood love Yusuf. As her father and brother abandon the family and marriage fails to bring the dreamed-of salvation, Süsen and Yusuf must confront mounting responsibilities and learn to adapt, or risk losing each other entirely.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sbHemfTwWHbjedDGmqjxb1i4n1p.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:329496'),
  ('361464144071230844', 'Gee Whiz-z-z-z-z-z-z', 1956, 'Animation, Comedy', 'Chuck Jones', null, 'Paul Julian', 'NR', 'Wile E. Coyote unsuccessfully chases the Road Runner using such contrivances as a rifle, a steel plate, a dynamite stick on an extending metal pulley, a painting of a collapsed bridge (which the Coyote falls into while Road Runner passes right through), and a jet motor.', 'Wile E. Coyote unsuccessfully chases the Road Runner using such contrivances as a rifle, a steel plate, a dynamite stick on an extending metal pulley, a painting of a collapsed bridge (which the Coyote falls into while Road Runner passes right through), and a jet motor.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3ZAJVd0GVowF1fKmRkXDkVnUyN8.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:74969'),
  ('935076878053393025', 'Geek Charming', 2011, 'Comedy, Drama, Family, TV Movie', 'Jeffrey Hornaday, Robert Brinkmann', 'Hilary Galanoy, Elizabeth Hackett', 'Sarah Hyland, Matt Prokop, Vanessa Morgan, Sasha Pieterse, Lili Simmons, Andrea Brooks, Jordan A. Nichols, Jimmy Bellinger', 'PG', 'Film geek Josh is looking for the subject of his new documentary when a chance meeting puts the perfect star in his sights—Dylan, his school''s most popular junior. But Dylan''s hopes of using the film to become Blossom Queen don''t quite match with Josh''s goal to make a hard-hitting exposé about popularity. Will Josh shoot the film as planned, or show Dylan as the truly interesting person she is?', 'Film geek Josh is looking for the subject of his new documentary when a chance meeting puts the perfect star in his sights—Dylan, his school''s most popular junior. But Dylan''s hopes of using the film to become Blossom Queen don''t quite match with Josh''s goal to make a hard-hitting exposé about popularity. Will Josh shoot the film as planned, or show Dylan as the truly interesting person she is?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xweQBQSYQyHKiUxN1nCDQbLvJE0.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:81250'),
  ('128268873084623911', 'Geek Maggot Bingo or The Freak from Suckweasel Mountain', 1983, 'Fantasy, Comedy, Horror', 'Nick Zedd, Nick Zedd', 'Nick Zedd', 'Richard Hell, Brenda Bergman, Robert Andrews, Donna Death, John Zacherle, Bruno Zeus, Gumby Spangler, Tyler Smith', 'NR', 'From the warped mind of underground auteur Nick Zedd comes this campy horrorfest that follows screwy scientist Dr. Frankenberry as he attempts to resurrect the dead, aided by his hunchbacked minion. Adding to the twisted fun are Donna Death as bloodsucking temptress Scumbalina, Richard Hell as punk-rock cowboy crooner the Rawhide Kid and Tyler Smith as Frankenberry’s monstrous two-headed creation, Formaldehyde Man.', 'From the warped mind of underground auteur Nick Zedd comes this campy horrorfest that follows screwy scientist Dr. Frankenberry as he attempts to resurrect the dead, aided by his hunchbacked minion. Adding to the twisted fun are Donna Death as bloodsucking temptress Scumbalina, Richard Hell as punk-rock cowboy crooner the Rawhide Kid and Tyler Smith as Frankenberry’s monstrous two-headed creation, Formaldehyde Man.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9G9pzFAicPj4Csobn5iWPrCvLHc.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:56145'),
  ('699374098896536193', 'Geese-Swans', 1949, 'Animation', 'Ivan Ivanov-Vano, Aleksandra Snezhko-Blotskaya, Nikolay Voinov', 'Ivan Ivanov-Vano, Aleksandra Snezhko-Blotskaya', 'Mariya Babanova, Faina Shevchenko, Galina Novozhilova, Leonid Pirogov, Aleksandra Denisova, Iraida Vinokur, Mikhail Kholodov, Vera Orlova', null, 'With a help of good nature a young brave girl goes to the dark forest for saving her youngest brother abducted by Baba Yaga.', 'With a help of good nature a young brave girl goes to the dark forest for saving her youngest brother abducted by Baba Yaga.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/peffLTs3s0R8Xaz1Nf0c0F07KBi.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:72202'),
  ('803107706330886638', 'Geetha Govindam', 2018, 'Romance', 'Manikandan Saravanan, Parasuram Petla', 'Parasuram Petla', 'Vijay Deverakonda, Rashmika Mandanna, Vennela Kishore, Subbaraju, Rahul Ramakrishna, Annapoorna, Giri Babu, Ravi Prakash', null, 'Vijay Govind, a young college lecturer who dreams of marriage falls for Geetha, a level-headed woman who''s wary of strangers and isn''t easy to convince. While things seem to go smoothly, Vijay makes a terrible mistake which not only derails any hope for his love story, but also potential repercussions with his family.', 'Vijay Govind, a young college lecturer who dreams of marriage falls for Geetha, a level-headed woman who''s wary of strangers and isn''t easy to convince. While things seem to go smoothly, Vijay makes a terrible mistake which not only derails any hope for his love story, but also potential repercussions with his family.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sTreb0ajewXqeIqAyZ0IWtafoB5.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:540468'),
  ('1060487461294990876', 'Geethanjali', 1989, 'Drama, Romance', 'Mani Ratnam, P. C. Sreeram', 'Mani Ratnam', 'Nagarjuna Akkineni, Girija Shettar, Vijayakumar, Vijayachander, M. M. Radhabai, Sumithra, Aruna Mucherla, Janaki', null, 'Prakash, who is diagnosed with terminal cancer, and Geethanjali, an equally ill patient, fall in love with each other. However, when she learns about his illness, she decides to move out of his life.', 'Prakash, who is diagnosed with terminal cancer, and Geethanjali, an equally ill patient, fall in love with each other. However, when she learns about his illness, she decides to move out of his life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qZVWloCwvgP5JtaqBWoFY6YspzT.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:148808'),
