  ('778770026195959107', 'Gefangen: Der Fall K.', 2018, 'Drama, TV Movie', 'Hans Steinbichler', null, 'Jan Josef Liefers, Julia Koschitz, Francis Fulton-Smith, Thomas Limpinsel, Lilly Forgách, Michael Wittenborn, Gerhard Wittmann, Jonathan Müller', null, 'For a long time, wealth adviser Elke and car mechanic Wastl were happy together. Until Elke gets involved more and more in dubious financial transactions that bring her success down the line. When her husband wants to stop these windy business, she separates from him. And goes even further - the accusation that her husband has beaten her, brings Wastl for a long time in a psychiatric hospital.', 'For a long time, wealth adviser Elke and car mechanic Wastl were happy together. Until Elke gets involved more and more in dubious financial transactions that bring her success down the line. When her husband wants to stop these windy business, she separates from him. And goes even further - the accusation that her husband has beaten her, brings Wastl for a long time in a psychiatric hospital.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5TMerGsi2rxUCBmSW6M4l9FoZNM.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:501597'),
  ('132645314234038991', 'Gehenna: Where Death Lives', 2016, 'Horror, Thriller, Mystery, Science Fiction', 'Hiroshi Katagiri, Yohei Tateishi', 'Brad Palmer, Nathan Long, Hiroshi Katagiri', 'Doug Jones, Eva Swan, Lance Henriksen, Patrick Gorman, Simon Phillips, Masashi Odate, Justin Gordon, Sean Sprawling', 'R', 'A group visits Saipan to search for locations for their company''s newest resort. As they find what they think is the perfect spot, they discover a hidden bunker on the property which they decide to explore. However, they soon find out that curiosity can kill. As each member faces their most private secrets and the secrets of the bunker itself, the results lead to a most shocking conclusion.', 'A group visits Saipan to search for locations for their company''s newest resort. As they find what they think is the perfect spot, they discover a hidden bunker on the property which they decide to explore. However, they soon find out that curiosity can kill. As each member faces their most private secrets and the secrets of the bunker itself, the results lead to a most shocking conclusion.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/VLRxwqEIMKQNf4CSdKotNSu86A.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:403283'),
  ('717979292551786678', 'Gehraiyaan', 2022, 'Romance, Drama', 'Shakun Batra, Panchami Ghavri, Yash Brahmbhatt', 'Ayesha DeVitre, Sumit Roy, Shakun Batra', 'Deepika Padukone, Siddhant Chaturvedi, Ananya Panday, Dhairya Karwa, Naseeruddin Shah, Rajat Kapoor, Vihaan Chaudhary, Pavleen Gujral', null, 'Alisha Khanna, 30, ambitious, now finds herself at crossroads in life. Her six year long relationship has grown monotonous, her career seems to be going nowhere. But just when she had begun to accept this reality as unchangeable, her life is usurped by the arrival of her cousin, Tia and her fiancé, Zain, with whom she bonds over a troubled past and a common wish to break from its confines.', 'Alisha Khanna, 30, ambitious, now finds herself at crossroads in life. Her six year long relationship has grown monotonous, her career seems to be going nowhere. But just when she had begun to accept this reality as unchangeable, her life is usurped by the arrival of her cousin, Tia and her fiancé, Zain, with whom she bonds over a troubled past and a common wish to break from its confines.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/AqqMoV3o83oiPZSUrBBeujKnk1n.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:911645'),
  ('127521498703316515', 'Geisha Assassin', 2008, 'Action', 'Gô Ohara', 'Isao Kodaka', 'Minami Tsukui, Shigeru Kanai, Nao Nagasawa, Taka Okubo, Satoshi Hakuzen, Shuji Korimoto, Kaori Sakai, Yasutaka Yuuki', null, 'One rainy night in the Edo period, Kotono (a geisha) confronts samurais who killed her father. The samurais attack her one after another, but she fights hard against samurais with her sword. Kotono tries to chase the samurais who scramble to escape. Yet now three ninjas stand up against her. Kotono drops her sword by their wave of assaults. Can she beat them?', 'One rainy night in the Edo period, Kotono (a geisha) confronts samurais who killed her father. The samurais attack her one after another, but she fights hard against samurais with her sword. Kotono tries to chase the samurais who scramble to escape. Yet now three ninjas stand up against her. Kotono drops her sword by their wave of assaults. Can she beat them?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tMcoaWNR8nmNtGFS6vAhHYqAwmL.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:17762'),
  ('927465706439005254', 'Gekisou Sentai Carranger vs Ohranger', 1997, 'Action, Adventure, Science Fiction, Fantasy, Comedy', 'Tarou Sakamoto', 'Yoshio Urasawa', 'Yuji Kishi, Yoshihiro Fukuda, Yoshihiro Masujima, Yuka Motohashi, Atsuko Kurusu, Masaru Shishido, Kunio Masaoka, Masashi Goda', null, 'The team-up between Gekisou Sentai Carranger and Chouriki Sentai Ohranger.', 'The team-up between Gekisou Sentai Carranger and Chouriki Sentai Ohranger.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7RIWcUVZdW3kTxmN4Dmrs7sXjsU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:200757'),
  ('686985358328413812', 'Geld oder Leber!', 1986, 'Comedy', 'Dieter Pröttel, Atze Glanert, Olaf R. Benold', 'Christoph Treutwein, Mike Krüger', 'Mike Krüger, Ursela Monn, Simone Brahmann, Corinna Genest, Lotti Krekel, Renate Muhri, Christine Schuberth, Barbara Valentin', null, 'Mike and Susanne are a loving couple who keep afloat through petty crime. When they are pursued by the police following a robbery at a jewelry store, they seek refuge in a slaughterhouse.', 'Mike and Susanne are a loving couple who keep afloat through petty crime. When they are pursued by the police following a robbery at a jewelry store, they seek refuge in a slaughterhouse.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qNGdCLmoyIfqMOEUlz1y9yvUEbu.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:46514'),
  ('354888742944682037', 'Geliefert', 2021, 'Drama, TV Movie', 'Jan Fehse, Michael Wiesweg', 'Jan Fehse', 'Bjarne Mädel, Herbert Forthuber, Nick Julius Schuck, Anne Schäfer, Jochen Matschke, Marcus Mittermeier, Heinz-Josef Braun, Ingrid Resch', null, 'Although Volker is one of the less privileged people as a parcel deliverer and single father to his son Benny, he tries never to let his good mood be spoiled. But the miserable pay increasingly pushes Volker to his limits. When his son wants to move back in with his mother, Volker gives up something no one thought he could do - his integrity. He takes advantage of an opportunity that presents itself to make quick money.', 'Although Volker is one of the less privileged people as a parcel deliverer and single father to his son Benny, he tries never to let his good mood be spoiled. But the miserable pay increasingly pushes Volker to his limits. When his son wants to move back in with his mother, Volker gives up something no one thought he could do - his integrity. He takes advantage of an opportunity that presents itself to make quick money.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ay81EjjfDy9hhQ3f6QAPMRGzP0l.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:848129'),
  ('24681557822629178', 'Gemini', 1999, 'Drama, Fantasy, Horror', 'Shinya Tsukamoto, Shinya Tsukamoto', 'Shinya Tsukamoto', 'Masahiro Motoki, Ryo, Shiho Fujimura, Yasutaka Tsutsui, Masako Motai, Hisako Ôkata, Yuki Inomata, Yuriko Hirooka', null, 'When his mother''s untimely death quickly follows his father''s, a doctor begins to believe a killer may be targeting him and his amnesiac wife.', 'When his mother''s untimely death quickly follows his father''s, a doctor begins to believe a killer may be targeting him and his amnesiac wife.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aZGZfip534xdCN0EgjHTzWYHNAL.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:27276'),
  ('614662673570935898', 'Gemini', 2005, 'Drama', 'Albertina Carri, Guillermo Nieto, Emiliano Torres', 'Santiago Giralt, Albertina Carri', 'Cristina Banegas, Daniel Fanego, María Abadi, Lucas Escariz, Julieta Zylberberg, Damian Ramonda, Beatriz Spelzini, Silvia Baylé', null, 'An incestuous love affair. Meme and Jeremias are the younger children in a typical bourgeois family. Their mother Lucia is the dominant force in the household, but her fixation on upholding the niceties of upper middle class life has prevented her from seeing what is going on under her roof. When the siblings’ older brother and his fiancee arrive home for their wedding, it seems inevitable that the concealment will be impossible to sustain. But equally it becomes apparent that if Lucia were to find out about the affair, there would be catastrophic consequences.', 'An incestuous love affair. Meme and Jeremias are the younger children in a typical bourgeois family. Their mother Lucia is the dominant force in the household, but her fixation on upholding the niceties of upper middle class life has prevented her from seeing what is going on under her roof. When the siblings’ older brother and his fiancee arrive home for their wedding, it seems inevitable that the concealment will be impossible to sustain. But equally it becomes apparent that if Lucia were to find out about the affair, there would be catastrophic consequences.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6VzGSoaXJLNJkWLnkNABwB3CZEa.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:30688'),
  ('1060767787981743940', 'Gemini', 2017, 'Mystery, Crime, Drama, Thriller', 'Aaron Katz, Andrew Reed', 'Aaron Katz', 'Lola Kirke, Zoë Kravitz, John Cho, Greta Lee, Michelle Forbes, Ricki Lake, Nelson Franklin, Reeve Carney', 'R', 'A heinous crime tests the complex relationship between a tenacious personal assistant and her Hollywood starlet boss. As the assistant travels across Los Angeles to unravel the mystery, she must stay one step ahead of a determined policeman and confront her own understanding of friendship, truth and celebrity.', 'A heinous crime tests the complex relationship between a tenacious personal assistant and her Hollywood starlet boss. As the assistant travels across Los Angeles to unravel the mystery, she must stay one step ahead of a determined policeman and confront her own understanding of friendship, truth and celebrity.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oIltQs7MPk7VQFG3DJfgC63mShU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:412302'),
  ('658029000396042182', 'Gemini Man', 2019, 'Science Fiction, Action, Adventure, Thriller, Drama', 'Ana María Cabrera, Ang Lee, Dion Beebe', 'Darren Lemke, Billy Ray, David Benioff', 'Will Smith, Mary Elizabeth Winstead, Clive Owen, Benedict Wong, Douglas Hodge, Ralph Brown, Linda Emond, Ilia Volok', 'PG-13', 'Henry Brogan is an elite 51-year-old assassin who''s ready to call it quits after completing his 72nd job. His plans get turned upside down when he becomes the target of a mysterious operative who can seemingly predict his every move. To his horror, Brogan soon learns that the man who''s trying to kill him is a younger, faster, cloned version of himself.', 'Henry Brogan is an elite 51-year-old assassin who''s ready to call it quits after completing his 72nd job. His plans get turned upside down when he becomes the target of a mysterious operative who can seemingly predict his every move. To his horror, Brogan soon learns that the man who''s trying to kill him is a younger, faster, cloned version of himself.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cT5m5m9X6hNbUrx7kUTsedAMivW.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:453405'),
  ('645066728674116353', 'Gemma Bovery', 2014, 'Romance, Drama, Comedy', 'Anne Fontaine, Christophe Beaucarne, Valentin Morel', 'Anne Fontaine, Pascal Bonitzer', 'Gemma Arterton, Jason Flemyng, Fabrice Luchini, Elsa Zylberstein, Isabelle Candelier, Niels Schneider, Mel Raido, Pip Torrens', 'R', 'Martin, an ex-Parisian well-heeled hipster passionate about Gustave Flaubert who settled into a Norman village as a baker, sees an English couple moving into a small farm nearby. Not only are the names of the new arrivals Gemma and Charles Bovery, but their behavior also seems to be inspired by Flaubert''s heroes.', 'Martin, an ex-Parisian well-heeled hipster passionate about Gustave Flaubert who settled into a Norman village as a baker, sees an English couple moving into a small farm nearby. Not only are the names of the new arrivals Gemma and Charles Bovery, but their behavior also seems to be inspired by Flaubert''s heroes.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3WpkG2nv9lamSKnVIVJcxYRiYL1.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:272435'),
  ('203308951289299233', 'Gen', 2006, 'Thriller', 'Togan Gökbakar, Veli Kuzlu, Tuba Çoban', 'Murat Toktamışoğlu', 'Doğa Rutkay, Yurdaer Okur, Şahan Gökbakar, Mahmut Gökgöz, Haldun Boysan, Sefa Zengin, Cemil Büyükdöğerli, Zeliha Güney', null, 'A suicide case is informed to the police from a mental hospital in a rocky district. Two policemen comes to hospital to investigate the case. In the same morning, Dr. Deniz comes to hospital as the new psychiatrist. Because of the heavy rain and landslide the only road and telephone connections that provide access to hospital from the city are damaged.There is no transportation to hospital and none can leave hospital. During three days, three patients are killed wildly in the hospital. Everyone becomes anxious. The police deepen the investigation. A mystical patient attracts attention.', 'A suicide case is informed to the police from a mental hospital in a rocky district. Two policemen comes to hospital to investigate the case. In the same morning, Dr. Deniz comes to hospital as the new psychiatrist. Because of the heavy rain and landslide the only road and telephone connections that provide access to hospital from the city are damaged.There is no transportation to hospital and none can leave hospital. During three days, three patients are killed wildly in the hospital. Everyone becomes anxious. The police deepen the investigation. A mystical patient attracts attention.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aqSTTHj98cIdAfJWsXkOkke0Xu8.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:52131'),
  ('233761498768866490', 'GEN HOSHINO STADIUM TOUR "POP VIRUS"', 2019, 'Music, Documentary', null, 'Ko-Jo, Mikiko', 'Gen Hoshino', 'PG-13', 'Singer-songwriter Gen Hoshino takes the stage at the sold out Tokyo Dome in his highly anticipated 2019 Pop Virus dome tour.', 'Singer-songwriter Gen Hoshino takes the stage at the sold out Tokyo Dome in his highly anticipated 2019 Pop Virus dome tour.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kkVGHSJFchif5jh9BsYB9ZZ6y6X.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:637868'),
  ('60582915728506756', 'Gen-X Cops', 1999, 'Action, Comedy, Crime, Thriller', 'Benny Chan Muk-Sing, Arthur Wong Ngok-Tai, Anthony Pun Yiu-Ming', 'Anna Lee, Benny Chan Muk-Sing, Koan Hui', 'Nicholas Tse Ting-Fung, Stephen Fung, Sam Lee, Grace Yip Pui-Man, Eric Tsang Chi-Wai, Daniel Wu, Francis Ng Chun-Yu, Toru Nakamura', 'R', 'Four young officers of the Hong Kong Police are joined together to fight against organised crime using all possible means, even if this would lead them to break the law… Their first assignment is to eliminate a gang of criminals who have stolen a shipload of explosives.', 'Four young officers of the Hong Kong Police are joined together to fight against organised crime using all possible means, even if this would lead them to break the law… Their first assignment is to eliminate a gang of criminals who have stolen a shipload of explosives.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2URAvYZ67Wwo7iceIfTHl050luM.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:13099'),
  ('230011526713950161', 'Gen-Y Cops', 2000, 'Action, Science Fiction, Thriller, Crime', 'Nicky Li Chung-Chi, Benny Chan Muk-Sing, Anthony Pun Yiu-Ming', 'Bey Logan, Chan Kiu-Ying, Felix Chong Man-Keung', 'Edison Chen, Stephen Fung, Sam Lee, Paul Rudd, Richard Sun Kwok-Ho, Maggie Q, Christy Chung Lai-Tai, Cheung Tat-Ming', null, 'When terrorists abduct a deadly government attack robot, the call is put out to the Gen-Y Cops, an elite task force with lethal fighting skills. Together with a trigger-happy FBI agent, the Gen-Y Cops race against time to destroy the robot before it destroys their city.', 'When terrorists abduct a deadly government attack robot, the call is put out to the Gen-Y Cops, an elite task force with lethal fighting skills. Together with a trigger-happy FBI agent, the Gen-Y Cops race against time to destroy the robot before it destroys their city.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/28ogVAXiUjUwUIHXXh99UWfgpwj.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:49514'),
  ('1006731722518809131', 'Gen¹³', 2000, 'Action, Animation, Science Fiction', 'Kevin Altieri', 'Karen Kolus, Kevin Altieri', 'Alicia Witt, John de Lancie, E. G. Daily, Flea, Mark Hamill, Lauren Lane, Cloris Leachman, Corey Burton', 'NR', 'Caitlin Fairchild, a teenager offered a place in an institute for gifted children. She soon learns that the school isn''t really a school, but rather a military project to turn children with a special genetic structure into super soldiers. After developing incredibly enhanced abilities, Caitlin rebels against the program that created her.', 'Caitlin Fairchild, a teenager offered a place in an institute for gifted children. She soon learns that the school isn''t really a school, but rather a military project to turn children with a special genetic structure into super soldiers. After developing incredibly enhanced abilities, Caitlin rebels against the program that created her.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wIVQV5ELcY2nwPf5NkYXqGx7RXe.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:15993'),
  ('1019551896262416559', 'Gena the Crocodile', 1969, 'Animation, Family', 'Roman Kachanov', 'Eduard Uspensky', 'Vasiliy Livanov, Klara Rumyanova, Vladimir Rautbart, Vladimir Kenigson, Tamara Dmitrieva', null, 'First animation about Gena and Cheburashka. Gena the Crocodile works as a zoo animal at an urban zoo. Every evening, he returns home to his lonely apartment. Gena gets very tired of playing chess against himself and decides to find some friends to play with. Animals and people respond to advertisements that he posts all around the city. First, a girl named Galya comes with a homeless puppy, who is then followed by Cheburashka. They decide to build a house for all the lonely citizens of the city, but a mischievous old lady, Shapoklyak, tries to stop them in different ways.', 'First animation about Gena and Cheburashka. Gena the Crocodile works as a zoo animal at an urban zoo. Every evening, he returns home to his lonely apartment. Gena gets very tired of playing chess against himself and decides to find some friends to play with. Animals and people respond to advertisements that he posts all around the city. First, a girl named Galya comes with a homeless puppy, who is then followed by Cheburashka. They decide to build a house for all the lonely citizens of the city, but a mischievous old lady, Shapoklyak, tries to stop them in different ways.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kw6UmmvqYnaPIdw24WoD83Akfod.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:79701'),
  ('1016420978592249779', 'Genealogies of a Crime', 1997, 'Crime, Drama, Thriller', 'Raúl Ruiz, Stefan Ivanov', 'Raúl Ruiz, Pascal Bonitzer', 'Catherine Deneuve, Michel Piccoli, Melvil Poupaud, Andrzej Seweryn, Bernadette Lafont, Monique Mélinand, Hubert Saint-Macary, Jean-Yves Gautier', null, 'An attorney defends a young man on trial for killing his aunt — a psychiatrist who took him in to study possible homicidal tendencies.', 'An attorney defends a young man on trial for killing his aunt — a psychiatrist who took him in to study possible homicidal tendencies.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sd5mYgYVLkbr8yGAbtr3Xn4Xbvi.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:125039'),
  ('993325158303312279', 'General Cemetery', 2013, 'Horror', 'Dorian Fernández-Moris, Miguel Angel Valencia', 'Javier Velasquez', 'Leslie Shaw, Marisol Aguirre, Airam Galliani, Jürgen Gömez', null, 'Set in Iquitos, the story follows Andrea (Airam Galliani), a 15-years-ago teenage girl, who suffers the death of his father. With the help of his friends from school, encourage her to contact him using the ouija. However, this triggers a series of terrifying events.', 'Set in Iquitos, the story follows Andrea (Airam Galliani), a 15-years-ago teenage girl, who suffers the death of his father. With the help of his friends from school, encourage her to contact him using the ouija. However, this triggers a series of terrifying events.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ahYTelGWA8zIgJFnUaNBQSDkHaK.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:218454'),
  ('526295640003601491', 'General Commander', 2019, 'Action', 'Ross W. Clarkson, Alan Chanliongco, Sue Aspiras', 'Philippe Martinez, Lisa Gabriel', 'Steven Seagal, Byron Gibson, Ron Smoorenburg, Sonia Couling, Soraya Torrens, Megan Brown, Mica Javier, Erdenetuya Batsukh', 'R', 'GRS operative Jake Alexander and his team of young recruits go after the most dangerous and notorious criminals with the help of a Hong Kong billionaire.', 'GRS operative Jake Alexander and his team of young recruits go after the most dangerous and notorious criminals with the help of a Hong Kong billionaire.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tarle8uNAqiQfCTY95U0Oj1DxIU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:585311'),
  ('251285369537371434', 'General Della Rovere', 1959, 'Drama, War', 'Roberto Rossellini, Philippe Arthuys, Renzo Rossellini', 'Sergio Amidei, Diego Fabbri, Indro Montanelli', 'Vittorio De Sica, Hannes Messemer, Vittorio Caprioli, Nando Angelini, Herbert Fischer, Mary Greco, Bernardo Menicacci, Lucia Modugno', null, 'The Gestapo forces con man Victorio Bardone to impersonate a dead partisan general in order to extract information from his fellow inmates.', 'The Gestapo forces con man Victorio Bardone to impersonate a dead partisan general in order to extract information from his fellow inmates.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dTynqWaUm92ecwxCuMkTdHCoOfx.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:43100'),
  ('720620714968399068', 'General Idi Amin Dada', 1974, 'Documentary', 'Barbet Schroeder, Néstor Almendros', 'Barbet Schroeder', 'Idi Amin, Fidel Castro, Golda Meir', null, 'Filmmaker Barbet Schroeder shows the Ugandan dictator meeting his Cabinet, reviewing his troops, explaining his ideology.', 'Filmmaker Barbet Schroeder shows the Ugandan dictator meeting his Cabinet, reviewing his troops, explaining his ideology.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/AwkE1rC3UEmoZAonUlcPxEFhgMT.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:36665'),
  ('716711017757750514', 'General Suvorov', 1941, 'Drama, History', 'Mikhail Doller, Vsevolod Pudovkin, Anatoli Golovnya', 'Georgiy Grebner, Nikolai Ravich', 'Nikolai Cherkasov, Apollon Yachnitskiy, Mikhail Astangov, Sergey Kiligin, Vsevolod Aksyonov, Aleksandr Khanov, Georgi Kovrov, Aleksandr Antonov', null, 'Primarily a biographical documentary about the military career of Alexander Vasilvich Suvorov, who was Field Marshal of the armies of Catherine the Great and Czar Paul I. After many military successes during the reign of Catherine, General Suvorov broke with her successor, Paul I, the Mad Emperor, over questions regarding army policy. He went into retirement and wrote "The Science of Victory," containing maxims such as "Swiftness of movement accompanies victory," and "the real general is he who defeats the enemy before reaching him." The czar recalled Suvorov to become the leader of the joint armies of Russia and Austria against Napoleon.', 'Primarily a biographical documentary about the military career of Alexander Vasilvich Suvorov, who was Field Marshal of the armies of Catherine the Great and Czar Paul I. After many military successes during the reign of Catherine, General Suvorov broke with her successor, Paul I, the Mad Emperor, over questions regarding army policy. He went into retirement and wrote "The Science of Victory," containing maxims such as "Swiftness of movement accompanies victory," and "the real general is he who defeats the enemy before reaching him." The czar recalled Suvorov to become the leader of the joint armies of Russia and Austria against Napoleon.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vmwmbb3dRdDwfTOvmn9PsNET5rr.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:282083'),
  ('222969706908493009', 'General''s Son', 1990, 'Action, Crime', 'Im Kwon-taek, Jung Il-sung, Yang Jin-bang', null, 'Park Sang-min, Shin Hyun-jun, Lee Il-jae, Bang Eun-hee, Kim Hyeong-il, Kim Seung-woo, Min Eung-sik, Jung Doo-hong', null, 'In Japanese-occupied South Korea, a young man, newly-released from prison, is accepted into a gang for his fighting skills and quickly rises to the top. Based on the life of South Korean mobster and politician Kim Du-han.', 'In Japanese-occupied South Korea, a young man, newly-released from prison, is accepted into a gang for his fighting skills and quickly rises to the top. Based on the life of South Korean mobster and politician Kim Du-han.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/e6uDhfJmL11vmXucio1p2DZqBU9.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:245382'),
  ('414619963393723631', 'General''s Son 2', 1991, 'Action', 'Im Kwon-taek, Jung Il-sung, Kim Yeong-Mo', null, 'Park Sang-min, Shin Hyun-jun, Lee Il-jae, Song Chae-hwan, Kim Hae-gon, Jung Doo-hong, Yang Taek-jo, Kim Jin-soo', null, 'Upon being released from prison, Kim Du-han begins rebuilding his street gang in the face of Hayashi''s Yakuzas and increasing Japanese influence.', 'Upon being released from prison, Kim Du-han begins rebuilding his street gang in the face of Hayashi''s Yakuzas and increasing Japanese influence.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sMtHEbCL8L33lmuWAVcioeKrunU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:265790'),
  ('61529203085508690', 'Generation Iron', 2013, 'Documentary', 'Vlad Yudin', 'Vlad Yudin', 'Mickey Rourke, Michael Jai White, Lou Ferrigno, Mike Katz, Arnold Schwarzenegger, Phil Heath, Kai Greene, Busta Rhymes', 'PG-13', 'Generation Iron - examines the professional sport of bodybuilding today and gives the audience front row access to the lives of the top 7 bodybuilders in the sport as they train to compete in the world''s most premiere bodybuilding stage - Mr. Olympia.', 'Generation Iron - examines the professional sport of bodybuilding today and gives the audience front row access to the lives of the top 7 bodybuilders in the sport as they train to compete in the world''s most premiere bodybuilding stage - Mr. Olympia.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/b71ERNofHX9HXp2v61W3q2sef03.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:207021'),
  ('773561197671431501', 'Generation Iron 2', 2017, 'Documentary', 'Vlad Yudin', null, 'Arnold Schwarzenegger, Jay Cutler, Shawn Ray, Ken ''Flex'' Wheeler, Calum Von Moger, Kai Greene, Rich Piana, Iris Kyle', 'PG-13', 'From the director of Generation Iron, comes the anticipated sequel that will depict 5 of the top bodybuilding and fitness mega-stars on a quest of achieving the ultimate physique and taking it to the next extreme level. In the world of social media and internet, the rules have changed as to what makes an iconic bodybuilding mass-monster. Starring Kai Greene, Calum Von Moger, Rich Piana, among others, this film will explore an all new generation of bodybuilders and how this new world, and new people, carve their own path to physique perfection.', 'From the director of Generation Iron, comes the anticipated sequel that will depict 5 of the top bodybuilding and fitness mega-stars on a quest of achieving the ultimate physique and taking it to the next extreme level. In the world of social media and internet, the rules have changed as to what makes an iconic bodybuilding mass-monster. Starring Kai Greene, Calum Von Moger, Rich Piana, among others, this film will explore an all new generation of bodybuilders and how this new world, and new people, carve their own path to physique perfection.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cXZGSRFN2WyLa6a4KhGIoTrjvdL.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:447818'),
  ('1007738990404710083', 'Generation P', 2011, 'Comedy, Drama, Science Fiction', 'Victor Ginzburg, Georgiy Matveev, Alexey Rodionov', 'Djina Ginzburg, Victor Ginzburg', 'Mikhail Efremov, Andrey Fomin, Sergey Shnurov, Andrei Panin, Leonid Parfyonov, Vladimir Yepifantsev, Oleg Taktarov, Ivan Okhlobystin', null, 'Set in the ground zero of gangster globalism and driven by a truly manic energy, Generation P is at once a comedy, a tragedy and a fantasy about the rise of a poet-turned-adman through Russia’s nascent advertising business during the Moscow roaring 1990s.', 'Set in the ground zero of gangster globalism and driven by a truly manic energy, Generation P is at once a comedy, a tragedy and a fantasy about the rise of a poet-turned-adman through Russia’s nascent advertising business during the Moscow roaring 1990s.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/c7aMcRsKSU3oOhEdrfcR04iZEMS.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:63375'),
  ('1047850291919987429', 'Generation Um...', 2012, 'Drama', 'Mark Mann, Mauricio Rubinstein', 'Mark Mann', 'Keanu Reeves, Bojana Novaković, Adelaide Clemens, Jake Hoffman, Daniel Sunjata, Sarita Choudhury, Karen Olivo, Ashley Austin Morris', 'R', 'A drama that follows three adults during a single day in New York, one filled with sex, drugs, and indecision.', 'A drama that follows three adults during a single day in New York, one filled with sex, drugs, and indecision.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8n1Ww3FZQ3VE8OU7vhHClFLzxZG.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:124972'),
  ('205145753683939482', 'Generation Wealth', 2018, 'Documentary', 'Lauren Greenfield, Robert Chappell, Lauren Greenfield', 'Lauren Greenfield', 'Lauren Greenfield, Florian Homm, Bret Easton Ellis, Kim Kardashian, Kylie Jenner, Eden Wood, Jacqueline Siegel, Tiffany Masters', null, 'Over the past 25 years, Lauren Greenfield''s documentary photography and film projects have explored youth culture, gender, body image, and affluence. Underscoring the ever-increasing gap between the haves and the have-nots, portraits reveal a focus on cultivating image over substance, where subjects unable to attain actual wealth instead settle for its trappings, no matter their ability to pay for it.', 'Over the past 25 years, Lauren Greenfield''s documentary photography and film projects have explored youth culture, gender, body image, and affluence. Underscoring the ever-increasing gap between the haves and the have-nots, portraits reveal a focus on cultivating image over substance, where subjects unable to attain actual wealth instead settle for its trappings, no matter their ability to pay for it.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ehe6Hrf9Re7BdO7ErIM49FrO0JY.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:493014'),
  ('1049492556274344601', 'Generation X', 1996, 'TV Movie, Action, Science Fiction', 'Jack Sholder, Bryan England, Judy Slattery', 'Eric Blakeney', 'Matt Frewer, Finola Hughes, Jeremy Ratchford, Heather McComb, Agustin Rodriguez, Randall Slavin, Bumper Robinson, Suzanne Davis', 'NR', 'A group of young mutants--humans with a genetic variation that gives them superpowers and makes them feared by the population at large--begin training at a school for heroes. Their studies are interrupted when they must rescue one of their number from a mad scientist who can enter others'' dreams.', 'A group of young mutants--humans with a genetic variation that gives them superpowers and makes them feared by the population at large--begin training at a school for heroes. Their studies are interrupted when they must rescue one of their number from a mad scientist who can enter others'' dreams.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wqkTCfznNXtYO9UnnxComqhhHRP.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:26623'),
  ('975791872730041886', 'Generazione 1000 euro', 2009, 'Comedy', 'Massimo Venier', 'Massimo Venier, Federica Pontremoli', 'Alessandro Tiberi, Valentina Lodovini, Carolina Crescentini, Francesco Mandelli, Francesco Brandi, Francesca Inaudi, Paolo Villaggio, Steffan Boje', null, 'In Milan, Matteo is an underemployed physicist, giving the occasional lecture at a university while working at a PR firm where he knows he''ll be fired. Without his really trying, two women are attracted to him, a blond and a brunette. The blond is Angelica; they meet smoking on the office rooftop. To his surprise, she has clout in the company and soon has him flying off (with her) to make presentations. The brunette is Beatrice, a new flatmate, hoping for a teaching job in the national service. Angelica dangles a posting with her in Barcelona; Beatrice is simply Beatrice. Will Matteo figure out what he wants - and decide before opportunity passes him by?', 'In Milan, Matteo is an underemployed physicist, giving the occasional lecture at a university while working at a PR firm where he knows he''ll be fired. Without his really trying, two women are attracted to him, a blond and a brunette. The blond is Angelica; they meet smoking on the office rooftop. To his surprise, she has clout in the company and soon has him flying off (with her) to make presentations. The brunette is Beatrice, a new flatmate, hoping for a teaching job in the national service. Angelica dangles a posting with her in Barcelona; Beatrice is simply Beatrice. Will Matteo figure out what he wants - and decide before opportunity passes him by?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6a5YGMN2jUXa73iqgmuKvmZxBnM.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:42395'),
  ('888613270355385546', 'Genesis', 1968, 'Comedy, Animation', 'Osamu Tezuka', null, 'Seiji Kobayashi', null, 'The creation of Earth and Mankind. And how God changed his mind.', 'The creation of Earth and Mankind. And how God changed his mind.', null, 'tmdb:movie:85803'),
  ('235538686482016519', 'Genesis', 1998, 'Drama, Horror, Romance, Fantasy', 'Nacho Cerdà', 'Nacho Cerdà', 'Pep Tosar, Trae Houlihan', null, 'A sculptor is traumatized by the death of his wife in a car accident. He builds a sculpture in her memory. As the lifelike sculpture begins to bleed through the cracks of clay, the sculptor''s flesh mutates and crumbles away...', 'A sculptor is traumatized by the death of his wife in a car accident. He builds a sculpture in her memory. As the lifelike sculpture begins to bleed through the cracks of clay, the sculptor''s flesh mutates and crumbles away...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lfxhbhwxCqnccErWy9ODxTQunFe.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:36228'),
  ('457314226898710842', 'Genesis', 2004, 'Documentary', 'Marie Pérennou, Claude Nuridsany, Claude Nuridsany', null, 'Sotigui Kouyaté', null, 'An African narrator tells the story of earth history, the birth of the universe and evolution of life. Beautiful imagery makes this movie documentary complete.', 'An African narrator tells the story of earth history, the birth of the universe and evolution of life. Beautiful imagery makes this movie documentary complete.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vWFaFIgIpfqwhzyyRSOAoehc6wn.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:31190'),
  ('225424816787969949', 'Genesis', 2019, 'Drama, Romance', 'Philippe Lesage, Nicolas Canniccioni', 'Philippe Lesage', 'Théodore Pellerin, Noée Abita, Édouard Tremblay-Grenier, Pier-Luc Funk, Émilie Bierre, Maxime Dumontier, Paul Ahmarani, Jules Roy Sicotte', null, 'Three teenagers are shaken up by their first loves in the turmoil of their youth. At a time when others are conforming, they stand their ground and assert their right to love and be free.', 'Three teenagers are shaken up by their first loves in the turmoil of their youth. At a time when others are conforming, they stand their ground and assert their right to love and be free.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8P1O9JBjpH901k1rw4L0BheZ1pF.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:536881'),
  ('313581755213748671', 'Genesis II', 1973, 'Science Fiction, TV Movie', 'John Llewellyn Moxey, Gerald Perry Finnerman', 'Gene Roddenberry', 'Alex Cord, Mariette Hartley, Ted Cassidy, Percy Rodriguez, Harvey Jason, Titos Vandis, Bill Striglos, Lynne Marta', null, 'A scientist who has been preserved in suspended animation wakes up to find himself in a primitive society in the future.', 'A scientist who has been preserved in suspended animation wakes up to find himself in a primitive society in the future.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lUuTI79hfzxdgywmP3O2wxOKTOm.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:56769'),
  ('451729890708028940', 'Genesis: The Creation and the Flood', 1994, 'Adventure, Drama, Fantasy, History, TV Movie', 'Ermanno Olmi, Ermanno Olmi, Zinedine Ibnou Jabal', 'Ermanno Olmi', 'Omero Antonutti, Paul Scofield, Sabir Aziz, Haddou Zoubida, Annabi Abdelialil, B. Haddan Mohammed', 'NR', 'An all-enveloping darkness. Suddenly, a child''s voice, frightened, questioning, pierces the darkness... The first flickering rays of light begin to sculpt mysterious shapes out of the darkness... Among them, a very old man. He reassures the child, exhorting him to see the wonders of the earth. And it is with this child''s eyes that we will witness the creation of the world.', 'An all-enveloping darkness. Suddenly, a child''s voice, frightened, questioning, pierces the darkness... The first flickering rays of light begin to sculpt mysterious shapes out of the darkness... Among them, a very old man. He reassures the child, exhorting him to see the wonders of the earth. And it is with this child''s eyes that we will witness the creation of the world.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xK0EUM7U0hnsemsvCu3KIBAvJf9.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:2703'),
  ('911994575073011419', 'Genevieve', 1953, 'Comedy', 'Henry Cornelius, Christopher Challis, Muir Mathieson', 'William Rose', 'Dinah Sheridan, John Gregson, Kay Kendall, Kenneth More, Geoffrey Keen, Reginald Beckwith, Arthur Wontner, Joyce Grenfell', null, 'Two friends driving in the London to Brighton vintage car rally bet on which of them will be the first to arrive back home.', 'Two friends driving in the London to Brighton vintage car rally bet on which of them will be the first to arrive back home.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fO5PtTc7GGgxDfD6ndM009gGWhE.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:43346'),
  ('932052936824502205', 'Genghis Blues', 1999, 'Documentary, Music', 'Roko Belic', 'Roko Belic', 'Paul Pena, Kongar-ol Ondar', 'NR', 'Blind blues musician Paul Pena is perhaps best known for his song "Jet Airliner". In 1993, Pena heard Tuvan throat singing over his shortwave radio and subsequently taught himself how to reproduce these extraordinary sounds. This documentary follows him to Tuva, where he takes part in a throat singing competition. Languages featured in the film include English, Russian and Tuvan.', 'Blind blues musician Paul Pena is perhaps best known for his song "Jet Airliner". In 1993, Pena heard Tuvan throat singing over his shortwave radio and subsequently taught himself how to reproduce these extraordinary sounds. This documentary follows him to Tuva, where he takes part in a throat singing competition. Languages featured in the film include English, Russian and Tuvan.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tEwdvxK2ntu6LGBPqCNFkXnwO1B.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:28030'),
  ('150874286045414791', 'Genghis Khan', 1965, 'History, Drama, Adventure', 'Henry Levin, Geoffrey Unsworth, Maurice Carter', 'Clarke Reynolds, Beverley Cross', 'Omar Sharif, Stephen Boyd, James Mason, Eli Wallach, Françoise Dorléac, Telly Savalas, Robert Morley, Yvonne Mitchell', null, 'This is the story of the shy Mongol boy Temujin who,during the 13th century, becomes the fearless Mongol leader Genghis Khan that unites all Mongol tribes and conquers India,China,Persia,Korea and parts of Rusia,Europe and Middle-East.', 'This is the story of the shy Mongol boy Temujin who,during the 13th century, becomes the fearless Mongol leader Genghis Khan that unites all Mongol tribes and conquers India,China,Persia,Korea and parts of Rusia,Europe and Middle-East.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xDbKUiPsEYGppuTOzGQoBU3UBMv.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:4868'),
