  ('708666902995671444', 'Genghis Khan: To the Ends of the Earth And Sea', 2007, 'History, Adventure', 'Shinichiro Sawai, Yonezō Maeda', 'Shōichi Maruyama, Takehiro Nakajima', 'Takashi Sorimachi, Rei Kikukawa, Mayumi Wakamura, Eugene Nomura', null, 'A look at Genghis Khan''s life, from his birth to conquests in Asia.', 'A look at Genghis Khan''s life, from his birth to conquests in Asia.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8RaAY1oO0PU8epRKyZ1W9QmlTCr.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:26637'),
  ('335574688831849479', 'Genie', 2023, 'Fantasy, Comedy', 'Sam Boyd, John Guleserian', 'Richard Curtis', 'Melissa McCarthy, Paapa Essiedu, Denée Benton, Jordyn McIntosh, Alan Cumming, Marc Maron, Tate Ellington, LaChanze', 'PG', 'Flora, a genie trapped for more than 2,000 years inside an antique jewelry box, is accidentally called to service by Bernard, whose life is unraveling around him.', 'Flora, a genie trapped for more than 2,000 years inside an antique jewelry box, is accidentally called to service by Bernard, whose life is unraveling around him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ykkVuQgvjrVWiEe7TvUQZOrLUgC.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1189198'),
  ('537694073485098507', 'Geniş Aile: Komşu Kızı', 2019, 'Comedy', 'Cüneyt İnay', 'Cüneyt İnay', 'Ufuk Özkan, Bülent Çolak, Emre Altuğ, Rojda Demirer, Tolga Canbeyli, Mine Teber, Tuğçe Karabayır, Nihal Tercan', null, 'When Cevahir crosses paths with his old flame Zeynep, she seeks his help in untangling an arranged marriage that spurs even more predicaments.', 'When Cevahir crosses paths with his old flame Zeynep, she seeks his help in untangling an arranged marriage that spurs even more predicaments.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cy3XPESP6eosutP1s13Gpq9OkGT.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:656917'),
  ('1032284722319733014', 'Geniş Aile: Yapıştır', 2015, 'Comedy', 'Ömer Uğur', 'Cüneyt İnay, İlker Arslan, Meriç Demiray', 'Ufuk Özkan, Fırat Tanış, Bülent Çolak, Ahmet Sarsılmaz, Yağmur Tanrısevsin, Renan Bilek, Derya Karadaş, Mine Teber', null, 'Upon the illness of Cevahir''s grandmother Hafize; a treasure map passes by the hand of Cevahir who is trying to find enough money for the treatment. Bilal, the enemy of Cevahir, picks up the smell of the incident and takes half of the map and heads for Ayvalik. Cevahir and Ulvi fall together on Ayvalik road. They all find themselves in situations, events, and troubles that they have never expected in a journey of search for treasure and adventure.', 'Upon the illness of Cevahir''s grandmother Hafize; a treasure map passes by the hand of Cevahir who is trying to find enough money for the treatment. Bilal, the enemy of Cevahir, picks up the smell of the incident and takes half of the map and heads for Ayvalik. Cevahir and Ulvi fall together on Ayvalik road. They all find themselves in situations, events, and troubles that they have never expected in a journey of search for treasure and adventure.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/f1Ee0LtLXycRfXhjp7D28tdq6Rj.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:368787'),
  ('977508509978653950', 'Genitori & figli - Agitare bene prima dell''uso', 2010, 'Comedy', 'Tani Canevari, Giovanni Veronesi', 'Ugo Chiti, Andrea Agnello, Giovanni Veronesi', 'Silvio Orlando, Luciana Littizzetto, Michele Placido, Elena Sofia Ricci, Margherita Buy, Vittorio Emanuele Propizio, Chiara Passarelli, Andrea Fachinetti', null, 'Parent-teenage children clashes in 21st century Italy.', 'Parent-teenage children clashes in 21st century Italy.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pim7FiLRoeXIc8K5kBFkBY7Jxpy.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:42675'),
  ('178826474620457665', 'Genitori vs influencer', 2021, 'Comedy', 'Michela Andreozzi, Fabio Zamarion', 'Michela Andreozzi, Fabio Bonifacci', 'Fabio Volo, Ginevra Francesconi, Giulia De Lellis, Paola Tiziana Cruciani, Paola Minaccioni, Massimiliano Vado, Marco Zingaro, Ruben Mulet Porena', null, 'A father and a daughter with the dream of becoming an influencer clash until they meet the famous webstar and idol of the girl.', 'A father and a daughter with the dream of becoming an influencer clash until they meet the famous webstar and idol of the girl.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oXHApdhkIWwFE4DiMQXAPu7dRrf.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:773147'),
  ('1042711661626858608', 'Genius', 1991, 'Crime, Comedy', 'Irina Guseva, Anatoliy Rodionov, Vladimir Gusev', 'Igor Ageev', 'Aleksandr Abdulov, Larisa Belogurova, Innokentiy Smoktunovskiy, Yuriy Kuznetsov, Anatoliy Kuznetsov, Valentina Talyzina, Sergei Prokhanov, Algis Matulionis', null, 'He is overly intelligent... He is genius... And he''s just trying to make his life a little bit better in an new era post-communist Russia.', 'He is overly intelligent... He is genius... And he''s just trying to make his life a little bit better in an new era post-communist Russia.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/58uGqBmcV64L1d08u5k2lTi3KOV.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:143380'),
  ('420845438493685772', 'Genius', 1999, 'Family, Comedy, TV Movie', 'Peter Benison, Rod Daniel', 'Dan Studney, Jim Lincoln, John Rieck', 'Trevor Morgan, Emmy Rossum, Charles Fleischer, Yannick Bisson, Peter Keleghan, Philip Granger, Patrick Thomas, Sandi Ross', 'G', 'Charlie Boyle finds that even his high IQ can''t solve all of his problems when he takes on a double life in order to make friends his own age.', 'Charlie Boyle finds that even his high IQ can''t solve all of his problems when he takes on a double life in order to make friends his own age.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ectbHu5dtNFNIgnTAhmyqxG55yo.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:73527'),
  ('159332299237674711', 'Genius', 2016, 'History, Drama', 'Michael Grandage, Ben Davis, Rebecca White', 'John Logan', 'Colin Firth, Jude Law, Nicole Kidman, Laura Linney, Guy Pearce, Dominic West, Vanessa Kirby, Demetri Goritsas', 'PG-13', 'New York in the 1920s. Max Perkins, a literary editor is the first to sign such subsequent literary greats as Ernest Hemingway and F. Scott Fitzgerald. When a sprawling, chaotic 1,000-page manuscript by an unknown writer falls into his hands, Perkins is convinced he has discovered a literary genius.', 'New York in the 1920s. Max Perkins, a literary editor is the first to sign such subsequent literary greats as Ernest Hemingway and F. Scott Fitzgerald. When a sprawling, chaotic 1,000-page manuscript by an unknown writer falls into his hands, Perkins is convinced he has discovered a literary genius.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/f3KG63zvQGvakfwOTUb8ODgHEnP.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:267192'),
  ('694802008696783215', 'Genius', 2018, 'Thriller, Action', 'Anil Sharma, Najeeb Khan, Shreedhar Dubey', 'Anil Sharma, Sunil Sirvaiya, Syed Amjad Ali', 'Nawazuddin Siddiqui, Mithun Chakraborty, Ayesha Jhulka, Ishita Chauhan, K.K. Raina, Utkarsh Sharma, Rajiv Kachroo', null, 'An orphan, with a brilliant mind, joins RAW and is burdened by the killing of his entire team. Until he doesn''t avenge their death, he can''t live in peace with his love. So, he hatches a genius plan.', 'An orphan, with a brilliant mind, joins RAW and is burdened by the killing of his entire team. Until he doesn''t avenge their death, he can''t live in peace with his love. So, he hatches a genius plan.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jdEJ2dgus9d0pAQjC8086SVcx2n.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:545620'),
  ('713078418282370725', 'Genius Loci', 2020, 'Animation, Drama, Fantasy', 'Maya Merigeau', 'Nicolas Pleskof, Maya Merigeau', 'Nadia Moussa, Georgia Cusack, Jina Djemba', null, 'One night, Reine, a young loner, sees among the urban chaos a moving oneness that seems alive, like some sort of guide.', 'One night, Reine, a young loner, sees among the urban chaos a moving oneness that seems alive, like some sort of guide.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9Z5sjvSv2hGZwm9DaSjOF142gny.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:663881'),
  ('433606711878572805', 'Genius Party', 2007, 'Animation, Science Fiction, Fantasy, Action, Drama, Comedy', 'Atsuko Fukushima, Yoji Fukuyama, Hideki Futamura', 'Mitsuyoshi Takasu', 'Tomoko Kaneda, Rinko Kikuchi, Taro Yabe, Yuya Yagira, Nanase Iwai, Miki Yamamoto, Gakuto Furuhara, Hiroshi Mikami', null, 'The seven short films making up GENIUS PARTY couldn’t be more diverse, linked only by a high standard of quality and inspiration. Atsuko Fukushima’s intro piece is a fantastic abstraction to soak up with the eyes. Masaaki Yuasa, of MIND GAME and CAT SOUP fame, brings his distinctive and deceptively simple graphic style and dream-state logic to the table with “Happy Machine,” his spin on a child’s earliest year. Shinji Kimura’s spookier “Deathtic 4,” meanwhile, seems to tap into the creepier corners of a child’s imagination and open up a toybox full of dark delights. Hideki Futamura’s “Limit Cycle” conjures up a vision of virtual reality, while Yuji Fukuyama’s "Doorbell" and "Baby Blue" by Shinichiro Watanabe use understated realism for very surreal purposes. And Shoji Kawamori, with “Shanghai Dragon,” takes the tropes and conventions of traditional anime out for very fun joyride.', 'The seven short films making up GENIUS PARTY couldn’t be more diverse, linked only by a high standard of quality and inspiration. Atsuko Fukushima’s intro piece is a fantastic abstraction to soak up with the eyes. Masaaki Yuasa, of MIND GAME and CAT SOUP fame, brings his distinctive and deceptively simple graphic style and dream-state logic to the table with “Happy Machine,” his spin on a child’s earliest year. Shinji Kimura’s spookier “Deathtic 4,” meanwhile, seems to tap into the creepier corners of a child’s imagination and open up a toybox full of dark delights. Hideki Futamura’s “Limit Cycle” conjures up a vision of virtual reality, while Yuji Fukuyama’s "Doorbell" and "Baby Blue" by Shinichiro Watanabe use understated realism for very surreal purposes. And Shoji Kawamori, with “Shanghai Dragon,” takes the tropes and conventions of traditional anime out for very fun joyride.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/e0jqLkjEOtfRhugXs84tfZtT9i8.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:40123'),
  ('997751694644120573', 'Genius Party Beyond', 2008, 'Animation', 'Koji Morimoto, Kazuto Nakazawa, Tatsuyuki Tanaka', 'Mahiro Maeda, Tatsuya Tanaka, Shinya Ohira', 'Arata Furuta, Yukiji, Shoko Takada, Urara Takano', null, 'Five stories, five maestros, five styles and one common denominator: maximum creativity. Studio 4°C, the coolest label on the planet, invites us for the second time to an exclusive reunion of a talents with a group film, full of freedom and ingenuity, that goes from Mahiro Maeda''s classic anime, to Kazuto Nakazawa''s intricate urban sketches, Shinya Ohira''s bedlam of color and Tatsuyuki Tanaka''s animated cyberpunk. And as if that wasn''t enough, Koji Morimoto, the studio big boss, is charge of putting the icing on the cake with fantafabulous piece of abstract poetry that would make a VJ die of ecstasy. The party of the year.', 'Five stories, five maestros, five styles and one common denominator: maximum creativity. Studio 4°C, the coolest label on the planet, invites us for the second time to an exclusive reunion of a talents with a group film, full of freedom and ingenuity, that goes from Mahiro Maeda''s classic anime, to Kazuto Nakazawa''s intricate urban sketches, Shinya Ohira''s bedlam of color and Tatsuyuki Tanaka''s animated cyberpunk. And as if that wasn''t enough, Koji Morimoto, the studio big boss, is charge of putting the icing on the cake with fantafabulous piece of abstract poetry that would make a VJ die of ecstasy. The party of the year.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uGZbRSafiU6A2Ek5idLWS7yGR4U.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:77248'),
  ('279026432439554140', 'Genocidal Organ', 2017, 'Thriller, Science Fiction, Animation, Action, War', 'Kazuhiro Yamada, Shukou Murase, Takayuki Masuo', 'Shukou Murase', 'Yuichi Nakamura, Takahiro Sakurai, Akio Otsuka, Kaito Ishikawa, Sanae Kobayashi, Kazuhiro Yamaji, Takuya Kirimoto, Yuki Kaji', null, 'The war on terror exploded, literally, the day Sarajevo was destroyed by a homemade nuclear device. The leading democracies transformed into total surveillance states, and the developing world has drowned under a wave of genocides. The mysterious American John Paul seems to be behind the collapse of the world system, and it''s up to intelligence agent Clavis Shepherd to track John Paul across the wreckage of civilizations and to find the true heart of darkness—a genocidal organ.', 'The war on terror exploded, literally, the day Sarajevo was destroyed by a homemade nuclear device. The leading democracies transformed into total surveillance states, and the developing world has drowned under a wave of genocides. The mysterious American John Paul seems to be behind the collapse of the world system, and it''s up to intelligence agent Clavis Shepherd to track John Paul across the wreckage of civilizations and to find the true heart of darkness—a genocidal organ.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aL5mNV5UgUoQ00qsC6dvwgQcIbA.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:357407'),
  ('942426007493978506', 'Genocide', 1968, 'Horror, Science Fiction', 'Kazui Nihonmatsu, Shizuo Hirase', 'Susumu Takaku', 'Keisuke Sonoi, Yūsuke Kawazu, Emi Shindō, Reiko Hitomi, Eriko Sono, Toshiyuki Ichimura, Tadayoshi Ueda, Hiroshi Aoyama', null, 'A group of military personnel transporting a hydrogen bomb are left to figure out how and why swarms of killer bugs took down their plane; the answer is more deliriously nihilistic, and convoluted, than they could imagine.', 'A group of military personnel transporting a hydrogen bomb are left to figure out how and why swarms of killer bugs took down their plane; the answer is more deliriously nihilistic, and convoluted, than they could imagine.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/23AUnhNeayJWJ5VCep7R2lljol6.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:124597'),
  ('117560687584661984', 'Genocide', 1982, 'Documentary, History, War', 'Arnold Schwartzman', 'Martin Gilbert, Marvin Hier, Arnold Schwartzman', 'Elizabeth Taylor, Orson Welles, Simon Wiesenthal, Neville Chamberlain, Winston Churchill, Dwight D. Eisenhower, Joseph Goebbels, Hermann Göring', null, 'The mass murder of Jewish people by the Nazi regime is chronicled, with a warning that anti-Semitism is on the rise and the events of the Holocaust could happen again. The history of European Jewish culture and events before and during the Holocaust are seen in newsreels, photographs, and animated segments. The words of the victims of the era are read, and footage from the liberation os a concentration camp is shown.', 'The mass murder of Jewish people by the Nazi regime is chronicled, with a warning that anti-Semitism is on the rise and the events of the Holocaust could happen again. The history of European Jewish culture and events before and during the Holocaust are seen in newsreels, photographs, and animated segments. The words of the victims of the era are read, and footage from the liberation os a concentration camp is shown.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7Td0yUXt40jqk4ddQoPcRMKEDr5.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:114516'),
  ('541968546307945592', 'Genocyber', 1994, 'Animation, Horror, Science Fiction', 'Koichi Ohata', 'Sho Aikawa, Koichi Ohata', 'Akiko Hiramatsu, Emi Shinohara, Kaoru Shimamura, Kazuyuki Sogabe, Kousei Yagi, Kumiko Nishihara, Masako Katsuki, Masashi Ebara', null, 'As the nations of the world begin to merge, world peace is threatened by the private armies of individual corporations. The Kuryu Group has just discovered a weapon that will tip world power in their favor. The Genocyber: a nightmarish combination of cybernetics and psychic potential. Many desire to control this monstrosity, but can its hatred be contained... Battle erupts, and the cyberpunk world of the future is about to explode with violence.', 'As the nations of the world begin to merge, world peace is threatened by the private armies of individual corporations. The Kuryu Group has just discovered a weapon that will tip world power in their favor. The Genocyber: a nightmarish combination of cybernetics and psychic potential. Many desire to control this monstrosity, but can its hatred be contained... Battle erupts, and the cyberpunk world of the future is about to explode with violence.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7z24eVtTXogfiFdUoKhnZ2O9Q6Q.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:120253'),
  ('176502341544954443', 'Genome Hazard', 2014, 'Thriller, Drama', 'Kim Sung-soo, Choi Sang-muk, Yu Jae-gyu', 'Kim Sung-soo', 'Hidetoshi Nishijima, Kim Hyo-jin, Yoko Maki, Masatô Ibu, Manabu Hamada, Yuri Nakamura, Park Hae-joon, Lee Kyung-young', null, 'Ishigami comes home from work and discovers his wife dead. Just then, he receives a phone call from his wife and falls in utter confusion. Unexplainable things keep happening as Ishigami struggles to find his wife. Gradually, Ishigami realizes all his memories are gone and finds himself acting like someone else. What is his true identity?', 'Ishigami comes home from work and discovers his wife dead. Just then, he receives a phone call from his wife and falls in utter confusion. Unexplainable things keep happening as Ishigami struggles to find his wife. Gradually, Ishigami realizes all his memories are gone and finds himself acting like someone else. What is his true identity?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/u1TCQAiF0WzIaQ4ff57XzvgHEC0.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:280612'),
  ('272022373769058219', 'Genova', 2009, 'Romance, Drama', 'Michael Winterbottom, Marcel Zyskind', 'Michael Winterbottom, Laurence Coriat', 'Colin Firth, Perla Haney-Jardine, Hope Davis, Catherine Keener, Kerry Shale, Alessandro Giuggioli, Willa Holland, Margherita Romeo', null, 'A man moves his two daughters to Italy after their mother dies in a car accident, in order to revitalize their lives. Genoa changes all three of them as the youngest daughter starts to see the ghost of her mother, while the older one discovers her sexuality.', 'A man moves his two daughters to Italy after their mother dies in a car accident, in order to revitalize their lives. Genoa changes all three of them as the youngest daughter starts to see the ghost of her mother, while the older one discovers her sexuality.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sxYarCXOudBzSyFbBBNt723R7q3.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:12408'),
  ('1085872902579663806', 'Genre', 1996, 'Animation, Comedy', 'Don Hertzfeldt, Cary Walker', 'Don Hertzfeldt', null, 'NR', 'In Don Hertzfeldt''s second student film, a hapless cartoon character is dragged through a spectrum of cinematic situations by his frustrated animator.', 'In Don Hertzfeldt''s second student film, a hapless cartoon character is dragged through a spectrum of cinematic situations by his frustrated animator.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/A9V9IYinYRoBQ0hB9aV7A9ZkpIs.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:32533'),
  ('722731845543799074', 'Genshin Impact: Star Odyssey', 2025, 'Animation, Music', null, null, 'Ryohei Kimura, Inori Minase, Kikuko Inoue, Mamiko Noto, Ryota Takeuchi, Kenjiro Tsuda', null, 'Looking up, she could see the night sky embracing all that is. In that moment, a thousand emotions crystallized into questions. Where hang the sun and moon? What canvas depicts the stars? The infinite universe and breadth of time question the smallness of man. Yet it is these small specimens of mortality who may embark on long voyages, the power to create miracles firmly within their grasp.', 'Looking up, she could see the night sky embracing all that is. In that moment, a thousand emotions crystallized into questions. Where hang the sun and moon? What canvas depicts the stars? The infinite universe and breadth of time question the smallness of man. Yet it is these small specimens of mortality who may embark on long voyages, the power to create miracles firmly within their grasp.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iBsKv6W5gaEnpYf3LBvwaybrnAX.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1496735'),
  ('529097316134219625', 'Gente de bien', 2014, 'Drama', 'Franco Lolli, Paola Andrea Pérez, María Fernanda Barrientos', 'Virginie Legeay, Franco Lolli, Catherine Paillé', 'Brayan Santamaría, Carlos Fernando Perez, Santiago Martinez, Sofía Rivas, Alejandra Borrero, Mónica Bustamante, Germán Quintero, Jacinta Ruiz', null, 'Eric, a ten-year-old boy, finds himself living overnight with Gabriel, his father whom he barely knows. Seeing that the man is having a hard time building a relationship with his son and staying afloat financially, Maria Isabel, the upper-class woman Gabriel works for as a carpenter, decides to take the boy under her wing.', 'Eric, a ten-year-old boy, finds himself living overnight with Gabriel, his father whom he barely knows. Seeing that the man is having a hard time building a relationship with his son and staying afloat financially, Maria Isabel, the upper-class woman Gabriel works for as a carpenter, decides to take the boy under her wing.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kgdr57ALY5qf2ugCC6NEXgvRnEl.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:284341'),
  ('683649814718126882', 'Gentille', 2005, 'Comedy', 'Sophie Fillières, Christophe Pollock', 'Sophie Fillières', 'Emmanuelle Devos, Lambert Wilson, Michael Lonsdale, Bulle Ogier, Julie-Anne Roth, Nicolas Briançon, Michel Vuillermoz, Magali Woch', null, 'As Gentille opens, Fontaine Leglou is walking down a Paris street, and stops to confront a man whom she suspects is following her. She tells him he looks normal, but she''s sorry, she doesn''t have time to have coffee with him. When he convincingly protests that he was not following her, she apologizes and asks him to have coffee. Fontaine would seem to have a relatively good life. She works as an anesthetist at a fancy mental hospital, and she''s got a live-in Nobel Prize-winning arctic scientist boyfriend, Michel, who seems to love her. But there''s clearly something nagging at her. She walks around in a perpetually distracted state, and frequently mistakes other peoples'' identities and their intentions. When Michel proposes to her, she needs some time to digest it before she responds.', 'As Gentille opens, Fontaine Leglou is walking down a Paris street, and stops to confront a man whom she suspects is following her. She tells him he looks normal, but she''s sorry, she doesn''t have time to have coffee with him. When he convincingly protests that he was not following her, she apologizes and asks him to have coffee. Fontaine would seem to have a relatively good life. She works as an anesthetist at a fancy mental hospital, and she''s got a live-in Nobel Prize-winning arctic scientist boyfriend, Michel, who seems to love her. But there''s clearly something nagging at her. She walks around in a perpetually distracted state, and frequently mistakes other peoples'' identities and their intentions. When Michel proposes to her, she needs some time to digest it before she responds.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9qsLl9mUAcjf722uysvuJEuuCcb.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:78688'),
  ('786616461767472886', 'Gentleman', 1993, 'Action, Crime', 'Shankar, Jeeva', 'Shankar', 'Arjun Sarja, Madhoo, M. N. Nambiar, Goundamani, Charan Raj, Subhashri, Senthil, Vineeth Radhakrishnan', null, 'Kicha is a modern-day Robin Hood, who along with his friend, Mani, steals from the rich to aid the poor. In society, he is a respected man who runs a small business.', 'Kicha is a modern-day Robin Hood, who along with his friend, Mani, steals from the rich to aid the poor. In society, he is a respected man who runs a small business.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dCQ5YBMRGhTuDvbpeOx5NWGqt5J.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:66530'),
  ('734856465912180823', 'Gentleman', 2022, 'Action, Crime', 'Kim Kyoung-won, Byun Bong-sun, Song Hyun-suk', 'Kim Kyoung-won', 'Ju Ji-hoon, Park Sung-woong, Choi Sung-eun, Park Hae-eun, Kang Hong-suk, Lee Dal, Kwon Han-sol, Lee Seo-hwan', null, 'Hyun-soo, a C.E.O of a private detective agency, visits a pension with a client asking for her dog. While waiting outside of pension, he is falsely accused of kidnapping the client. During the arrest Hyun-soo, a serious car accident occurs and people misunderstand Hyun-soo as a prosecutor instead of a suspect. To find the real criminal, Hyun-soo pretends to be a prosecutor. Hwa-jin is an elite prosecutor but demoted to the provinces while trying to catch a law firm conglomerate Do-hoon, who colluded with the prosecutor’s leadership, meets Hyun-soo. Hwa-jin finds out the case is related to Do-hoon, she begins cooperating with Hyun-soo. While cooperating is on-going, they realize that there is a dirty truth behind the crime.', 'Hyun-soo, a C.E.O of a private detective agency, visits a pension with a client asking for her dog. While waiting outside of pension, he is falsely accused of kidnapping the client. During the arrest Hyun-soo, a serious car accident occurs and people misunderstand Hyun-soo as a prosecutor instead of a suspect. To find the real criminal, Hyun-soo pretends to be a prosecutor. Hwa-jin is an elite prosecutor but demoted to the provinces while trying to catch a law firm conglomerate Do-hoon, who colluded with the prosecutor’s leadership, meets Hyun-soo. Hwa-jin finds out the case is related to Do-hoon, she begins cooperating with Hyun-soo. While cooperating is on-going, they realize that there is a dirty truth behind the crime.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bTyD004PndbO9xu9p2aBlmp9xQT.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:848198'),
  ('45377268874700093', 'Gentleman Jim', 1942, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Raoul Walsh, Sidney Hickox, Russell Saunders', 'Vincent Lawrence, Horace McCoy', 'Errol Flynn, Alexis Smith, Jack Carson, Alan Hale, John Loder, William Frawley, Minor Watson, Ward Bond', 'NR', 'As bare-knuckled boxing enters the modern era, brash extrovert Jim Corbett uses new rules and dazzlingly innovative footwork to rise to the top of the boxing world.', 'As bare-knuckled boxing enters the modern era, brash extrovert Jim Corbett uses new rules and dazzlingly innovative footwork to rise to the top of the boxing world.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9ajoFwfXXV70UidTkc9YorUzOYo.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:43522'),
  ('325500862743538349', 'Gentleman''s Agreement', 1947, 'Drama', 'Elia Kazan, Arthur C. Miller', 'Moss Hart', 'Gregory Peck, Dorothy McGuire, John Garfield, Celeste Holm, Anne Revere, June Havoc, Albert Dekker, Jane Wyatt', 'NR', 'A magazine writer poses as a Jew to expose anti-Semitism.', 'A magazine writer poses as a Jew to expose anti-Semitism.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aCCRbcmigPk00f34hpJuWZuvABo.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:33667'),
  ('635363774963116790', 'Gentlemen Broncos', 2009, 'Comedy, Science Fiction, Drama', 'Jared Hess, Munn Powell, J. Scott Smiley', 'Jared Hess, Jerusha Hess', 'Michael Angarano, Sam Rockwell, Jemaine Clement, Jennifer Coolidge, Halley Feiffer, Mike White, Héctor Jiménez, Josh Pais', 'PG-13', 'A teenager attends a fantasy writers'' convention where he discovers his idea has been stolen by an established novelist.', 'A teenager attends a fantasy writers'' convention where he discovers his idea has been stolen by an established novelist.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eRnUC60trqoRZuAtM8M3gOFT6ED.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:22820'),
  ('818713018809260801', 'Gentlemen Marry Brunettes', 1955, 'Music, Romance, Comedy', 'Richard Sale', 'Mary Loos, Richard Sale', 'Jane Russell, Jeanne Crain, Alan Young, Scott Brady, Guy Middleton, Eric Pohlmann, Rudy Vallee, Gwen Verdon', 'NR', 'Two Broadway showgirls, who are also sisters, are sick and tired of New York as well as not getting nowhere. Quitting Broadway, the sisters decided to travel to Paris to become famous.', 'Two Broadway showgirls, who are also sisters, are sick and tired of New York as well as not getting nowhere. Quitting Broadway, the sisters decided to travel to Paris to become famous.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/frYYVwR80lMlTQlMMogg9B9KtqO.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:73810'),
  ('1122864261932942837', 'Gentlemen of Fortune', 1971, 'Comedy, Crime, Drama', 'Aleksandr Sery, Georgiy Kupriyanov, Vasily Kosteltsev', 'Georgiy Daneliya, Viktoriya Tokareva', 'Evgeni Leonov, Georgiy Vitsin, Savely Kramarov, Radner Muratov, Erast Garin, Natalya Fateyeva, Roman Filippov, Oleg Vidov', null, 'Kindergarten teacher Evgeniy Ivanovich Troshkin is reluctantly sent undercover to take the place of an imprisoned thief who stole Alexander the Great''s helmet. Evgeniy uses his striking resemblance to the thief to infiltrate his gang and learn the location of the stolen artifact. He finds the gangsters are unexpectedly similar to his students- they also need love and care.', 'Kindergarten teacher Evgeniy Ivanovich Troshkin is reluctantly sent undercover to take the place of an imprisoned thief who stole Alexander the Great''s helmet. Evgeniy uses his striking resemblance to the thief to infiltrate his gang and learn the location of the stolen artifact. He finds the gangsters are unexpectedly similar to his students- they also need love and care.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/owZ2KQ2x99XqMprSvFNeTdmCBk8.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:20871'),
  ('17214482571448400', 'Gentlemen Prefer Blondes', 1953, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Howard Hawks, Harry J. Wild, Don Torpin', 'Charles Lederer', 'Jane Russell, Marilyn Monroe, Charles Coburn, Elliott Reid, Tommy Noonan, George Winslow, Marcel Dalio, Taylor Holmes', 'NR', 'Lorelei Lee is a beautiful showgirl engaged to be married to the wealthy Gus Esmond, much to the disapproval of Gus'' rich father, Esmond Sr., who thinks that Lorelei is just after his money. When Lorelei goes on a cruise accompanied only by her best friend, Dorothy Shaw, Esmond Sr. hires Ernie Malone, a private detective, to follow her and report any questionable behavior that would disqualify her from the marriage.', 'Lorelei Lee is a beautiful showgirl engaged to be married to the wealthy Gus Esmond, much to the disapproval of Gus'' rich father, Esmond Sr., who thinks that Lorelei is just after his money. When Lorelei goes on a cruise accompanied only by her best friend, Dorothy Shaw, Esmond Sr. hires Ernie Malone, a private detective, to follow her and report any questionable behavior that would disqualify her from the marriage.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fDozhst5HVJJcd3BM8ZOsKniO7Q.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:759'),
  ('86420836589443639', 'Gentlemen Prefer Nature Girls', 1963, 'Drama', 'Raymond Phelan, Doris Wishman', 'Doris Wishman', 'Lou Alexion, Joan Bamford, William Mayer, Dolores K. Norris, Jim Antonio, Sandra Sinclair, Lee Abell, Mary Jo Walls', null, 'Married nudists Anne and Tom work in real estate but Tom is fired for his lifestyle. Unfortunately, as he was ready to close a big major deal, Tom goes to his favorite nudist camp to take his mind off his problems and discovers that the client is also a member. Together, they scheme to get Anne and their boss to visit in order to make the deal.', 'Married nudists Anne and Tom work in real estate but Tom is fired for his lifestyle. Unfortunately, as he was ready to close a big major deal, Tom goes to his favorite nudist camp to take his mind off his problems and discovers that the client is also a member. Together, they scheme to get Anne and their boss to visit in order to make the deal.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mwEJtOKXknMUMwXC2f6uCpvrIzN.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:258705'),
  ('504251010498628121', 'Gently Down the Stream', 1981, 'Documentary', 'Su Friedrich', 'Su Friedrich', null, null, 'GENTLY DOWN THE STREAM is constructed from fourteen dreams taken from eight years'' worth of my journals. The text is scratched directly on to the film so that you hear your own voice as you read. The accompanying images of women, water, animals and saints were chosen for their indirect but potent correspondence to the text.', 'GENTLY DOWN THE STREAM is constructed from fourteen dreams taken from eight years'' worth of my journals. The text is scratched directly on to the film so that you hear your own voice as you read. The accompanying images of women, water, animals and saints were chosen for their indirect but potent correspondence to the text.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yyHfs5WgSQkzFujU5TwO8k5BrpF.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:283965'),
  ('119618144886860343', 'Gently Was Anastasia Passing', 1980, 'Drama, War', 'Alexandru Tatos', 'Dumitru Radu Popescu', 'Anda Onesa, Amza Pellea, Tark Laszlo, Levente Bíró, Cristian Ghiță, Imola Gáspár, Catalin Ciornei, Razvan Onesa', null, 'A border town on the Danube, 1944. The town is occupied by the Germans, and there are plenty of collaborators. A number of the young men join the partisans, kill a Serbian, and throw his body into the village, forbidding anyone to bury it. Anastasia refuses to obey the order…', 'A border town on the Danube, 1944. The town is occupied by the Germans, and there are plenty of collaborators. A number of the young men join the partisans, kill a Serbian, and throw his body into the village, forbidding anyone to bury it. Anastasia refuses to obey the order…', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3hCiIWukVWuRPDdScaoPRzsK9pg.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:102411'),
  ('1150824058140222048', 'Genuine: The Tragedy of a Vampire', 1920, 'Horror', 'Robert Wiene, Willy Hameister', 'Carl Mayer', 'Fern Andra, Hans Heinrich von Twardowski, Ernst Gronau, Harald Paulsen, Albert Bennefeld, John Gottowt, Lewis Brody', null, 'Since completing a portrait of Genuine, a high priestess, Percy becomes irritable and withdrawn. He loses interest in painting and refuses to see his friends, preferring to spend his time alone with the portrait in his study. After turning down a wealthy patron''s offer to buy the picture, Percy falls asleep while reading stories of Genuine''s life. Genuine comes to life from the painting and escapes.', 'Since completing a portrait of Genuine, a high priestess, Percy becomes irritable and withdrawn. He loses interest in painting and refuses to see his friends, preferring to spend his time alone with the portrait in his study. After turning down a wealthy patron''s offer to buy the picture, Percy falls asleep while reading stories of Genuine''s life. Genuine comes to life from the painting and escapes.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pQZNf7PA0CTJXZFez7NQ3RUgJ0r.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:84943'),
  ('327526204942189166', 'Geo-Disaster', 2017, 'Action, Science Fiction, TV Movie', 'Thunder Levin, Laura Beth Love', 'Thunder Levin', 'Matthew Pohlkamp, Natalie Pelletier, Erich Riegelmann, Maggie Rose Hudson, Isabella Bazler, M. Steven Felty, Tammy Klein, Annie Quigley', 'NR', 'A chunk of dark matter shoots right through earth, causing various worldwide disasters. A family in Los Angeles struggles to survive the ordeal.', 'A chunk of dark matter shoots right through earth, causing various worldwide disasters. A family in Los Angeles struggles to survive the ordeal.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3CejlBFDXEuktLJxLB6E59MbpGs.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:479475'),
  ('655105444441140690', 'Geography Club', 2013, 'Comedy, Drama, Romance', 'Gary Entin, Matthew Irving', 'Edmund Entin', 'Cameron Deane Stewart, Justin Deeley, Ally Maki, Andrew Lewis Caldwell, Meaghan Jette Martin, Nikki Blonsky, Alex Newell, Teo Olivares', 'PG-13', 'A coming-of-age movie that tells a story unfolding in every high school around the country -- a story of kids hiding their true identities in plain sight, even as they feverishly pursue their hearts'' desires.', 'A coming-of-age movie that tells a story unfolding in every high school around the country -- a story of kids hiding their true identities in plain sight, even as they feverishly pursue their hearts'' desires.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oPwDoem41nOxe1tEI5p65tYTbpe.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:197033'),
  ('781911368316761953', 'Geometry', 1987, 'Comedy, Horror', 'Guillermo del Toro', 'Guillermo del Toro', 'Guadalupe del Toro, Fernando Garcia Marin, Francisco ''Napo'' Sanchez, Rodrigo Mora', null, 'A boy is tired of failing geometry, so he summons a demon.', 'A boy is tired of failing geometry, so he summons a demon.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2Ch38McqOKI22C3r0q9U3ZJuy1X.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:160004'),
  ('304331325820864330', 'Georama Boy Panorama Girl', 2020, 'Drama', 'Natsuki Seta, Kyouhei Tamazawa', 'Natsuki Seta', 'Anna Yamada, Jin Suzuki, Erika Takizawa, Mimori Wakasugi, Misato Morita, Sora Hirata, Ibuki Mochida, Kiita', null, 'Shibuya Haruko is a high school student living in Tokyo. One night, she is instantly smitten by Kanagawa Kenichi, who is lying prone on a bridge. But Kenichi becomes far more interested in a girl he impulsively hits on, Mayumi, over the high-spirited Haruko.', 'Shibuya Haruko is a high school student living in Tokyo. One night, she is instantly smitten by Kanagawa Kenichi, who is lying prone on a bridge. But Kenichi becomes far more interested in a girl he impulsively hits on, Mayumi, over the high-spirited Haruko.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zGuFsppqLqJXk6EigMw1FMGUVB4.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:720271'),
  ('1010635439248830867', 'Geordie', 1955, 'Comedy, Drama, Romance', 'Wilkie Cooper, Frank Launder', 'Sidney Gilliat, Frank Launder', 'Alastair Sim, Bill Travers, Norah Gorsen, Jameson Clark, Molly Urquhart, Paul Young, Anna Ferguson, Miles Malleson', null, 'Concerned about his small stature, a young Scottish boy applies for a mail-order body building course, successfully gaining both height and strength. The film was released as "Wee Geordie" in the USA.', 'Concerned about his small stature, a young Scottish boy applies for a mail-order body building course, successfully gaining both height and strength. The film was released as "Wee Geordie" in the USA.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gOzR2R3RbbWVEcsJNHr1CQjF6pm.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:42343'),
  ('521812785657680613', 'George & Mildred', 1980, 'Comedy', 'Peter Frazer-Jones, Frank Watts, Ken Baker', 'Dick Sharples', 'Yootha Joyce, Brian Murphy, Stratford Johns, Norman Eshley, Sheila Fearn, Kenneth Cope, David Barry, Sue Bond', null, 'Big screen spin-off of the Seventies sitcom. Mildred Roper is determined to make husband George celebrate their wedding anniversary in style, at a posh hotel in London. However, upon arrival George is mistaken by a gangland criminal for a rival hitman, and soon the Ropers find themselves up to their necks in trouble on the wrong side of the law!', 'Big screen spin-off of the Seventies sitcom. Mildred Roper is determined to make husband George celebrate their wedding anniversary in style, at a posh hotel in London. However, upon arrival George is mistaken by a gangland criminal for a rival hitman, and soon the Ropers find themselves up to their necks in trouble on the wrong side of the law!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yeFniniACzenTqoDgCrtXDMNCmj.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:40742'),
  ('767698680788574256', 'George and A.J.', 2009, 'Animation, Family, Comedy', 'Josh Cooley', 'Josh Cooley', 'Steve Purcell, Jason Topolski, Bob Peterson, A.J. Riebli III, Peter Sohn, Kim Donovan, Claire Munzer, Valerie LaPointe', 'G', 'George and A.J. is a short film created by Pixar which uses characters from the film Up to tell what Nurses George and A.J. did after Carl Fredricksen left with his house tied to balloons in the feature film.', 'George and A.J. is a short film created by Pixar which uses characters from the film Up to tell what Nurses George and A.J. did after Carl Fredricksen left with his house tied to balloons in the feature film.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rIEV9tf9tjlzns2oygAxrSFv4sr.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:72962'),
  ('1116937874121453290', 'George and Rosemary', 1987, 'Animation, Romance, Comedy', 'Alison Snowden, David Fine', null, 'Cec Linder, Doris Malcolm, Marty Myers, Alexander Weldon', null, 'A shy old man works up the gumption to meet a woman on whom he has a crush.', 'A shy old man works up the gumption to meet a woman on whom he has a crush.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/60m8NFcFjx2cQHEz2kpnNvvFWo6.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:208260'),
  ('834566485879866276', 'George and the Dragon', 2004, 'Adventure', 'Tom Reeve, Joost van Starrenburg, Sean Guest', 'Michael Burks, Tom Reeve', 'James Purefoy, Piper Perabo, Patrick Swayze, Michael Clarke Duncan, Bill Treacher, Jean-Pierre Castaldi, Rollo Weeks, Paul Freeman', 'PG', 'In 12th century England, the handsome and noble knight, George, has left the Crusades behind to follow his dream of a peaceful life on his own piece of land. However, in order to obtain his land from the ruling King Edgaar, he must help find the King''s missing daughter, Princess Lunna, a quest which sees George drawn into an unexpected battle with the kingdom''s last surviving dragon.', 'In 12th century England, the handsome and noble knight, George, has left the Crusades behind to follow his dream of a peaceful life on his own piece of land. However, in order to obtain his land from the ruling King Edgaar, he must help find the King''s missing daughter, Princess Lunna, a quest which sees George drawn into an unexpected battle with the kingdom''s last surviving dragon.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/50NxkQexHBoQypzfADEdlxxOlWA.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:5494'),
  ('489606267839970746', 'George Carlin: 40 Years of Comedy', 1997, 'Documentary, Comedy, TV Movie', 'Rocco Urbisci', 'George Carlin', 'George Carlin, Jon Stewart', null, 'George Carlin celebrates 40 years of comedy and here, he presents 2 new standup bits, comedian Jon Stewart gives an interview with him, and we look at his old comedy work through the last 4 decades.', 'George Carlin celebrates 40 years of comedy and here, he presents 2 new standup bits, comedian Jon Stewart gives an interview with him, and we look at his old comedy work through the last 4 decades.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pQdyep8PiI72qO99IvP8RiISRv7.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:34508'),
  ('548292560815722089', 'George Carlin: Again!', 1978, 'TV Movie, Comedy, Documentary', 'Marty Callner, Greg Brunton', 'George Carlin', 'George Carlin, Brenda Carlin', null, 'Performing at the Celebrity Star Theater in Phoenix on July 23, 1978, Carlin mesmerizes his audience in the second of his 12 HBO specials. The show was originally planned as part of a concert/sketch movie, The Illustrated George Carlin, that never came to fruition.The routines include: Death, Kids & Parents, Newscast #2, Time and Al Sleet, the Hippy-Dippy Weatherman. -- From Amazon.com', 'Performing at the Celebrity Star Theater in Phoenix on July 23, 1978, Carlin mesmerizes his audience in the second of his 12 HBO specials. The show was originally planned as part of a concert/sketch movie, The Illustrated George Carlin, that never came to fruition.The routines include: Death, Kids & Parents, Newscast #2, Time and Al Sleet, the Hippy-Dippy Weatherman. -- From Amazon.com', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xGAW8AgQ8qDQcsAWImDHdsqvEye.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:57837'),
  ('755220844947203850', 'George Carlin: Back in Town', 1996, 'Comedy, TV Movie', 'Rocco Urbisci', 'George Carlin', 'George Carlin', null, 'Back in Town is George Carlin''s ninth HBO special. It was also released on CD on September 17, 1996. This was also his first of many performances at the Beacon Theater in New York City. He rants about Abortion, The death penalty, prison farms, fart jokes, free floating hostility and words.', 'Back in Town is George Carlin''s ninth HBO special. It was also released on CD on September 17, 1996. This was also his first of many performances at the Beacon Theater in New York City. He rants about Abortion, The death penalty, prison farms, fart jokes, free floating hostility and words.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gMA34cMwtPKG1GbKlWokMSmUDIE.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:34509'),
  ('873153696865054916', 'George Carlin: Complaints & Grievances', 2001, 'Comedy, TV Movie, Documentary', 'Rocco Urbisci', 'George Carlin', 'George Carlin', null, 'George Carlin performs a hilarious set of never-before released material in "Complaints and Grievances." His 12th HBO special was recorded live at the Beacon Theater in New York City on November 17, 2001. In "Complaints and Grievances," Carlin shamelessly exposes the people and subjects that irritate him the most.', 'George Carlin performs a hilarious set of never-before released material in "Complaints and Grievances." His 12th HBO special was recorded live at the Beacon Theater in New York City on November 17, 2001. In "Complaints and Grievances," Carlin shamelessly exposes the people and subjects that irritate him the most.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wGljefQICKydQgM0aaYjNYTQ0Ku.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:20679'),
  ('538390889503406716', 'George Carlin: Doin'' It Again', 1990, 'TV Movie, Comedy, Documentary', 'Rocco Urbisci', 'George Carlin', 'George Carlin, Rocco Urbisci', null, 'George Carlin brings his comedy back to New Jersey and this time talks about Offensive Language, Euphemisms, They''re Only Words, Dogs, Things you never hear, see or wanna hear, Some people are stupid, Cancer, Feminists, Good Ideas, Rape, Life''s moments, and organ donors.', 'George Carlin brings his comedy back to New Jersey and this time talks about Offensive Language, Euphemisms, They''re Only Words, Dogs, Things you never hear, see or wanna hear, Some people are stupid, Cancer, Feminists, Good Ideas, Rape, Life''s moments, and organ donors.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fGWOQ7M9bybjah8bDELlG8nfNe4.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:25160'),
  ('394569629543828947', 'George Carlin: George''s Best Stuff', 1996, 'Comedy, TV Movie, Documentary', 'Rocco Urbisci', 'George Carlin', 'George Carlin', null, 'George''s Best Stuff is a compilation of Carlin''s legendary routines, including "A Place For My Stuff," "Dogs and Cats," Vitamins," "Baseball and Football," "Losing Things," "Al Sleet the Hippie-Dippie Weather Man," the notorious "Seven Words You Can''t Say on Television," and many more. A great collection of some of the best standup comedy ever performed.', 'George''s Best Stuff is a compilation of Carlin''s legendary routines, including "A Place For My Stuff," "Dogs and Cats," Vitamins," "Baseball and Football," "Losing Things," "Al Sleet the Hippie-Dippie Weather Man," the notorious "Seven Words You Can''t Say on Television," and many more. A great collection of some of the best standup comedy ever performed.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/w8Cz07ewoPhj1aGIxVG8ZsBsqph.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:34510'),
  ('756241570975040008', 'George Carlin: It''s Bad for Ya!', 2008, 'Comedy', 'Rocco Urbisci', 'George Carlin', 'George Carlin', 'R', 'It''s Bad For Ya, Carlin''s Emmy nominated 14th and final HBO special from March of 2008 features Carlin''s noted irreverent and unapologetic observations on topics ranging from death, religion, bureaucracy, patriotism, overprotected children and big business to the pungent examinations of modern language and the decrepit state of the American culture.', 'It''s Bad For Ya, Carlin''s Emmy nominated 14th and final HBO special from March of 2008 features Carlin''s noted irreverent and unapologetic observations on topics ranging from death, religion, bureaucracy, patriotism, overprotected children and big business to the pungent examinations of modern language and the decrepit state of the American culture.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/m9fIvowFHpVjGn5OzFKudp2XJLD.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:13643'),
  ('351025688472663840', 'George Carlin: Jammin'' in New York', 1992, 'Comedy', 'Rocco Urbisci', 'George Carlin', 'George Carlin', null, 'When George Carlin is asked which HBO concert is his favorite, his answer is always, "Jammin’ In New York." The show, taped at the Paramount Theater in Madison Square Garden and winner of the 1992 CableACE Award, is a perfect blend of biting social commentary and more gently-observed observational pieces.', 'When George Carlin is asked which HBO concert is his favorite, his answer is always, "Jammin’ In New York." The show, taped at the Paramount Theater in Madison Square Garden and winner of the 1992 CableACE Award, is a perfect blend of biting social commentary and more gently-observed observational pieces.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vnUzbdtqkudKSBgX0KGivfpdYNB.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:25161'),
  ('535965252255080384', 'George Carlin: Life Is Worth Losing', 2005, 'Comedy, TV Movie, Documentary', 'Rocco Urbisci', 'George Carlin', 'George Carlin', null, 'Carlin returns to the stage in his 13th live comedy stand-up special, performed at the Beacon Theatre in New York City for HBO®. His spot-on observations on the deterioration of human behavior include Americans’ obsession with their two favorite addictions - shopping and eating; his creative idea for The All-Suicide Channel, a new reality TV network; and the glorious rebirth of the planet to its original pristine condition - once the fires and floods destroy life as we know it.', 'Carlin returns to the stage in his 13th live comedy stand-up special, performed at the Beacon Theatre in New York City for HBO®. His spot-on observations on the deterioration of human behavior include Americans’ obsession with their two favorite addictions - shopping and eating; his creative idea for The All-Suicide Channel, a new reality TV network; and the glorious rebirth of the planet to its original pristine condition - once the fires and floods destroy life as we know it.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/djoek5ZJA1J7E6vD0jAoUN5Mqjb.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:13015'),
  ('332748490337400240', 'George Carlin: On Campus', 1984, 'Comedy, TV Movie, Documentary', 'Steven J. Santos', 'George Carlin', 'George Carlin', null, 'George Carlin hits the boards with the former Hippie-Dippie Weatherman''s take on Brooklynese pronunciations of the names of sexually transmitted disease ("hoipes"), plus a prayer for the separation of church and state, feuds between breakfast foods, and the absurdity of wearing jungle camouflage in a desert.', 'George Carlin hits the boards with the former Hippie-Dippie Weatherman''s take on Brooklynese pronunciations of the names of sexually transmitted disease ("hoipes"), plus a prayer for the separation of church and state, feuds between breakfast foods, and the absurdity of wearing jungle camouflage in a desert.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uc6FStS2bMtHB2HfP3T8SrIJzP7.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:30649'),
  ('632483337696736622', 'George Carlin: On Location at USC', 1977, 'TV Movie, Comedy, Documentary', 'Marty Callner', 'George Carlin', 'George Carlin, Shayna Alexander, Brenda Carlin', null, 'George Carlin''s first ever comedy special, filmed live at the University of Southern California. Here, he talks about monopoly, flying on planes, random thoughts, walking, and other things.', 'George Carlin''s first ever comedy special, filmed live at the University of Southern California. Here, he talks about monopoly, flying on planes, random thoughts, walking, and other things.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bq9aTrDlLIJomFGEJPRXkBaN8HD.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:70086'),
  ('1078731907623875785', 'George Carlin: Personal Favorites', 1997, 'Comedy, TV Movie, Documentary', 'Rocco Urbisci', 'George Carlin', 'George Carlin', null, 'After starring in a dozen or so HBO Special Presentations, comedian George Carlin has amassed a substantial body of work in the cable channel''s vaults. Personal Favorites is a greatest-hits package, a selection of some of Carlin''s best moments on HBO from 1977 to 1998 and, not coincidentally, some of his most enduring comic routines from any medium.', 'After starring in a dozen or so HBO Special Presentations, comedian George Carlin has amassed a substantial body of work in the cable channel''s vaults. Personal Favorites is a greatest-hits package, a selection of some of Carlin''s best moments on HBO from 1977 to 1998 and, not coincidentally, some of his most enduring comic routines from any medium.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7IJlTEgi94h6eQ7AVy0HCsImxnH.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:34511'),
  ('5880808913427845', 'George Carlin: Playin'' with Your Head', 1986, 'Documentary, Comedy, TV Movie', 'Rocco Urbisci, Bruce Logan', 'George Carlin, Rocco Urbisci', 'George Carlin, Rick Ducommun, Anthony James, Vic Tayback, Adam Rich, Lyle Talbot', null, 'George Carlin is in top form with these stand-up recorded at the Beverly Theater in Los Angeles in 1986. Routines included are "Losing Things," "Charities," "Sports," "Hello and Goodbye," "Battered Plants," "Earrings," and "A Moment of Silence." Also included is a short film entitled "The Envelope" co-starring Vic Tayback.', 'George Carlin is in top form with these stand-up recorded at the Beverly Theater in Los Angeles in 1986. Routines included are "Losing Things," "Charities," "Sports," "Hello and Goodbye," "Battered Plants," "Earrings," and "A Moment of Silence." Also included is a short film entitled "The Envelope" co-starring Vic Tayback.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/j4WkiRSDMACb54L50bmF6iQaKFu.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:34163'),
  ('36033692131971525', 'George Carlin: What Am I Doing in New Jersey?', 1988, 'Comedy, Documentary, TV Movie', 'Bruce Gowers, Rocco Urbisci', 'George Carlin', 'George Carlin, Robert N. Altman, Lloyd Lindsay Young', null, 'George Carlin changes his act by bringing politics into the act, but also talks about the People he can do without, Keeping People Alert, and Cars and Driving part 2.', 'George Carlin changes his act by bringing politics into the act, but also talks about the People he can do without, Keeping People Alert, and Cars and Driving part 2.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mT2Ve5lHbPYHJv2DytqZIZkVfZK.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:34512'),
  ('1073197651056227383', 'George Carlin: You Are All Diseased', 1999, 'Comedy, TV Movie', 'Rocco Urbisci', 'George Carlin', 'George Carlin', null, 'Legendary comic Carlin comes back to the Beacon theater to angrily rant about airport security, germs, cigars, angels, children and parents, men, names, religion, god, advertising, Bill Jeff and minorities.', 'Legendary comic Carlin comes back to the Beacon theater to angrily rant about airport security, germs, cigars, angels, children and parents, men, names, religion, god, advertising, Bill Jeff and minorities.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rLW93IZAIwnnN9P1oGJjidsPoEm.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:34513'),
  ('797553180853317201', 'George Lucas in Love', 1999, 'Drama, Comedy, Romance', 'Joe Nussbaum, Eric Haase, Kevin Fukunaga', 'Joe Nussbaum, Daniel Shere', 'Martin Hynes, Lisa Jakub, Jason Peck, Jeff Wiens, Patrick Kerr, Marilyn McIntyre', 'NR', '1967 film student George Lucas has writer''s block trying to finish his "Space Wheat" script, until a beautiful fellow student with a familiar hairstyle teaches him that the best stories are in plain sight.', '1967 film student George Lucas has writer''s block trying to finish his "Space Wheat" script, until a beautiful fellow student with a familiar hairstyle teaches him that the best stories are in plain sight.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/umumYQuZjFvC1TLzclBesdIuaFR.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:14792'),
  ('780202392100808135', 'George Of Cappadocia', 2024, 'Action, Drama, War', 'Alexandre Machafer, Pedro Faerstein, Ricardo Soares', 'Matheus Souza', 'Alexandre Machafer, Cyria Coentro, Roberto Bomtempo, Miriam Freeland, Ricardo Soares, Augusto Garcia, Antonio Gonzalez, Roney Villela', null, 'After winning yet another battle, Jorge is decorated as the new captain of the army, and now finds himself faced with his greatest challenge, whether to be faithful to his faith or succumb to the excesses of Emperor Diocletian.', 'After winning yet another battle, Jorge is decorated as the new captain of the army, and now finds himself faced with his greatest challenge, whether to be faithful to his faith or succumb to the excesses of Emperor Diocletian.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/u41gunP8sYEjcOBAG5mQyLq8zk4.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1210096'),
  ('138568340289243128', 'George of the Jungle', 1997, 'Adventure, Comedy, Family, Romance', 'Sam Weisman, Thomas E. Ackerman, K.C. Colwell', 'Dana Olsen, Audrey Wells', 'Brendan Fraser, Leslie Mann, Thomas Haden Church, John Cleese, Richard Roundtree, Abraham Benrubi, Holland Taylor, John Bennett Perry', 'PG', 'Deep in the African jungle, a baby named George, the sole survivor of a plane crash, is raised by gorillas. George grows up to be a buff and lovable klutz who has a rainforest full of animal friends: Tookie, his big-beaked toucan messenger; Ape, a witty talking gorilla; and Shep, a peanut-loving pooch of an elephant. But when poachers mess with George''s pals, the King of Swing swings into action.', 'Deep in the African jungle, a baby named George, the sole survivor of a plane crash, is raised by gorillas. George grows up to be a buff and lovable klutz who has a rainforest full of animal friends: Tookie, his big-beaked toucan messenger; Ape, a witty talking gorilla; and Shep, a peanut-loving pooch of an elephant. But when poachers mess with George''s pals, the King of Swing swings into action.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lWp8hUqE4oLPxsYgilXoYoVThfU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:10603'),
  ('716202658862525268', 'George of the Jungle 2', 2003, 'Adventure, Comedy, Family', 'David Burr, Ian ''Thistle'' Thorburn, David Grossman', 'Jordan Moffet', 'Christopher Showerman, Julie Benz, Angus T. Jones, Thomas Haden Church, Christina Pickles, John Cleese, Michael Clarke Duncan, John Kassir', 'PG', 'George and Ursula now have a son, George Junior, so Ursula''s mother arrives to try and take them back to "civilization".', 'George and Ursula now have a son, George Junior, so Ursula''s mother arrives to try and take them back to "civilization".', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hMJbCWC9EpkVNKM3KaIOElCQIrT.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:26264'),
