  ('519840362821514278', 'George Wallace', 1997, 'History, Drama, TV Movie', 'John Frankenheimer, Alan Caso, James Sbardellati', null, 'Gary Sinise, Mare Winningham, Joe Don Baker, Angelina Jolie, Terry Kinney, William Sanderson, Mark Rolston, Tracy Fraim', 'G', 'George Wallace is a 1997 television film starring Gary Sinise as George Wallace, the former Governor of Alabama. It was directed by John Frankenheimer, who won an Emmy award for it; Sinise and Mare Winningham also won Emmies for their performances. The film was based on the 1996 biography Wallace : The Classic Portrait of Alabama Governor George Wallace by Marshall Frady, who also co-wrote the teleplay. Frankenheimer''s film was highly praised by critics: in addition to the Emmy awards, it received the Golden Globe for Best Miniseries/Motion Picture made for TV. Angelina Jolie also received a Golden Globe for her performance as Wallace''s second wife, Cornelia.', 'George Wallace is a 1997 television film starring Gary Sinise as George Wallace, the former Governor of Alabama. It was directed by John Frankenheimer, who won an Emmy award for it; Sinise and Mare Winningham also won Emmies for their performances. The film was based on the 1996 biography Wallace : The Classic Portrait of Alabama Governor George Wallace by Marshall Frady, who also co-wrote the teleplay. Frankenheimer''s film was highly praised by critics: in addition to the Emmy awards, it received the Golden Globe for Best Miniseries/Motion Picture made for TV. Angelina Jolie also received a Golden Globe for her performance as Wallace''s second wife, Cornelia.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/AeCijWmx9B1rZSBozFRuDFup3wI.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:61445'),
  ('409973263924947046', 'George Washington', 2000, 'Drama', 'Benji Gillespie, Andrew Gillis, Danny McBride', 'David Gordon Green', 'Donald Holden, Damian Jewan Lee, Curtis Cotton III, Rachael Handy, Candace Evanofski, Paul Schneider, Eddie Rouse, Janet Taylor', 'NR', 'Set in the landscape of a rural southern town, "George Washington" is a stunning portrait of how a group of young kids come to grips with a hard world of choices and consequences. During an innocent game in an abandoned amusement park, a member of the group dies. Narrated by one of the children, the film follows the kids as they struggle to balance their own ambitions and relationships against a tragic lie.', 'Set in the landscape of a rural southern town, "George Washington" is a stunning portrait of how a group of young kids come to grips with a hard world of choices and consequences. During an innocent game in an abandoned amusement park, a member of the group dies. Narrated by one of the children, the film follows the kids as they struggle to balance their own ambitions and relationships against a tragic lie.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/g9nZi8u5LqSrVKEpSm199EM4hk5.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:18292'),
  ('1025374982847174518', 'George Washington Slept Here', 1942, 'Comedy', 'William Keighley, Leo F. Forbstein, Ernest Haller', 'Everett Freeman', 'Jack Benny, Ann Sheridan, Charles Coburn, Percy Kilbride, Hattie McDaniel, William Tracy, Joyce Reynolds, Lee Patrick', 'NR', 'New Yorkers Bill and Connie Fuller have to move from their apartment. Without Bill''s knowledge, Connie purchases a delapidated old farmhouse in Pennsylvania, where George Washington was supposed to have actually slept during the American Revolution.', 'New Yorkers Bill and Connie Fuller have to move from their apartment. Without Bill''s knowledge, Connie purchases a delapidated old farmhouse in Pennsylvania, where George Washington was supposed to have actually slept during the American Revolution.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qJGPPLaarCSFziixOUwFB4MZwmG.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:35262'),
  ('222434272430504996', 'Georgetown', 2019, 'Crime, Drama', 'Christoph Waltz, Henry Braham', 'David Auburn', 'Christoph Waltz, Annette Bening, Vanessa Redgrave, Corey Hawkins, Sergio Di Zio, Noam Jenkins, David Reale, Paulino Nunes', 'R', 'Ulrich Mott is an eccentric and versatile social climber with grandiose plans to affect United States foreign policy. Encouraged in his attempts by his strategically chosen (and much older) wife, the well-connected journalist Elsa Brecht, Mott has a knack for making himself indispensable and impossible to ignore. The only one seemingly immune to his charms is Elsa''s daughter Amanda, who might simply disapprove of her mother marrying a much younger man - or perhaps she senses something more sinister beneath the smooth-talking surface?', 'Ulrich Mott is an eccentric and versatile social climber with grandiose plans to affect United States foreign policy. Encouraged in his attempts by his strategically chosen (and much older) wife, the well-connected journalist Elsa Brecht, Mott has a knack for making himself indispensable and impossible to ignore. The only one seemingly immune to his charms is Elsa''s daughter Amanda, who might simply disapprove of her mother marrying a much younger man - or perhaps she senses something more sinister beneath the smooth-talking surface?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pfBZObVPRNFA47jU22iaYH19Rdy.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:339395'),
  ('1130084349719229327', 'Georgia', 1995, 'Drama', 'Lynn Wegenka, Elisa Sansalone, Craig Huston', 'Barbara Turner', 'Jennifer Jason Leigh, Mare Winningham, Ted Levine, Max Perlich, John Doe, John C. Reilly, Jimmy Witherspoon, Jason Carter', 'R', 'Sadie looks up to her older sister Georgia, a successful folk singer. Unfortunately it is this very obsession — coupled with her self-destructive tendencies and rampant drug abuse — that keeps her spiraling down the drain.', 'Sadie looks up to her older sister Georgia, a successful folk singer. Unfortunately it is this very obsession — coupled with her self-destructive tendencies and rampant drug abuse — that keeps her spiraling down the drain.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uXjfK404xo7SiVlFcAoRyaFqXR4.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:97406'),
  ('353631839542450770', 'Georgia Peach', 2026, 'Drama', 'Mann Robinson', 'Mann Robinson', 'Jasmine Burke, Cocoa Brown, Teresa Celeste', 'Not Rated', 'A nurse in recovery from alcoholism must confront her past and her brother''s growing demands, risking everything she''s worked for to reclaim her life or lose it all to her inner demons.', 'A nurse in recovery from alcoholism must confront her past and her brother''s growing demands, risking everything she''s worked for to reclaim her life or lose it all to her inner demons.', 'https://images.plex.tv/photo?size=large-1280&url=https%3A%2F%2Fimage.tmdb.org%2Ft%2Fp%2Foriginal%2F4GGnhujDdrn1xRyHMqyCG5HQGu3.jpg', 'plex:movie:georgia-peach-2026'),
  ('978909305937957704', 'Georgia Rule', 2007, 'Drama, Comedy, Romance', 'Garry Marshall, Tommy Harper, Scott Marshall', 'Mark Andrus', 'Jane Fonda, Lindsay Lohan, Felicity Huffman, Dermot Mulroney, Cary Elwes, Garrett Hedlund, Héctor Elizondo, Dylan McLaughlin', 'R', 'Rebellious, uncontrollable teenager, Rachel is hauled off by her dysfunctional mother to spend the summer with her estranged grandmother, Georgia. Her journey will lead all three women to revelations of buried family secrets and an understanding that - regardless what happens - the ties that bind can never be broken.', 'Rebellious, uncontrollable teenager, Rachel is hauled off by her dysfunctional mother to spend the summer with her estranged grandmother, Georgia. Her journey will lead all three women to revelations of buried family secrets and an understanding that - regardless what happens - the ties that bind can never be broken.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9C7VaTib40dBaBrefxFesQ7pbKW.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:13159'),
  ('1074383345264591850', 'Georgian Ancient Songs', 1969, 'Documentary, Music, History', 'Otar Iosseliani', null, null, null, 'Under the premise of documenting for the sake of preservation the various forms of Georgian religious chanting, a distinct kind of sonorous psalmody passed over from generation to generation, what Otar Iosseliani captures in reality is the snapshot of a not-so-distant past that coexists with the world we might know yet transports us to what used to be.', 'Under the premise of documenting for the sake of preservation the various forms of Georgian religious chanting, a distinct kind of sonorous psalmody passed over from generation to generation, what Otar Iosseliani captures in reality is the snapshot of a not-so-distant past that coexists with the world we might know yet transports us to what used to be.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tiCLdfpZZa1gI2Up45OgZDBkGNV.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:216753'),
  ('438753885638806902', 'Georgica', 1998, 'Drama', 'Sulev Keedus, Rein Kotov, Marju Lepp', 'Sulev Keedus, Madis Kõiv', 'Evald Aavik, Mait Merekülski, Ülle Toming, Andres Ait, Katri Altmäe, Maret Elbing, Kersti Heinloo, Kalle Käesel', null, 'The action takes place in post-World War II Estonia. An old man lives alone on a deserted island which the Soviet fighter planes use for nighttime target practicing. A young neglected boy, who has become mute, is banished from the mainland and sent to the island to keep the old man company. Both are haunted by memories, the boy about his mother and the old man about the years before World War I he spent as a young missionary in Africa', 'The action takes place in post-World War II Estonia. An old man lives alone on a deserted island which the Soviet fighter planes use for nighttime target practicing. A young neglected boy, who has become mute, is banished from the mainland and sent to the island to keep the old man company. Both are haunted by memories, the boy about his mother and the old man about the years before World War I he spent as a young missionary in Africa', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/llTZ5m9dsy5tgI9XFP39VO63u78.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:46860'),
  ('1134383882350110736', 'Georgy Girl', 1966, 'Comedy, Drama, Romance', 'Silvio Narizzano, Kenneth Higgins, Michael Stevenson', 'Peter Nichols', 'Lynn Redgrave, James Mason, Alan Bates, Charlotte Rampling, Bill Owen, Clare Kelly, Rachel Kempson, Denise Coffey', 'NR', 'A homely but vivacious young woman dodges the amorous attentions of her father''s middle-aged employer while attempting to please her glamorously stuck-up roommate Meredith.', 'A homely but vivacious young woman dodges the amorous attentions of her father''s middle-aged employer while attempting to please her glamorously stuck-up roommate Meredith.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2v6ezHOqJM2HpSHiGWqLj0Mqs78.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:42719'),
  ('194805073319869829', 'Geostorm', 2017, 'Action, Science Fiction, Thriller', 'Dean Devlin, Roberto Schaefer, Page Buckner', 'Dean Devlin, Paul Guyot', 'Gerard Butler, Alexandra Maria Lara, Jim Sturgess, Abbie Cornish, Ed Harris, Andy Garcia, Zazie Beetz, Eugenio Derbez', 'PG-13', 'After an unprecedented series of natural disasters threatened the planet, the world''s leaders came together to create an intricate network of satellites to control the global climate and keep everyone safe. But now, something has gone wrong: the system built to protect Earth is attacking it, and it becomes a race against the clock to uncover the real threat before a worldwide geostorm wipes out everything and everyone along with it.', 'After an unprecedented series of natural disasters threatened the planet, the world''s leaders came together to create an intricate network of satellites to control the global climate and keep everyone safe. But now, something has gone wrong: the system built to protect Earth is attacking it, and it becomes a race against the clock to uncover the real threat before a worldwide geostorm wipes out everything and everyone along with it.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nrsx0jEaBgXq4PWo7SooSnYJTv.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:274855'),
  ('750021752068197400', 'Gérald le Conquérant', 2025, 'Comedy', 'Fabrice Eboué, Elsa Pharaon, Vincent Richard-Marquis', 'Fabrice Eboué', 'Fabrice Eboué, Vincent Solignac, Joaquim Fossi, Gaëtan Cotigny, Jean-François Cayrey, Alexandra Roth, Serge Da Silva, Franck Dubosc', null, 'A Duchy of Normandy crank nostalgic wants to give his homeland back its power of days gone by. He wants to create a huge historic park to the glory of William the Conqueror, helped by an upstart documentaries director.', 'A Duchy of Normandy crank nostalgic wants to give his homeland back its power of days gone by. He wants to create a huge historic park to the glory of William the Conqueror, helped by an upstart documentaries director.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lyjO7qEAxtMF4hZhzp3haPdeBde.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1174382'),
  ('948738858828462649', 'Gerald McBoing-Boing', 1950, 'Animation, Comedy', 'Robert Cannon, John Hubley', null, 'Marvin Miller', null, 'The story of a little boy who would only talk in sound effects. With story by Dr. Seuss (and Bill Scott of Rocky and Bullwinkle fame) this cartoon won the Oscar for best short subject (animated) for 1950.', 'The story of a little boy who would only talk in sound effects. With story by Dr. Seuss (and Bill Scott of Rocky and Bullwinkle fame) this cartoon won the Oscar for best short subject (animated) for 1950.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/afgivuAiO9ZllYvISlzDRU9kzuv.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:46990'),
  ('722470899365905003', 'Gerald''s Game', 2017, 'Horror, Thriller', 'Mike Flanagan, Michael Fimognari', 'Mike Flanagan, Jeff Howard', 'Carla Gugino, Bruce Greenwood, Carel Struycken, Chiara Aurelia, Henry Thomas, Kate Siegel, Adalyn Jones, Bryce Harper', 'NR', 'When her husband''s sex game goes wrong, Jessie (who is handcuffed to a bed in a remote lake house) faces warped visions, dark secrets and a dire choice.', 'When her husband''s sex game goes wrong, Jessie (who is handcuffed to a bed in a remote lake house) faces warped visions, dark secrets and a dire choice.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/32dippiypDdaKv7XFEfUlQ7kPup.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:343674'),
  ('716564611637609810', 'Geraldine', 2001, 'Animation, Comedy', 'Arthur de Pins', 'Arthur de Pins', 'Anne Charlotte Guillot, Camille Serceau', null, 'Gerald is dealing with an unwanted sex change.', 'Gerald is dealing with an unwanted sex change.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rEAJ0OdhMCUW7q8KzQx3LyeY3wb.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:246654'),
  ('1004702082688043520', 'Geranium', 2020, 'Drama', 'İdris Kaan Akbay, Gülgün Dedecam, Orçun Özkılınç', 'Çağıl Bocut', 'İlayda Elhih, Ali Seçkiner Alıcı, Ahsen Eroğlu, Evren Duyal, Tansu Biçer, Zeyno Eracar, Cemalettin Çekmece, Mehmet Tolga Girgin', null, 'Just before her final exams, 19 years old Defne, has to return to her hometown after her father''s stroke. His rehabilitation sessions will give the pair a chance to heal their fragile relationship in this beautiful Mediterranean town.', 'Just before her final exams, 19 years old Defne, has to return to her hometown after her father''s stroke. His rehabilitation sessions will give the pair a chance to heal their fragile relationship in this beautiful Mediterranean town.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3JcWV0QObH9V9Ztl4tSnlq5hysZ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:819213'),
  ('455695793537393156', 'Gerçek Kesit: Manyak', 2018, 'Drama, Thriller', 'Onur Ünlü', 'Cahit Kaşıkçılar', 'Cahit Kaşıkçılar, Emel Emir, Fatma Pazvant, Mehmet Vanlıoğlu, Zehra Sözügüzel, Erdal Parmaksızoğlu, Ufuk Durmaz, Mesut Hakyemez', null, 'Riza, a garbage man becomes obsessed in her old mother when he finds a woman''s corpse in a garbage can. But someday he meets with his new neighbor,a beautiful widow and starts to lose track of reality, stuck between his love and her mother.', 'Riza, a garbage man becomes obsessed in her old mother when he finds a woman''s corpse in a garbage can. But someday he meets with his new neighbor,a beautiful widow and starts to lose track of reality, stuck between his love and her mother.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8ZUcyBBlPrpfqKr9nL71FD9uTGM.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:510055'),
  ('131816442305959401', 'Gerda', 2021, 'Drama', 'Kirill Vasilenko, Alexander Aleshkovskiy, Vladimir Golov', 'Natalya Kudryashova', 'Anastasiya Krasovskaya, Yura Borisov, Darius Gumauskas, Yuliya Marchenko, Mariya Leonova, Julia Ogun, Serafima Krasnikova, Maksim Stoyanov', null, 'During the day, Lera studies humankind and its needs through opinion polls, which are an educational practice at the institute; at night, she dances under the pseudonym Gerda in a club to support herself and her mother. The people she meets are as unfortunate as her family. Her father has recently left for another woman, but he constantly returns home, unable to make his choice and thereby making the life of close people intolerable. The mother painfully endures the breakup and constantly sleeps, ignoring reality. Lera doesn’t know how to carry on, where to go and what to live for, and — most importantly — how to improve life. The adult world, invariable unfortunate, which Lera observes day and night, seems hopeless.', 'During the day, Lera studies humankind and its needs through opinion polls, which are an educational practice at the institute; at night, she dances under the pseudonym Gerda in a club to support herself and her mother. The people she meets are as unfortunate as her family. Her father has recently left for another woman, but he constantly returns home, unable to make his choice and thereby making the life of close people intolerable. The mother painfully endures the breakup and constantly sleeps, ignoring reality. Lera doesn’t know how to carry on, where to go and what to live for, and — most importantly — how to improve life. The adult world, invariable unfortunate, which Lera observes day and night, seems hopeless.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qbM1tJps4jIjHNZodQON05zp1eR.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:656097'),
  ('597590174747363301', 'German Angst', 2015, 'Horror, Drama', 'Jörg Buttgereit, Andreas Marschall, Michal Kosakowski', 'Jörg Buttgereit, Andreas Marschall, Goran Mimica', 'Lola Gave, Axel Holst, Andreas Pape, Annika Strauss, Matthan Harris, Daniel Faust, Martina Schöne-Radunski, Denis Lyons', 'R', 'Horror anthology consisting of three episodes directed by Jörg Buttgereit, Andreas Marschall and Michal Kosakowski.', 'Horror anthology consisting of three episodes directed by Jörg Buttgereit, Andreas Marschall and Michal Kosakowski.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7kSww7oRgQUmLbiyzAkyeUq94y9.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:252596'),
  ('796322718086750756', 'Germany ’09 – 13 Short Films About the State of the Nation', 2009, 'Drama', 'Fatih Akin, Wolfgang Becker, Jan Ole Gerster', 'Christoph Hochhäusler', 'Denis Moschitto, Kai Strittmatter, Peter Jordan, Andreas Hofer, Anneke Kim Sarnau, Winnie Böwe, Karl Markovics, Helene Hegemann', null, 'Thirteen German directors present short films exploring the state of their country.', 'Thirteen German directors present short films exploring the state of their country.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4bgBGauu6izdrqThtEvcsnZIR7u.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:56694'),
  ('888811916829724946', 'Germany in Autumn', 1978, 'Documentary, Drama', 'Hans Peter Cloos, Maximiliane Mainka, Rainer Werner Fassbinder', 'Maximiliane Mainka, Peter Steinbach, Alf Brustellin', 'Hannelore Hoger, Angela Winkler, Vadim Glowna, Katja Rupé, Heinz Bennent, Wolf Biermann, Joachim Bißmeier, Helmut Griem', null, 'Nine fictitious documentaries and films reflect the mood of late 1970s Germany, particularly the two-month period in 1977 when a businessman was kidnapped by the RAF (Red Army Faction). The kidnap had been made to orchestrate the release of the original leaders of the RAF, aka the Baader-Meinhof.', 'Nine fictitious documentaries and films reflect the mood of late 1970s Germany, particularly the two-month period in 1977 when a businessman was kidnapped by the RAF (Red Army Faction). The kidnap had been made to orchestrate the release of the original leaders of the RAF, aka the Baader-Meinhof.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/c647fe1s7gpjaHYY5ccl54K7mFA.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:12578'),
  ('972070645260388546', 'Germany Pale Mother', 1980, 'Drama', 'Helma Sanders-Brahms, Jürgen Jürges', 'Helma Sanders-Brahms', 'Eva Mattes, Ernst Jacobi, Elisabeth Stepanek, Angelika Thomas, Rainer Friedrichsen, Fritz Lichtenhahn', null, 'Germany 1939. Hans and Lene marry the day before the war breaks out, and Hans is sent to the Eastern front. During a bombing raid their daughter Anna is born. The house is destroyed and Lene and Anna moves in with relatives in Berlin. Hans survives the war but he is not the same person as in 1939, and he and Lene find it difficult to live together again.', 'Germany 1939. Hans and Lene marry the day before the war breaks out, and Hans is sent to the Eastern front. During a bombing raid their daughter Anna is born. The house is destroyed and Lene and Anna moves in with relatives in Berlin. Hans survives the war but he is not the same person as in 1939, and he and Lene find it difficult to live together again.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/odEUpPvCNQx85pQrHMbj3s3HhEm.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:65481'),
  ('1053697448884577604', 'Germany Year 90 Nine Zero', 1993, 'Drama', 'Jean-Luc Godard, Christophe Pollock, Andreas Erben', 'Jean-Luc Godard', 'Eddie Constantine, Hanns Zischler, Claudia Michelsen, Nathalie Kadem, André S. Labarthe, Robert Wittmers, Kim Kashkashian, Anton Mossine', null, 'The supremely world-weary Lemmy Caution, last seen in Godard''s "Alphaville" (France/1965), has several strange encounters while trying to make his way from the former East Germany to "the west."', 'The supremely world-weary Lemmy Caution, last seen in Godard''s "Alphaville" (France/1965), has several strange encounters while trying to make his way from the former East Germany to "the west."', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tHM0WHbeJHreRT5mqXDY9PFeKFx.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:53016'),
  ('583206338854502514', 'Germany, Year Zero', 1948, 'Drama', 'Roberto Rossellini, Robert Juillard, Max Kolpé', 'Roberto Rossellini, Max Kolpé, Carlo Lizzani', 'Edmund Moeschke, Ernst Pittschau, Ingetraud Hinze, Franz-Otto Krüger, Erich Gühne, Heidi Blänkner, Jo Herbst, Barbara Hintz', 'NR', 'In the ruins of post-WWII Berlin, a twelve-year-old boy is left to his own devices in order to help provide for his family.', 'In the ruins of post-WWII Berlin, a twelve-year-old boy is left to his own devices in order to help provide for his family.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sdxegsjrrvujXvv2GLPENyDlWDI.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:8016'),
  ('250456861042072961', 'Germany: A Summer''s Fairytale', 2006, 'Documentary', 'Sönke Wortmann, Sönke Wortmann, Frank Griebe', 'Sönke Wortmann', 'Jürgen Klinsmann, Joachim Löw, Andreas Köpke, Oliver Bierhoff, Jens Lehmann, Oliver Kahn, Timo Hildebrand, Christoph Metzelder', null, 'A documentary of the German national soccer team’s 2006 World Cup experience that changed the face of modern Germany.', 'A documentary of the German national soccer team’s 2006 World Cup experience that changed the face of modern Germany.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pQ7p8zGxy0OTy6RwDA0Y2mlqmdu.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:286'),
  ('137263634296910256', 'Germany. A Winter''s Tale', 2019, 'Drama', 'Jan Bonny, Benjamin Loeb', 'Jan Eichberg, Jan Bonny', 'Thomas Schubert, Ricarda Seifried, Jean-Luc Bubert, Victoria Trauttmansdorff, Lars Eidinger, Judith Bohle, Peter Eberst, Franziska Hartmann', null, 'Becky, Tommi and Maik form a right-wing terror cell that lives in the underground and is dreaming of country-wide attention. Entangled in a complex relationship of love, hate and friendship, they follow a path of destruction that leads to a series of violent crime. Their alleged values such as honor, pride and loyalty decline due to their increasing disorientation.', 'Becky, Tommi and Maik form a right-wing terror cell that lives in the underground and is dreaming of country-wide attention. Entangled in a complex relationship of love, hate and friendship, they follow a path of destruction that leads to a series of violent crime. Their alleged values such as honor, pride and loyalty decline due to their increasing disorientation.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ydZ9QPs3y6act9U0KzXHeVwHugK.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:537854'),
  ('282918200423322402', 'Germinal', 1993, 'Drama, Romance', 'Claude Berri, Yves Angelo, Frédéric Auburtin', 'Arlette Langmann, Claude Berri', 'Miou-Miou, Renaud, Jean Carmet, Judith Henry, Jean-Roger Milo, Gérard Depardieu, Laurent Terzieff, Bernard Fresson', null, 'It''s mid 19th century, north of France. The story of a coal miner''s town. They are exploited by the mine''s owner. One day the decide to go on strike, and then the authorities repress them.', 'It''s mid 19th century, north of France. The story of a coal miner''s town. They are exploited by the mine''s owner. One day the decide to go on strike, and then the authorities repress them.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cizv23RUxcpTrQt4kcOz7Sv6YJl.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:51980'),
  ('963775156971669859', 'Geronimo', 1962, 'Western, History', 'Arnold Laven, Alex Phillips, Henry Spitz', 'Pat Fielder', 'Chuck Connors, Kamala Devi, Pat Conway, Armando Silvestre, Adam West, Lawrence Dobkin, John Anderson, Denver Pyle', 'NR', 'In 1883, the Apache Indians lead by Geronimo reluctantly surrender to the attacks of American and Mexican troops, in exchange for a territory and food for their warriors. Soon though, Geronimo escapes the camps and declares war against the Americans.', 'In 1883, the Apache Indians lead by Geronimo reluctantly surrender to the attacks of American and Mexican troops, in exchange for a territory and food for their warriors. Soon though, Geronimo escapes the camps and declares war against the Americans.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mO8jTUR212MuRs2aMajCe95gZ3W.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:37238'),
  ('808514739094852109', 'Geronimo', 1993, 'Western, TV Movie', 'Craig Huston, James Devis, Roger Young', 'J. T. Allen', 'Joseph Runningfox, Nick Ramus, Michelle St. John, Michael Greyeyes, Tailinh Agoyo, Kimberly Guerrero, Jimmy Herman, August Schellenberg', null, 'The story of the greatest Native American warrior who, together with the rest of his Apache tribesmen, defied American and Mexican Armies in 1867. Finally caught and sent to a reservation camp, he eluded a military force of 5000 for 18 months before finally surrendering to the government.', 'The story of the greatest Native American warrior who, together with the rest of his Apache tribesmen, defied American and Mexican Armies in 1867. Finally caught and sent to a reservation camp, he eluded a military force of 5000 for 18 months before finally surrendering to the government.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gytUWL0MThgV4Paec9jlhrBqT6P.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:357434'),
  ('413945820314833176', 'Geronimo', 2014, 'Drama', 'Tony Gatlif, Patrick Ghiringhelli', 'Tony Gatlif', 'Céline Sallette, Rachid Yous, David Murgia, Nailia Harzoune, Vincent Heneine, Adrien Ruiz, Aksel Üstün, Tim Seyfi', null, 'South of France. In the sultry August heat, Geronimo, a young social educator, tries to ease tensions between the youngsters of the St Pierre neighborhood. The mood changes when Nil Terzi, a teenage girl of Turkish origin, flees an arranged marriage, running to the arms of her gypsy lover, Lucky Molina. Their escape sparks hostilities between the two clans. When the jousting and the musical battles begin, Geronimo struggles to quell the ensuing unrest around her.', 'South of France. In the sultry August heat, Geronimo, a young social educator, tries to ease tensions between the youngsters of the St Pierre neighborhood. The mood changes when Nil Terzi, a teenage girl of Turkish origin, flees an arranged marriage, running to the arms of her gypsy lover, Lucky Molina. Their escape sparks hostilities between the two clans. When the jousting and the musical battles begin, Geronimo struggles to quell the ensuing unrest around her.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/d7xgQLgJI5ysMG9TcOFBQ4G0B6W.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:280640'),
  ('868928738452365471', 'Geronimo: An American Legend', 1993, 'Western, History, Action, Drama', 'Walter Hill, Lloyd Ahern II, Josh McLaglen', 'John Milius, Larry Gross', 'Jason Patric, Gene Hackman, Robert Duvall, Wes Studi, Matt Damon, Rodney A. Grant, Kevin Tighe, Steve Reevis', 'PG-13', 'The Apache Indians have reluctantly agreed to settle on a US Government approved reservation. Not all the Apaches are able to adapt to the life of corn farmers. One in particular, Geronimo, is restless. Pushed over the edge by broken promises and necessary actions by the government, Geronimo and thirty or so other warriors form an attack team which humiliates the government by evading capture, while reclaiming what is rightfully theirs.', 'The Apache Indians have reluctantly agreed to settle on a US Government approved reservation. Not all the Apaches are able to adapt to the life of corn farmers. One in particular, Geronimo, is restless. Pushed over the edge by broken promises and necessary actions by the government, Geronimo and thirty or so other warriors form an attack team which humiliates the government by evading capture, while reclaiming what is rightfully theirs.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9FNuwnhHngkblD6eVRXnmJN8kQq.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:35588'),
  ('693100729589775885', 'Gerontokoros', 1967, 'Comedy', 'Orestis Laskos, Aris Papatheodorou, Pantelis Filippides', 'Lakis Mihailidis, Giorgos Katsabis', 'Labros Konstadaras, Maro Kodou, Yorgos Moutsios, Despoina Stylianopoulou, Popi Lazou, Orfeas Zahos, Kostas Prekas, Aggela Giouranti', null, 'Thanasis is against marriage, by conviction. But he changes his mind when hiring Mary as secretary.', 'Thanasis is against marriage, by conviction. But he changes his mind when hiring Mary as secretary.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kGl678Xe4dMkr9D75NeVLvCn2m4.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:375181'),
  ('177030012463335326', 'Gerontophilia', 2013, 'Romance, Comedy', 'Bruce LaBruce, Nicolas Canniccioni, Sinan Saber', 'Daniel Allen Cox, Bruce LaBruce', 'Pier-Gabriel Lajoie, Walter Borden, Katie Boland, Yardly Kavanagh, Marie-Hélène Thibault, Shawn Campbell, Jean-Alexandre Létourneau, Dana Wright', 'NR', 'Lake is in a straight relationship with Desiree but finds himself becoming attracted to men at the pool. When he cannot control his desires any longer, he starts working at an adult home and begins a relationship with a much, much older man.', 'Lake is in a straight relationship with Desiree but finds himself becoming attracted to men at the pool. When he cannot control his desires any longer, he starts working at an adult home and begins a relationship with a much, much older man.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mHtqroqrwpyFhR2j7uerQ7AZ3JZ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:212721'),
  ('152334818301945224', 'Gerorist', 1986, 'Mystery, Thriller, Horror', 'Shozin Fukui, Tomio', null, 'Chiemi Endô', null, 'A young woman on the Tokyo subway who may be possessed.', 'A young woman on the Tokyo subway who may be possessed.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kfffrdSFzgXDlEBBriCqh080mno.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:151022'),
  ('1015241691234588958', 'Gerry', 2002, 'Drama, Adventure, Mystery', 'Gus Van Sant, Harris Savides, Sally Sue Beisel', 'Matt Damon, Casey Affleck, Gus Van Sant', 'Casey Affleck, Matt Damon', 'R', 'Two friends named Gerry become lost in the desert after taking a wrong turn. Their attempts to find their way home only lead them into further trouble.', 'Two friends named Gerry become lost in the desert after taking a wrong turn. Their attempts to find their way home only lead them into further trouble.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jzuPVECdfWuHoBIqQEFajbSwwpa.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1956'),
  ('577565927570338321', 'Gerry', 2011, 'Drama, Romance, Music', 'Alain Desrochers', 'Nathalie Petrowski', 'Mario Saint-Amand, Capucine Delaby, Marc-François Blondin, Eugene Brotto, Éric Bruneau, Nathalie Cavezzali, Mathieu Lepage, Louis-David Morasse', null, 'Born into a modest family, Gerry Boulet found fame with the Québec rock group Offenbach. After a life of drug and alcohol abuse and a great love story, Gerry died of cancer in 1990.', 'Born into a modest family, Gerry Boulet found fame with the Québec rock group Offenbach. After a life of drug and alcohol abuse and a great love story, Gerry died of cancer in 1990.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fRqAHlxQPWE2SOgwIBSupAlKCPZ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:76896'),
  ('1049719770275497067', 'Gertie on Tour', 1921, 'Comedy, Animation, Fantasy', 'Winsor McCay', 'Winsor McCay', null, null, 'Windsor McCay''s partially lost follow-up to his tremendouly successful Gertie the Dinosaur. Gertie has been brought into the modern world. Continually perplexed by her new surroundings, she begins to explore the new sights. But when she sleeps, she dreams of the way it used to be, in the days when the world was full of dinosaurs like herself.', 'Windsor McCay''s partially lost follow-up to his tremendouly successful Gertie the Dinosaur. Gertie has been brought into the modern world. Continually perplexed by her new surroundings, she begins to explore the new sights. But when she sleeps, she dreams of the way it used to be, in the days when the world was full of dinosaurs like herself.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/24aBxZfXjbvMf4phx1qyadobq8c.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:175485'),
  ('876166341469501557', 'Gertie the Dinosaur', 1914, 'Animation, Comedy', 'Winsor McCay', 'Winsor McCay', 'Winsor McCay, George McManus, Roy L. McCardell, Thomas A. ''Tad'' Dorgan, Tom Powers, Robert McCay, John Bunny', 'NR', 'Although not the first feature-length animated film, as is sometimes thought, it was the first cartoon to feature a character with an appealing personality. The appearance of a true character distinguished it from earlier animated "trick films", such as those of Blackton and Cohl, and makes it the predecessor to later popular cartoons such as those by Walt Disney. The film was also the first to be created using keyframe animation.', 'Although not the first feature-length animated film, as is sometimes thought, it was the first cartoon to feature a character with an appealing personality. The appearance of a true character distinguished it from earlier animated "trick films", such as those of Blackton and Cohl, and makes it the predecessor to later popular cartoons such as those by Walt Disney. The film was also the first to be created using keyframe animation.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fH5c2a3Nti765GqG8jj0uMBLgIK.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:100246'),
  ('1119143085930191297', 'Gertrud', 1964, 'Drama, Romance', 'Carl Theodor Dreyer, Henning Bendtsen, Arne Abrahamsen', 'Carl Theodor Dreyer', 'Nina Pens Rode, Bendt Rothe, Ebbe Rode, Baard Owe, Axel Strøbye, Karl Gustav Ahlefeldt, Vera Gebuhr, Lars Knutzon', null, 'Hopeless romantic Gertrud inhabits a turn-of-the-century milieu of artists and musicians, where she pursues an idealized notion of love that will always elude her. She abandons her distinguished husband and embraces an affair with a young concert pianist, who falls short of her desire for lasting affection. When an old lover returns to her life, fresh disappointments follow, and Gertrud must try to come to terms with reality.', 'Hopeless romantic Gertrud inhabits a turn-of-the-century milieu of artists and musicians, where she pursues an idealized notion of love that will always elude her. She abandons her distinguished husband and embraces an affair with a young concert pianist, who falls short of her desire for lasting affection. When an old lover returns to her life, fresh disappointments follow, and Gertrud must try to come to terms with reality.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/o6tiS3EaSwn4wI1DStLqDJ8OZJL.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:34181'),
  ('964548957518922731', 'Gervaise', 1956, 'Romance, Drama', 'René Clément, Robert Juillard, Claude Clément', 'Jean Aurenche, Pierre Bost', 'Maria Schell, François Périer, Jany Holt, Mathilde Casadesus, Suzy Delair, Armand Mestral, Florelle, Micheline Luccioni', null, 'An adaptation of Émile Zola’s 1877 masterpiece L’assommoir, the film is an uncompromising depiction of a lowly laundress’s struggles to deal with an alcoholic husband while running her own business.', 'An adaptation of Émile Zola’s 1877 masterpiece L’assommoir, the film is an uncompromising depiction of a lowly laundress’s struggles to deal with an alcoholic husband while running her own business.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/njux1vvBuiwR4UJ6FCpYoar9buO.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:52726'),
  ('848600062039133600', 'Gerzek Şaban', 1980, 'Comedy', 'Natuk Baytan, Rafet Şiriner, Mehmet Gün', 'Erdoğan Tünaş', 'Kemal Sunal, Ülkü Özen, Esengül Doğan, Reha Yurdakul, Nejat Gürçen, Muharrem Gürses, Muhteşem Durukan, Yadigar Ejder', null, 'People mistake a naive extra for his lookalike gangster and cause funny events.', 'People mistake a naive extra for his lookalike gangster and cause funny events.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/n2ccx4fqrQmqn7kx80yHL0KWztU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:123599'),
  ('118936280338311284', 'Gestapo''s Last Orgy', 1977, 'Horror, War, Drama', 'Claudio Catozzo, Cesare Canevari', 'Antonio Lucarella, Cesare Canevari', 'Daniela Poggi, Adriano Micantoni, Maristella Greco, Fulvio Ricciardi, Antiniska Nemour, Caterina Barbero, Domenico Seren Gay, Vittorio Joderi', 'R', 'Lise Cohen is taken to a special prisoner-of-war camp for female Jews, a camp run as a bordello to entertain the German officers and troops going in to battle. The camp is run with an iron fist by Commandant Starker and his minion Alma. Starker becomes frustrated when Lise demonstrates no fear, and devises cruel experiments to scare her, to no avail. Once she realizes her guilt is unfounded, Lise begins to play Starker''s game, but even though she begins living a better life, she doesn''t forget the atrocities she has seen and experienced.', 'Lise Cohen is taken to a special prisoner-of-war camp for female Jews, a camp run as a bordello to entertain the German officers and troops going in to battle. The camp is run with an iron fist by Commandant Starker and his minion Alma. Starker becomes frustrated when Lise demonstrates no fear, and devises cruel experiments to scare her, to no avail. Once she realizes her guilt is unfounded, Lise begins to play Starker''s game, but even though she begins living a better life, she doesn''t forget the atrocities she has seen and experienced.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lLnhAs01wHT8wQ6zTXTwBYl1u8j.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:39987'),
  ('916943504495755556', 'Gesture', 2026, 'Drama', 'Pouya Parsamagham, Hooman Behmanesh', 'Pouya Parsamagham', 'Ali Mosaffa, Nazanin Farahani, Vahid Moghadasi, Morteza Farshbaf, Rastin Ghafoori', null, 'Ali learns through medical documents the sudden recurrence of his son''s incurable genetic disorder. Deciding to hide the matter from the rest of the family, he finds himself helpless and starts behaving strangely.', 'Ali learns through medical documents the sudden recurrence of his son''s incurable genetic disorder. Deciding to hide the matter from the rest of the family, he finds himself helpless and starts behaving strangely.', 'https://images.plex.tv/photo?size=large-1280&url=https%3A%2F%2Fmetadata-static.plex.tv%2Fc%2Fgracenote%2Fcba2d88e94c91954b756d91af587b9ea.jpg', 'plex:movie:gesture'),
  ('1097446606752059516', 'Gesualdo: Death for Five Voices', 1995, 'Documentary, TV Movie, Music, History', 'Werner Herzog, Rudolph Herzog, Pietro Medioli', 'Werner Herzog', 'Milva, Alan Curtis, Werner Herzog, Walter Beloch, Angelo Carrabs, Francesco D''Avalos, Salvatore Catorano, Vincenzo Giusto', null, 'Works, legend and murders of Carlo Gesualdo, a notorious Italian composer and murderer from 16th century.', 'Works, legend and murders of Carlo Gesualdo, a notorious Italian composer and murderer from 16th century.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/y4CMKllPHgMno7Uvigqic56pvmM.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:97707'),
  ('142216785837324533', 'Get a Clue', 2002, 'Family, Comedy, Mystery, TV Movie', 'Maggie Greenwald, Rhett Morita, Roman Buchok', 'Alana Sanko', 'Lindsay Lohan, Bug Hall, Ian Gomez, Brenda Song, Al Mukadam, Dan Lett, Amanda Plummer, Charles Shaughnessy', 'G', 'A wealthy student with too much fashion sense, her equally rich friends, and her rival/superior from the school paper work together to solve the case when their teacher goes missing.', 'A wealthy student with too much fashion sense, her equally rich friends, and her rival/superior from the school paper work together to solve the case when their teacher goes missing.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9NhdXavPBUPYkdBwCaatOIGwGjp.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:26189'),
  ('232870244598728979', 'Get a Horse!', 2013, 'Animation, Family, Comedy', 'Lauren MacMullan', null, 'Walt Disney, Marcellite Garner, Russi Taylor, Billy Bletcher, Will Ryan, Bob Bergen, Paul Briggs, Terri Douglas', 'G', 'Mickey, Minnie, Horace Horsecollar, and Clarabelle Cow go on a musical wagon ride until Peg-Leg Pete tries to run them off the road.', 'Mickey, Minnie, Horace Horsecollar, and Clarabelle Cow go on a musical wagon ride until Peg-Leg Pete tries to run them off the road.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/axVSbOZxa6Xp0ticSJA6faVeyDY.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:234567'),
  ('338093124103420173', 'Get a Job', 2016, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Dylan Kidd, Stephen E. Hagen, Jon Recher', 'Kyle Pennekamp, Scott Turpel', 'Miles Teller, Anna Kendrick, Bryan Cranston, Nicholas Braun, Brandon T. Jackson, Christopher Mintz-Plasse, Alison Brie, Marcia Gay Harden', 'R', 'Life after college graduation is not exactly going as planned for Will and Jillian who find themselves lost in a sea of increasingly strange jobs. But with help from their family, friends and coworkers they soon discover that the most important (and hilarious) adventures are the ones that we don''t see coming.', 'Life after college graduation is not exactly going as planned for Will and Jillian who find themselves lost in a sea of increasingly strange jobs. But with help from their family, friends and coworkers they soon discover that the most important (and hilarious) adventures are the ones that we don''t see coming.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eElBXTTBBy9xgnJh6rMQcXm17En.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:186759'),
  ('987237346721798893', 'Get a Room', 2016, 'Comedy', 'Mauro Carvalho, Thiago Cazado', null, 'Leonardo Vieira Teles, Thiago Cazado, Arlyson Gomes', null, 'Daniel sets a date for casual sex with a stranger at his place. He lives moments of adrenaline in a night where not everything is what it seems.', 'Daniel sets a date for casual sex with a stranger at his place. He lives moments of adrenaline in a night where not everything is what it seems.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8BJStrCnkwQ1qo2buNMRb8bP3Bu.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:426348'),
  ('289342779714382610', 'Get Away', 2024, 'Horror, Comedy', 'Steffen Haars, Joris Kerbosch', 'Nick Frost', 'Nick Frost, Aisling Bea, Sebastian Croft, Maisie Ayres, Ville Virtanen, Eero Milonoff, Anitta Suikkari, Jouko Ahola', 'R', 'A family''s vacation to a remote getaway takes an unexpected turn when they discover the island they''re on is inhabited by a serial killer.', 'A family''s vacation to a remote getaway takes an unexpected turn when they discover the island they''re on is inhabited by a serial killer.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ser6ZCKHMXhQISKULYCxz6Saf3I.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1201753'),
  ('497671969147739736', 'Get Bruce!', 1999, 'Comedy, Documentary', 'Andrew J. Kuehn', null, 'Whoopi Goldberg, Bette Midler, Nathan Lane, Lily Tomlin, Bruce Vilanch, Raquel Welch, Michael Feinstein, Shirley MacLaine', null, 'Affectionate tribute to Bruce Vilanch, who writes material for celebrities who make public appearances, from Oscar hosts and award recipients to Presidents. We meet his mom and see photos of his childhood; in Chicago, he writes for the Tribune and then heads West. Whoopi Goldberg, Billy Crystal, Robin Williams, and Bette Midler talk with him and to the camera about working with Bruce, and we also watch Bruce help others prepare for Liz Taylor''s 60th, Bill Clinton''s 50th, and an AIDS awards banquet where the hirsute, rotund Vilanch lets his emotions show.', 'Affectionate tribute to Bruce Vilanch, who writes material for celebrities who make public appearances, from Oscar hosts and award recipients to Presidents. We meet his mom and see photos of his childhood; in Chicago, he writes for the Tribune and then heads West. Whoopi Goldberg, Billy Crystal, Robin Williams, and Bette Midler talk with him and to the camera about working with Bruce, and we also watch Bruce help others prepare for Liz Taylor''s 60th, Bill Clinton''s 50th, and an AIDS awards banquet where the hirsute, rotund Vilanch lets his emotions show.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/f1uXB5YuDmaadM6wq5qTAIiK6Sr.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:68426'),
  ('643581500333837060', 'Get Carter', 1971, 'Crime, Thriller', 'Mike Hodges, Wolfgang Suschitzky', 'Mike Hodges, Ted Lewis', 'Michael Caine, Ian Hendry, Britt Ekland, John Osborne, Tony Beckley, George Sewell, Geraldine Moffat, Rosemarie Dunham', 'R', 'Jack Carter is a small-time hood working in London. When word reaches him of his brother''s death, he travels to Newcastle to attend the funeral. Refusing to accept the police report of suicide, Carter seeks out his brother’s friends and acquaintances to learn who murdered his sibling and why.', 'Jack Carter is a small-time hood working in London. When word reaches him of his brother''s death, he travels to Newcastle to attend the funeral. Refusing to accept the police report of suicide, Carter seeks out his brother’s friends and acquaintances to learn who murdered his sibling and why.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3AytAYzJuPmS4Wo8X3jcsaN4oM3.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1485'),
  ('892823517492226326', 'Get Carter', 2000, 'Action, Drama, Thriller, Crime', 'Stephen Kay, Mauro Fiore, Kevin Fair', 'David McKenna, Ted Lewis', 'Sylvester Stallone, Miranda Richardson, Rachael Leigh Cook, Alan Cumming, Mickey Rourke, John C. McGinley, Michael Caine, Rhona Mitra', 'R', 'Jack Carter, a mob enforcer living in Las Vegas, travels back to his hometown of Seattle for his brother''s funeral. During this visit, Carter realizes that the death of his brother was not accidental, but a murder. With this knowledge, Carter sets out to kill all those responsible.', 'Jack Carter, a mob enforcer living in Las Vegas, travels back to his hometown of Seattle for his brother''s funeral. During this visit, Carter realizes that the death of his brother was not accidental, but a murder. With this knowledge, Carter sets out to kill all those responsible.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xGANaRWD6638ch1qQmqgRp395R6.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:10461'),
  ('566434305006799682', 'Get Christie Love!', 1974, 'Thriller, Action, Drama, TV Movie', 'William A. Graham, Meredith M. Nicholson, Lorin Bennett Salob', null, 'Teresa Graves, Harry Guardino, Louise Sorel, Paul Stevens, Ron Rifkin, Lynne Holmes, Lee Paul, Titos Vandis', 'NR', 'Get Christie Love! is a 1974 made-for-television film starring Teresa Graves as an undercover female police detective who is determined to overthrow a drug ring. This film is based on Dorothy Uhnak''s crime-thriller novel, The Ledger.', 'Get Christie Love! is a 1974 made-for-television film starring Teresa Graves as an undercover female police detective who is determined to overthrow a drug ring. This film is based on Dorothy Uhnak''s crime-thriller novel, The Ledger.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9SVRYyzMn2hG7y7q9aAZvx62N95.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:252144'),
  ('574806843562450056', 'Get Crazy', 1983, 'Comedy, Music', 'Allan Arkush, Thomas Del Ruth', 'Henry Rosenbaum, Danny Opatoshu, David Taylor', 'Malcolm McDowell, Allen Garfield, Daniel Stern, Gail Edwards, Miles Chapin, Ed Begley Jr., Stacey Nelkin, Bill Henderson', 'R', 'Mega-promoter Colin Beverly plans to sabotage the New Year''s 1983 concert of small-time operator Max Wolfe. Wolfe''s assistants Neil Allen and Willie Loman find romance while trying to save the drugs, violence, and rock and roll from Beverly''s schemes.', 'Mega-promoter Colin Beverly plans to sabotage the New Year''s 1983 concert of small-time operator Max Wolfe. Wolfe''s assistants Neil Allen and Willie Loman find romance while trying to save the drugs, violence, and rock and roll from Beverly''s schemes.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/biOonZmJloMVqdz4g0ghFEnDtEr.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:29628'),
  ('1009309445819600793', 'Get Duked!', 2019, 'Comedy, Action, Horror', 'Ninian Doff, Patrick Meller', 'Ninian Doff', 'Lewis Gribben, Rian Gordon, Viraj Juneja, Jonathan Aris, Samuel Bottomley, James Cosmo, Eddie Izzard, Kate Dickie', 'R', 'An anarchic, hip-hop inspired comedy that follows four city boys on a wilderness trek as they try to escape a mysterious huntsman.', 'An anarchic, hip-hop inspired comedy that follows four city boys on a wilderness trek as they try to escape a mysterious huntsman.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/b52nqFj5XrBNA7MhqcnENvFsHtx.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:580629'),
  ('666606675811453623', 'Get Fast', 2024, 'Action, Crime, Thriller', 'James Clayton, Ryan Petey, Andrea Stefancikova', 'Cooper Bibaud, James Clayton', 'James Clayton, Lou Diamond Phillips, Fei Ren, Lee Majdoub, Alisha Ahamed, Philip Granger, James Hutson, Elan Ross Gibson', 'R', 'When The Thief’s partner is kidnapped after stealing millions in cash from a merciless drug lord named Nushi, he reluctantly teams up with an angst-ridden orphan to rescue him. Nushi enlists her most trusted hitman, The Cowboy, a lovable charmer who’s quick with his guns, to track down the Thief. Guns, cars, and explosions will give the newfound partners a head start, but how long will they be able to keep it up?', 'When The Thief’s partner is kidnapped after stealing millions in cash from a merciless drug lord named Nushi, he reluctantly teams up with an angst-ridden orphan to rescue him. Nushi enlists her most trusted hitman, The Cowboy, a lovable charmer who’s quick with his guns, to track down the Thief. Guns, cars, and explosions will give the newfound partners a head start, but how long will they be able to keep it up?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tDpTR7xhHu9cz1X4JAIRFwXyf6U.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1369679'),
  ('883969057049471957', 'Get Hard', 2015, 'Comedy', 'Etan Cohen, Scott August, Matthew Gatlin', 'Jay Martel, Ian Roberts, Etan Cohen', 'Will Ferrell, Kevin Hart, Alison Brie, Craig T. Nelson, T.I., Greg Germann, Matt Walsh, Mariana Paola Vicente', 'R', 'When millionaire hedge fund manager James is convicted of fraud and sentenced to a stretch in San Quentin, the judge gives him one month to get his affairs in order. Knowing that he won''t survive more than a few minutes in prison on his own, James desperately turns to Darnell-- a black businessman who''s never even had a parking ticket -- for help. As Darnell puts James through the wringer, both learn that they were wrong about many things, including each other.', 'When millionaire hedge fund manager James is convicted of fraud and sentenced to a stretch in San Quentin, the judge gives him one month to get his affairs in order. Knowing that he won''t survive more than a few minutes in prison on his own, James desperately turns to Darnell-- a black businessman who''s never even had a parking ticket -- for help. As Darnell puts James through the wringer, both learn that they were wrong about many things, including each other.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rJPbS2cYOYhDCjT5NmW1Fm6gFl3.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:257091'),
  ('620639056712120840', 'Get Help', 2025, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Tiziano Russo, Vito Frangione', 'Roberto Proia, Giulio Carrieri', 'Matilde Gioli, Asia Argento, Francesco Centorame, Pierpaolo Spollon, Camilla Carniello, Luigi Cesolini, Chiara Dell''Omodarme, Maurizio Di Carmine', null, 'Sandra, a young Psychology graduate, has just been hired by the famous online psychotherapy site FATTIVEDERE.COM. But when she returns home to tell everything to Stefano, her boyfriend with whom she has been happily cohabiting for 10 years, she finds him with his suitcases in his hands. He is dumping her without giving her an explanation. Sandra goes into total crisis because she demands to know why she has been left. Paradoxically, during her first day at work, she realizes not only that a website bug has given her the identity and photo of a sprightly 70-year-old woman, but also that one of her first patients is her ex. She is in time to switch off the webcam so as not to be recognized and, disguising her voice, she pretends to be the elderly psychotherapist...', 'Sandra, a young Psychology graduate, has just been hired by the famous online psychotherapy site FATTIVEDERE.COM. But when she returns home to tell everything to Stefano, her boyfriend with whom she has been happily cohabiting for 10 years, she finds him with his suitcases in his hands. He is dumping her without giving her an explanation. Sandra goes into total crisis because she demands to know why she has been left. Paradoxically, during her first day at work, she realizes not only that a website bug has given her the identity and photo of a sprightly 70-year-old woman, but also that one of her first patients is her ex. She is in time to switch off the webcam so as not to be recognized and, disguising her voice, she pretends to be the elderly psychotherapist...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5FQgpPISI2QGgSthhuYCKGQNH87.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1389705'),
  ('86221295141830907', 'Get Her... If You Can', 2019, 'Comedy', 'Inés de León, Miguel P. Gilaberte, Sara Mazkiarán', 'Astrid Gil-Casares, Rafa Russo, Breixo Corral', 'Amaia Salamanca, Javier Rey, Leticia Dolera, Walter Orellana, Mariam Hernández, Brays Efe, Daniel Pérez Prada, Santiago Segura', null, 'Roberto and Daniela are two siblings who live in a world of wealth and glamor thanks to the shipping company they inherited from their father. Both share the direction of the company, although they have a completely opposite attitude to life: Daniela is thorough and perfectionist; Roberto, on the other hand, is a visionary genius who hates the meticulousness of his sister. However, both find the way out of their disagreements when they fall in love with the same woman: Isabel (Dolera), a monologist who Roberto has hired to seduce Daniela and so be as fun as she was before taking the address of the company.', 'Roberto and Daniela are two siblings who live in a world of wealth and glamor thanks to the shipping company they inherited from their father. Both share the direction of the company, although they have a completely opposite attitude to life: Daniela is thorough and perfectionist; Roberto, on the other hand, is a visionary genius who hates the meticulousness of his sister. However, both find the way out of their disagreements when they fall in love with the same woman: Isabel (Dolera), a monologist who Roberto has hired to seduce Daniela and so be as fun as she was before taking the address of the company.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dduVIOVouv2u8BI3PESjcMxXmz5.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:533984'),
  ('747544987668789599', 'Get Him to the Greek', 2010, 'Adventure, Comedy, Music', 'Nicholas Stoller, Dawn Massaro, Gary Marcus', 'Nicholas Stoller', 'Jonah Hill, Russell Brand, Rose Byrne, Elisabeth Moss, Tyler McKinney, Zoe Salmon, Lino Facioli, Eric Marshall', 'R', 'Pinnacle records has the perfect plan to get their sinking company back on track: a comeback concert in LA featuring Aldous Snow, a fading rockstar who has dropped off the radar in recent years. Record company intern Aaron Green is faced with the monumental task of bringing his idol, out of control rock star Aldous Snow, back to LA for his comeback show.', 'Pinnacle records has the perfect plan to get their sinking company back on track: a comeback concert in LA featuring Aldous Snow, a fading rockstar who has dropped off the radar in recent years. Record company intern Aaron Green is faced with the monumental task of bringing his idol, out of control rock star Aldous Snow, back to LA for his comeback show.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6g0li87w8LIK77QRUtOkQkM6bD7.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:32823'),
  ('270705901181299347', 'Get In', 2019, 'Thriller', 'Laurent Tangy, Olivier Abbou', 'Olivier Abbou, Aurélien Molas', 'Adama Niane, Stéphane Caillard, Paul Hamy, Eddy Leduc, Hubert Delattre, Leila Amara, Coline Beal, Carine Bouquillon', null, 'When the Diallo family return home from their holiday, they find the locks have been changed and the new occupants maintain they are in "their home". With no one to turn to, patriarch Paul gets closer to Mickey, a shady local man with a penchant for all things extreme and illegal. Soon the once anti-violent teacher is approaching the point of no return…', 'When the Diallo family return home from their holiday, they find the locks have been changed and the new occupants maintain they are in "their home". With no one to turn to, patriarch Paul gets closer to Mickey, a shady local man with a penchant for all things extreme and illegal. Soon the once anti-violent teacher is approaching the point of no return…', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wX6Cd4RDkrrpVudHELcUhNkF2T8.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:622654'),
  ('227786663554811506', 'Get Low', 2010, 'Drama, Mystery, Comedy', 'Aaron Schneider, David Boyd', 'Chris Provenzano, C. Gaby Mitchell', 'Robert Duvall, Bill Murray, Sissy Spacek, Lucas Black, Bill Cobbs, Gerald McRaney, Scott Cooper, Chandler Riggs', 'PG-13', 'A movie spun out of equal parts folk tale, fable and real-life legend about the mysterious, 1930s Tennessee hermit who famously threw his own rollicking funeral party... while he was still alive.', 'A movie spun out of equal parts folk tale, fable and real-life legend about the mysterious, 1930s Tennessee hermit who famously threw his own rollicking funeral party... while he was still alive.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6uUaQ5zn9neK1VLqO2sGClbJrb9.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:44718'),
  ('613074599978372083', 'Get Lucky', 2019, 'Comedy', 'Hannes Hubach, Ziska Riemann', 'Ziska Riemann, Madeleine Fricke, Oneil Sharma', 'Palina Rojinski, Bjarne Meisel, Emma-Katharina Suthe, Lilly Terzic, Benny Opoku-Arthur, Luissa Cara Hansen, Jascha Baum, Moritz Jahn', null, 'Six teenagers experience tumultuous vacation at the Baltic Sea with a lot of sun and beach. At the holiday home they meet the sexologist Ellen. The teenagers experience their first love, the first sex and what possibly can go wrong.', 'Six teenagers experience tumultuous vacation at the Baltic Sea with a lot of sun and beach. At the holiday home they meet the sexologist Ellen. The teenagers experience their first love, the first sex and what possibly can go wrong.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uZHkJG8y5VtlERx9PL6yCNK6AKi.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:613247'),
  ('990880870921327657', 'Get Married If You Can', 2014, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Marco Polo Constandse', 'Martha Higareda', 'Martha Higareda, Luis Gerardo Méndez, Michel Brown, Juan Pablo Medina, Fernando Luján, Miriam Higareda, Richie Mestre, Rocío García', null, 'Ana Paula catches her fiancé cheating. After a night of drinking, she wakes up far from home, not so certain she wants to go back.', 'Ana Paula catches her fiancé cheating. After a night of drinking, she wakes up far from home, not so certain she wants to go back.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qShzlTIGJRDENDgvgVVvrIqpmIJ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:252444'),
  ('708129696021967996', 'Get Me Roger Stone', 2017, 'Documentary', 'Daniel DiMauro, Morgan Pehme, Dylan Bank', 'Daniel DiMauro, Morgan Pehme, Dylan Bank', 'Roger Stone, Donald Trump, Paul Manafort, Jeffrey Toobin, Jane Mayer, Nydia Stone, Wayne Barrett, Harry Siegel', null, 'From his days of testifying at the Watergate hearings to advising recent presidential candidate Donald Trump, Roger Stone has long offended people on both sides of the political fence as a force in conservative America. Outspoken author, pundit, ahead of his time election strategist, this is his story.', 'From his days of testifying at the Watergate hearings to advising recent presidential candidate Donald Trump, Roger Stone has long offended people on both sides of the political fence as a force in conservative America. Outspoken author, pundit, ahead of his time election strategist, this is his story.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/n0FXjHHG4a0apw3X4zggpIC5fih.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:448448'),
  ('780280465188133332', 'Get Mean', 1975, 'Western', 'Ferdinando Baldi, Mario Perino', 'Wolf Lowenthal, Lloyd Battista, Ferdinando Baldi', 'Tony Anthony, Diana Lorys, Lloyd Battista, Raf Baldassarre, David Dreyer, Mirta Miller, Raúl Castro, Ferdinando Baldi', 'PG', 'The plot revolves around the return of a Spanish princess from America to her native country Spain. To help her she enlists the aid of a reluctant hero.', 'The plot revolves around the return of a Spanish princess from America to her native country Spain. To help her she enlists the aid of a reluctant hero.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4DnyqSqxMhdvrx0Nwr3EZi1ygau.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:121927'),
  ('1026637291728832218', 'Get on the Bus', 1996, 'History, Adventure, Drama', 'Spike Lee, Elliot Davis, Reuben Cannon', 'Reggie Rock Bythewood', 'Richard Belzer, De''Aundre Bonds, Andre Braugher, Thomas Jefferson Byrd, Gabriel Casseus, Albert Hall, Hill Harper, Harry Lennix', 'R', 'Fifteen Black men gather in South Central LA to take a cross-country bus trip to attend the Million Man March in Washington, DC in October 1995. Among the attendees are an eclectic set of characters, including a laid-off aircraft worker, a man whose at-risk son is handcuffed to him, a Black Republican, a former gangsta, a Hollywood actor, a cop of mixed racial background, and a white bus driver. All make the trek discussing issues surrounding the March, including manhood, religion, politics, sexuality, and race.', 'Fifteen Black men gather in South Central LA to take a cross-country bus trip to attend the Million Man March in Washington, DC in October 1995. Among the attendees are an eclectic set of characters, including a laid-off aircraft worker, a man whose at-risk son is handcuffed to him, a Black Republican, a former gangsta, a Hollywood actor, a cop of mixed racial background, and a white bus driver. All make the trek discussing issues surrounding the March, including manhood, religion, politics, sexuality, and race.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7p8FvHMSr11LQw9Xv6dPJdrBeU2.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:49471'),
  ('825785751460102505', 'Get On Up', 2014, 'Drama, Music, History', 'Tate Taylor, Stephen Goldblatt, Cleta Elaine Ellington', 'John-Henry Butterworth, Jez Butterworth, Steven Baigelman', 'Chadwick Boseman, Nelsan Ellis, Dan Aykroyd, Viola Davis, Lennie James, Fred Melamed, Jill Scott, Octavia Spencer', 'PG-13', 'A chronicle of James Brown''s rise from extreme poverty to become one of the most influential musicians in history.', 'A chronicle of James Brown''s rise from extreme poverty to become one of the most influential musicians in history.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dVbGeU5agxFGcJnL5hk4uO8W7i2.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:239566'),
  ('348858303438680383', 'Get Out', 2010, 'Comedy, Animation', 'Pascal Han-Kwan, Tristan Reinarz, Fanny Roche', null, 'Jacques Briere, Philippe Peythieu', null, 'A doctor unrelentingly tries to convince a phobic guy to come out of his isolation room.', 'A doctor unrelentingly tries to convince a phobic guy to come out of his isolation room.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jmZhoQBUHHA0JA5JtjybZiGrlYG.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:130627'),
  ('724860331049402037', 'Get Out', 2017, 'Mystery, Thriller, Horror', 'Jordan Peele, Toby Oliver, Ram Paul Silbey', 'Jordan Peele', 'Daniel Kaluuya, Allison Williams, Catherine Keener, Bradley Whitford, Caleb Landry Jones, Marcus Henderson, Betty Gabriel, LaKeith Stanfield', 'R', 'Chris and his girlfriend Rose go upstate to visit her parents for the weekend. At first, Chris reads the family''s overly accommodating behavior as nervous attempts to deal with their daughter''s interracial relationship, but as the weekend progresses, a series of increasingly disturbing discoveries lead him to a truth that he never could have imagined.', 'Chris and his girlfriend Rose go upstate to visit her parents for the weekend. At first, Chris reads the family''s overly accommodating behavior as nervous attempts to deal with their daughter''s interracial relationship, but as the weekend progresses, a series of increasingly disturbing discoveries lead him to a truth that he never could have imagined.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mE24wUCfjK8AoBBjaMjho7Rczr7.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:419430'),
