  ('796181743687024411', 'Get the Gringo', 2012, 'Action, Thriller, Crime, Drama', 'Adrian Grünberg, Benoît Debie, J.J. Perry', 'Mel Gibson', 'Mel Gibson, Kevin Hernandez, Daniel Giménez Cacho, Peter Stormare, Jesús Ochoa, Roberto Sosa, Dolores Heredia, Mario Zaragoza', 'R', 'A career criminal nabbed by Mexican authorities is placed in a tough prison where he learns to survive with the help of a 9-year-old boy.', 'A career criminal nabbed by Mexican authorities is placed in a tough prison where he learns to survive with the help of a 9-year-old boy.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/y4IACuEUGkygp2QsZPUEMY5Tlft.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:80389'),
  ('116541459116825879', 'Get the Hell Out', 2020, 'Comedy, Horror, Action', 'Wang I-fan, Seven Tsai', 'Wang I-fan, Yang Wan-ju, Chien Shih-Keng', 'Bruce He, Megan Lai, Tou Tsung-hua, Wang Chung-huang, Francesca Kao, Lin He-hsuan, Yu-Shan Lin, Wang Lan-shen', null, 'A group, lead by a loser MP and his assistant, must work together to stay alive after a virus infects the Taiwanese parliament and turns them all into ravenous zombies.', 'A group, lead by a loser MP and his assistant, must work together to stay alive after a virus infects the Taiwanese parliament and turns them all into ravenous zombies.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7TUiyxIlL8c7EVfy1gQWA39sBe4.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:717863'),
  ('537808872523486641', 'Get Thrashed', 2006, 'Documentary, Music', 'Rick Ernst', null, 'Lars Ulrich, Tom Angelripper, Phil Anselmo, Tom Araya, Bobby "Blitz" Ellsworth, Scott Ian, Dave Mustaine, Kerry King', null, 'Get Thrashed traces the rise, fall and impact of thrash metal; from its early years, through its influence on grunge, nu metal and today''s heavy metal scene. It is the story of the heaviest, hardest music of the 80s and early 90s as told by the bands who lived it, the fans and bands that grew up on it and by the artists that carry the "thrash metal" flag today.', 'Get Thrashed traces the rise, fall and impact of thrash metal; from its early years, through its influence on grunge, nu metal and today''s heavy metal scene. It is the story of the heaviest, hardest music of the 80s and early 90s as told by the bands who lived it, the fans and bands that grew up on it and by the artists that carry the "thrash metal" flag today.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hl3c0l9jeEe6hZSZOG4mBaXPk8T.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:29124'),
  ('381986050424069284', 'Get to Know Your Rabbit', 1972, 'Comedy', 'Brian De Palma, John A. Alonzo', 'Jordan Crittenden', 'Tom Smothers, John Astin, Susanne Zenor, Samantha Jones, Allen Garfield, Katharine Ross, Orson Welles, Hope Summers', 'R', 'A young businessman goes to a magic expert to learn hardness and skill with his cynical and greedy collaborators. He becomes a very good tap dancer, but will he be able to get free of his old boss?', 'A young businessman goes to a magic expert to learn hardness and skill with his cynical and greedy collaborators. He becomes a very good tap dancer, but will he be able to get free of his old boss?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tj3xzcFBbcmcrq4j0ZyjZhlN5AS.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:89417'),
  ('878372685483562764', 'Get Well Soon', 2014, 'Comedy', 'Jean Becker, Jean-Claude Larrieu', 'Jean-Loup Dabadie, Marie-Sabine Roger, Jean Becker', 'Gérard Lanvin, Fred Testot, Jean-Pierre Darroussin, Swann Arlaud, Claudia Tagbo, Anne-Sophie Lapix, Philippe Rebbot, Mona Jabeur', null, 'After an accident, Pierre, a sixty years old grumpy man, ends up stuck on an hospital bed with a cast. While Pierre dreams of silence and solitude with his strong character, the whole world seems to invite himself to his hospital bed. Powerless, he has to support the daily visits of doctors,nurse and hospital staff then his closes including his brother Herve. Visits after visits, funny or touching, Pierre starts to reconsider some people and reexamine his environment. And after all, his stay becomes a second chance ...', 'After an accident, Pierre, a sixty years old grumpy man, ends up stuck on an hospital bed with a cast. While Pierre dreams of silence and solitude with his strong character, the whole world seems to invite himself to his hospital bed. Powerless, he has to support the daily visits of doctors,nurse and hospital staff then his closes including his brother Herve. Visits after visits, funny or touching, Pierre starts to reconsider some people and reexamine his environment. And after all, his stay becomes a second chance ...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3fyZRAawhST4tNtQplYgfwGJ9jw.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:289151'),
