  ('601259294280107751', 'Getaway', 2013, 'Action, Crime', 'Yaron Levy, Courtney Solomon, David A. Armstrong', 'Sean Finegan, Gregg Maxwell Parker', 'Ethan Hawke, Selena Gomez, Jon Voight, Rebecca Budig, Paul Freeman, Bruce Payne, Dimo Alexiev, Velislav Pavlov', 'PG-13', 'Former race car driver Brent Magna is pitted against the clock. Desperately trying to save the life of his kidnapped wife, Brent commandeers a custom Ford Shelby GT500 Super Snake, taking it and its unwitting owner on a high-speed race against time, at the command of the mysterious villain holding his wife hostage.', 'Former race car driver Brent Magna is pitted against the clock. Desperately trying to save the life of his kidnapped wife, Brent commandeers a custom Ford Shelby GT500 Super Snake, taking it and its unwitting owner on a high-speed race against time, at the command of the mysterious villain holding his wife hostage.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/z4sEWm1ykf9WX5WJU4XMD4oI5sI.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:146227'),
