  ('640904637060989230', 'Gettin'' Square', 2003, 'Comedy, Thriller, Crime', 'Jonathan Teplitzky, Garry Phillips', 'Chris Nyst', 'Sam Worthington, David Wenham, Timothy Spall, Freya Stafford, Gary Sweet, Richard Carter, David Field, Helen Thomson', null, 'Gettin'' Square is about starting over, keeping clean and going straight. Barry Wirth is fresh out of prison and determined to stay on the straight and narrow. But like his mate Johnny ''Spit'' Spiteri and reformed gangster turned restaurateur Dabba, he finds out the hard way that there are old scores and a few new ones that''ll make getting square a lot harder than he thought.', 'Gettin'' Square is about starting over, keeping clean and going straight. Barry Wirth is fresh out of prison and determined to stay on the straight and narrow. But like his mate Johnny ''Spit'' Spiteri and reformed gangster turned restaurateur Dabba, he finds out the hard way that there are old scores and a few new ones that''ll make getting square a lot harder than he thought.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pNmRcemD7hWuJkT2694ErOWU0K6.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:23201'),
  ('543005504204199016', 'Getting Any?', 1995, 'Comedy', 'Takeshi Kitano, Katsumi Yanagijima', 'Takeshi Kitano', 'Dankan, Moeko Ezawa, Hakuryu, Hideo Higashikokubaru, Akiji Kobayashi, Guadalcanal Taka, Tokie Hidari, Tetsuya Yuuki', null, 'While pursuing his dream of having car sex, a goofy middle-aged man makes all the wrong moves and ends up enrolling in a number of crazy escapades.', 'While pursuing his dream of having car sex, a goofy middle-aged man makes all the wrong moves and ends up enrolling in a number of crazy escapades.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/owvDqHOzdeN7nMiUBZfHtpgEWW.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:39767'),
  ('806134088555276196', 'Getting Away with Murder', 1996, 'Comedy', 'Harvey Miller, Frank Tidy', 'Harvey Miller', 'Dan Aykroyd, Lily Tomlin, Jack Lemmon, Bonnie Hunt, Brian Kerwin, Jerry Adler, Andy Romano, Robert Fields', 'R', 'When the very moralistic college ethics instructor Jack Lambert finds himself living next door to an accused German death camp commander, he takes it upon himself to rid the world of this man.', 'When the very moralistic college ethics instructor Jack Lambert finds himself living next door to an accused German death camp commander, he takes it upon himself to rid the world of this man.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zL9RbLQrhTyi60ZeXjc8hEIaTxf.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:25697'),
  ('227158410275675532', 'Getting Even with Dad', 1994, 'Comedy, Crime, Family', 'Howard Deutch, Tim Suhrstedt, Jack Gill', 'Jim Jennewein, Tom S. Parker', 'Macaulay Culkin, Ted Danson, Glenne Headly, Saul Rubinek, Gailard Sartain, Sam McMurray, Héctor Elizondo, Sydney Walker', 'PG', 'Con man Ray is going after one last heist – a stash of rare coins – when his estranged son Timmy unexpectedly shows up. Ray is too preoccupied with his robbery to spend time with his son, so Timmy blackmails him into acting like a father, hiding the coins and promises to return them only after Ray takes him to amusement parks and baseball games.', 'Con man Ray is going after one last heist – a stash of rare coins – when his estranged son Timmy unexpectedly shows up. Ray is too preoccupied with his robbery to spend time with his son, so Timmy blackmails him into acting like a father, hiding the coins and promises to return them only after Ray takes him to amusement parks and baseball games.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/txsmdQqbgSz5Zu3rgd9fglMqKA4.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:41579'),
  ('1017473680205840055', 'Getting Home', 2007, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Zhang Yang, Nelson Yu Lik-wai', 'Zhang Yang, Wang Yao', 'Zhao Benshan, Qiwen Hong, Song Dandan, Liao Fan, Hu Jun, Guo Degang, Wu Ma', null, 'A black comedy about a farmer who tries to bring home the body of his friend, who died far from their town.', 'A black comedy about a farmer who tries to bring home the body of his friend, who died far from their town.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/l3ESk3iFDhrLWKeFnzlsPCS7s7j.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:36113'),
  ('1023726712857700386', 'Getting Into Heaven', 1970, 'Comedy', 'Edward L. Montoro, James Somich', 'Edward L. Montoro', 'Uschi Digard, Jennie Lynn, Miles White, Scott Cameron, Phyllis Stengel', null, 'Miss Heaven wishes very much to get into films, but first she must meet Sin through Salacity, that is, have all sorts of sex on a producer''s couch.', 'Miss Heaven wishes very much to get into films, but first she must meet Sin through Salacity, that is, have all sorts of sex on a producer''s couch.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fYWFx5O3uLCP3CpiXV4LqpuwvzM.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:120267'),
  ('11598776942300424', 'Getting It On', 1983, 'Comedy', 'William Olsen', 'William Olsen', 'Martin Yost, Heather Kennedy, Jeff Edmond, Kathy Brickmeier, Mark Alan Ferri, C.K. Bibby, Terry Loughlin, Caroline McDonald', 'R', 'An ordinary sex-starved teenager and his friends start secretly video recording high school girls and their activity irks the community, as well as their principal.', 'An ordinary sex-starved teenager and his friends start secretly video recording high school girls and their activity irks the community, as well as their principal.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hxB0DeYPyo6vOa4A6BmFiH3TyO8.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:81894'),
  ('391946538988102926', 'Getting It Right', 1989, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Randal Kleiser, Clive Tickner', 'Elizabeth Jane Howard', 'Jesse Birdsall, Lynn Redgrave, Helena Bonham Carter, Jane Horrocks, Richard Huw, Kevin Drinkwater, Pat Heywood, Bryan Pringle', null, 'Gavin is 31 years old and still lives with his parents. He is awfully shy but before he knows it there are three women interested in him. Lady Minerva Munday has a casual way of life and lives in a basement, Joan is an over-sexed millionairess, married to a Greek architect. But Gavin prefers the ugly assistant in the barbershop.', 'Gavin is 31 years old and still lives with his parents. He is awfully shy but before he knows it there are three women interested in him. Lady Minerva Munday has a casual way of life and lives in a basement, Joan is an over-sexed millionairess, married to a Greek architect. But Gavin prefers the ugly assistant in the barbershop.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bwLXdy17z5qk3WA8xLh4skM55p1.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:86959'),
  ('904215546794269498', 'Getting Lucky', 1989, 'Comedy, Fantasy', 'Michael Paul Girard, Gerald M. Williams', 'Michael Paul Girard', 'Steven Cooke, Lezlie Z. McCraw, Rick McDowell, Garry Kluger, Jean Stewart, Richard Monda, Pattie Gordon, C.J. Merrill', null, 'School nerd Bill just wants to save the world and to score a date with cheerleader babe Chrissie Schackler. Both become real possibilities when he finds an alcoholic Leprechaun in a beer bottle he was about to recycle. Wacky hijinks ensue as the leprechaun, Lepkey, messes up a few of the wishes. Can Bill fight off school jock Tony Chanuka and marry Chrissie so they can fulfill their dream of opening a clinic?', 'School nerd Bill just wants to save the world and to score a date with cheerleader babe Chrissie Schackler. Both become real possibilities when he finds an alcoholic Leprechaun in a beer bottle he was about to recycle. Wacky hijinks ensue as the leprechaun, Lepkey, messes up a few of the wishes. Can Bill fight off school jock Tony Chanuka and marry Chrissie so they can fulfill their dream of opening a clinic?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mAKns7jbJD2rBwCE0K2aMW67uj.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:93922'),
  ('1140684125878375202', 'Getting My Ex-wife Back', 2018, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Gabriel Guzmán', 'Gabriel Guzmán, Miguel Valdéz-López', 'Andrés Almeida, Adriana Louvier, Sofía Niño de Rivera, Jan Cornet, Ricardo O''Farrill, Mía Rubín Legarreta, Anabel Ferreira, Emilio Guerrero', null, 'When washed-out, has-been actor Francisco, finds out that his ex-wife is about to remarry and take their daughter to live abroad, he''ll manipulate everyone around him to stop the wedding and get his family back.', 'When washed-out, has-been actor Francisco, finds out that his ex-wife is about to remarry and take their daughter to live abroad, he''ll manipulate everyone around him to stop the wedding and get his family back.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9dqWfaK5mwQ4FFpkgGgmMDpjns4.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:548176'),
  ('18028086492033703', 'Getting Played', 2005, 'Comedy, Romance', 'David Silberg, Francis Kenny, Daniel Carrey', 'David Silberg', 'Vivica A. Fox, Bill Bellamy, Carmen Electra, Stacey Dash, Kathy Najimy, Joe Torry, Dorian Gregory, Mindy Sterling', 'PG-13', 'Three smart and sexy friends, Andrea, Lauren and Emily, are fed up with being played by the men in their lives. To prove that all men are predictable and easily seduced, this hot trio decides to play by a new set of rules. They enter into a wild game of seduction to convince one lucky man that he''s living the dream... but what the girls don''t realize is their mark is on to their game and he''s got a few plays of his own. Can the girls win? Or, will this player''s double play end their game?', 'Three smart and sexy friends, Andrea, Lauren and Emily, are fed up with being played by the men in their lives. To prove that all men are predictable and easily seduced, this hot trio decides to play by a new set of rules. They enter into a wild game of seduction to convince one lucky man that he''s living the dream... but what the girls don''t realize is their mark is on to their game and he''s got a few plays of his own. Can the girls win? Or, will this player''s double play end their game?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3bK0BRVyO96qe5BOI3Lla0E9oko.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:18307'),
  ('66150075844106294', 'Getting Started', 1979, 'Animation, Comedy', 'Richard Condie, Ken Rodeck', null, 'Richard Condie, Jay Brazeau', null, 'A concert pianist prepares to begin his practising for a major concert coming up. Unfortunately, he has this procrastination problem that prevents him from getting any serious time done, even when his frustration with it literally driving him into a frenzy.', 'A concert pianist prepares to begin his practising for a major concert coming up. Unfortunately, he has this procrastination problem that prevents him from getting any serious time done, even when his frustration with it literally driving him into a frenzy.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/agupIW6QmvftgONq6YTUwrvu67r.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:210828'),
  ('443987072585366170', 'Getting Straight', 1970, 'Comedy, Drama, Romance', 'Richard Rush, Hawk Koch, Charles Norton', 'Robert Kaufman', 'Elliott Gould, Candice Bergen, Robert F. Lyons, Cecil Kellaway, Jeff Corey, Max Julien, Jon Lormer, Leonard Stone', 'R', 'Graduate student Harry Bailey was once one of the most visible undergraduate activists on campus, but now that he''s back studying for his master''s, he''s trying to fly right. Trouble is, the campus is exploding with various student movements, and Harry''s girlfriend, Jan, is caught up in most of them. As Harry gets closer to finishing his degree, he finds his iconoclastic attitude increasingly aligned with the students rather than the faculty.', 'Graduate student Harry Bailey was once one of the most visible undergraduate activists on campus, but now that he''s back studying for his master''s, he''s trying to fly right. Trouble is, the campus is exploding with various student movements, and Harry''s girlfriend, Jan, is caught up in most of them. As Harry gets closer to finishing his degree, he finds his iconoclastic attitude increasingly aligned with the students rather than the faculty.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qwyyq5lMFWTO1xS2qWI48Be5tdU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:42588'),
  ('1138059049866152267', 'Getting There', 2002, 'Family, Comedy, Adventure', 'James M. LeGoy, David Lewis, Brian Sullivan', 'Michael Swerdlick', 'Mary-Kate Olsen, Ashley Olsen, Billy Aaron Brown, Heather Lindell, Jeff D''Agostino, Talon Ellithorpe, Holly Towne, Alexandra Picatto', 'G', 'Taylor and Kylie Hunter are sweet sixteen and licensed to drive. Grab a seat in their classic Mustang convertible as they set out on their very first road trip, to the Winter Games in Utah. Cute outfits, even cuter guys. And all kinds of friends along the way. But watch for Olympic-size detours. Will they ever make it to the velvet-smooth ski slopes and posh Stein Ericksen Lodge at Deer Valley and the big-air snowboarding at Park City? Will they be on time for the Winter Games? See for yourself why half the fun is getting there.', 'Taylor and Kylie Hunter are sweet sixteen and licensed to drive. Grab a seat in their classic Mustang convertible as they set out on their very first road trip, to the Winter Games in Utah. Cute outfits, even cuter guys. And all kinds of friends along the way. But watch for Olympic-size detours. Will they ever make it to the velvet-smooth ski slopes and posh Stein Ericksen Lodge at Deer Valley and the big-air snowboarding at Park City? Will they be on time for the Winter Games? See for yourself why half the fun is getting there.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2OAJU8pVky1T4fq41DfXZr7kWcG.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:54005'),
  ('761000446149261413', 'Getting to Know the Big Wide World', 1978, 'Drama', 'Kira Muratova, Yury Klimenko, Garri Belenky', 'Kira Muratova, Grigori Baklanov', 'Nina Ruslanova, Sergei Popov, Aleksei Zharkov, Natalya Leble, Olga Malakhova, Lena Shelgunova, Natasha Shelgunova, Lyudmila Gurchenko', null, 'On a rough and tumble construction site for a new factory, the conversation flows and love blooms for trio Lyuba, Misha, and Kolya. In the liminal space of their workplace, they build material and intangible connections.', 'On a rough and tumble construction site for a new factory, the conversation flows and love blooms for trio Lyuba, Misha, and Kolya. In the liminal space of their workplace, they build material and intangible connections.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vttxDyd9VD0YLEZbGCVh3IPF0TR.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:263837'),
  ('367868581627235494', 'Gettysburg', 1993, 'Drama, History, War', 'Ronald F. Maxwell, Kees Van Oostrum, Skip Cosper', 'Ronald F. Maxwell', 'Jeff Daniels, Tom Berenger, Martin Sheen, Sam Elliott, Stephen Lang, C. Thomas Howell, Richard Anderson, Richard Jordan', 'PG', 'In the summer of 1863, General Robert E. Lee leads the Confederate Army of Northern Virginia into Gettysburg, Pennsylvania with the goal of marching through to Washington, D.C. The Union Army of the Potomac, under the command of General George G. Meade, forms a defensive position to confront the rebel forces in what will prove to be the decisive battle of the American Civil War.', 'In the summer of 1863, General Robert E. Lee leads the Confederate Army of Northern Virginia into Gettysburg, Pennsylvania with the goal of marching through to Washington, D.C. The Union Army of the Potomac, under the command of General George G. Meade, forms a defensive position to confront the rebel forces in what will prove to be the decisive battle of the American Civil War.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/k0XKdT3QbycMB8f2H7CEZVx2t4m.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:10655'),
  ('331721484603441891', 'Getulio', 2014, 'Drama, History', 'João Jardim, Gigi Soares, Fernanda Neves', 'Teresa Frota, George Moura', 'Tony Ramos, Drica Moraes, Alexandre Borges, Adriano Garib, Fernando Luís, Leonardo Medeiros, Alexandre Nero, José Raposo', null, 'The movie depicts the political crisis that led to the suicide of president Getúlio Vargas, in the 19 days that preceded August 24, 1954. The crisis began with the attempted assassination of journalist and politician Carlos Lacerda in August 5, 1954, at rua Toneleros, Rio de Janeiro, in which Major Vaz was assassinated instead. Investigations pointed to Gregório Fortunato, chief of Vargas'' personal guard, as the orderer of the frustrated assassination. This incident was one of the most importants in the history of Brazil.', 'The movie depicts the political crisis that led to the suicide of president Getúlio Vargas, in the 19 days that preceded August 24, 1954. The crisis began with the attempted assassination of journalist and politician Carlos Lacerda in August 5, 1954, at rua Toneleros, Rio de Janeiro, in which Major Vaz was assassinated instead. Investigations pointed to Gregório Fortunato, chief of Vargas'' personal guard, as the orderer of the frustrated assassination. This incident was one of the most importants in the history of Brazil.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tAOyDRHraKlJlG5o9br4jxvJbwF.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:259719'),
  ('551229144518580668', 'Gezhi Town', 2025, 'Drama, War', 'Kong Sheng, Zeng Jian', 'Lan Xiaolong', 'Xiao Zhan, Peng Yuchang, Zhou Yiran, Yin Zheng, Yang Xinming, Alan Aruna, Gan Yunchen, Zhou Siyu', null, 'A group of Chinese refugees and straggler soldiers, led by a machinist, defend their mountain town, "Gezhi," against a surprise attack by Japanese reconnaissance troops in a desperate fight using civilian ingenuity against a trained military force.', 'A group of Chinese refugees and straggler soldiers, led by a machinist, defend their mountain town, "Gezhi," against a surprise attack by Japanese reconnaissance troops in a desperate fight using civilian ingenuity against a trained military force.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/24rBSxBq3WLlmNdzoL7Gl6nLZfG.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1356454'),
  ('652889903613812994', 'GG Bond: Lollipop in Fantasy', 2019, 'Animation, Family', 'Jinming Lu, Zhong Yu', 'Wang Xiaoli', '陆双', null, 'Little Jana loves magical hero GG Bond. As she grows up she looses her excitement about magic, until one day she opens a portal that takes her to her beloved heroe''s world.', 'Little Jana loves magical hero GG Bond. As she grows up she looses her excitement about magic, until one day she opens a portal that takes her to her beloved heroe''s world.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ycmaIdeOuyv7tbNwbzMvvzkTpWx.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:622627'),
  ('986026819925065714', 'GGS - Ganteng-Ganteng Sange', 2023, 'Drama, Romance', null, null, null, null, 'Kelas Bintang is back with this pack of drama called GGS - Ganteng-Ganteng Sange.', 'Kelas Bintang is back with this pack of drama called GGS - Ganteng-Ganteng Sange.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/39fFH027tOpTyZwSNOydSAsOCzb.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1135873'),
  ('909411353947674195', 'Ghajini', 2005, 'Action, Romance, Thriller', 'A. R. Murugadoss, R. D. Rajasekhar', 'A. R. Murugadoss', 'Suriya, Asin Thottumkal, Nayanthara, Pradeep Ram Singh Rawat, Riyaz Khan, Manobala, Sathyan Sivakumar, Venba', null, 'After being hit by an iron rod, Sanjay Ramaswamy, a business tycoon, suffers from anterograde amnesia. He is unable to remember anything beyond fifteen minutes. Under such circumstances, he sets out on a quest to find the people who were responsible for his lover Kalpana''s murder.', 'After being hit by an iron rod, Sanjay Ramaswamy, a business tycoon, suffers from anterograde amnesia. He is unable to remember anything beyond fifteen minutes. Under such circumstances, he sets out on a quest to find the people who were responsible for his lover Kalpana''s murder.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fWCiwGeABg5APrLGHV2IgxoP20N.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:69636'),
  ('129454433079620356', 'Ghajini', 2008, 'Action, Romance, Thriller', 'A. R. Murugadoss, Ravi K. Chandran', 'A. R. Murugadoss', 'Aamir Khan, Asin Thottumkal, Jiah Khan, Pradeep Ram Singh Rawat, Riyaz Khan, Khalid Siddiqui, Tinnu Anand, Sunil Grover', 'PG-13', 'A man suffering from anterograde amnesia as a result of a violent attack in the past sets out to avenge his girlfriend''s death with the aid of photographs, notes and tattoos all over his body.', 'A man suffering from anterograde amnesia as a result of a violent attack in the past sets out to avenge his girlfriend''s death with the aid of photographs, notes and tattoos all over his body.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kaj131xxVxJRCthraiaxRrCt7X.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:14070'),
  ('673882374364693969', 'Ghanchakkar', 2013, 'Comedy, Crime, Thriller', 'Raj Kumar Gupta, Hanish Kalia, Anmol Ahuja', 'Parveez Sheikh, Raj Kumar Gupta', 'Vidya Balan, Emraan Hashmi, Rajesh Sharma, Parvin Dabas, Namit Das, Shashank Shende, Mahabanoo Mody-Kotwal, Vishwanath Chatterjee', null, 'A safe cracker claims he has lost his memory when two criminals come calling for their cut of the bank heist loot.', 'A safe cracker claims he has lost his memory when two criminals come calling for their cut of the bank heist loot.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8hGSdhi7szg64w5mOqsdGGQdoqm.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:192097'),
  ('153707032595103386', 'Gharga', 2026, 'Thriller', 'M Shashidhar', 'Chethan Kumar, Nagendra Prasad', 'Rahul Dev, Dev Gill, Raagavi Gowda', null, 'A hidden place lures strangers with concealed truths. Are they hunters or hunted? Driven by desire, guilt, or something darker? A silent journey becomes a gripping thriller where secrets collide and identities blur.', 'A hidden place lures strangers with concealed truths. Are they hunters or hunted? Driven by desire, guilt, or something darker? A silent journey becomes a gripping thriller where secrets collide and identities blur.', 'https://images.plex.tv/photo?size=large-1280&url=https%3A%2F%2Fm.media-amazon.com%2Fimages%2FM%2FMV5BMjlkNmIyMzktZjU0NC00Y2ZiLWEyNzktZTE4NjE0ZTg4N2I2XkEyXkFqcGc%40._V1_.jpg', 'plex:movie:gharga'),
  ('28965121928042633', 'Ghastly', 2011, 'Horror, Thriller', 'Go Seok jin, Baek Dong-hyeon, Yun-ho Yang', 'Kim Yu-ra', 'Han Da-gam, Lee Hyeong-seok, Hyomin, Park Sung-min, Baek Su-ryeon, Kim Jin-sung, Hwang Ji-hyeon, No Min-woo', null, 'After his parents are murdered, Bin is taken into the care of relatives. He begins to act strangely, the new occupants of his house experience horrific nightmares, and a mystery unfolds as a terrible secret is revealed.', 'After his parents are murdered, Bin is taken into the care of relatives. He begins to act strangely, the new occupants of his house experience horrific nightmares, and a mystery unfolds as a terrible secret is revealed.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3mPlfFjdGqc7569GkppAXvnsxRm.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:100702'),
  ('974994070871950222', 'Ghatak', 1996, 'Action, Drama', 'Rajkumar Santoshi, Ishwar Bidri', 'Rajkumar Santoshi', 'Sunny Deol, Meenakshi Sheshadri, Danny Denzongpa, Amrish Puri, K.K. Raina, Tinnu Anand, Om Puri, Mukesh Rishi', null, 'Katya, a ruthless mobster, rules over the town with an iron fist. When newcomer Kashi dares to challenge his reign of terror, he faces brutal consequences.', 'Katya, a ruthless mobster, rules over the town with an iron fist. When newcomer Kashi dares to challenge his reign of terror, he faces brutal consequences.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iuoKFDCV58P5GCqlNTi9S2X2Q3C.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:118632'),
  ('339686779745353282', 'Ghayal', 1990, 'Action, Crime, Drama', 'Rajkumar Santoshi', 'Rajkumar Santoshi', 'Sunny Deol, Meenakshi Sheshadri, Amrish Puri, Raj Babbar, Moushumi Chatterjee, Kulbhushan Kharbanda, Om Puri, Deep Dhillon', null, 'Ajay is framed by Balwant Rai for his brother''s murder and sent to prison. Later, he befriends three convicts and sets out to seek revenge against Balwant Rai.', 'Ajay is framed by Balwant Rai for his brother''s murder and sent to prison. Later, he befriends three convicts and sets out to seek revenge against Balwant Rai.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/r8n2JqfyxoL1qBEp8JnnyiFg2fU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:71308'),
  ('179585165217799430', 'Ghayal Once Again', 2016, 'Action, Crime, Drama', 'Dan Bradley, Sunny Deol', 'Sanjay Masoom, Vishal Vijay Kumar', 'Sunny Deol, Om Puri, Soha Ali Khan, Narendra Jha, Aanchal Munjal, Shivam Patil, Meenakshi Sheshadri, Ramesh Deo', null, 'Ajay Mehra (from previous Ghayal-1990), after finishing off his life sentence, starts a newspaper called Satyakam. Still dealing with the haunting trauma of losing his loved ones, Ajay manages to make a credible name for himself in investigative journalism. Working with a strange team of RTI activists, ex-criminals and ilk; and even stranger ways of unearthing and presenting truth, Ajay Mehra has earned quite a fan following among the youths, who finds his fearless and unforgiving approach in dealing with all kinds of sociopaths very inspiring.', 'Ajay Mehra (from previous Ghayal-1990), after finishing off his life sentence, starts a newspaper called Satyakam. Still dealing with the haunting trauma of losing his loved ones, Ajay manages to make a credible name for himself in investigative journalism. Working with a strange team of RTI activists, ex-criminals and ilk; and even stranger ways of unearthing and presenting truth, Ajay Mehra has earned quite a fan following among the youths, who finds his fearless and unforgiving approach in dealing with all kinds of sociopaths very inspiring.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pLJDxJ9WzPLu1mlWZNAUnZh5h4.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:381298'),
  ('441276885246509506', 'Ghetto', 2006, 'History, War', 'Audrius Juzėnas, Andrejus Vasilenko, Andreas Höfer', 'Joshua Sobol', 'Heino Ferch, Sebastian Hülk, Marozsán Erika, Vytautas Šapranauskas, Asta Baukutė, Margarita Žiemelytė, Darius Meškauskas, Mantas Vaitiekūnas', null, 'In 1942, in Vilna, the Nazi annihilate 55,000 Jews and squeeze the 15,000 survivors in a seven blocks ghetto. The twenty-two year old sadistic commander Kittel is assigned to administrate the ghetto in the capital of Lithuania, becoming the master of life or death. When he finds the gorgeous Hayyah sneaking with one kilo of beam stolen from the German army, he sentences her to death; but when he is informed that she was a former successful singer, he decides to activate the old theater and promote shows in the ghetto. The Jew Chief of Police Gens uses the theater and a sewing factory to save as much lives as he can; in his ambiguous position, he kills Jews to save lives of others.', 'In 1942, in Vilna, the Nazi annihilate 55,000 Jews and squeeze the 15,000 survivors in a seven blocks ghetto. The twenty-two year old sadistic commander Kittel is assigned to administrate the ghetto in the capital of Lithuania, becoming the master of life or death. When he finds the gorgeous Hayyah sneaking with one kilo of beam stolen from the German army, he sentences her to death; but when he is informed that she was a former successful singer, he decides to activate the old theater and promote shows in the ghetto. The Jew Chief of Police Gens uses the theater and a sewing factory to save as much lives as he can; in his ambiguous position, he kills Jews to save lives of others.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/a8TQFtHVJibpYtWQMX63alj2M8j.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:18619'),
  ('131966004770325272', 'Ghetto Blaster', 1989, 'Drama, Action', 'Alan Stewart, Thomas L. Callaway', 'Clay McBride, Andres Carranza', 'Richard Hatch, R.G. Armstrong, Richard Jaeckel, Rose Marie, Harry Caesar, Diane Moser, Kamar de los Reyes, Del Zamora', 'R', 'When Travis, middle-aged, working class man, returns home to visit his parents, he quickly learns that his hood is rife with criminal activity and gang warfare. Quickly, Travis finds himself thrust into a position to defend his family and neighbors from the punks who terrorize them on a daily basis. Good thing he has a military training, enabling the man to become a one-man vigilante unit against the forces of evil in his town.', 'When Travis, middle-aged, working class man, returns home to visit his parents, he quickly learns that his hood is rife with criminal activity and gang warfare. Quickly, Travis finds himself thrust into a position to defend his family and neighbors from the punks who terrorize them on a daily basis. Good thing he has a military training, enabling the man to become a one-man vigilante unit against the forces of evil in his town.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pneuQgsMaotfHqH3b7ICt5S2HQm.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:95353'),
  ('793909270665505920', 'Ghiaccio', 2022, 'Drama', 'Alessio De Leonardis, Fabrizio Moro, Andrea Salvatore Sciuto', 'Alessio De Leonardis, Fabrizio Moro', 'Giacomo Ferrara, Vinicio Marchioni, Beatrice Bartoni, Claudio Camilli, Mauro Cremonini, Valerio Morigi, Vittorio Emanuele Propizio, Lidia Vitale', null, 'Giorgio is a young talented boxer who lives with his mother and dreams to became a champion.', 'Giorgio is a young talented boxer who lives with his mother and dreams to became a champion.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/p9rQgxDnXfG0dozjp3HwfvtyVo8.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:812050'),
  ('916407958374928317', 'Ghiblies', 2000, 'Animation, Comedy', 'Yoshiyuki Momose, Mitsunori Kataama, Atsushi Okui', 'Yoshiyuki Momose', 'Masako Kurata, Fumihiko Tachiki, Yoshiko Sakakibara, Akio Otsuka, Makoto Tsumura, Kanji Wakabayashi, Yuji Ueda, Kenji Wakabayashi', null, 'Ghiblies, a totally different look on the staff of Studio Ghibli as they go through life, work on new animation projects, office jokes, off the wall events, and deciding what to have for lunch.', 'Ghiblies, a totally different look on the staff of Studio Ghibli as they go through life, work on new animation projects, office jokes, off the wall events, and deciding what to have for lunch.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/81GgoQrVMrqdq3wvJcNad0YC21s.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:222471'),
  ('614190462068542736', 'Ghiblies: Episode 2', 2002, 'Animation, Comedy', 'Yoshiyuki Momose, Atsushi Okui', 'Yoshiyuki Momose', 'Masahiko Nishimura, Arata Furuta, Kyoka Suzuki, Kaoru Kobayashi, Koji Imada, Satoru Saito, Tomoe Shinohara', null, 'Ghiblies (pronounced with a hard "g" as in "gallop") is a short film aired during a TV special about Ghibli. It''s about a fictional animation studio named "Ghibli" and the people who work there. This rare Ghibli Comedy is a look into who the people making the films are. Plotlines run from office jokes to Nonaka''s first love, bringing together a short feature of random events.', 'Ghiblies (pronounced with a hard "g" as in "gallop") is a short film aired during a TV special about Ghibli. It''s about a fictional animation studio named "Ghibli" and the people who work there. This rare Ghibli Comedy is a look into who the people making the films are. Plotlines run from office jokes to Nonaka''s first love, bringing together a short feature of random events.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xe1j87sZVl2zKek9AXRGbU7G4OP.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:40576'),
  ('157920298096854648', 'Ghidorah, the Three-Headed Monster', 1964, 'Science Fiction, Action, Fantasy, Thriller', 'Ishirō Honda, Hajime Koizumi, Ken Sano', 'Shinichi Sekizawa', 'Yōsuke Natsuki, Yuriko Hoshi, Hiroshi Koizumi, Takashi Shimura, Emi Ito, Yumi Ito, Akiko Wakabayashi, Hisaya Ito', 'NR', 'After a meteorite unleashes a three-headed beast upon Tokyo, Mothra tries to unite with Godzilla and Rodan to battle the extraterrestrial threat.', 'After a meteorite unleashes a three-headed beast upon Tokyo, Mothra tries to unite with Godzilla and Rodan to battle the extraterrestrial threat.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qkI5nhvxx3233gQmoQvv0W3MB7A.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:15766'),
  ('126132649965653192', 'Ghilli', 2004, 'Action, Comedy, Family, Romance', 'Dharani, Gopinath', 'Dharani', 'Vijay, Trisha Krishnan, Prakash Raj, Ashish Vidhyarthi, Janaki Sabesh, Nancy Jennifer, Dhamu, Tanikella Bharani', null, 'Muthu Pandi, a village strongman, decides to marry Dhanalakshmi, and begins his quest by eliminating everyone who opposes their union - starting with both her brothers. In desperation, Dhanalakshmi decides to escape from the village, and in the process is unwittingly assisted by a university Kabaddi player Velu.', 'Muthu Pandi, a village strongman, decides to marry Dhanalakshmi, and begins his quest by eliminating everyone who opposes their union - starting with both her brothers. In desperation, Dhanalakshmi decides to escape from the village, and in the process is unwittingly assisted by a university Kabaddi player Velu.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aUvUohnBgX5sbuMKNyKDAPAoVNc.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:63647'),
  ('1107136541471165756', 'Ghislain Lambert''s Bicycle', 2001, 'Comedy', 'Philippe Harel', 'Benoît Poelvoorde, Philippe Harel, Olivier Dazat', 'Benoît Poelvoorde, José Garcia, Daniel Ceccaldi, Sacha Bourdo, Emmanuel Quatra, Christelle Cornil, Jacqueline Poelvoorde-Pappaert, Fernand Guiot', null, 'In the 70s, there was Merckx and there were the others. Ghislain Lambert was one of the others. This is his story, a quite simple one. The story of a modest Belgian bike racer. His greatest ambition in life? To become a champion. His greatest tragedy? Not having the legs his heart deserves.', 'In the 70s, there was Merckx and there were the others. Ghislain Lambert was one of the others. This is his story, a quite simple one. The story of a modest Belgian bike racer. His greatest ambition in life? To become a champion. His greatest tragedy? Not having the legs his heart deserves.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lIYWYhFxWaDK3ECxWRRnUxpRs0B.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:40415'),
  ('807496320033989551', 'Ghislaine Maxwell: Filthy Rich', 2022, 'Documentary', 'Lisa Bryant, Maiken Baird, Andrew Dunn', null, 'Ghislaine Maxwell, Maiken Baird, David Boies III, Kate Briquelet', 'R', 'Stories from survivors frame this documentary detailing the sex-trafficking trial of Ghislaine Maxwell, a socialite and accomplice of Jeffrey Epstein.', 'Stories from survivors frame this documentary detailing the sex-trafficking trial of Ghislaine Maxwell, a socialite and accomplice of Jeffrey Epstein.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/Av758PktOlmKVlCzkhKBJqwpFcN.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1040599'),
  ('363651315893354585', 'Ghoomketu', 2020, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Pushpendra Nath Misra', 'Pushpendra Nath Misra', 'Nawazuddin Siddiqui, Ragini Khanna, Richa Chadha, Anurag Kashyap, Ila Arun, Raghubir Yadav, Deepika Amin, Amitabh Bachchan', null, 'An aspiring writer from a small town in U.P. runs away to Mumbai. He gives himself 30 days to try and prove his worth.', 'An aspiring writer from a small town in U.P. runs away to Mumbai. He gives himself 30 days to try and prove his worth.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6BV7tNQjM43bIjdZthXyq91lKLx.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:496348'),
