  ('236451827369290633', 'Ghost', 2015, 'Family, Comedy', 'Alexander Voitinsky, Mikhail Milashin', 'Oleg Malovichko, Dmitriy Aleynikov, Andrey Zolotarev', 'Fyodor Bondarchuk, Semyon Treskunov, Yan Tsapnik, Anna Antonova, Igor Ugolnikov, Kseniya Lavrova-Glinka, Andrey Amshinsky, Igor Kistol', null, 'An aircraft designer becomes a ghost after a sudden death. Now he needs to engage a help of seven-grader in order to finish all his unaccomplished tasks.', 'An aircraft designer becomes a ghost after a sudden death. Now he needs to engage a help of seven-grader in order to finish all his unaccomplished tasks.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2njykKt6eASXbrMENEcLkDLZZ6Y.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:332512'),
  ('185837622997569699', 'Ghost Adventures', 2007, 'Documentary, Horror', 'Zak Bagans, Nick Groff', null, 'Zak Bagans, Nick Groff, Aaron Goodwin', null, 'In 2007, The Sci-Fi Channel premiered "Ghost Adventures," a raw documentary in which 3 men go to Virginia City, NV and Goldfield, NV on a ghost hunting expedition. Virginia City is rife with macabre lore and reputed to be one of the most haunted cities in America. Ghost Adventures has won a Grand Jury Prize for Best Documentary that was given by the New York International Film &amp; Video Festival.', 'In 2007, The Sci-Fi Channel premiered "Ghost Adventures," a raw documentary in which 3 men go to Virginia City, NV and Goldfield, NV on a ghost hunting expedition. Virginia City is rife with macabre lore and reputed to be one of the most haunted cities in America. Ghost Adventures has won a Grand Jury Prize for Best Documentary that was given by the New York International Film &amp; Video Festival.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3yN8gsBIk40fdthF7tCPrOonGug.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:29721'),
  ('218169363075150561', 'Ghost Book', 2022, 'Fantasy, Family', 'Takashi Yamazaki, Kohei Adachi, Kōzō Shibazaki', 'Takashi Yamazaki', 'Kairi Jo, Fuga Shibazaki, Sonny Mcclendon, Ayaka Yoshimura, Yui Aragaki, Ryunosuke Kamiki, Akio Otsuka, Min Tanaka', 'G', 'The forbidden book that will make any wish come true "The Ghostly Book of Books". However, in order to make your wish come true you have to go through a life-threatening trial. What is that trial...?', 'The forbidden book that will make any wish come true "The Ghostly Book of Books". However, in order to make your wish come true you have to go through a life-threatening trial. What is that trial...?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/AiW2QXuWBVrY2hmtaWGk95Uvt0V.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:961418'),
  ('972352625026551048', 'Ghost Cat Anzu', 2024, 'Animation, Fantasy, Comedy, Family', 'Yoko Kuno, Nobuhiro Yamashita, Masato Makino', 'Shinji Imaoka', 'Mirai Moriyama, Noa Goto, Munetaka Aoki, Miwako Ichikawa, Keiichi Suzuki, Shingo Mizusawa, Mutsuo Yoshioka, Wataru Sawabe', 'NR', 'Precocious tween Karin finds herself abandoned by her father in rural Japan. Living in a temple with her grandfather, she meets Anzu, a giant "ghost cat" and notorious layabout tasked with looking after her. Distrustful of her new guardian, Karin sabotages Anzu''s odd jobs for the townsfolk and befriends the eccentric local forest spirits. In an effort to win Karin over, Anzu accidentally makes a deal with the devil, and all Hell breaks loose.', 'Precocious tween Karin finds herself abandoned by her father in rural Japan. Living in a temple with her grandfather, she meets Anzu, a giant "ghost cat" and notorious layabout tasked with looking after her. Distrustful of her new guardian, Karin sabotages Anzu''s odd jobs for the townsfolk and befriends the eccentric local forest spirits. In an effort to win Karin over, Anzu accidentally makes a deal with the devil, and all Hell breaks loose.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rJSSc7vbLseCOjsgDnCKtVNs9Qe.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1030588'),
  ('663139584040877296', 'Ghost Chase', 1987, 'Horror, Fantasy, Science Fiction, Family, Comedy', 'Roland Emmerich, Karl Walter Lindenlaub, Oliver Eberle', 'Roland Emmerich, Thomas Kubisch', 'Jason Lively, Tim McDaniel, Jill Whitlow, Leonard Lansink, Paul Gleason, Ian MacNaughton, Julian Curry, Chuck Mitchell', 'PG', 'In an old Hollywood mansion, the spirit of an old family retainer inhabits an old grandfather clock. When a movie company uses the mansion for a film, the spirit inhabits the body of an alien and persuades the two filmmakers to track down an old house that will resolve a family scandal.', 'In an old Hollywood mansion, the spirit of an old family retainer inhabits an old grandfather clock. When a movie company uses the mansion for a film, the spirit inhabits the body of an alien and persuades the two filmmakers to track down an old house that will resolve a family scandal.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lK2gSEIYbjA8NOJ2BeRMCTzq6Hg.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:71697'),
  ('1101768840223642770', 'Ghost Dad', 1990, 'Comedy, Family, Fantasy', 'Sidney Poitier, Andrew Laszlo, Candace Allen', 'Brent Maddock, S.S. Wilson, Phil Alden Robinson', 'Bill Cosby, Kimberly Russell, Denise Nicholas, Ian Bannen, Christine Ebersole, Barry Corbin, Salim Grant, Brooke Fontaine', 'PG', 'Elliot Hopper, a widower with three children, is working on a business deal to get his family out of financial straits when he is suddenly killed in a taxi accident. With the aid of a paranormal researcher, Elliott attempts to complete the deal from the beyond, ensuring his family will be taken care of.', 'Elliot Hopper, a widower with three children, is working on a business deal to get his family out of financial straits when he is suddenly killed in a taxi accident. With the aid of a paranormal researcher, Elliott attempts to complete the deal from the beyond, ensuring his family will be taken care of.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vYNIUUkJSZixxrfpMLFgVlagbaf.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:10485'),
  ('173625751935622621', 'Ghost Dog: The Way of the Samurai', 1999, 'Crime, Drama', 'Robby Müller, Jim Jarmusch, Jeanne McCarthy', 'Jim Jarmusch', 'Forest Whitaker, John Tormey, Cliff Gorman, Frank Minucci, Richard Portnow, Tricia Vessey, Henry Silva, Gene Ruffini', 'R', 'A Black hitman who models after the samurai of old finds himself targeted for death by the mob.', 'A Black hitman who models after the samurai of old finds himself targeted for death by the mob.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gkH4zOxIfbb4BEbk9Q4cVOEpDaY.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:4816'),
  ('689538342742233554', 'Ghost Elephants', 2026, 'Documentary', 'Werner Herzog, Rafael Leyva', 'Werner Herzog', 'Werner Herzog, Steve Boyes, Kerllen Costa, Xui, Xui Dawid, Kobus, Gary Trower, Jordana Meyer', 'NR', 'In Angola''s mist-shrouded highlands, three KhoiSan master trackers embark on a spiritual quest to rediscover the legendary "ghost elephants" of Lisima, creatures presumed lost but remembered in ancestral trance, ritual, and memory.', 'In Angola''s mist-shrouded highlands, three KhoiSan master trackers embark on a spiritual quest to rediscover the legendary "ghost elephants" of Lisima, creatures presumed lost but remembered in ancestral trance, ritual, and memory.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/h2zN5Oo89DjwY9Q4F8zto5MlnNb.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1451867'),
  ('195322327339840264', 'Ghost Fever', 1987, 'Horror, Comedy', 'Lee Madden, Alan Smithee, Xavier Cruz Ruvalcaba', 'Oscar Brodney, Ron Rich, Richard Egan', 'Sherman Hemsley, Luis Ávalos, Jennifer Rhodes, Deborah Benson, Diana Brookes, Myron Healey, Pepper Martin, Joe Frazier', 'PG', 'Two policeman are sent on a routine assignment to serve an eviction notice. It becomes anything but run-of-the-mill when they become involved in the ghostly happenings.', 'Two policeman are sent on a routine assignment to serve an eviction notice. It becomes anything but run-of-the-mill when they become involved in the ghostly happenings.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mtXxgiICkEvld07MQUS9153S0Vb.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:144351'),
  ('95119607598047313', 'Ghost Game', 2006, 'Horror, Mystery, Thriller', 'Sarawut Wichiensarn, Pithan Chokijgran, Supawan Jutikul', 'Damkerng Thitapiyasak', 'Pachornpol Jantieng, Thanyanan Mahapirun, Pongsak Rattanapong, Zeenam Soonthorn, Supatsiri Patomnupong, Taweesak Pamornpol, Kittyluck Jullustian, Parnwet Saiklay', null, 'The story of 11 contestants who sign up for a scary reality show which forces them to confront the supernatural and their innermost fears. They''re brought to an ancient war museum in Cambodia, which was used as a Khmer Rouge prison twenty years before. Thousands of innocent people were tortured and killed there during the Cambodian war in the 1970s.', 'The story of 11 contestants who sign up for a scary reality show which forces them to confront the supernatural and their innermost fears. They''re brought to an ancient war museum in Cambodia, which was used as a Khmer Rouge prison twenty years before. Thousands of innocent people were tortured and killed there during the Cambodian war in the 1970s.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/euwJSZw2CObG80wcKusms5sNcvP.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:27423'),
  ('91362383649385235', 'Ghost Game', 2024, 'Horror, Thriller', 'Jill Gevargizian, Justin Brooks, Johnny Mercer', 'Adam Cesare', 'Kia Dorsey, Zaen Haidar, Sam Lukowski, Michael C. Williams, Emily Bennett, Vienna Maas, Aiden Hughes, Daniel Mascarello', null, 'As part of an internet challenge to live undetected in a stranger’s home, a daring couple target an infamous haunted house and endure a series of chilling incidents as they witness a family descending into madness.', 'As part of an internet challenge to live undetected in a stranger’s home, a daring couple target an infamous haunted house and endure a series of chilling incidents as they witness a family descending into madness.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1P4h41vMPZMIFHgyoAsw2Em66D7.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1249385'),
  ('1063883313438628226', 'Ghost Graduation', 2012, 'Comedy, Fantasy', 'Javier Ruiz Caldera, Arnau Valls Colomer, David González', 'Cristóbal Garrido, Adolfo Valor', 'Raúl Arévalo, Alexandra Jiménez, Aura Garrido, Andrea Duro, Àlex Maruny, Jaime Olías, Anna Castillo, Javier Bódalo', null, 'A teacher with paranormal abilities helps a group of ghosts graduate high school.', 'A teacher with paranormal abilities helps a group of ghosts graduate high school.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oduJ7jj5DsVuvIctPxHRcb88vfr.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:86541'),
  ('565901149645319546', 'Ghost House', 2004, 'Comedy, Horror', 'Kim Sang-jin, Choi Sung-won', null, 'Cha Seung-won, Jang Seo-hee, Jang Hang-seon, Son Tae-young, Jin Yoo-young, Jang Hyun-sung, Hwang Seok-jeong, Chang Hang-jun', null, 'The day that Pil-gi waited for so many years has finally come: hes getting his own house, the last wish of his deceased father. And what a perfect house it is! Big, beautiful, isolated, next to the ocean and at that price, Pil-gi couldn''t have found a better place.', 'The day that Pil-gi waited for so many years has finally come: hes getting his own house, the last wish of his deceased father. And what a perfect house it is! Big, beautiful, isolated, next to the ocean and at that price, Pil-gi couldn''t have found a better place.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aUxZM5G7bwmWs1d3UZugVxnC9sc.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:77823'),
  ('106460444532992805', 'Ghost House', 2017, 'Horror, Thriller, Mystery', 'Pierluigi Malavasi, Rich Ragsdale', 'Jason Chase Tyrrell, Kevin O''Sullivan', 'Scout Taylor-Compton, James Landry Hébert, Mark Boone Junior, Michael S. New, Elana Krausz, Katrina Grey, Russell Geoffrey Banks, Rich Lee Gray', null, 'A young couple go on an adventurous vacation to Thailand only to find themselves haunted by a malevolent spirit after naively disrespecting a Ghost House.', 'A young couple go on an adventurous vacation to Thailand only to find themselves haunted by a malevolent spirit after naively disrespecting a Ghost House.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qhb9xJQCWCXICXV8Liy7zZFaIpe.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:359228'),
  ('976828120848119029', 'Ghost in the Machine', 1993, 'Science Fiction, Thriller, Horror', 'Rachel Talalay, Phil Meheux, Mickey Gilbert', 'William Osborne, William Davies', 'Karen Allen, Wil Horneff, Chris Mulkey, Jessica Walter, Shevonne Durkin, Brandon Quintin Adams, Ted Marcoux, Rick Ducommun', 'R', 'After a freak, fatal accident, the soul Karl—aka The Address Book Killer—ends up trapped in the electrical grid. He targets Terry and her son for his next victims, turning home technology against them as deadly weapons.', 'After a freak, fatal accident, the soul Karl—aka The Address Book Killer—ends up trapped in the electrical grid. He targets Terry and her son for his next victims, turning home technology against them as deadly weapons.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lyUZFIQj4CekCtGeR3smYNUJWtk.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:41651'),
  ('1045009861461434126', 'Ghost in the Shell', 1995, 'Action, Animation, Science Fiction', 'Hisao Shirai, Mamoru Oshii, Seichi Tanaka', 'Kazunori Ito', 'Atsuko Tanaka, Akio Otsuka, Iemasa Kayumi, Koichi Yamadera, Yutaka Nakano, Tamio Ohki, Tessyo Genda, Masakazu Namaki', 'NR', 'In the year 2029, the barriers of our world have been broken down by the net and by cybernetics, but this brings new vulnerability to humans in the form of brain-hacking. When a highly-wanted hacker known as ''The Puppetmaster'' begins involving them in politics, Section 9, a group of cybernetically enhanced cops, are called in to investigate and stop the Puppetmaster.', 'In the year 2029, the barriers of our world have been broken down by the net and by cybernetics, but this brings new vulnerability to humans in the form of brain-hacking. When a highly-wanted hacker known as ''The Puppetmaster'' begins involving them in politics, Section 9, a group of cybernetically enhanced cops, are called in to investigate and stop the Puppetmaster.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9gC88zYUBARRSThcG93MvW14sqx.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:9323'),
  ('499147636911669497', 'Ghost in the Shell', 2017, 'Science Fiction, Drama, Action', 'Rupert Sanders, Richard L. Johnson, Jess Hall', 'Jamie Moss, Ehren Kruger, William Wheeler', 'Scarlett Johansson, Takeshi Kitano, Pilou Asbæk, Michael Pitt, Chin Han, Juliette Binoche, Peter Ferdinando, Rila Fukushima', 'PG-13', 'In the near future, Major is the first of her kind: a human saved from a terrible crash, then cyber-enhanced to be a perfect soldier devoted to stopping the world''s most dangerous criminals.', 'In the near future, Major is the first of her kind: a human saved from a terrible crash, then cyber-enhanced to be a perfect soldier devoted to stopping the world''s most dangerous criminals.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zCtL3UBgCoZzd7XTVGhvl6XY75E.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:315837'),
  ('170367777857481616', 'Ghost in the Shell 2: Innocence', 2004, 'Animation, Drama, Science Fiction', 'Mamoru Oshii, Miki Sakuma, Ryo Kono', 'Mamoru Oshii', 'Atsuko Tanaka, Akio Otsuka, Koichi Yamadera, Tamio Ohki, Yutaka Nakano, Hiroaki Hirata, Masaki Terasoma, Sumi Mutoh', 'PG-13', 'Cyborg detective Batou is assigned to investigate a series of murders committed by gynoids—doll-like cyborgs, which all malfunctioned, killed, then self-destructed afterwards. The brains of the gynoids initialize in order to protect their manufacturer''s software, but in one gynoid, which Batou himself neutralized, one file remains: a voice speaking the phrase "Help me."', 'Cyborg detective Batou is assigned to investigate a series of murders committed by gynoids—doll-like cyborgs, which all malfunctioned, killed, then self-destructed afterwards. The brains of the gynoids initialize in order to protect their manufacturer''s software, but in one gynoid, which Batou himself neutralized, one file remains: a voice speaking the phrase "Help me."', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1ZJRbLDVr90KLtKdmTT4WZhT26E.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:12140'),
  ('492258030430779694', 'Ghost in the Shell 2.0', 2008, 'Action, Animation, Crime, Science Fiction', 'Mamoru Oshii, Hisao Shirai', 'Kazunori Ito', 'Atsuko Tanaka, Akio Otsuka, Koichi Yamadera, Tamio Ohki, Tessyo Genda, Masato Yamanouchi, Shinji Ogawa, Yoshiko Sakakibara', null, 'In the year 2029, Section 9, a group of cybernetically enhanced cops, are called in to investigate and stop a highly-wanted hacker known as ''The Puppetmaster''.', 'In the year 2029, Section 9, a group of cybernetically enhanced cops, are called in to investigate and stop a highly-wanted hacker known as ''The Puppetmaster''.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5ngIhoA0b4aGBoPFPURAbDwCKT7.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:14092'),
  ('649116382910445344', 'Ghost in the Shell: Arise - Border 1: Ghost Pain', 2013, 'Action, Animation, Crime, Science Fiction', 'Eiji Inomoto, Yoshikazu Iwanami, Koji Tanaka', 'Tow Ubukata', 'Maaya Sakamoto, Ikkyu Juku, Kenichirou Matsuda, Kazuya Nakai, Shunsuke Sakuya, Tomoyuki Dan, Takuro Nakakuni, Tarusuke Shingaki', 'R', 'The story is set in 2027, one year after the end of the fourth non-nuclear war. New Port City is still reeling from the war''s aftermath when it suffers a bombing caused by a self-propelled mine. Then, a military member implicated in arms-dealing bribes is gunned down. During the investigation, Public Security Section''s Daisuke Aramaki encounters Motoko Kusanagi, the cyborg, wizard-level hacker assigned to the military''s 501st Secret Unit. Batou, a man with the "eye that does not sleep," suspects that Kusanagi is the one behind the bombing. The Niihama Prefectural Police detective Togusa is pursuing his own dual cases of the shooting death and a prostitute''s murder. Motoko herself is being watched by the 501st Secret Unit''s head Kurutsu and cyborg agents.', 'The story is set in 2027, one year after the end of the fourth non-nuclear war. New Port City is still reeling from the war''s aftermath when it suffers a bombing caused by a self-propelled mine. Then, a military member implicated in arms-dealing bribes is gunned down. During the investigation, Public Security Section''s Daisuke Aramaki encounters Motoko Kusanagi, the cyborg, wizard-level hacker assigned to the military''s 501st Secret Unit. Batou, a man with the "eye that does not sleep," suspects that Kusanagi is the one behind the bombing. The Niihama Prefectural Police detective Togusa is pursuing his own dual cases of the shooting death and a prostitute''s murder. Motoko herself is being watched by the 501st Secret Unit''s head Kurutsu and cyborg agents.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/p0kHK9nJoLzpqa6tqOzPgPkdxYN.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:196750'),
  ('217578916794384439', 'Ghost in the Shell: Arise - Border 2: Ghost Whispers', 2013, 'Action, Animation, Science Fiction, Thriller', 'Kazuchika Kise, Atsushi Takeuchi, Koji Tanaka', 'Tow Ubukata', 'Maaya Sakamoto, Ikkyu Juku, Kenichirou Matsuda, Tomoyuki Dan, Takuro Nakakuni, Yoji Ueda, Kazuya Nakai, Miyuki Sawashiro', 'R', 'Freed of her responsibilities with the 501 Organization, Motoko Kusanagi must now learn how to take orders from Aramaki. Someone hacks the Logicomas, and Batou enlists the help of former army intelligence officer Ishikawa and former air artillery expert Borma. Kusanagi also seeks to enlist ace sniper Saito and undercover cop Paz into the new Public Security Section 9.', 'Freed of her responsibilities with the 501 Organization, Motoko Kusanagi must now learn how to take orders from Aramaki. Someone hacks the Logicomas, and Batou enlists the help of former army intelligence officer Ishikawa and former air artillery expert Borma. Kusanagi also seeks to enlist ace sniper Saito and undercover cop Paz into the new Public Security Section 9.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eC8babU050Nwnss5CnAJyymGkB.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:212168'),
  ('687647427403071457', 'Ghost in the Shell: Arise - Border 3: Ghost Tears', 2014, 'Action, Animation, Science Fiction', 'Kazuchika Kise, Koji Tanaka, Kazuchika Kise', 'Tow Ubukata', 'Maaya Sakamoto, Ikkyu Juku, Kenichirou Matsuda, Kazuya Nakai, Tomoyuki Dan, Shunsuke Sakuya, Miyuki Sawashiro, Yoji Ueda', 'R', 'Posing as lovers on vacation, Motoko and Batou work to try to stop a terrorist organization whose symbol is the Scrasath. Meanwhile, Togusa investigates a murder of a man who possessed a prosthetic leg manufactured by the Mermaid''s Leg corporation.', 'Posing as lovers on vacation, Motoko and Batou work to try to stop a terrorist organization whose symbol is the Scrasath. Meanwhile, Togusa investigates a murder of a man who possessed a prosthetic leg manufactured by the Mermaid''s Leg corporation.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nrMr4ht4CgX4tyseN1uYVHXENJN.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:240341'),
  ('731445704220555769', 'Ghost in the Shell: Arise - Border 4: Ghost Stands Alone', 2014, 'Action, Animation, Science Fiction, Crime', 'Susumu Kudo, Kazuchika Kise, Koji Tanaka', 'Tow Ubukata', 'Maaya Sakamoto, Ikkyu Juku, Kenichirou Matsuda, Aya Hisakawa, Kazuya Nakai, Shunsuke Sakuya, Mayumi Asano, Miyuki Sawashiro', 'R', 'The upcoming installment''s story takes place amidst signs of postwar reconstruction in the winter of 2028. Tensions are rising in New Port City as demonstrations are held concerning the interests of foreign cartels. This leads to a shooting incident involving riot police. It all started with a cyberbrain infection released by the terrorist "Fire Starter." An independent offensive unit led by Makoto Kusanagi entrusts the suppression of the situation to their ghosts and aims for their own justice. Below the surface of the incident, lies the "tin girl" Emma and the "scarecrow man" Burinda Junior. As Kusanagi deals with the incident, she draws near to what those two ghosts were seeking.', 'The upcoming installment''s story takes place amidst signs of postwar reconstruction in the winter of 2028. Tensions are rising in New Port City as demonstrations are held concerning the interests of foreign cartels. This leads to a shooting incident involving riot police. It all started with a cyberbrain infection released by the terrorist "Fire Starter." An independent offensive unit led by Makoto Kusanagi entrusts the suppression of the situation to their ghosts and aims for their own justice. Below the surface of the incident, lies the "tin girl" Emma and the "scarecrow man" Burinda Junior. As Kusanagi deals with the incident, she draws near to what those two ghosts were seeking.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dNlPBbpsyZCHDbYa4VxZOCj3RiI.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:279254'),
  ('1070103667013290404', 'Ghost in the Shell: S.A.C. 2nd GIG - Individual Eleven', 2006, 'Animation, Science Fiction', 'Kenji Kamiyama, Kyoji Asano, Koichi Maruyama', 'Dai Sato, Yutaka Omatsu, Taiki Sakurai', 'Atsuko Tanaka, Osamu Saka, Koichi Yamadera, Rikiya Koyama, Takashi Onozuka, Taro Yamaguchi, Toru Okawa, Yutaka Nakano', 'NR', 'The year is 2030, and an influx of refuges have effortlessly transformed themselves into a terrorist organization known as the "Individual Eleven." With a sadistic intent of mass destruction, will they triumph in victory or discover the gloomy pitfalls of defeat?', 'The year is 2030, and an influx of refuges have effortlessly transformed themselves into a terrorist organization known as the "Individual Eleven." With a sadistic intent of mass destruction, will they triumph in victory or discover the gloomy pitfalls of defeat?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uXT8XDWZwGax4FqmEQGjpajzcKO.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:111224'),
  ('855015172552680578', 'Ghost in the Shell: SAC_2045 Sustainable War', 2021, 'Animation, Action, Science Fiction', 'Michihito Fujii, Kenji Kamiyama, Shinji Aramaki', 'Daisuke Ohigashi, Kurasumi Sunayama, Kenji Kamiyama', 'Atsuko Tanaka, Osamu Saka, Akio Otsuka, Koichi Yamadera, Yutaka Nakano, Toru Okawa, Takashi Onozuka, Taro Yamaguchi', 'R', 'In the year 2045, after an economic disaster known as the Synchronized Global Default, rapid developments in AI propelled the world to enter a state of "Sustainable War". However, the public is not aware of the threat that AI has towards the human race. A compilation film with newly added footage.', 'In the year 2045, after an economic disaster known as the Synchronized Global Default, rapid developments in AI propelled the world to enter a state of "Sustainable War". However, the public is not aware of the threat that AI has towards the human race. A compilation film with newly added footage.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kNTvGWDTxb2spAp9SRLNfOo7kCM.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:965244'),
  ('942227476354087830', 'Ghost in the Shell: SAC_2045 The Last Human', 2023, 'Animation, Action, Science Fiction', 'Shinji Aramaki, Kenji Kamiyama', 'Dai Sato, Kenji Kamiyama', 'Atsuko Tanaka, Akio Otsuka, Koichi Yamadera, Megumi Han, Sakiko Tamagawa, Hiroshi Naka, Megumi Hayashibara', null, 'In 2045, amidst an economic disaster and the rapid evolution of AI in a world where sustainable warfare is on the rise, Public Security Section 9, led by Motoko Kusanagi, arrives in Tokyo to confront the "post-human" Takashi Shimamura and prevent the looming threat of nuclear war. A compilation film with newly added footage.', 'In 2045, amidst an economic disaster and the rapid evolution of AI in a world where sustainable warfare is on the rise, Public Security Section 9, led by Motoko Kusanagi, arrives in Tokyo to confront the "post-human" Takashi Shimamura and prevent the looming threat of nuclear war. A compilation film with newly added footage.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pJgPt0wVrOrAFTPozeARmExR6xJ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1104401'),
  ('244166968507555581', 'Ghost in the Shell: Stand Alone Complex - Solid State Society', 2007, 'Animation, Action, Thriller, Crime, Science Fiction', 'Kenji Kamiyama, Takayuki Goto, Masaki Tachibana', 'Kenji Kamiyama, Shoutarou Suga, Taiki Sakurai', 'Atsuko Tanaka, Osamu Saka, Koichi Yamadera, Akio Otsuka, Yutaka Nakano, Takashi Onozuka, Toru Okawa, Taro Yamaguchi', null, 'The story takes place in the year 2034, two years after the events in Ghost in the Shell: S.A.C. 2nd GIG. Female cyborg Major Motoko Kusanagi has left Public Security Section 9, an elite counter-terrorist and anti-crime unit specializing in cyber-warfare, which has expanded to a team of 20 field operatives with Togusa acting as the field lead.', 'The story takes place in the year 2034, two years after the events in Ghost in the Shell: S.A.C. 2nd GIG. Female cyborg Major Motoko Kusanagi has left Public Security Section 9, an elite counter-terrorist and anti-crime unit specializing in cyber-warfare, which has expanded to a team of 20 field operatives with Togusa acting as the field lead.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tExdDYmxqv30rtf2dMkTAVpzORf.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:18874'),
  ('368249870173507816', 'Ghost In The Shell: The Movie Virtual Reality Diver', 2016, 'Action, Adventure, Animation, Crime, Science Fiction, Thriller', 'Hiroaki Higashi', null, 'Maaya Sakamoto, Kenichirou Matsuda, Miyuki Sawashiro, Ryota Takeuchi, Sayaka Ohara', null, 'An original story in the Ghost In The Shell franchise; an effort to the sensation of being in another world, meshing future technologies with art. A World of Purity: Holy Ground. "To end the war and protect my wife, I must delete you all…" Japan, 2025. Technology has been advancing more and more rapidly. "Brain cyberization" that makes possible direct connections to information networks via the brain, the technology of "prosthetic bodies" that allows humans to change their body parts into cybernetical ones; in this world where such scientific advances have become common, a bombing attack threat is sent to the Japanese government. The target is an international meeting involving dignitaries from the Republic of Kuzan. The case is entrusted to the Ministry of Home Affairs'' Public Security Section 9. Section 9''s leader, the full-cyborg Motoko Kusanagi, assembles her team and heads off to trap and eliminate the terrorist.', 'An original story in the Ghost In The Shell franchise; an effort to the sensation of being in another world, meshing future technologies with art. A World of Purity: Holy Ground. "To end the war and protect my wife, I must delete you all…" Japan, 2025. Technology has been advancing more and more rapidly. "Brain cyberization" that makes possible direct connections to information networks via the brain, the technology of "prosthetic bodies" that allows humans to change their body parts into cybernetical ones; in this world where such scientific advances have become common, a bombing attack threat is sent to the Japanese government. The target is an international meeting involving dignitaries from the Republic of Kuzan. The case is entrusted to the Ministry of Home Affairs'' Public Security Section 9. Section 9''s leader, the full-cyborg Motoko Kusanagi, assembles her team and heads off to trap and eliminate the terrorist.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hvBoNHkfUbEwyUd4jd14fJSRGg2.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:384217'),
  ('803278983754805366', 'Ghost in the Shell: The New Movie', 2015, 'Science Fiction, Animation', 'Kazuya Nomura, Koji Tanaka, Toru Okubo', 'Tow Ubukata', 'Maaya Sakamoto, Ikkyu Juku, Kenichirou Matsuda, Tarusuke Shingaki, Shunsuke Sakuya, Takuro Nakakuni, Yoji Ueda, Kazuya Nakai', null, 'When a ghost-infecting virus known as Fire-Starter begins spreading through the system resulting in the assassination of the Japanese Prime Minister, Major Motoko Kusanagi and her elite team of special operatives are called in to track down its source.', 'When a ghost-infecting virus known as Fire-Starter begins spreading through the system resulting in the assassination of the Japanese Prime Minister, Major Motoko Kusanagi and her elite team of special operatives are called in to track down its source.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eLd31emY3jann7JV0AkSPJ06Xep.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:334376'),
  ('351329469942840595', 'Ghost Killer', 2025, 'Action, Comedy, Fantasy', 'Kensuke Sonomura, Kensuke Sonomura, Moritada Iju', 'Yugo Sakamoto', 'Akari Takaishi, Mario Kuroba, Masanori Mimoto, Ayaka Higashino, Hidenobu Abera, Naoto Kuratomi, Satoshi Kibe, Ryu Ichinose', 'NR', 'After being possessed by the ghost of vengeful hitman Kudo, college student Fumika Matsuoka agrees to help him finish his quest for revenge from beyond the grave.', 'After being possessed by the ghost of vengeful hitman Kudo, college student Fumika Matsuoka agrees to help him finish his quest for revenge from beyond the grave.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uKIG4f25QHUpBmBv0MPWOzKMGAM.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1330435'),
  ('241485084326371242', 'Ghost Killers vs. Bloody Mary', 2018, 'Horror, Comedy', 'Fabrício Bittar', 'Danilo Gentili, Fabrício Bittar, André Catarinacho', 'Danilo Gentili, Pietra Quintela, Dani Calabresa, Léo Lins, Murilo Couto, Matheus Ueta, Ratinho, Antonio Tabet', null, 'A group of three youtubers who call themselves experts in supernatural beings decide to win public recognition once and for all. For this they plot a plan to capture a being known to all. It is the spirit of a light-haired woman who died in an unknown way and who haunts the bathrooms of schools across the country: the blonde in the bathroom.', 'A group of three youtubers who call themselves experts in supernatural beings decide to win public recognition once and for all. For this they plot a plan to capture a being known to all. It is the spirit of a light-haired woman who died in an unknown way and who haunts the bathrooms of schools across the country: the blonde in the bathroom.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jXChjh6YQFNDH5mUd0A2Fs7DjFE.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:560491'),
  ('927427925552032745', 'Ghost Lab', 2021, 'Drama, Horror, Science Fiction, Thriller', 'Pithai Smithsuth, Paween Purijitpanya, Saovaluk Toonim', 'Paween Purijitpanya, Tossaphon Riantong, Vasudhorn Piyaromna', 'Thanapob Leeratanakachorn, Paris Intarakomalyasut, Nuttanicha Dungwattanawanich, Suquan Bulakul, Rachanee Siralert, Nuttawut Jenmana, Chaleeda Gilbert, Anchuleeon Buagaew', 'NR', 'After witnessing a haunting in their hospital, two doctors become dangerously obsessed with obtaining scientific proof that ghosts exist.', 'After witnessing a haunting in their hospital, two doctors become dangerously obsessed with obtaining scientific proof that ghosts exist.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/A09Dqy91W40Q2iiD7IOJteDpJAa.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:710871'),
  ('715312998438025446', 'Ghost Lantern', 1993, 'Action, Comedy, Romance, Fantasy, Horror', 'Andrew Lau Wai-Keung', 'Wong Jing', 'Tony Leung Ka-fai, Chingmy Yau Suk-Ching, Tommy Wong, Roy Cheung Yiu-Yeung, Kingdom Yuen King-Tan, Ronald Wong, Dion Lam, Teresa Ha Ping', null, 'A down-on-his-luck street hustler is cursed with eternal misfortune by a ruthless crime boss who murdered him and his lover in a past life. The hustler reunites with his ghostly lover, trapped in a human-skin lantern by the same man. Together, they must confront the crime boss, break the curse, and free her soul so she can finally pass to the afterlife.', 'A down-on-his-luck street hustler is cursed with eternal misfortune by a ruthless crime boss who murdered him and his lover in a past life. The hustler reunites with his ghostly lover, trapped in a human-skin lantern by the same man. Together, they must confront the crime boss, break the curse, and free her soul so she can finally pass to the afterlife.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/55Kkwpy3HkZTHd1oLqU9LB6YQMJ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:220885'),
  ('334981016907365680', 'Ghost Machine', 2009, 'Action, Horror, Science Fiction, Thriller', 'Chris Hartwill, George Richmond', 'Malachi Smyth, Sven Hughes', 'Sean Faris, Rachael Taylor, Luke Ford, Josh Dallas, Sam Corry, Halla Vilhjálmsdóttir, Richard Dormer, Jonathan Harden', null, 'Two technicians battle a vengeful spirit that has infected their stolen military software.', 'Two technicians battle a vengeful spirit that has infected their stolen military software.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xfKMTNAuBQzAKnZPNc8m6YEL2VC.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:26656'),
  ('680365930452414479', 'Ghost Mansion', 2021, 'Horror, Thriller', 'Jo Ba-reun', 'Jo Ba-reun', 'Sung Joon, Kim Hong-pa, Kim Bo-ra, Lee Chang-hoon, Park So-jin, Lee Dong-ha, Lee Gwan-mok, Park Se-hyun', null, 'A horror webtoon writer journeys to a shabby apartment building in search of ideas. The building''s caretaker tells him about multiple strange events that happened throughout the building''s history.', 'A horror webtoon writer journeys to a shabby apartment building in search of ideas. The building''s caretaker tells him about multiple strange events that happened throughout the building''s history.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gLd1aJmAaNvLM8SwkD3cGVYIrTO.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:842033'),
  ('440553634884484558', 'Ghost Night', 2022, 'Drama, Thriller', 'Fulvio Risuleo, Guido Mazzoni', 'Fulvio Risuleo', 'Edoardo Pesce, Yothin Clavenzani, Elisa Pierdominici, Stefano Cipani, Elena Ferrantini, Elena Gigliotti, Davide Iachini, Miriam Imperatore', null, 'It is evening. Tarek is seventeen years old and is on his way to see his friends, who have asked him on the telephone to pass by the park first and buy a few grams of dope: nothing much, just enough for some fun. The boy buys the stuff in the dark park, but when he emerges finds that someone has seen him: a policeman in plain clothes, sitting in his own car. The man could simply confiscate the hash, intimidate him a little and then let him go, or he could decide to take him to the station and call his parents. But he opts for neither of these things. He tells the young man to get in the car and starts the engine. Where does he want to take him? The policeman is ambiguous, mysterious. What does he want from the teenager? Tarek is in check, he can’t just leave. The policeman makes him stay with him the whole night, driving around in apparently aimless fashion, stopping first in one place, then in another.', 'It is evening. Tarek is seventeen years old and is on his way to see his friends, who have asked him on the telephone to pass by the park first and buy a few grams of dope: nothing much, just enough for some fun. The boy buys the stuff in the dark park, but when he emerges finds that someone has seen him: a policeman in plain clothes, sitting in his own car. The man could simply confiscate the hash, intimidate him a little and then let him go, or he could decide to take him to the station and call his parents. But he opts for neither of these things. He tells the young man to get in the car and starts the engine. Where does he want to take him? The policeman is ambiguous, mysterious. What does he want from the teenager? Tarek is in check, he can’t just leave. The policeman makes him stay with him the whole night, driving around in apparently aimless fashion, stopping first in one place, then in another.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/30irU6Zd3eaAHXDhu3MbQmL2qkv.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1004765'),
  ('55590476803810999', 'Ghost of Dragstrip Hollow', 1959, 'Comedy, Horror', 'William J. Hole Jr., Gilbert Warrenton', 'Lou Rusoff', 'Jody Fair, Russ Bender, Henry McCann, Martin Braddock, Elaine DuPont, Leon Tyler, Jack Ging, Nancy Anderson', 'NR', 'A group of drag-racing fanatics, members of a Los Angeles club, move into an old deserted mansion and set up shop, making it their headquarters. They hold a Halloween masked ball for the club''s grand opening, and invite everyone to come dressed as their favorite monster! Oddly enough, the festivities turn sour when one of the bright youths discovers an impostor among them in the form of an honest-to-gosh live monster who''s been hogging all the dances with the best-looking girls', 'A group of drag-racing fanatics, members of a Los Angeles club, move into an old deserted mansion and set up shop, making it their headquarters. They hold a Halloween masked ball for the club''s grand opening, and invite everyone to come dressed as their favorite monster! Oddly enough, the festivities turn sour when one of the bright youths discovers an impostor among them in the form of an honest-to-gosh live monster who''s been hogging all the dances with the best-looking girls', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pigoVXsGIXB759B47UvDD0OqUD3.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:53050'),
  ('824776641640921380', 'Ghost of Love', 1981, 'Romance, Drama, Horror, Mystery', 'Dino Risi, Claudio Risi, Tonino Delli Colli', 'Bernardino Zapponi, Dino Risi', 'Romy Schneider, Marcello Mastroianni, Eva Maria Meineke, Wolfgang Preiss, Michael Kroecher, Paolo Baroni, Victoria Zinny, Giampiero Becherelli', null, 'Over two decades after their affair ended, a married man is haunted by the presence of his former lover.', 'Over two decades after their affair ended, a married man is haunted by the presence of his former lover.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wLfm5ENAvBWcGbJIPQdtFvFgSA7.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:116997'),
  ('861842905022665424', 'Ghost of Mae Nak', 2005, 'Horror, Mystery', 'Mark Duffield, Mark Duffield, Desho Bernard', 'Mark Duffield', 'Siwat Chotchaicharin, Nida Patcharaveerapong, Marasri Isarangkul, Porntip Papanai, Kowit Wattanakul, Kanjanaporn Plodpai, Meesak Nakarat, Charay Mueanprayun', null, 'Mak and Nak are a young couple who have just moved into their first home as a married couple. But the house they own has a history much older than them and spirits who won''t rest until they get what they want. And this time, love won''t conquer all!', 'Mak and Nak are a young couple who have just moved into their first home as a married couple. But the house they own has a history much older than them and spirits who won''t rest until they get what they want. And this time, love won''t conquer all!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wEWuBITzckXnJNpBGZZB8RZwpEU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:51077'),
  ('684825129781108693', 'Ghost Project', 2023, 'Horror, Science Fiction', 'Manuel Rebella, Federico Finkielstain', 'Santiago Fernández Calvete', 'Juan Cruz Rolla, Laura Casale, Zhongbo Li Zhang, Raymond Carmichael, Gayl Braddix, Camila Pizzo, Dan Buchler, Matt Wray', null, 'Three young programmers come across an abandoned technology meant to detect supernatural presence. They reverse engineer the tech and create an app for their phones which allows them to see ghosts, thus endangering their own lives.', 'Three young programmers come across an abandoned technology meant to detect supernatural presence. They reverse engineer the tech and create an app for their phones which allows them to see ghosts, thus endangering their own lives.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4sbAOlBm59vvLG2RxrwnAibn0uq.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1161663'),
  ('669403162789102990', 'Ghost Punting', 1992, 'Action, Comedy', 'Sammo Hung Kam-Bo, Corey Yuen, Ricky Lau', 'Barry Wong Ping-Yiu', 'Sammo Hung Kam-Bo, Eric Tsang Chi-Wai, Natalis Chan Pak-Cheung, Stanley Fung Shui-Fan, Richard Ng Yiu-Hon, Charlie Chin Chiang-Lin, Chin Ho, Ng Ka-Man', null, 'The "Five Lucky Stars" attempt to help a restless ghost take revenge on the evil drug gang who took his life. At the same time, they want the ghost to help them get rich and court the four policewomen assigned to the case.', 'The "Five Lucky Stars" attempt to help a restless ghost take revenge on the evil drug gang who took his life. At the same time, they want the ghost to help them get rich and court the four policewomen assigned to the case.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xpVVJcJ8ge0uiuPp7wr46LYD6GR.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:63032'),
  ('818341693438647762', 'Ghost Recon: Alpha', 2012, 'Action, Science Fiction, Thriller, War', 'Hervé de Crécy, François Alaux, Trent Opaloch', 'Timothy J. Sexton, Greg Pruss', 'Charlotte Rampling, Mark Ivanir, Keith Gilmore, Pavel Ledinsky, Erich Redman, Joplin Sibtain, Daniel Svoboda, Charles Venn', null, 'Ghost Recon: Alpha sees a team led by Ghost Leader infiltrate a trade at a Russian depot between a general and a mysterious other figure.', 'Ghost Recon: Alpha sees a team led by Ghost Leader infiltrate a trade at a Russian depot between a general and a mysterious other figure.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dVP2QZl7XL55jDMFBWJqMhM9js2.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:107170'),
  ('973131679802741827', 'Ghost Rider', 2007, 'Thriller, Action, Fantasy', 'Mark Steven Johnson, Russell Boyd, Brad Shield', 'Mark Steven Johnson', 'Nicolas Cage, Eva Mendes, Sam Elliott, Wes Bentley, Peter Fonda, Matt Long, Brett Cullen, Raquel Alessi', 'PG-13', 'In order to save his dying father, young stunt cyclist Johnny Blaze sells his soul to Mephistopheles and sadly parts from the pure-hearted Roxanne Simpson, the love of his life. Years later, Johnny''s path crosses again with Roxanne, now a go-getting reporter, and also with Mephistopheles, who offers to release Johnny''s soul if Johnny becomes the fabled, fiery ''Ghost Rider''.', 'In order to save his dying father, young stunt cyclist Johnny Blaze sells his soul to Mephistopheles and sadly parts from the pure-hearted Roxanne Simpson, the love of his life. Years later, Johnny''s path crosses again with Roxanne, now a go-getting reporter, and also with Mephistopheles, who offers to release Johnny''s soul if Johnny becomes the fabled, fiery ''Ghost Rider''.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1pyU94dAY7npDQCKuxCSyX9KthN.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1250'),
  ('1103578087666648201', 'Ghost Rider: Spirit of Vengeance', 2011, 'Action, Fantasy, Thriller', 'Brandon Trost, Brian Taylor, Mark Neveldine', 'David S. Goyer, Scott M. Gimple, Seth Hoffman', 'Nicolas Cage, Fergus Riordan, Violante Placido, Ciarán Hinds, Johnny Whitworth, Idris Elba, Spencer Wilding, Sorin Tofan', 'PG-13', 'When the devil resurfaces with aims to take over the world in human form, Johnny Blaze reluctantly comes out of hiding to transform into the flame-spewing supernatural hero Ghost Rider -- and rescue a 10-year-old boy from an unsavory end.', 'When the devil resurfaces with aims to take over the world in human form, Johnny Blaze reluctantly comes out of hiding to transform into the flame-spewing supernatural hero Ghost Rider -- and rescue a 10-year-old boy from an unsavory end.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fDtIZXLNreDHk3mOskJYABrQNOQ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:71676'),
  ('694217900861293138', 'Ghost Shark', 2013, 'Horror, Science Fiction', 'Griff Furst, Andrew Strahorn, Brian O''Sullivan', 'Griff Furst', 'Mackenzie Rosman, Shawn C. Phillips, Richard Moll, Jayme Bohn, Eliot Brasseaux, Amy Brassette, Sloane Coe, Robert Aberdeen', null, 'A coastal town is plagued by a supernatural man-eating shark. A ghost hunter joins forces with a sea captain to uncover the secrets of the area''s dark past and find a way to exorcise the spectral predator.', 'A coastal town is plagued by a supernatural man-eating shark. A ghost hunter joins forces with a sea captain to uncover the secrets of the area''s dark past and find a way to exorcise the spectral predator.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/erZ7mMudfRES9We5zmclUqQltoQ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:216539'),
  ('1098187059201769134', 'Ghost Ship', 1952, 'Horror, Thriller', 'Vernon Sewell, Stanley Grant', 'Vernon Sewell', 'Dermot Walsh, Hazel Court, Joss Ambler, Hugh Burden, Mignon O''Doherty, Hugh Latimer, Joan Carol, John Robinson', 'NR', 'Warned that it is haunted, a skeptical young couple buy a rundown yacht and fix it up to be their home-on-the-sea, only to slowly realize that it really is haunted.', 'Warned that it is haunted, a skeptical young couple buy a rundown yacht and fix it up to be their home-on-the-sea, only to slowly realize that it really is haunted.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8yl7rQNycO7di0LLs1EmzmbJdb8.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:117019'),
  ('817392640361578566', 'Ghost Ship', 2002, 'Horror, Mystery, Thriller', 'Steve Beck, Gale Tattersall, Charles McGuinness', 'Mark Hanlon, John Pogue', 'Gabriel Byrne, Julianna Margulies, Desmond Harrington, Ron Eldard, Isaiah Washington, Karl Urban, Emily Browning, Francesca Rettondini', 'R', 'After discovering a passenger ship missing since 1962 floating adrift on the Bering Sea, salvagers claim the vessel as their own. Once they begin towing the ghost ship towards harbor, a series of bizarre occurrences happen and the group becomes trapped inside the ship, which they soon learn is inhabited by a demonic creature.', 'After discovering a passenger ship missing since 1962 floating adrift on the Bering Sea, salvagers claim the vessel as their own. Once they begin towing the ghost ship towards harbor, a series of bizarre occurrences happen and the group becomes trapped inside the ship, which they soon learn is inhabited by a demonic creature.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kIlzZJqV4SCGHrrjoGLBhmsO7z2.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:9645'),
  ('1015211432520385396', 'Ghost Son', 2007, 'Drama, Horror, Mystery, Thriller', 'Tani Canevari, Lamberto Bava', 'Lamberto Bava, Silvia Ranfagni', 'Laura Harring, John Hannah, Pete Postlethwaite, Coralina Cataldi-Tassoni, Mosa Kaiser, Laura Susanne Ruedeberg, Jake David Matthewson, Mary Twala', 'R', 'A widowed newlywed stays on her deceased husband''s South African farm, then bears a child who seems to be possessed by the dead man.', 'A widowed newlywed stays on her deceased husband''s South African farm, then bears a child who seems to be possessed by the dead man.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zI9pjSsJff8JBsHlYPjRdGfqSq9.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:50392'),
  ('276755459822280543', 'Ghost Soup', 1992, 'Comedy, Drama, TV Movie', 'Shunji Iwai, Koji Kanaya, Isao Yukisada', 'Shunji Iwai', 'Ranran Suzuki, Hiroyuki Watari, Dave Spector, Ken Mitsuishi, Yumiko Fujita, Junji Takada, Kōichi Hayashi, Maki Onda', null, 'It''s Christmas Eve in Tokyo as Ichiro is moving into his new apartment one month ahead of schedule. As he is getting settled in, two strangers enter the apartment and are surprised to find him there. They begin complaining that he is upsetting their plans for a Christmas party to be thrown in the apartment that night before attempting to kick him out.', 'It''s Christmas Eve in Tokyo as Ichiro is moving into his new apartment one month ahead of schedule. As he is getting settled in, two strangers enter the apartment and are surprised to find him there. They begin complaining that he is upsetting their plans for a Christmas party to be thrown in the apartment that night before attempting to kick him out.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zLFu7lBLe4iBaetTvxPjB8qT2cs.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:206195'),
  ('574081692956668055', 'Ghost Squad', 2018, 'Horror, Fantasy, Action', 'Noboru Iguchi', 'Noboru Iguchi', 'Asaka Nakamura, Anna Yanagi, Yuni Akino, Minori Mikado, Sumire Ueno', null, 'After a group of girls get murdered, they come back as ghosts and seek revenge.', 'After a group of girls get murdered, they come back as ghosts and seek revenge.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/w8Dnm93aQYPnBbs0icYT8Fhd43d.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:460082'),
  ('147681523958666941', 'Ghost Stories', 1982, 'Horror', 'Hsin Yen', null, 'Jiang Lingling, Ai Ting, Chu Hui-Te, Kao Wen-Song, Chia-bao Lan', null, 'No description available yet.', 'No description available yet.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/m4ALMhsuqOOUkkABvgQWfrgoL8y.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:687259'),
  ('728260010258587510', 'Ghost Stories', 2018, 'Horror, Drama', 'Jeremy Dyson, Andy Nyman, Ole Bratt Birkeland', 'Jeremy Dyson, Andy Nyman', 'Andy Nyman, Paul Whitehouse, Alex Lawther, Martin Freeman, Samuel Bottomley, Deborah Wastell, Amy Doyle, Daniel Hill', null, 'Professor Philip Goodman devotes his life to exposing phony psychics and fraudulent supernatural shenanigans. His skepticism soon gets put to the test when he receives news of three chilling and inexplicable cases -- disturbing visions in an abandoned asylum, a car accident deep in the woods and the spirit of an unborn child. Even scarier -- each of the macabre stories seems to have a sinister connection to the professor''s own life.', 'Professor Philip Goodman devotes his life to exposing phony psychics and fraudulent supernatural shenanigans. His skepticism soon gets put to the test when he receives news of three chilling and inexplicable cases -- disturbing visions in an abandoned asylum, a car accident deep in the woods and the spirit of an unborn child. Even scarier -- each of the macabre stories seems to have a sinister connection to the professor''s own life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7a0sai9k5jr7YJRP5S3YIDErMVY.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:429417'),
  ('415658792039373569', 'Ghost Stories', 2020, 'Horror', 'Ranjan Palit, Ravi Ahuja, Nikita Grover', 'Zoya Akhtar, Dibakar Banerjee, Avinash Sampath', 'Janhvi Kapoor, Surekha Sikri, Vijay Varma, Sobhita Dhulipala, Sagar Arya, Zachary Braz, Pavail Gulati, Sukant Goel', 'NR', 'An anthology of four short horror tales.', 'An anthology of four short horror tales.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wszWo7WJwh8AdTZjK7yfljejjBU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:601643'),
  ('380421093075939849', 'Ghost Story', 1974, 'Mystery, Horror', 'Stephen Weeks, Peter Hurst', 'Philip Norman, Stephen Weeks, Rosemary Sutcliff', 'Larry Dann, Murray Melvin, Vivian MacKerrell, Marianne Faithfull, Penelope Keith, Barbara Shelley, Anthony Bate, Sally Grace', null, 'Several old college friends converge at a mansion, ostensibly for a pleasant reunion. Larry Dann, the most easygoing of the bunch, comes to the conclusion that all is not well in the old dark house. For one thing, he''s run across several people whom he''s never met. For another, they all seem to be of a different time and place.', 'Several old college friends converge at a mansion, ostensibly for a pleasant reunion. Larry Dann, the most easygoing of the bunch, comes to the conclusion that all is not well in the old dark house. For one thing, he''s run across several people whom he''s never met. For another, they all seem to be of a different time and place.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4krpdKziOjo6lFp9ddp5SNZqNSR.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:104116'),
  ('870244430492471660', 'Ghost Story', 1981, 'Horror, Drama, Thriller', 'John Irvin, Jack Cardiff, Dan Kolsrud', 'Lawrence D. Cohen', 'Fred Astaire, Melvyn Douglas, Douglas Fairbanks Jr., John Houseman, Craig Wasson, Patricia Neal, Alice Krige, Jacqueline Brookes', 'R', 'Four successful elderly gentlemen, members of the Chowder Society, share a gruesome, 50-year-old secret. When one of Edward Wanderley''s twin sons dies in a bizarre accident, the group begins to see a pattern of frightening events developing.', 'Four successful elderly gentlemen, members of the Chowder Society, share a gruesome, 50-year-old secret. When one of Edward Wanderley''s twin sons dies in a bizarre accident, the group begins to see a pattern of frightening events developing.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/awnN2k2726xqzqsmd3YcSe6lSj0.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:24634'),
  ('190787838856181840', 'Ghost Story of Kam Pin Mui', 1991, 'Horror, Fantasy, Drama', 'Li Bo-Han', null, 'Ku Feng, Wu Ma, Chan Pooi-Kei, Wong Mei-Ching, Man Siu', null, 'A quartet of sexy naked vampires and their ghostly family, helmed by Wu Ma, haunt the village of Kam Pin Mui in this traditional tale of good and evil.', 'A quartet of sexy naked vampires and their ghostly family, helmed by Wu Ma, haunt the village of Kam Pin Mui in this traditional tale of good and evil.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/texedfU179vUE4WP0g26Hlp0lfh.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:173122'),
  ('710993923533056137', 'Ghost Sweeper Mikami', 1994, 'Animation, Action, Adventure, Comedy, Fantasy, Horror', 'Atsutoshi Umezawa', 'Takashi Shiina', 'Hiromi Tsuru, Mariko Kouda, Takeshi Aono, Shigeru Chiba, Toshio Furukawa, Ryo Horikawa, Nobuhiko Kazama, Toshiyuki Morikawa', 'PG-13', 'Meet Mikami - the SEXY leader of one of Japan''s most successful independent ghost-busting agencies. Together with her eclectic team of exorcists, she''s prepared to do battle with any supernatural adversary - but only for the right price! When an ancient spirit enlists her aid to deal with a re-incarnated foe, Mikami gets more than she bargained for. As the wicked Nosferatu - a vampire lord able to absorb the very life essence of his victims - begins to turn the city''s inhabitants into mindless zombies, Mikami''s team must race against time to save Tokyo from destruction. Watch The Ultimate Vampire Slayer in this fast, fun and furious supernatural action-adventure!', 'Meet Mikami - the SEXY leader of one of Japan''s most successful independent ghost-busting agencies. Together with her eclectic team of exorcists, she''s prepared to do battle with any supernatural adversary - but only for the right price! When an ancient spirit enlists her aid to deal with a re-incarnated foe, Mikami gets more than she bargained for. As the wicked Nosferatu - a vampire lord able to absorb the very life essence of his victims - begins to turn the city''s inhabitants into mindless zombies, Mikami''s team must race against time to save Tokyo from destruction. Watch The Ultimate Vampire Slayer in this fast, fun and furious supernatural action-adventure!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ratYneTrbgbtvkPXs3cNp98fChQ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:129213'),
  ('743667579446609692', 'Ghost Sweepers', 2012, 'Adventure, Fantasy, Comedy, Mystery', 'Shin Jung-won, Sung Seung-taek, Song Jae-wan', 'Kwon Sung-hui', 'Kim Soo-ro, Kang Ye-won, Lee Je-hoon, Kwak Do-won, Kim Yoon-hye, Yang Kyung-mo, Kim Tae-hun, Lee Jun-hyeok', null, 'Chan-young, a young journalist, is sent to investigate a village which has supposedly been possessed by demons. The incidents taking place have been so strange and terrifying that local shamans and other religious leaders have simply given up, abandoning the town. But upon her arrival, Chan-young discovers that an all-star team of supernaturally-inclined heroes has assembled to rid the village of evil. This team includes Mr. PARK the exorcist, Shi-min the monk, Wol-gwang the clairvoyant, Seung-hee the tarot master, and Seok-hyeon, an engineer. Chan-young follows the heroes as they prepare for an epic battle against the village’s evil forces.', 'Chan-young, a young journalist, is sent to investigate a village which has supposedly been possessed by demons. The incidents taking place have been so strange and terrifying that local shamans and other religious leaders have simply given up, abandoning the town. But upon her arrival, Chan-young discovers that an all-star team of supernaturally-inclined heroes has assembled to rid the village of evil. This team includes Mr. PARK the exorcist, Shi-min the monk, Wol-gwang the clairvoyant, Seung-hee the tarot master, and Seok-hyeon, an engineer. Chan-young follows the heroes as they prepare for an epic battle against the village’s evil forces.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/egLt0vh5FCRZWaohW3XQKt0cFq4.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:142284'),
  ('812213161144323543', 'Ghost Team', 2016, 'Comedy, Horror', 'Oliver Irving, Timothy Naylor', 'Oliver Irving', 'Amy Sedaris, Martin Barabas, Justin Long, Jon Heder, David Krumholtz, Melonie Díaz, Veronika Dash, Tom Schiller', 'PG-13', 'A paranormal-obsessed man mounts his own investigation into the beyond with his depressed best friend, misfit nephew, a cable access medium and an overeager security guard.', 'A paranormal-obsessed man mounts his own investigation into the beyond with his depressed best friend, misfit nephew, a cable access medium and an overeager security guard.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kzfXA7vFwr1pgFtYiKL8Xh6ol64.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:404073'),
  ('719479063726748755', 'Ghost Team One', 2013, 'Comedy, Horror', 'Scott Rutherford, Ben Peyser', 'Arthur Pielli, Andrew Knauer', 'Fernanda Romero, Carlos Santos, J.R. Villarreal, Tony Cavalero, Meghan Falcone, James Babson, Craig Stott, Scott MacArthur', 'R', 'Two roommates deathly afraid of ghosts both fall in love with a girl who believes their home is haunted.', 'Two roommates deathly afraid of ghosts both fall in love with a girl who believes their home is haunted.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dfZERS5Xk1s4xuPpkEn5o2acQu.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:159638'),
  ('894861147665059244', 'Ghost Theater', 2015, 'Horror', 'Hideo Nakata, Ryuichi Saeki', 'Junya Kato, Ryuta Miyake, Hideo Nakata', 'Haruka Shimazaki, Rika Adachi, Riho Takada, Keita Machida, Mantaro Koichi, Ikuji Nakamura, Asana Mamoru, Tarō Suwa', null, 'Sara, a young actress, is able to land the leading role in big theater play, but soon learns that somebody or something is trying to end the production at all cost, which puts Sara in deadly danger.', 'Sara, a young actress, is able to land the leading role in big theater play, but soon learns that somebody or something is trying to end the production at all cost, which puts Sara in deadly danger.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vjI4SfYKAXU5bpdhkJ5qiZArqVi.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:371241'),
  ('156369309336397497', 'Ghost Town', 1988, 'Horror, Western, Crime', 'Richard Governor, Michael Becker, Lamar Card', 'Duke Sandefur, David Schmoeller', 'Franc Luz, Catherine Hickland, Jimmie F. Skaggs, Bruce Glover, Zitto Kazann, Laura Schaefer, Michael Alldredge, Penelope Windust', 'R', 'Deputy Langley tracks a kidnapped girl to an abandoned ghost town. However, the town is not abandoned, but haunted by the spirits of an outlaw, Devlin, and his gang, who hold the equally deceased townspeople hostage until the outlaws can be killed by a lawman.', 'Deputy Langley tracks a kidnapped girl to an abandoned ghost town. However, the town is not abandoned, but haunted by the spirits of an outlaw, Devlin, and his gang, who hold the equally deceased townspeople hostage until the outlaws can be killed by a lawman.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mMw96ItmxOKp4lAtmoN3BPf1ayT.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:90926'),
  ('1136507483757207131', 'Ghost Town', 2008, 'Comedy, Romance, Drama, Fantasy', 'David Koepp, Fred Murphy, Nancy Herrmann', 'John Kamps, David Koepp', 'Ricky Gervais, Greg Kinnear, Téa Leoni, Billy Campbell, Aasif Mandvi, Dana Ivey, Kristen Wiig, Michael-Leon Wooley', 'PG-13', 'Bertram Pincus, a cranky, people-hating Manhattan dentist, develops the unwelcome ability to see dead people. Really annoying dead people. Even worse, they all want something from him, particularly Frank Herlihy, a smooth-talking ghost, who pesters him into a romantic scheme involving his widow Gwen. They are soon entangled in a hilarious predicament between the now and the hereafter!', 'Bertram Pincus, a cranky, people-hating Manhattan dentist, develops the unwelcome ability to see dead people. Really annoying dead people. Even worse, they all want something from him, particularly Frank Herlihy, a smooth-talking ghost, who pesters him into a romantic scheme involving his widow Gwen. They are soon entangled in a hilarious predicament between the now and the hereafter!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/b8VS14DwpLlugTxVWSllYU0Gjn5.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:12797'),
  ('501152526735183752', 'Ghost Town', 2009, 'Horror, Western, Science Fiction', 'Todor Chapkanov, Anton Bakarski', 'Andy Briggs', 'Jessica Lee Rose, Randy Wayne, Gil Gerard, Billy Drago, Annabelle Wallis, Elize du Toit, Joey Ansah, Cian Barry', null, 'Reb Halland, who lives in the era of Wild West, has made a deal with the devil to gain immortality alog with his gang. Preacher McCready is trying to protect the small town by placing five totems around the town in the shape of pinnacle. One day, an collector passes by the town and sees one of the totems pinned to the earth and he decides to take it. When the man takes the totem out of ground Halland and his gang arrives and start killing everyone. The film moves to the present day when a group of college students driving back home from another city after a debate contest suddenly find themselves at this town. Soon they start to be murdered one by one, and it will be up to them to find the secret of this town and destroy Halland and his gang.', 'Reb Halland, who lives in the era of Wild West, has made a deal with the devil to gain immortality alog with his gang. Preacher McCready is trying to protect the small town by placing five totems around the town in the shape of pinnacle. One day, an collector passes by the town and sees one of the totems pinned to the earth and he decides to take it. When the man takes the totem out of ground Halland and his gang arrives and start killing everyone. The film moves to the present day when a group of college students driving back home from another city after a debate contest suddenly find themselves at this town. Soon they start to be murdered one by one, and it will be up to them to find the secret of this town and destroy Halland and his gang.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uykJ7fyZxh74llvf5TtX9ZJYurO.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:72859'),
  ('150611384412952466', 'Ghost Town Anthology', 2019, 'Drama, Mystery', 'Morgane Pinel, Catherine Kirouac, Gabrielle Mankiewicz', 'Denis Côté', 'Robert Naylor, Josée Deschênes, Jean-Michel Anctil, Larissa Corriveau, Diane Lavallée, Rémi Goulet, Jocelyne Zucco, Normand Carrière', null, 'It is a small village somewhere in Quebec with only 215 inhabitants. When young Simon Dubé dies in a car accident, the villagers’ tranquil and regulated existence is thrown out of step. People are decidedly reluctant to talk about the accident. Time seems to lose all meaning. Snowy, frosty winter days stretch out into infinity. Mysterious figures emerge from the fog and commit strange acts. But what seems strange is sometimes more familiar than one might suspect.', 'It is a small village somewhere in Quebec with only 215 inhabitants. When young Simon Dubé dies in a car accident, the villagers’ tranquil and regulated existence is thrown out of step. People are decidedly reluctant to talk about the accident. Time seems to lose all meaning. Snowy, frosty winter days stretch out into infinity. Mysterious figures emerge from the fog and commit strange acts. But what seems strange is sometimes more familiar than one might suspect.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aEOM10uq1SkAeFVcSxVShjg9fBH.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:568790'),
  ('735867570954360029', 'Ghost Trail', 2024, 'Thriller, Drama', 'Jonathan Millet, Olivier Boonjing', 'Jonathan Millet, Florence Rochat', 'Adam Bessa, Tawfeek Barhom, Julia Franz Richter, Hala Rajab, Shafiqa El Till, Sylvain Samson, Mohammad Saboor Rasooli, Faisal Alia', null, 'After being imprisoned by the Assad regime in Syria, Hamid now works undercover as part of a secret group pursuing their leaders, including the guard he suspects was responsible for his torture.', 'After being imprisoned by the Assad regime in Syria, Hamid now works undercover as part of a secret group pursuing their leaders, including the guard he suspects was responsible for his torture.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qO0ZWq3w6uvb06YleIAIGtoGnku.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1001292'),
  ('159959013970238138', 'Ghost Train', 2006, 'Horror', 'Takeshi Furusawa, Noriyuki Mizuguchi', null, 'Erika Sawajiri, Chinatsu Wakatsuki, Shun Oguri, Aya Sugimoto, Itsuji Itao, Miyoko Asada, Koki Kato, Shigeru Saiki', null, 'On her way to school, high school girl Nana sees a train accident. Then Nana and her friend Kanae start to come across various bizarre phenomena, including red fingerprints and a female spirit who ''lives'' on the station platform. One day, Nana''s younger sister is lost, and the only possibility seems to be that she had been taken by these spirits. The missing tracks. The predictions that a mysterious woman makes.', 'On her way to school, high school girl Nana sees a train accident. Then Nana and her friend Kanae start to come across various bizarre phenomena, including red fingerprints and a female spirit who ''lives'' on the station platform. One day, Nana''s younger sister is lost, and the only possibility seems to be that she had been taken by these spirits. The missing tracks. The predictions that a mysterious woman makes.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kR2DZjar3uRW7LZMXJMbDWR2V8B.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:7513'),
  ('1011928509492856418', 'Ghost Train', 2025, 'Horror, Mystery', 'Tak Se-woong, Kwon Young-il', 'Jo Ba-reun', 'Joo Hyun-young, Jeon Bae-soo, Choi Bo-min, Kim Ji-in, Kim Woo-kyum, Jung Han-bit, Kim Na-yeon, Lim Cheol-soo', 'NR', 'Da-kyung, a horror YouTuber desperate for views, uploads a video about the eerie urban legends surrounding Gwanglim Station—the site of the highest number of missing person cases in the country. The video goes viral overnight. Despite everyone''s warnings, Da-kyung''s thirst for views only grows stronger. But as she digs deeper, she uncovers a shocking secret behind the station…', 'Da-kyung, a horror YouTuber desperate for views, uploads a video about the eerie urban legends surrounding Gwanglim Station—the site of the highest number of missing person cases in the country. The video goes viral overnight. Despite everyone''s warnings, Da-kyung''s thirst for views only grows stronger. But as she digs deeper, she uncovers a shocking secret behind the station…', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rOTXYy5ScOHdaC2YMQowVwQex5s.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1241624'),
  ('446159476639547376', 'Ghost Tropic', 2020, 'Drama', 'Siel Van Daele, Didier Frateur, Bas Devos', 'Bas Devos', 'Saadia Bentaïeb, Laurent Kumba, Jovial Mbenga, Sara Sampelayo, Mieke De Groote, Anemone Valcke, Stefan Gota, Edoardo Ripani', null, 'After a long day at work, fiftyeight-year-old Khadija falls asleep on the last subway train. When she wakes up at the end of the line, she has no choice but to make her way home on foot. On her nocturnal journey she finds herself compelled to ask for and give help to the other inhabitants of the night.', 'After a long day at work, fiftyeight-year-old Khadija falls asleep on the last subway train. When she wakes up at the end of the line, she has no choice but to make her way home on foot. On her nocturnal journey she finds herself compelled to ask for and give help to the other inhabitants of the night.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gZFuhwJWHPzsPGMtfJGppgBopxO.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:597093'),
  ('746055328985363108', 'Ghost Voyage', 2008, 'Horror, Science Fiction, TV Movie', 'James Oxford, Anton Bakarski', 'Glenn R. Bloom, Rob Mecarini', 'Antonio Sabàto, Jr., Deanna Russo, Nicolas Irons, P.J. Marino, Adrian Neil, Julian Berlin', 'PG-13', 'A group of passengers plot their escape off a haunted ship to hell.', 'A group of passengers plot their escape off a haunted ship to hell.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vCTvHz7NW10kcoxYxud5xrrS5l.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:57529'),
  ('464030651189253681', 'Ghost Warrior', 1984, 'Crime, Action, Science Fiction', 'J. Larry Carroll, Mac Ahlberg, Debbie Pinthus', 'Tim Curnen', 'Hiroshi Fujioka, John Calvin, Janet Julian, Charles Lampkin, Frank Schuller, Bill Morey, Andy Wood, Robert Kino', null, 'When skiers in Japan come across the frozen body of centuries-old samurai warrior Yoshimita, scientists secretly whisk the corpse to a high-tech laboratory in California, where they bring him back to life. But when Yoshimita escapes onto the mean streets of 1980s Los Angeles, his ancient and strict code of honor gets him both into and out of trouble. J. Larry Carroll directs this low-budget action fantasy.', 'When skiers in Japan come across the frozen body of centuries-old samurai warrior Yoshimita, scientists secretly whisk the corpse to a high-tech laboratory in California, where they bring him back to life. But when Yoshimita escapes onto the mean streets of 1980s Los Angeles, his ancient and strict code of honor gets him both into and out of trouble. J. Larry Carroll directs this low-budget action fantasy.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rD0pSQ4tIoTNzUli5CPP5jGBTk.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:40837'),
  ('760006090997443732', 'Ghost with Driver', 1996, 'Comedy, Fantasy', 'Gérard Oury, Robert Fraisse', 'Francis Veber', 'Philippe Noiret, Gérard Jugnot, Jean-Luc Bideau, Charlotte Kady, Daniel Russo, Béatrice Agenin, Maxime Boidron, Sophie Desmarets', null, 'A chauffeur for a corrupt CEO, and a few hours later, his boss himself, are killed by the industrialist''s associate. But their ghosts remain on Earth, and they try to tell the millionaire''s teenage son the identity of the killer.', 'A chauffeur for a corrupt CEO, and a few hours later, his boss himself, are killed by the industrialist''s associate. But their ghosts remain on Earth, and they try to tell the millionaire''s teenage son the identity of the killer.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/saQUmh4WiHwdOhPwGaINtrap3fS.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:50214'),
  ('75423543326307960', 'Ghost World', 2001, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Terry Zwigoff, Affonso Beato, William Paul Clark', 'Daniel Clowes, Terry Zwigoff', 'Thora Birch, Scarlett Johansson, Steve Buscemi, Brad Renfro, Illeana Douglas, Bob Balaban, Stacey Travis, Charles C. Stevenson Jr.', 'R', 'Two quirky, cynical teenaged girls try to figure out what to do with their lives after high school graduation. After they play a prank on an eccentric, middle aged record collector, one of them befriends him, which causes a rift in the girls’ friendship.', 'Two quirky, cynical teenaged girls try to figure out what to do with their lives after high school graduation. After they play a prank on an eccentric, middle aged record collector, one of them befriends him, which causes a rift in the girls’ friendship.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uwKqnUPE4dSM0kKuMW0vXpURh2T.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1548'),
  ('581917126028859165', 'Ghost Writer', 1989, 'Comedy', 'Kenneth J. Hall, Nicholas Josef von Sternberg', 'Kenneth J. Hall', 'Audrey Landers, Judy Landers, John Matuszak, David Doyle, George Buck Flower, Pedro Gonzalez Gonzalez, Joey Travolta, Jeff Conaway', 'PG', 'A writer moves into a Malibu beach house, and comes up against the ghost of an actress who supposedly had committed suicide there 30 years previously, but had been murdered by her boyfriend. The ghost asks the writer''s help in proving her boyfriend the killer.', 'A writer moves into a Malibu beach house, and comes up against the ghost of an actress who supposedly had committed suicide there 30 years previously, but had been murdered by her boyfriend. The ghost asks the writer''s help in proving her boyfriend the killer.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fPebwUDUwhF215dWh3JnoExHRFh.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:262986'),
  ('589944535383444932', 'Ghostbusters', 1984, 'Comedy, Fantasy', 'László Kovács, Ivan Reitman, Katterli Frauenfelder', 'Harold Ramis, Dan Aykroyd', 'Bill Murray, Dan Aykroyd, Sigourney Weaver, Harold Ramis, Rick Moranis, Annie Potts, William Atherton, Ernie Hudson', 'PG', 'After losing their university jobs, three parapsychologists start a ghost-catching business in New York City and uncover a supernatural threat that could destroy the world.', 'After losing their university jobs, three parapsychologists start a ghost-catching business in New York City and uncover a supernatural threat that could destroy the world.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7E8nLijS9AwwUEPu2oFYOVKhdFA.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:620'),
  ('13629101215263983', 'Ghostbusters', 2016, 'Action, Fantasy, Comedy', 'G.A. Aguilar, Paul Feig, Robert D. Yeoman', 'Katie Dippold, Paul Feig', 'Kristen Wiig, Melissa McCarthy, Kate McKinnon, Leslie Jones, Chris Hemsworth, Neil Casey, Zach Woods, Ed Begley Jr.', 'PG-13', 'Following a ghost invasion of Manhattan, paranormal enthusiasts Erin Gilbert and Abby Yates, nuclear engineer Jillian Holtzmann, and subway worker Patty Tolan band together to stop the otherworldly threat.', 'Following a ghost invasion of Manhattan, paranormal enthusiasts Erin Gilbert and Abby Yates, nuclear engineer Jillian Holtzmann, and subway worker Patty Tolan band together to stop the otherworldly threat.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wJmWliwXIgZOCCVOcGRBhce7xPS.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:43074'),
  ('916969261076285280', 'Ghostbusters II', 1989, 'Comedy, Fantasy', 'Ivan Reitman, Michael Chapman, Peter Giuliano', 'Dan Aykroyd, Harold Ramis', 'Bill Murray, Dan Aykroyd, Sigourney Weaver, Harold Ramis, Rick Moranis, Ernie Hudson, Annie Potts, Peter MacNicol', 'PG', 'The discovery of a massive river of ectoplasm and a resurgence of spectral activity allows the staff of Ghostbusters to revive the business.', 'The discovery of a massive river of ectoplasm and a resurgence of spectral activity allows the staff of Ghostbusters to revive the business.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yObYPMA58DnTMvJooFW7GG6jWAt.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:2978'),
  ('271036096244405425', 'Ghostbusters: Afterlife', 2021, 'Fantasy, Comedy, Adventure', 'Katrina Sainz, Joel Tobman, Brian Smrz', 'Harold Ramis, Dan Aykroyd, Jason Reitman', 'Mckenna Grace, Finn Wolfhard, Carrie Coon, Bokeem Woodbine, Paul Rudd, Logan Kim, Celeste O''Connor, Bill Murray', 'PG-13', 'When single mom Callie and her two kids Trevor and Phoebe arrive in a small Oklahoma town, they begin to discover their connection to the original Ghostbusters and the secret legacy their grandfather left behind.', 'When single mom Callie and her two kids Trevor and Phoebe arrive in a small Oklahoma town, they begin to discover their connection to the original Ghostbusters and the secret legacy their grandfather left behind.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sg4xJaufDiQl7caFEskBtQXfD4x.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:425909'),
  ('621260766088342110', 'Ghostbusters: Frozen Empire', 2024, 'Fantasy, Adventure, Comedy', 'Gil Kenan, Eric Steelberg, Daryn McLaughlan', 'Gil Kenan, Jason Reitman, Dan Aykroyd', 'Mckenna Grace, Paul Rudd, Carrie Coon, Finn Wolfhard, Dan Aykroyd, Kumail Nanjiani, Patton Oswalt, Celeste O''Connor', 'PG-13', 'When the discovery of an ancient artifact unleashes an evil force, Ghostbusters new and old must join forces to protect their home and save the world from a second Ice Age.', 'When the discovery of an ancient artifact unleashes an evil force, Ghostbusters new and old must join forces to protect their home and save the world from a second Ice Age.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/e1J2oNzSBdou01sUvriVuoYp0pJ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:967847'),
  ('826435748599160771', 'Ghosted', 2009, 'Drama, Thriller, Mystery, Romance', 'Monika Treut', 'Monika Treut, Astrid Ströher', 'Inga Busch, Huan-ru Ke, Hu Tingting, Jana Schulz, Marek Harloff, Lu Yi-ching, Jack Kao, Nick Dong-Sik', null, 'A woman who is mourning the love of her life falls into a relationship with a mysterious stranger.', 'A woman who is mourning the love of her life falls into a relationship with a mysterious stranger.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/e6n8btzudF0zcTQHIOthVkgvge7.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:53846'),
  ('112451325833703602', 'Ghosted', 2023, 'Action, Comedy, Romance', 'Garrett Warren, Dexter Fletcher, Ashley Fidalgo Fogleman', 'Rhett Reese, Paul Wernick, Chris McKenna', 'Chris Evans, Ana de Armas, Adrien Brody, Mike Moh, Amy Sedaris, Tate Donovan, Tim Blake Nelson, Marwan Kenzari', 'PG-13', 'Salt-of-the-earth Cole falls head over heels for enigmatic Sadie—but then makes the shocking discovery that she''s a secret agent. Before they can decide on a second date, Cole and Sadie are swept away on an international adventure to save the world.', 'Salt-of-the-earth Cole falls head over heels for enigmatic Sadie—but then makes the shocking discovery that she''s a secret agent. Before they can decide on a second date, Cole and Sadie are swept away on an international adventure to save the world.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/liLN69YgoovHVgmlHJ876PKi5Yi.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:868759'),
  ('1076006813178940098', 'Ghosthouse', 1988, 'Horror', 'Umberto Lenzi, Rubina Michettoni, Franco Delli Colli', 'Cinthia McGavin', 'Lara Wendel, Greg Rhodes, Mary Sellers, Ron Houck, Martin Jay, Kate Silver, Donald O''Brien, Robert Champagne', 'R', 'A group of unlikely companions receive a radio call leading to a deserted house with a grisly past.', 'A group of unlikely companions receive a radio call leading to a deserted house with a grisly past.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hC7qz0fYeomKqcieHmcBV1wRx0R.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:30997'),
  ('526005223934573108', 'Ghosthunters', 2016, 'Horror', 'Spencer Hutchins, Pearry Reginald Teo', 'Pearry Reginald Teo', 'Francesca Santoro, Stephen Manley, David O''Donnell, Liz Fenning, London Grace, Anna Harr, Crystal Web, Kjai Block', null, 'When one of their own loses his wife and daughter at the hands of a serial killer, a team of ghost hunters is determined to capture the spirits of the loved ones so their spirits can finally rest in peace. But as the team goes deeper into the house, the ghosts become more hostile, and the group discovers the true secrets of the house and its murderer.', 'When one of their own loses his wife and daughter at the hands of a serial killer, a team of ghost hunters is determined to capture the spirits of the loved ones so their spirits can finally rest in peace. But as the team goes deeper into the house, the ghosts become more hostile, and the group discovers the true secrets of the house and its murderer.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/A5trbZjaureXY7cj7Vpik7upw5R.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:404961'),
  ('974418847049337754', 'Ghosthunters: On Icy Trails', 2015, 'Comedy, Family, Fantasy', 'Tobi Baumann, Thomas W. Kiennast, Miguel A. Fuertes', 'Martin Ritzenhoff, Roland Slawik, Christian Tramitz', 'Milo Parker, Anke Engelke, Bastian Pastewka, Christian Tramitz, Karoline Herfurth, Christian Ulmen, Julia Koschitz, Ruby O. Fee', 'PG', 'They couldn''t be more different, the members of the trio that allies in the fight against an Ancient Ice Ghost (AIG): Tom, an easily scared boy, Hetty, a professional ghosthunter and the loveable, but pretty slimy Hugo - a ghost. Will the team manage to save their town from the next ice age?', 'They couldn''t be more different, the members of the trio that allies in the fight against an Ancient Ice Ghost (AIG): Tom, an easily scared boy, Hetty, a professional ghosthunter and the loveable, but pretty slimy Hugo - a ghost. Will the team manage to save their town from the next ice age?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nQkBy6DVgvZYi18Zd3GdQTbXkon.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:333112'),
  ('19211291341318023', 'Ghostkeeper', 1981, 'Horror, Thriller', 'John Holbrook, Jim Makichuk, Maggie Cole', 'Doug MacLeod, Jim Makichuk', 'Riva Spier, Murray Ord, Sheri McFadden, Georgie Collins, Les Kimber, Bill Grove, John MacMillan', 'R', 'A group of three friends on a snowmobiling trip find themselves stranded at an abandoned lodge isolated in the mountains. They discover that an old woman resides in the hotel, along with an evil entity that she is keeping in the basement.', 'A group of three friends on a snowmobiling trip find themselves stranded at an abandoned lodge isolated in the mountains. They discover that an old woman resides in the hotel, along with an evil entity that she is keeping in the basement.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mtp1L82bCKQZt8rLuErco11ByVP.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:85189'),
