  ('1017122328789477997', 'Giannis: The Marvelous Journey', 2024, 'Documentary', 'Kristen Lappas, Michael Bollacke, Thomas McCallum', null, 'Giannis Antetokounmpo, Veronica Antetokounmpo, Thanasis Antetokounmpo, Kostas Antetokounmpo, Alex Antetokounmpo, Mariah Riddlesprigger, Jason Kidd, Khris Middleton', null, 'A documentary that chronicles the extraordinary odyssey of NBA mega-star Giannis Antetokounmpo from an impoverished childhood in Greece as the son of Nigerian immigrants to the very top of the basketball world.', 'A documentary that chronicles the extraordinary odyssey of NBA mega-star Giannis Antetokounmpo from an impoverished childhood in Greece as the son of Nigerian immigrants to the very top of the basketball world.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/heOqng8QyxEFOuHdF6p4HGw70Zn.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1231942'),
  ('594645542247983305', 'Giant', 1956, 'Drama, Western, Romance', 'William C. Mellor, George Stevens, Joseph E. Rickards', 'Ivan Moffat, Fred Guiol', 'Elizabeth Taylor, Rock Hudson, James Dean, Carroll Baker, Jane Withers, Chill Wills, Mercedes McCambridge, Dennis Hopper', 'NR', 'Wealthy rancher Bick Benedict and dirt-poor cowboy Jett Rink both woo Leslie Lynnton, a beautiful young woman from Maryland who is new to Texas. She marries Benedict, but she is shocked by the racial bigotry of the White Texans against the local people of Mexican descent. Rink discovers oil on a small plot of land, and while he uses his vast, new wealth to buy all the land surrounding the Benedict ranch, the Benedict''s disagreement over prejudice fuels conflict that runs across generations.', 'Wealthy rancher Bick Benedict and dirt-poor cowboy Jett Rink both woo Leslie Lynnton, a beautiful young woman from Maryland who is new to Texas. She marries Benedict, but she is shocked by the racial bigotry of the White Texans against the local people of Mexican descent. Rink discovers oil on a small plot of land, and while he uses his vast, new wealth to buy all the land surrounding the Benedict ranch, the Benedict''s disagreement over prejudice fuels conflict that runs across generations.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/h5RRYPVVuHzd7QOJyP5Dsi8J9XZ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1712'),
  ('880902131725644446', 'Giant', 2009, 'Drama, Romance', 'Adrián Biniez, Arauco Hernández Holz', 'Adrián Biniez', 'Horacio Camandulle, Leonor Svarcas, Néstor Guzzini, Federico Garcia, Fabiana Charlo, Ernesto Liotti, Diego Artucio, Carlos Lissardy', null, 'A chronicle of a supermarket security guard''s obsession with a late-shift janitor.', 'A chronicle of a supermarket security guard''s obsession with a late-shift janitor.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bAMkRRIApE2APQMttwMVzi3XFiK.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:39488'),
  ('990941468204701578', 'Giant', 2026, 'Drama, Biography, Sport, History', 'Rowan Athale, Larry Smith, Colin Jones', 'Rowan Athale', 'Amir El-Masry, Pierce Brosnan, Toby Stephens, Katherine Dow Blyton, Asan N''Jie', null, 'Inspired by the real-life story of Prince Naseem "Naz" Hamed, a British-Yemeni boxer, and his journey from humble beginnings to becoming a world champion and his training under Brendan Ingle, who played a crucial role in his success.', 'Inspired by the real-life story of Prince Naseem "Naz" Hamed, a British-Yemeni boxer, and his journey from humble beginnings to becoming a world champion and his training under Brendan Ingle, who played a crucial role in his success.', 'https://images.plex.tv/photo?size=large-1280&url=https%3A%2F%2Fimage.tmdb.org%2Ft%2Fp%2Foriginal%2F1KKmUdFulYDVSV31nQt9LVm3Oue.jpg', 'plex:movie:giant-2026'),
  ('390892772112353494', 'Giant from the Unknown', 1958, 'Horror', 'Richard E. Cunha, Richard E. Cunha', 'Frank Hart Taussig, Ralph Brooke', 'Ed Kemmer, Sally Fraser, Morris Ankrum, Bob Steele, Buddy Baer, Gary Crutcher, Billy Dix, Oliver Blake', 'NR', 'A series of grisly murders plague a small mountain community and the sheriff suspects a local scientist whom he dislikes. Together with a former professor and the professor''s pretty daughter, the scientist sets about solving the crimes and discovers the killer is an oversized 16th century conquistador, resurrected by a lightning bolt from his mountain grave.', 'A series of grisly murders plague a small mountain community and the sheriff suspects a local scientist whom he dislikes. Together with a former professor and the professor''s pretty daughter, the scientist sets about solving the crimes and discovers the killer is an oversized 16th century conquistador, resurrected by a lightning bolt from his mountain grave.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5Er7lEm2ukXBnkT7dq6hVP8fMJy.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:52202'),
  ('291772654781691185', 'Giant God Warrior Appears in Tokyo', 2012, 'Science Fiction, Horror, Action, Animation', 'Keiichi Sakurai, Keizo Suzuki, Shinji Higuchi', 'Hideaki Anno', 'Megumi Hayashibara, Hayao Miyazaki', null, 'The short focuses on the God Warrior from Nausicaa of The Valley of The Wind (1984). Super-powered bio-weapons in ceramic armor begin attacking Tokyo, annihilating human civilization.', 'The short focuses on the God Warrior from Nausicaa of The Valley of The Wind (1984). Super-powered bio-weapons in ceramic armor begin attacking Tokyo, annihilating human civilization.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oObJQ17AL0cD1KijlbX63K7Tm3u.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:188541'),
  ('1078361961566104156', 'Giant Little Ones', 2019, 'Drama', 'Keith Behrman, Guy Godfree', 'Keith Behrman', 'Josh Wiggins, Darren Mann, Taylor Hickson, Maria Bello, Kyle MacLachlan, Carson MacCormac, Olivia Scriven, Niamh Wilson', 'R', 'Two popular teen boys, best friends since childhood, discover their lives, families, and girlfriends dramatically upended after an unexpected incident occurs on the night of a 17th birthday party.', 'Two popular teen boys, best friends since childhood, discover their lives, families, and girlfriends dramatically upended after an unexpected incident occurs on the night of a 17th birthday party.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/j4U3nFK1JcvfCm9SyBta2g0eTwU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:537681'),
  ('3528857594898420', 'Giant Spider', 2021, 'Thriller, Horror', 'Li Yadong', null, 'Yu Rongguang, Zhou Hengyuan, Liu Weizhou, Su Youchen, Qin Liyang, Li Xiaoai', null, 'In a mysterious laboratory located in the desert, the experimental spiders used for genetic research mutate and turn into giant spider monsters, turning the laboratory into a giant spider''s lair. A few days later, a special warfare team led by the captain Gao Qiang, escorting Dr. Chen, a scientist of the Kwon Plant Group, goes to the laboratory to rescue the trapped people and try to retrieve the relevant scientific research data', 'In a mysterious laboratory located in the desert, the experimental spiders used for genetic research mutate and turn into giant spider monsters, turning the laboratory into a giant spider''s lair. A few days later, a special warfare team led by the captain Gao Qiang, escorting Dr. Chen, a scientist of the Kwon Plant Group, goes to the laboratory to rescue the trapped people and try to retrieve the relevant scientific research data', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5ApvzOzDQHMvrp59tOiCF2yLh7d.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:835786'),
  ('299318601213368494', 'Giantess Battle Attack!', 2022, 'Science Fiction, Comedy, Horror', 'Jim Wynorski, Chuck Cirino', 'Kent Roudebush', 'Ivy Smith, Brian Gross, Masuimi Max, Steve Altman, Kira Noir, Lisa London, Lauren Nicole Smith, Deborah Dutch', 'PG-13', 'The beautiful, beastly Beverly returns and faces a new gaggle of gargantuan gals, hell bent on achieving deluxe diva domination. Get ready for the cinematic smackdown thrills of Giantess Battle Attack. Size really does matter.', 'The beautiful, beastly Beverly returns and faces a new gaggle of gargantuan gals, hell bent on achieving deluxe diva domination. Get ready for the cinematic smackdown thrills of Giantess Battle Attack. Size really does matter.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wj6cbxh1e8h21R3FOPil19lnIkv.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1026202'),
  ('687116797092462633', 'Giantland', 1933, 'Animation', 'Burt Gillett', null, 'Walt Disney, Marcellite Garner', 'NR', 'Mickey''s orphans ask for a story; Mickey casts himself as Jack in Jack and the Beanstalk. He starts with the climbing of the beanstalk; after evading the giant a few times, he ends up inside a cheese sandwich, and then in the giant''s mouth, where he ultimately grabs onto a pipe and gets pulled out by the giant. In the ensuing chase, Mickey launches a pepper bomb to slow the giant down, then outruns him coming down the beanstalk and sets the stalk on fire.', 'Mickey''s orphans ask for a story; Mickey casts himself as Jack in Jack and the Beanstalk. He starts with the climbing of the beanstalk; after evading the giant a few times, he ends up inside a cheese sandwich, and then in the giant''s mouth, where he ultimately grabs onto a pipe and gets pulled out by the giant. In the ensuing chase, Mickey launches a pepper bomb to slow the giant down, then outruns him coming down the beanstalk and sets the stalk on fire.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ejWDAx9tHXyNsyZ29ucGIkwKU1E.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:161832'),
  ('862784576263023659', 'Giants and Toys', 1958, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Yasuzō Masumura, Hiroshi Murai, Yoshio Inoue', 'Yoshio Shirasaka', 'Hiroshi Kawaguchi, Hitomi Nozoe, Yūnosuke Itō, Michiko Ono, Kyū Sazanka, Kinzō Shin, Hideo Takamatsu, Hisako Horigome', null, 'Nishi is an advertising executive for a caramel company that is planning to launch a new product, in fierce competition with two other companies.', 'Nishi is an advertising executive for a caramel company that is planning to launch a new product, in fierce competition with two other companies.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uu9PjSOV76c2sKgbXJBIYBHYgBo.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:76754'),
  ('260495168030379488', 'Giants Don''t Exist', 2017, 'Drama', 'Chema Rodríguez, Álvaro Rodríguez Sánchez', 'Elías León Siminiani, Chema Rodríguez, Francisco Vargas', 'Rafael Rojas, Marta Tuyuc, Luis Carlos Pineda, Andrés Toz, José Javier Martínez', null, 'Guatemala, in the 80s. The worst days of the Civil war. Andrés is 9 years old. He lives with Pedro González, one of the men who massacred all the women and children in his village. Andrés has survived, but he''s scared. Pedro''s wife, María, is also scared, scared to go out, scared to lose Andrés, whom she considers as "her new son" - even Pedro is scared, scared of himself and what the Army bounds him to do. Andrés would like to run away but he also wants to stay in his new family - until his sister appears.', 'Guatemala, in the 80s. The worst days of the Civil war. Andrés is 9 years old. He lives with Pedro González, one of the men who massacred all the women and children in his village. Andrés has survived, but he''s scared. Pedro''s wife, María, is also scared, scared to go out, scared to lose Andrés, whom she considers as "her new son" - even Pedro is scared, scared of himself and what the Army bounds him to do. Andrés would like to run away but he also wants to stay in his new family - until his sister appears.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gCbrGFojcZ0W2y0mAwSrGSe0Od3.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:482474'),
  ('680950136074236382', 'Gideon', 1998, 'Comedy, Drama, Romance', 'Claudia Hoover, João Fernandes', 'Brad Mirman', 'Christopher Lambert, Charlton Heston, Carroll O''Connor, Shirley Jones, Mike Connors, Barbara Bain, Shelley Winters, Crystal Bernard', null, 'Gideon Dobbs is young, simple-minded man who has never stopped dreaming. He checks into a retirement home where he finds the residents have lost their lust for life. Through his innocence he changes their lives and teaches them that each day is a precious gift. They get back their self-esteem and their lust for life.', 'Gideon Dobbs is young, simple-minded man who has never stopped dreaming. He checks into a retirement home where he finds the residents have lost their lust for life. Through his innocence he changes their lives and teaches them that each day is a precious gift. They get back their self-esteem and their lust for life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bl4STfhVoNBP9MWWaDlEEi03vL0.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:219575'),
  ('1047729683144472964', 'Gideon''s Daughter', 2005, 'TV Movie, Drama', 'Stephen Poliakoff, Barry Ackroyd, Jack Ravenscroft', 'Stephen Poliakoff', 'Bill Nighy, Miranda Richardson, Emily Blunt, Robert Lindsay, Tom Hardy, Tom Goodman-Hill, Joanna Page, David Westhead', null, 'Bill Nighy and Miranda Richardson star in a story of grief and celebrity, set in the intense spring and summer of New Labour''s election victory and Diana''s death. Nighy is a PR guru who has to stop and re-evaluate his world when his daughter threatens to leave his life, perhaps as revenge for his serial infidelities. Richardson plays a mother trying to bury her grief in an unconventional way after the loss of her young son.', 'Bill Nighy and Miranda Richardson star in a story of grief and celebrity, set in the intense spring and summer of New Labour''s election victory and Diana''s death. Nighy is a PR guru who has to stop and re-evaluate his world when his daughter threatens to leave his life, perhaps as revenge for his serial infidelities. Richardson plays a mother trying to bury her grief in an unconventional way after the loss of her young son.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7QNYM2gCTBEWuW5KqOJ8wS2dABb.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:59958'),
  ('136621687803198439', 'Gideon''s Day', 1958, 'Crime, Drama, Comedy', 'John Ford, Freddie Young', 'T. E. B. Clarke', 'Jack Hawkins, Anna Lee, Anna Massey, Andrew Ray, Dianne Foster, Cyril Cusack, James Hayter, Derek Bond', null, 'Scotland Yard Inspector George Gideon starts his day off on the wrong foot when he gets a traffic-violation ticket from a young police officer. From there, his ''typical day" consists in learning that one of his most-trusted detectives has accepted bribes; hunts an escaped maniac who has murdered a girl; tracks a young girl suspected of involvement in a payroll robbery and then helps break up a bank robbery.', 'Scotland Yard Inspector George Gideon starts his day off on the wrong foot when he gets a traffic-violation ticket from a young police officer. From there, his ''typical day" consists in learning that one of his most-trusted detectives has accepted bribes; hunts an escaped maniac who has murdered a girl; tracks a young girl suspected of involvement in a payroll robbery and then helps break up a bank robbery.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yaDNqztIrTbeIDDkD1DvPqbq4M5.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:44071'),
  ('433225815494818047', 'Gideon''s Trumpet', 1980, 'Drama, Crime, History, TV Movie', 'Donald H. Birnkrant, Robert L. Collins', null, 'Henry Fonda, José Ferrer, John Houseman, Fay Wray, Dean Jagger, Sam Jaffe, Nicholas Pryor, William Prince', null, 'True story of Clarence Gideon''s fight to be appointed counsel at the expense of the state. This landmark case led to the Supreme Court''s decision which extended this right to all criminal defendants.', 'True story of Clarence Gideon''s fight to be appointed counsel at the expense of the state. This landmark case led to the Supreme Court''s decision which extended this right to all criminal defendants.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eaquX0IKVaeRujPBQFlaspE0fDg.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:63505'),
  ('613896983169268478', 'Gidget', 1959, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Paul Wendkos, Burnett Guffey, Milton Feldman', 'Gabrielle Upton', 'Sandra Dee, James Darren, Cliff Robertson, Arthur O''Connell, Mary LaRoche, Joby Baker, Tom Laughlin, Sue George', 'NR', 'Due to an accident while swimming in the sea, Francis meets the surfer Moondoggie. She''s fascinated with his sport and starts to hang out with his clique. Although they make fun of her at first, they teach her to surf and soon she''s accepted and given the nickname "Gidget". But it''s hard work to become more than a friend to Moondoggie.', 'Due to an accident while swimming in the sea, Francis meets the surfer Moondoggie. She''s fascinated with his sport and starts to hang out with his clique. Although they make fun of her at first, they teach her to surf and soon she''s accepted and given the nickname "Gidget". But it''s hard work to become more than a friend to Moondoggie.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/i4aRCd5sRzYLb3TLm8iiUN0iJTr.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:43096'),
  ('741075867262853755', 'Gidget Goes Hawaiian', 1961, 'Comedy, Music, Romance', 'Paul Wendkos', 'Frederick Kohner, Ruth Brooks Flippen', 'Deborah Walley, James Darren, Michael Callan, Carl Reiner, Peggy Cass, Eddie Foy Jr., Jeff Donnell, Vicki Trickett', 'NR', 'Francis is desperate: her parents want to force her to come with them on vacation to Hawaii - just during the two weeks when her beloved "Moondoggy" is home from College. When he suggests her to go for it, she''s even more in panic - doesn''t he care to be with her? So she sets out for Hawaii in the worst mood. On the plane she meets the sociable Abby, who gives her the advice to forget about Jeff - and regrets it shortly after, when Francis follows the advice and steals her boyfriend Eddie, a famous dancer. But then Jeff discovers he''s missing Francis...', 'Francis is desperate: her parents want to force her to come with them on vacation to Hawaii - just during the two weeks when her beloved "Moondoggy" is home from College. When he suggests her to go for it, she''s even more in panic - doesn''t he care to be with her? So she sets out for Hawaii in the worst mood. On the plane she meets the sociable Abby, who gives her the advice to forget about Jeff - and regrets it shortly after, when Francis follows the advice and steals her boyfriend Eddie, a famous dancer. But then Jeff discovers he''s missing Francis...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9iVh5W5TU9VN5Ky6mUuXtIaSVzt.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:43018'),
  ('855073913179871123', 'Gidget Goes to Rome', 1963, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Paul Wendkos, Enzo Barboni, Robert J. Bronner', 'Ruth Brooks Flippen, Katherine Albert, Dale Eunson', 'James Darren, Cindy Carol, Jessie Royce Landis, Cesare Danova, Danielle De Metz, Joby Baker, Trudi Ames, Noreen Corcoran', 'NR', 'Francis, now 17, is still in love with Moondoggy. She can persuade her parents to allow them a journey to Rome, together with two of her and two of his friends. However they have to take an adult with them, so they choose Peter''s eccentric aunt. In Rome they get the beautiful guide Daniela, who''s fascinating the guys and making especially Gidget jealous. She starts looking elsewhere herself.', 'Francis, now 17, is still in love with Moondoggy. She can persuade her parents to allow them a journey to Rome, together with two of her and two of his friends. However they have to take an adult with them, so they choose Peter''s eccentric aunt. In Rome they get the beautiful guide Daniela, who''s fascinating the guys and making especially Gidget jealous. She starts looking elsewhere herself.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dt8mopbjqOEfmxXomSflSt3wwqB.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:42799'),
  ('689711588743151005', 'Gierek', 2022, 'Drama, History', 'Michał Węgrzyn, Wojciech Węgrzyn', 'Michał Kalicki, Rafał Woś, Heathcliff Janusz Iwanowski', 'Michał Koterski, Sebastian Stankiewicz, Antoni Pawlicki, Rafał Zawierucha, Małgorzata Kożuchowska, Agnieszka Więdłocha, Damian Bajorek, Ewa Ziętek', null, 'A film about a man with a breakthrough history of Poland in the background. Edward Gierek is one of the most important figures of the 20th century in the collective memory of Polish people.', 'A film about a man with a breakthrough history of Poland in the background. Edward Gierek is one of the most important figures of the 20th century in the collective memory of Polish people.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gxhMDsmQRuYH7xMKcYKf4yM8R6K.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:879837'),
  ('606773422232399727', 'Gift Horse', 1952, 'Adventure, War, Drama', 'Compton Bennett, Harry Waxman', 'William Fairchild, Hugh Hastings', 'Richard Attenborough, James Donald, Sonny Tufts, Trevor Howard, Bernard Lee, Dora Bryan, Hugh Williams, Robin Bailey', null, 'Compton Bennett''s war drama The Gift Horse follows the fortunes of ageing destroyer The Ballantrae and her crew from the time they come together in 1940 until the climactic raid on occupied St Nazaire in 1942. Trevor Howard plays Lt Cmdr Hugh Alginon Fraser, the newly appointed captain, back in service after having left the navy following a court martial.', 'Compton Bennett''s war drama The Gift Horse follows the fortunes of ageing destroyer The Ballantrae and her crew from the time they come together in 1940 until the climactic raid on occupied St Nazaire in 1942. Trevor Howard plays Lt Cmdr Hugh Alginon Fraser, the newly appointed captain, back in service after having left the navy following a court martial.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ctlViVwbJlSK7xBQO3iczTcYrpW.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:71985'),
  ('900716773330403867', 'Gift Wrapped', 1952, 'Animation, Comedy', 'Friz Freleng', null, 'Mel Blanc, Bea Benaderet, Daws Butler', 'NR', 'It''s Christmas Day in the home of Granny, and her pet cat Sylvester delights at chasing her new Tweety Bird and takes fright at the bulldog unwrapped from under the tree.', 'It''s Christmas Day in the home of Granny, and her pet cat Sylvester delights at chasing her new Tweety Bird and takes fright at the bulldog unwrapped from under the tree.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5HULlnIJVblKCXMY3m3VRd7oN8Z.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:48875'),
