  ('576109511036941898', 'Gigantic', 1999, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Frank Griebe, Sebastian Schipper, Volker Sattel', 'Sebastian Schipper', 'Frank Giering, Florian Lukas, Antoine Monot Jr., Julia Hummer, Jochen Nickel, Albert Kitzl, Hannes Hellmann, Gustav Peter Wöhler', null, 'The Hamburg friends Walter, Ricco and Floyd take each day as it comes between the estates of tower blocks and fast food restaurants. All three are in their early twenties and are dreaming of another life when Floyd suddenly takes a job on a freighter going to Singapore.', 'The Hamburg friends Walter, Ricco and Floyd take each day as it comes between the estates of tower blocks and fast food restaurants. All three are in their early twenties and are dreaming of another life when Floyd suddenly takes a job on a freighter going to Singapore.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bfIyk9Tlc4u5NdpWvtSD2jQEqOE.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1661'),
  ('1016617481137183380', 'Gigantic', 2008, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Matt Aselton, Peter Donahue', 'Matt Aselton, Adam Nagata', 'Zooey Deschanel, John Goodman, Paul Dano, Ed Asner, Jane Alexander, Ian Roberts, Robert Stanton, Clarke Peters', 'R', 'Young mattress salesman Brian decides to adopt a baby from China but is distracted when he forms a relationship with quirky, wealthy Harriet whom he meets at his mattress store. As their relationship flourishes, unbeknownst to them, a hitman is trying to kill Brian.', 'Young mattress salesman Brian decides to adopt a baby from China but is distracted when he forms a relationship with quirky, wealthy Harriet whom he meets at his mattress store. As their relationship flourishes, unbeknownst to them, a hitman is trying to kill Brian.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cYYE7rm6cC773PAJDVZmlNJA3Rs.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:14940'),
