  ('694539275412682016', 'Giggi il bullo', 1982, 'Comedy', 'Marino Girolami, Romano Scandariato, Federico Zanni', 'Carlo Veo, Marino Girolami', 'Alvaro Vitali, Adriana Russo, Cinzia De Carolis, Marcello Furgiuele, Susanna Fassetta, Ennio Girolami, Gianfranco Barra, Diana Dei', null, 'Giggi is a city boy convinced that "in life you must always hit first". And, good or bad, he gains a certain popularity between beatings, dates and blows taken.', 'Giggi is a city boy convinced that "in life you must always hit first". And, good or bad, he gains a certain popularity between beatings, dates and blows taken.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nF5Hpr6q5nFCST7CUXmfiqfBi0N.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:106915'),
  ('683238130566897490', 'Gigi', 1949, 'Romance, Comedy', 'Jacqueline Audry, Gérard Perrin, Jean Bastia', 'Pierre Laroche', 'Danièle Delorme, Gaby Morlay, Jean Tissier, Yvonne de Bray, Frank Villard, Paul Demange, Madeleine Rousset, Pierre Juvenet', null, 'Gilberte is a sixteen year old girl raised by her aunt and grandmother to be a demimondaine. But she''s not ready for that yet, and spends her days in lessons and in teasing Mamita''s old friend, the rich playboy Gaston LaChaille, and following his affairs from afar. But when Gaston throws off his latest mistress, it looks as if Gigi just might be ready to begin her destined career.', 'Gilberte is a sixteen year old girl raised by her aunt and grandmother to be a demimondaine. But she''s not ready for that yet, and spends her days in lessons and in teasing Mamita''s old friend, the rich playboy Gaston LaChaille, and following his affairs from afar. But when Gaston throws off his latest mistress, it looks as if Gigi just might be ready to begin her destined career.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/devLzCOnSjKKXNZmXxVB8Rd86bA.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:123723'),
  ('943796241058681733', 'Gigi', 1958, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Joseph Ruttenberg, Vincente Minnelli, William Shanks', 'Alan Jay Lerner', 'Leslie Caron, Maurice Chevalier, Louis Jourdan, Hermione Gingold, Eva Gabor, Jacques Bergerac, Isabel Jeans, John Abbott', 'G', 'A home, a motorcar, servants, the latest fashions: the most eligible and most finicky bachelor in Paris offers them all to Gigi. But she, who''s gone from girlish gawkishness to cultured glamour before our eyes, yearns for that wonderful something money can''t buy.', 'A home, a motorcar, servants, the latest fashions: the most eligible and most finicky bachelor in Paris offers them all to Gigi. But she, who''s gone from girlish gawkishness to cultured glamour before our eyes, yearns for that wonderful something money can''t buy.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3GSuecnDr4N5ZaqTrwElSzt6eC2.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:17281'),
  ('116148128596756920', 'Gigi & Nate', 2022, 'Drama', 'Nick Hamm, Scott E. Anderson, Richard L. Fox', 'David Hudgins', 'Charlie Rowe, Marcia Gay Harden, Jim Belushi, Diane Ladd, Josephine Langford, Zoe Colletti, Hannah Riley, Sasha Compère', 'PG-13', 'A young man with a bright future suffers a near-fatal accident and recreates his new life with the help of an unlikely animal friend.', 'A young man with a bright future suffers a near-fatal accident and recreates his new life with the help of an unlikely animal friend.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xP1GXV1gms9b5BpHZP7S8qs8FO.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:829503'),
  ('742948347448972956', 'Gigli', 2003, 'Comedy, Crime, Drama, Romance', 'Martin Brest, Robert Elswit, Amy Sayres', 'Martin Brest', 'Ben Affleck, Jennifer Lopez, Justin Bartha, Lainie Kazan, Missy Crider, Al Pacino, Lenny Venito, Christopher Walken', 'R', 'Gigli is ordered to kidnap the psychologically challenged younger brother of a powerful federal prosecutor. When plans go awry, Gigli''s boss sends in Ricki, a gorgeous free-spirited female gangster who has her own set of orders to assist with the kidnapping. But Gigli begins falling for the decidedly unavailable Ricki, which could be a hazard to his occupation.', 'Gigli is ordered to kidnap the psychologically challenged younger brother of a powerful federal prosecutor. When plans go awry, Gigli''s boss sends in Ricki, a gorgeous free-spirited female gangster who has her own set of orders to assist with the kidnapping. But Gigli begins falling for the decidedly unavailable Ricki, which could be a hazard to his occupation.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qOhAK3WDqdeVTIE59loXvEGU7Lu.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:8046'),
  ('146213464897498231', 'Gigola', 2010, 'Drama', 'Laure Charpentier, Giorgos Arvanitis', null, 'Lou Doillon, Marie Kremer, Eduardo Noriega, Thierry Lhermitte, Rossy de Palma, Ana Padrão, Marisa Berenson, Marisa Paredes', null, 'George, a charismatic and adventurous young woman, born from an old, catholic family, falls in love, in her teens, with a female teacher named Sybil. Devastated by her lover''s eventual suicide, some years later, George embarks on an exciting and reckless journey to the depths of Pigalle''s nightlife, circa 1960. After an encounter with a very wealthy, still attractive, but older woman, Odete, who offers her money and gifts in return for sexual favours, George becomes Gigola, a kind of gigolo for women only.', 'George, a charismatic and adventurous young woman, born from an old, catholic family, falls in love, in her teens, with a female teacher named Sybil. Devastated by her lover''s eventual suicide, some years later, George embarks on an exciting and reckless journey to the depths of Pigalle''s nightlife, circa 1960. After an encounter with a very wealthy, still attractive, but older woman, Odete, who offers her money and gifts in return for sexual favours, George becomes Gigola, a kind of gigolo for women only.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dzcD1GK35BodPdmcWnG7uYBqmyO.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:61769'),
  ('1052790370091150575', 'Gigot', 1962, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Gene Kelly, Jean Bourgoin', 'Jackie Gleason, John Patrick, A.J. Russell', 'Jackie Gleason, Katherine Kath, Gabrielle Dorziat, Jean Lefebvre, Jacques Marin, Albert Rémy, Yvonne Constant, Germaine Delbat', null, 'A poignant comedy about a mute who befriends Nicole, the little daughter of a prostitute. Gleason shows his considerable talents as an actor without uttering a sound as he plays the bumbling, kind-hearted janitor, Gigot. Gleason wrote the original story and music for this film.', 'A poignant comedy about a mute who befriends Nicole, the little daughter of a prostitute. Gleason shows his considerable talents as an actor without uttering a sound as he plays the bumbling, kind-hearted janitor, Gigot. Gleason wrote the original story and music for this film.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yICUAhX7RNGgSkZXDHMGq7qNYci.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:48003'),
  ('896144636384539803', 'Gilbert', 2017, 'Documentary', 'Neil Berkeley, Neil Berkeley', 'Neil Berkeley, James Leche', 'Gilbert Gottfried, Dave Attell, Joy Behar, Richard Belzer, Lewis Black, Bill Burr, Dick Van Dyke, Susie Essman', null, 'The life and career of one of comedy''s most inimitable modern voices, Mr. Gilbert Gottfried.', 'The life and career of one of comedy''s most inimitable modern voices, Mr. Gilbert Gottfried.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bixUm35DzCtiapbS8UjGzWCbhij.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:448446'),
  ('1022718886266177617', 'Gilda', 1946, 'Romance, Drama, Thriller', 'Charles Vidor, Rudolph Maté, Arthur S. Black Jr.', 'Marion Parsonnet', 'Rita Hayworth, Glenn Ford, George Macready, Joseph Calleia, Steven Geray, Joe Sawyer, Gerald Mohr, Mark Roberts', 'NR', 'A gambler discovers an old flame while in Argentina, but she''s married to his new boss.', 'A gambler discovers an old flame while in Argentina, but she''s married to his new boss.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/46eKPjoWEyNBAQKDoXEcDFBcaUw.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:3767'),
  ('790023871924947395', 'Giliap', 1975, 'Crime, Drama', 'Roy Andersson, John Olsson', 'Roy Andersson', 'Thommy Berggren, Mona Seilitz, Willie Andréason, Lars-Levi Læstadius, Henry Olhans, Rainer Mieth, Julie Bernby, Pernilla August', null, 'In a minor town the morose manager is primarily responsible for the bad atmosphere of a restaurant. But central for the plot are three persons: a male waiter who is never named (here called W), the female waiter Anna, and "the count", a self-invented nickname by a man cleaning plates. The count is skilled in making others do what he wants. Half a dozen of the personnel assist in a poorly planned and failed attempt to liberate a man whom the police move from one arrest to another. The event involves stealing a motorcycle and threatening policemen with a gun. Anna strongly tries to make contact with W. Finally it turns out that she need his help to break her sexual relation to the count, a relation that from her part is not motivated by positive feelings. W rejects her attempts. And then Anna has suddenly gone. She has got a pleasant job in another town. And then W''s feelings awaken.', 'In a minor town the morose manager is primarily responsible for the bad atmosphere of a restaurant. But central for the plot are three persons: a male waiter who is never named (here called W), the female waiter Anna, and "the count", a self-invented nickname by a man cleaning plates. The count is skilled in making others do what he wants. Half a dozen of the personnel assist in a poorly planned and failed attempt to liberate a man whom the police move from one arrest to another. The event involves stealing a motorcycle and threatening policemen with a gun. Anna strongly tries to make contact with W. Finally it turns out that she need his help to break her sexual relation to the count, a relation that from her part is not motivated by positive feelings. W rejects her attempts. And then Anna has suddenly gone. She has got a pleasant job in another town. And then W''s feelings awaken.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3h1pjVCkPgHRTZJ4FxlZrc4gd6.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:91873'),
  ('714852354286218684', 'Gilles'' Wife', 2004, 'Drama', 'Frédéric Fonteyne', 'Frédéric Fonteyne, Philippe Blasband, Marion Hänsel', 'Emmanuelle Devos, Clovis Cornillac, Laura Smet, Dean Constantin, Colette Emmanuelle, Gil Lagay, Alice Verlinden, Chloé Verlinden', null, 'Gilles'' wife, Elise, who smiles when she thinks of him, cooks and scrubs and cheerfully makes love to him, suspects during her third pregnancy that he is having an affair with her coquettish younger sister, Victorine. Elise suffers, usually in silence. She listens to her husband rave; she asks her priest; she breaks picture frames; she weeps. She decides on a strategy to keep him. Will she succeed?', 'Gilles'' wife, Elise, who smiles when she thinks of him, cooks and scrubs and cheerfully makes love to him, suspects during her third pregnancy that he is having an affair with her coquettish younger sister, Victorine. Elise suffers, usually in silence. She listens to her husband rave; she asks her priest; she breaks picture frames; she weeps. She decides on a strategy to keep him. Will she succeed?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/o0G1tZlx5vEiC1sFOjyxP3hSNue.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:61814'),
  ('683193481035340545', 'Gimme an ''F''', 1984, 'Comedy', 'Paul Justman', 'James V. Hart', 'Stephen Shellen, Daphne Ashbrook, Mark Keyloun, Beth Miller, Jennifer Cooke, Sarah M. Miles, Emily Longstreth, Darcy DeMoss', null, 'Can a squad of misfit cheerleaders with an over-age trainer possibly win the big cheerleading competition.', 'Can a squad of misfit cheerleaders with an over-age trainer possibly win the big cheerleading competition.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/o1ABh5ikUwy9TVxSf34ivvExgpk.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:84777'),
  ('563435924742326579', 'Gimme Danger', 2016, 'Documentary, Music', 'Jim Jarmusch', 'Jim Jarmusch', 'Iggy Pop, Scott Asheton, James Williamson, Dave Alexander, Steve Mackay, Mike Watt, Danny Fields, Kathy Asheton', 'R', 'No other band in rock''n''roll history has rivaled The Stooges'' combination of heavy primal throb, spiked psychedelia, blues-a-billy grind, complete with succinct angst-ridden lyrics, and a snarling, preening leopard of a frontman who somehow embodies Nijinsky, Bruce Lee, Harpo Marx, and Arthur Rimbaud all rolled into one. There is no precedent for The Stooges, while those inspired by them are now legion. The film will present the context of their emergence musically, culturally, politically, historically, and relate their adventures and misadventures while charting their inspirations and the reasons behind their initial commercial challenges, as well as their long-lasting legacy.', 'No other band in rock''n''roll history has rivaled The Stooges'' combination of heavy primal throb, spiked psychedelia, blues-a-billy grind, complete with succinct angst-ridden lyrics, and a snarling, preening leopard of a frontman who somehow embodies Nijinsky, Bruce Lee, Harpo Marx, and Arthur Rimbaud all rolled into one. There is no precedent for The Stooges, while those inspired by them are now legion. The film will present the context of their emergence musically, culturally, politically, historically, and relate their adventures and misadventures while charting their inspirations and the reasons behind their initial commercial challenges, as well as their long-lasting legacy.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8YHqUETRBIFza756s8kcuU8XhEQ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:392820'),
  ('560725186398123353', 'Gimme Power', 2000, 'Crime, Comedy', 'Fernando Sariñana, Miguel Lima, Nela Fernández', 'Enrique Renteria, Carolina Rivera, Fernando Sariñana', 'Demián Bichir, Cecilia Suárez, Luis Felipe Tovar, Ximena Sariñana, Claudia Lobo, Juan Carlos Colombo, José Carlos Rodríguez, Rodrigo Murray', null, 'When a Mexican film director becomes fed up with the crime and corruption in his homeland, he decides to single-handedly take on a powerful band of criminals.', 'When a Mexican film director becomes fed up with the crime and corruption in his homeland, he decides to single-handedly take on a powerful band of criminals.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3Y97y9q1Br4bZOEpBcjkcmPIKr0.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:62353'),
  ('96509049244698338', 'Gimme Shelter', 1970, 'Documentary, Music', 'Albert Maysles, David Maysles, Charlotte Zwerin', null, 'Mick Jagger, Charlie Watts, Keith Richards, Mick Taylor, Bill Wyman, Marty Balin, Sonny Barger, Melvin Belli', null, 'A detailed chronicle of the famous 1969 tour of the United States by the British rock band The Rolling Stones, which culminated with the disastrous and tragic concert held on December 6 at the Altamont Speedway Free Festival, an event of historical significance, as it marked the end of an era: the generation of peace and love suddenly became the generation of disillusionment.', 'A detailed chronicle of the famous 1969 tour of the United States by the British rock band The Rolling Stones, which culminated with the disastrous and tragic concert held on December 6 at the Altamont Speedway Free Festival, an event of historical significance, as it marked the end of an era: the generation of peace and love suddenly became the generation of disillusionment.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fFLKCqI7nfkie9V1LmBLljiNV4j.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:132'),
  ('824501272354185633', 'Gimme Shelter', 2013, 'Drama', 'Ron Krauss, Alain Marcoen', 'Ron Krauss', 'Vanessa Hudgens, Rosario Dawson, Brendan Fraser, Stephanie Szostak, James Earl Jones, Dascha Polanco, Emily Meade, Ann Dowd', 'PG-13', 'After running away from her abusive mother, a streetwise teen seeks refuge with her father, but he rejects her when he learns that she''s pregnant.', 'After running away from her abusive mother, a streetwise teen seeks refuge with her father, but he rejects her when he learns that she''s pregnant.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eEvqFlmn7d8prqRVaFJ5pjJFHuB.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:232175'),
  ('783727276417111376', 'Gimme the Power', 2012, 'Documentary, Music', 'Olallo Rubio', null, 'Sergio Arau, Olallo Rubio, Juan Villoro, Fernanda Tapia, Francisco Ayala, Miky Huidobro, Randy Ebright, Tito Fuentes', null, 'A rock documentary, about the Mexican band Molotov, that focuses more in the political and musical context of Mexico rather than in the actual story of the band.', 'A rock documentary, about the Mexican band Molotov, that focuses more in the political and musical context of Mexico rather than in the actual story of the band.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/udVe0sp0Xds7ch6QYvZWEU1Hoi6.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:116305'),
