  ('326688736390421172', 'Gina', 1975, 'Drama, Thriller, Crime', 'Denys Arcand, Alain Dostie', 'Jacques Poulin, Alain Dostie', 'Céline Lomez, Claude Blanchard, Frédérique Collin, Serge Thériault, Gabriel Arcand, Louise Cuerrier, Jocelyn Bérubé, Paule Baillargeon', null, 'A beautiful stripper hires renowned criminals to exact revenge on those who raped her in her motel room.', 'A beautiful stripper hires renowned criminals to exact revenge on those who raped her in her motel room.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gTxczCO83QAIQOQtqkKz4s6jTwz.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:89944'),
