  ('1032045295589902275', 'Ginger', 1971, 'Drama, Action, Crime', 'Don Schain', 'Don Schain', 'Cheri Caffaro, Duane Tucker, Herbert Kerr, Casey Donovan, David Ross, Michele Norris, Cindy Barnett, Lise Mauer', 'R', 'The police suspect that a drug and forced-prostitution ring is behind the recent spate of kidnappings and disappearances, but so far they''ve been unable to infiltrate the suspects gang. To break the case, they recruit Ginger, a young woman from an upper-class family to act as bait for the kidnappers and hopefully lead the police to their hideout. It may sound like a foolproof plan to the police, but Ginger''s the one who has to risk it all.', 'The police suspect that a drug and forced-prostitution ring is behind the recent spate of kidnappings and disappearances, but so far they''ve been unable to infiltrate the suspects gang. To break the case, they recruit Ginger, a young woman from an upper-class family to act as bait for the kidnappers and hopefully lead the police to their hideout. It may sound like a foolproof plan to the police, but Ginger''s the one who has to risk it all.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dONQlfaIj0QfVNoBnjEEH0ok1gK.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:89072'),
  ('287033715954931685', 'Ginger & Rosa', 2012, 'Drama', 'Sally Potter, Robbie Ryan, Matthew Hanson', 'Sally Potter', 'Elle Fanning, Alice Englert, Christina Hendricks, Alessandro Nivola, Timothy Spall, Annette Bening, Jodhi May, Oliver Platt', 'PG-13', 'A look at the lives of two teenage girls - inseparable friends Ginger and Rosa -- growing up in 1960s London as the Cuban Missile Crisis looms, and the pivotal event the comes to redefine their relationship.', 'A look at the lives of two teenage girls - inseparable friends Ginger and Rosa -- growing up in 1960s London as the Cuban Missile Crisis looms, and the pivotal event the comes to redefine their relationship.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5EmQri2RwjN5zELdAtUY52k71pN.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:121872'),
  ('969164043718365288', 'Ginger and Cinnamon', 2003, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Paolo Carnera, Umberto Riccioni Carteni, Daniele Luchetti', 'Ivan Cotroneo, Daniele Luchetti, Stefania Montorsi', 'Stefania Montorsi, Giampaolo Morelli, Martina Merlino, Alberto Cucca, Marco Piras, Isabella Cecchi, Karen Ann McLoughlin', 'NR', 'Stefania works in a bookshop. Shortly before closing for summer holidays, Andrea, who was left behind by his fiancée, enters the store.', 'Stefania works in a bookshop. Shortly before closing for summer holidays, Andrea, who was left behind by his fiancée, enters the store.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2WK9bUPOGxWIaP4i3jJXpTAaXYR.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:44142'),
  ('87174406785276197', 'Ginger and Fred', 1986, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Federico Fellini, Anke Zindler, Filippo Ascione', 'Tullio Pinelli, Tonino Guerra, Federico Fellini', 'Giulietta Masina, Marcello Mastroianni, Franco Fabrizi, Friedrich von Ledebur, Augusto Poderosi, Martin Maria Blau, Jacques Henri Lartigue, Totò Mignone', 'PG-13', 'Amelia and Pippo are reunited after several decades to perform their old music-hall act, imitating Fred Astaire and Ginger Rogers, on a TV variety show.', 'Amelia and Pippo are reunited after several decades to perform their old music-hall act, imitating Fred Astaire and Ginger Rogers, on a TV variety show.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nuhHvDVQLIDzpLpomBHilS1hliL.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:42021'),
  ('427637866856358842', 'Ginger Snaps', 2000, 'Fantasy, Horror, Drama, Thriller', 'John Fawcett, Thom Best, Laura Wood Fawcett', 'Karen Walton', 'Katharine Isabelle, Emily Perkins, Kris Lemche, Mimi Rogers, Jesse Moss, Danielle Hampton, John Bourgeois, Peter Keleghan', null, 'The story of two outcast sisters, Ginger and Brigitte, in the mindless suburban town of Bailey Downs. On the night of Ginger''s first period, she is savagely attacked by a wild creature. Ginger''s wounds miraculously heal but something is not quite right. Now Brigitte must save her sister and save herself.', 'The story of two outcast sisters, Ginger and Brigitte, in the mindless suburban town of Bailey Downs. On the night of Ginger''s first period, she is savagely attacked by a wild creature. Ginger''s wounds miraculously heal but something is not quite right. Now Brigitte must save her sister and save herself.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ozohDiJd7Oi65NEf8B0ya7lR9Fr.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:9871'),
  ('658832967361553585', 'Ginger Snaps 2: Unleashed', 2004, 'Drama, Horror, Fantasy, Thriller', 'Brett Sullivan, Gavin Smith, Ehud Ellman', 'Megan Martin', 'Emily Perkins, Tatiana Maslany, Katharine Isabelle, Eric Johnson, Janet Kidder, Brendan Fletcher, Chris Fassbender, Pascale Hutton', null, 'Brigitte has escaped the confines of Bailey Downs but she''s not alone. Another werewolf is tailing her closely and her sister''s specter haunts her. An overdose of Monkshood - the poison that is keeping her transformation at bay - leads to her being incarcerated in a rehabilitation clinic for drug addicts where her only friend is an eccentric young girl by the name of Ghost.', 'Brigitte has escaped the confines of Bailey Downs but she''s not alone. Another werewolf is tailing her closely and her sister''s specter haunts her. An overdose of Monkshood - the poison that is keeping her transformation at bay - leads to her being incarcerated in a rehabilitation clinic for drug addicts where her only friend is an eccentric young girl by the name of Ghost.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/no1Qw1jMGrH77fIuWxwYZ7BIhHa.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:10361'),
  ('703117191006538398', 'Ginger Snaps Back: The Beginning', 2004, 'Horror, Drama, Western, Fantasy, Thriller', 'Michael Marshall, Grant Harvey, Wes Doyle', 'Stephen Massicotte, Christina Ray', 'Katharine Isabelle, Emily Perkins, Nathaniel Arcand, JR Bourne, Hugh Dillon, Adrien Dorval, Brendan Fletcher, David La Haye', 'R', 'Set in 19th Century Canada, Brigitte and her sister Ginger take refuge in a Traders'' Fort which later becomes under siege by some savage werewolves. But when one of the girls is bitten, they have no one to turn to but themselves.', 'Set in 19th Century Canada, Brigitte and her sister Ginger take refuge in a Traders'' Fort which later becomes under siege by some savage werewolves. But when one of the girls is bitten, they have no one to turn to but themselves.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tQ17krYhctcHnnslqq90zzGkhg7.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:12583'),
  ('217021727629376062', 'Gingerbread Miracle', 2021, 'TV Movie, Comedy, Drama, Romance', 'Michael M. Scott, Kamal Derkaoui', 'John Benjamin Martin, Emma Claire Martin, Tracy Andreen', 'Merritt Patterson, Jon Ecker, Jorge Montesi, Elyse Maloway, Sunita Prasad, Lini Evans, Sean Martin Savoy, Patch May', 'G', 'Maya and Alex, old friends from high school, work together over Christmas to sell his uncle’s Mexican bakery famous for its gingerbread cookies that the patrons believe grants wishes.', 'Maya and Alex, old friends from high school, work together over Christmas to sell his uncle’s Mexican bakery famous for its gingerbread cookies that the patrons believe grants wishes.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/r6oT4u5nUNxKxpKVKbEhzX9pS8I.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:874244'),
  ('475834797311368263', 'Gingerdead Man 2: The Passion of the Crust', 2008, 'Comedy, Horror, Fantasy', 'Pieter Christian Colson, Silvia St. Croix, Viorel Sergovici', 'Muffy Bolding, Aaron Strongoni', 'K-von, Joseph Porter, Kelsey Sanders, John Vulich, Michelle Bauer, Frank Nicotero, Greg Nicotero, John Carl Buechler', 'NR', 'The horrifying yet delicious and chewy Gingerdead Man causes murder and mayhem on the set of a horrible low budget movie set. It will take the determination of the studio''s young new owner to save both his company and well as the lives of his young new friends. Including a terminally ill young boy whose final wish it was to meet the studios stars - The Tiny Terrors.', 'The horrifying yet delicious and chewy Gingerdead Man causes murder and mayhem on the set of a horrible low budget movie set. It will take the determination of the studio''s young new owner to save both his company and well as the lives of his young new friends. Including a terminally ill young boy whose final wish it was to meet the studios stars - The Tiny Terrors.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1hd6zLMDvs5hLTTcaTIYanNmauy.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:16846'),
  ('612167088109761148', 'Ginny & Georgia - The Afterparty', 2021, 'Documentary', 'Joe Guidry', 'Bobby Miyamoto, Brad Wollack, Candice Thompson', 'David Spade, London Hughes, Fortune Feimster, Brianne Howey, Antonia Gentry, Jennifer Robertson, Sara Waisglass, Cristela Alonzo', 'R', 'Cast members of the hit Netflix show join the hosts to unpack the drama of Season 1, and Cristela Alonzo offers tips for being the new kid at school.', 'Cast members of the hit Netflix show join the hosts to unpack the drama of Season 1, and Cristela Alonzo offers tips for being the new kid at school.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jUCinYtvrF9n9SQCU6thTkIkFve.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:800728'),
  ('394798582255833829', 'Ginny Weds Sunny', 2020, 'Romance, Comedy, Drama, Family', 'Puneet Khanna, Payal Dev', 'Sumit Arora, Navjot Gulati', 'Yami Gautam Dhar, Vikrant Massey, Ayesha Raza Mishra, Suhail Nayyar, Rajiv Gupta, Menka Kurup, Mazel Vyas, Gurpreet Saini', null, 'Delhi girl Ginny lives with her matchmaker mother and is set up with Sunny, who has given up on the idea of love. He just wants to get married and settle down. But, the match is not that simple. As Ginny meets Sunny, there’s a lot more that comes to the fore than previously imagined in this tale of love, life, weddings and music.', 'Delhi girl Ginny lives with her matchmaker mother and is set up with Sunny, who has given up on the idea of love. He just wants to get married and settle down. But, the match is not that simple. As Ginny meets Sunny, there’s a lot more that comes to the fore than previously imagined in this tale of love, life, weddings and music.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1LhWNRcLkHmtQPf9aYK534uxHP9.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:744676'),
  ('335565083558322195', 'Gintama', 2017, 'Action, Comedy, Science Fiction', 'Yuichi Fukuda, Tetsuya Kudô, Yasuyuki Suzuki', 'Yuichi Fukuda', 'Shun Oguri, Masaki Suda, Kanna Hashimoto, Yuya Yagira, Hirofumi Arai, Ryo Yoshizawa, Akari Hayami, Tsuyoshi Domoto', 'PG-13', 'In an era where aliens have invaded and taken over feudal Tokyo, a young samurai finds work however he can.', 'In an era where aliens have invaded and taken over feudal Tokyo, a young samurai finds work however he can.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/optlFojmbJKLwTe9QpqLiFbGR9k.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:432985'),
  ('674512254334943384', 'Gintama 2: Rules are Made to Be Broken', 2018, 'Comedy, Action, Science Fiction, Fantasy', 'Keiya Tabuchi, Jang Jae-wook, Tetsuya Kudô', 'Yuichi Fukuda', 'Shun Oguri, Masaki Suda, Kanna Hashimoto, Masami Nagasawa, Masaki Okada, Jiro Sato, Yuya Yagira, Ryo Yoshizawa', null, 'The Yorozuya gang returns to protect the country''s shogun when the Shinsengumi police force finds itself in a crisis.', 'The Yorozuya gang returns to protect the country''s shogun when the Shinsengumi police force finds itself in a crisis.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ftVeN9fZC4VqJ3r5k51JRtklRq9.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:519176'),
  ('644679945654512105', 'Gintama: The Final Chapter - Be Forever Yorozuya', 2013, 'Action, Animation, Science Fiction', 'Youichi Fujita, Katsuyoshi Kobayashi, Ei Rouhei', 'Akatsuki Yamatoya', 'Tomokazu Sugita, Daisuke Sakaguchi, Rie Kugimiya, Akira Ishida, Susumu Chiba, Kazuya Nakai, Kenichi Suzumura, Satsuki Yukino', null, 'What would have happened if the Shiroyasha never existed? Edo is thrown to chaos by a mysterious cause. Sakata Gintoki, now lives in a world where the future has changed, without him. What has happened to the Yorozuya? Gintoki, who is now a ghost of the past, must once again carry the burden in order to save his friends. He must finish the biggest job ever, which may be the final job of Yorozuya.', 'What would have happened if the Shiroyasha never existed? Edo is thrown to chaos by a mysterious cause. Sakata Gintoki, now lives in a world where the future has changed, without him. What has happened to the Yorozuya? Gintoki, who is now a ghost of the past, must once again carry the burden in order to save his friends. He must finish the biggest job ever, which may be the final job of Yorozuya.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1wEl5WHQO2SdWQ6S3gLBaaobf4c.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:245917'),
  ('798401803557857908', 'Gintama: The Movie', 2010, 'Action, Science Fiction, Animation', 'Shinji Takamatsu, Katsuyoshi Kobayashi, Yohei Sasaki', 'Akatsuki Yamatoya', 'Tomokazu Sugita, Daisuke Sakaguchi, Rie Kugimiya, Akira Ishida, Takehito Koyasu, Yutaka Aoyama, Takeharu Oonishi, Keiko Nemoto', null, 'Odd Jobs Gin has taken on a lot of odd work in the past, and when you''re a Jack of All Trades agency based in a feudal Japan that''s been conquered and colonized by aliens, the term "Odd Jobs" means REALLY ODD jobs. But when some more than slightly suspicious secrets from the shadows of Gintoki Sakata''s somewhat shady former samurai past and a new pair of odd jobs collide, the action is bound to get so wild and demented that only a feature film will do it justice!', 'Odd Jobs Gin has taken on a lot of odd work in the past, and when you''re a Jack of All Trades agency based in a feudal Japan that''s been conquered and colonized by aliens, the term "Odd Jobs" means REALLY ODD jobs. But when some more than slightly suspicious secrets from the shadows of Gintoki Sakata''s somewhat shady former samurai past and a new pair of odd jobs collide, the action is bound to get so wild and demented that only a feature film will do it justice!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/E3RT3f8oOuPS2pMhgH47TKBPgu.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:71172'),
  ('1113825020233331361', 'Gintama: The Very Final', 2021, 'Animation, Action, Science Fiction', 'Shinji Takeuchi, Ikumi Oka, Yohei Sasaki', 'Chizuru Miyawaki', 'Tomokazu Sugita, Daisuke Sakaguchi, Rie Kugimiya, Kazuya Nakai, Akira Ishida, Kenichi Suzumura, Takehito Koyasu, Susumu Chiba', null, 'The countdown to destruction has begun! Gintoki and the others set out to fulfill the wishes of their teacher Shoyo and thwart Utsuro''s plans. Shinpachi, Kagura, the Shinsengumi, members of the Kabuki District, and even former enemies will join their fight. As Utsuro''s power grows, Takasugi fights for his very life. Will Gintoki be able to put an end to all this?!', 'The countdown to destruction has begun! Gintoki and the others set out to fulfill the wishes of their teacher Shoyo and thwart Utsuro''s plans. Shinpachi, Kagura, the Shinsengumi, members of the Kabuki District, and even former enemies will join their fight. As Utsuro''s power grows, Takasugi fights for his very life. Will Gintoki be able to put an end to all this?!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kxBHS1PGebEN0lrFdk0o9FZY6Rn.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:732203'),
  ('707196635587610407', 'Gintama: Yoshiwara in Flames', 2026, 'Animation, Action, Comedy, Drama, Science Fiction', 'Naoya Ando, Dango Sakata', 'Taku Kishimoto, Hideaki Sorachi', 'Tomokazu Sugita, Daisuke Sakaguchi, Rie Kugimiya, Satoshi Hino, Yuhko Kaida', null, 'Upon meeting a young boy named Haruta who makes a living as a pickpocket, Gintoki discovers that he is pickpocketing out of a desire to meet his long-lost mother, Hiwa, Yoshiwara''s number one courtesan. Gintoki and his friends venture to Yoshiwara to fulfill Haruta''s wish, but standing in their way is Housen, the Night King who rules Yoshiwara.', 'Upon meeting a young boy named Haruta who makes a living as a pickpocket, Gintoki discovers that he is pickpocketing out of a desire to meet his long-lost mother, Hiwa, Yoshiwara''s number one courtesan. Gintoki and his friends venture to Yoshiwara to fulfill Haruta''s wish, but standing in their way is Housen, the Night King who rules Yoshiwara.', 'https://images.plex.tv/photo?size=large-1280&url=https%3A%2F%2Fimage.tmdb.org%2Ft%2Fp%2Foriginal%2FnSNHGYHXDckxSxLsVithEX7hiuy.jpg', 'plex:movie:gintama-yoshiwara-in-flames'),
  ('100034450795698414', 'Ginza Cosmetics', 1951, 'Drama', 'Mikio Naruse, Akira Mimura, Teruo Ishii', 'Matsuo Kishi', 'Kinuyo Tanaka, Ranko Hanai, Yūji Hori, Kyōko Kagawa, Eijirō Yanagi, Eijirō Tōno, Yoshihiro Nishikubo, Haruo Tanaka', null, 'A few days in the life of a quiet geisha, single mother of a smart young boy, in the lively Tokyo quarter of Ginza. A woman devoted to others'' needs, she''ll end by taking part herself in one of the many disguises of Ginza.', 'A few days in the life of a quiet geisha, single mother of a smart young boy, in the lively Tokyo quarter of Ginza. A woman devoted to others'' needs, she''ll end by taking part herself in one of the many disguises of Ginza.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/r8ZqmqPzK9NmXYNvVvhdfbLRUca.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:118575'),
  ('497051100160322789', 'Gioia', 2026, 'Drama', 'Nicolangelo Gelormini, Gianluca Palma', 'Giuliano Scarpinato, Benedetta Mori', 'Saul Nanni, Jasmine Trinca, Francesco Colella, Betti Pedrazzi, Gianni Bissacca', null, 'Gioia is a french literature teacher who has never known love, except for the suffocating kind from her parents, with whom she still lives. Among the students at her school is Alessio, who uses his body as a means to earn money and help his mother, a cashier in a supermarket. A forbidden, fragile, and inexplicably necessary bond grows between Alessio and Gioia. But Alessio''s desire for social and personal redemption becomes a silent poison that keeps him from fully surrendering to Gioia''s disarming sweetness. And so, he destroys everything and erases the only person who has ever loved him.', 'Gioia is a french literature teacher who has never known love, except for the suffocating kind from her parents, with whom she still lives. Among the students at her school is Alessio, who uses his body as a means to earn money and help his mother, a cashier in a supermarket. A forbidden, fragile, and inexplicably necessary bond grows between Alessio and Gioia. But Alessio''s desire for social and personal redemption becomes a silent poison that keeps him from fully surrendering to Gioia''s disarming sweetness. And so, he destroys everything and erases the only person who has ever loved him.', 'https://images.plex.tv/photo?size=large-1280&url=https%3A%2F%2Fimage.tmdb.org%2Ft%2Fp%2Foriginal%2F7Knu11VK9j1xqta3JuPpZyxwXWr.jpg', 'plex:movie:gioia-2026'),
  ('482040563073702776', 'Giordano Bruno', 1973, 'Drama', 'Giuliano Montaldo, Vittorio Storaro, Lorenzo Magnolia', 'Giuliano Montaldo, Lucio De Caro', 'Gian Maria Volonté, Hans Christian Blech, Mathieu Carrière, Renato Scarpa, Giuseppe Maffioli, Charlotte Rampling, Mark Burns, Alberto Plebani', null, 'Fleeing from his enemies in the Catholic Church, the free thinking philosopher, poet and scientist Giordano Bruno has found some protection in Venice. But the Roman Inquisition, fearing his influence in Europe, wants to bring him on trial for ''heresy''.', 'Fleeing from his enemies in the Catholic Church, the free thinking philosopher, poet and scientist Giordano Bruno has found some protection in Venice. But the Roman Inquisition, fearing his influence in Europe, wants to bring him on trial for ''heresy''.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oTvu16YmggQc3oWTg7g3lgIi4LO.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:64943'),
  ('353561539065238503', 'Giorgino', 1994, 'Drama, Horror, Adventure', 'Laurent Boutonnat, Jean-Pierre Sauvaire', 'Gilles Laurent, Laurent Boutonnat', 'Jeff Dahlgren, Mylène Farmer, Frances Barber, Joss Ackland, Jean-Pierre Aumont, Louise Fletcher, Janine Duvitski, David Ryall', null, 'October 1918: After returning to the civil life, the young Doctor Giorgino Volli searches for a group of children, which he had been the care-taker of before the first world war began. However, soon the searching becomes a part of hide-and-seek with death. Giorgino finds a village bordered with a treacherous marsh and rumours of wolves. There he also meets the mysterious Catherine....', 'October 1918: After returning to the civil life, the young Doctor Giorgino Volli searches for a group of children, which he had been the care-taker of before the first world war began. However, soon the searching becomes a part of hide-and-seek with death. Giorgino finds a village bordered with a treacherous marsh and rumours of wolves. There he also meets the mysterious Catherine....', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/j87ucqJHsg8W8QMa38oAQzi3hKH.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:77728'),
  ('838728184115151479', 'Giovanna''s Father', 2008, 'Drama', 'Pupi Avati, Pasquale Rachini', 'Pupi Avati', 'Silvio Orlando, Francesca Neri, Ezio Greggio, Alba Rohrwacher, Serena Grandi, Manuela Morabito, Gianfranco Jannuzzo, Paolo Graziosi', null, 'Michele Casali is a middle-class professor in Fascist Italy who teaches at the same high school attended by his only daughter, Giovanna. A shy and sensitive girl, her insecurities are only magnified by Michele''s overprotectiveness—reaching a point of no return.', 'Michele Casali is a middle-class professor in Fascist Italy who teaches at the same high school attended by his only daughter, Giovanna. A shy and sensitive girl, her insecurities are only magnified by Michele''s overprotectiveness—reaching a point of no return.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tAywDk0WjNtthSxgwTFe0zohjzy.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:12424'),
  ('736032426555143607', 'Giovanni Falcone', 1993, 'History, Crime', 'Giuseppe Ferrara, Claudio Cirillo, Tiziana Gagnor', 'Armenia Balducci, Giuseppe Ferrara', 'Michele Placido, Anna Bonaiuto, Massimo Bonetti, Nello Riviè, Gianni Musy, Paolo De Giorgio, Pietro Biondi, Gianfranco Barra', null, 'The story of the first ever "anti-mafia judges pool" established in the ''80s at the Palermo Courthouse, in Sicily, in the ''80s, while two mafia families started a 10-year-long war to obtain the complete control of smuggles.', 'The story of the first ever "anti-mafia judges pool" established in the ''80s at the Palermo Courthouse, in Sicily, in the ''80s, while two mafia families started a 10-year-long war to obtain the complete control of smuggles.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iQ4CYa1mISYBOrpl9Ko3h0Dk21y.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:145635'),
  ('421434207227480504', 'Giovanni Falcone - L''uomo che sfidò Cosa Nostra', 2006, 'Crime, History, TV Movie', 'Antonio Frazzi, Daniele Nannuzzi, Alessandro Capitani', 'Pietro Calderoni, Gualtiero Rosella', 'Massimo Dapporto, Elena Sofia Ricci, Cesare Bocci, Francesco Pannofino, Emilio Solfrizzi, David Coco, Turi Catanzaro, Nino D''Agata', null, 'TV-Movie on the life and accomplishments of Giovanni Falcone, the legendary Sicilian judge who boldly opposed the Mafia', 'TV-Movie on the life and accomplishments of Giovanni Falcone, the legendary Sicilian judge who boldly opposed the Mafia', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/o13JRPU7uLo4K5USFN3PgoM6Qqa.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:149959'),
  ('396728739209538149', 'Giovanni''s Island', 2014, 'Animation, Drama, History', 'Mizuho Nishikubo, Eiji Inomoto, Nobutake Ito', 'Shigemichi Sugita, Taiki Sakurai', 'Masachika Ichimura, Yukie Nakama, Kanako Yanagihara, Yusuke Santamaria, Kota Yokoyama, Junya Taniai, Saburo Kitajima, Hiroshi Inuzuka', null, 'In the aftermath of the most devastating conflict mankind had ever experienced, the tiny island of Shikotan became part of the Sakhalin Oblast... and on the unhealed border in this remote corner of the world, friendship among children from two different countries timidly blossomed, striving to overcome language barriers and the waves of history. Inspired by true events.', 'In the aftermath of the most devastating conflict mankind had ever experienced, the tiny island of Shikotan became part of the Sakhalin Oblast... and on the unhealed border in this remote corner of the world, friendship among children from two different countries timidly blossomed, striving to overcome language barriers and the waves of history. Inspired by true events.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aqNDzNcxesN6CNGP4jInMVpqC5l.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:239367'),
  ('683356246004267501', 'Giovannona Long-Thigh', 1973, 'Comedy', 'Sergio Martino, Michele Massimo Tarantini, Stelvio Massi', 'Francesco Milizia, Carlo Veo, Franco Mercuri', 'Pippo Franco, Edwige Fenech, Gigi Ballista, Riccardo Garrone, Francesca Romana Coluzzi, Vittorio Caprioli, Danika La Loggia, Adriana Facchetti', null, 'When a judge shuts down a high profile cheese factory for violating pollution standards, the owner bribes a monsignor to fix the problem. After they discover the judge has a predilection for married women, the owner employs a prostitute to pose as his wife in an attempt to seduce the judge.', 'When a judge shuts down a high profile cheese factory for violating pollution standards, the owner bribes a monsignor to fix the problem. After they discover the judge has a predilection for married women, the owner employs a prostitute to pose as his wife in an attempt to seduce the judge.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/44DmpZUW13qR9WvaFhPhYwMcEa7.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:121342'),
