  ('508553600670170443', 'Girl Asleep', 2015, 'Fantasy, Comedy, Drama', 'Rosemary Myers, Andrew Commis', 'Matthew Whittet', 'Bethany Whitmore, Harrison Feldman, Amber McMahon, Matthew Whittet, Eamon Farren, Tilda Cobham-Hervey, Imogen Archer, Maiah Stewardson', null, 'The world is closing in on Greta Driscoll. On the cusp of turning fifteen, she can’t bear to leave her childhood; it contains all the things that give her comfort in an incomprehensible new world. She floats in a bubble of loserdom with her only friend, Elliott, until her parents throw her a surprise fifteenth birthday party and she’s flung into a parallel place—a world that’s weirdly erotic, a little bit violent, and thoroughly ludicrous. Only there can she find herself.', 'The world is closing in on Greta Driscoll. On the cusp of turning fifteen, she can’t bear to leave her childhood; it contains all the things that give her comfort in an incomprehensible new world. She floats in a bubble of loserdom with her only friend, Elliott, until her parents throw her a surprise fifteenth birthday party and she’s flung into a parallel place—a world that’s weirdly erotic, a little bit violent, and thoroughly ludicrous. Only there can she find herself.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yHmXk0j8RTKV9br3wEKCm9ApZag.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:364540'),
  ('639749173290001352', 'Girl at the Window', 2022, 'Horror, Thriller', 'Mark Hartley, Garry Richards', 'Terence Hammond, Nicolette Minster', 'Radha Mitchell, Ella Newton, Vince Colosimo, James Mackay, Jackson Gallagher, Nathan Hill, Sharon Johal, Lauren Goetz', 'R', 'A troubled teenage girl who’s struggling to cope with the accidental death of her father suspects that the mysterious killer stalking her hometown is not only her neighbour but her mother’s new romantic interest.', 'A troubled teenage girl who’s struggling to cope with the accidental death of her father suspects that the mysterious killer stalking her hometown is not only her neighbour but her mother’s new romantic interest.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5k5E5NMhoMOv0QY5PsvixOm0maU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:985335'),
