  ('612738810124290103', 'Girl in the Sunny Place', 2013, 'Drama, Romance, Fantasy', 'Takahiro Miki, Yoko Itakura, Hiroyuki Inokoshi', 'Tomoe Kanno, Kosuke Mukai', 'Juri Ueno, Jun Matsumoto, Tetsuji Tamayama, Masaki Suda, Koji Ohkura, Mitsuki Tanimura, Takumi Kitamura, Wakana Aoi', null, 'A new salesman named Kosuke Okuda happens to meet Mao Watarai, a friend from his middle school days. Back then, Mao was called stupid and bullied, but now she is an attractive woman. Kosuke and Mao fall in love and decide to marry, but Mao has a secret.', 'A new salesman named Kosuke Okuda happens to meet Mao Watarai, a friend from his middle school days. Back then, Mao was called stupid and bullied, but now she is an attractive woman. Kosuke and Mao fall in love and decide to marry, but Mao has a secret.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gb3alvRQlTaj82owXIjZuH4msuK.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:248503'),
  ('760290880616840969', 'Girl in the Window', 1961, 'Drama, Romance', 'Luciano Emmer, Vana Caruso, Giancarlo Ravasio', 'Luciano Martino, Luciano Emmer, Vinicio Marinucci', 'Lino Ventura, Magali Noël, Marina Vlady, Bernard Fresson, Antonio Badas, Roger Bernard, Ingeborg Jonassen, Salvatore Lombardo', null, 'A romantic drama partially set in Amsterdam, this standard tale starts out in a mining area in Holland where conditions are about as rough as they get. Two of the miners, Italians Federico and Vincenzo take off together for the city''s red-light district, where the women pose in windows for prospective customers. There the duo meet Else and Carrel who are willing to leave their windows to spend a weekend at a resort with the two men. Soon Else has fallen in love with Vincenzo and the future of the two hookers, as well as the miners, seems to look brighter.', 'A romantic drama partially set in Amsterdam, this standard tale starts out in a mining area in Holland where conditions are about as rough as they get. Two of the miners, Italians Federico and Vincenzo take off together for the city''s red-light district, where the women pose in windows for prospective customers. There the duo meet Else and Carrel who are willing to leave their windows to spend a weekend at a resort with the two men. Soon Else has fallen in love with Vincenzo and the future of the two hookers, as well as the miners, seems to look brighter.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ndkUETLnTbY4h8WgedAFwXyyuDF.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:92589'),
  ('1035178463051617746', 'Girl Lost', 2018, 'Drama', 'Ian Campbell, Robin Bain', 'Robin Bain', 'Felix Ryan, Jessica Taylor Haid, Emily Cheree, Robin Bain, James Seaman, Misha Suvorov, Evana Alexeeva, Madison Casas', null, 'Girl Lost tackles the issue of underage prostitution as told through the eyes of a wayward teen. Groomed by her own mother to work in the underbelly of Los Angeles, the young girl struggles to survive in this dark world.', 'Girl Lost tackles the issue of underage prostitution as told through the eyes of a wayward teen. Groomed by her own mother to work in the underbelly of Los Angeles, the young girl struggles to survive in this dark world.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hhsVJLyp8OEUEstX60Pu2qCWaIp.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:525102'),
