  ('584425674276424230', 'Girl on a Bicycle', 2013, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Jeremy Leven, Robert Fraisse', 'Jeremy Leven', 'Vincenzo Amato, Nora Tschirner, Louise Monot, Paddy Considine, Stéphane Debac, Kellie Shirley, Brice Fournier, John Friedmann', 'R', 'Paolo, an Italian tour bus driver living in Paris, has just summoned up the courage to propose marriage to his German girlfriend Greta. However, a chance encounter with a French woman on a bicycle the very next day turns Paolo''s life upside down.', 'Paolo, an Italian tour bus driver living in Paris, has just summoned up the courage to propose marriage to his German girlfriend Greta. However, a chance encounter with a French woman on a bicycle the very next day turns Paolo''s life upside down.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nxzQEltbVbhJbVhWK9RtMRiXEM9.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:199341'),
