  ('454909033700450949', 'Girl Picture', 2022, 'Romance, Drama', 'Jarmo Kiuru, Mikko Niskala, Tom Saxman', 'Ilona Ahti, Daniela Hakulinen', 'Aamu Milonoff, Eleonoora Kauhanen, Linnea Leino, Sonya Lindfors, Cécile Orblin, Oona Airola, Mikko Kauppila, Amos Brotherus', 'NR', 'Best friends Mimmi and Rönkkö support each other unconditionally. They want to live adventurous lives, loaded with experiences and passion. Emma on the contrary has given her whole life to figure skating. Nothing gets between her and success. But when the girls meet, life opens whole new paths, and they all rocket in new directions. While Mimmi and Emma experience the earth moving effects of first love, Rönkkö is on a quest to find pleasure. Three Fridays is all it takes to turn their worlds upside down.', 'Best friends Mimmi and Rönkkö support each other unconditionally. They want to live adventurous lives, loaded with experiences and passion. Emma on the contrary has given her whole life to figure skating. Nothing gets between her and success. But when the girls meet, life opens whole new paths, and they all rocket in new directions. While Mimmi and Emma experience the earth moving effects of first love, Rönkkö is on a quest to find pleasure. Three Fridays is all it takes to turn their worlds upside down.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kNRhvWoVDWP9kr2E7GBB3G0ZQVI.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:683363'),
  ('567945392876916900', 'Girl Play', 2004, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Lee Friedlander, Christopher Wedding, Graham T. McClusky', 'Robin Greenspan, Lacie Harmon, Lee Friedlander', 'Lacie Harmon, Robin Greenspan, Mink Stole, Dom DeLuise, Katherine Randolph, Lauren Maher, Gina DeVivo, Shannon Perez', null, 'Two real-life lesbian actresses meet by chance when they are cast as lovers in a local stage play, and end up actually falling in love. Robin, who is married to her girlfriend for half a dozen years, and Lacie, someone who never had a lasting relationship, are both cast to play lesbian lovers in a Los Angeles stage play. Innocently, the stage director, Gabriel runs the actresses through a series of rehearsals designed to "bring out the intimacy" in each performer. Soon the two women find themselves increasingly and undeniably attracted to each other and overcome with desire. They must ask themselves whether this relationship is manufactured, created for the sake of the "girl play", or is true love.', 'Two real-life lesbian actresses meet by chance when they are cast as lovers in a local stage play, and end up actually falling in love. Robin, who is married to her girlfriend for half a dozen years, and Lacie, someone who never had a lasting relationship, are both cast to play lesbian lovers in a Los Angeles stage play. Innocently, the stage director, Gabriel runs the actresses through a series of rehearsals designed to "bring out the intimacy" in each performer. Soon the two women find themselves increasingly and undeniably attracted to each other and overcome with desire. They must ask themselves whether this relationship is manufactured, created for the sake of the "girl play", or is true love.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2ZS0H8ysSzD0d0k8zdO2jeM3kge.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:85430'),
  ('894119695624556946', 'Girl Seeks Father', 1959, 'War, Drama', 'Lev Golub, Oleg Avdeev, Izrail Pikman', 'Konstantin Gubarevich, Yevgeni Ryss', 'Vladimir Guskov, Nikolai Barmin, Vladimir Dorofeyev, Nina Grebeshkova, Yevgeni Grigoryev, Boris Kudryavtsev, Татьяна Бейнерович, Evgeny Polosin', null, 'The film was set in Russia during World War II and is about a 5 year old girl searching for her partisan leader father while escaping from the Nazis. Nazis, trying to catch 5 years old girl to make her their hostage, because her father is the Soviet partisan commander, and young boy trying to save her. For some time, when little baby was lost in the forest alone or when Nazis finally caught two children your hope is almost broken.', 'The film was set in Russia during World War II and is about a 5 year old girl searching for her partisan leader father while escaping from the Nazis. Nazis, trying to catch 5 years old girl to make her their hostage, because her father is the Soviet partisan commander, and young boy trying to save her. For some time, when little baby was lost in the forest alone or when Nazis finally caught two children your hope is almost broken.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1yfLEFpDE8Cm9qDQMsEzG5fKaBO.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:81595'),
  ('643319197173075803', 'Girl Shy', 1924, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Sam Taylor, Fred C. Newmeyer, Robert A. Golden', 'Harold Lloyd', 'Harold Lloyd, Jobyna Ralston, Richard Daniels, Carlton Griffin, Nola Luxford, Judy King, Ethel Broadhurst, Sammy Brooks', 'NR', 'Harold Meadows is a shy, stuttering bachelor working in a tailor shop, who is writing a guidebook, The Secret of Making Love, for other bashful young men. Fate has him meet rich girl Mary, and they fall in love. But she is about to wed an already married man, so our hero embarks upon a hair-raising daredevil ride to prevent the wedding.', 'Harold Meadows is a shy, stuttering bachelor working in a tailor shop, who is writing a guidebook, The Secret of Making Love, for other bashful young men. Fate has him meet rich girl Mary, and they fall in love. But she is about to wed an already married man, so our hero embarks upon a hair-raising daredevil ride to prevent the wedding.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dMxXZoNWqODqkeDY9SC5O4lLrae.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:40574'),
  ('455792827532997347', 'Girl Slaves of Morgana Le Fay', 1971, 'Fantasy, Drama, Horror', 'Bruno Gantillon, Jean Monsigny', 'Jacques Chaumelle, Bruno Gantillon', 'Dominique Delpierre, Alfred Baillou, Mireille Saunin, Régine Motte, Ursule Pauly, Michèle Perello, Nathalie Chaine, Velly Beguard', null, 'Two French girls get lost in the woods and accidentally enter the realm of sorceress Morgana Le Fay - who gives them the choice of either staying young forever as her lovers, or rot in a dungeon for eternity.', 'Two French girls get lost in the woods and accidentally enter the realm of sorceress Morgana Le Fay - who gives them the choice of either staying young forever as her lovers, or rot in a dungeon for eternity.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aoNLgzsVYFhJwbZiF5i3YZWf935.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:84896'),
