  ('806801329863744065', 'Girl vs. Monster', 2012, 'Family, Comedy, Science Fiction, TV Movie', 'Stuart Gillard, Thomas Burstyn', 'Annie DeYoung, Ron McGee', 'Olivia Holt, Kerris Dorsey, Brendan Meyer, Katherine McNamara, Adam Chambers, Tracy Dawson, Brian Palermo, Luke Benward', 'PG', 'Skylar finds out that her parents are monster hunters after she accidentally releases some monsters from a secret containment chamber; so she and her techno friends must recapture all the monsters and also save her mom and dad from these monsters who are out for revenge.', 'Skylar finds out that her parents are monster hunters after she accidentally releases some monsters from a secret containment chamber; so she and her techno friends must recapture all the monsters and also save her mom and dad from these monsters who are out for revenge.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9CMRe7lE9bZxgz9cEwkPHmF8yc3.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:138038'),
  ('179410815427991588', 'Girl Walks Into a Bar', 2011, 'Comedy', 'Sebastian Gutierrez', 'Sebastian Gutierrez', 'Carla Gugino, Emmanuelle Chriqui, Rosario Dawson, Josh Hartnett, Danny DeVito, Zachary Quinto, Gil Bellows, Robert Forster', 'R', 'A sharp-witted comedy that follows a group of apparent strangers in interlocking stories taking place in ten different bars during the course of one evening throughout Los Angeles.', 'A sharp-witted comedy that follows a group of apparent strangers in interlocking stories taking place in ten different bars during the course of one evening throughout Los Angeles.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/t6Mr51fTqha0bVFUS8b8YAhxhyJ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:59006'),
  ('534355233389691127', 'Girl with a Pearl Earring', 2003, 'Drama, Romance', 'Peter Webber, Eduardo Serra', 'Olivia Hetreed', 'Scarlett Johansson, Colin Firth, Tom Wilkinson, Cillian Murphy, Judy Parfitt, Essie Davis, Joanna Scanlan, Gabrielle Reidy', 'PG-13', 'This film, adapted from a work of fiction by author Tracy Chevalier, tells a story about the events surrounding the creation of the painting "Girl With A Pearl Earring" by 17th century Dutch master Johannes Vermeer. A young peasant maid working in the house of painter Johannes Vermeer becomes his talented assistant and the model for one of his most famous works.', 'This film, adapted from a work of fiction by author Tracy Chevalier, tells a story about the events surrounding the creation of the painting "Girl With A Pearl Earring" by 17th century Dutch master Johannes Vermeer. A young peasant maid working in the house of painter Johannes Vermeer becomes his talented assistant and the model for one of his most famous works.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/41DkOi1MvTgTQXt5BevVSzo94kk.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:3635'),
  ('447849837640220924', 'Girl with a Suitcase', 1961, 'Drama, Romance', 'Valerio Zurlini, Tino Santoni, Piero Schivazappa', 'Piero De Bernardi, Leonardo Benvenuti, Enrico Medioli', 'Claudia Cardinale, Adriana Asti, Jacques Perrin, Massimo Turci, Luciana Angiolillo, Riccardo Garrone, Elsa Albani, Corrado Pani', null, 'Lorenzo, who''s 16 and born to a wealthy family in Parma, tries to make things right toward a showgirl, Aida, whom his older brother has mistreated. In extending kindness and standing up for her, he comes of age. But, is there anything he can do that will alter Aida''s situation or her prospects?', 'Lorenzo, who''s 16 and born to a wealthy family in Parma, tries to make things right toward a showgirl, Aida, whom his older brother has mistreated. In extending kindness and standing up for her, he comes of age. But, is there anything he can do that will alter Aida''s situation or her prospects?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vC6ysIyFTg7yp483x27uEVsbPGW.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:49697'),
  ('27885328573097924', 'Girl with Green Eyes', 1964, 'Drama, Romance', 'Desmond Davis, Manny Wynn', 'Edna O''Brien', 'Rita Tushingham, Peter Finch, Lynn Redgrave, Arthur O''Sullivan, Julian Glover, Marie Kean, T. P. McKenna, Pat Laffan', null, 'A naive young country girl moves to Dublin and finds herself drawn to a sophisticated author twice her age.', 'A naive young country girl moves to Dublin and finds herself drawn to a sophisticated author twice her age.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ntuLUDK48OQMQgBpakOfQtpM70e.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:64811'),
  ('54224645315764139', 'Girl with Hyacinths', 1950, 'Drama, Mystery', 'Hasse Ekman, Göran Strindberg, Lasse Swärd', 'Hasse Ekman', 'Eva Henning, Ulf Palme, Birgit Tengroth, Anders Ek, Gösta Cederlund, Karl-Arne Holmsten, Keve Hjelm, Marianne Löfgren', null, 'A young woman dies by suicide and leaves all her belongings to her next-door neighbour, who becomes determined to investigate her reasons for taking her life.', 'A young woman dies by suicide and leaves all her belongings to her next-door neighbour, who becomes determined to investigate her reasons for taking her life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xbJzBFevDcxsNWNkyh1oiq70dDv.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:81981'),
  ('114215954634288628', 'Girl with the Golden Panties', 1980, 'Thriller', 'Vicente Aranda, José Luis Alcaine, Manuel Lombardero', 'Vicente Aranda, Mauricio Walerstein, Santiago San Miguel', 'Victoria Abril, Lautaro Murúa, Hilda Vera, Perla Vonasek, Pep Munné, José María Lana, Palmiro Aranda, Consuelo de Nieva', null, 'Luys Forest is a writer with a Falangist political past. He lives isolated in a coastal town, writing his memoirs (actually rewriting and adapting his autobiography with the times), and brooding over his failed marriage. His sister is worried about him and decides to send her daughter Mariana to stay with him. Mariana and a seemingly mute and artistic lesbian companion come to town to shake the stable world of Luys with their free and uninhibited ways. Soon begins a game of seduction that ends up exposing the intellectual game of Luys.', 'Luys Forest is a writer with a Falangist political past. He lives isolated in a coastal town, writing his memoirs (actually rewriting and adapting his autobiography with the times), and brooding over his failed marriage. His sister is worried about him and decides to send her daughter Mariana to stay with him. Mariana and a seemingly mute and artistic lesbian companion come to town to shake the stable world of Luys with their free and uninhibited ways. Soon begins a game of seduction that ends up exposing the intellectual game of Luys.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/AbBZvKygEMRdglHDqeHbc51uzb7.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:115682'),
  ('155883456495687712', 'Girl without an Address', 1958, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Eldar Ryazanov, Aleksandr Kharitonov, Viktor Zorin', 'Leonid Lench', 'Svetlana Karpinskaya, Nikolai Rybnikov, Erast Garin, Vasiliy Toporkov, Yuri Belov, Svetlana Tarasova, Zoya Fyodorova, Sergei Filippov', null, 'The amusing adventures of the young builder Pasha Gusarov began from the moment when he met and fell in love with Katya on the train, who was going to conquer Moscow. Happiness makes a person careless, and the station is just the place where you can lose it. But it is at the station after all kinds of adventures that they meet again and now they will never part.', 'The amusing adventures of the young builder Pasha Gusarov began from the moment when he met and fell in love with Katya on the train, who was going to conquer Moscow. Happiness makes a person careless, and the station is just the place where you can lose it. But it is at the station after all kinds of adventures that they meet again and now they will never part.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kvWhvsruglHQPGRUmIBglLU3AUg.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:63303'),
  ('110221212931519698', 'Girl You Know It''s True', 2023, 'Drama, History, Music', 'Jo Heim, Simon Verhoeven', 'Simon Verhoeven', 'Elan Ben Ali, Tijan Njie, Matthias Schweighöfer, Graham Rogers, Bella Dayne, Nico Ehrenteit, Sebastian Kempf, David Baalcke', null, 'The rise and fall of Milli Vanilli, a studio group assembled by German producer Frank Farian and fronted by nightclub dancers Robert Pilatus and Fabrice Morvan. After a string of worldwide hit singles, awards and performances, it was revealed that the duo never sang a note of their songs, leading to one of the biggest scandals in music history.', 'The rise and fall of Milli Vanilli, a studio group assembled by German producer Frank Farian and fronted by nightclub dancers Robert Pilatus and Fabrice Morvan. After a string of worldwide hit singles, awards and performances, it was revealed that the duo never sang a note of their songs, leading to one of the biggest scandals in music history.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yKYSHULhVfFzibLmWyJfUiwsFkR.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1067950'),
  ('534279205822100360', 'Girl, Boy, Bakla, Tomboy', 2013, 'Comedy, Drama, Family', 'Sherman So, Wenn V. Deramas', 'Mel Mendoza-Del Rosario', 'Vice Ganda, Maricel Soriano, Ejay Falcon, Joey Marquez, JC de Vera, Cristine Reyes, Ruffa Gutierrez, Joy Viado', null, 'Quadruplet siblings (two boys and two girls) played by Vice Ganda were separated after birth when their grandmother steals two of the siblings (a boy and a girl) away from their mother. The stolen siblings lived a comfortable life in the US, not knowing that their mother and siblings, a gay and a lesbian, struggled to make ends meet in the Philippines. When the boy develops hepatitis that requires him to have a liver transplant from a compatible donor, their father tells them about their siblings in the Philippines, who may be possible candidates as donors. But once the siblings finally meet, pent up resentment and animosity between the girl and the gay siblings, has threatened the chances of the boy sibling''s survival.', 'Quadruplet siblings (two boys and two girls) played by Vice Ganda were separated after birth when their grandmother steals two of the siblings (a boy and a girl) away from their mother. The stolen siblings lived a comfortable life in the US, not knowing that their mother and siblings, a gay and a lesbian, struggled to make ends meet in the Philippines. When the boy develops hepatitis that requires him to have a liver transplant from a compatible donor, their father tells them about their siblings in the Philippines, who may be possible candidates as donors. But once the siblings finally meet, pent up resentment and animosity between the girl and the gay siblings, has threatened the chances of the boy sibling''s survival.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gpolv26K8s0zZSfnwaS8gEbwjrr.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:247986'),
  ('647478990183199152', 'Girl, Interrupted', 1999, 'Drama', 'James Mangold, Jack N. Green, Cas Donovan', 'Anna Hamilton Phelan, James Mangold, Lisa Loomer', 'Winona Ryder, Angelina Jolie, Clea DuVall, Brittany Murphy, Elisabeth Moss, Jared Leto, Jeffrey Tambor, Vanessa Redgrave', 'R', 'Set in the changing world of the late 1960s, Susanna Kaysen''s prescribed "short rest" from a psychiatrist she had met only once becomes a strange, unknown journey into Alice''s Wonderland, where she struggles with the thin line between normal and crazy. Susanna soon realizes how hard it is to get out once she has been committed, and she ultimately has to choose between the world of people who belong inside or the difficult world of reality outside.', 'Set in the changing world of the late 1960s, Susanna Kaysen''s prescribed "short rest" from a psychiatrist she had met only once becomes a strange, unknown journey into Alice''s Wonderland, where she struggles with the thin line between normal and crazy. Susanna soon realizes how hard it is to get out once she has been committed, and she ultimately has to choose between the world of people who belong inside or the difficult world of reality outside.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dOBdatHIVppvmRFw2z7bf9VKJr9.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:3558'),
  ('919669765464519487', 'Girl''s Blood', 2014, 'Action, Drama, Romance', 'Koichi Sakamoto', 'Takehiko Minato', 'Yuria Haga, Asami Tada, Ayame Misaki, Rina Koike, Yoshiyuki Yamaguchi, Takahisa Maeyama, Misaki Momose, Rina Sakuragi', null, 'Four girls take part in illegal underground fighting event "Girl''s Blood" held at an abandoned school building in Roppongi every night. The girls have their own stories and quirks from their private lives. Satsuki (Yuria Haga) suffers from a gender identity disorder, Chinatsu (Asami Tada) ran away from an abusive husband, Miko (Ayame Misaki) is a S&amp;M queen and Mayu (Rina Koike) has a Lolita face.', 'Four girls take part in illegal underground fighting event "Girl''s Blood" held at an abandoned school building in Roppongi every night. The girls have their own stories and quirks from their private lives. Satsuki (Yuria Haga) suffers from a gender identity disorder, Chinatsu (Asami Tada) ran away from an abusive husband, Miko (Ayame Misaki) is a S&amp;M queen and Mayu (Rina Koike) has a Lolita face.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9Oc7cqHsPLA1FvNLmF6jUAz38tg.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:278540'),
  ('687004357191722228', 'Girl''s Life, Boy''s World', 2003, 'Comedy, TV Movie', 'Uwe Schäfer, Hansjörg Thurn', null, 'Jana Petersen, Nicky Kantor, Florian Jahr, David Winter, Sissi Perlinger, Vinzenz Kiefer, Manuel Cortez, Tim Sander', null, 'At seventeen, girls are all about looking good, dressing right and making out with the cutest boys. Or they''re like Luka, who''s an ace in boxing and couldn''t care less about her looks or her appeal to boys. When she breaks a schoolmate''s nose, her parents send her off to boarding school to acquire some ladylike manners. There she''s mistaken for Frankie, a boy who hasn''t shown up, and takes on his identity. With her boxing skills, she instantly wins over her three roommates Chico, Toby and Jo, and strikes up a particularly close friendship with Chico. Her uncompromising honesty and loyalty to her new friends, however, soon get her into trouble with the headmistress and her nephew, the school bully.', 'At seventeen, girls are all about looking good, dressing right and making out with the cutest boys. Or they''re like Luka, who''s an ace in boxing and couldn''t care less about her looks or her appeal to boys. When she breaks a schoolmate''s nose, her parents send her off to boarding school to acquire some ladylike manners. There she''s mistaken for Frankie, a boy who hasn''t shown up, and takes on his identity. With her boxing skills, she instantly wins over her three roommates Chico, Toby and Jo, and strikes up a particularly close friendship with Chico. Her uncompromising honesty and loyalty to her new friends, however, soon get her into trouble with the headmistress and her nephew, the school bully.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oUgbUWfPlAQhKLPnX6N9gAjKkvJ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:11292'),
  ('887571161065186861', 'Girl’s Pleasure: Man Hunting', 1977, 'Drama, Thriller', 'Yoshiro Takahashi, Toshiya Fujita, Shōhei Andō', 'Toshiya Fujita, Machiko Nasu', 'Kaori Ono, Jun Nakagawa, Shigeru Yazaki, Moeko Ezawa, Aya Origuchi, Tony Wada, Ryoichi Sato, Kunio Shimizu', null, 'Two high school friends. One witnesses the breakup of her family after a brutal home invasion. The other loses her virginity to an African-American soldier. Together they make a vital discovery and exact violent revenge.', 'Two high school friends. One witnesses the breakup of her family after a brutal home invasion. The other loses her virginity to an African-American soldier. Together they make a vital discovery and exact violent revenge.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6mxVYlKY7B102lqwtTawwWlGOd9.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:553168'),
  ('700807071376013320', 'Girl''s Revenge', 2020, 'Drama', 'Chang Hsi-ming, En-Chieh Chen, Weica Wang', 'Blanche Chiang', 'Wang Yu-ping, Chen Yi-ruei, Shiny Yao, Chu-Ping Liu, Mike Lin, Edison Song, Alex Ko, Heaven Hai', null, 'At a birthday party, a sex video is filmed without consent and Ren Li-cha is the girl in the video. The clip circulates among the students and Li-cha is mocked and bullied as a result. Wu Yun-heng, a transfer student, went to the party with Li-cha. As she cannot stand how much Li-cha is suffering'' she is determined to find out about the truth behind the incident, fighting for her best friend. However, as she gets closer to the truth, she is about to shatter the peace in school.', 'At a birthday party, a sex video is filmed without consent and Ren Li-cha is the girl in the video. The clip circulates among the students and Li-cha is mocked and bullied as a result. Wu Yun-heng, a transfer student, went to the party with Li-cha. As she cannot stand how much Li-cha is suffering'' she is determined to find out about the truth behind the incident, fighting for her best friend. However, as she gets closer to the truth, she is about to shatter the peace in school.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/b3bkRhpPJ4qQfINJ1BRZoqrK0kc.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:720851'),
  ('489453581385729735', 'Girlfight', 2000, 'Drama', 'Karyn Kusama, Patrick Cady', 'Karyn Kusama', 'Michelle Rodriguez, Jamie Tirelli, Paul Calderon, Santiago Douglas, Ray Santiago, Víctor Sierra, Elisa Bocanegra, Herb Lovelle', 'R', 'Diana Guzman, a troubled Brooklyn teenager, decides to channel her aggression by training to become a boxer, all while keeping it a secret from her father.', 'Diana Guzman, a troubled Brooklyn teenager, decides to channel her aggression by training to become a boxer, all while keeping it a secret from her father.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ydHUoYtpZdkwxdroK1rWyEpJrLZ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:19348'),
  ('245573451157126006', 'Girlfriend Boyfriend', 2012, 'Drama, Comedy, Romance', 'Yang Ya-che, Shirley Chien, Jake Pollock', 'Yang Ya-che', 'Joseph Chang, Gwei Lun-mei, Rhydian Vaughan, Bryan Shu-Hao Chang, Serena Fang, Ding Ning, Hung-Ying Shang-Kuan, Lin Nai-Hua', 'NR', 'Mabel, Liam and Aaron have been friends since childhood. Their bonds of friendship are tested when, years later, they realize their friendship is the only reason they have made it through emotional hardships and extreme tragedies.', 'Mabel, Liam and Aaron have been friends since childhood. Their bonds of friendship are tested when, years later, they realize their friendship is the only reason they have made it through emotional hardships and extreme tragedies.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mOAyQFruJiB0oXWzVAmbGCSHqNb.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:119273'),
  ('1092843213796351272', 'Girlfriend from Hell', 1989, 'Comedy, Horror', 'Dan Peterson, Gerry Lively', 'Dan Peterson', 'Liane Curtis, Dana Ashbrook, Lezlie Deane, James Daughton, Anthony Barrile, Ken Abraham, Sarah Kaite Coughlan, Hilary Morse', 'R', 'The inventor of the condom has become God''s bounty hunter and is tasked with tracking down and capturing the Devil, who has possessed the body of a high school wallflower in order to feed on human souls via sex.', 'The inventor of the condom has become God''s bounty hunter and is tasked with tracking down and capturing the Devil, who has possessed the body of a high school wallflower in order to feed on human souls via sex.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dxkfg6wR2ctbKj6wHRE2y5GG8Y6.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:59798'),
