  ('253612881510212884', 'Girls in Trouble: Space Squad Episode Zero', 2017, 'Action, Adventure, Science Fiction', 'Shu G. Momose, Koichi Sakamoto, Koichi Sakamoto', 'Naruhisa Arakawa', 'Ayumi Kinoshita, Mika Kikuchi, Suzuka Morita, Misaki Momose, Mayu Kawamoto, Minami Tsukui, Sanae Hitomi, Mikie Hara', null, 'Girls in Trouble: Space Squad Episode Zero is an installment in the Toei Company V-Cinema series. Space Squad serves as a crossover between the revival of the Metal Heroes'' Space Sheriff series and the Super Sentai series Tokusou Sentai Dekaranger. A prologue to Gavan vs. Dekaranger, this movie focuses on the female characters of both series.', 'Girls in Trouble: Space Squad Episode Zero is an installment in the Toei Company V-Cinema series. Space Squad serves as a crossover between the revival of the Metal Heroes'' Space Sheriff series and the Super Sentai series Tokusou Sentai Dekaranger. A prologue to Gavan vs. Dekaranger, this movie focuses on the female characters of both series.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4zgVnsXjgn7niSvQLec8glp3ggX.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:434027'),
  ('82220975953304986', 'Girls in Uniform', 1958, 'Drama', 'Géza von Radványi, Werner Krien, Eva Ebner', 'Franz Höllering, Friedrich Dammann', 'Lilli Palmer, Romy Schneider, Therese Giehse, Blandine Ebinger, Adelheid Seeck, Gina Albert, Sabine Sinjen, Christine Kaufmann', 'NR', 'A new student, Manuela, enters a strict girls'' boarding school after her mother’s death, where she finds comfort in a kind teacher, stirring complex emotions within her.', 'A new student, Manuela, enters a strict girls'' boarding school after her mother’s death, where she finds comfort in a kind teacher, stirring complex emotions within her.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/snsC0lkDugHhhcP64Iyu0x47hBn.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:4955'),
  ('526754466315703356', 'Girls Just Want to Have Fun', 1985, 'Comedy, Family, Music, Romance', 'Alan Metter, Thomas E. Ackerman, Richard Muessel', 'Amy Spies', 'Sarah Jessica Parker, Helen Hunt, Shannen Doherty, Lee Montgomery, Morgan Woodward, Jonathan Silverman, Ed Lauter, Holly Gagnier', 'PG', 'Janey is new in town. She soon meets Lynne, a classmate who shares her passion for the local show ''Dance TV''. When a competition is announced to find new Dance TV performers, Janey and Lynne are determined to audition. The only problem is that Janey''s father doesn''t approve of that kind of thing.', 'Janey is new in town. She soon meets Lynne, a classmate who shares her passion for the local show ''Dance TV''. When a competition is announced to find new Dance TV performers, Janey and Lynne are determined to audition. The only problem is that Janey''s father doesn''t approve of that kind of thing.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yhbuTnTA6wu5hOXL5uc3rRFLnCl.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:16263'),
