  ('395550320122683941', 'Girls Nite Out', 1982, 'Horror', 'Robert Deubel, Tom Fritz, Dwight Williams', 'Gil Spencer Jr., Kevin Kurgis, Joe Bolster', 'Julia Montgomery, James Carroll, Suzanne Barnes, Rutanya Alda, Hal Holbrook, Lauren-Marie Taylor, David Holbrook, Laura Summer', 'R', 'The students of DeWitt University are preparing themselves for a night of fun and frolics in the form of an all-night scavenger hunt. Little do they know that they are in fact the ones being hunted.', 'The students of DeWitt University are preparing themselves for a night of fun and frolics in the form of an all-night scavenger hunt. Little do they know that they are in fact the ones being hunted.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zWW7IF7klwhvmWXk2JBxnNHbXWM.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:59738'),
