  ('52384948797631189', 'Girls of the Sun', 2018, 'Drama, War', 'Eva Husson, Taras Myskiv, Mattias Troelstrup', 'Jacques Akchoti', 'Golshifteh Farahani, Emmanuelle Bercot, Zübeyde Bulut, Behi Djanati Atai, Evin Ahmad, Erol Afşin, Arabi Ghibeh, Zirek', null, 'Bahar, the commanding officer of the Daughters of the Sun, a battalion made up entirely of Kurdish female soldiers, is on the cusp of liberating their town, which has been overrun by ISIS extremists.', 'Bahar, the commanding officer of the Daughters of the Sun, a battalion made up entirely of Kurdish female soldiers, is on the cusp of liberating their town, which has been overrun by ISIS extremists.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fgVoQyioqX2Q78lnBO7CYqQ8eOZ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:479520'),
  ('272358166997542497', 'Girls of the White Orchid', 1983, 'Action, Thriller, Romance, TV Movie', 'Jonathan Kaplan, Robert Della Santina, Jules Lichtman', 'Carole Raschella, Michael Raschella', 'Jennifer Jason Leigh, Thomas Byrd, Mako, Carolyn Seymour, Richard Narita, Soon-Tek Oh, Ann Jillian, Yvonne McCord', null, 'In Los Angeles, naive and lonely waitress and aspirant singer Carol finds an advertisement for a job opportunity in Tokyo. Traveling to Japan to work at the White Orchid nightclub, she discovers the scheme of prostitution in the club that belongs to Yakuza. Alone, without money and her passport, she is protected by Shiro, but pressed by the managers Madame Mori and her husband Hatanaka to be receptive to client''s proposals.', 'In Los Angeles, naive and lonely waitress and aspirant singer Carol finds an advertisement for a job opportunity in Tokyo. Traveling to Japan to work at the White Orchid nightclub, she discovers the scheme of prostitution in the club that belongs to Yakuza. Alone, without money and her passport, she is protected by Shiro, but pressed by the managers Madame Mori and her husband Hatanaka to be receptive to client''s proposals.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jzB5fkTjZFukpPTvDMvuJBhLzqQ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:98880'),
  ('393680316296207904', 'Girls on Top', 2001, 'Comedy', 'Dennis Gansel, Axel Sand, Ulrike Schürhoff', 'Maggie Peren', 'Diana Amft, Karoline Herfurth, Felicitas Woll, Andreas Christ, Max Riemelt, Arzu Bazman, Frederic Welter, Florian Lukas', null, 'The adventures of three teenage girls - Inken, Vicky and Lena - and their quest to have their first orgasm.', 'The adventures of three teenage girls - Inken, Vicky and Lena - and their quest to have their first orgasm.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/edGsy5IFi6m6xe6JWFqUoKPiJ1n.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:9337'),
  ('102832960654091312', 'Girls on Top 2', 2004, 'Comedy', 'Jochen Stäblein, Peter Gersina', 'Maggie Peren', 'Diana Amft, Karoline Herfurth, Jasmin Gerat, Max Riemelt, Sebastian Ströbel, Max von Thun, Simon Verhoeven, Florian David Fitz', null, 'Inken and Lucy are facing hard times when their parents'' money is radically cut off. Together with Lena, who is fed up with her boyfriend, they desperately search for money, an apartment and love. But because each individual point is difficult to realize on its own, the girls decide to kill all three birds with one stone for the sake of simplicity. The solution: they need rich, nice boys with suitable living space - and they need them now! But until then, horrendous rents, false identities and sleazy neighbors put their friendship to the test.', 'Inken and Lucy are facing hard times when their parents'' money is radically cut off. Together with Lena, who is fed up with her boyfriend, they desperately search for money, an apartment and love. But because each individual point is difficult to realize on its own, the girls decide to kill all three birds with one stone for the sake of simplicity. The solution: they need rich, nice boys with suitable living space - and they need them now! But until then, horrendous rents, false identities and sleazy neighbors put their friendship to the test.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hdFAZeWyLsJfJZl2T9WMT8jt8PT.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:11179'),
  ('229765284134828506', 'Girls School Screamers', 1986, 'Horror, Mystery', 'John P. Finnegan, Bill Pace, Tom Rondinella', 'John P. Finnegan', 'Mollie O''Mara, Sharon Christopher, Beth O''Malley, Karen Krevitz, Marcia Hinton, Monica Antonucci, Peter Cosimano, Vera Gallagher', 'R', 'Seven girls from the local Catholic school are chosen to go inventory the Wells estate. It sounds like a fun weekend until the girls hold a séance to try and contact Jennifer Wells, a 20-year-old who died mysteriously on the grounds in 1939. Their weekend gets even stranger when it is revealed one of the girls, Jackie, is a dead ringer for the deceased.', 'Seven girls from the local Catholic school are chosen to go inventory the Wells estate. It sounds like a fun weekend until the girls hold a séance to try and contact Jennifer Wells, a 20-year-old who died mysteriously on the grounds in 1939. Their weekend gets even stranger when it is revealed one of the girls, Jackie, is a dead ringer for the deceased.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wW7o4AuME2eBCpogBXsq5Fc14TW.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:85137'),
  ('895741085229457717', 'Girls Town', 1959, 'Drama', 'Charles F. Haas, John L. Russell', 'Robert Smith', 'Mamie Van Doren, Mel Tormé, Ray Anthony, Margaret Hayes, Paul Anka, Cathy Crosby, Gigi Perreau, Elinor Donahue', 'NR', 'Chip is killed accidentally while trying to rape a blonde girl, who runs. Silver becomes the number one suspect even though she has an alibi, but due to previous brushes with the law she''s sent to Girls Town, a home for young women in trouble with the law which is run by nuns. Silver is rebellious and causes trouble at the school, and her friend Sarafina totters near the brink of self-destruction because of an infatuation with a young singer. Meanwhile Chip''s father hires a detective to find out the truth, and Chip''s friend Fred gets Silver''s sister in trouble at a drag race. Silver has a lot of problems all right.', 'Chip is killed accidentally while trying to rape a blonde girl, who runs. Silver becomes the number one suspect even though she has an alibi, but due to previous brushes with the law she''s sent to Girls Town, a home for young women in trouble with the law which is run by nuns. Silver is rebellious and causes trouble at the school, and her friend Sarafina totters near the brink of self-destruction because of an infatuation with a young singer. Meanwhile Chip''s father hires a detective to find out the truth, and Chip''s friend Fred gets Silver''s sister in trouble at a drag race. Silver has a lot of problems all right.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nbHxQOvHLX6LrHdRfBmoiD5cQlE.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:43097'),
  ('879933087576284552', 'Girls Trip', 2017, 'Comedy, Romance, Adventure', 'Malcolm D. Lee, Greg Gardiner, Eric Scott Williamson', 'Kenya Barris, Tracy Oliver, Erica Rivinoja', 'Regina Hall, Queen Latifah, Jada Pinkett Smith, Tiffany Haddish, Larenz Tate, Mike Colter, Kate Walsh, Kofi Siriboe', 'R', 'Four girlfriends take a trip to New Orleans for an annual festival and, along the way, rediscover their wild sides and strengthen the bonds of sisterhood.', 'Four girlfriends take a trip to New Orleans for an annual festival and, along the way, rediscover their wild sides and strengthen the bonds of sisterhood.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mdsHCFt2PeZacEr38y2p5RRf6Hl.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:417870'),
  ('164041476373377154', 'Girls Unbutton', 1994, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Venus Keung, Taylor Wong Tai-Loi', null, 'Loletta Lee Lai-Chun, Leung See-Ho, David Siu Chung-Hang, Elvis Tsui Kam-Kong, Strawberry Yeung Yuk-Mui, Mikie Ng, Hung Yuk-laan, Yau Kwok-Leung', null, 'A film about the ups and downs of a beautiful young lass named Jenny and her never ending pursuit of a boyfriend.', 'A film about the ups and downs of a beautiful young lass named Jenny and her never ending pursuit of a boyfriend.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/46mNCuoHuXRH9z4XnlioLuuBXO5.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:68428'),
  ('524311572936420016', 'Girls und Panzer das Finale: Part 1', 2017, 'Animation, Action, Comedy', 'Isao Sugimoto, Yoshikazu Iwanami, Keiichiro Yanagino', 'Reiko Yoshida', 'Mai Fuchigami, Ai Kayano, Ozaki Mami, Ikumi Nakagami, Yuka Iguchi, Misato Fukuen, Mikako Takahashi, Kana Ueda', null, 'Too much tankery and not enough studying for her entrance exams has landed Momo in the hot seat! Luckily her friends won’t let her flunk out without a fight, and they’ve hatched a foxy plan to put her back on top. Miho’s stepping down to let Momo take up the mantle of commander, because if she can lead the team to victory in the Continuous Cup, Momo can retake her exams. The stakes have never been higher for the team as they fight for tank supremacy both on and off the combat field!', 'Too much tankery and not enough studying for her entrance exams has landed Momo in the hot seat! Luckily her friends won’t let her flunk out without a fight, and they’ve hatched a foxy plan to put her back on top. Miho’s stepping down to let Momo take up the mantle of commander, because if she can lead the team to victory in the Continuous Cup, Momo can retake her exams. The stakes have never been higher for the team as they fight for tank supremacy both on and off the combat field!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/p4HIfKM5Qw1458NLm7YKuYMTJQK.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:474659'),
  ('622630775922329121', 'Girls und Panzer das Finale: Part 2', 2019, 'Animation, Action, Comedy', 'Tsutomu Mizushima, Kohei Tanada, Keiichiro Yanagino', 'Reiko Yoshida', 'Mai Fuchigami, Ai Kayano, Ikumi Nakagami, Ozaki Mami, Yuka Iguchi, Misato Fukuen, Mikako Takahashi, Kana Ueda', null, 'After falling for BC Freedom High’s clever deception, the Oarai Girl’s High tank-maidens find themselves faced with an entirely different battlefront than expected. However, Yukari suspects that any bluff that could have been carried out so easily by so many people must have some basis in fact. So, as the other school teams prepare for combat across the competition, Oarai digs down with a plan to undermine the groundwork beneath their opposition.', 'After falling for BC Freedom High’s clever deception, the Oarai Girl’s High tank-maidens find themselves faced with an entirely different battlefront than expected. However, Yukari suspects that any bluff that could have been carried out so easily by so many people must have some basis in fact. So, as the other school teams prepare for combat across the competition, Oarai digs down with a plan to undermine the groundwork beneath their opposition.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2UPHyMm8fE22yvTFVGu1LW2nVF0.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:496891'),
  ('140267692575178172', 'Girls und Panzer das Finale: Part 3', 2021, 'Animation, Action, Comedy', 'Takahiko Usui, Munetaka Abe, Yoshikazu Iwanami', 'Reiko Yoshida', 'Mai Fuchigami, Ikumi Nakagami, Yuka Iguchi, Ozaki Mami', null, 'Firepower and strategy are the name of the game as the schools square off on three additional battlegrounds. Six teams enter and only the survivors will advance!', 'Firepower and strategy are the name of the game as the schools square off on three additional battlegrounds. Six teams enter and only the survivors will advance!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/v76E48AKCLtQE45aMXZf5f6MKGT.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:746880'),
  ('464425531655088623', 'Girls und Panzer der Film', 2015, 'Animation, Action, Comedy', 'Tsutomu Mizushima, Isao Sugimoto, Keiichiro Yanagino', 'Reiko Yoshida', 'Mai Fuchigami, Ikumi Nakagami, Ai Kayano, Ozaki Mami, Yuka Iguchi, Ayana Taketatsu, Misato Fukuen, Mikako Takahashi', null, 'When the Ministry of Education goes back on its promise to keep Ooarai Girls Academy open, the task of saving the five-mile-long Academy Ship from the wreckers falls to Miho and her barely-seasoned tankery team. However, things go off track almost immediately. While the Oorai tank crew may have won the high school tournament, they’re now facing a larger and more experienced university team, and if they fail, their armored vehicles will be forfeit! Will they be swapping their tanks for the memories? It’s possible, but winning a tank battle is all about tactics and teamwork, and the fledgling Ooarai students have more friends and allies than anyone suspects.', 'When the Ministry of Education goes back on its promise to keep Ooarai Girls Academy open, the task of saving the five-mile-long Academy Ship from the wreckers falls to Miho and her barely-seasoned tankery team. However, things go off track almost immediately. While the Oorai tank crew may have won the high school tournament, they’re now facing a larger and more experienced university team, and if they fail, their armored vehicles will be forfeit! Will they be swapping their tanks for the memories? It’s possible, but winning a tank battle is all about tactics and teamwork, and the fledgling Ooarai students have more friends and allies than anyone suspects.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jGa3LLsUzj9gooXstNyTIqazOWS.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:357405'),
  ('1102170074600256211', 'Girls und Panzer: This Is the Real Anzio Battle!', 2014, 'Comedy, Animation, Action', 'Tsutomu Mizushima, Yoshihiro Sekiya, Yoshikazu Iwanami', 'Takaaki Suzuki', 'Mai Fuchigami, Ai Kayano, Ozaki Mami, Ikumi Nakagami, Yuka Iguchi, Misato Fukuen, Mikako Takahashi, Kana Ueda', null, 'Following Oorai''s victory over Saunders, the school''s next opponent is Anzio. This is an OVA which covers the battle of Oorai versus Anzio, which was not fully shown in the regular anime series.', 'Following Oorai''s victory over Saunders, the school''s next opponent is Anzio. This is an OVA which covers the battle of Oorai versus Anzio, which was not fully shown in the regular anime series.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pJ7JBbHypOboHXtSp27spSlHtqg.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:480976'),
  ('625379711514802042', 'Girls Will Be Girls', 1980, 'Comedy', 'Mariano Laurenti, Maurizio Maggi', 'Franco Mercuri, Gianfranco D''Angelo, Mariano Laurenti', 'Enzo Cannavale, Anna Maria Rizzoli, Gianfranco D''Angelo, Bombolo, Jimmy il Fenomeno, Carmen Russo, Vincenzo Crocitti, Giacomo Furia', null, 'A group of employees, on a winter vacation, rather than skiing, spend their time in an attempt to impress the beautiful Angela and a sexy servant girl.', 'A group of employees, on a winter vacation, rather than skiing, spend their time in an attempt to impress the beautiful Angela and a sexy servant girl.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/r7noiDa6MDQD4svWNzrhfwEH0PL.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:194106'),
  ('859936212422236340', 'Girls Will Be Girls', 2003, 'Comedy', 'Richard Day, Nicholas Hutak', 'Richard Day', 'Jack Plotnick, Miss Coco Peru, Varla Jean Merman, Ron Mathews, Eric Stonestreet, Sam Pancake, Dana Gould, Hamilton von Watts', 'R', 'Nothing stirs up the competitive spirit in haggard Hollywood has-been Evie Harris like having to share a house with a younger actress like Varla. Especially since Varla happens to be the daughter of Evie''s now-deceased rival! But even as their saner roommate, Coco, attempts to keep the peace, Evie''s jealousy over Varla''s burgeoning infomercial career is about to explode... in the most spectacular, showstopping way possible!', 'Nothing stirs up the competitive spirit in haggard Hollywood has-been Evie Harris like having to share a house with a younger actress like Varla. Especially since Varla happens to be the daughter of Evie''s now-deceased rival! But even as their saner roommate, Coco, attempts to keep the peace, Evie''s jealousy over Varla''s burgeoning infomercial career is about to explode... in the most spectacular, showstopping way possible!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dkuOR3E28A3mXjfjuoMudJWEN4B.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:21059'),
  ('804595286288868317', 'Girls Will Be Girls', 2024, 'Drama, Romance', 'Shuchi Talati, Jih-E Peng', 'Shuchi Talati', 'Preeti Panigrahi, Kani Kusruti, Kesav Binoy Kiron, Kajol Chugh, Nandini Verma, Devika Shahani, Akash Pramanik, Aman Desai', null, 'In a strict boarding school nestled in the Himalayas, 16-year-old Mira discovers desire and romance. But her sexual, rebellious awakening is disrupted by her mother who never got to come of age herself.', 'In a strict boarding school nestled in the Himalayas, 16-year-old Mira discovers desire and romance. But her sexual, rebellious awakening is disrupted by her mother who never got to come of age herself.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/psklilaTgyczbHidamDlpFWodb0.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1108828'),
  ('864745277024171689', 'Girls with Balls', 2019, 'Horror, Comedy', 'Olivier Afonso, Sacha Wiernik', 'Olivier Afonso, Jean-Luc Cano', 'Artus, Manon Azem, Louise Blachère, Tiphaine Daviot, Margot Dufrene, Anne-Solenne Hatte, Camille Razat, Dany Verissimo-Petit', null, 'All girls volley ball team The Falcons end up stranded in the middle of nowhere after their mini-van breaks down. Little do they know they landed in degenerate hunters'' territory and the hunt is on. Thus begins a very long night where they must run for their lives and test their team spirit. But the girls are more resourceful than it appears. In the heart of the forest, the tables are about to turn between hunter and hunted...', 'All girls volley ball team The Falcons end up stranded in the middle of nowhere after their mini-van breaks down. Little do they know they landed in degenerate hunters'' territory and the hunt is on. Thus begins a very long night where they must run for their lives and test their team spirit. But the girls are more resourceful than it appears. In the heart of the forest, the tables are about to turn between hunter and hunted...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cd7WFEjGgcpOSKRYbQoTCDkdhIX.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:449684'),
  ('122868765932329742', 'Girls with Guns', 1994, 'Comedy, Action', 'Jean-Paul Salomé, Patrick Duroux', 'Joëlle Goron, Gérard Mordillat, Laurent Bénégui', 'Catherine Jacob, Clémentine Célarié, Alexandra Kazan, Nanou Garcia, Annie Girardot, Jean-Claude Adelin, Jacques Gamblin, Vanessa Guedj', null, 'In Montelimar, four young women whom life has not spared want to emerge from mediocrity. They decide to rob a bank, but everything is not so simple and the perfectly developed heist could turn into disaster.', 'In Montelimar, four young women whom life has not spared want to emerge from mediocrity. They decide to rob a bank, but everything is not so simple and the perfectly developed heist could turn into disaster.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wAc2xGklmWKUX41OLpT0Rt1ExIr.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:138659'),
  ('522656258502637858', 'Girls, Girls', 1967, 'Drama', 'Roger Fritz, Klaus König', 'Roger Fritz, Eckhart Schmidt', 'Helga Anders, Jürgen Jung, Hellmut Lange, Renate Grosser, Klaus Löwitsch, Monika Zinnenberg, Christian Doermer, Ernst Ronnecker', null, 'An underage girl starts an affair with her much older employer. Then, her lover is sentenced for the seduction of a minor, and the young woman gets involved with his son, the junior head of the company. When his father is released from prison, father and son become rivals for their shared lover.', 'An underage girl starts an affair with her much older employer. Then, her lover is sentenced for the seduction of a minor, and the young woman gets involved with his son, the junior head of the company. When his father is released from prison, father and son become rivals for their shared lover.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/teVHJk4L0NBPiX1tQXaVX7lsoQs.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:270204'),
  ('635556570581367937', 'Girls! Girls! Girls!', 1962, 'Comedy, Music, Romance', 'Norman Taurog, Loyal Griggs, Irmin Roberts', 'Allan Weiss, Edward Anhalt', 'Elvis Presley, Stella Stevens, Jeremy Slate, Laurel Goodwin, Benson Fong, Robert Strauss, Guy Lee, Frank Puglia', 'PG', 'When he finds out his boss is retiring to Arizona, a sailor, Ross Carpenter, has to find a way to buy the Westwind, a boat that he and his father built. He is also caught between two women: insensitive club singer Robin and sweet Laurel.', 'When he finds out his boss is retiring to Arizona, a sailor, Ross Carpenter, has to find a way to buy the Westwind, a boat that he and his father built. He is also caught between two women: insensitive club singer Robin and sweet Laurel.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/41NoayYsUD4LPv586apJxl0iNzf.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:15734'),
  ('31626118625737242', 'Girls'' Night Out', 1998, 'Drama', 'Im Sang-soo, Hong Kyung-pyo', 'Im Sang-soo', 'Jin Hee-kyung, Cho Jae-hyun, Kang Soo-youn, Kim Yeo-jin, Sul Kyung-gu, Kim Eung-soo, Won Mi-won, Nam Myung-ryeol', null, 'Three best friends meet and boldly talk about sex together. Their characters are as different as their lifestyles. One works at a hotel, one at a design firm and the other is a graduate student. The conversations alter their lives as they begin to have different sexual relationships than before.', 'Three best friends meet and boldly talk about sex together. Their characters are as different as their lifestyles. One works at a hotel, one at a design firm and the other is a graduate student. The conversations alter their lives as they begin to have different sexual relationships than before.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ecqlA8btCuHNR6aeCNKLOs5wt6S.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:216027'),
  ('936276213883739970', 'Girls'' Night Out', 2015, 'Comedy', 'Manuela Moreno, Bet Rourich, Nicolás Tapia', 'Manuela Moreno, Susana López Rubio', 'Natalia de Molina, Celia de Molina, Úrsula Corberó, María Hervás, Brays Efe, Roger Berruezo, José Lamuño, Jim Arnold', 'R', 'A group of girls taking a trip to celebrate a bachelorette party in which they will rediscover themselves.', 'A group of girls taking a trip to celebrate a bachelorette party in which they will rediscover themselves.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cq4Vfr4kXig8mWSKqJy0ZE5usTL.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:278736'),
  ('877587884033660731', 'Girls'' Night Out', 2017, 'Thriller, TV Movie', 'Philippe Gagnon, Daniel Villeneuve', 'Lisa Steele', 'Katherine Barrell, Mackenzie Mauzy, Kelly Kruger, Hannah Emily Anderson, Cody Ray Thompson, Jacob Blair, Tristan D. Lalla, Alex Ivanovici', null, 'McKenzie is a few months away from getting married when her three best friends from college surprise her with a bachelorette party.', 'McKenzie is a few months away from getting married when her three best friends from college surprise her with a bachelorette party.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2sIH1UwPGwlHzxWK6xhgLzme6IN.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:439201'),
  ('851290996368359375', 'Girls'' Robbery', 2014, 'Action, Comedy', 'A. Taner Elhan', null, 'Meltem Cumbul, Filiz Ahmet, Esra Dermancıoğlu, Özge Ulusoy, Gökçe Eyüboğlu, Ayşen İnci, Güven Murat Akpınar, Meral Çetinkaya', null, 'After a mother in debt seeks moral support from her three closest friends, she ends up with a ragtag crew ready to rob a bank.', 'After a mother in debt seeks moral support from her three closest friends, she ends up with a ragtag crew ready to rob a bank.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9cW4WrGyMbmikumNd8j5a5CE9p5.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:271955'),
  ('487726814360299618', 'Girolimoni, the Monster of Rome', 1972, 'Drama, Crime, Comedy', 'Damiano Damiani, Riccardo Sesani, Marcello Gatti', 'Fulvio Gicca Palli, Damiano Damiani, Enrico Ribulsi', 'Nino Manfredi, Gabriele Lavia, Guido Leontini, Orso Maria Guerrini, Anna Maria Pescatori, Luciano Catenacci, Mario Carotenuto, Carlo Alighiero', null, 'In Mussolini''s Rome a murderer is targeting young girls. The movie explores how the fascist mind works, how it plays its values off the sentiment of the masses and explores the role of the press in creating a unified narrative.', 'In Mussolini''s Rome a murderer is targeting young girls. The movie explores how the fascist mind works, how it plays its values off the sentiment of the masses and explores the role of the press in creating a unified narrative.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nd3udNcpbjaWRgTXRj2jmEKgqwG.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:79750'),
  ('280020892076445632', 'Girotondo: Giro Attorno al Mondo', 1999, 'Drama', 'Davide Manuli, Florent Herry, Arnaldo Catinari', 'Davide Manuli', 'Sarah Boberg, Luciano Curreli, Davide Manuli', null, 'Angelo is an orphan who grew up with a nomad woman. He reacts to his pain over the death of his best friend for overdose, thanks to the encounter with Serena. She survives being a prostitute, but she has not lost hope. Angelo moves along an axis of characters in a desolate and poetic day without end.', 'Angelo is an orphan who grew up with a nomad woman. He reacts to his pain over the death of his best friend for overdose, thanks to the encounter with Serena. She survives being a prostitute, but she has not lost hope. Angelo moves along an axis of characters in a desolate and poetic day without end.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sE404sMwq5Mtuy22Vw4PVD4QwLE.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:406276'),
  ('886150961898696218', 'Gisaku', 2005, 'Action, Animation, Fantasy, Adventure', 'Baltasar Pedrosa, Antonio Santamaría, Oriol De La Torre', 'Angel E. Pariente', 'Eduard Farelo, José Antonio Torrabadella, Núria Trifol, Luis Posada, Alfonso Vallés, Pepe Antequera, Concha García Valero, Ana Pallejá', null, 'The adventures of a young Japanese samurai named Yohei who visited Spain in the 17th century, in a story loosely taking its inspiration from the travels of historic samurai Hasekura. Yohei survived in hiding to the present day due to magical powers, and accomplishes many adventures in modern Spain as a superhero.', 'The adventures of a young Japanese samurai named Yohei who visited Spain in the 17th century, in a story loosely taking its inspiration from the travels of historic samurai Hasekura. Yohei survived in hiding to the present day due to magical powers, and accomplishes many adventures in modern Spain as a superhero.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8op96HUtPVQ22MnSo1ohSwdXQvh.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:50007'),
  ('519726255254862477', 'Gisèle Kérozène', 1990, 'Comedy, Action, Animation', 'Jan Kounen, Jeanne Lapoirie', 'Carlo De Boutiny', 'Abel Abouliaten, Pascal Banos, Bob Fletchard, Jan Kounen, Jean-Baptise Sastre, Graziella Tymen', null, 'Three witches worship a bird statue in a postmodern city. When Gisèle Kerozene comes and steals it, the three witches jump on their brooms and initiate a hilarious chase.', 'Three witches worship a bird statue in a postmodern city. When Gisèle Kerozene comes and steals it, the three witches jump on their brooms and initiate a hilarious chase.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9XrFxCaBwyOxlP9sbFU2nZbiPyZ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:35829'),
  ('745656036781231335', 'Gitana Tenias Que Ser', 1953, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Rafael Baledón, Raúl Martínez Solares', 'Fernando Galiana, Ramón Obón', 'Pedro Infante, Carmen Sevilla, Estrellita Castro, Ángel Garasa, Pedro de Aguillón, José Jasso, Florencio Castelló, Carlos Múzquiz', null, 'Pastora de los Reyes is a beautiful Spanish that goes to Mexico with a contract to film a movie. The main actors will receive her at the airport, among them is Paul, a little-known mariachi that has been chosen to become a new idol. Automatically, both had bad relations and during filming many discussions happens. This arguments gives way to a deep love.', 'Pastora de los Reyes is a beautiful Spanish that goes to Mexico with a contract to film a movie. The main actors will receive her at the airport, among them is Paul, a little-known mariachi that has been chosen to become a new idol. Automatically, both had bad relations and during filming many discussions happens. This arguments gives way to a deep love.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bgqVOdqEDsFntQANN1lJ5SrWftH.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:103150'),
  ('1062355203784006350', 'Giulia', 2022, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Ciro De Caro', 'Rosa Palasciano, Ciro De Caro', 'Rosa Palasciano, Valerio Di Benedetto, Fabrizio Ciavoni, Cristian Di Sante, Leonardo Bocci, Lucia Batassa, Matteo Quinzi, Emma Nitti', null, 'Giulia is constantly torn between the need to feel at home and be loved and a wild desire for freedom. One day she finds herself homeless and begins, in her own crazy way, to seek shelter and her own place in the world. Between an illusory desire for motherhood and ways to make ends meet, she spends the hottest days of a torrid Roman summer surrounded by elusive characters with empty lives, yet pure and wonderful like her. In a limbo made up of nothing (and everything), Giulia understands that it is up to her to decide how to live, or not to live, her own life.', 'Giulia is constantly torn between the need to feel at home and be loved and a wild desire for freedom. One day she finds herself homeless and begins, in her own crazy way, to seek shelter and her own place in the world. Between an illusory desire for motherhood and ways to make ends meet, she spends the hottest days of a torrid Roman summer surrounded by elusive characters with empty lives, yet pure and wonderful like her. In a limbo made up of nothing (and everything), Giulia understands that it is up to her to decide how to live, or not to live, her own life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kxs0Stf3q22W18FkJ2ezC5NasnD.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:856389'),
  ('1141408009034425834', 'Giulia Doesn''t Date at Night', 2009, 'Drama, Romance', 'Giuseppe Piccioni, Chiara Polizzi, Sophie Chiarello', 'Giuseppe Piccioni, Federica Pontremoli', 'Valerio Mastandrea, Valeria Golino, Sonia Bergamasco, Antónia Lišková, Piera Degli Esposti, Domiziana Cardinali, Jacopo Domenicucci, Jacopo Maria Bicocchi', 'NR', 'Guido, an acclaimed writer, leads a seemingly perfect life with his wife and daughter, but his restless search for inspiration leads him into the arms of Giulia, a charming and mysterious swim instructor who''s hiding a secret.', 'Guido, an acclaimed writer, leads a seemingly perfect life with his wife and daughter, but his restless search for inspiration leads him into the arms of Giulia, a charming and mysterious swim instructor who''s hiding a secret.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kHngIetgZajxnB2Z4bI39A8Y4x.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:42679'),
  ('996714330170512573', 'Giulio Regeni: Tutto il male del mondo', 2026, 'Documentary', 'Simone Manetti, Gianluca Ceresoli', 'Matteo Billi, Emanuele Cava', 'Giulio Regeni, Claudio Regeni, Paola Deffendi, Alessandra Ballerini', null, 'The events related to the death of Giulio Regeni, kidnapped, tortured and killed in Egypt, with the reconstruction of his family and lawyer Alessandra Ballerini, showing the stages of the kidnapping, the torture and killing.', 'The events related to the death of Giulio Regeni, kidnapped, tortured and killed in Egypt, with the reconstruction of his family and lawyer Alessandra Ballerini, showing the stages of the kidnapping, the torture and killing.', 'https://images.plex.tv/photo?size=large-1280&url=https%3A%2F%2Fimage.tmdb.org%2Ft%2Fp%2Foriginal%2F5lnDD2sFErBF27j3NM5rSdhLXTI.jpg', 'plex:movie:giulio-regeni-tutto-il-male-del-mondo'),
  ('248297281004620569', 'Giuseppe in Warsaw', 1964, 'Romance, Comedy, War', 'Stanisław Lenartowicz, Zbigniew Kociuba, Marian Zietkiewicz', 'Jacek Wejroch', 'Antonio Cifariello, Elżbieta Czyżewska, Zbigniew Cybulski, Jarema Stępowski, Krystyna Borowicz, Aleksander Fogiel, Andrzej Gawroński, Zdzisław Maklakiewicz', null, 'The Italian soldier Giuseppe Santucci, on his way home from the Russian front has his machine gun stolen in Warsaw. Afraid of consequences, he stays in Warsaw and occupies a flat of the Polish girl Maria, whom he suspects of stealing weapon. Maria indeed is an active member of the Polish resistance, contrary to her brother, Staszek, a painter, who only wants a calm living. In a course of events Giuseppe falls in love and, along with Staszek, becomes a hero of the Polish resistance.', 'The Italian soldier Giuseppe Santucci, on his way home from the Russian front has his machine gun stolen in Warsaw. Afraid of consequences, he stays in Warsaw and occupies a flat of the Polish girl Maria, whom he suspects of stealing weapon. Maria indeed is an active member of the Polish resistance, contrary to her brother, Staszek, a painter, who only wants a calm living. In a course of events Giuseppe falls in love and, along with Staszek, becomes a hero of the Polish resistance.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/f1inVUsmSH3ubTYvq9vLLqPQ0ae.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:81507'),
