  ('1148943869605324950', 'Give ''em Hell, Malone', 2009, 'Crime, Action, Thriller', 'Russell Mulcahy, Jonathan Hall', 'Mark Hosack', 'Thomas Jane, Ving Rhames, Elsa Pataky, Doug Hutchison, Leland Orser, French Stewart, Gregory Harrison, Eileen Ryan', 'R', 'A tough as nails private investigator (Malone) squares off with gangsters and their thugs to protect a valuable secret. Malone goes through hell to protect the information but he dishes some hell as well...', 'A tough as nails private investigator (Malone) squares off with gangsters and their thugs to protect a valuable secret. Malone goes through hell to protect the information but he dishes some hell as well...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cs8U9er6RDr7dFsVVSPgQZbfEGU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:28019'),
  ('65259486358272259', 'Give a Girl a Break', 1953, 'Music, Comedy, Romance', 'Stanley Donen, William C. Mellor, Marvin Stuart', 'Albert Hackett, Frances Goodrich', 'Marge Champion, Gower Champion, Debbie Reynolds, Dolly Sharp, Bob Fosse, Kurt Kasznar, Richard Anderson, William Ching', null, 'When the temperamental star of a new Broadway musical revue in rehearsals walks out, director and choreographer Ted Sturgis suggests casting an unknown for the role. When it is announced in the newspapers, throngs of hopefuls show up. The revue''s musical composer, Leo Belney, champions ballerina Joanna Moss, while gofer Bob Dowdy is enchanted by novice Suzy Doolittle. Then producer Felix Jordan persuades Ted''s former dance partner, Madelyn Corlan, to come out of retirement to try out, much to Ted''s great discomfort.', 'When the temperamental star of a new Broadway musical revue in rehearsals walks out, director and choreographer Ted Sturgis suggests casting an unknown for the role. When it is announced in the newspapers, throngs of hopefuls show up. The revue''s musical composer, Leo Belney, champions ballerina Joanna Moss, while gofer Bob Dowdy is enchanted by novice Suzy Doolittle. Then producer Felix Jordan persuades Ted''s former dance partner, Madelyn Corlan, to come out of retirement to try out, much to Ted''s great discomfort.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4xMzYnvYRPP8zwG4H9qA4TGuW4e.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:114685'),
  ('18976092179828161', 'Give a Little Beat', 2024, 'Comedy, Family', 'Joseph Rapp, Melvin Nkosi, Julien Drean', 'Cécilia Rouaud, Laurence Arné', 'Laurence Arné, Dany Boon, Ferdinand Redouloux, Jehan Renard, Marie Lanchas, Yannick Choirat, Luna Ho Poumey, Jeanne Arènes', null, 'When her teenage son Henri threatens to move in with his father, Justine improvises a road trip along the Atlantic coast with her new partner Ludo and stepson Joseph, giving her family one last chance to unite.', 'When her teenage son Henri threatens to move in with his father, Justine improvises a road trip along the Atlantic coast with her new partner Ludo and stepson Joseph, giving her family one last chance to unite.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1CxOpcaxLqArSRR5OLrqfLkLNOK.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1130405'),
  ('315318149203663556', 'Give Her the Moon', 1970, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Philippe de Broca, Jean Penzer', 'Daniel Boulanger, Philippe de Broca', 'Bert Convy, Philippe Noiret, Valentina Cortese, Fernand Gravey, Jean-Pierre Marielle, François Périer, Didi Perego, Marthe Keller', 'G', 'Marie, a young provincial girl, is seduced by an American billionaire. She agrees to stay with him if he moves her village to New York.', 'Marie, a young provincial girl, is seduced by an American billionaire. She agrees to stay with him if he moves her village to New York.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zAmpPtECipibPQJYb8LEhsDuCoi.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:356858'),
  ('533344081959201070', 'Give It All', 1998, 'Drama', 'Itsumichi Isomura, Yuichi Nagata, 助監督', 'Itsumichi Isomura', 'Rena Tanaka, Mami Shimizu, Wakana Chizaki, Kirina Mano, Emu Hisazumi, Masatoshi Matsuo, Tomoko Nakajima, Hakuryu', null, 'Etsuko - a typical Japanese high school student, who''s unlucky in love, an academic failure, and plain bored with life. That''s until one day, the view of a boat gliding gracefully in the sea inspires her to take up the oar. Since she''s rejected by her school''s all-male rowing team, she decides to form her own all-women team. Nothing will ever be the same again.', 'Etsuko - a typical Japanese high school student, who''s unlucky in love, an academic failure, and plain bored with life. That''s until one day, the view of a boat gliding gracefully in the sea inspires her to take up the oar. Since she''s rejected by her school''s all-male rowing team, she decides to form her own all-women team. Nothing will ever be the same again.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tQkcrgYkTTVbSxfdHtUfXbP4mzb.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:184972'),
  ('251863459930137039', 'Give It Up', 2026, 'Comedy', 'Kyle Anderson, Luke Simmons', 'Gareth Reynolds, Kyle Anderson', 'Jake Johnson, Maggie Maye, Anna Lore, Catherine Reitman, Chelcie Lynn', 'R', 'When washed up stand-up comedian Mortimer Baldwin (Gareth Reynolds) is replaced on his popular podcast by a viral sensation 9-year-old, his manager (Jake Johnson) sends him out on a tour to reclaim his career and film his comeback comedy special - but what''s so funny?', 'When washed up stand-up comedian Mortimer Baldwin (Gareth Reynolds) is replaced on his popular podcast by a viral sensation 9-year-old, his manager (Jake Johnson) sends him out on a tour to reclaim his career and film his comeback comedy special - but what''s so funny?', 'https://images.plex.tv/photo?size=large-1280&url=https%3A%2F%2Fimage.tmdb.org%2Ft%2Fp%2Foriginal%2FzMRWq2V1ALc6vTdgNiY0GCP1UGN.jpg', 'plex:movie:give-it-up-2026'),
  ('1136302984002414914', 'Give Me a Complaints Book', 1964, 'Comedy', 'Eldar Ryazanov, Valeri Popov, Anatoliy Mukasey', 'Aleksandr Galich, Boris Laskin', 'Larisa Golubkina, Anatoliy Kuznetsov, Oleg Borisov, Anatoliy Papanov, Nikolay Kryuchkov, Rina Zelyonaya, Yuriy Nikulin, Georgiy Vitsin', null, 'A group of young motivated people are trying to convert old "Oduvanchik" restaurant in to a youth club.', 'A group of young motivated people are trying to convert old "Oduvanchik" restaurant in to a youth club.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/knX4pYN6nCiVD2IL7vsJHWOrI2i.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:66078'),
  ('342111604531902607', 'Give Me Back My Body!', 2026, 'Horror', 'Nick McCallum', 'Nick McCallum', 'Anna Mhairi, Derek Gary, Khara C., Krucial Katie, Ella Fraley', null, 'A paralyzed man and his caregiver use a drone for neighborhood surveillance, uncovering a murderer. They find a mysterious object that sends them to another dimension where they switch bodies and become pawns of a dark force.', 'A paralyzed man and his caregiver use a drone for neighborhood surveillance, uncovering a murderer. They find a mysterious object that sends them to another dimension where they switch bodies and become pawns of a dark force.', 'https://images.plex.tv/photo?size=large-1280&url=https%3A%2F%2Fmetadata-static.plex.tv%2Ff%2Fgracenote%2Ff97f68dadd661829adac8244e22f3c38.jpg', 'plex:movie:give-me-back-my-body'),
  ('797411741804121922', 'Give Me Five', 1980, 'Comedy', 'Pasquale Festa Campanile, Giancarlo Ferrando', 'Ottavio Jemma, Enrico Oldoini', 'Adriano Celentano, Enrico Montesano, Renzo Montagnani, Mario Carotenuto, Andrea Roncato, Gigi Sammarchi, Dino Emanuelli, Raffaele di Sipio', null, 'Two episodes: A roman coachman fulfills the dream of his life and meets the Pope. A priest crazy about dancing wins the first prize in a contest.', 'Two episodes: A roman coachman fulfills the dream of his life and meets the Pope. A priest crazy about dancing wins the first prize in a contest.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iodggeR671Kf15HLBZhIf3przuA.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:50195'),
  ('731380058288788036', 'Give Me Five', 2022, 'Comedy, Science Fiction, Romance, Drama', 'Zhang Luan', 'Tianyi Dong', 'Ma Li, Chang Yuan, Wei Xiang, Jia Bing, Huang Yuntong, Han Yanbo, Zhang Yiming, Hao Pengfei', null, 'Xiao Wu, who had been at odds with his father, Lao Wu, accidentally travels back in time to the 1980s. He prevents the first encounter between his parents in mainland China. In order to correct this mistake, he tries to return to the past again, to encourage his mother to chase his father. Do the parents meet and fall in love again despite Xiao Wu''s intervention?', 'Xiao Wu, who had been at odds with his father, Lao Wu, accidentally travels back in time to the 1980s. He prevents the first encounter between his parents in mainland China. In order to correct this mistake, he tries to return to the past again, to encourage his mother to chase his father. Do the parents meet and fall in love again despite Xiao Wu''s intervention?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/t6DGs6BJyDu56OCBhSHJeVuP388.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:945778'),
  ('958066294930014764', 'Give Me Liberty', 1936, 'Drama, History', 'B. Reeves Eason, W. Howard Greene', 'Forrest Barnes', 'John Litel, Nedda Harrigan, Carlyle Moore Jr., Robert Warwick, George Irving, Boyd Irwin, Gordon Hart, Myrtle Stedman', null, 'Patrick Henry''s rousing speech before the Virginia legislature argues for colonial independence.', 'Patrick Henry''s rousing speech before the Virginia legislature argues for colonial independence.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qpwafnNixYDlHJHnpQ2pUtTuzqC.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:233693'),
  ('643300341098340595', 'Give Me Liberty', 2019, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Kirill Mikhanovsky, Wyatt Garfield', 'Kirill Mikhanovsky, Alice Austen', 'Chris Galust, Lauren ''Lolo'' Spencer, Maksim Stoyanov, Darya Ekamasova, Steve Wolski, Michelle Caspar, Anna Maltova, Arkady Basin', null, 'When a riot breaks out in Milwaukee, America''s most segregated city, medical transport driver Vic is torn between his promise to get a group of elderly Russians to a funeral and his desire to help Tracy, a young black woman with ALS.', 'When a riot breaks out in Milwaukee, America''s most segregated city, medical transport driver Vic is torn between his promise to get a group of elderly Russians to a funeral and his desire to help Tracy, a young black woman with ALS.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dua9PHGjGE8dmnYyp6CyfFUbO0Y.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:565720'),
  ('439432377767572779', 'Give Me Your Hand', 2008, 'Drama', 'Pascal-Alex Vincent, Alexis Kavyrchine', 'Pascal-Alex Vincent, Martin Drouot', 'Victor Carril, Alexandre Carril, Anaïs Demoustier, Samir Harrag, Patrick Hauthier, Katrin Sass, Fernando Ramallo, Maya Borker', null, 'Quentin and Antoine are 18-year-old twins. Without their father knowing it, they set out on a voyage to Spain, where their mother''s funeral is to take place. The two brothers barely knew their mother. Their hitchhiking journey is full of encounters, arguments, reconciliations, and experiences. Their time on the road also reveals their differences, the splits in their attractions, and the confusion of their feelings.', 'Quentin and Antoine are 18-year-old twins. Without their father knowing it, they set out on a voyage to Spain, where their mother''s funeral is to take place. The two brothers barely knew their mother. Their hitchhiking journey is full of encounters, arguments, reconciliations, and experiences. Their time on the road also reveals their differences, the splits in their attractions, and the confusion of their feelings.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fBL3fM71XvzfYH3jCMS3aQXIbvb.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:40421'),
  ('461179216045268921', 'Give My Regards to Broad Street', 1984, 'Drama, Music, Mystery', 'Peter Webb, Ian McMillan, Simone Reynolds', 'Paul McCartney', 'Paul McCartney, Bryan Brown, Ringo Starr, Barbara Bach, Linda McCartney, Tracey Ullman, Ralph Richardson, John Burgess', 'PG', 'When the mastertape of McCartney''s latest album is misplaced, he must discover its whereabouts in less than 24 hours or else risk losing his recording company to the lowlife Mr. Rath.', 'When the mastertape of McCartney''s latest album is misplaced, he must discover its whereabouts in less than 24 hours or else risk losing his recording company to the lowlife Mr. Rath.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ecR5d9T1CpFNMtveQhXwzjt215i.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:34748'),
  ('478526839468311663', 'Give the Devil His Due', 1985, 'Family, Fantasy', 'Hynek Bočan, Jaromír Šofr, Jiří Růžička', 'Jiří Just, Hynek Bočan', 'Vladimír Dlouhý, Ondřej Vetchý, Jana Dítětová, František Vicena, Jaroslava Kretschmerová, Viktor Preiss, Karel Heřmánek, Josef Kemr', null, 'Dorota, a bad woman married the miller, out of sheer greed drives him to death. She then took the mill away from his son Peter and threw him out of the hime. Lucifer, who is known to rule in hell, sends out the devil Janek. He is supposed to fetch Dorota because the measure of her earthly sins is overflowing. But the devil himself can not handle this evil woman and flees to the military. There he meets Peter. By joining forces, they finally succeed in transporting the wicked Dorota to hell. Since then hell is hell. But for Peter, who is suddenly in possession of a magic mantle, begins a nice time, because strangely, the prince shows great interest in him.', 'Dorota, a bad woman married the miller, out of sheer greed drives him to death. She then took the mill away from his son Peter and threw him out of the hime. Lucifer, who is known to rule in hell, sends out the devil Janek. He is supposed to fetch Dorota because the measure of her earthly sins is overflowing. But the devil himself can not handle this evil woman and flees to the military. There he meets Peter. By joining forces, they finally succeed in transporting the wicked Dorota to hell. Since then hell is hell. But for Peter, who is suddenly in possession of a magic mantle, begins a nice time, because strangely, the prince shows great interest in him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8whFlQxAaVWqvCHtqAIhAzgKFwc.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:54333'),
  ('20203362948873720', 'Give Us This Day', 1949, 'Drama', 'Edward Dmytryk, C.M. Pennington-Richards, George Mills', 'Ben Barzman', 'Sam Wanamaker, Lea Padovani, Kathleen Ryan, Charles Goldner, Bonar Colleano, William Sylvester, George Pastell, Philo Hauser', null, 'Exiled from Hollywood due to the blacklist, director Edward Dmytryk briefly operated in England in the late 1940s. Though filmed in its entirety in London, Dmytryk''s Give Us This Day is set in New York during the depression. Fellow blacklistee Sam Wanamaker is starred as the head of an Italian immigrant family struggling to survive the economic crisis.', 'Exiled from Hollywood due to the blacklist, director Edward Dmytryk briefly operated in England in the late 1940s. Though filmed in its entirety in London, Dmytryk''s Give Us This Day is set in New York during the depression. Fellow blacklistee Sam Wanamaker is starred as the head of an Italian immigrant family struggling to survive the economic crisis.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gf5ga58MsYAhQXnhfCSGalgBBTh.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:92819'),
  ('567864347678320038', 'Given', 2020, 'Animation, Drama, Music, Romance', 'Naoki Serizawa, Haruna Nagata, Nanako Ninomiya', 'Yuniko Ayana', 'Takuya Eguchi, Masatomo Nakazawa, Shogo Yano, Yuma Uchida, Shintaro Asanuma', null, 'Haruki secretly had feelings for Akihiko for years, but Akihiko was still in a relationship with his roommate, the violinist Ugetsu Murata. Haruki, Akihiko, and Ugetsu''s love clashes and starts to move forward.', 'Haruki secretly had feelings for Akihiko for years, but Akihiko was still in a relationship with his roommate, the violinist Ugetsu Murata. Haruki, Akihiko, and Ugetsu''s love clashes and starts to move forward.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pegCub2zdYD5As43AOmGsIctuKc.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:632632'),
