  ('1130969629030081970', 'given the Movie: To the Sea', 2024, 'Animation, Romance', 'Noriko Hashimoto, Kouji Yamagata, Haruna Nagata', 'Yuniko Ayana', 'Shogo Yano, Yuma Uchida, Masatomo Nakazawa, Takuya Eguchi, Fumiya Imai, Taito Ban, Shintaro Asanuma', 'NR', 'Mafuyu doubts his place in the band, but a familiar face could be the spark that brings him back to the stage.', 'Mafuyu doubts his place in the band, but a familiar face could be the spark that brings him back to the stage.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2VLnT5JtJ77ErG6GD3c1J628VLp.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1317276'),
  ('701942043680088912', 'Giving It Up', 1999, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Christopher Kublan, Leland Krane', 'Christopher Kublan', 'Mark Feuerstein, Amy Redford, Dabney Coleman, Ben Weber, James Toback, Timothi-Jane Graham, Ali Larter, James Lesure', null, 'A womanizing New York adman attempts to identify the causes of, and find a remedy for, his so-called addiction to sex, in order to win the love of a woman he respects.', 'A womanizing New York adman attempts to identify the causes of, and find a remedy for, his so-called addiction to sex, in order to win the love of a woman he respects.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/keSv9MzN8DcWHruzBoYlmWraiy7.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:47893'),
  ('454719048031789753', 'Giving Voice', 2020, 'Documentary', 'James D. Stern, Fernando Villena', null, 'Denzel Washington, Viola Davis, Stephen McKinley Henderson, Gerardo Navarro, Derrick Sanders, Hailey Kilgore', 'PG-13', 'Every year, thousands of high schoolers enter the August Wilson monologue competition for a chance to perform on Broadway. This film follows these students, examining how Wilson and his characters speak to a new generation, inspiring them to listen to his words and find their own voice.', 'Every year, thousands of high schoolers enter the August Wilson monologue competition for a chance to perform on Broadway. This film follows these students, examining how Wilson and his characters speak to a new generation, inspiring them to listen to his words and find their own voice.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2qlQceN0IrqXXEIcFCcpm6B3jQb.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:653747'),
  ('840611240249301014', 'Gizmo!', 1977, 'Documentary, Comedy', 'Howard Smith', null, 'Milt Moss', null, 'A documentary about some of the thousands of inventions that did things we never thought needed doing, or in ways we never considered doing them. A respectful, yet humorous tribute to the inventors whose vision, however far-reaching, was just a little off the mark.', 'A documentary about some of the thousands of inventions that did things we never thought needed doing, or in ways we never considered doing them. A respectful, yet humorous tribute to the inventors whose vision, however far-reaching, was just a little off the mark.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9kxOr1p9NN6FMuEotx3iTYmTnWC.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:57954'),
  ('256324144810994115', 'Gırgıriye', 1981, 'Comedy', 'Kartal Tibet, Muzaffer Hiçdurmaz, Nezih Tunar', 'Sadık Şendil', 'Gülşen Bubikoğlu, Müjdat Gezen, Perran Kutman, Münir Özkul, Adile Naşit, Ayşen Gruda, Sümer Tilmaç, Şemsi İnkaya', null, 'A bear-leading gypsy from the slums struggles to get back his sweetheart who works for a pavilion runner in the city, until she feels a wistful longing for where she thinks she is belong to and turns recalcitrant against the pavilion runner.', 'A bear-leading gypsy from the slums struggles to get back his sweetheart who works for a pavilion runner in the city, until she feels a wistful longing for where she thinks she is belong to and turns recalcitrant against the pavilion runner.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ei05DaYZ0aBAHDBnea9nq5Eofcv.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:248750'),
