  ('803024883051026823', 'Gladbeck: The Hostage Crisis', 2022, 'Documentary', 'Volker Heise', null, 'Hans-Jürgen Rösner, Dieter Degowski, Marion Löblich, Silke Bischoff, Ines Falk, Emanuele de Giorgi, Peter Meyer, Udo Röbel', null, 'In August 1988, two armed bank robbers keep German police at bay for 54 hours during a hostage-taking drama that ends in a shootout and three deaths.', 'In August 1988, two armed bank robbers keep German police at bay for 54 hours during a hostage-taking drama that ends in a shootout and three deaths.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3gQVzkLd8GxqNVG5t5CkQEvMDnD.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:975923'),
  ('896379076270120411', 'Gladiator', 1992, 'Drama', 'Rowdy Herrington, Tak Fujimoto', 'Robert Mark Kamen, Lyle Kessler', 'James Marshall, T.E. Russell, Cuba Gooding Jr., Robert Loggia, Brian Dennehy, Ossie Davis, Cara Buono, Richard Lexsee', 'R', 'Tommy Riley has moved with his dad to Chicago from a ''nice place''. He keeps to himself, goes to school. However, after a street fight, he''s noticed and quickly falls into the world of illegal underground boxing — where punches can kill.', 'Tommy Riley has moved with his dad to Chicago from a ''nice place''. He keeps to himself, goes to school. However, after a street fight, he''s noticed and quickly falls into the world of illegal underground boxing — where punches can kill.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/w0YjBWVfu689txEXZG3xa4Aev3i.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:16219'),
  ('433253822905201785', 'Gladiator', 2000, 'Action, Drama, Adventure', 'Ridley Scott, Terry Needham, Alexander Witt', 'David Franzoni, William Nicholson, John Logan', 'Russell Crowe, Joaquin Phoenix, Connie Nielsen, Oliver Reed, Richard Harris, Derek Jacobi, Djimon Hounsou, David Schofield', 'R', 'After the death of Emperor Marcus Aurelius, his devious son takes power and demotes Maximus, one of Rome''s most capable generals who Marcus preferred. Eventually, Maximus is forced to become a gladiator and battle to the death against other men for the amusement of paying audiences.', 'After the death of Emperor Marcus Aurelius, his devious son takes power and demotes Maximus, one of Rome''s most capable generals who Marcus preferred. Eventually, Maximus is forced to become a gladiator and battle to the death against other men for the amusement of paying audiences.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wN2xWp1eIwCKOD0BHTcErTBv1Uq.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:98'),
  ('1077861585817502277', 'Gladiator Cop', 1995, 'Action, Adventure, Fantasy', 'Nick Rotundo, Edgar Egger', 'Nick Rotundo, Paco Alvarez, Nicolas Stiliadis', 'Lorenzo Lamas, George Touliatos, Nicholas Pasco, Christopher Lee Clements, James Hong, Claire Stansfield, Frank Anderson, Eugene Clark', 'R', 'Andrew Garret is a cop trying to reveal the background of secret killing fights named "Game". He takes part in the fights under the nickname Gladiator. One of the Game bosses, Parmenion, wants him to fight with the ancient sword that once belonged to Alexander the Great against his own fighter Mongol to recall the 2000 years old duel between Alexander and his enemy whose re-incarnations he believes to be Andrew Garrett and himself.', 'Andrew Garret is a cop trying to reveal the background of secret killing fights named "Game". He takes part in the fights under the nickname Gladiator. One of the Game bosses, Parmenion, wants him to fight with the ancient sword that once belonged to Alexander the Great against his own fighter Mongol to recall the 2000 years old duel between Alexander and his enemy whose re-incarnations he believes to be Andrew Garrett and himself.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dNwgcU6tFYIbR0R1MelvakTxDRJ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:65293'),
  ('595345219224150453', 'Gladiator II', 2024, 'Action, Adventure, Drama', 'John Mathieson, Sara Taddei, Conor Feltham', 'David Scarpa', 'Paul Mescal, Denzel Washington, Pedro Pascal, Connie Nielsen, Joseph Quinn, Fred Hechinger, Lior Raz, Derek Jacobi', 'R', 'Years after witnessing the death of the revered hero Maximus at the hands of his uncle, Lucius is forced to enter the Colosseum after his home is conquered by the tyrannical Emperors who now lead Rome with an iron fist. With rage in his heart and the future of the Empire at stake, Lucius must look to his past to find strength and honor to return the glory of Rome to its people.', 'Years after witnessing the death of the revered hero Maximus at the hands of his uncle, Lucius is forced to enter the Colosseum after his home is conquered by the tyrannical Emperors who now lead Rome with an iron fist. With rage in his heart and the future of the Empire at stake, Lucius must look to his past to find strength and honor to return the glory of Rome to its people.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2cxhvwyEwRlysAmRH4iodkvo0z5.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:558449'),
  ('56199869841530820', 'Gladiator of Rome', 1962, 'Adventure, History', 'Mario Costa', 'Gian Paolo Callegari, Giuseppe Mariani', 'Gordon Scott, Wandisa Guida, Roberto Risso, Eleonora Vargas, Ombretta Colli, Alberto Farnese, Charles Borromel, Gianni Solaro', null, 'A warrior protecting a slave girl, who is really a princess, winds up as a gladiator in the Roman arenas.', 'A warrior protecting a slave girl, who is really a princess, winds up as a gladiator in the Roman arenas.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bnYYCgn7hBtV6Xq4PF8GttGMvI3.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:158093'),
  ('648023987097195462', 'Gladiator Underground', 2025, 'Action', 'Chaya Supannarat', 'Ariel Bleiberg', 'D.Y. Sao, Andy Le, Brian Le, Apasiri Kulthanan, Craig Ng, Selina Wiesmann, Geoffrey Giuliano, Bear Williams', null, 'Two brothers compete in the world''s deadliest underground fighting tournament, where they must decide whether to play by the rules or to cast their honor aside and team up to bring down the dark syndicate running the tournament.', 'Two brothers compete in the world''s deadliest underground fighting tournament, where they must decide whether to play by the rules or to cast their honor aside and team up to bring down the dark syndicate running the tournament.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qLN16AeIjS5P5Kk5B6pBi1Mh1mi.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1499984'),
  ('482648314690694112', 'Gladiators of Rome', 2012, 'Animation, Family', 'Iginio Straffi, Gianmario Catania', 'Iginio Straffi', 'Luca Argentero, Laura Chiatti, Belén Rodríguez, Massimo Corvo, Fabrizio De Flaviis, Enzo Avolio, Michele Cucuzza, Francesco Vairano', 'PG', 'A new hero is born in this hilarious, animated adventure of epic proportions! Timo, a student at the Gladiators? Academy in Rome, has no desire to become a legendary gladiator like his stepfather. That is, until the mesmerizing Lucilla walks into his life. With the help of an unlikely band of sidekicks, Timo is determined to be the gladiator of her dreams and embarks on an action-packed journey to become the Colosseum?s first victor!', 'A new hero is born in this hilarious, animated adventure of epic proportions! Timo, a student at the Gladiators? Academy in Rome, has no desire to become a legendary gladiator like his stepfather. That is, until the mesmerizing Lucilla walks into his life. With the help of an unlikely band of sidekicks, Timo is determined to be the gladiator of her dreams and embarks on an action-packed journey to become the Colosseum?s first victor!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9Qyx97TwsPQ1uR82wwQ2dzY0wOU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:137548'),
  ('398522089032943058', 'Gladiatress', 2004, 'Comedy, Adventure, Action', 'Brian Grant, Witold Stok', 'Nick Whitby', 'Doon Mackichan, Fiona Allen, Sally Phillips, David Hayman, Ronan Vibert, Pam Ferris, Rory MacGregor, Philippe De Grossouvre', null, 'Three unlikely heroines set out to thwart a Roman invasion and save Celtic Britain in their own unique and outrageous style.', 'Three unlikely heroines set out to thwart a Roman invasion and save Celtic Britain in their own unique and outrageous style.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mbiaH8jDBaHJrpkTiKOd9GGmqoD.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:20125'),
  ('413169762351633051', 'Glass', 1958, 'Documentary', 'Bert Haanstra, Wim van der Velde', 'Bert Haanstra', null, null, 'This short documentary, shot in the glass factories of Leerdam and Schiedam, demonstrates how glass blowers do their work. But thanks to the superbly edited ballet of working hands and the sequence of mechanical motions of the engines, is it especially a cinematic tour de force. That the industry can’t do without man’s involvement is shown in the scene where we hear the voice of Haanstra himself counting the bottles on the conveyor belt, until one bottle breaks…', 'This short documentary, shot in the glass factories of Leerdam and Schiedam, demonstrates how glass blowers do their work. But thanks to the superbly edited ballet of working hands and the sequence of mechanical motions of the engines, is it especially a cinematic tour de force. That the industry can’t do without man’s involvement is shown in the scene where we hear the voice of Haanstra himself counting the bottles on the conveyor belt, until one bottle breaks…', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ArjmYTCwJLZr4hxTDal0sSrlnrX.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:52779'),
  ('252886337782739601', 'Glass', 2019, 'Thriller, Drama, Science Fiction', 'Alison C. Rosa, John Rusk, Blair Howley', 'M. Night Shyamalan', 'James McAvoy, Bruce Willis, Samuel L. Jackson, Sarah Paulson, Anya Taylor-Joy, Spencer Treat Clark, Charlayne Woodard, Luke Kirby', 'PG-13', 'In a series of escalating encounters, former security guard David Dunn uses his supernatural abilities to track Kevin Wendell Crumb, a disturbed man who has twenty-four personalities. Meanwhile, the shadowy presence of Elijah Price emerges as an orchestrator who holds secrets critical to both men.', 'In a series of escalating encounters, former security guard David Dunn uses his supernatural abilities to track Kevin Wendell Crumb, a disturbed man who has twenty-four personalities. Meanwhile, the shadowy presence of Elijah Price emerges as an orchestrator who holds secrets critical to both men.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/svIDTNUoajS8dLEo7EosxvyAsgJ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:450465'),
  ('595539032483894090', 'Glass House: The Good Mother', 2006, 'Drama, Thriller', 'Steve Antin, Bobby Bukowski', 'Brett Merryman', 'Angie Harmon, Joel Gretsch, Jordan Danger, Bobby Coleman, Jason London, Tasha Smith', 'R', 'One year after losing their son David, Eve Goode and her husband Raymond Goode adopt the orphan Ethan Snow (and his teenager sister Abby Snow and bring them to their mansion nearby a lake. Abby faces difficulties of adaptation in her new home, and she confronts Eve, who proves to be deranged and unstable. When Ethan gets sick, Abby tries to contact their friend, detective Ben Koch, and she realizes that her brother and she are trapped in the house.', 'One year after losing their son David, Eve Goode and her husband Raymond Goode adopt the orphan Ethan Snow (and his teenager sister Abby Snow and bring them to their mansion nearby a lake. Abby faces difficulties of adaptation in her new home, and she confronts Eve, who proves to be deranged and unstable. When Ethan gets sick, Abby tries to contact their friend, detective Ben Koch, and she realizes that her brother and she are trapped in the house.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1ZSXkO2c9y7G9EV5HYuqR5wqJwf.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:57784'),
  ('258020800456297571', 'Glass Houses', 2020, 'Thriller, TV Movie', 'Sarah Pellerin, Daniel Villeneuve', 'Barbara Kymlicka', 'Bree Turner, Aviva Mongillo, Steve Byers, Zoie Palmer, Kira Guloien, Amalia Williamson, Alexandre Dubois', null, 'Teenage babysitter Carrie Dawson has a chip on her shoulder on the heels of a humiliating family scandal. When she finds out that neighborhood Queen Bee Madeline Cooper may be to blame, she is determined to exact revenge - even if it means discovering and exposing Madeline''s own scandalous secret. As Carrie gets closer to the truth, will Madeline''s world come tumbling down?', 'Teenage babysitter Carrie Dawson has a chip on her shoulder on the heels of a humiliating family scandal. When she finds out that neighborhood Queen Bee Madeline Cooper may be to blame, she is determined to exact revenge - even if it means discovering and exposing Madeline''s own scandalous secret. As Carrie gets closer to the truth, will Madeline''s world come tumbling down?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5fZGWJjStklNAbYfqrinkj9cv0G.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:663124'),
  ('705407184940246301', 'Glass Tiger', 2001, 'Comedy', 'Péter Rudolf, Iván Kapitány', 'Gábor Olivér Buss', 'Péter Rudolf, Gábor Reviczky, Sándor Gáspár, József Szarvas, Lajos Ottó Horváth, Enikő Börcsök, Roland Selmeczi, Árpád Besenczi', null, 'This film tells the story of a few uneventful days in the life of six pals. Lali, a great fan of America, owns a sandwich stand on the side of the road, called The Glass Tiger. Gaben pinches cars; Fox is a petty swindler; Sanyi a half-wit homeless; Coco can''t shut up about getting some dough and going to America; Slimmy keeps playing the saxophone, despite the others'' frayed nerves. Gaben talks Lali into buying an old Chevrolet Impala, the real American dream. After the long escapade of getting the car, Lali doesn''t even get the chance to try the Chevvy out, because a truck completely demolishes it. Fox in the meantime is looking excitedly for the "Wreck", what he has been trying to sell for big money. But Lali has sold what he thought to be scrap, not good for anything. Fox is threatened by some tough guys to bring it back or pay up. He has to get money at all costs...', 'This film tells the story of a few uneventful days in the life of six pals. Lali, a great fan of America, owns a sandwich stand on the side of the road, called The Glass Tiger. Gaben pinches cars; Fox is a petty swindler; Sanyi a half-wit homeless; Coco can''t shut up about getting some dough and going to America; Slimmy keeps playing the saxophone, despite the others'' frayed nerves. Gaben talks Lali into buying an old Chevrolet Impala, the real American dream. After the long escapade of getting the car, Lali doesn''t even get the chance to try the Chevvy out, because a truck completely demolishes it. Fox in the meantime is looking excitedly for the "Wreck", what he has been trying to sell for big money. But Lali has sold what he thought to be scrap, not good for anything. Fox is threatened by some tough guys to bring it back or pay up. He has to get money at all costs...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tBSZcB63mGsnrEJ5y9uwPw0p8tz.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:22974'),
  ('822470018394646154', 'Glass Tiger 2', 2006, 'Comedy', 'Péter Rudolf, János Vecsernyés', 'Gábor Olivér Buss, Péter Rudolf', 'Péter Rudolf, Imre Csuja, Gábor Reviczky, Sándor Gáspár, József Szarvas, Lajos Ottó Horváth, Gyula Bodrogi, Juli Básti', null, 'In the sequel to the surprise hit Üvegtigris (2001), we witness the 6 losers again as they run amok around the roadside buffet, which again fails to make their dreams come true, but which serves as the basis and end station of numerous funny adventures.', 'In the sequel to the surprise hit Üvegtigris (2001), we witness the 6 losers again as they run amok around the roadside buffet, which again fails to make their dreams come true, but which serves as the basis and end station of numerous funny adventures.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xr4hnuPETl196ZscjMW5FqI8UUY.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:36558'),
  ('35724007379772909', 'Glassboy', 2020, 'Drama, Adventure', 'Samuele Rossi, Ariel Salati', 'Jean-Claude Van Rijckeghem, Josella Porto, Rolando Colla', 'Andrea Arru, Rosa Barbolini, Mia Pomelari, Loretta Goggi, Giorgio Colangeli, Giorgia Würth, Massimo Di Lorenzo, David Paryla', null, 'Pino Gambassi is a child suffering from haemophilia and is animated by an unbridled desire for freedom and boundless courage: he decides to start his adventure in the world and to show everyone that he can live his life like a normal kid.', 'Pino Gambassi is a child suffering from haemophilia and is animated by an unbridled desire for freedom and boundless courage: he decides to start his adventure in the world and to show everyone that he can live his life like a normal kid.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xaXZJTPSTi2NVRbMRppgp8cFyPP.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:706530'),
  ('251006261038271222', 'Glasses', 2007, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Naoko Ogigami, Noboru Tanimine', 'Naoko Ogigami', 'Satomi Kobayashi, Mikako Ichikawa, Ryo Kase, Ken Mitsuishi, Masako Motai, Hiroko Yakushimaru, Ken', null, 'An overworked career woman leaves her life in the city for an island vacation only to encounter eccentric local inhabitants.', 'An overworked career woman leaves her life in the city for an island vacation only to encounter eccentric local inhabitants.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/m1SyPPx9gvHFLNKZbad1VqohyW0.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:25656'),
  ('559838121035039144', 'Glasshouse', 2021, 'Thriller, Science Fiction, Drama', 'Kelsey Egan', 'Kelsey Egan, Emma Lungiswa De Wet', 'Jessica Alexander, Adrienne Pearce, Hilton Pelser, Anja Taljaard, Brent Vermeulen, Kitty Harris, Robert Haxton, Morgan James Bosman', null, 'A mother and her three daughters — romantic Bee, sensible Evie, and child of nature Daisy — occupy the titular glass building, which has been completely sealed off to protect its occupants from a dementia-inducing toxin called the Shred that’s poisoning the air outside. Fearful of becoming like the lost souls who wander the abyss outside, the family keep a grasp on their past by performing sacred rituals. When Bee breaks the rules and lets an injured stranger into their midst, the family dynamic is shattered forever, as hidden truths upend the illusions the women have worked so hard to protect.', 'A mother and her three daughters — romantic Bee, sensible Evie, and child of nature Daisy — occupy the titular glass building, which has been completely sealed off to protect its occupants from a dementia-inducing toxin called the Shred that’s poisoning the air outside. Fearful of becoming like the lost souls who wander the abyss outside, the family keep a grasp on their past by performing sacred rituals. When Bee breaks the rules and lets an injured stranger into their midst, the family dynamic is shattered forever, as hidden truths upend the illusions the women have worked so hard to protect.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2HFLUZ0LWKDQa4xiUnjeM9ZKa0q.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:852858'),
  ('429745776940367468', 'Glassy Ocean', 1998, 'Animation, Fantasy', 'Shigeru Tamura', 'Shigeru Tamura', 'Eric Jacobsen, Hiroyuki Aoki, Ichiro Nagai, Kento Ogasawara, Masaharu Sato, Masatoshi Nagase, Masayuki Terashima, Noboru Mitani', null, 'On what apparently is a parallel world, time flows in a much slower pace than normal. The ocean remains on a solid state of matter as the eccentric individuals who inhabit this land casually wander over it.', 'On what apparently is a parallel world, time flows in a much slower pace than normal. The ocean remains on a solid state of matter as the eccentric individuals who inhabit this land casually wander over it.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/daOXAbYF2WA8i4TFvGV814x7B4s.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:72696'),
  ('23113103823435506', 'Glaze of Cathexis', 1990, null, 'Stan Brakhage', null, null, null, 'This hand-painted work is easily the most minutely detailed ever given to me to do, for it traces (as best I''m able) the hypnagogic after-effect of psychological cathexis as designed by Freud in his first (and unfinished) book on the subject - "Toward a Scientific Psychology." (SB)', 'This hand-painted work is easily the most minutely detailed ever given to me to do, for it traces (as best I''m able) the hypnagogic after-effect of psychological cathexis as designed by Freud in his first (and unfinished) book on the subject - "Toward a Scientific Psychology." (SB)', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mnrvgft9H4iBD1J1SFKd25S550P.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:104407'),
  ('87856130579995054', 'Gleaming the Cube', 1989, 'Crime, Thriller, Action', 'Graeme Clifford, Reed Smoot, Dennis M. White', 'Michael Tolkin', 'Christian Slater, Steven Bauer, Richard Herd, Ed Lauter, Le Tuan, Peter Kwong, Charles Cyphers, Micole Mercurio', 'PG-13', 'An Orange County teenager''s carefree life of ditching class and skateboarding abandoned pools comes to a screeching halt when someone close to him dies. The cops rule the death a suicide, but the bereaved skater believes he was murdered. It''s up to him to solve the case, with a skateboard.', 'An Orange County teenager''s carefree life of ditching class and skateboarding abandoned pools comes to a screeching halt when someone close to him dies. The cops rule the death a suicide, but the bereaved skater believes he was murdered. It''s up to him to solve the case, with a skateboard.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dpwbqnG2vmkwBBIpfQmFUf5l120.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1380'),
  ('1151597457753859783', 'Gleason', 2016, 'Documentary', 'J. Clay Tweel', 'J. Clay Tweel', 'Steve Gleason, Michel Gleason, Rivers Gleason, Paul Varisco, Blair Casey, Scott Fujita, Drew Brees, Eddie Vedder', 'R', 'At the age of 34, former New Orleans Saints defensive back Steve Gleason was diagnosed with ALS and given a life expectancy of two to five years. Weeks later, Gleason found out his wife, Michel, was expecting their first child. A video journal that began as a gift for his unborn son expands to chronicle Steve’s determination to get his relationships in order, build a foundation to provide other ALS patients with purpose, and adapt to his declining physical condition—utilizing medical technologies that offer the means to live as fully as possible.', 'At the age of 34, former New Orleans Saints defensive back Steve Gleason was diagnosed with ALS and given a life expectancy of two to five years. Weeks later, Gleason found out his wife, Michel, was expecting their first child. A video journal that began as a gift for his unborn son expands to chronicle Steve’s determination to get his relationships in order, build a foundation to provide other ALS patients with purpose, and adapt to his declining physical condition—utilizing medical technologies that offer the means to live as fully as possible.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eyVQ501jW3PuzVPLXzkoj14eEWU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:373446'),
  ('1200083311400921', 'Glee: The Concert Movie', 2011, 'Music, Documentary, Family', 'Glen MacPherson, Kevin Tancharoen, Justin Talley', 'Ian Brennan, Ryan Murphy, Brad Falchuk', 'Lea Michele, Cory Monteith, Dianna Agron, Chris Colfer, Darren Criss, Naya Rivera, Heather Morris, Mark Salling', 'PG', 'A concert documentary shot during the Glee Live! In Concert! summer 2011 tour, featuring song performances and fans'' life stories and how the show influenced them.', 'A concert documentary shot during the Glee Live! In Concert! summer 2011 tour, featuring song performances and fans'' life stories and how the show influenced them.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/y5NCu183zREb4XmHSB6QP3K7TH2.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:67675'),
  ('788850180839567429', 'Glen and Randa', 1971, 'Adventure, Science Fiction', 'Jim McBride, Alan Raymond', 'Lorenzo Mans, Rudy Wurlitzer, Jim McBride', 'Steve Curry, Shelley Plimpton, Woody Chambliss, Garry Goodrow', 'R', 'Teenagers Glen and Randa are members of a tribe that lives in a rural area, several decades after nuclear war has devastated the planet. They know nothing of the outside world, except that Glen has read about and seen pictures of a great city in some old comic books. He and Randa set out to find this city.', 'Teenagers Glen and Randa are members of a tribe that lives in a rural area, several decades after nuclear war has devastated the planet. They know nothing of the outside world, except that Glen has read about and seen pictures of a great city in some old comic books. He and Randa set out to find this city.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/66hppx8GF756ijGVzUvPwdoOS13.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:42494'),
  ('1103956261594514253', 'Glen or Glenda', 1953, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Edward D. Wood Jr., William C. Thompson', 'Edward D. Wood Jr.', 'Bela Lugosi, Edward D. Wood Jr., Lyle Talbot, Timothy Farrell, Dolores Fuller, ''Tommy'' Haynes, Charlie Crafts, Conrad Brooks', null, 'A psychiatrist tells two stories: one of a trans woman, the other of a pseudohermaphrodite.', 'A psychiatrist tells two stories: one of a trans woman, the other of a pseudohermaphrodite.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uZir2hA6VOmVNS6JdKb6RiYghTA.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:24018'),
  ('1062420909418772437', 'Glengarry Glen Ross', 1992, 'Crime, Drama, Mystery', 'James Foley, Juan Ruiz Anchía, Thomas A. Reilly', 'David Mamet', 'Al Pacino, Jack Lemmon, Alec Baldwin, Alan Arkin, Ed Harris, Kevin Spacey, Jonathan Pryce, Bruce Altman', 'R', 'Times are tough at Premiere Properties. Shelley "the machine" Levene and Dave Moss are veteran salesmen, but only Ricky Roma is on a hot streak. The new Glengarry sales leads could turn everything around, but the front office is holding them back until these "losers" prove themselves. Then someone decides to take matters into his own hands, stealing the Glengarry leads and leaving everyone wondering who did it.', 'Times are tough at Premiere Properties. Shelley "the machine" Levene and Dave Moss are veteran salesmen, but only Ricky Roma is on a hot streak. The new Glengarry sales leads could turn everything around, but the front office is holding them back until these "losers" prove themselves. Then someone decides to take matters into his own hands, stealing the Glengarry leads and leaving everyone wondering who did it.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zcaEDx8KlVfh4vKfMNLhiSi5Oz4.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:9504'),
  ('948110462556450258', 'Glens Falls Sequence', 1946, 'Animation', 'Douglass Crockwell', null, null, null, 'Starting in the late 1930s, illustrator and experimental animator Douglass Crockwell created a series of short abstract animated films at his home in Glen Falls, New York. The films offered Crockwell a chance to experiment with various unorthodox animation techniques such as adding and removing non-drying paint on glass frame-by-frame, squeezing paint between two sheets of glass, and finger painting. The individual films created over a nine-year period were then stitched together for presentation, forming a nonsensical relationship that only highlights the abstract qualities of the images. —Kansas City Electronic Music and Arts Alliance', 'Starting in the late 1930s, illustrator and experimental animator Douglass Crockwell created a series of short abstract animated films at his home in Glen Falls, New York. The films offered Crockwell a chance to experiment with various unorthodox animation techniques such as adding and removing non-drying paint on glass frame-by-frame, squeezing paint between two sheets of glass, and finger painting. The individual films created over a nine-year period were then stitched together for presentation, forming a nonsensical relationship that only highlights the abstract qualities of the images. —Kansas City Electronic Music and Arts Alliance', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fC5o94PWfhFApZo11losMHedBhp.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:209708'),
  ('549509355023457554', 'Gli Animotosi nella terra di Nondove', 2005, 'Animation', 'Alessandro Belli', null, 'Domitilla D''Amico, Alessio De Filippis, Marco Vivio, Monica Ward, Mirko Mazzanti, Ilaria Latini, Michele Kalamera, Anna Melato', null, 'For his birthday, Fofì gives his brother Dedo a mysterious slot car, which has only one rule to follow.', 'For his birthday, Fofì gives his brother Dedo a mysterious slot car, which has only one rule to follow.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/n23IREuZ7GDCuujnpRKXdjn3SCR.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:542687'),
