  ('635277668042165221', 'Gli onorevoli', 1963, 'Comedy', 'Sergio Corbucci, Enzo Barboni, Ruggero Deodato', 'Giovanni Grimaldi, Bruno Corbucci, Renato Mainardi', 'Totò, Franca Valeri, Peppino De Filippo, Gino Cervi, Walter Chiari, Franco Fabrizi, Aroldo Tieri, Riccardo Billi', null, 'Some political candidates are determined to win the electors'' preference during an election campaign in Italy.', 'Some political candidates are determined to win the electors'' preference during an election campaign in Italy.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wyQDXOnIMV8VG3Ob31pLx3RfloX.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:64946'),
  ('641661897980085214', 'Gli ospiti', 2023, 'Comedy, Mystery', 'Svevo Moltrasio, Jheison Garcia', 'Svevo Moltrasio', 'Svevo Moltrasio, Simona Di Bella, Leonardo Bocci, Chiara Tomei, Quentin Darmon, Federico Iarlori, Federico Lima Roque, Paola Moscelli', null, 'In a cottage on the outskirts of Rome a group of people are guests for dinner at the owner’s house. Which of them is not the intruder?', 'In a cottage on the outskirts of Rome a group of people are guests for dinner at the owner’s house. Which of them is not the intruder?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rYvNZguPyNPvD2PSakBPEpQZ6cX.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1138915'),
  ('1149270230328461041', 'Gli Smile and Go e il braciere bifuoco', 2007, 'Animation', 'Cristina Lo Giudice, Maurizio Forestieri', null, 'Dario Penne, Domitilla D''Amico, Perla Liberatori, Daniele Raffaeli, Davide Perino, Monica Ward, Ilaria Latini, Monica Bertolotti', null, 'A group of kids tries to reach the Bifuoco Brazier before it runs out of fuel. During this race against time, they encounter some lightning-fast animals with whom they befriend and will never be separated again: they are the Smile and Go.', 'A group of kids tries to reach the Bifuoco Brazier before it runs out of fuel. During this race against time, they encounter some lightning-fast animals with whom they befriend and will never be separated again: they are the Smile and Go.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2UPbsbI4lOz8aWwQuXOE8tZgHyX.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:503056'),
  ('446961919780750595', 'Gliitch', 2023, 'Horror', 'Hugo König', 'Hugo König', 'Mariel-Louise Compain, Ania Klobukowska, Fred Villabruna, Clarence Cassard, Lila Messiliti', null, 'A film crew goes on an adventure to report on extreme tourism by choosing a haunted forest as their destination.', 'A film crew goes on an adventure to report on extreme tourism by choosing a haunted forest as their destination.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kFWGFRBC4KbU27O73R6FJRU43WC.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1186868'),
  ('262160053136292185', 'Glimmers', 2024, 'Drama', 'Pilar Palomero, Daniela Cajías, Eva Leira', 'Pilar Palomero', 'Patricia López Arnaiz, Antonio de la Torre, Marina Guerola, Julián López, Lobo el Perro, Ramon Fontserè, Rubén Martínez, Carlos Burot', null, 'Isabel''s life is turned upside down the day her daughter Madalen asks her to visit her sick ex-husband Ramón on a regular basis.', 'Isabel''s life is turned upside down the day her daughter Madalen asks her to visit her sick ex-husband Ramón on a regular basis.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gmDfHGgHxKlpNbdPGIS6QYNyFdb.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1214107'),
