  ('708270830783231528', 'Global Heresy', 2002, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Sidney J. Furie, Curtis Petersen', 'Mark Mills', 'Peter O''Toole, Alicia Silverstone, Joan Plowright, Jaimz Woolvett, Keram Malicki-Sánchez, Christopher Bolton, Lochlyn Munro, Martin Clunes', 'R', 'A rock band bursts onto the scene and then their frontman disappears on the eve of a European tour.', 'A rock band bursts onto the scene and then their frontman disappears on the eve of a European tour.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wvPRRiM2W4Qa4M6nAkvfHfEY22u.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:64293'),
  ('939694427003141350', 'Global Meltdown', 2017, 'Action, Science Fiction, Thriller, TV Movie', 'Charles Hamilton, Daniel Gilboy', 'Daniel Gilboy', 'Michael Paré, Anna Barker, Marin Almasi, Caroline Buzanko, Elle Young, Sarah Beaudin, Duff Zayonce, Anthony De Almeida', null, 'A helicopter pilot and an environmental scientist lead a exodus of survivors in a search for a safe haven after a catastrophic tectonic event causes the crust of the earth to break apart.', 'A helicopter pilot and an environmental scientist lead a exodus of survivors in a search for a safe haven after a catastrophic tectonic event causes the crust of the earth to break apart.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3msVFWalwQyfXQONXh9dRM0FLpD.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:514690'),
  ('207422022998645866', 'Global Metal', 2008, 'Documentary, Music', 'Sam Dunn', 'Sam Dunn', 'Sam Dunn, Rafael Bittencourt, Bruce Dickinson, Adrian Smith, Dave Murray, Max Cavalera, Tom Araya, Kerry King', null, 'In GLOBAL METAL, directors Scot McFadyen and Sam Dunn set out to discover how the West''s most maligned musical genre - heavy metal - has impacted the world''s cultures beyond Europe and North America. The film follows metal fan and anthropologist Sam Dunn on a whirlwind journey through Asia, South America and the Middle East as he explores the underbelly of the world''s emerging extreme music scenes; from Indonesian death metal to Chinese black metal to Iranian thrash metal. GLOBAL METAL reveals a worldwide community of metalheads who aren''t just absorbing metal from the West - they''re transforming it - creating a new form of cultural expression in societies dominated by conflict, corruption and mass-consumerism.', 'In GLOBAL METAL, directors Scot McFadyen and Sam Dunn set out to discover how the West''s most maligned musical genre - heavy metal - has impacted the world''s cultures beyond Europe and North America. The film follows metal fan and anthropologist Sam Dunn on a whirlwind journey through Asia, South America and the Middle East as he explores the underbelly of the world''s emerging extreme music scenes; from Indonesian death metal to Chinese black metal to Iranian thrash metal. GLOBAL METAL reveals a worldwide community of metalheads who aren''t just absorbing metal from the West - they''re transforming it - creating a new form of cultural expression in societies dominated by conflict, corruption and mass-consumerism.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/28f1iaERjW8pk39Ye5KpG7Xfqa4.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:16919'),
  ('601889726542728089', 'Gloomy Sunday', 1999, 'Drama, Romance', 'Rolf Schübel, Edward Kłosiński', 'Rolf Schübel, Ruth Toma', 'Marozsán Erika, Joachim Król, Ben Becker, Stefano Dionisi, András Bálint, Géza Boros, Rolf Becker, Ilse Zielstorff', null, 'Budapest in the thirties. The restaurant owner Laszlo hires the pianist András to play in his restaurant. Both men fall in love with the beautiful waitress Ilona who inspires András to his only composition. His song of Gloomy Sunday is, at first, loved and then feared, for its melancholic melody triggers off a chain of suicides. The fragile balance of the erotic ménage à trois is sent off kilter when the German Hans goes and falls in love with Ilona as well.', 'Budapest in the thirties. The restaurant owner Laszlo hires the pianist András to play in his restaurant. Both men fall in love with the beautiful waitress Ilona who inspires András to his only composition. His song of Gloomy Sunday is, at first, loved and then feared, for its melancholic melody triggers off a chain of suicides. The fragile balance of the erotic ménage à trois is sent off kilter when the German Hans goes and falls in love with Ilona as well.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7cjNxmJUmz3gaaN6LYRJuEYtaKe.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1277'),
  ('644445409278704531', 'Gloria', 1980, 'Crime, Drama, Thriller', 'John Cassavetes, Fred Schuler, Gaetano Lisi', 'John Cassavetes', 'Gena Rowlands, Buck Henry, Julie Carmen, John Adames, Tony Knesich, Gregory Cleghorne, Lupe Garnica, Jessica Castillo', 'PG', 'When a young boy''s family is killed by the mob, their tough neighbor Gloria becomes his reluctant guardian. In possession of a book that the gangsters want, the pair go on the run in New York.', 'When a young boy''s family is killed by the mob, their tough neighbor Gloria becomes his reluctant guardian. In possession of a book that the gangsters want, the pair go on the run in New York.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mrYZInXp0JEoZYXs0Z108l2jN0C.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:10889'),
  ('932434008750867826', 'Gloria', 1999, 'Drama, Crime, Thriller', 'David Watkin, Sidney Lumet, Jack Gill', 'John Cassavetes', 'Sharon Stone, Jeremy Northam, Cathy Moriarty, Jean-Luke Figueroa, Mike Starr, George C. Scott, Bobby Cannavale, Bonnie Bedelia', 'R', 'After serving a prison term for her boyfriend, a streetwise, middle-aged moll named Gloria stands up against the mobs, which is complicated by a six-year-old urchin with a will of his own, whom she reluctantly takes under her wing after his family has been gunned down.', 'After serving a prison term for her boyfriend, a streetwise, middle-aged moll named Gloria stands up against the mobs, which is complicated by a six-year-old urchin with a will of his own, whom she reluctantly takes under her wing after his family has been gunned down.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1AKAfnT3nm7asU9qyNT6gtS1vbe.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:45712'),
  ('1078153928315969791', 'Gloria', 2013, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Sebastián Lelio, Benjamín Echazarreta, Manuela Delpiano', 'Sebastián Lelio, Gonzalo Maza', 'Paulina García, Sergio Hernández, Coca Guazzini, Antonia Santa María, Diego Fontecilla, Fabiola Zamora, Hugo Moraga, Alejandro Goic', 'R', 'Gloria is a 58-year-old divorcée. Her children have all left home but she has no desire to spend her days and nights alone. Determined to defy old age and loneliness, she rushes headlong into a whirl of singles’ parties on the hunt for instant gratification – which only leads to repeated disappointment and enduring emptiness. But when Gloria meets Rodolfo, an ex-naval officer seven years her senior, she begins to imagine the possibility of a permanent relationship.', 'Gloria is a 58-year-old divorcée. Her children have all left home but she has no desire to spend her days and nights alone. Determined to defy old age and loneliness, she rushes headlong into a whirl of singles’ parties on the hunt for instant gratification – which only leads to repeated disappointment and enduring emptiness. But when Gloria meets Rodolfo, an ex-naval officer seven years her senior, she begins to imagine the possibility of a permanent relationship.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/t1copJu3ecVx7zVCBA1o6z02WcZ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:160068'),
  ('103605533783194566', 'Gloria', 2014, 'Music, Drama', 'Martín Boege, Christian Keller', 'Sabina Berman', 'Sofía Espinosa, Marco Pérez, Tatiana del Real, Ximena Romo, Osvaldo Ríos, Pepe Olivares, Pedro Mira, Moisés Arizmendi', null, 'Gloria never imagined that an audition for the music producer Sergio Andrade was going to change her life so drastically. King Midas not only brought her to stardom, but also to a dramatic story of love, heartbreak and betrayal. Based on the life story of pop/rock singer Gloria Trevi.', 'Gloria never imagined that an audition for the music producer Sergio Andrade was going to change her life so drastically. King Midas not only brought her to stardom, but also to a dramatic story of love, heartbreak and betrayal. Based on the life story of pop/rock singer Gloria Trevi.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1yVRLamL1TixPSrWAJQ51AI6PZr.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:264401'),
  ('597354639325232777', 'Gloria and Grace', 2017, 'Drama', 'Tatiana Fragoso, Mikaela Feitosa, Rafael Ganime', 'Mikael de Albuquerque, Lusa Silvestre', 'Carolina Ferraz, Sandra Corveloni, Sofia Marques, Vicente Demori, Carol Marra, Vicente Monte, César Mello, Roberto Maya', null, 'Gloria, a successful and happy transvestite, lives far from her sister Grace. When Grace discovers she has a terminal illness, the two try to bring their families closer together to re-establish the relationship between the cousins.', 'Gloria, a successful and happy transvestite, lives far from her sister Grace. When Grace discovers she has a terminal illness, the two try to bring their families closer together to re-establish the relationship between the cousins.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/z5mCK6Ex2UbpF25dpeoEw4SEts8.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:420322'),
  ('1079150492975648551', 'Gloria Bell', 2019, 'Drama, Romance', 'Sebastián Lelio, Natasha Braier', 'Sebastián Lelio', 'Julianne Moore, John Turturro, Michael Cera, Caren Pistorius, Brad Garrett, Sean Astin, Holland Taylor, Jeanne Tripplehorn', null, 'Gloria is a free-spirited divorcée who spends her days at a straight-laced office job and her nights on the dance floor, joyfully letting loose at clubs around Los Angeles. After meeting Arnold on a night out, she finds herself thrust into an unexpected new romance, filled with both the joys of budding love and the complications of dating, identity, and family.', 'Gloria is a free-spirited divorcée who spends her days at a straight-laced office job and her nights on the dance floor, joyfully letting loose at clubs around Los Angeles. After meeting Arnold on a night out, she finds herself thrust into an unexpected new romance, filled with both the joys of budding love and the complications of dating, identity, and family.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oTfAWQXUceUszmifA4AwkIsDccQ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:491473'),
  ('243296301852694740', 'Gloria Mundi', 1976, 'Drama', 'Frédéric Variot, Benoît Rizzotti, Yves Lafaye', 'Nikos Papatakis', 'Olga Karlatos, Roland Bertin, Philippe Adrien, Mehmet Ulusoy, Armand Abplanalp, Christiane Tissot, Jean-Louis Broust, Antoinette Moya', null, 'An actress of political torture movies made by her husband has to finish his latest film and arrange a screening for distributors while the husband, who is also secretly an anarchist revolutionary, is away for some resistance operation.', 'An actress of political torture movies made by her husband has to finish his latest film and arrange a screening for distributors while the husband, who is also secretly an anarchist revolutionary, is away for some resistance operation.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/e4V3SVoc4vxA0YIieiOBsYJJKc0.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:258019'),
  ('564476252634235620', 'Gloria Mundi', 2019, 'Drama', 'Robert Guédiguian, Pierre Milon, Ferdinand Verhaeghe', 'Robert Guédiguian, Serge Valletti', 'Ariane Ascaride, Jean-Pierre Darroussin, Gérard Meylan, Anaïs Demoustier, Robinson Stévenin, Lola Naymark, Grégoire Leprince-Ringuet, Angelica Sarre', null, 'Daniel leaves prison. He returns to Marseilles where Mathilda, his daughter, has just given birth. Nicolas, her spouse, a self-employed driver, is exhausted while Mathilda is a sales assistant on a trial basis. But, one night, Nicolas is assaulted by taxi drivers determined to reduce unfair competition.', 'Daniel leaves prison. He returns to Marseilles where Mathilda, his daughter, has just given birth. Nicolas, her spouse, a self-employed driver, is exhausted while Mathilda is a sales assistant on a trial basis. But, one night, Nicolas is assaulted by taxi drivers determined to reduce unfair competition.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oa7xgXwykmLGCXmJUrmaJQ0dDBS.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:572521'),
  ('409079657029873606', 'Gloria Trevi | En Concierto', 2023, 'Music', 'Aldo Ballesteros O.', null, 'Gloria Trevi', null, 'The Supreme Diva of Mexican Pop, Gloria Trevi, takes the stage inn an unmissable show that will feature her biggest hits and an exclusive interview with the singer.', 'The Supreme Diva of Mexican Pop, Gloria Trevi, takes the stage inn an unmissable show that will feature her biggest hits and an exclusive interview with the singer.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gJTuvjfuh2zn87eBIDahg4nTOvf.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1144146'),
  ('689516627209812389', 'Gloria!', 1979, 'Documentary', 'Hollis Frampton', null, null, null, 'In GLORIA! Frampton juxtaposes nineteenth-century concerns with contemporary forms through the interfacing of a work of early cinema with a videographic display of textual material. These two formal components (the film and the texts) in turn relate to a nineteenth-century figure, Frampton''s maternal grandmother, and to a twentieth-century one, her grandson (filmmaker Frampton himself). In attempting to recapture their relationship, GLORIA! becomes a somewhat comic, often touching meditation on death, on memory and on the power of image, music and text to resurrect the past.', 'In GLORIA! Frampton juxtaposes nineteenth-century concerns with contemporary forms through the interfacing of a work of early cinema with a videographic display of textual material. These two formal components (the film and the texts) in turn relate to a nineteenth-century figure, Frampton''s maternal grandmother, and to a twentieth-century one, her grandson (filmmaker Frampton himself). In attempting to recapture their relationship, GLORIA! becomes a somewhat comic, often touching meditation on death, on memory and on the power of image, music and text to resurrect the past.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wIWcAxtzoAMHqpEy0LSOS08F9C6.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:147168'),
  ('50070338103921225', 'Gloria!', 2024, 'Drama, Music', 'Margherita Vicario, Gianluca Palma', 'Margherita Vicario, Anita Rivaroli', 'Galatea Bellugi, Carlotta Gamba, Veronica Lucchesi, Maria Vittoria Dallasta, Sara Mafodda, Paolo Rossi, Elio, Natalino Balasso', null, 'In late 18th century Venice, in a convent school for girls, Teresa, a student with prophetic gifts, joins forces with some amazing music-makers. They create a new kind of pop, bright and bold, and challenge the ancient and rigid system.', 'In late 18th century Venice, in a convent school for girls, Teresa, a student with prophetic gifts, joins forces with some amazing music-makers. They create a new kind of pop, bright and bold, and challenge the ancient and rigid system.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/Nm0umpaFx2FthwtdTqGdegohu6.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1231035'),
  ('79692433058339299', 'Glorifying the American Girl', 1929, 'Music, Comedy', 'George J. Folsey, Millard Webb', null, 'Mary Eaton, Eddie Cantor, Helen Morgan, Rudy Vallee, Dan Healy, Kaye Renard, Edward Crandall, Gloria Shea', 'NR', 'A young woman, who wants to be in the Follies, is making ends meet by working at a department store''s sheet music department, where she sings the latest hits. She is accompanied on piano by her childhood boyfriend, who is in love with her, despite her single-minded interest in her career. When a vaudeville performer asks her to join him as his new partner, she sees it as an opportunity to make her dream come true. Upon arriving in New York City, our heroine finds out that her new partner is only interested in sleeping with her and makes this a condition of making her a star. Soon, however, she is discovered by a representative of Ziegfeld.', 'A young woman, who wants to be in the Follies, is making ends meet by working at a department store''s sheet music department, where she sings the latest hits. She is accompanied on piano by her childhood boyfriend, who is in love with her, despite her single-minded interest in her career. When a vaudeville performer asks her to join him as his new partner, she sees it as an opportunity to make her dream come true. Upon arriving in New York City, our heroine finds out that her new partner is only interested in sleeping with her and makes this a condition of making her a star. Soon, however, she is discovered by a representative of Ziegfeld.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yEMSn4J7e0mAOCol0dTHK3pSDJH.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:117248'),
  ('651495091795774989', 'Glorious', 2022, 'Horror, Fantasy, Comedy', 'Rebekah McKendry, Katherine Bacque, Mike Snow', 'Todd Rigney, Joshua Hull, David Ian McKendry', 'Ryan Kwanten, J.K. Simmons, Sylvia Grace Crim, Andre Lamar, Tordy Clark, Sarah Clark, Katie Bacque', null, 'After a breakup, Wes ends up at a remote rest stop. He finds himself locked inside the bathroom with a mysterious figure speaking from an adjacent stall. Soon Wes realizes he is involved in a situation more terrible than he could imagine.', 'After a breakup, Wes ends up at a remote rest stop. He finds himself locked inside the bathroom with a mysterious figure speaking from an adjacent stall. Soon Wes realizes he is involved in a situation more terrible than he could imagine.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gttZLC3yhLFx1EnfjEUaDb2YAwl.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:939914'),
  ('999550149866835402', 'Glorious 39', 2009, 'War, Drama, History, Thriller', 'Stephen Poliakoff, Danny Cohen', 'Stephen Poliakoff', 'Romola Garai, Bill Nighy, Julie Christie, Eddie Redmayne, Juno Temple, David Tennant, Charlie Cox, Jeremy Northam', 'R', 'A mysterious tale set around a traditional British family on the eve of World War Two. Oblivious to the looming shadow of World War II, the wealthy Keyes maintain a confident façade in the British countryside until daughter Anne becomes an unexpected pawn. Her accidental discovery of secret recordings creates a rift in the family.', 'A mysterious tale set around a traditional British family on the eve of World War Two. Oblivious to the looming shadow of World War II, the wealthy Keyes maintain a confident façade in the British countryside until daughter Anne becomes an unexpected pawn. Her accidental discovery of secret recordings creates a rift in the family.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kYXMRksWR7R2G7LEuEeVWhWgEY4.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:35939'),
  ('745059099517622243', 'Glorious Technicolor', 1998, 'Documentary, TV Movie', 'Rob McWilliams, Peter Jones, Peter B. Good', 'Peter Jones', 'Angela Lansbury, Esther Williams, Arlene Dahl, Evelyn Keyes, Jack Cardiff, Vittorio Storaro, Cammie King Conlon, Richard J. Goldberg', null, 'The history of color photography in motion pictures, in particular the Technicolor company''s work.', 'The history of color photography in motion pictures, in particular the Technicolor company''s work.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rqCQosq00JdcieCNY3yFrP7pZIT.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:135312'),
