  ('387597690585187452', 'Glory', 1989, 'Drama, History, War', 'Freddie Francis, Edward Zwick, Andrew Precht', 'Kevin Jarre', 'Matthew Broderick, Denzel Washington, Cary Elwes, Morgan Freeman, Jihmi Kennedy, Andre Braugher, John Finn, Donovan Leitch', 'R', 'Robert Gould Shaw leads the US Civil War''s first all-black volunteer company, fighting prejudices of both his own Union army and the Confederates.', 'Robert Gould Shaw leads the US Civil War''s first all-black volunteer company, fighting prejudices of both his own Union army and the Confederates.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pGDzBjZvzmSCIEduQBfESLMiwtp.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:9665'),
