  ('913504124311888721', 'Glory Daze', 1995, 'Comedy', 'Rich Wilkes, Christopher Taylor', 'Rich Wilkes', 'Ben Affleck, Sam Rockwell, Megan Ward, French Stewart, Vien Hong, Vinnie DeRamus, Kristin Bauer, Alyssa Milano', 'R', 'Jack, a soon-to-be graduate, finds he''s having a difficult time letting go of the college life -- and decides maybe he doesn''t have to. Also questioning whether there''s life after college are Jack''s roommates: Rob, who fears domestication; comic-strip artist Mickey, who''s shy around girls; intellectual party animal Slosh; and perpetual student Dennis.', 'Jack, a soon-to-be graduate, finds he''s having a difficult time letting go of the college life -- and decides maybe he doesn''t have to. Also questioning whether there''s life after college are Jack''s roommates: Rob, who fears domestication; comic-strip artist Mickey, who''s shy around girls; intellectual party animal Slosh; and perpetual student Dennis.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mosH3RnC5wjcThd0DZq4ZqWkTPQ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:26626'),
  ('1089236993082401428', 'Glory Road', 2006, 'Drama, History', 'James Gartner, John Toon, Jeffrey L. Kimball', 'Christopher Cleveland, Bettina Gilois', 'Josh Lucas, Derek Luke, Jon Voight, Austin Nichols, Evan Jones, Mehcad Brooks, Damaine Radcliff, Alphonso McAuley', 'PG', 'In 1966, Texas Western coach Don Haskins led the first all-black starting line-up for a college basketball team to the NCAA national championship.', 'In 1966, Texas Western coach Don Haskins led the first all-black starting line-up for a college basketball team to the NCAA national championship.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bGRSV5tStxDNPRLCewnOeeiZzrY.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:9918'),
  ('847430478319569890', 'Glory to the Filmmaker!', 2007, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Takeshi Kitano, Katsumi Yanagijima', 'Takeshi Kitano', 'Takeshi Kitano, Tohru Emori, Kayoko Kishimoto, Anne Suzuki, Keiko Matsuzaka, Yoshino Kimura, Kazuko Yoshiyuki, Yuki Uchida', null, 'Takeshi Kitano plays a version of himself in which he''s a struggling director cycling through a number of different genres in an effort to complete his latest project.', 'Takeshi Kitano plays a version of himself in which he''s a struggling director cycling through a number of different genres in an effort to complete his latest project.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/u4Rg9fb8foonmyKmNSFzW5jpRbY.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:30427'),
  ('48902298400642781', 'Gloss', 2007, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Andrei Konchalovsky, Vladimir Ilin, Mariya Solovyova', 'Avdotya Smirnova, Andrei Konchalovsky', 'Yuliya Vysotskaya, Alexandr Domogarov, Aleksey Serebryakov, Irina Rozanova, Tatyana Arntgolts, Yuliya Snigir, Efim Shifrin, Olga Arntgolts', null, 'A pretty, young girl from a coal-mining town comes to Moscow with dreams of becoming a supermodel in this satirical look at the fashion industry.', 'A pretty, young girl from a coal-mining town comes to Moscow with dreams of becoming a supermodel in this satirical look at the fashion industry.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zVRskM54fGSjfGtvuLxJ0b9W0P0.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:64264'),
  ('972399611090901405', 'Glove', 2011, 'Drama, Family', 'Kang Dae-hui, Kang Woo-suk, Kim Yong-heung', 'Kim Ki-beom', 'Jung Jae-young, Yu Seon, Kang Shin-il, Jang Ki-bum, Kim Hye-seong, Cho Jin-woong, Kim Mi-kyeong, Lee Hyun-woo', null, 'Star baseball player and national hero Sang-nam finds his career in jeopardy when he gets involved in a drunken brawl. His promoter, Charles, advises him to volunteer his time somewhere sympathetic to improve his public image. The place: a school for the deaf. The service: coaching its baseball team.', 'Star baseball player and national hero Sang-nam finds his career in jeopardy when he gets involved in a drunken brawl. His promoter, Charles, advises him to volunteer his time somewhere sympathetic to improve his public image. The place: a school for the deaf. The service: coaching its baseball team.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ub5ilD9ApRMGJJ6zruUphQAQ6zC.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:64396'),
  ('432354767386628788', 'Glue', 2006, 'Drama', 'Alexis Dos Santos, Natasha Braier', 'Alexis Dos Santos', 'Nahuel Pérez Biscayart, Nahuel Viale, Inés Efrón, Verónica Llinás, Héctor Díaz, Florencia Braier', null, 'A teenage summer in a small town in the desert, a dysfunctional family, a rock band, a can full of glue, two boys, one girl, loads of tongue kisses, dry heat, wind in Patagonia, existential angst... A teenage story in the middle of nowhere.', 'A teenage summer in a small town in the desert, a dysfunctional family, a rock band, a can full of glue, two boys, one girl, loads of tongue kisses, dry heat, wind in Patagonia, existential angst... A teenage story in the middle of nowhere.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hs2t9b50iFwCE3mXlO12Vb72rAM.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:10817'),
  ('84654333605526060', 'Glumov''s Diary', 1923, 'Fantasy, Comedy', 'Sergei Eisenstein, Boris Frantsisson', 'Sergei Eisenstein', 'Grigori Aleksandrov, Aleksandr Antonov, Sergei Eisenstein, Ivan Yazykanov, Maksim Shtraukh, Vera Yanukova, Mikhail Gomorov, Very Muzykant', null, 'Filmic insert to Eisenstein''s modernized, free adaptation of Ostrovskiy''s 19th-century Russian stage play, "The Wise Man" ("Na vsyakogo mudretsa dovolno prostoty"). The anti-hero Glumov tries to escape exposure in the midst of acrobatics, derring-do, and farcical clowning. Several members of Eisenstein''s troupe at the legendary "Proletkult" stage theatre in Moscow briefly appear in this little film.', 'Filmic insert to Eisenstein''s modernized, free adaptation of Ostrovskiy''s 19th-century Russian stage play, "The Wise Man" ("Na vsyakogo mudretsa dovolno prostoty"). The anti-hero Glumov tries to escape exposure in the midst of acrobatics, derring-do, and farcical clowning. Several members of Eisenstein''s troupe at the legendary "Proletkult" stage theatre in Moscow briefly appear in this little film.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6hIklrh5eSwXcugDy4MCQJsS9JX.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:47703'),
  ('301271943823250431', 'Gnaw', 2008, 'Horror, Comedy', 'Gregory Mandry', 'Max Waller, Rob Weston', 'Hiram Bleetman, Carrie Cohen, Nigel Croft-Adams, Sara Dylan, Rachel Mitchem, Oliver Squires, Julia Vandoorne, Jennifer Wren', null, 'In this dark, tongue in cheek, British Horror, six friends take a holiday in the heart of the English countryside which turns into a culinary nightmare when they discover that their hosts are a sadistic family of cannibals, set on turning their guests into their next meal! It''s nice to have your friends for dinner', 'In this dark, tongue in cheek, British Horror, six friends take a holiday in the heart of the English countryside which turns into a culinary nightmare when they discover that their hosts are a sadistic family of cannibals, set on turning their guests into their next meal! It''s nice to have your friends for dinner', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/x8HkuoWDV8zijuL9L1Unc5yJKD8.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:17910'),
  ('614699306512401183', 'Gnaw', 2017, 'Horror', 'Antón Fresco, Haylar Garcia', 'Jim Brennan, Haylar Garcia, Kathryn Gould', 'Penelope Mitchell, Kyle Gass, Chris Johnson, Sally Kirkland, Graham Emmons, Susan Bellone, Erin Graham, Elisa Vasquez', 'NR', 'Jennifer Conrad is a small-town girl starting over in the big city. Fleeing an abusive relationship, all she wants is a chance to begin again. But it is hard to start over when something is eating you while you sleep . . . one painful bite at a time.', 'Jennifer Conrad is a small-town girl starting over in the big city. Fleeing an abusive relationship, all she wants is a chance to begin again. But it is hard to start over when something is eating you while you sleep . . . one painful bite at a time.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7Z8OTmCjxVibRIEmcSD89pzpze.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:483987'),
  ('130270653128711599', 'Gnir Rednow', 1955, null, 'Joseph Cornell', null, null, null, 'A film composed of the out-takes from Brakhage’s The Wonder Ring (1955), which Cornell had commissioned. There has been a long-standing misconception that the film "Gnir Rednow" is simply "The Wonder Ring" mirrored or projected in reverse. However, Mark Toscano of the Academy Film Archive has definitively established that the original roll of each one of these two films is "unmistakably, completely comprised of camera original Kodachrome," and that no two shots are precisely the same from one film to the other.', 'A film composed of the out-takes from Brakhage’s The Wonder Ring (1955), which Cornell had commissioned. There has been a long-standing misconception that the film "Gnir Rednow" is simply "The Wonder Ring" mirrored or projected in reverse. However, Mark Toscano of the Academy Film Archive has definitively established that the original roll of each one of these two films is "unmistakably, completely comprised of camera original Kodachrome," and that no two shots are precisely the same from one film to the other.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tYDvFbHdKRyZfNa9UbhdcQmvqDP.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:211259'),
  ('550985102617849166', 'Gnome Alone', 2017, 'Animation, Family, Adventure, Comedy, Fantasy', 'Peter Lepeniotis', 'Zina Zaflow, Michael Schwartz', 'Becky G, Nash Grier, Tara Strong, Josh Peck, David Koechner, Olivia Holt, George López, Madison De La Garza', 'PG', 'When Chloe discovers that her new home''s garden gnomes are not what they seem, she must decide between the pursuit of a desired high school life and taking up the fight against the Troggs.', 'When Chloe discovers that her new home''s garden gnomes are not what they seem, she must decide between the pursuit of a desired high school life and taking up the fight against the Troggs.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jWB0zhk1Rj1tIWUM98Wsh15gkiW.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:466876'),
  ('763377951024687650', 'Gnomeo & Juliet', 2011, 'Animation, Family', 'Kelly Asbury', 'Johnny Smith, Rob Sprackling, Emily Cook', 'James McAvoy, Emily Blunt, Michael Caine, Maggie Smith, Julie Walters, Jim Cummings, Jason Statham, Ashley Jensen', 'G', 'A version of Shakespeare''s play, set in the world of warring indoor and outdoor gnomes. Garden gnomes Gnomeo and Juliet have as many obstacles to overcome as their quasi namesakes when they are caught up in a feud between neighbors. But with plastic pink flamingos and lawnmower races in the mix, can this young couple find lasting happiness?', 'A version of Shakespeare''s play, set in the world of warring indoor and outdoor gnomes. Garden gnomes Gnomeo and Juliet have as many obstacles to overcome as their quasi namesakes when they are caught up in a feud between neighbors. But with plastic pink flamingos and lawnmower races in the mix, can this young couple find lasting happiness?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vVQwgfS9gSFviVT4gS7tZAmhRFc.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:45772'),
  ('833739645328307947', 'Gnomes', 1980, 'Animation, Fantasy, Family, TV Movie', 'Lars Calonius, Jack Zander', 'Sam Moore, Maurice Rapf', 'Lee Richardson, Arthur Anderson, Rex Everhart, Anne Francine, Hetty Galen, Gordon Halliday, Bob McFadden, Corinne Orr', null, 'A family of gnomes preparing for the wedding of their eldest son must engage in a battle of wits with an enemy family of vicious trolls.', 'A family of gnomes preparing for the wedding of their eldest son must engage in a battle of wits with an enemy family of vicious trolls.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8IQrILLnAGvW2724eKYBNHwQJL0.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:30703'),
  ('1079179834457774193', 'Go', 1999, 'Crime, Comedy, Thriller', 'Doug Liman, Doug Liman, Rebecca MacDonald', 'John August', 'Sarah Polley, Timothy Olyphant, Katie Holmes, Desmond Askew, Jay Mohr, Scott Wolf, Taye Diggs, William Fichtner', 'R', 'A supermarket clerk decides to step in for an absent drug dealer, setting off an explosive, comedic chain of events.', 'A supermarket clerk decides to step in for an absent drug dealer, setting off an explosive, comedic chain of events.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kP0OOAa4GTZSUPW8fgPbk1OmKEW.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:9430'),
  ('30439005489616918', 'Go', 2007, 'Crime, Romance', 'Jailesh Oberoi, Manish Shrivastav', null, 'Gautam Gupta, Priyanka Kothari, Kay Kay Menon, Rajpal Yadav, Priyanka Sharma, Ravi Kale, Roger Danuarta, Sherveer Vakil', null, 'Mrs. Dave does not approve of her daughter, Vasundhara''s next-door boyfriend, Abhay Narula, and arranges her marriage with Carson Gharodia. In protest, she elopes with Abhay on his motorbike. Enroute to Goa they run out of petrol and hitch a ride from a male named Bihari. It is this ride that will turn their lives upside down and pit them against the Police, goons, and a male named Jagtap Tiwari who thinks that they are gold and cocaine smugglers.', 'Mrs. Dave does not approve of her daughter, Vasundhara''s next-door boyfriend, Abhay Narula, and arranges her marriage with Carson Gharodia. In protest, she elopes with Abhay on his motorbike. Enroute to Goa they run out of petrol and hitch a ride from a male named Bihari. It is this ride that will turn their lives upside down and pit them against the Police, goons, and a male named Jagtap Tiwari who thinks that they are gold and cocaine smugglers.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/QkzRFm636ObSqAjbEETqYADpfm.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:20299'),
  ('485316670975001620', 'GO', 2001, 'Drama, Romance', 'Isao Yukisada, Katsumi Yanagijima', null, 'Yosuke Kubozuka, Ko Shibasaki, Shinobu Otake, Tsutomu Yamazaki, Taro Yamamoto, Hirofumi Arai, Mitsu Murata, Takahito Hosoyamada', null, 'Sugihara, a Japanese-born, third-generation Korean teenager struggles to find a place in a society that will not accept him.', 'Sugihara, a Japanese-born, third-generation Korean teenager struggles to find a place in a society that will not accept him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1b4JNGUsy0WAuHAVK2VPNCcvPGS.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:37959'),
  ('958162226835327225', 'Go Ahead, Brazil!', 1982, 'Crime, Drama', 'Roberto Farias, Dib Lutfi', 'Roberto Farias', 'Reginaldo Faria, Antônio Fagundes, Natália do Vale, Elizabeth Savalla, Carlos Zara, Cláudio Marzo, Flávio Migliaccio, Luiz Armando Queiroz', null, 'Mid-1970s. When the military regime''s "economic miracle" and the victory of the Brazilian football team on the World Cup serve as a distraction for the persecution of opposition leaders by the political police of the dictatorship. Under this context, Jofre Godoi da Fonseca, an alienated middle-class man, is mistaken for Sarmento, a political activist he met at an airport prior to his assassination. He is then arrested for being "subversive".', 'Mid-1970s. When the military regime''s "economic miracle" and the victory of the Brazilian football team on the World Cup serve as a distraction for the persecution of opposition leaders by the political police of the dictatorship. Under this context, Jofre Godoi da Fonseca, an alienated middle-class man, is mistaken for Sarmento, a political activist he met at an airport prior to his assassination. He is then arrested for being "subversive".', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mrabMJb4AEnJinawd6iM0CMVXvw.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:181619'),
  ('205530028727612149', 'Go Ask Alice', 1973, 'Drama, TV Movie', 'John Korty, Earl Rath', 'Ellen M. Violett', 'William Shatner, Ruth Roman, Wendell Burton, Julie Adams, Andy Griffith, Ayn Ruymen, Mimi Maynard, Jennifer Edwards', null, 'A 15-year-old girl in late 1960''s America is inadvertently sucked into an odyssey of sex and drugs. She eventually seeks help.', 'A 15-year-old girl in late 1960''s America is inadvertently sucked into an odyssey of sex and drugs. She eventually seeks help.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oT9jcgCDhSOU4n8nP4LDDEsOvsa.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:126526'),
  ('158383072603275099', 'Go Away Mr. Tumor', 2015, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Charlie Lam Chi-Kin, Han Yan, Han Guanhua', 'Weizhong Zhang, Yuan Yuan', 'Bai Baihe, Daniel Wu, Zhang Zixuan, Li Yuan, Teng Shen, Lui Ruilin, Li Jianyi, Liu Lili', null, 'A young woman begins to live life to the fullest when she receives a diagnosis of cancer.', 'A young woman begins to live life to the fullest when she receives a diagnosis of cancer.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rEcUeqPMokCIe9s9Ydob5mpyADo.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:354128'),
  ('611976210831068293', 'Go Away, Ultramarine', 2019, 'Drama, Mystery, Fantasy', 'Akina Yanagi, Hiroki Ando', 'Minato Takano', 'Ryusei Yokohama, Marie Iitoyo, Mario Kuroba, Matsumoto Kiyo, Honoka Yahagi, Koudai Matsuoka, Moemi Katayama, Yuki Kimisawa', null, 'An island in Japan is the site for the dumped and the refuse. Nanakusa and Yu who were childhood and school friends meet on this island that is called Kaiden, a scary name that only refers to things not normal or earthly. The reunited friends strike a bargain and are soon involved in cases most would not dare be involved in or become entangled in.', 'An island in Japan is the site for the dumped and the refuse. Nanakusa and Yu who were childhood and school friends meet on this island that is called Kaiden, a scary name that only refers to things not normal or earthly. The reunited friends strike a bargain and are soon involved in cases most would not dare be involved in or become entangled in.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8rjqqu4INO0tiow6TqpOB4e9vZK.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:628571'),
  ('1008718719213458264', 'Go Brother!', 2018, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Cheng Fenfen', 'Cheng Fenfen', 'Zhang Zifeng, Peng Yuchang, Zhao Jinmai, Sun Zeyuan, Jiang Hongbo, Xu Guangyu, Liu Congfei, Jiang Linjing', null, 'Shi Miao hates her brother Shi Fen. So, she makes a birthday wish: She wants her brother gone. However, she did not expect the wish come true.', 'Shi Miao hates her brother Shi Fen. So, she makes a birthday wish: She wants her brother gone. However, she did not expect the wish come true.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/13LfNxb54HHSxgvnnLVRm4NKX49.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:543628'),
  ('779036009591265116', 'Go Fast', 2008, 'Drama, Action, Crime', 'Olivier Van Hoofstadt', 'Jean-Marc Souvira, Bibi Naceri, Emmanuel Prévost', 'Roschdy Zem, Olivier Gourmet, David Saracino, Jean-Michel Fête, Jil Milan, Julie Durand, Catalina Denis, Caroline Breton', null, 'Marek, a crime squad officer, sets out to avenge the death of his partner and best friend, who was killed by drug traffickers. He asks for a posting to a new undercover unit created to infiltrate a drug gang that imports hashish from Morocco using the "Go Fast" method. A fleet of high-powered speedboats and cars races across the Mediterranean to Spain and then France, loaded with drugs.', 'Marek, a crime squad officer, sets out to avenge the death of his partner and best friend, who was killed by drug traffickers. He asks for a posting to a new undercover unit created to infiltrate a drug gang that imports hashish from Morocco using the "Go Fast" method. A fleet of high-powered speedboats and cars races across the Mediterranean to Spain and then France, loaded with drugs.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mXESPPvjKWtcl0uVXnuRipPxz2q.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:15942'),
  ('173989034186677169', 'Go Figure', 2005, 'TV Movie, Comedy, Drama, Family', 'Francine McDougall, Matias Alvarez, Peggy Stuber', 'Beth Rigazio, Patrick J. Clifton', 'Jordan Danger, Whitney Sloan, Cristine Rose, Ryan Malgarini, Tania Gunadi, Amy Halloran, Brittany Curran, Sabrina Speer', 'G', 'Katelin Kingsford, an Olympic hopeful figure skater wants to train with a Russian figure skating coach. In order to go to go to the school that Natasha is at, Katelin gets a scholarship playing on the girls hockey team.', 'Katelin Kingsford, an Olympic hopeful figure skater wants to train with a Russian figure skating coach. In order to go to go to the school that Natasha is at, Katelin gets a scholarship playing on the girls hockey team.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3ngHrgIt33g0IEjl7rvzGLQ8wpj.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:55504'),
  ('37245981053260296', 'Go Fish', 1994, 'Romance, Comedy, Drama', 'Rose Troche, Ann T. Rossetti, Art Stone', 'Rose Troche, Guinevere Turner', 'Guinevere Turner, V.S. Brodie, T. Wendy McMillan, Migdalia Melendez, Anastasia Sharp, Brooke Webster, Mimi Weddell, JoAnne C. Willis', 'R', 'Max is a trendy, pretty, young lesbian, who is having trouble finding love. A friend sets her up with Ely, whom Max likes, but Ely is frumpy, homely, and older. Nor do they have much in common. Can Max learn to look past the packaging?', 'Max is a trendy, pretty, young lesbian, who is having trouble finding love. A friend sets her up with Ely, whom Max likes, but Ely is frumpy, homely, and older. Nor do they have much in common. Can Max learn to look past the packaging?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4hczdEX2RmQTOmiIKygoOYCy0bI.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:18620'),
  ('153603453880186997', 'Go Fly a Kit', 1957, 'Animation, Comedy', 'Chuck Jones', null, 'Mel Blanc, Daws Butler', null, 'The story of a cat, raised by an eagle, who learns to fly and uses his ability to save his future girlfriend from a vicious bulldog.', 'The story of a cat, raised by an eagle, who learns to fly and uses his ability to save his future girlfriend from a vicious bulldog.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/o84IbJaiYZC1LfmgyenRwvKbcES.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:190197'),
  ('442642912697461438', 'Go For Broke', 2024, 'Action, Crime', 'Marc Ma, Kenny Tse Chung-To, Wu Gang', 'Zhao Haozhe, Marc Ma, Gu Haoran', 'Nick Cheung Ka-Fai, Ethan Juan, Sandrine Pinna, Marc Ma, Danny Chan Kwok-Kwan, Jiang Yixuan, Zhang Li, Vithaya Pansringarm', null, 'Zhang Yao, whose family was destroyed by drug dealers, secretly cooperates with Anti-drug team leader An Du. The two join forces to ruthlessly eliminate the evil and vow to wipe out Mukun and Anpei, the top two figures of the criminal group.', 'Zhang Yao, whose family was destroyed by drug dealers, secretly cooperates with Anti-drug team leader An Du. The two join forces to ruthlessly eliminate the evil and vow to wipe out Mukun and Anpei, the top two figures of the criminal group.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sZDX7WPOcQKBN3pJP0HaCvUvIMg.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1301470'),
  ('123978666042735984', 'Go for Broke!', 1951, 'Action, Drama, War, History', 'Paul Vogel, Robert Pirosh', 'Robert Pirosh', 'Van Johnson, Lane Nakano, George Miki, Akira Fukunaga, Ken K. Okamoto, Henry Oyasato, Harry Hamada, Henry Nakamura', 'NR', 'A tribute to the U.S. 442nd Regimental Combat Team, formed in 1943 by Presidential permission with Japanese-American volunteers. We follow the training of a platoon under the rueful command of Lt. Mike Grayson who shares common prejudices of the time. The 442nd serve in Italy, then France, distinguishing themselves in skirmishes and battles; gradually and naturally, Grayson''s prejudices evaporate with dawning realization that his men are better soldiers than he is.', 'A tribute to the U.S. 442nd Regimental Combat Team, formed in 1943 by Presidential permission with Japanese-American volunteers. We follow the training of a platoon under the rueful command of Lt. Mike Grayson who shares common prejudices of the time. The 442nd serve in Italy, then France, distinguishing themselves in skirmishes and battles; gradually and naturally, Grayson''s prejudices evaporate with dawning realization that his men are better soldiers than he is.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2XnwfYhgAnZzDPkA7ixdiSai81p.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:37214'),
  ('81235830846820046', 'Go for It', 1983, 'Adventure, Action, Comedy', 'Ben McDermott, Enzo Barboni, Peter Gold', 'Marco Barboni', 'Terence Hill, Bud Spencer, Buffy Dee, David Huddleston, Riccardo Pizzuti, Faith Minton, Dan Rambo, Susan Teesdale', null, 'After Doug picks up hitchhiking Rosco with his truck, they are mistaken for two bank robbers by the traffic police. They manage to escape only to be confused for two secret agents while trying to take a flight at the airport.', 'After Doug picks up hitchhiking Rosco with his truck, they are mistaken for two bank robbers by the traffic police. They manage to escape only to be confused for two secret agents while trying to take a flight at the airport.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gfv6ctg1BTtpQeOkwThe4EzDSK9.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:11616'),
  ('607960844565346951', 'Go for Zucker', 2004, 'Comedy', 'Dani Levy, Carl-Friedrich Koschnick', 'Holger Franke, Dani Levy', 'Henry Hübchen, Hannelore Elsner, Udo Samel, Gołda Tencer, Steffen Groth, Anja Franke, Sebastian Blomberg, Elena Uhlig', null, 'Germany director Dani Levy filmed this comedy about Jewish life in today’s Germany along side the familiar east-west conflict. With it great success this film is a joyful comedy of humor and knowledge.', 'Germany director Dani Levy filmed this comedy about Jewish life in today’s Germany along side the familiar east-west conflict. With it great success this film is a joyful comedy of humor and knowledge.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sDAVHwXZI3yMSBOqjZGtiEyfhQt.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:460'),
