  ('389902011481185033', 'Go Goa Gone', 2013, 'Comedy, Horror', 'Krishna D.K., Raj Nidimoru, Dan MacArthur', 'Krishna D.K., Raj Nidimoru', 'Kunal Khemu, Anand Tiwari, Vir Das, Saif Ali Khan, Puja Gupta, Larissa Bonesi, Soha Ali Khan, Pitobash', 'NR', 'A rave party off the coast of Goa goes horrifyingly and hilariously wrong when the island is overrun with zombies.', 'A rave party off the coast of Goa goes horrifyingly and hilariously wrong when the island is overrun with zombies.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pyaAYAifrZ1jAfbdunSAiK0QbKs.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:191562'),
  ('175406012556778343', 'Go Heat Man!', 2001, 'Drama', 'Mitsuhiko Yazaki, Junya Ikegami, Shûji Kuriyama', 'Mitsuhiko Yazaki', 'Kotaro Takada, Miwa Mukunoki, Jun Miho, Tsutomu Yamazaki, Shunsuke Kariya, Ken Mitsuishi, Yutaka Matsushige, Tetsu Sawaki', null, '17 year old Tokyo pizza delivery boy Kosuke crashes his bike into photographer Reiko and breaks her expensive camera. He promises to deliver homemade pizza to make up for her broken camera. After discovering that Reiko has moved 1,200 km away to her hometown of Nagasaki things become trickier, but Kosuke decides to fulfill his promise anyways by borrowing a moped from his workplace.', '17 year old Tokyo pizza delivery boy Kosuke crashes his bike into photographer Reiko and breaks her expensive camera. He promises to deliver homemade pizza to make up for her broken camera. After discovering that Reiko has moved 1,200 km away to her hometown of Nagasaki things become trickier, but Kosuke decides to fulfill his promise anyways by borrowing a moped from his workplace.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7AjoubMYq5usswBUzdjKmClXJE2.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:313865'),
  ('514050641501968783', 'Go Home', 2019, 'Horror', 'Luna Gualano', 'Luna Gualano, Emiliano Rubbi', 'Antonio Bannò, Sidy Diop, Shiek Dauda, Cyril Dorand Nzeugang Domche, Pape Momar Diop, Mounis Firwana, Wajeeh Jaber Ibrahim, Awa Koundoul', null, 'In the course of a demonstration in Rome against the opening of a refugee center, an apocalypse of zombies breaks out. Enrico, an ultra-rightist young man lying on his identity, finds refuge in the center. The only safe place for him is this refugee camp that he did not want, while the dead are walking outside.', 'In the course of a demonstration in Rome against the opening of a refugee center, an apocalypse of zombies breaks out. Enrico, an ultra-rightist young man lying on his identity, finds refuge in the center. The only safe place for him is this refugee camp that he did not want, while the dead are walking outside.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pwjERLS4xH36jaQOxYQAp7UExTL.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:554847'),
  ('686659940996442949', 'Go Lala Go!', 2010, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Xu Jinglei', 'Xu Jinglei, Zhao Meng, Wang Yun', 'Xu Jinglei, Karen Mok Man-Wai, Stanley Huang, Pace Wu Pui-Tsi, Li Ai, Song Ningfeng, Peter Loehr, Erik Siao', null, 'About a working class woman climbing her way up the corporate ladder and scoring a hot, rich boyfriend along the way, this romantic comedy is based on the same-name popular novel.', 'About a working class woman climbing her way up the corporate ladder and scoring a hot, rich boyfriend along the way, this romantic comedy is based on the same-name popular novel.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pC13M3067gEFuP5PaIqTkFDG0GJ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:39560'),
  ('221923795863740291', 'Go Naked in the World', 1961, 'Drama', 'Ranald MacDougall, Milton Krasner, William Shanks', 'Ranald MacDougall', 'Gina Lollobrigida, Ernest Borgnine, Anthony Franciosa, Luana Patten, Will Kuluva, Philip Ober, Tracey Roberts, Nancy R. Pollock', null, 'A domineering San Francisco businessman is determined to put an end to his son''s romance with a high-priced hooker.', 'A domineering San Francisco businessman is determined to put an end to his son''s romance with a high-priced hooker.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3rE2awSLYNBpOcWHOqZFGDoGrhH.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:174709'),
  ('325203188657794400', 'Go Now', 1995, 'Romance, Drama, TV Movie', 'Michael Winterbottom, Daf Hobson, Nick Laws', 'Paul Henry Powell, Jimmy McGovern', 'Robert Carlyle, Juliet Aubrey, Sophie Okonedo, James Nesbitt, Berwick Kaler, Barbara Rafferty, Tony Curran, Erin McMahon', null, 'Nick, is a young Scottish soccer player living in the big city. He meets Karen, and the two fall in love and move in together. Soon after, Nick exhibits signs of serious illness. As his body slowly succumbs to multiple sclerosis, he experiences a wide sweep of jagged emotions, and in the process gives himself and those who love him the strength to carry on.', 'Nick, is a young Scottish soccer player living in the big city. He meets Karen, and the two fall in love and move in together. Soon after, Nick exhibits signs of serious illness. As his body slowly succumbs to multiple sclerosis, he experiences a wide sweep of jagged emotions, and in the process gives himself and those who love him the strength to carry on.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/51d63BwusSczQjWAVelCDT1xLaD.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:49474'),
  ('1122835714574168253', 'Go Seppuku Yourselves', 2021, 'Drama', 'Toshiaki Toyoda, Kenji Maki', 'Toshiaki Toyoda', 'Yosuke Kubozuka, Kiyohiko Shibukawa, Haruka Imou, Danko Iida, Ryôichi Yuki', null, 'A man is tasked with assisting in the ritual suicide of a samurai who won''t die without condemning the corrupt powers that be.', 'A man is tasked with assisting in the ritual suicide of a samurai who won''t die without condemning the corrupt powers that be.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sbjjrrOYKiBlaZDyWVUaaTlZVQk.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:846446'),
  ('117739262371203462', 'Go Tell the Spartans', 1978, 'War', 'Ted Post, Harry Stradling Jr.', 'Wendell Mayes', 'Burt Lancaster, Craig Wasson, Marc Singer, Joe Unger, David Clennon, Evan C. Kim, John Megna, Hilly Hicks', null, 'A unit of American military advisors in Vietnam prior to the major U.S. involvement finds similarities between their helpless struggle against the Viet Cong and the doomed actions of a French unit at the same site a decade before.', 'A unit of American military advisors in Vietnam prior to the major U.S. involvement finds similarities between their helpless struggle against the Viet Cong and the doomed actions of a French unit at the same site a decade before.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fUmid11VCcYixxEb2Odwy5dxe3J.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:32052'),
  ('880415504114080325', 'Go Toward the Light', 1988, 'Drama, TV Movie', 'Mike Robe', null, 'Linda Hamilton, Richard Thomas, Joshua Harris, Piper Laurie, Ned Beatty, Gary Bayer, Rosemary Dunsmore, Steven Eckholdt', null, 'A young couple faces the realities of life with their child who is diagnosed with AIDS.', 'A young couple faces the realities of life with their child who is diagnosed with AIDS.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bamFhZ3cP4MSRxXi3S8mGiwHEsl.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:148654'),
  ('684919825902126966', 'Go Trabi Go', 1991, 'Comedy', 'Peter Timm, Axel Block', 'Reinhard Klooss, Peter Timm', 'Claudia Schmutzler, Marie Gruber, Wolfgang Stumph, Dieter Hildebrandt, Ottfried Fischer, Diether Krebs, Barbara Valentin, Billie Zöckler', null, 'Family Struutz lives in Bitterfeld (GDR). After the fall of the wall, they take the opportunity to go on holiday with their car, an old Trabant. They simply want to visit Italy. But there are some incidents during their journey.', 'Family Struutz lives in Bitterfeld (GDR). After the fall of the wall, they take the opportunity to go on holiday with their car, an old Trabant. They simply want to visit Italy. But there are some incidents during their journey.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wtc8VETDc5jOZ90E6SzoMqr11ta.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:11691'),
  ('298808877600238707', 'Go Trabi Go 2: Those Were the Days of the Wild East', 1992, 'Comedy', 'Wolfgang Büld, Reinhard Klooss, Axel Block', 'Reinhard Klooss, Stefan Cantz', 'Claudia Schmutzler, Marie Gruber, Wolfgang Stumph, Gerit Kling, Astrid Boner, Rolf Zacher, Uwe Friedrichsen, Jochen Busse', null, 'Elated by the Italian attitude to life, family Struutz returns to Bitterfeld and experiences a shock: In the turmoil of the reunification her house must give way to a golf course. Hope Udo teacher, his wife Rita and daughter Jacqueline through the surprising inheritance of a factory near Dresden. But of market economy, the staid Saxons unfortunately have no idea. Help comes in the guise of adventurer and condoms dealer Charlie, who works as a "business consultant" and gives Udo a Rock & Roll crash course in capitalism - with unsurpassed success.', 'Elated by the Italian attitude to life, family Struutz returns to Bitterfeld and experiences a shock: In the turmoil of the reunification her house must give way to a golf course. Hope Udo teacher, his wife Rita and daughter Jacqueline through the surprising inheritance of a factory near Dresden. But of market economy, the staid Saxons unfortunately have no idea. Help comes in the guise of adventurer and condoms dealer Charlie, who works as a "business consultant" and gives Udo a Rock & Roll crash course in capitalism - with unsurpassed success.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4vZ6FolFjIy9nNnZ3QwA4waIz6v.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:11168'),
  ('608558516997772994', 'Go West', 1923, 'Western, Drama, Comedy', 'Len Powers', null, null, null, 'Maw and Paw Monkey throw their boy out of the house after a long night of drinking. When he hitches a ride on a freight train to parts unknown, he arrives in a Wild West town full of gunslingers, giant police dogs, and steeds--billy goats--for the riding, as an unpaid tab leads to a rootin'' tootin'' chase from the town sheriff.', 'Maw and Paw Monkey throw their boy out of the house after a long night of drinking. When he hitches a ride on a freight train to parts unknown, he arrives in a Wild West town full of gunslingers, giant police dogs, and steeds--billy goats--for the riding, as an unpaid tab leads to a rootin'' tootin'' chase from the town sheriff.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4vhZ275pgUzSyMrp77kAxQm2ca6.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:104294'),
  ('725245014567412973', 'Go West', 1925, 'Comedy, Western', 'Buster Keaton, Elgin Lessley, Bert Haines', 'Buster Keaton, Lex Neal, Raymond Cannon', 'Buster Keaton, Howard Truesdale, Kathleen Myers, Ray Thompson, Brown Eyes, Roscoe Arbuckle, Joe Keaton, Gus Leonard', 'NR', 'With little luck at keeping a job in the city a New Yorker tries work in the country and eventually finds his way leading a herd of cattle to the West Coast.', 'With little luck at keeping a job in the city a New Yorker tries work in the country and eventually finds his way leading a herd of cattle to the West Coast.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/chZ6GbfTIKgD6nYmUKZScDAnIo8.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:33015'),
  ('728222422475123668', 'Go West', 1940, 'Comedy, Western', 'Edward Buzzell, Leonard Smith', 'Irving Brecher', 'Groucho Marx, Chico Marx, Harpo Marx, John Carroll, Diana Lewis, Walter Woolf King, Robert Barrat, June MacCloy', 'NR', 'Embezzler, shill, all around confidence man S. Quentin Quale is heading west to find his fortune; he meets the crafty but simple brothers Joseph and Rusty Panello in a train station, where they steal all his money. They''re heading west, too, because they''ve heard you can just pick the gold off the ground. Once there, they befriend an old miner named Dan Wilson whose property, Dead Man''s Gulch, has no gold. They loan him their last ten dollars so he can go start life anew, and for collateral, he gives them the deed to the Gulch. Unbeknownst to Wilson, the son of his longtime rival, Terry Turner (who''s also in love with his daughter, Eva), has contacted the railroad to arrange for them to build through the land, making the old man rich and hopefully resolving the feud. But the evil Red Baxter, owner of a saloon, tricks the boys out of the deed, and it''s up to them - as well as Quale, who naturally finds his way out west anyway - to save the day.', 'Embezzler, shill, all around confidence man S. Quentin Quale is heading west to find his fortune; he meets the crafty but simple brothers Joseph and Rusty Panello in a train station, where they steal all his money. They''re heading west, too, because they''ve heard you can just pick the gold off the ground. Once there, they befriend an old miner named Dan Wilson whose property, Dead Man''s Gulch, has no gold. They loan him their last ten dollars so he can go start life anew, and for collateral, he gives them the deed to the Gulch. Unbeknownst to Wilson, the son of his longtime rival, Terry Turner (who''s also in love with his daughter, Eva), has contacted the railroad to arrange for them to build through the land, making the old man rich and hopefully resolving the feud. But the evil Red Baxter, owner of a saloon, tricks the boys out of the deed, and it''s up to them - as well as Quale, who naturally finds his way out west anyway - to save the day.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/di0laTicoduEdp1WS10T8Poss7r.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:22575'),
  ('244035164533145370', 'Go West Young Man', 1936, 'Comedy', 'Henry Hathaway, Karl Struss, Hollingsworth Morse', 'Mae West', 'Mae West, Warren William, Randolph Scott, Alice Brady, Elizabeth Patterson, Lyle Talbot, Isabel Jewell, Margaret Perry', null, 'Sensational movie star Mavis Arden''s following spans the world and her personal appearance tours prove her popularity. On her way home from one such appearance, Mavis'' car breaks down. She orders her publicity agent to find her a place to stay, suspicious that he planned the breakdown to keep her away from a man. However, she soon finds herself mooning over an attractive local repairman and listening to his ideas about inventing equipment for film.', 'Sensational movie star Mavis Arden''s following spans the world and her personal appearance tours prove her popularity. On her way home from one such appearance, Mavis'' car breaks down. She orders her publicity agent to find her a place to stay, suspicious that he planned the breakdown to keep her away from a man. However, she soon finds herself mooning over an attractive local repairman and listening to his ideas about inventing equipment for film.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iHgQZTl8yosVr2E8H2QamqtbicF.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:71772'),
  ('1117705782464773360', 'Go West: A Lucky Luke Adventure', 2007, 'Adventure, Animation, Comedy, Western', 'Olivier Jean-Marie', 'Jean-François Henry, Olivier Jean-Marie', 'Lambert Wilson, Clovis Cornillac, François Morel, Bernard Alane, Edgar Givry, Titoff, Jean Piat, Eric Métayer', null, 'The Daltons have escaped to New York, where their accumulated loot is hidden in the carts of Monsieur Pierre''s group of honest, naive European immigrants, who naively bought land in California from Crook, who inserted a clause they must claim it within 80 days. Joe emotionally blackmails Luke to guide them there, hoping to escape on the way. The usual route must shortened from 6 to 2 months, so no danger can be avoided. Given Lucky''s reputation, Crook decides to shadow them to add sabotage, just to be sure- or is it?', 'The Daltons have escaped to New York, where their accumulated loot is hidden in the carts of Monsieur Pierre''s group of honest, naive European immigrants, who naively bought land in California from Crook, who inserted a clause they must claim it within 80 days. Joe emotionally blackmails Luke to guide them there, hoping to escape on the way. The usual route must shortened from 6 to 2 months, so no danger can be avoided. Given Lucky''s reputation, Crook decides to shadow them to add sabotage, just to be sure- or is it?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6FXVZVTvHojnjCy2pNnyPYl2iVY.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:34655'),
  ('197156996747673445', 'Go!', 2020, 'Family', 'Peter Eastgate, Owen Trevor, Simon Green', 'Steve Worland', 'Richard Roxburgh, Frances O''Connor, Dan Wyllie, Cooper van Grootel, William Lodder, Anastasia Bampos, Damian de Montemas, Darius Amarfio Jefferson', null, 'Jack is a charismatic larrikin who has just discovered the one thing he''s really good at — go-kart racing. With the support of his mentor, Patrick, an old race car driver with a secret past, and his best mates Colin and Mandy, Jack must learn to control his recklessness if he is to defeat the best drivers in Australia, including the ruthless champion Dean, and win the National title.', 'Jack is a charismatic larrikin who has just discovered the one thing he''s really good at — go-kart racing. With the support of his mentor, Patrick, an old race car driver with a secret past, and his best mates Colin and Mandy, Jack must learn to control his recklessness if he is to defeat the best drivers in Australia, including the ruthless champion Dean, and win the National title.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tOLC9552jBvymwsgHc3ri2SyuyD.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:520765'),
  ('577137187077000773', 'Go! Go! Cory Carson: Chrissy Takes the Wheel', 2021, 'Animation, Family', 'Alex Woo, Stanley Moore', 'Jason Heaton, Citlalli Anderson, Erik Benson', 'Maisie Benson, Paul Killam, Kerry Gudjohnsen, Emma Berman, John Crosthwaite, Ella Joy Ballesteros, Adelaide Hirasaki, Pfeiffer Chastain', null, 'From arcade games to sled days and hiccup cures, Cory Carson’s curious little sister Chrissy speeds off on her own for fun and adventure all over town!', 'From arcade games to sled days and hiccup cures, Cory Carson’s curious little sister Chrissy speeds off on her own for fun and adventure all over town!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eZvpTcUk0L8paEqegXzUcJa9nG.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:876576'),
  ('782497367718366499', 'Go! Go! Go!', 1964, 'Documentary', 'Marie Menken', null, null, null, 'Various forms of everyday motion in and around a city are shown at rapid speed.', 'Various forms of everyday motion in and around a city are shown at rapid speed.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/r3FoHOZ9Eh5XjSkwrSojCCgXI6r.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:147931'),
  ('423997624035376642', 'Go! The Unforgettable Party', 2019, 'Music, Family, Drama, TV Movie', 'Mauro Scandolari', null, 'Pilar Pascual, José Giménez-Zapiola, Santiago Saez, Renata Toscano Bruzón, Gastón Ricaud, Jesse Huerta, Joy Huerta', null, 'Mia is happy to be able to spend a vacation with her dad, but Lupe, Mercedes, Juanma and Alvaro arrive by surprise at the same resort... and bring the school drama with them!', 'Mia is happy to be able to spend a vacation with her dad, but Lupe, Mercedes, Juanma and Alvaro arrive by surprise at the same resort... and bring the school drama with them!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5PnL2fXmDCmwJ0lVTluLn5qoulo.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:648337'),
  ('261302946409645973', 'Goal II: Living the Dream', 2007, 'Drama', 'Jaume Collet-Serra, Flavio Martínez Labiano', 'Adrian Butchart, Terry Loane, Mike Jefferies', 'Kuno Becker, Stephen Dillane, Anna Friel, Leonor Varela, Elizabeth Peña, Carmelo Gómez, Miriam Colon, Frances Barber', 'PG-13', 'Tempted away from Newcastle United to join Real Madrid, rising star Santiago Munez finds this latest change of fortune the greatest challenge yet - personally as well as professionally. He is reunited with Gavin Harris, though they must compete to be on the team, and estranged from fiancee Roz, whose nursing career keeps her back home.', 'Tempted away from Newcastle United to join Real Madrid, rising star Santiago Munez finds this latest change of fortune the greatest challenge yet - personally as well as professionally. He is reunited with Gavin Harris, though they must compete to be on the team, and estranged from fiancee Roz, whose nursing career keeps her back home.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sKKej989oVbZahldAkrMVmyB8pU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:9815'),
  ('1028486138276925047', 'Goal III: Taking on the World', 2009, 'Drama', 'Andrew Morahan, George Tiffin, Joe Hornsey', 'Mike Jefferies, Piers Ashworth', 'JJ Feild, Leo Gregory, Kuno Becker, Kasia Smutniak, Anya Lahiri, Nick Moran, Christopher Fairbank, Mike Elliot', null, 'Mexican footballer Santiago Muñez, along with his best friends and England national team players Charlie Braithwaite and Liam Adams, are selected for their respective national teams at the 2006 FIFA World Cup Finals in Germany.', 'Mexican footballer Santiago Muñez, along with his best friends and England national team players Charlie Braithwaite and Liam Adams, are selected for their respective national teams at the 2006 FIFA World Cup Finals in Germany.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uYXkXYOxe79aTcTSPGeV4TMc5sM.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:19139'),
  ('561030761063956887', 'Goal of the Dead', 2014, 'Comedy, Horror', 'Thierry Poiraud, Benjamin Rocher', 'Quoc Dang Tran, Ismaël Sy Savané, Tristan Schulmann', 'Alban Lenoir, Charlie Bruneau, Tiphaine Daviot, Ahmed Sylla, Bruno Salomone, Patrick Ligardes, Xavier Laurent, Sebastien Vandenberghe', null, 'For the Olympique de Paris soccer team, this away match scheduled against Caplongue was merely supposed to be one last chore before the end of the professional season. Yet no one could ever have imagined that an unknown rabies-like infection was going to spread like wildfire, turning this small town’s inhabitants into ultra-violent and highly contagious creatures.', 'For the Olympique de Paris soccer team, this away match scheduled against Caplongue was merely supposed to be one last chore before the end of the professional season. Yet no one could ever have imagined that an unknown rabies-like infection was going to spread like wildfire, turning this small town’s inhabitants into ultra-violent and highly contagious creatures.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rRlvKreD88Fj6cUbc2WPxKISxDm.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:273467'),
  ('380223421477383618', 'Goal!', 2005, 'Drama', 'Danny Cannon, Michael Barrett, Gavin Fitch', 'Dick Clement, Ian La Frenais, Mike Jefferies', 'Kuno Becker, Alessandro Nivola, Anna Friel, Stephen Dillane, Gary Lewis, Kieran O''Brien, Sean Pertwee, Marcel Iureș', 'PG-13', 'Like millions of kids around the world, Santiago harbors the dream of being a professional footballer... However, living in the Barrios section of Los Angeles, he thinks it is only that—a dream. Until one day an extraordinary turn of events has him trying out for Premiership club Newcastle United.', 'Like millions of kids around the world, Santiago harbors the dream of being a professional footballer... However, living in the Barrios section of Los Angeles, he thinks it is only that—a dream. Until one day an extraordinary turn of events has him trying out for Premiership club Newcastle United.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9YZhJGoIbJtrjDYbENGhR6f6SZE.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:9763'),
