  ('389709055372855961', 'Goat', 2016, 'Drama', 'Andrew Neel, Ethan Palmer', 'David Gordon Green, Mike Roberts, Andrew Neel', 'Ben Schnetzer, Nick Jonas, Austin Lyon, Virginia Gardner, Danny Flaherty, Jake Picking, Patrick Murney, James Franco', 'R', 'Reeling from a terrifying assault, a nineteen year old enrolls into college with his brother and pledges the same fraternity. What happens there, in the name of ''brotherhood,'' tests him and his loyalty in brutal ways.', 'Reeling from a terrifying assault, a nineteen year old enrolls into college with his brother and pledges the same fraternity. What happens there, in the name of ''brotherhood,'' tests him and his loyalty in brutal ways.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kQBy81VxGA20wbwouOruNyucCnG.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:337874'),
  ('679557354567228592', 'GOAT', 2026, 'Animation, Comedy, Family', 'Tyree Dillihay, Adam Rosette, John Clark', 'Aaron Buchsbaum, Teddy Riley', 'Caleb McLaughlin, Gabrielle Union, Stephen Curry, Aaron Pierre, Nicola Coughlan, David Harbour, Nick Kroll, Jenifer Lewis', 'PG', 'A small goat with big dreams gets a once-in-a-lifetime shot to join the pros and play roarball, a high-intensity, co-ed, full-contact sport dominated by the fastest, fiercest animals in the world.', 'A small goat with big dreams gets a once-in-a-lifetime shot to join the pros and play roarball, a high-intensity, co-ed, full-contact sport dominated by the fastest, fiercest animals in the world.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wfuqMlaExcoYiUEvKfVpUTt1v4u.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1297842'),
  ('149573032409418194', 'Goat Girl', 2025, 'Drama', 'Ana Asensio, David Tudela, Alejandro Gil', 'Ana Asensio', 'Lorena López, Javier Pereira, Zaira Romero, Enrique Villén, Gloria Muñoz, Alessandra González, Petrache Ninel, Silvia Torregrosa', null, 'Eight-year-old Elena prepares for her First Communion while grappling with her grandmother''s death. Her friendship with gypsy girl Serezade, inseparable from her goat, makes Elena question her worldview.', 'Eight-year-old Elena prepares for her First Communion while grappling with her grandmother''s death. Her friendship with gypsy girl Serezade, inseparable from her goat, makes Elena question her worldview.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ehq0HZHlfDGVD3nzP0wq5YwK9kP.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1053594'),
  ('772946063213597541', 'Goatman', 2023, 'Horror', 'Trey Murphy', 'Trey Murphy', 'Micha Marie Stevens, Jason R. Davis, Chance Gibbs, Richard Haskins, Brandon Herndon, Taffeta Darling, Matthew Strauser, Tom Young', null, 'A series of grisly murders point to the terrifying cryptid.', 'A series of grisly murders point to the terrifying cryptid.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/85N39Re3qw8o52BcmnVlacVPyni.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1115694'),
  ('1058676745979656172', 'Goats', 2012, 'Comedy', 'Christopher Neil, Wyatt Troll', 'Mark Poirier', 'David Duchovny, Vera Farmiga, Graham Phillips, Keri Russell, Justin Kirk, Ty Burrell, Dakota Johnson, Anthony Anderson', 'R', 'Having a self-absorbed New Age mother and an estranged father has meant 15-year-old Ellis Whitman has grown up relying on an unconventional guardian: a goat-trekking, marijuana-growing sage called ''Goat Man''. When Ellis decides to leave the alternative ways of his desert homestead for a stuffy East Coast prep school, major changes are in store.', 'Having a self-absorbed New Age mother and an estranged father has meant 15-year-old Ellis Whitman has grown up relying on an unconventional guardian: a goat-trekking, marijuana-growing sage called ''Goat Man''. When Ellis decides to leave the alternative ways of his desert homestead for a stuffy East Coast prep school, major changes are in store.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sguv1tnaQjFWsbcpN0b08cWmsFJ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:84203'),
  ('1061455093130928522', 'Goblin Slayer: Goblin''s Crown', 2020, 'Animation, Adventure, Action, Fantasy', 'Naoko Shokinji, Nana Fujiki, Rina Nagai', 'Hideyuki Kurata', 'Yuuichirou Umehara, Yui Ogura, Nao Toyama, Yuichi Nakamura, Tomokazu Sugita, Sumire Uesaka, Yuka Iguchi, Maaya Uchida', 'NR', 'Goblin Slayer and his party head up to the snowy mountains in the north after receiving that request from the Sword Maiden to find any information on the Noble Fencer that disappeared after leaving to slay some goblins. A small village gets attacked, they encounter a mysterious chapel, and something about how these goblins are acting bothers the Goblin slayer. In order to save the captured Noble Fencer, the Goblin Slayer and his party head to an ancient fortress covered in snow to face off with a powerful foe and a horde of goblins!', 'Goblin Slayer and his party head up to the snowy mountains in the north after receiving that request from the Sword Maiden to find any information on the Noble Fencer that disappeared after leaving to slay some goblins. A small village gets attacked, they encounter a mysterious chapel, and something about how these goblins are acting bothers the Goblin slayer. In order to save the captured Noble Fencer, the Goblin Slayer and his party head to an ancient fortress covered in snow to face off with a powerful foe and a horde of goblins!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/A7SH888eBwbJDU3m48Vk2FK6ahW.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:631132'),
  ('346689708320046104', 'God', 1998, 'Comedy', 'John August', 'John August', 'Melissa McCarthy, Sam Pancake', null, 'Talking to the camera, Margaret tells us about her friendship with God. "We talk every day," she explains. And at that moment, her phone rings, and it''s God on the line. God''s gossip is the best, Margaret tells us. Then, we see what happens to her when she and God have a falling out. Can they patch it up? Is she sane?', 'Talking to the camera, Margaret tells us about her friendship with God. "We talk every day," she explains. And at that moment, her phone rings, and it''s God on the line. God''s gossip is the best, Margaret tells us. Then, we see what happens to her when she and God have a falling out. Can they patch it up? Is she sane?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/la0eOA49YtQfffTwQFFFVIJCh5u.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:197806'),
  ('659050856652289677', 'God Bless America', 2012, 'Comedy, Drama, Crime', 'Bobcat Goldthwait, Bradley Stonesifer', 'Bobcat Goldthwait', 'Joel Murray, Tara Lynne Barr, Melinda Page Hamilton, Mackenzie Brooke Smith, Rich McDonald, Maddie Hasson, Larry Miller, Dorie Barton', 'R', 'Fed up with the cruelty and stupidity of American culture, an unlikely duo goes on a killing spree, killing reality TV stars, bigots and others they find repugnant.', 'Fed up with the cruelty and stupidity of American culture, an unlikely duo goes on a killing spree, killing reality TV stars, bigots and others they find repugnant.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jEyiGve8BLOCvi8R2tL8H52aLp4.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:74306'),
  ('236740319515409819', 'God Bless the Broken Road', 2018, 'Drama, Family, Romance', 'Harold Cronk', 'Harold Cronk', 'Lindsay Pulsipher, Jordin Sparks, Andrew W. Walker, LaDainian Tomlinson, Robin Givens, Makenzie Moss, Kim Delaney, Gary Grubbs', 'PG', 'The story of a young mother who loses her husband in Afghanistan and struggles to raise their young daughter in his absence.', 'The story of a young mother who loses her husband in Afghanistan and struggles to raise their young daughter in his absence.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tw3mdpa9Nxit9kkbXZOpkN3zcFY.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:434767'),
  ('444437520762617770', 'God Exists, Her Name Is Petrunya', 2019, 'Drama', 'Teona Strugar Mitevska, Virginie Saint-Martin', 'Elma Tataragić, Teona Strugar Mitevska', 'Zorica Nuševa, Labina Mitevska, Stefan Vujisikj, Simeon ''Moni'' Damevski, Suad Begovski, Violeta Šapkovska, Xhevdet Jashari, Andrijana Kolevska', null, 'In Stip, a small town in Macedonia, every January the local priest throws a wooden cross into the river and hundreds of men dive after it. Good fortune and prosperity are guaranteed to the man who retrieves it. This time, Petrunya dives into the water on a whim and manages to grab the cross before the others. Her competitors are furious - how dare a woman take part in their ritual? All hell breaks loose, but Petrunya holds her ground. She won her cross and will not give it up.', 'In Stip, a small town in Macedonia, every January the local priest throws a wooden cross into the river and hundreds of men dive after it. Good fortune and prosperity are guaranteed to the man who retrieves it. This time, Petrunya dives into the water on a whim and manages to grab the cross before the others. Her competitors are furious - how dare a woman take part in their ritual? All hell breaks loose, but Petrunya holds her ground. She won her cross and will not give it up.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jp8NqAtph3fFHtQpNw1orvoEdmU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:574434'),
  ('326363554384502123', 'God Forbid: The Sex Scandal That Brought Down a Dynasty', 2022, 'Documentary', 'Billy Corben', null, 'Sam Myerson, Betty Monroe, Landon Price, Joe Allen Ray, Lou Silver, Tyler Robert Miller, Nastassja Zygmuntowicz, William Christopher Watson', null, 'A Miami pool boy finds himself trapped in a seven-year affair with a charming older woman and her husband, the evangelical Trump stalwart Jerry Falwell Jr., as he becomes increasingly entangled with the Falwells'' seemingly perfect lives.', 'A Miami pool boy finds himself trapped in a seven-year affair with a charming older woman and her husband, the evangelical Trump stalwart Jerry Falwell Jr., as he becomes increasingly entangled with the Falwells'' seemingly perfect lives.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2sBzpz2fEfELMRzOxQtK83eocJL.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1017751'),
  ('514511390903675912', 'God Forgives... I Don''t!', 1967, 'Western, Drama', 'Giuseppe Colizzi, Silvana Mangini Colizzi, Alfio Contini', 'Giuseppe Colizzi', 'Terence Hill, Bud Spencer, Frank Wolff, Gina Rovere, José Manuel Martín, Frank Braña, Joaquín Blanco, Antonietta Fiorito', null, 'In this violent spaghetti western a murderous robber hijacks a payroll train, murders everyone aboard and then stashes his loot. A gunslinger learns about it and decides he wants the money for himself and so hatches an elaborate plot to get at it. He lures the crook into a rigged poker game, and afterward a gunfight ensues. The quick-drawing gunman makes short work of the robber, then teams up with an insurance agent to look for the hidden fortune. Unbeknownst to them, the robber had an ace up his sleeve...', 'In this violent spaghetti western a murderous robber hijacks a payroll train, murders everyone aboard and then stashes his loot. A gunslinger learns about it and decides he wants the money for himself and so hatches an elaborate plot to get at it. He lures the crook into a rigged poker game, and afterward a gunfight ensues. The quick-drawing gunman makes short work of the robber, then teams up with an insurance agent to look for the hidden fortune. Unbeknownst to them, the robber had an ace up his sleeve...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mEhoHmnwxpGeLdSOfqJHFGmcWqv.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:41608'),
  ('1030484180892713194', 'God Grew Tired of Us', 2006, 'Documentary', 'Christopher Dillon Quinn, Tommy Walker', null, 'John Bul Dau, Daniel Abul Pach, Panther Bior, Nicole Kidman', null, 'Filmmaker Christopher Quinn observes the ordeal of three Sudanese refugees -- Jon Bul Dau, Daniel Abul Pach and Panther Bior -- as they try to come to terms with the horrors they experienced in their homeland, while adjusting to their new lives in the United States.', 'Filmmaker Christopher Quinn observes the ordeal of three Sudanese refugees -- Jon Bul Dau, Daniel Abul Pach and Panther Bior -- as they try to come to terms with the horrors they experienced in their homeland, while adjusting to their new lives in the United States.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mrUCcDeCPW3d0s2VCgyTRVoxyKa.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:15325'),
  ('346607285676803157', 'God Help the Girl', 2014, 'Comedy, Drama, Music', 'Stuart Murdoch, Giles Nuttgens, Helen Fraser', 'Stuart Murdoch', 'Emily Browning, Olly Alexander, Hannah Murray, Pierre Boulanger, Cora Bissett, Sarah Swire, Mark Radcliffe, Stuart Maconie', 'NR', 'Eve is a catastrophe—low on self-esteem but high on fantasy, especially when it comes to music. Over the course of one Glasgow summer, she meets two similarly rootless souls: posh Cass and fastidious James, and together they form a band.', 'Eve is a catastrophe—low on self-esteem but high on fantasy, especially when it comes to music. Over the course of one Glasgow summer, she meets two similarly rootless souls: posh Cass and fastidious James, and together they form a band.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7HvJyWDP5OhgAjrg1qs1dHPV9rd.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:245859'),
  ('842232443249700130', 'God Is a Bullet', 2023, 'Thriller, Action, Crime', 'Nick Cassavetes, Kenji Katori, Kim H. Winther', 'Nick Cassavetes', 'Maika Monroe, Nikolaj Coster-Waldau, Karl Glusman, January Jones, Jamie Foxx, Paul Johansson, David Thornton, Ethan Suplee', 'NR', 'Vice detective Bob Hightower finds his ex-wife murdered and daughter kidnapped by a cult. Frustrated by the botched official investigations, he quits the force and infiltrates the cult to hunt down the leader with the help of the cult’s only female victim escapee, Case Hardin.', 'Vice detective Bob Hightower finds his ex-wife murdered and daughter kidnapped by a cult. Frustrated by the botched official investigations, he quits the force and infiltrates the cult to hunt down the leader with the help of the cult’s only female victim escapee, Case Hardin.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5kiLS9nsSJxDdlYUyYGiSUt8Fi8.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:808396'),
  ('867764213110945786', 'God Is Brazilian', 2003, 'Adventure, Comedy, Fantasy', 'Carlos Diegues, Affonso Beato, Fernando Zagallo', 'João Emanuel Carneiro, Renata Almeida Magalhães', 'Antônio Fagundes, Wagner Moura, Palomma Duarte, Bruce Gomlevsky, Stepan Nercessian, Hugo Carvana, Castrinho, Chico Assis', null, 'God decides to take a vacation, but first He has to find a saint who can rule the universe while He''s away. So He goes to the Northeast of Brazil, where He believes there''s a very good man for the job. As soon as He comes down to Earth, a young man comes along to help on His quest.', 'God decides to take a vacation, but first He has to find a saint who can rule the universe while He''s away. So He goes to the Northeast of Brazil, where He believes there''s a very good man for the job. As soon as He comes down to Earth, a young man comes along to help on His quest.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/g7mDnFbYus7q9z2OtvJgFWLFjFn.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:34196'),
  ('70345521528143227', 'God Is Dog Spelled Backwards', 1967, null, 'Dan McLaughlin', null, null, 'NR', 'In a joyous tour de force, the world''s greatest paintings -- all schools, all periods -- flash by at the rate of eight per second; yet we are able to recognize and retain most.', 'In a joyous tour de force, the world''s greatest paintings -- all schools, all periods -- flash by at the rate of eight per second; yet we are able to recognize and retain most.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/y1ePmchLhDgs1DkeNBykSkP8cNE.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:360982'),
  ('554419114143688640', 'God Is Great and I''m Not', 2001, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Pascale Bailly, Antoine Roch', 'Alain Tasma, Pascale Bailly', 'Audrey Tautou, Édouard Baer, Julie Depardieu, Catherine Jacob, Philippe Laudenbach, Cathy Verney, Anna Koch, Max Tzwangue', null, 'Michèle, 20 years old, feels terrible after having broken up with her boy-friend. She meets Francois, who''s a veterinarian and jewish. Michèle decides to convert into Judaism because she has to believe in something, if not in someone.', 'Michèle, 20 years old, feels terrible after having broken up with her boy-friend. She meets Francois, who''s a veterinarian and jewish. Michèle decides to convert into Judaism because she has to believe in something, if not in someone.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jl0JxTK0r3H8K7GIpSQyKYfULpM.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:27204'),
