  ('838185088864276399', 'God of Gamblers III: Back to Shanghai', 1991, 'Action, Comedy, Fantasy', 'Wong Jing, Albert Mak Kai-Kwong', 'Wong Jing', 'Stephen Chow, Gong Li, Ray Lui, Charles Heung, Sandra Ng Kwan-Yu, Richard Ng Man-Tat, Sharla Cheung, John Ching Tung', null, 'While battling a psychic gambler, Sing hurtles back in time to 1937 Shanghai. Now he must come to grips with his family history and get back to 1991.', 'While battling a psychic gambler, Sing hurtles back in time to 1937 Shanghai. Now he must come to grips with his family history and get back to 1991.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dmhdQ61SfG8p44ySNIhRrq8F70M.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:53658'),
