  ('505166199748049642', 'God Tussi Great Ho', 2008, 'Comedy, Drama, Fantasy', 'Rumi Jaffery, Ashok Mehta, Masum Ali', 'Rumi Jaffery', 'Amitabh Bachchan, Salman Khan, Priyanka Chopra Jonas, Anupam Kher, Sohail Khan, Dalip Tahil, Beena Kak, Upasna Singh', null, 'When a rival steals his presentation and takes the credit for making it, a man gets fired from his job and lashes out on God for making his life miserable. However, God appears before him in human form and gives him his powers with a challenge to do better than him.', 'When a rival steals his presentation and takes the credit for making it, a man gets fired from his job and lashes out on God for making his life miserable. However, God appears before him in human form and gives him his powers with a challenge to do better than him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/68WQOBUhe7UtyAGjKDKK5rqfORS.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:26153'),
