  ('708597049342354382', 'God''s Gun', 1976, 'Action, Western', 'Gianfranco Parolini, Sandro Mancori, Timna Ranon', 'Gianfranco Parolini, John Fonseca', 'Lee Van Cleef, Jack Palance, Richard Boone, Sybil Danning, Leif Garrett, Robert Lipton, Cody Palance, Ian Sander', 'R', 'Priest turned vigilante Father John hunts down a gang of criminals, led by Sam Clayton, who killed a man in a local bar. On the gang''s return to the town, they kill the priest, leaving a young parishioner Johnny behind. He now seeks revenge for the death of the holy man.', 'Priest turned vigilante Father John hunts down a gang of criminals, led by Sam Clayton, who killed a man in a local bar. On the gang''s return to the town, they kill the priest, leaving a young parishioner Johnny behind. He now seeks revenge for the death of the holy man.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8NpAE7y4UVTj4yf9z0hTNz3Ksgd.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:79194'),
