  ('1087205563061069534', 'God''s Not Dead', 2014, 'Drama', 'Harold Cronk, Brian Shanley, Jordan Champine', 'Cary Solomon', 'Kevin Sorbo, Shane Harper, David A.R. White, Dean Cain, Cassidy Gifford, Marco Khan, Alex Aristidis, Willie Robertson', 'PG', 'After he refuses to disavow his faith, a devout Christian student must prove the existence of God or else his college philosophy professor will fail him.', 'After he refuses to disavow his faith, a devout Christian student must prove the existence of God or else his college philosophy professor will fail him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yKUzBolWrwyByevBtDPfy3kIumv.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:249660'),
